window.FULL = {"id":"python","title":"Python：读懂代码，说清需求","summary":"面向数据处理的通用 Python 入门：读懂别人或 AI 写的代码、追踪中间结果， 并把数据处理的要求说成别人能照做、能核对的规则。不以从空白写完整程序为目标。","topics":[{"id":"py01","title":"给数据起名，再按顺序读","summary":"读懂赋值：先算右边再起名；逐行追踪名字的值，读出 print 显示什么。","minutes":20,"prereq":[],"intro":"这一节先练看懂几行代码，不要求你从空白写出来。\n\n下面的程序都当作一段短脚本，从第一行往下逐行运行。`print(x)` 暂时理解为“在屏幕上显示 x 现在的值”，它的完整含义在后面讲函数调用时再展开。\n","wrapup":"读到一行赋值，先算右边，再让左边的名字指向结果；读一段代码，就按运行顺序记下每个名字此刻的值。\n\n试着用这两步说出一段代码在做什么，再看看这一节的两张概念卡。\n","kps":[{"id":"py01.k1","title":"名字指向当前的值，赋值先算右边","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"赋值","aliases":["变量","名字"],"definition":"`=` 先算出右边的值，再让左边的名字指向这个值；赋值本身不在屏幕上显示任何东西。","conditions":["`=` 是一个动作，不是在问两边是否相等。","名字要先赋值才能使用；想看它现在的值，用 print。"],"example":"```python\nsamples = 6\nreserve = 2\nusable = samples - reserve\nprint(usable)\n```\n第三行先算 6 - 2 得到 4，再让 `usable` 指向 4；最后一行显示 4。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"一段程序从第一行开始往下运行。像 `samples = 6` 这样的一行叫**赋值**：Python 先算出等号右边的值，再让左边的名字指向这个值。之后在别处写 `samples`，读到的就是它现在指向的值。\n\n赋值是一个动作，不是在问“两边是否相等”。读到 `usable = samples - reserve` 时，分两步读：\n\n1. 先算右边：取 `samples` 现在的值和 `reserve` 现在的值，相减。\n2. 再起名：让 `usable` 指向算出来的结果。\n\n赋值本身不会在屏幕上显示任何东西。想看某个名字现在的值，就用 `print(名字)`。\n","example":{"id":"py01.k1.e0","body":"一次收到 6 份样本，其中预留 2 份。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python\nsamples = 6\nreserve = 2\nusable = samples - reserve\nprint(usable)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序最后显示哪个整数？","key":4},{"id":"source","type":"choice","prompt":"`usable` 的值是怎样来的？","options":[{"id":"computed","content":"`samples` 减 `reserve` 算出的结果"},{"id":"literal","content":"程序里直接写下的数字 4"},{"id":"printed","content":"`print` 算出来的"}],"key":"computed"}],"explanation":"答案是 **4**。第三行先取 `samples` 的 6 和 `reserve` 的 2，算出 4，再让名字 `usable` 指向 4。前两行只是赋值，没有显示任何数字；最后一行的 `print` 才把 `usable` 现在的值显示出来。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py01.k1.q1","body":"```python\ntotal = 9\nused = 4\nremaining = total - used\nprint(remaining)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序最后显示哪个整数？","key":5,"feedback":[{"when":13,"message":"第三行是 `total - used`，用的是减号。"}]}],"explanation":"答案是 **5**。第三行先算 9 - 4 得到 5，再让 `remaining` 指向 5；`print` 显示的就是这个值。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.q2","body":"```python\nreading = 3\ndoubled = reading + reading\n```\n\n这两行里没有 `print`，屏幕上什么也不显示，但两个名字都已经有了值。\n","slots":[{"id":"reading","type":"text","format":"integer","label":"reading","prompt":"执行完两行后，`reading` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"doubled","type":"text","format":"integer","label":"doubled","prompt":"执行完两行后，`doubled` 是多少？","key":6}],"explanation":"`reading` 是 **3**，`doubled` 是 **6**。第二行先取 `reading` 的值 3，算出 3 + 3 = 6，再让 `doubled` 指向 6；`reading` 自己没有改变。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.q3","body":"`raw` 表示一批样本的总数，每批都固定预留 2 份，`raw` 至少为 2。哪一行能写出“剩下多少份”？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"plus","content":"```python\nclean = raw + 2\n```\n","feedback":"预留的 2 份要从总数里去掉，不是加上。"},{"id":"minus","content":"```python\nclean = raw - 2\n```\n"},{"id":"fixed","content":"```python\nclean = 6\n```\n","feedback":"6 只碰巧适合 raw 为 8 的那一批；换一批样本就不对了。"}],"key":"minus"}],"explanation":"`clean = raw - 2` 正确：raw 为 8 时得到 6，换成 raw 为 10 时得到 8。`raw + 2` 多加了预留的份数；`clean = 6` 只碰巧适合 raw 为 8 的那一批。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.q4","body":"只读下面两行。这段程序能得到 available 的值吗？\n\n```python\navailable = incoming - held\nincoming = 8\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"later","content":"能，Python 会先到下面找 incoming 的值"},{"id":"missing","content":"不能，右边用到的名字还没有赋值"},{"id":"zero","content":"能，没有赋值的名字默认是 0"}],"key":"missing"}],"explanation":"读第一行时就要计算右边；incoming 和 held 都没有值，程序会在这里停止，不会先去执行第二行。名字不会自动获得 0。"},{"id":"py01.k1.q5","body":"三张指令卡要组成一段显示可用座位数的程序。每张卡都用一次，先准备数据，再计算，最后显示。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(free)"},{"id":"seats","code":"seats = 12"},{"id":"free","code":"free = seats - 3"}],"key":["seats","free","show"]}],"explanation":"计算 free 前必须先给 seats 赋值；print 也只能放在 free 得到值之后。因此顺序是准备 12 个座位、扣除 3 个、显示 9。"},{"id":"py01.k1.q6","body":"这段脚本完成后，填写两个名字的值和屏幕显示的行数。不要把赋值当成显示。\n\n```python\nreceived = 11\npacked = received - 4\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"received","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"received 的值","key":11},{"id":"packed","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"packed 的值","key":7},{"id":"lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"屏幕显示几行？","key":0}],"explanation":"received 得到 11，packed 得到 11 - 4 的结果 7。两行都是赋值，没有 print，所以显示 0 行。"}],"review":[{"id":"py01.k1.r1","body":"下面四行代码的顺序被打乱了。把它们排成一段能显示剩余份数的程序，每一行都要用上。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(left)"},{"id":"left","code":"left = total - used"},{"id":"total","code":"total = 9"},{"id":"used","code":"used = 4"}],"key":["total","used","left","show"],"alternatives":[["used","total","left","show"]],"tests":[{"name":"显示剩余份数","stdout":"5","expect":{"left":"5"}}]}],"explanation":"先给 `total` 和 `used` 赋值（这两行谁先都可以），再算 `left`，最后 `print`。如果把算 `left` 或 `print` 的那一行放在前面，用到的名字还没有值，程序会报错。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.r2","body":"有人说：“第 2 行 `y = x + 1` 把 `x` 改成了 4。”\n\n```python startLine=1\nx = 3\ny = x + 1\nprint(x)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":3},{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这个说法对吗？","options":[{"id":"unchanged","content":"不对，第 2 行只给 `y` 赋值，`x` 还是 3"},{"id":"changed","content":"对，第 2 行把 `x` 改成了 4"}],"key":"unchanged"}],"explanation":"显示 **3**。第 2 行先用 `x` 的值算出 4，再让 `y` 指向 4；等号左边是 `y`，`x` 没有被重新赋值。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.r3","body":"会议室已到 7 人，又到 2 人；计算赋值后并不自动显示。分别读出两次 print。\n\n```python\narrived = 7\nlate = 2\ntotal = arrived + late\nprint(arrived)\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"7"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"9"}],"explanation":"total 保存加法结果 9，原来的 arrived 仍是 7；只有两条 print 会显示内容。"},{"id":"py01.k1.r4","body":"一批包裹要扣除破损件。按依赖顺序阅读，填写扣除量与可用量。\n\n```python\nall_items = 15\nbroken = 3\nusable = all_items - broken\nprint(broken)\nprint(usable)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"12"}],"explanation":"先准备总量与破损量，再计算 15 - 3；计算结果交给 usable，不会反过来改变 broken。"},{"id":"py01.k1.r5","body":"最后一行试图读取另一个名字。填写停止前显示的行数。\n\n```python\nfirst = 4\nsecond = first + 1\nprint(unassigned)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"0"}],"explanation":"名字 unassigned 没有赋值，程序会在 print 求值时停止，之前两次赋值也没有显示。"},{"id":"py01.k1.r6","body":"右边必须先求值。第一条 print 位于成功赋值之后，第二条位于失败赋值之后；实际显示哪些内容？只填写已经显示的一行。\n\n```python\ntotal = 12\nready = total - 4\nprint(ready)\nunknown = missing + 1\nprint(unknown)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"8"}],"explanation":"ready 成功得到 8 并显示；下一次赋值要先读 missing，却找不到这个名字，因此不会再显示 unknown。"},{"id":"py01.k1.r7","body":"这段程序显示剩余份数。现在把名字 incoming 改成 received，其他含义保持不变。哪一段改名后的代码仍能正常显示相同的结果？\n\n```python\nincoming = 9\nspare = incoming - 4\nprint(spare)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"all","content":"```python\nreceived = 9\nspare = received - 4\nprint(spare)\n```\n"},{"id":"left_only","content":"```python\nreceived = 9\nspare = incoming - 4\nprint(spare)\n```\n"},{"id":"too_late","content":"```python\nspare = received - 4\nreceived = 9\nprint(spare)\n```\n"}],"key":"all"}],"explanation":"赋值左边改成 received 后，后面读取同一个数的地方也要使用 received。只改第一行会留下未赋值的 incoming；先算 spare 再赋 received，则读取 received 时还没有值。完整改名的那一段仍显示 5。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py01.k1.x1","body":"哪一段程序会显示 10？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"early","content":"```python\nb = 6\nprint(a + b)\na = 4\n```\n"},{"id":"backwards","content":"```python\na + b = 10\nprint(a)\n```\n"},{"id":"assigned","content":"```python\na = 4\nb = 6\nprint(a + b)\n```\n"}],"key":"assigned"}],"explanation":"先给 `a`、`b` 赋值、再把它们相加的那一段会显示 10。在 `a` 还没有值时就用它的那一段会报错；把算式 `a + b` 写在等号左边的那一段不是合法的赋值，等号左边要写名字。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.x2","body":"前两行是 `total = 10` 和 `used = 4`。要让 `left` 指向 6，第三行应写成哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"correct","content":"```python\nleft = total - used\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nleft = used - total\n```\n"},{"id":"backwards","content":"```python\ntotal - used = left\n```\n"}],"key":"correct"}],"explanation":"`left = total - used`：先算右边的 10 - 4，再让 `left` 指向 6。`used - total` 得到 -6；把算式写在等号左边不是合法的赋值。\n"},{"id":"py01.k1.x3","body":"一次交接只准备值但不显示它。填写屏幕显示的行数，不填写内存中的数值。\n\n```python\nsupplied = 8\nheld = 1\navailable = supplied - held\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"0"}],"explanation":"三行都是赋值，没有 print，因此显示零行。名字已有值不等于屏幕上已有内容。"},{"id":"py01.k1.x4","body":"右边引用的名字与接收结果的名字不是同一个动作。对照原份数与分配后的份数。\n\n```python\noriginal = 14\nallocated = original - 6\nprint(original)\nprint(allocated)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"14"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"8"}],"explanation":"赋值先计算 14 - 6，再把 8 交给 allocated；original 的值仍是 14。"}]},{"id":"py01.k2","title":"逐行追踪重新赋值，读出 print 的结果","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"重新赋值","aliases":["追踪","状态表"],"definition":"同一个名字可以再次赋值，之后读到的是新值；先前用它算出并存进别的名字的值不会跟着重算。","conditions":["每一行读到的是那一刻的值；按运行顺序记下各个名字的值，比凭印象可靠。","这里说的是整数这类值；列表等可以原地修改的对象另有情况，后面的课再讲。"],"example":"```python\ncount = 4\nsaved = count\ncount = count + 1\nprint(saved)\nprint(count)\n```\n第 3 行用旧的 count（4）算出 5，再让 count 指向 5；saved 仍是第 2 行存下的 4。输出依次为 4、5。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"同一个名字可以被赋值不止一次。`n = n + 2` 这样的行，也照“先算右边，再起名”来读：先用 `n` 现在的值算出结果，再让 `n` 改为指向新结果。\n\n读一段代码时，可以边读边记一张小状态表：每执行一行，写下各个名字此刻的值。\n\n| 执行到 | n |\n|---|---:|\n| `n = 3` | 3 |\n| `n = n + 2` | 5 |\n\n有两处容易读错：\n\n- 一个名字改指向新的值以后，先前用它算出来、已经存进别的名字里的值，不会跟着重算。\n- `print` 写在哪一行，就显示那一刻的值；同一个名字在不同位置 `print`，可能显示不同的数。\n","example":{"id":"py01.k2.e0","body":"按运行顺序填写每行执行后 `count` 与 `saved` 的值，再写出两行输出。还没有赋值的名字填“尚未定义”。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount = 4\nsaved = count\ncount = count + 1\nprint(saved)\nprint(count)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","label":"状态表","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"count","header":"count","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"saved","header":"saved","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","count":4,"saved":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","count":4,"saved":4}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","count":5,"saved":4}}]},{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":4},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":5}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | count | saved |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 第 1 行 | 4 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | 4 | 4 |\n| 第 3 行 | 5 | 4 |\n\n输出依次为 **4**、**5**。第 3 行先用旧的 `count`（4）算出 5，再让 `count` 指向 5；它没有再次执行 `saved = count`，所以 `saved` 仍是 4。“尚未定义”表示第 1 行执行完时 `saved` 这个名字还不存在。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py01.k2.q1","body":"```python startLine=1\nn = 3\nn = n + 2\nn = n + 2\nprint(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","prompt":"填写前三行各自执行后 `n` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","n":3}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","n":5}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","n":7}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":7,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"第 3 行用的是第 2 行之后的 n，也就是 5，而不是最初的 3。"}]}],"explanation":"`n` 依次是 **3 → 5 → 7**，最后显示 **7**。每一行的 `n + 2` 都用当时的 `n`：第 2 行用 3，第 3 行用 5。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.q2","body":"```python\na = 2\nb = a + 3\na = 9\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":5,"feedback":[{"when":12,"message":"第 2 行计算 b 时，a 还是 2；后来 a 改成 9，不会让 b 重新计算。"}]},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句解释了这个结果？","options":[{"id":"recomputed","content":"b 会随 a 的变化重新计算"},{"id":"kept","content":"b 保存的是第 2 行算出的结果"}],"key":"kept"}],"explanation":"显示 **5**。第 2 行用当时的 `a`（2）算出 5 并让 `b` 指向 5；第 3 行只让 `a` 改指向 9，`b` 不会重新计算。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.q3","body":"屏幕上先后显示什么？请按两行分别填写，不只写最后一个数。\n\n```python\nn = 4\nprint(n)\nn = n + 1\nprint(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"第一次 print 发生在 n 改变之前，那时 n 还是 4。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":5}],"explanation":"先显示 **4**，再显示 **5**。第一次 `print` 时 `n` 还是 4；第 3 行把 `n` 改为 5 之后，第二次 `print` 才显示 5。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.q4","body":"交接时先记下旧库存，再登记新库存。两个 print 分别显示什么？\n\n```python\nstock = 9\nsaved = stock\nstock = 4\nprint(saved)\nprint(stock)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"saved","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":9},{"id":"stock","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":4}],"explanation":"saved 在第二行得到当时的值 9。后来 stock 改成 4，并不会倒回去重做 saved = stock，所以依次显示 9、4。"},{"id":"py01.k2.q5","body":"希望最后显示刚更新后的差额 5。保持其他行不变，只能移动 print，应当放在哪里？\n\n```python startLine=1\ntotal = 10\nused = 2\nleft = total - used\nprint(left)\nused = 5\nleft = total - used\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"position","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"before","content":"第 3 行之前"},{"id":"middle","content":"第 5 行之后、第 6 行之前"},{"id":"after","content":"第 6 行之后"}],"key":"after"}],"explanation":"used 变成 5 时，left 仍是原来算出的 8；第 6 行重新计算后 left 才成为 5。只移动显示而不重新计算，不能更新旧结果。"}],"review":[{"id":"py01.k2.r1","body":"```python startLine=1\nscore = 5\nscore = score + 2\nscore = score + 2\nscore = score - 1\nprint(score)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"第几行执行完以后，`score` 第一次等于 9？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"}],"key":"l3"},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":8}],"explanation":"`score` 依次是 5、7、9、8：第 3 行执行完时第一次等于 9，第 4 行又减去 1，所以最后显示 **8**。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.r2","body":"有人想用下面的程序交换 `a` 和 `b` 的值。\n\n```python startLine=1\na = 1\nb = 2\na = b\nb = a\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":2},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":2},{"id":"swapped","type":"choice","prompt":"交换成功了吗？","options":[{"id":"no","content":"没有。第 3 行之后 a 已经是 2，第 4 行读到的 a 也是 2"},{"id":"yes","content":"成功了，a 是 2，b 是 1"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"两行都显示 **2**。第 3 行让 `a` 指向 `b` 的值 2；第 4 行读到的 `a` 已经是 2，所以 `b` 也成了 2。原来的 1 没有存到任何名字里，交换没有成功。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.r3","body":"先计算差额，再改变原始总量。填写两个显示结果，判断旧差额是否自动重算。\n\n```python\ntotal = 20\nleft = total - 3\ntotal = 9\nprint(left)\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"17"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"9"}],"explanation":"left 在第二行已经得到 17；total 后来变成 9，只影响这个名字，不会自动重做之前的计算。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r4","body":"重复两次“用自己当前值加一”，不是两次从初值重新算。\n\n```python\ncount = 4\ncount = count + 1\ncount = count + 1\nprint(count)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"6"}],"explanation":"第一次重新赋值后 count 是 5，第二次右边读到的是 5，因此最后得到 6。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r5","body":"同一个名字先后指向不同的数。按指定时刻填写追踪表，不要把最终值填进所有位置。\n\n```python startLine=1\nreading = 5\nprint(reading)\nreading = 8\nprint(reading)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"states","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"after","header":"时刻"},{"id":"value","header":"reading 的值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"first","cells":{"after":"第 1 行执行后","value":5}},{"id":"changed","cells":{"after":"第 3 行执行后","value":8}}]}],"explanation":"第一行执行后 reading 是 5；第三行重新赋值后才变成 8。后来的赋值不会改写早先时刻的状态。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r6","body":"临时名字用于保存交换前的值。逐行追踪一次真正的交换。\n\n```python\nleft = 3\nright = 8\nsaved = left\nleft = right\nright = saved\nprint(left)\nprint(right)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"8"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"3"}],"explanation":"saved 保住旧 left 的 3；随后 left 取 8，right 再取 saved 的 3，因此交换成功。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r7","body":"没有临时保存的反向覆盖会丢失旧值。填写最后的两个值。\n\n```python\nleft = 3\nright = 8\nright = left\nleft = right\nprint(left)\nprint(right)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"3"}],"explanation":"right 先被覆盖成 3；下一行 left 读到的 right 已是 3，原来的 8 已经没有保留。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r8","body":"合计变量也可以重新计算。区分它第一次与第二次显示的值。\n\n```python\ntoday = 4\ntotal = today + 6\nprint(total)\ntoday = 9\ntotal = today + 6\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"10"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"15"}],"explanation":"第一次按 today=4 算出 10；第二次显式重新计算时 today 已是 9，所以得到 15。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r9","body":"名字的复制方向影响哪个旧值被保留。填写最终的两个数。\n\n```python\noriginal = 6\ncopy = original\noriginal = copy + 2\ncopy = original - 1\nprint(original)\nprint(copy)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"8"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"7"}],"explanation":"copy 先是 6，original 由它加 2 变成 8；最后 copy 重新取 8 - 1 得到 7。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r10","body":"更新动作按书写顺序发生。先更新 a，再用更新后的 a 计算 b。\n\n```python\na = 2\nb = 5\na = a + b\nb = a - b\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"7"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"2"}],"explanation":"第三行把 a 更新为 7；第四行的 a 已不是初值 2，因此 b 得到 7 - 5 = 2。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r11","body":"已保存的快照与当前值各走各的更新。填写三个最终值。\n\n```python\nbase = 10\nsnapshot = base\nbase = base - 4\ndelta = snapshot - base\nprint(snapshot)\nprint(base)\nprint(delta)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"10"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"6"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"4"}],"explanation":"snapshot 保留 10，base 重新赋值为 6，两者相减得到变化量 4。保存的数不会随另一个名字自动更新。"},{"id":"py01.k2.r12","body":"第 2、3、4 行中，哪一行可以单独删去，而不改变程序显示的两行结果？只删所选的一行，其他行保持原顺序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nleft = 5\nsaved = left\nleft = left + 2\nleft = left\nprint(saved)\nprint(left)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"}],"key":"l4"}],"explanation":"第 4 行把 left 的当前值 7 再赋给 left，值没有改变，因此可以删去。第 2 行保存的是更新前的 5，删掉后无法显示 saved；第 3 行把 left 更新成 7，删掉后最后一行会显示 5。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.r13","body":"每次更新都读取当时的值。按表格中的执行时刻填写 a、b，不要把最终结果提前填进前面的行。\n\n```python startLine=1\na = 2\nb = a\na = a + 3\nb = b + a\na = b - a\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"states","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"after","header":"时刻"},{"id":"a","header":"a","input":"integer"},{"id":"b","header":"b","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"after":"第 3 行执行后","a":5,"b":2}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"after":"第 4 行执行后","a":5,"b":7}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"after":"第 5 行执行后","a":2,"b":7}}]}],"explanation":"b 先保存 2，a 加 3 变成 5 时，b 仍是 2。下一行 b 读取当前的 a，得到 2 + 5 = 7；最后 a 读取当前的 b 和 a，得到 7 - 5 = 2。赋值只更新左边的名字。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py01.k2.x1","body":"按运行顺序填写每行执行后 `x` 与 `y` 的值。还没有赋值的名字填“尚未定义”。\n\n```python startLine=1\nx = 2\ny = x + 1\nx = y + 1\ny = x + y\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"x","header":"x","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"y","header":"y","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","x":2,"y":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","x":2,"y":3}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","x":4,"y":3}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","x":4,"y":7}}]}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | x | y |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 第 1 行 | 2 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | 2 | 3 |\n| 第 3 行 | 4 | 3 |\n| 第 4 行 | 4 | 7 |\n\n每一行都用那一刻的值：第 3 行用的是第 2 行算出的 y（3），第 4 行用的是第 3 行之后的 x（4）。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.x2","body":"下面的程序想算出本周一共收到多少份样本。\n\n```python startLine=1\nweek = 0\nweek = week + 12\ntoday = 5\nweek = week + today\ntoday = 9\nprint(week)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":17},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"第 5 行把 `today` 改成 9 以后，`week` 怎样了？","options":[{"id":"follows","content":"week 跟着变成 21"},{"id":"fixed","content":"week 不变，它保存的是第 4 行加上 5 那一刻的结果"}],"key":"fixed"}],"explanation":"显示 **17**。第 4 行用当时的 `today`（5）算出 17；第 5 行只让 `today` 改指向 9，`week` 不会重新计算。\n"},{"id":"py01.k2.x3","body":"显示记录不会被后面的赋值追溯改写，保存下来的旧值也不会自动更新。\n\n```python\nvalue = 3\nprevious = value\nprint(value)\nvalue = 9\nprint(previous)\nprint(value)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"9"}],"explanation":"第一行显示当时的 3；previous 也保留 3；最后 value 已经改为 9。这三处分别对应不同名字和时刻。"},{"id":"py01.k2.x4","body":"一个计算结果成为下一次重新赋值的输入。逐行追踪，不把最后一行误读成旧初值的差。\n\n```python\na = 4\nb = a + 3\na = b - 2\nb = a + b\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"5"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"12"}],"explanation":"b 先得到 7，a 再得到 5，最后 b 用新的 a 与旧的 b 相加，成为 12。"}]}]},{"id":"py02","title":"把计算写成表达式","summary":"读懂一行算式的计算顺序和括号；分清 /、// 和 %；换算时把单位写进名字，并用量级核对结果。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py01"],"intro":"上一节的程序只做加减。这一节把几步计算写进一行：乘、除、括号，以及怎样让算出来的数带着正确的单位。\n\n程序仍当作一段短脚本，从第一行往下运行，只有 `print` 会在屏幕上显示东西。\n\n有些题会写“宿主提供了 `plates = 2`”或“宿主已经给 `a`、`b` 赋好了值”。宿主就是运行你的代码的这个环境：它事先替你把这些名字赋好值，你的代码里不要再写这一行；换一次运行，这些名字可能取别的值，所以代码要对任何取值都算对。\n","wrapup":"读一行算式，先找括号，再算乘除（`*`、`/`、`//`、`%`），最后算加减，同一级从左往右；`/` 的结果总带小数点。算完再看单位：名字里写的是什么单位，换算该乘还是该除，结果的大小说不说得通。\n\n向同事或 AI 提计算要求时，把“先合起来再乘”“保留小数”“结果以小时为单位”这类信息说出来，对方就不用猜。\n","kps":[{"id":"py02.k1","title":"括号与运算顺序","key":["py01"],"links":["py01.k1"],"card":{"name":"运算顺序","aliases":["括号","先乘除后加减"],"definition":"一行算式里先算括号里的，再算乘除，最后算加减；同一级从左往右。想让加减先算，就把它放进括号。","conditions":["乘号要写成 `*`，不能省略，也不能写成 ×。","把需求写成算式时，先想清楚哪几个数要先合在一起，再决定括号放在哪里。"],"example":"```python\ntubes = boxes * per_box + loose\n```\nboxes 为 4、per_box 为 8、loose 为 3 时，先算 4 * 8 得 32，再加 3，tubes 是 35。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"Python 的乘号写成 `*`。一行算式里既有加减又有乘时，计算顺序和数学课一样：\n\n1. 括号里的先算；\n2. 再算乘（下一个知识点的除法也在这一级）；\n3. 最后算加减；同一级的从左往右算。\n\n| 算式 | 怎样算 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| `4 * 8 + 3` | 先算 `4 * 8` 得 32，再加 3 | 35 |\n| `4 * (8 + 3)` | 先算括号里的 `8 + 3` 得 11，再乘 4 | 44 |\n| `10 - 4 - 3` | 从左往右：`10 - 4` 得 6，再减 3 | 3 |\n\n[赋值](repa:concept/py01.k1)的读法不变：先把等号右边整个算完，再让左边的名字指向结果。\n\n把一句需求写成算式时，先想清楚哪几个数要先合在一起。“单价加运费，再乘份数”里，单价和运费要先相加，就得写成 `(price + fee) * count`；不加括号，乘法先算，就成了只有运费乘了份数。乘号也不能省：数学里的 `2(3 + 4)` 在 Python 里要写成 `2 * (3 + 4)`。\n","example":{"id":"py02.k1.e0","body":"每盒装 8 管样本，一共 4 盒，另外还有 3 管散装。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nboxes = 4\nper_box = 8\nloose = 3\ntubes = boxes * per_box + loose\nprint(tubes)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 行等号右边，最先算的是哪一步？","options":[{"id":"add","content":"`per_box + loose`，得 11"},{"id":"mul","content":"`boxes * per_box`，得 32"}],"key":"mul"},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示哪个整数？","key":35}],"explanation":"第 4 行没有括号，乘法先算：`boxes * per_box` 是 4 * 8 = 32，再加上 `loose` 的 3，得 **35**，然后让 `tubes` 指向 35。最后一行显示 **35**。\n\n如果写成 `boxes * (per_box + loose)`，就成了 4 * 11 = 44，意思变成“每盒 11 管”，和实际情况不符。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py02.k1.q1","body":"```python\nprint(2 + 3 * 4)\nprint((2 + 3) * 4)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":14,"feedback":[{"when":20,"message":"没有括号时乘法先算：先算 3 * 4 得 12，再加 2。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":20,"feedback":[{"when":14,"message":"括号里的 2 + 3 先算，得 5，再乘 4。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **14**：没有括号，先算 `3 * 4` 得 12，再加 2。第二行显示 **20**：括号里的 `2 + 3` 先算得 5，再乘 4。两行只差一对括号，结果就不同。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.q2","body":"一份试剂单价 `price` 元，每买一份另收运费 `fee` 元，一共买 `count` 份。哪一行能算出要付的总钱数 `cost`？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"fee_only","content":"```python\ncost = price + fee * count\n```\n","feedback":"没有括号时 `fee * count` 先算，单价只算了一份。"},{"id":"both","content":"```python\ncost = (price + fee) * count\n```\n"},{"id":"once","content":"```python\ncost = price * count + fee\n```\n","feedback":"运费是每份都收，这一行只加了一次。"}],"key":"both"}],"explanation":"`cost = (price + fee) * count` 正确：每一份要付单价加运费，所以先把两者加起来，再乘份数。例如单价 12、运费 3、买 5 份，要付 15 × 5 = 75 元。\n\n`price + fee * count` 先算了运费乘份数，单价只算了一份，得 27；`price * count + fee` 只收了一次运费，得 63。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\nn = 2\nn = n * 3 + 1\nn = (n - 1) * 2\nprint(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","prompt":"填写前三行各自执行后 `n` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","n":2}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","n":7}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","n":12}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":12,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"括号里的 n - 1 先算。第 3 行的 n 是 7，括号里得 6，再乘 2。"}]}],"explanation":"`n` 依次是 **2 → 7 → 12**，最后显示 **12**。第 2 行先算 `2 * 3` 得 6，再加 1 得 7；第 3 行先算括号里的 `7 - 1` 得 6，再乘 2 得 12。每一行都用那一刻的 `n`。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.q4","body":"要先合并两批数量，再按每批 3 份包装。哪段代码对所有非负整数 a、b 都得到三倍的合计？\n","slots":[{"id":"formula","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"first","content":"`result = a + b * 3`"},{"id":"grouped","content":"`result = (a + b) * 3`"},{"id":"reduced","content":"`result = a + (b - 3)`"}],"key":"grouped"}],"explanation":"括号让 a + b 先计算，再把整个合计乘 3。没有括号时，只有 b 被乘了 3。"},{"id":"py02.k1.q5","body":"两个算式用了同样的数字和符号。分别计算结果，观察括号改变了哪一步。\n\n```python\nprint(30 - 12 - 4)\nprint(30 - (12 - 4))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"plain","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":14},{"id":"grouped","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":22}],"explanation":"连续减法从左往右，先得到 18 再减 4，结果是 14。第二行先算括号中的 8，再算 30 - 8，结果是 22。"}],"review":[{"id":"py02.k1.r1","body":"库存原有 20 份样本，用掉 2 批、每批 3 份，又收到 4 份。同事写下了这一行：\n\n```python\nstock = 20 - 2 * 3 + 4\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按 Python 实际计算的先后，排出等号右边的计算步骤；不会发生的步骤不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"sub","content":"`20 - 6` 得 14"},{"id":"early_sub","content":"`20 - 2` 得 18"},{"id":"add","content":"`14 + 4` 得 18"},{"id":"mul","content":"`2 * 3` 得 6"},{"id":"early_add","content":"`3 + 4` 得 7"}],"key":["mul","sub","add"]},{"id":"result","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`stock` 最后是多少？","key":18}],"explanation":"先算乘法 `2 * 3` 得 6；剩下的减和加是同一级，从左往右：`20 - 6` 得 14，再 `14 + 4` 得 **18**。\n\n`20 - 2` 不会发生，因为 2 先要和 3 相乘；`3 + 4` 也不会发生，因为 3 已经在乘法里用掉了。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.r2","body":"每块板有 96 个孔，每块板都要留出 6 个孔放对照，其余的孔放样本。`plates` 是板数。\n\n作答框里的代码想算出一共能放多少个样本，存进 `capacity`，但只在一块板时算对。请改正它，结果变量仍叫 `capacity`。宿主提供了 `plates = 2`，换一次实验可能是别的板数。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"capacity = plates * 96 - 6\n","solution":"capacity = plates * (96 - 6)\n","accepts":["capacity = (96 - 6) * plates","capacity = plates * 96 - plates * 6","capacity = plates * 90"],"rejects":[{"code":"capacity = plates * 96","why":"没有扣掉对照孔"},{"code":"capacity = plates * 96 - 6 * 2","why":"只在两块板时碰巧算对"},{"code":"capacity = (plates - 6) * 96","why":"括号括错了位置"},{"code":"capacity = 180","why":"把结果写死成两块板的数"}],"tests":[{"name":"两块板","setup":"plates = 2","expect":{"capacity":"180"}},{"name":"三块板","hidden":true,"setup":"plates = 3","expect":{"capacity":"270"}},{"name":"五块板","hidden":true,"setup":"plates = 5","expect":{"capacity":"450"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ncapacity = plates * (96 - 6)\n```\n\n每块板能放样本的孔是 96 - 6 = 90 个，要先在括号里算出来，再乘板数。原来的 `plates * 96 - 6` 先算乘法，只扣了一次 6 个孔，所以只有一块板时才对。写成 `plates * 96 - plates * 6` 也对。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.r3","body":"先抵扣优惠再按份数计费，与只给最后一项乘份数不同。读出两个算式的结果。\n\n```python\nprint((18 - 3) * 2)\nprint(18 - 3 * 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"30"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"12"}],"explanation":"第一行先做括号内减法得到 15，再乘 2；第二行先乘得 6，再从 18 中减去它。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py02.k1.x1","body":"逐行写出程序显示的整数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(10 - 4 - 3)\nprint(10 - (4 - 3))\nprint(2 * 3 + 2 * 4)\nprint(2 * (3 + 2) * 4)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outputs","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"第几行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","shown":3}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":9}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":14}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":40}}]}],"explanation":"| 行 | 怎样算 | 显示 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| 1 | 从左往右：10 - 4 得 6，再减 3 | 3 |\n| 2 | 括号先算：4 - 3 得 1，10 - 1 | 9 |\n| 3 | 两个乘法先算：6 + 8 | 14 |\n| 4 | 括号先算得 5，再从左往右乘：2 × 5 × 4 | 40 |\n\n第 1、2 行只差一对括号：减法从左往右算，括号改变了先后，结果也就不同。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.x2","body":"需求是：每个样本先离心 5 分钟，再静置 10 分钟；`n` 个样本一个接一个处理，算出一共要多少分钟。同事写的程序是：\n\n```python\nn = 4\nminutes = n * 5 + 10\nprint(minutes)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示多少？","key":30},{"id":"needed","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按需求，4 个样本一共要多少分钟？","suffix":"分钟","key":60},{"id":"coincide","type":"choice","prompt":"同事先用一个样本试了试，结果和需求一样，就以为写对了。n 取下面哪个值时，`n * 5 + 10` 才会碰巧和需求算出同样的分钟数？","options":[{"id":"n1","content":"1"},{"id":"n2","content":"2"},{"id":"n4","content":"4"},{"id":"n10","content":"10"}],"key":"n1"}],"explanation":"程序显示 **30**：先算 `4 * 5` 得 20，再加 10，静置时间只算了一次。按需求，每个样本要 5 + 10 = 15 分钟，4 个样本是 **60** 分钟，应当写成 `n * (5 + 10)`。\n\nn 取 **1** 时，`1 * 5 + 10` 是 15，`1 * (5 + 10)` 也是 15：只有一个样本时，静置“算一次”和“每个样本各算一次”没有区别。n 是 2、4、10 时，错误写法分别得 20、30、60，而需求是 30、60、150。检查算式时只试一个样本，查不出这处括号的问题，要多试几个不同的值。\n"},{"id":"py02.k1.x3","body":"同一级除法与乘法从左到右；括号改变被除数。读出两个结果。\n\n```python\nprint(24 / 3 * 2)\nprint(24 / (3 * 2))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"16.0"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"4.0"}],"explanation":"第一行先 24 / 3 得 8.0，再乘 2；第二行先算括号中的 6，再用 24 除它。"}]},{"id":"py02.k2","title":"除法 /、整除 // 与余数 %","key":["py01"],"links":["py02.k1"],"card":{"name":"三种除法","aliases":["整除","余数","//","%"],"definition":"`/` 是普通除法，结果总带小数点；`//` 只留下整除的整数部分；`%` 取余数。","conditions":["`/` 除得尽也带小数点：`6 / 2` 显示 3.0，不是 3。","`//` 与 `%` 常一起用：装满几盒、还剩几个。这里只用正数。","它们和 `*` 同一级，比加减先算；求平均要写成 `(a + b) / 2`。"],"example":"50 管样本装进每盒 8 管的盒子：`50 // 8` 得 6（装满 6 盒），`50 % 8` 得 2（还剩 2 管），`50 / 8` 得 6.25。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"Python 有三种和除法有关的写法。把 50 管样本装进每盒 8 管的盒子：\n\n| 写法 | 结果 | 意思 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `50 / 8` | 6.25 | 普通除法 |\n| `50 // 8` | 6 | 整除：能装满 6 盒 |\n| `50 % 8` | 2 | 余数：装满后还剩 2 管 |\n\n可以这样核对：6 盒 × 8 管 + 2 管 = 50 管。\n\n- `/` 的结果总带小数点，即使除得尽：`6 / 2` 显示 `3.0`，不是 `3`。\n- `//` 只留下整数部分，不四舍五入：`50 // 8` 是 6，不是 7。\n- `%` 读作“除以……的余数”。这一节只用正数。\n\n这三种写法和 `*` 是同一级，比加减先算（见[运算顺序](repa:concept/py02.k1)）。所以两个读数的平均要写成 `(a + b) / 2`：写成 `a + b / 2`，会先算 `b / 2`，再加上 `a`。\n","example":{"id":"py02.k2.e0","body":"50 管样本，每盒装 8 管。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntubes = 50\nper_box = 8\nfull = tubes // per_box\nleft = tubes % per_box\nprint(full)\nprint(left)\nprint(tubes / per_box)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示（装满几盒）","key":6},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示（还剩几管）","key":2},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"6.25"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **6**、**2**、**6.25**。`50 // 8` 只留下整除的整数部分 6，也就是能装满 6 盒；`50 % 8` 是余数 2，装满后还剩 2 管；`50 / 8` 是普通除法，得 6.25。\n\n核对一下：6 × 8 + 2 = 50，一管不多一管不少。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py02.k2.q1","body":"逐行写出程序显示的内容。注意带不带小数点：`3` 和 `3.0` 算不同的答案。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(9 / 3)\nprint(9 // 2)\nprint(9 % 2)\nprint(7 / 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outputs","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"第几行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","shown":"3.0"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":"4"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"1"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":"3.5"}}]}],"explanation":"| 行 | 显示 | 为什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 3.0 | `/` 的结果总带小数点，除得尽也一样 |\n| 2 | 4 | 9 里有 4 个完整的 2 |\n| 3 | 1 | 9 = 4 × 2 + 1，余数是 1 |\n| 4 | 3.5 | 普通除法 |\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.q2","body":"两次测量的读数分别是 12 和 15，想求平均值。\n\n```python\na = 12\nb = 15\nprint(a + b / 2)\nprint((a + b) / 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"19.5","feedback":[{"when":"13.5","message":"没有括号时 `b / 2` 先算，得 7.5，再加上 a。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"13.5"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **19.5**：除法比加法先算，先算 `15 / 2` 得 7.5，再加 12。第二行显示 **13.5**：括号里先加得 27，再除以 2。求平均要用第二种写法。\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.q3","body":"`samples` 份样本平均分给 `people` 位同学，每人只拿整份，分不完的交回冰箱。例如 30 份分给 4 人，每人 7 份，交回 2 份。哪一行算的是交回冰箱的份数 `back`？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"div","content":"```python\nback = samples / people\n```\n","feedback":"普通除法得 7.5，这是平均每人分到多少，不是剩下多少。"},{"id":"floor","content":"```python\nback = samples // people\n```\n","feedback":"这是每人拿到的整份数 7。"},{"id":"minus","content":"```python\nback = samples - people\n```\n"},{"id":"mod","content":"```python\nback = samples % people\n```\n"}],"key":"mod"}],"explanation":"`back = samples % people`：余数就是分完整份后剩下的份数，30 % 4 得 2。`samples // people` 得 7，是每人拿到的份数；`samples / people` 得 7.5；`samples - people` 得 26，和分配无关。\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.q4","body":"要得到整盒数 4，下面三个表达式中哪一个的结果不仅数值为 4，而且是整数？\n\n```python\nprint(28 / 7)\nprint(28 // 7)\nprint(28 % 7)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"operator","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"division","content":"`/`"},{"id":"floor","content":"`//`"},{"id":"remainder","content":"`%`"}],"key":"floor"}],"explanation":"/ 得到带小数点的 4.0，// 得到整数 4，% 得到余数 0。能整除也不会让 / 变成整除运算。"},{"id":"py02.k2.q5","body":"先装满 6 个一组的盒子，再数散件。填写整盒数与散件数，并检查它们能否还原总数。\n\n```python\npieces = 41\nboxes = pieces // 6\nloose = pieces % 6\nprint(boxes)\nprint(loose)\nprint(boxes * 6 + loose)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"boxes","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"整盒数","key":6},{"id":"loose","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"散件数","key":5},{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"还原的总数","key":41}],"explanation":"41 中有 6 个完整的 6，余下 5；6 × 6 + 5 又得到 41。// 与 % 分别保留完整组数和剩余量。"}],"review":[{"id":"py02.k2.r1","body":"每块板有 96 个孔，一共 250 个样本，先把板一块块放满。\n\n```python startLine=1\nwells = 96\nsamples = 250\nplates = samples // wells\nextra = samples % wells\ncheck = plates * wells + extra\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","prompt":"程序运行完以后，下面三个名字各是多少？","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"plates","cells":{"name":"plates","value":2}},{"id":"extra","cells":{"name":"extra","value":58}},{"id":"check","cells":{"name":"check","value":250}}]}],"explanation":"`plates` 是 **2**：250 里有 2 个完整的 96。`extra` 是 **58**：放满 2 块板用掉 192 个，剩下 58 个放在第三块不满的板上。`check` 是 **250**：2 × 96 + 58 正好回到样本总数，说明整除和余数没有算错。\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.r2","body":"哪一段程序显示 `4`，不带小数点？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"slash","content":"```python\nprint(8 / 2)\n```\n","feedback":"`/` 的结果总带小数点，这里显示 4.0。"},{"id":"floor","content":"```python\nprint(8 // 2)\n```\n"},{"id":"half","content":"```python\nprint(9 / 2)\n```\n"},{"id":"rest","content":"```python\nprint(8 % 2)\n```\n"}],"key":"floor"}],"explanation":"`print(8 // 2)` 显示 **4**。`8 / 2` 虽然除得尽，`/` 的结果仍带小数点，显示 4.0；`9 / 2` 显示 4.5；`8 % 2` 是余数，显示 0。\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.r3","body":"运输箱恰好装满时，余数应为零，而普通除法仍返回浮点结果。\n\n```python\nprint(36 // 6)\nprint(36 % 6)\nprint(36 / 6)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"6"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"0"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"6.0"}],"explanation":"36 包含六个完整的 6，没有剩余；/ 仍使用普通除法，不会因为整除就去掉小数点。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py02.k2.x1","body":"一共 75 管样本。前两个空：离心机每次最多放 12 管，要算能满载离心几次、满载之后还剩几管。第三个空：把 75 管平均分成 12 份，每份平均几管（可以带小数）。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntubes = 75\nn = 12\nfull_runs = tubes ▢ n\nleft = tubes ▢ n\naverage = tubes ▢ n\n```\n\n每个 ▢ 各应填哪个运算符？\n","slots":[{"id":"full","type":"choice","layout":"row","prompt":"第 3 行（满载几次）","options":[{"id":"div","content":"`/`"},{"id":"floor","content":"`//`"},{"id":"mod","content":"`%`"}],"key":"floor"},{"id":"left","type":"choice","layout":"row","prompt":"第 4 行（还剩几管）","options":[{"id":"div","content":"`/`"},{"id":"floor","content":"`//`"},{"id":"mod","content":"`%`"}],"key":"mod"},{"id":"average","type":"choice","layout":"row","prompt":"第 5 行（平均每份几管）","options":[{"id":"div","content":"`/`"},{"id":"floor","content":"`//`"},{"id":"mod","content":"`%`"}],"key":"div"}],"explanation":"满载次数用 `//`：75 // 12 得 6。剩下的管数用 `%`：75 % 12 得 3（6 × 12 + 3 = 75）。平均每份要保留小数，用 `/`：75 / 12 得 6.25。\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.x2","body":"需求：算出三个读数 `a`、`b`、`c` 的平均值，存进 `mean`，保留小数。\n\n作答框里的代码算错了，请改正，结果变量仍叫 `mean`。宿主提供了 `a`、`b`、`c` 的值，换一批读数时代码也要算对。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"mean = a + b + c / 3\n","solution":"mean = (a + b + c) / 3\n","accepts":["total = a + b + c\nmean = total / 3\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"mean = (a + b + c) // 3","why":"整除丢掉了小数部分"},{"code":"mean = (a + b + c) / 2","why":"除数应当是读数的个数 3"},{"code":"mean = a + (b + c) / 3","why":"括号没有把 a 包进去"},{"code":"mean = 6.0","why":"把结果写死成第一组读数的平均"}],"tests":[{"name":"读数 3、6、9","setup":"a = 3\nb = 6\nc = 9\n","expect":{"mean":"6.0"}},{"name":"平均值带小数","hidden":true,"setup":"a = 1\nb = 2\nc = 4\n","expect":{"mean":"(1 + 2 + 4) / 3"}},{"name":"另一组读数","hidden":true,"setup":"a = 10\nb = 12\nc = 11\n","expect":{"mean":"11.0"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nmean = (a + b + c) / 3\n```\n\n`/` 比 `+` 先算，原来的代码只把 `c` 除以了 3。要先用括号把三个读数加起来，再除以 3。不能用 `//`：读数 1、2、4 的平均是 2.33…，整除会只留下 2。\n"},{"id":"py02.k2.x3","body":"不足一整盒时，整盒数与余数分别是什么？普通除法能保留不足整盒的比例。\n\n```python\nprint(3 // 6)\nprint(3 % 6)\nprint(3 / 6)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"0"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"0.5"}],"explanation":"三个物件装不满六个一盒，因此整盒零盒、散件三个；普通除法得到半盒的数值比例 0.5。"}]},{"id":"py02.k3","title":"单位随计算一起核对","key":["py01"],"links":["py02.k2"],"card":{"name":"单位核对","aliases":["单位换算","量级检查"],"definition":"每个数都带着单位：把单位写进名字，换算时核对该乘还是该除、乘除的数对不对，算完再看结果的大小说不说得通。","conditions":["小单位换大单位用除：分钟变小时除以 60，µL 变 mL 除以 1000；大单位换小单位用乘。","浓度（mg/mL）乘体积（mL）得到质量（mg）；单位对不上的算式多半写错了。","换算要保留小数时用 `/`，不要用 `//`。"],"example":"135 分钟：`135 // 60` 得 2，`135 % 60` 得 15，即 2 小时 15 分；`135 / 60` 得 2.25，单位是小时。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"数据里的数几乎都带单位：分钟、毫升、mg/mL。Python 只认数，不管单位，所以要把单位写进名字（`minutes`、`volume_ul`、`conc_mg_per_ml`），每一步自己核对。\n\n换算时先想“1 个大单位等于多少个小单位”：1 小时 = 60 分钟，1 mL = 1000 µL。\n\n- 小单位换成大单位，用除：`hours = minutes / 60`，`volume_ml = volume_ul / 1000`。\n- 大单位换成小单位，用乘：`minutes = hours * 60`。\n- 浓度乘体积得到质量：`mass_mg = conc_mg_per_ml * volume_ml`，单位上 mg/mL × mL = mg。\n\n| 要算 | 写法 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| 90 分钟是几小时 | `90 / 60` | 1.5 |\n| 250 µL 是几 mL | `250 / 1000` | 0.25 |\n| 2 mg/mL 的溶液取 5 mL，含多少 mg | `2 * 5` | 10 |\n| 135 分钟是几小时几分 | `135 // 60` 和 `135 % 60` | 2 小时 15 分 |\n\n最后一行用的是[三种除法](repa:concept/py02.k2)里的 `//` 和 `%`。要保留小数的换算用 `/`：`250 // 1000` 得 0，0.25 mL 就丢了。\n\n算完再估一下大小：一个下午的实验算出要几千小时，一管样本算出几万毫升，多半是乘除用反了。\n","example":{"id":"py02.k3.e0","body":"一次实验用了 135 分钟。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nminutes = 135\nhours = minutes // 60\nrest_minutes = minutes % 60\nprint(hours)\nprint(rest_minutes)\nprint(minutes / 60)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":2},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":15},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"2.25"},{"id":"unit","type":"choice","prompt":"第三行显示的数，单位是什么？","options":[{"id":"minute","content":"分钟"},{"id":"hour","content":"小时"},{"id":"second","content":"秒"}],"key":"hour"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **2**、**15**、**2.25**。135 分钟里有 2 个完整的 60 分钟，余下 15 分钟，所以是 2 小时 15 分。`minutes / 60` 把分钟换成小时，得 2.25 **小时**：0.25 小时就是 15 分钟，两种写法说的是同一段时间。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py02.k3.q1","body":"`volume_ul` 是以微升（µL）为单位的体积，例如 250。要得到以毫升（mL）为单位的体积 `volume_ml`，哪一行对？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"times","content":"```python\nvolume_ml = volume_ul * 1000\n```\n","feedback":"微升换成毫升是小单位换大单位，数应当变小。250 µL 不会是 250000 mL。"},{"id":"floor","content":"```python\nvolume_ml = volume_ul // 1000\n```\n","feedback":"整除只留下整数部分，250 µL 会算成 0 mL。"},{"id":"div","content":"```python\nvolume_ml = volume_ul / 1000\n```\n"},{"id":"hundred","content":"```python\nvolume_ml = volume_ul / 100\n```\n","feedback":"1 mL 是 1000 µL，不是 100 µL。"}],"key":"div"}],"explanation":"`volume_ml = volume_ul / 1000`：1 mL = 1000 µL，小单位换大单位用除，250 µL 得 0.25 mL。乘 1000 方向反了；`// 1000` 会把 0.25 丢成 0；除以 100 用错了换算的数。\n"},{"id":"py02.k3.q2","body":"溶液浓度是 2 mg/mL，取 500 µL。\n\n```python startLine=1\nconc_mg_per_ml = 2\nvolume_ul = 500\nvolume_ml = volume_ul / 1000\nmass_mg = conc_mg_per_ml * volume_ml\nprint(mass_mg)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"1.0","feedback":[{"when":"1000","message":"第 4 行用的是第 3 行换算后的毫升数 0.5，不是 500。"}]},{"id":"unit","type":"choice","prompt":"显示的数，单位是什么？","options":[{"id":"ml","content":"mL"},{"id":"mg_per_ml","content":"mg/mL"},{"id":"mg","content":"mg"}],"key":"mg"}],"explanation":"显示 **1.0**，单位是 **mg**。第 3 行把 500 µL 换成 0.5 mL；第 4 行浓度乘体积，2 mg/mL × 0.5 mL = 1.0 mg。0.5 来自 `/`，所以结果带小数点。\n\n如果跳过第 3 行，直接用 500 去乘，会得到 1000，单位却成了 mg/mL × µL，对不上 mg。\n"},{"id":"py02.k3.q3","body":"需求：把用时 `minutes`（分钟）换算成小时，存进 `hours`，保留小数。\n\n作答框里的代码算出的数大得离谱。请改正它，结果变量仍叫 `hours`。宿主提供了 `minutes = 90`，换一次实验可能是别的分钟数。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"hours = minutes * 60\n","solution":"hours = minutes / 60\n","rejects":[{"code":"hours = minutes // 60","why":"整除丢掉了不满一小时的部分"},{"code":"hours = minutes / 100","why":"1 小时是 60 分钟，不是 100 分钟"},{"code":"hours = 1.5","why":"把结果写死成 90 分钟的答案"}],"tests":[{"name":"90 分钟","setup":"minutes = 90","expect":{"hours":"1.5","minutes":"90"}},{"name":"不满一小时","hidden":true,"setup":"minutes = 45","expect":{"hours":"0.75"}},{"name":"正好两小时","hidden":true,"setup":"minutes = 120","expect":{"hours":"2.0"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nhours = minutes / 60\n```\n\n分钟是小单位、小时是大单位，换算用除，90 分钟得 1.5 小时。原来的 `minutes * 60` 得 5400，按小时算超过 200 天，一看量级就不对。`// 60` 会把 45 分钟算成 0 小时。\n"},{"id":"py02.k3.q4","body":"一条记录用秒，另一条用分钟。程序能运行，但要把总时长换成秒，下面三个修订哪个正确？\n\n```python\nseconds = 45\nminutes = 2\ntotal_seconds = seconds + minutes\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both","content":"`total_seconds = (seconds + minutes) * 60`"},{"id":"minutes","content":"`total_seconds = seconds + minutes * 60`"},{"id":"seconds","content":"`total_seconds = seconds * 60 + minutes`"}],"key":"minutes"}],"explanation":"只有 minutes 需要从分钟换成秒。seconds 已经是秒，再乘 60 就重复换算了；正确总量是 45 + 120 = 165 秒。"},{"id":"py02.k3.q5","body":"设备报告 1500 毫秒；界面要显示秒。读程序，填写换算后的秒数与原始毫秒数。\n\n```python\ndelay_ms = 1500\ndelay_s = delay_ms / 1000\nprint(delay_s)\nprint(delay_ms)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"seconds","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"delay_s","key":1.5,"suffix":"秒"},{"id":"milliseconds","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"delay_ms","key":1500,"suffix":"毫秒"}],"explanation":"1000 毫秒等于 1 秒，所以除以 1000 得到 1.5 秒。换算结果交给了新名字 delay_s，原来的 delay_ms 仍是 1500。"}],"review":[{"id":"py02.k3.r1","body":"一共 40 个样本，每个样本取 250 µL。同事想算出一共要多少 mL，写了：\n\n```python\ntotal_ml = 40 * 250 * 1000\nprint(total_ml)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示多少？","key":10000000},{"id":"correct","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"一共实际需要多少 mL？","suffix":"mL","key":10}],"explanation":"程序显示 **10000000**，也就是一千万毫升，四十管样本不可能用这么多。40 × 250 = 10000 µL；µL 换 mL 应当除以 1000，实际需要 **10** mL。这一行把除写成了乘。\n"},{"id":"py02.k3.r2","body":"三个名字都带着单位：`mass_mg` 是质量（mg），`volume_ml` 是体积（mL），`conc_mg_per_ml` 是浓度（mg/mL）。\n\n按单位推一推，下面每个算式算出来的数是什么单位？单位对不上、算出来没有意义的，选“没有意义”。\n","slots":[{"id":"units","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"算式"},{"id":"unit","header":"算出的数是","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"mg","label":"mg"},{"id":"ml","label":"mL"},{"id":"mg_per_ml","label":"mg/mL"},{"id":"none","label":"没有意义"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"expr":"`mass_mg / volume_ml`","unit":"mg_per_ml"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"expr":"`conc_mg_per_ml * volume_ml`","unit":"mg"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"expr":"`mass_mg / conc_mg_per_ml`","unit":"ml"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"expr":"`mass_mg * volume_ml`","unit":"none"}}]},{"id":"volume","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"浓度 4 mg/mL、需要 10 mg 的药。按上表里算出 mL 的那个算式，要取多少 mL？","suffix":"mL","key":"2.5"}],"explanation":"| 算式 | 单位怎么推 | 算出的数 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `mass_mg / volume_ml` | mg ÷ mL | mg/mL，是浓度 |\n| `conc_mg_per_ml * volume_ml` | mg/mL × mL，mL 约掉 | mg，是质量 |\n| `mass_mg / conc_mg_per_ml` | mg ÷ (mg/mL)，mg 约掉 | mL，是体积 |\n| `mass_mg * volume_ml` | mg × mL | mg·mL，不是任何要用的量，多半是写错了乘除 |\n\n要取的体积是质量除以浓度：10 ÷ 4 = 2.5 mL。核对：2.5 mL × 4 mg/mL = 10 mg，正好回到需要的质量。\n"},{"id":"py02.k3.r3","body":"一次活动包括 2 小时和额外 15 分钟。统一换成分钟，再换回小时。\n\n```python\ntotal_minutes = 2 * 60 + 15\nprint(total_minutes)\nprint(total_minutes / 60)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"135"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"2.25"}],"explanation":"小时先乘 60 变成分钟，与额外的分钟相加得 135；整个合计除以 60，才得到 2.25 小时。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py02.k3.x1","body":"一次测量用时 `seconds` 秒，下面的代码把它写成“几分几秒”：\n\n```python\nminutes = seconds // 60\nrest_seconds = seconds % 60\n```\n\n`seconds` 取下面的值时，`minutes` 和 `rest_seconds` 各是多少？\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"seconds","header":"seconds"},{"id":"minutes","header":"minutes","input":"integer"},{"id":"rest","header":"rest_seconds","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"s75","cells":{"seconds":"75","minutes":1,"rest":15}},{"id":"s200","cells":{"seconds":"200","minutes":3,"rest":20}},{"id":"s59","cells":{"seconds":"59","minutes":0,"rest":59}}]}],"explanation":"| seconds | minutes | rest_seconds |\n|---:|---:|---:|\n| 75 | 1 | 15 |\n| 200 | 3 | 20 |\n| 59 | 0 | 59 |\n\n`// 60` 数出有几个完整的 60 秒，`% 60` 是剩下不满一分钟的秒数。59 秒不满一分钟，所以是 0 分 59 秒。核对：3 × 60 + 20 = 200。\n"},{"id":"py02.k3.x2","body":"一共 6 个样本，每个样本处理 15 分钟。用下面的代码行拼出一段程序，显示总共要几小时（保留小数）。不需要的行不要放进来。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"hours_times","code":"total_hours = total_minutes * 60"},{"id":"each","code":"minutes_each = 15"},{"id":"show","code":"print(total_hours)"},{"id":"hours","code":"total_hours = total_minutes / 60"},{"id":"samples","code":"samples = 6"},{"id":"hours_floor","code":"total_hours = total_minutes // 60"},{"id":"total","code":"total_minutes = samples * minutes_each"}],"key":["samples","each","total","hours","show"],"alternatives":[["each","samples","total","hours","show"]],"tests":[{"name":"显示总小时数","stdout":"1.5","expect":{"total_hours":"1.5"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsamples = 6\nminutes_each = 15\ntotal_minutes = samples * minutes_each\ntotal_hours = total_minutes / 60\nprint(total_hours)\n```\n\n先给样本数和每个样本的分钟数赋值（这两行谁先都可以），算出总分钟数 90，再除以 60 换成小时，显示 **1.5**。乘 60 方向反了，会得到 5400；`// 60` 会把 1.5 小时丢成 1。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py03","title":"数字、文字和缺省值不是一回事","summary":"分清整数、小数、文字三类值和表示“没有值”的 None；读懂 + 在不同类型上的结果，需要计算时先用 int、float、str 转换。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py01","py02"],"intro":"这一节认识三类值：整数、小数和文字，再认识一个表示“没有值”的 None。读别人或 AI 写的数据处理代码时，很多“结果怪怪的”都出在这里：看起来是数，其实是文字；没测的数据被当成了 0。\n\n程序仍然当作短脚本从上往下运行，只有 `print` 才在屏幕上显示东西。\n","wrapup":"读到一个值，先问它是哪一类：带引号的是文字，带小数点的是小数，`None` 是没有值。文字要先转换才能算数；没测的数据记 `None`，不记 0。\n\n向 AI 提需求时，可以把这些说清楚：“这一列读进来是文字，请先转成小数再相加”“没测的样本记为没有值，不要当作 0”。\n","kps":[{"id":"py03.k1","title":"int、float、str 的行为差别","key":["py01"],"links":["py01.k1"],"card":{"name":"值的类型","aliases":["int","float","str","整数","小数","文字"],"definition":"Python 的值分类型：整数 int、小数 float、文字 str。同一个符号作用在不同类型上结果不同，例如 + 对数是相加，对文字是拼接。","conditions":["带引号的是文字：print 显示 7 和 \"7\" 一模一样，要回到赋值的地方看有没有引号。","文字和数不能直接相加，会报 TypeError；整数和小数相加，结果是小数。","样本编号这类只当名字用、不拿来算的值，应当写成文字，例如 \"007\"。"],"example":"```python\na = 3\nb = \"3\"\nprint(a + a)\nprint(b + b)\n```\na 是整数，3 + 3 显示 6；b 是文字，两段 \"3\" 接起来显示 33。再写 print(a + b) 会报 TypeError。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"到现在为止我们算的都是整数。Python 的值分不同的**类型**，先认识三种：\n\n| 写法 | 类型 | 常见用途 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `7`、`-2` | 整数 int | 份数、计数 |\n| `2.5`、`7.0` | 小数 float | 体积、浓度 |\n| `\"7\"`、`\"S_A\"` | 文字 str | 编号、组别 |\n\n带引号的就是文字，哪怕引号里写的是数字。（别的教程和文档里常把它叫“字符串”，是同一种东西。）同一个符号作用在不同类型上，做的事不同：\n\n- `3 + 4` 是 7；`\"3\" + \"4\"` 是把两段文字接起来，得到文字 `\"34\"`。\n- `\"3\" * 2` 是把文字重复两次，得到 `\"33\"`。\n- 整数和小数相加，结果是小数：`2 + 0.5` 是 2.5。\n- 文字和数不能直接相加：`\"ab\" + 1` 会报错（TypeError），程序停在这一行，后面的行不再运行。\n\n`print` 显示文字时不带引号，`print(7)` 和 `print(\"7\")` 都显示 7。想知道一个值是哪一类，要回到它被[赋值](repa:concept/py01.k1)的地方，看有没有引号、有没有小数点。\n\n样本编号 `\"007\"` 这类值应当写成文字：它只是名字，不拿来算；写成数 7 就丢掉了前面的 0。\n\n**答题约定**：问“程序显示什么”时，照 print 显示的样子填，文字不加引号；如果程序在某一行报错停下，填 **ERROR**；如果什么也不显示，填 **NOTHING**。\n","example":{"id":"py03.k1.e0","body":"样本的份数本该写成整数，有一处却写成了文字。阅读程序。\n\n```python\na = 3\nb = \"3\"\nprint(a + a)\nprint(b + b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"6"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？","key":"33","feedback":[{"when":"6","message":"b 带引号，是文字 \"3\"；`+` 把两段文字接在一起。"}]},{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"`b` 是哪一类值？","options":[{"id":"int","content":"整数 int"},{"id":"float","content":"小数 float"},{"id":"str","content":"文字 str"}],"key":"str"},{"id":"mixed","type":"choice","prompt":"如果在末尾再加一行 `print(a + b)`，会怎样？","options":[{"id":"six","content":"显示 6"},{"id":"error","content":"报错停下（TypeError）"},{"id":"thirtythree","content":"显示 33"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **6**：a 是整数 3，3 + 3 = 6。第二行显示 **33**：b 带引号，是文字 \"3\"，`+` 把两段文字接成 \"33\"，print 显示时不带引号。\n\n整数和文字不能直接相加，所以 `print(a + b)` 会报 TypeError，程序停在那一行。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py03.k1.q1","body":"下面四段程序各自单独运行。写出每段显示什么；如果程序报错停下，填 ERROR。\n\n**①**\n\n```python\nprint(2 + 0.5)\n```\n\n**②**\n\n```python\nprint(\"2\" + \"5\")\n```\n\n**③**\n\n```python\nprint(\"12\" * 2)\n```\n\n**④**\n\n```python\nprint(\"5\" + 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"p1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"① 显示","key":"2.5"},{"id":"p2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"② 显示","key":"25","feedback":[{"when":"7","message":"两边都带引号，是两段文字，`+` 把它们接在一起。"}]},{"id":"p3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"③ 显示","key":"1212","feedback":[{"when":"24","message":"\"12\" 是文字，`* 2` 是把它重复两次。"}]},{"id":"p4","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"④ 显示","key":"ERROR","feedback":[{"when":"7","message":"\"5\" 是文字，2 是整数，文字和整数不能直接相加。"},{"when":"52","message":"文字只能和文字拼接；和整数 2 相加会报错。"}]}],"explanation":"① **2.5**：整数加小数，结果是小数。② **25**：两段文字拼接。③ **1212**：文字重复两次。④ **ERROR**：文字 \"5\" 和整数 2 不能直接相加，报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.q2","body":"```python\ncount = 12\nvolume_ml = 2.5\nlabel = \"12\"\ntotal = count + volume_ml\n```\n\n四行都执行完以后，每个名字指向哪一类值？\n","slots":[{"id":"kinds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"kind","header":"类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int","label":"整数 int"},{"id":"float","label":"小数 float"},{"id":"str","label":"文字 str"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"name":"count","kind":"int"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"name":"volume_ml","kind":"float"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"name":"label","kind":"str"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"name":"total","kind":"float"}}]}],"explanation":"`count` 是整数，`volume_ml` 是小数，`label` 带引号所以是文字，哪怕里面写的是 12。`total` 是整数 12 加小数 2.5，结果是小数 14.5。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.q3","body":"同事从表单里读到两次计数，想算出总数：\n\n```python\nfirst = \"4\"\nsecond = \"6\"\ntotal = first + second\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"46","feedback":[{"when":"10","message":"first 和 second 都带引号，是文字。"}]},{"id":"reason","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么没有得到 10？","options":[{"id":"print","content":"print 把两个数并排显示了"},{"id":"joined","content":"first 和 second 是文字，`+` 把它们接在了一起"},{"id":"math","content":"Python 做加法时出了错"}],"key":"joined"}],"explanation":"显示 **46**。第 1、2 行的值带引号，是文字 \"4\" 和 \"6\"，`+` 把两段文字接成 \"46\"，并没有做加法。print 只是如实显示 total 的值。要得到 10，得先把文字转成数，下一个知识点就讲这个。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.q4","body":"读下面两行，选择能准确描述结果的一项。不要把文字重复当作数字乘法。\n\n```python\nprint(\"4\" * 2)\nprint(4 * 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"behavior","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both","content":"两行都显示 8"},{"id":"text","content":"第一行显示 44，第二行显示 8"},{"id":"error","content":"第一行不能运行"}],"key":"text"}],"explanation":"\"4\" 是 str，乘 2 得到重复两次的文字 \"44\"；4 是 int，乘 2 才是数值乘法 8。"},{"id":"py03.k1.q5","body":"表格中的每一行独立求值，写出 Python 显示的结果。保留必要的引号和小数点。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expression","header":"表达式"},{"id":"result","header":"显示结果","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"word","cells":{"expression":"\"6\" + \"2\"","result":"'62'"}},{"id":"number","cells":{"expression":"6 + 2","result":"8"}},{"id":"decimal","cells":{"expression":"6.0 + 2","result":"8.0"}}]}],"explanation":"两个 str 用 + 拼接，得到文字 '62'；两个整数相加是 8；参与加法的 6.0 是浮点数，因此最后一行是 8.0。"}],"review":[{"id":"py03.k1.r1","body":"下面哪些表达式算出的是文字（str）？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"text","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"repeat","content":"```python\n\"5\" * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"product","content":"```python\n5 * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"mixed","content":"```python\n5 + 2.0\n```\n"},{"id":"joined","content":"```python\n\"5\" + \"2\"\n```\n"}],"key":["repeat","joined"]},{"id":"shown","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`print(5 + 2.0)` 显示什么？","key":"7.0","feedback":[{"when":"7","message":"整数加小数，结果是小数，显示时带小数点。"}]}],"explanation":"`\"5\" * 2` 得到文字 \"55\"，`\"5\" + \"2\"` 得到文字 \"52\"，这两个是文字。`5 * 2` 是整数 10；`5 + 2.0` 是整数加小数，得到小数，print 显示 **7.0**。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.r2","body":"一段给采样点写备注的程序：\n\n```python startLine=1\nsite = \"北坡\"\ndepth = 30\nunit = \"cm\"\nnote = site + unit\ntext = site + depth\nprint(text)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"程序运行到第几行报错停下？","options":[{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l5","content":"第 5 行"},{"id":"l6","content":"第 6 行"}],"key":"l5"},{"id":"note","type":"text","prompt":"停下时，`note` 的值是什么？（照 print 显示的样子写）","key":"北坡cm"},{"id":"printed","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"屏幕上显示了什么？如果什么也没显示，填 NOTHING。","key":"NOTHING"}],"explanation":"第 4 行把两段文字 \"北坡\" 和 \"cm\" 接成 **北坡cm**，没有问题。第 5 行把文字 \"北坡\" 和整数 30 相加，报 TypeError，程序停在**第 5 行**；第 6 行的 print 没有运行，所以屏幕上什么也没显示（**NOTHING**）。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.r3","body":"数字文字的重复与浮点数乘法有不同的结果形状，保留输出中的引号与小数点。\n\n```python\nprint(repr(\"2\" * 3))\nprint(2.0 * 3)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"'222'"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"6.0"}],"explanation":"str 乘整数重复文字，结果仍是文字；float 参与乘法得到浮点数 6.0。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py03.k1.x1","body":"哪一段程序会显示 10？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"repeat","content":"```python\nn = \"5\"\nprint(n * 2)\n```\n"},{"id":"decimal","content":"```python\nn = 5.0\nprint(n + n)\n```\n"},{"id":"integer","content":"```python\nn = 5\nprint(n + n)\n```\n"},{"id":"mixed","content":"```python\nn = \"10\"\nprint(n + 0)\n```\n"}],"key":"integer"}],"explanation":"`n = 5` 后 `print(n + n)` 显示 10。`n = \"5\"` 时 `n * 2` 是把文字重复两次，显示 55；`n = 5.0` 是小数，相加显示 10.0；`n = \"10\"` 是文字，和整数 0 相加会报错。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.x2","body":"把下面的行排成一段程序，让它显示样本编号 S_07。用不到的行不要放进来。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(label)"},{"id":"bad_add","code":"label = prefix + 7"},{"id":"label","code":"label = prefix + num"},{"id":"num","code":"num = \"07\""},{"id":"bad_num","code":"num = 07"},{"id":"prefix","code":"prefix = \"S_\""}],"key":["prefix","num","label","show"],"alternatives":[["num","prefix","label","show"]],"tests":[{"name":"显示 S_07","stdout":"S_07","expect":{"label":"\"S_07\""}}]}],"explanation":"先给 `prefix` 和 `num` 赋值（谁先都可以），再拼出 `label`，最后 print。编号 07 要写成文字 `\"07\"`：`num = 07` 不是合法的写法，写成整数还会丢掉前面的 0；`prefix + 7` 是文字加整数，会报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py03.k1.x3","body":"加号到底拼接还是求和，取决于参与运算的类型。保留显示中的引号与小数点。\n\n```python\nprint(repr(\"3\" + \"5\"))\nprint(3 + 5.0)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"'35'"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"8.0"}],"explanation":"两段文字拼成 '35'，并没有先转成数字；另一行有浮点数 5.0 参与，返回浮点数 8.0。"}]},{"id":"py03.k2","title":"显式 int/float/str 转换","key":["py01"],"links":["py03.k1"],"card":{"name":"类型转换","aliases":["int()","float()","str()","转换"],"definition":"int(值)、float(值)、str(值) 用原来的值算出一个新类型的值，例如文字 \"12\" 转成整数 12、数 7 转成文字 \"7\"；原来的值不变。","conditions":["int(\"2.5\") 会报 ValueError：带小数点的文字要用 float 转。","int(2.9) 得到 2：直接截掉小数部分，不是四舍五入。","转换得到的是新值，要赋给名字才留得住。"],"example":"```python\nvolume_text = \"2.5\"\nvolume = float(volume_text)\nprint(volume + volume)\nprint(volume_text + volume_text)\n```\nvolume 是小数 2.5，相加显示 5.0；volume_text 仍是文字，拼接显示 2.52.5。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"从文件、表格或网页表单读进来的数，常常是文字：`\"12.5\"` 看着是数，其实带着引号，拿来“相加”只会拼接。要计算，先转换：\n\n| 写法 | 结果 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `int(\"12\")` | 12 | 文字转整数 |\n| `float(\"2.5\")` | 2.5 | 文字转小数 |\n| `float(\"3\")` | 3.0 | 转成小数，显示带 .0（和前面 `6 / 2` 得 3.0 是一回事） |\n| `str(7)` | \"7\" | 数转文字 |\n| `int(2.9)` | 2 | 截掉小数部分，不是四舍五入 |\n| `int(\"2.5\")` | 报错 ValueError | int 不认带小数点的文字 |\n\n写法和 `print(x)` 相似：名字后面跟一对括号，括号里放要转换的值，算出一个新值。它不改变原来的名字：写 `count = int(count_text)` 以后，`count_text` 仍是文字，`count` 才是整数。这种写法叫函数调用，后面再细讲。\n\n反过来，要把数接进一段文字，先用 `str`：`str(3) + \" 份\"` 得到文字 \"3 份\"；直接写 `3 + \" 份\"` 会报 TypeError，因为[文字和数不能直接相加](repa:concept/py03.k1)。\n","example":{"id":"py03.k2.e0","body":"体积从表单里读进来，是文字 \"2.5\"。阅读程序。\n\n```python\nvolume_text = \"2.5\"\nvolume = float(volume_text)\nprint(volume + volume)\nprint(volume_text + volume_text)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"5.0"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？","key":"2.52.5"},{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"程序结束时，`volume_text` 是哪一类值？","options":[{"id":"float","content":"小数 float"},{"id":"str","content":"文字 str"},{"id":"int","content":"整数 int"}],"key":"str"}],"explanation":"第 2 行用文字 \"2.5\" 算出小数 2.5，赋给 `volume`；第一行显示 2.5 + 2.5 = **5.0**。`volume_text` 本身没有变，仍是文字，第二行把两段文字接起来，显示 **2.52.5**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py03.k2.q1","body":"下面五段程序各自单独运行。写出每段显示什么；如果程序报错停下，填 ERROR。\n\n**①**\n\n```python\nprint(int(\"12\") + 1)\n```\n\n**②**\n\n```python\nprint(float(\"3\"))\n```\n\n**③**\n\n```python\nprint(int(2.9))\n```\n\n**④**\n\n```python\nprint(int(\"2.5\"))\n```\n\n**⑤**\n\n```python\nprint(str(4) + \"0\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"p1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"① 显示","key":"13"},{"id":"p2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"② 显示","key":"3.0","feedback":[{"when":"3","message":"float 得到的是小数，显示时带 .0。"}]},{"id":"p3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"③ 显示","key":"2","feedback":[{"when":"3","message":"int 直接截掉小数部分，不四舍五入。"}]},{"id":"p4","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"④ 显示","key":"ERROR","feedback":[{"when":"2","message":"int 不认带小数点的文字，会报 ValueError；要先用 float。"}]},{"id":"p5","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"⑤ 显示","key":"40","feedback":[{"when":"4","message":"str(4) 是文字 \"4\"，和文字 \"0\" 接在一起。"}]}],"explanation":"① **13**：文字 \"12\" 转成整数后加 1。② **3.0**：float 得到小数。③ **2**：int 截掉小数部分，不四舍五入。④ **ERROR**：int 不认带小数点的文字，报 ValueError。⑤ **40**：str(4) 是文字 \"4\"，和 \"0\" 拼接成 \"40\"。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.q2","body":"菌落数从表格里读进来，是文字 \"38\"。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount_text = \"38\"\ncount = int(count_text)\ndouble = count * 2\nlabel = count_text * 2\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"double","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"执行完以后，`double` 是多少？","key":76},{"id":"label","type":"text","prompt":"执行完以后，`label` 的值是什么？（照 print 显示的样子写）","key":"3838","feedback":[{"when":"76","message":"第 4 行用的是 count_text，它仍是文字。"}]},{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行执行完以后，`count_text` 是哪一类值？","options":[{"id":"int","content":"整数 int"},{"id":"str","content":"文字 str"},{"id":"float","content":"小数 float"}],"key":"str"}],"explanation":"第 2 行用 `count_text` 的文字算出整数 38，赋给 `count`；`count_text` 本身不变，仍是文字。所以 `double` 是 38 × 2 = **76**，`label` 是文字 \"38\" 重复两次，即 **3838**。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.q3","body":"表单里读到的两次称重是文字，宿主已经提供了 `a = \"12.5\"` 和 `b = \"3\"`（单位都是克）。需求是：\n\n> 把两次称重按数值相加，结果存进 `total`，是一个小数。两次称重都可能带小数点，换一组读数时代码仍然要对。\n\n同事的代码在作答框里，它得到的 total 是文字 \"12.53\"。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"total = a + b\n","solution":"total = float(a) + float(b)\n","accepts":["first = float(a)\nsecond = float(b)\ntotal = first + second\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"total = float(a + b)","why":"先拼接成 \"12.53\" 再转换，得到的是 12.53"},{"code":"total = int(a) + int(b)","why":"int 不认带小数点的文字，会报 ValueError"},{"code":"total = float(a) + b","why":"只转换了 a，小数和文字相加会报 TypeError"},{"code":"total = 15.5","why":"写死了这一次的结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"本次读数","setup":"a = \"12.5\"\nb = \"3\"\n","expect":{"total":"15.5"}},{"name":"两次都带小数点","hidden":true,"setup":"a = \"0.25\"\nb = \"1.75\"\n","expect":{"total":"2.0"}},{"name":"两次都没有小数点","hidden":true,"setup":"a = \"4\"\nb = \"6\"\n","expect":{"total":"10.0"}}]}],"explanation":"两个读数都要先用 `float` 转成小数，再相加：\n\n```python\ntotal = float(a) + float(b)\n```\n\n`float(a + b)` 的顺序不对：括号里先把两段文字拼成 \"12.53\"，再转换就是 12.53。`int` 不认 \"12.5\" 这样带小数点的文字。判分时还会换几组读数运行你的代码。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.q4","body":"这段程序在哪个转换处停止？后面的 print 能执行吗？\n\n```python\ncount = int(\"7.0\")\nprint(count)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"value","content":"int 不能直接读取带小数点的文字，程序停止"},{"id":"seven","content":"自动去掉小数点，显示 7"},{"id":"text","content":"保留文字，显示 7.0"}],"key":"value"}],"explanation":"int 可以读取整数形式的文字，但 '7.0' 不是这种形式。这里会抛出 ValueError，print 不会运行；需要这条转换路径时可以先 float 再 int。"},{"id":"py03.k2.q5","body":"一段编号文字转成整数后再转回文字，能恢复前导零吗？分别填两个 print 的结果。\n\n```python\nprint(int(\"0042\"))\nprint(str(int(\"0042\")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"integer","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"42"},{"id":"string","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示（print 的内容，不加额外引号）","key":"42"}],"explanation":"int 把 '0042' 转成数值 42，前导零不再存在。随后 str 只能得到 '42'，不会把丢失的前导零找回来；print 这两个对象时都显示 42。"}],"review":[{"id":"py03.k2.r1","body":"两块平板的菌落数从表格里读进来，是文字：\n\n```python\nplate_a = \"38\"\nplate_b = \"41\"\n```\n\n要让 `total` 成为两块板的菌落总数，也就是整数 79，第三行应写哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"joined","content":"```python\ntotal = plate_a + plate_b\n```\n"},{"id":"late","content":"```python\ntotal = int(plate_a + plate_b)\n```\n"},{"id":"half","content":"```python\ntotal = int(plate_a) + plate_b\n```\n"},{"id":"both","content":"```python\ntotal = int(plate_a) + int(plate_b)\n```\n"}],"key":"both"}],"explanation":"两个值都先转成整数再相加：`int(plate_a) + int(plate_b)` 得到 79。直接相加得到文字 \"3841\"；`int(plate_a + plate_b)` 先拼接再转换，得到整数 3841；只转换一个，整数和文字相加会报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.r2","body":"一次实验用了多少分钟，从记录表里读进来是文字 \"95.8\"。\n\n```python startLine=1\nminutes_text = \"95.8\"\nminutes = float(minutes_text)\nwhole = int(minutes)\nprint(whole)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示哪个整数？","key":95,"feedback":[{"when":96,"message":"int 直接截掉小数部分，不四舍五入。"}]},{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"`minutes` 是哪一类值？","options":[{"id":"str","content":"文字 str"},{"id":"int","content":"整数 int"},{"id":"float","content":"小数 float"}],"key":"float"},{"id":"swap","type":"choice","prompt":"如果把第 2 行写成 `minutes = int(minutes_text)`，程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"show96","content":"显示 96"},{"id":"error","content":"报错停下（ValueError）"},{"id":"show95","content":"显示 95"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"显示 **95**：第 2 行把文字转成小数 95.8，第 3 行的 `int` 截掉小数部分，不是四舍五入。`minutes` 是**小数**。如果第 2 行直接写 `int(minutes_text)`，`int` 不认带小数点的文字，程序报 ValueError 停下。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.r3","body":"转整数会截去小数部分，而不是四舍五入；再转文字也不会恢复小数。\n\n```python\nprint(int(8.9))\nprint(repr(str(int(8.9))))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"8"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"'8'"}],"explanation":"int(8.9) 得到 8，外层 str 只把现有整数写成文字 '8'，并不保留之前的小数部分。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py03.k2.x1","body":"宿主提供了整数 `batch = 3`。需求是：\n\n> 生成批次标签存进 `label`：“批次”两个字后面直接接批次号，批次号为 3 时是 `批次3`。换一个批次号，代码仍然要对。\n\n作答框里的代码一运行就报 TypeError。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"label = \"批次\" + batch\n","solution":"label = \"批次\" + str(batch)\n","accepts":["number = str(batch)\nlabel = \"批次\" + number\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"label = \"批次\" + \"batch\"","why":"引号里的 batch 只是五个字母，不是名字 batch 的值"},{"code":"label = \"批次3\"","why":"写死了批次号"},{"code":"label = \"批次\" + int(batch)","why":"int 得到的仍是整数，文字和整数不能相加"},{"code":"label = str(\"批次\" + batch)","why":"括号里先算 \"批次\" + batch，仍然报错"}],"tests":[{"name":"批次 3","setup":"batch = 3","expect":{"label":"\"批次3\""}},{"name":"换一个批次号","hidden":true,"setup":"batch = 12","expect":{"label":"\"批次12\""}}]}],"explanation":"先用 `str` 把批次号转成文字，再和“批次”拼接：\n\n```python\nlabel = \"批次\" + str(batch)\n```\n\n`str(\"批次\" + batch)` 不行：括号里的文字加整数先就报错了。写成 `\"batch\"` 带引号，得到的是字母 batch，不是名字 batch 的值。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.x2","body":"下面哪些表达式算出的是整数 12？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"exprs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"as_float","content":"```python\nfloat(\"12\")\n```\n"},{"id":"cut","content":"```python\nint(12.7)\n```\n"},{"id":"joined","content":"```python\n\"1\" + \"2\"\n```\n"},{"id":"from_text","content":"```python\nint(\"12\")\n```\n"},{"id":"dotted","content":"```python\nint(\"12.7\")\n```\n"}],"key":["cut","from_text"]}],"explanation":"`int(\"12\")` 和 `int(12.7)` 都得到整数 12，后者截掉了小数部分。`float(\"12\")` 是小数 12.0；`\"1\" + \"2\"` 是文字 \"12\"；`int(\"12.7\")` 会报 ValueError，因为 int 不认带小数点的文字。\n"},{"id":"py03.k2.x3","body":"转换可以改变计算含义，但不会反向改变作为输入的文字对象。\n\n```python\ntext = \"09\"\nprint(int(text) + 1)\nprint(repr(text))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"10"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"'09'"}],"explanation":"int(text) 的返回值是 9，参与加法得到 10；text 没有重新赋值，仍保留带前导零的文字。"}]},{"id":"py03.k3","title":"None 表示没有值而不是零","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"None","aliases":["没有值","缺省值","空值"],"definition":"None 是 Python 里表示“这里没有值”的特殊值，用来记没测、没记或还没算出来的数据；它不是 0，也不是空文字 \"\"。","conditions":["0 是测到了零，\"\" 是一段空文字，None 是没有值，三者不能互相代替。","None 不能参与计算：None + 1 会报 TypeError。","str(None) 是四个字母的文字 \"None\"，并不是空的。"],"example":"```python\nplate_a = 0\nplate_b = None\nprint(plate_a + 5)\nprint(plate_b)\n```\n显示 5 和 None；再写 print(plate_b + 5) 会报 TypeError。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"记录数据时，“测到 0”和“没测”是两回事。数平板上的菌落：一块板一个菌落也没长，记 0；另一块板被污染了没有数，就不该记 0，否则算平均时会把结果拉低。Python 用一个专门的值 `None` 表示“这里没有值”：\n\n```python\nplate_a = 0      # 数过了，确实是 0 个\nplate_b = None   # 没有数，没有值\n```\n\n`None` 不加引号，首字母大写。它和另外两个“看起来像空”的值不同：\n\n| 值 | 类型 | 意思 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `0` | 整数 | 测到了零 |\n| `\"\"` | 文字 | 一段空文字，里面没有字 |\n| `None` | 特殊值 | 没有值 |\n\n`print(plate_b)` 会显示 None。`None` 不能参与计算：`plate_b + 1` 会报 TypeError，程序停下。这是好事：缺了数据时程序停下来提醒你，比悄悄当成 0、算出一个错的结果好。\n\n`str(None)` 得到的是四个字母的文字 \"None\"，不是空文字；把它拼进报告，报告里就会出现 None 这几个字母。\n","example":{"id":"py03.k3.e0","body":"两块平板：`plate_a` 数过了，一个菌落也没长；`plate_b` 被污染了，没有数。\n\n```python\nplate_a = 0\nplate_b = None\nprint(plate_a + 5)\nprint(plate_b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":5},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？","key":"None"},{"id":"extra","type":"choice","prompt":"如果在末尾再加一行 `print(plate_b + 5)`，会怎样？","options":[{"id":"none","content":"显示 None"},{"id":"five","content":"显示 5"},{"id":"error","content":"报错停下（TypeError）"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **5**：0 是一个真正的数，0 + 5 = 5。第二行显示 **None**：print 把“没有值”显示成 None。\n\n`None` 不能参与计算，`print(plate_b + 5)` 会报 TypeError。没数的板不会被悄悄当成 0 算进去。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py03.k3.q1","body":"下面四段程序各自单独运行。写出每段显示什么；如果程序报错停下，填 ERROR。\n\n**①**\n\n```python\nreading = None\nprint(reading)\n```\n\n**②**\n\n```python\nreading = None\nprint(reading + 1)\n```\n\n**③**\n\n```python\nreading = None\nnote = \"读数：\" + str(reading)\nprint(note)\n```\n\n**④**\n\n```python\nreading = 0\nprint(reading + 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"p1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"① 显示","key":"None","feedback":[{"when":"NOTHING","message":"print 会把 None 显示出来，显示的就是 None 这四个字母。"}]},{"id":"p2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"② 显示","key":"ERROR","feedback":[{"when":"1","message":"None 不是 0，不能参与加法。"}]},{"id":"p3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"③ 显示","key":"读数：None","feedback":[{"when":"读数：","message":"str(None) 是四个字母的文字 \"None\"，不是空文字。"}]},{"id":"p4","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"④ 显示","key":"1"}],"explanation":"① **None**。② **ERROR**：None 不能参与加法，报 TypeError。③ **读数：None**：str(None) 是文字 \"None\"，拼进了 note。④ **1**：0 是真正的数。\n"},{"id":"py03.k3.q2","body":"三份样本的菌落计数要录进程序，每份样本用一个名字记计数：\n\n- S1 的平板数过了，一个菌落也没长；\n- S2 的平板被污染了，没有数；\n- S3 还没到计数的时间。\n\n每份样本的计数应赋成哪个值？\n","slots":[{"id":"s1","type":"choice","prompt":"S1","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"`0`"},{"id":"none","content":"`None`"},{"id":"empty","content":"`\"\"`"}],"key":"zero"},{"id":"s2","type":"choice","prompt":"S2","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"`0`"},{"id":"none","content":"`None`"},{"id":"empty","content":"`\"\"`"}],"key":"none"},{"id":"s3","type":"choice","prompt":"S3","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"`0`"},{"id":"none","content":"`None`"},{"id":"empty","content":"`\"\"`"}],"key":"none"}],"explanation":"S1 数过了，结果就是 **0**。S2 和 S3 都没有计数，应记 **None**：它们不是零个菌落，而是没有值。`\"\"` 是一段空文字，不适合用来记一个计数。\n"},{"id":"py03.k3.q3","body":"三块平板，第二块没有数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nplate_1 = 12\nplate_2 = None\nplate_3 = 9\ntotal = plate_1 + plate_2 + plate_3\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？如果报错停下，填 ERROR。","key":"ERROR"},{"id":"zero","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"有人把第 2 行改成 `plate_2 = 0`，程序显示什么？","key":21},{"id":"meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"改成 0 以后显示的数，是三块板的菌落总数吗？","options":[{"id":"fake","content":"不是：第二块板没有数，这个数只是另外两块板的和"},{"id":"real","content":"是：没数的板按 0 算就行"}],"key":"fake"}],"explanation":"原程序在第 4 行报 TypeError（**ERROR**），因为 None 不能参与加法。改成 0 以后显示 **21**，但这只是第一、三块板的和：第二块板没有数，并不是零个菌落。程序报错其实是在提醒你缺了数据，不能用 0 把它掩盖掉。\n"},{"id":"py03.k3.q4","body":"三种值都可能出现在登记表里，但它们不是一回事。按 Python 显示内容填写每行结果。\n\n```python\nprint(type(None).__name__)\nprint(type(0).__name__)\nprint(type(\"None\").__name__)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"absent","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行","key":"NoneType"},{"id":"zero","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行","key":"int"},{"id":"word","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第三行","key":"str"}],"explanation":"None 是 NoneType 的特殊值，表示没有值；0 是整数；带引号的 'None' 只是四个字母组成的文字。"},{"id":"py03.k3.q5","body":"下面的调用表示“这次没有读数”。选择执行结果。\n\n```python\nreading = None\nprint(reading + 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"one","content":"显示 1，因为缺省值按 0 计算"},{"id":"nothing","content":"静默跳过 print"},{"id":"error","content":"加法不能把 None 当作数值，程序报错"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"None 没有自动变成 0 的规则，与整数相加会抛出 TypeError。缺测和测得零要保留为不同状态。"}],"review":[{"id":"py03.k3.r1","body":"下面哪些表达式会报错？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"errors","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"zero_add","content":"```python\n0 + 1\n```\n"},{"id":"none_add","content":"```python\nNone + 1\n```\n"},{"id":"text_none","content":"```python\nstr(None) + \"1\"\n```\n"},{"id":"none_mul","content":"```python\nNone * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"empty","content":"```python\n\"\" + \"1\"\n```\n"}],"key":["none_add","none_mul"]},{"id":"text","type":"text","prompt":"`str(None) + \"1\"` 算出的文字是什么？（照 print 显示的样子写）","key":"None1"}],"explanation":"`None + 1` 和 `None * 2` 会报 TypeError：None 不能参与计算。`0 + 1` 是 1；`\"\" + \"1\"` 是空文字接上 \"1\"，得到 \"1\"；`str(None)` 是文字 \"None\"，接上 \"1\" 得到 **None1**。\n"},{"id":"py03.k3.r2","body":"一段写温度记录的程序，第二次没有读到温度。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntemp_1 = 21.5\ntemp_2 = None\nnote = \"第二次读数：\" + str(temp_2)\nprint(note)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"第二次读数：None"},{"id":"swap","type":"choice","prompt":"如果第 3 行不用 str，写成 `note = \"第二次读数：\" + temp_2`，程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"blank","content":"显示“第二次读数：”，后面空着"},{"id":"error","content":"报错停下（TypeError）"},{"id":"same","content":"显示“第二次读数：None”"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"显示 **第二次读数：None**：`str(temp_2)` 把没有值变成了四个字母的文字 \"None\"。去掉 str，就是文字加 None，报 TypeError。如果报告里不想出现 None 字样，要另外说清楚缺失时写什么。\n"},{"id":"py03.k3.r3","body":"print 可以分别显示缺失值、零和文字 None。用 repr 的结果区分对象本身与文字。\n\n```python\nprint(repr(None))\nprint(repr(0))\nprint(repr(\"None\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"None"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"0"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"'None'"}],"explanation":"None 是无值标记，0 是整数，带引号的 'None' 是字符串。repr 保留能区分它们的显示形式。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py03.k3.x1","body":"```python\ncount_a = 0\ncount_b = None\nnote_a = \"\"\nnote_b = \"None\"\n```\n\n四行都执行完以后，每个名字指向哪一类值？\n","slots":[{"id":"kinds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"kind","header":"类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int","label":"整数 int"},{"id":"str","label":"文字 str"},{"id":"none","label":"None（没有值）"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"name":"count_a","kind":"int"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"name":"count_b","kind":"none"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"name":"note_a","kind":"str"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"name":"note_b","kind":"str"}}]},{"id":"shown","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"再执行 `print(note_b + \"!\")`，显示什么？如果报错停下，填 ERROR。","key":"None!"}],"explanation":"`count_a` 是整数 0；`count_b` 是 None，没有值；`note_a` 是一段空文字；`note_b` 带引号，是四个字母的文字 \"None\"，不是 None 本身。所以 `note_b + \"!\"` 是两段文字拼接，显示 **None!**，不会报错。\n"},{"id":"py03.k3.x2","body":"一台仪器每天测三次读数。某天仪器坏了，第 3 次读数没有测到。录入程序时，`reading_3` 应该写成哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"record","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"```python\nreading_3 = \"None\"\n```\n"},{"id":"b","content":"```python\nreading_3 = 0\n```\n"},{"id":"c","content":"```python\nreading_3 = None\n```\n"},{"id":"d","content":"```python\nreading_3 = \"\"\n```\n"}],"key":"c"}],"explanation":"写 `reading_3 = None`：没有测到，就是没有值。写 0 等于声称读数是零，平均时会拉低结果；`\"\"` 是一段空文字，`\"None\"` 是四个字母的文字，都不是“没有值”，拿去计算时也看不出是缺了数据。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py04","title":"读懂一次函数调用","summary":"读懂 名字(实参)：实参按位置或按名字交给函数，调用处换成返回值；后面还要用的结果要存进名字，print 只负责显示。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py03"],"intro":"前面学转换时，你已经写过 `int(\"12\")`、`str(7)` 这样的式子。这一节把这种写法看清楚：它叫**函数调用**，AI 写的代码里到处都会遇到它。\n\n程序仍然当作一段短脚本，从第一行往下运行，只有 `print` 才在屏幕上显示东西。\n","wrapup":"读一次调用，问三件事：调用的是哪个函数；交给它的实参是什么，按位置还是按名字；它交回的返回值去了哪里，是存进了名字、接着参与计算，还是只显示出来就没了。\n\n读 AI 写的代码时，后面要用的值如果只在 `print` 里出现过，多半就是没有存下来。\n","kps":[{"id":"py04.k1","title":"函数名、实参和返回结果","key":["py03"],"links":["py03.k2"],"card":{"name":"函数调用","aliases":["调用","实参","返回值"],"definition":"`名字(实参)` 把括号里的值交给这个函数，函数算出一个结果交回来，叫返回值；这次调用在式子里就换成返回值。","conditions":["括号里先算好再交给函数；调用套着调用时，从最里面一层往外算。","换成返回值以后，这一行照常往下算，例如 `abs(-4) + 1` 先得 4，再得 5。"],"example":"```python\nlow = min(12, 7, 9)\nhigh = max(12, 7, 9)\nspread = high - low\nprint(spread)\n```\n两次调用分别交回 7 和 12，spread 是 12 - 7 = 5，最后显示 5。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"`abs(-4)` 是一次**函数调用**：`abs` 是函数名，括号里的 `-4` 是交给函数的值，叫**实参**。函数算完交回一个值，叫**返回值**；`abs` 交回去掉负号以后的数，也就是 4。\n\n读到一次调用，就把它换成返回值，再接着读这一行：\n\n| 调用 | 返回值 | 做了什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `abs(-4)` | 4 | 绝对值 |\n| `max(3, 9, 5)` | 9 | 几个数里最大的 |\n| `min(3, 9, 5)` | 3 | 几个数里最小的 |\n| `len(\"sample\")` | 6 | 文字有几个字符 |\n| `round(3.14159, 2)` | 3.14 | 保留两位小数 |\n| `int(\"12\")` | 12 | 前面学过的[转换](repa:concept/py03.k2)，也是一次调用 |\n\n所以 `total = abs(-4) + 1` 先把 `abs(-4)` 换成 4，再算 4 + 1，`total` 指向 5。有几个实参时用逗号隔开。\n\n实参也可以是一个式子，或者另一次调用。Python 先把括号里算好，再交给函数：`max(2 + 5, 6)` 先算出 7，结果是 7；`abs(min(-3, 2))` 先算里面的 `min(-3, 2)` 得 -3，再算 `abs(-3)` 得 3。\n","example":{"id":"py04.k1.e0","body":"同一份样本测了三次，读数分别是 12、7、9。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python\nlow = min(12, 7, 9)\nhigh = max(12, 7, 9)\nspread = high - low\nprint(spread)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"low","type":"text","format":"integer","label":"low","prompt":"`low` 指向多少？","key":7},{"id":"high","type":"text","format":"integer","label":"high","prompt":"`high` 指向多少？","key":12},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序最后显示什么？","key":5}],"explanation":"`low` 是 **7**，`high` 是 **12**，最后显示 **5**。第 1 行的 `min(12, 7, 9)` 交回三个数里最小的 7，这一行就相当于 `low = 7`；第 2 行同理得到 12。第 3 行只是普通的减法，12 - 7 = 5。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py04.k1.q1","body":"```python\nprint(abs(3 - 8) + 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"显示什么？","key":6,"feedback":[{"when":-4,"message":"括号里的 3 - 8 得 -5，`abs` 交回的是去掉负号的 5，再加 1。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **6**。先算括号里的 `3 - 8` 得 -5；`abs(-5)` 交回 5；这次调用换成 5 以后，再算 5 + 1。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.q2","body":"```python\nsize = max(len(\"ctrl\"), len(\"drug_a\"))\n```\n\n这一行里一共有三次调用。按 Python 计算的先后，填写每次调用的返回值。\n","slots":[{"id":"calls","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"value","header":"返回值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"len(\"ctrl\")","value":4}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"len(\"drug_a\")","value":6}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"call":"max(4, 6)","value":6}}]}],"explanation":"先算 `max` 括号里的两个实参：`len(\"ctrl\")` 交回 **4**，`len(\"drug_a\")` 交回 **6**（下划线也算一个字符）。两个实参都算好了，才调用 `max(4, 6)`，交回 **6**，`size` 指向 6。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.q3","body":"```python\nreading = int(\"15\") + 5\n```\n\n逐项说出这一行里的调用。\n","slots":[{"id":"name","type":"choice","prompt":"调用的函数名是","options":[{"id":"reading","content":"`reading`"},{"id":"text","content":"`\"15\"`"},{"id":"int","content":"`int`"}],"key":"int"},{"id":"argument","type":"choice","prompt":"交给函数的实参是","options":[{"id":"text","content":"`\"15\"`，一段文字"},{"id":"five","content":"`5`"},{"id":"reading","content":"`reading`"}],"key":"text"},{"id":"returned","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这次调用的返回值","key":15},{"id":"reading","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行之后 `reading` 指向","key":20}],"explanation":"函数名是 **int**，实参是文字 **\"15\"**，返回值是整数 **15**；调用处换成 15 以后再加 5，`reading` 指向 **20**。`+ 5` 不在 `int` 的括号里，不是交给 `int` 的实参。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.q4","body":"这里只调用 Python 自带的函数：len 求文字长度，abs 求绝对值。填写两次调用的返回结果，不要把函数名本身当作结果。\n\n```python\nprint(len(\"ABCD\"))\nprint(abs(-7))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"length","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":4},{"id":"absolute","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":7}],"explanation":"len 收到文字 'ABCD'，返回长度 4；abs 收到 -7，返回绝对值 7。括号里的内容是实参，调用后得到的值才交给 print。"},{"id":"py04.k1.q5","body":"程序已经运行了前两行，最后一行还能调用 len 吗？\n\n```python\nsize = len(\"cat\")\nlen = 3\nprint(len(\"dog\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"callable","content":"能，函数名永远指向原来的函数"},{"id":"rebound","content":"不能，名字 len 现在指向整数 3"},{"id":"size","content":"能，调用会自动改用 size"}],"key":"rebound"}],"explanation":"第一行正常得到 3，但第二行把名字 len 重新绑定到整数。第三行试图调用整数，因而抛出 TypeError；Python 不会自动替换成另一个名字。"}],"review":[{"id":"py04.k1.r1","body":"样本编号是 `S_017`。哪一行让 `n` 指向这个编号有几个字符？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"bare","content":"```python\nn = len(S_017)\n```\n","feedback":"没有引号时，`S_017` 被当成一个名字，而这个名字没有赋过值。"},{"id":"length","content":"```python\nn = len(\"S_017\")\n```\n"},{"id":"copy","content":"```python\nn = \"S_017\"\n```\n","feedback":"这一行没有调用任何函数，`n` 指向的是编号本身。"},{"id":"convert","content":"```python\nn = int(\"S_017\")\n```\n","feedback":"`int` 把文字转成整数，`S_017` 不是一个整数的写法，会报错。"}],"key":"length"}],"explanation":"`n = len(\"S_017\")` 正确：`len` 交回文字的字符个数 5。去掉引号，`S_017` 就成了一个没有赋值的名字，会报错；`n = \"S_017\"` 没有调用，`n` 指向编号本身；`int(\"S_017\")` 也会报错，因为这段文字不是整数。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.r2","body":"上午 20 度，下午 26 度。下面先算温差，再取温差和两个参考值里最大的一个。\n\n```python startLine=1\ngap = abs(20 - 26)\nworst = max(gap, 4, 9)\nprint(worst * 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","prompt":"填写每行执行后 `gap` 与 `worst` 的值，还没有赋值的填“尚未定义”。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"gap","header":"gap","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"worst","header":"worst","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","gap":6,"worst":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","gap":6,"worst":9}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 3 行显示什么？","key":18}],"explanation":"第 1 行：`20 - 26` 得 -6，`abs` 交回 **6**。第 2 行：`max(6, 4, 9)` 交回三个数里最大的 **9**，不是第一个实参 6。第 3 行显示 9 × 2 = **18**。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.r3","body":"一次函数调用的结果又成为外层调用的实参。题目给定 len 求长度、str 把值转成文字。\n\n```python\nprint(len(str(1200)))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"4"}],"explanation":"内层 str 先把 1200 变成四个字符的文字 '1200'，外层 len 再收到这段文字并返回 4。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py04.k1.x1","body":"```python\nprint(max(abs(-7), 5) - min(4, 9))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"inner","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`abs(-7)` 交回","key":7},{"id":"largest","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`max(abs(-7), 5)` 交回","key":7},{"id":"smallest","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`min(4, 9)` 交回","key":4},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示","key":3}],"explanation":"从里往外算：`abs(-7)` 交回 **7**；于是 `max(7, 5)` 交回 **7**；`min(4, 9)` 交回 **4**；最后 7 - 4，显示 **3**。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.x2","body":"运行下面这一行之后，哪一句说法正确？\n\n```python\nsize = len(\"sample\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"shown","content":"屏幕上显示了 6","feedback":"赋值和调用都不会显示东西，要显示得用 print。"},{"id":"text","content":"`size` 指向文字 sample","feedback":"等号右边的调用先被换成返回值，`size` 指向的是返回值。"},{"id":"function","content":"`size` 指向 `len` 这个函数","feedback":"函数名后面有括号，就是调用了它；`size` 得到的是调用的结果。"},{"id":"correct","content":"`len` 交回 6，`size` 指向 6，屏幕上什么也不显示"}],"key":"correct"}],"explanation":"“`len` 交回 6，`size` 指向 6，屏幕上什么也不显示”这一句正确。`len(\"sample\")` 交回 sample 的字符个数 6，等号让 `size` 指向这个返回值；整行没有 `print`，所以什么也不显示。\n"},{"id":"py04.k1.x3","body":"已知 len 返回文字长度、abs 返回绝对值。内层调用的返回值继续交给外层调用。\n\n```python\nprint(abs(-len(\"alpha\")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"5"}],"explanation":"len 先返回 5，负号得到 -5，abs 再接收 -5 并返回 5，最后由 print 显示。"}]},{"id":"py04.k2","title":"位置参数与关键字参数","key":["py03"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"关键字参数","aliases":["位置参数","参数名","sep"],"definition":"实参可以按位置交给函数，第几个位置代表什么由函数规定；也可以写成 名字=值，指明交给哪一个参数，这叫关键字参数。","conditions":["位置调换，含义就变了：`round(2.468, 2)` 里的 2 是保留几位小数。","关键字参数写在位置参数后面；没写的参数用函数自带的缺省值，例如 print 的 sep 缺省是一个空格。"],"example":"```python\nprint(round(3.14159, 3))\nprint(round(3.14159, ndigits=1))\nprint(\"S1\", \"S2\", sep=\",\")\n```\n依次显示 3.142、3.1 和 S1,S2。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"`round(2.468, 2)` 交给 `round` 两个实参：第一个位置是要处理的数，第二个位置是保留几位小数，结果是 2.47。这样按先后位置交给函数的实参叫**位置参数**。每个位置代表什么由函数规定，调换了就是另一个意思：`round(2, 2.468)` 是要把 2 保留“2.468 位”小数，会报错。\n\n也可以写明交给哪一个参数：`round(2.468, ndigits=2)`。`ndigits` 是 `round` 第二个参数的名字（number of digits，位数）。这种 `名字=值` 的写法叫**关键字参数**，读代码的人不用记位置，也知道这个 2 是什么。\n\n没写的参数用函数自带的缺省值：`round(2.468)` 不给位数，就取整，结果是整数 2。\n\n`print` 可以一次显示几个值，它有个关键字参数 `sep`，规定这几个值之间放什么，缺省是一个空格：\n\n| 写法 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `print(\"A\", \"B\")` | A B |\n| `print(\"A\", \"B\", sep=\"-\")` | A-B |\n| `print(1, 2, sep=\"\")` | 12 |\n\n另一个关键字参数 `end` 规定显示完以后放什么，缺省是换行，所以每个 `print` 各占一行。\n\n关键字参数要写在位置参数的后面，`round(ndigits=2, 2.468)` 这种写法 Python 不接受。\n","example":{"id":"py04.k2.e0","body":"```python\nprint(round(3.14159, 3))\nprint(round(3.14159, ndigits=1))\nprint(\"S1\", \"S2\", sep=\",\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"3.142"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"3.1"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"S1,S2"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **3.142**、**3.1**、**S1,S2**。第一行按位置给出位数 3；第二行用关键字参数 `ndigits=1` 写明保留一位；第三行 `sep=\",\"` 让两个值之间放一个逗号，不再是缺省的空格。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py04.k2.q1","body":"```python\nprint(\"drug\", \"A\")\nprint(\"drug\", \"A\", sep=\"_\")\nprint(10, 20, 30, sep=\"\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"drug A"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"drug_A"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"102030","feedback":[{"when":"10 20 30","message":"`sep=\"\"` 让几个值之间什么也不放，连空格也没有。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **drug A**、**drug_A**、**102030**。没写 `sep` 时，几个值之间放一个空格；`sep=\"_\"` 放下划线；`sep=\"\"` 是一段空文字，值与值之间什么也不放。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.q2","body":"要让 `x` 指向 2.718 保留一位小数的结果 2.7。下面哪些写法能做到？选出所有能做到的。\n","slots":[{"id":"forms","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"positional","content":"```python\nx = round(2.718, 1)\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nx = round(1, 2.718)\n```\n","feedback":"第一个位置是要处理的数，第二个位置是位数；调换后会报错。"},{"id":"keyword","content":"```python\nx = round(2.718, ndigits=1)\n```\n"},{"id":"keyword_first","content":"```python\nx = round(ndigits=1, 2.718)\n```\n","feedback":"关键字参数要写在位置参数后面，这样写 Python 不接受。"},{"id":"no_digits","content":"```python\nx = round(2.718)\n```\n","feedback":"不给位数时 round 取整，得到 3。"}],"key":["positional","keyword"]}],"explanation":"`round(2.718, 1)` 和 `round(2.718, ndigits=1)` 都得到 2.7：一个按位置、一个按名字给出位数。`round(1, 2.718)` 把两个位置调换了，会报错；`round(ndigits=1, 2.718)` 把关键字参数写在了位置参数前面，Python 不接受；`round(2.718)` 没给位数，取整得 3。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.q3","body":"宿主准备了两个样本编号 `first` 和 `second`，都是文字。要把它们显示在一行里，中间只放一个逗号、没有空格，例如编号是 S_01 和 S_02 时显示 `S_01,S_02`。\n\n作答框里的代码中间放的是空格。请改好它；换了编号也要照这个格式显示。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"print(first, second)\n","solution":"print(first, second, sep=\",\")\n","accepts":["print(first + \",\" + second)"],"rejects":[{"code":"print(first, \",\", second)","why":"逗号成了第三个值，前后仍各有一个空格"},{"code":"print(first, second, sep=\", \")","why":"逗号后面多了一个空格"},{"code":"print(\"S_01,S_02\")","why":"把这一次的编号写死了"},{"code":"print(first, second, end=\",\")","why":"end 管的是显示完以后放什么，两个值之间仍是空格"}],"tests":[{"name":"编号 S_01 和 S_02","setup":"first = \"S_01\"\nsecond = \"S_02\"\n","stdout":"S_01,S_02"},{"name":"换一组编号","hidden":true,"setup":"first = \"C_7\"\nsecond = \"D_12\"\n","stdout":"C_7,D_12"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nprint(first, second, sep=\",\")\n```\n\n加上关键字参数 `sep=\",\"`，两个值之间就放逗号而不是空格。写成 `print(first + \",\" + second)` 先把三段文字接成一段再显示，也对。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.q4","body":"sep 决定各实参之间插入什么，end 决定本次显示怎样收尾。写出屏幕上的两行内容。\n\n```python\nprint(\"A\", \"B\", sep=\":\", end=\"!\")\nprint(\"C\")\nprint(\"D\", \"E\", sep=\"-\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行（不要写换行符）","key":"A:B!C"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行","key":"D-E"}],"explanation":"第一次显示用冒号分隔 A、B，以感叹号而非换行结束，所以 C 紧接在后面；下一次才显示独立一行 D-E。"},{"id":"py04.k2.q5","body":"哪个调用把“先按位置给出的 a、b”用斜线分隔，并在末尾追加句号？\n","slots":[{"id":"call","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"reversed","content":"`print(\"a\", \"b\", sep=\".\", end=\"/\")`"},{"id":"literal","content":"`print(\"a\", \"b\", \"/\", \".\")`"},{"id":"keywords","content":"`print(\"a\", \"b\", sep=\"/\", end=\".\")`"}],"key":"keywords"}],"explanation":"sep 和 end 是不同的关键字参数；把标点写成另外两个位置实参，只会显示更多项目，不会改变分隔和收尾规则。"}],"review":[{"id":"py04.k2.r1","body":"一次量得 5.678 毫升。如果把下面每个式子交给 `print`，各显示什么？会报错的填 ERROR。\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expression","header":"式子"},{"id":"display","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"two","cells":{"expression":"round(5.678, 2)","display":"5.68"}},{"id":"keyword","cells":{"expression":"round(5.678, ndigits=1)","display":"5.7"}},{"id":"none","cells":{"expression":"round(5.678)","display":"6"}},{"id":"swapped","cells":{"expression":"round(2, 5.678)","display":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **5.68**、**5.7**、**6**、**ERROR**。按位置给出 2，保留两位；`ndigits=1` 写明保留一位；不给位数就取整成 6；把两个实参调换以后，位数成了 5.678，不是整数，会报错。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.r2","body":"三个孔的读数是 12、15、9。要显示成用短横线连起来的一行：`12-15-9`。哪一行做到了？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"sep","content":"```python\nprint(12, 15, 9, sep=\"-\")\n```\n"},{"id":"extra","content":"```python\nprint(12, 15, 9, \"-\")\n```\n","feedback":"短横线成了第四个值，显示为 12 15 9 -。"},{"id":"minus","content":"```python\nprint(12-15-9)\n```\n","feedback":"没有引号的短横线是减号，这一行显示的是 12 - 15 - 9 的结果。"},{"id":"front","content":"```python\nprint(\"-\", 12, 15, 9)\n```\n","feedback":"短横线成了第一个值，值与值之间仍是空格。"}],"key":"sep"}],"explanation":"`print(12, 15, 9, sep=\"-\")` 正确：`sep` 规定值与值之间放短横线。把 `\"-\"` 写成普通的位置参数，它只是又一个要显示的值；不加引号的 `12-15-9` 是减法，显示 -12。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.r3","body":"sep 与 end 都不会额外成为一个显示项目。填写这一整行，保留标点。\n\n```python\nprint(\"red\", \"blue\", sep=\"/\", end=\";\")\nprint(\"done\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"red/blue;done"}],"explanation":"第一条 print 用 / 分隔两个位置实参，并以分号收尾而不换行；done 紧接在同一行。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py04.k2.x1","body":"宿主准备了 `value`（一个测量值）和 `digits`（要保留的小数位数）。同事的代码把两个实参的位置写反了，一运行就报错。改好它，让 `rounded` 指向把 `value` 保留 `digits` 位小数的结果；换了 `value` 或 `digits` 也要照样工作。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"rounded = round(digits, value)\n","solution":"rounded = round(value, digits)\n","accepts":["rounded = round(value, ndigits=digits)"],"rejects":[{"code":"rounded = round(value)","why":"没有给位数，round 取整"},{"code":"rounded = round(value, 2)","why":"把位数写死成 2"},{"code":"rounded = round(value, digits=digits)","why":"round 的第二个参数叫 ndigits，不叫 digits"}],"tests":[{"name":"保留两位","setup":"value = 3.14159\ndigits = 2\n","expect":{"rounded":"3.14"}},{"name":"保留一位","hidden":true,"setup":"value = 12.3456\ndigits = 1\n","expect":{"rounded":"12.3"}},{"name":"保留三位","hidden":true,"setup":"value = 0.4567\ndigits = 3\n","expect":{"rounded":"0.457"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nrounded = round(value, digits)\n```\n\n第一个位置放要处理的数，第二个位置放位数。写成 `round(value, ndigits=digits)` 也对；关键字参数的名字要写 round 自己规定的 `ndigits`，写成 `digits=` 会报错。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.x2","body":"```python\nprint(round(8.765, 1), \"mL\", sep=\"\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"显示什么？","key":"8.8mL"},{"id":"keywords","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"prompt":"这一行里，哪些是关键字参数？选出所有的。","options":[{"id":"digits","content":"`1`"},{"id":"sep","content":"`sep=\"\"`"},{"id":"unit","content":"`\"mL\"`"},{"id":"number","content":"`8.765`"}],"key":["sep"]}],"explanation":"显示 **8.8mL**。`round(8.765, 1)` 交回 8.8，它和 `\"mL\"` 是交给 `print` 的两个位置参数；`sep=\"\"` 是唯一的关键字参数，让两个值之间什么也不放。`8.765` 和 `1` 是按位置交给 `round` 的。\n"},{"id":"py04.k2.x3","body":"只有一个位置实参时，sep 没有插入位置，但 end 仍起作用。填写最终整行。\n\n```python\nprint(\"one\", sep=\"/\", end=\":\")\nprint(\"two\", \"three\", sep=\"+\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"one:two+three"}],"explanation":"第一条只有一个项目，所以不会插入 /；它以冒号收尾，后面的 two+three 接在同一行。"}]},{"id":"py04.k3","title":"把返回结果交给下一步而不是只显示","key":["py01","py03"],"links":["py03.k3"],"card":{"name":"接住返回值","aliases":["保存结果","print 的返回值"],"definition":"调用交回的值，要存进一个名字或直接放进下一步的式子，后面才用得上；单独一行的调用既不显示也不保存，print 只负责显示，交回的是 None。","conditions":["单独一行 `round(x, 1)` 不会改变 x；要保留，写 `x = round(x, 1)` 或存进新名字。","`result = print(5)` 会显示 5，但 result 指向 None，之后拿它计算会报错。"],"example":"```python\ndose = 2.468\nround(dose, 1)\nprint(dose)\ndose = round(dose, 1)\nprint(dose)\n```\n第 2 行算出 2.5 却没有存下，第一次显示 2.468；第 4 行把结果存回 dose，第二次显示 2.5。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"一次调用交回返回值以后，这个值去了哪里，要看调用写在哪里：\n\n```python startLine=1\nvalue = 2.468\nround(value, 1)\nrounded = round(value, 1)\nprint(round(value, 1))\n```\n\n- 第 2 行：算出了 2.5，但没有存进任何名字，也不显示，随即丢掉。它**不会**把 `value` 改成 2.5，`value` 仍是 2.468。\n- 第 3 行：返回值存进 `rounded`，后面的代码可以接着用。\n- 第 4 行：返回值交给 `print` 显示在屏幕上；显示完同样没有存下来。\n\n`print` 是把值显示出来，它自己交回的是 [None](repa:concept/py03.k3)。所以 `result = print(5)` 会显示 5，但之后 `result` 是 None，`result + 1` 会报错。\n\nAI 写的代码里常见这种情况：上一步只用 `print` 显示了一个结果，下一步却想用它。看到后面要用的值，先找它有没有被存进名字。\n","example":{"id":"py04.k3.e0","body":"```python startLine=1\ndose = 2.468\nround(dose, 1)\nprint(dose)\ndose = round(dose, 1)\nprint(dose)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一次显示什么？","key":"2.468"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二次显示什么？","key":"2.5"},{"id":"line2","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行做了什么？","options":[{"id":"lost","content":"算出 2.5，但没有存下也没有显示，dose 不变"},{"id":"changed","content":"把 dose 改成了 2.5"},{"id":"shown","content":"在屏幕上显示了 2.5"}],"key":"lost"}],"explanation":"第一次显示 **2.468**，第二次显示 **2.5**。第 2 行的 `round(dose, 1)` 算出了 2.5，可是它单独一行，既没有存进名字，也没有交给 `print`，算完就丢了，`dose` 仍是 2.468。第 4 行把同样的返回值存回 `dose`，之后 `dose` 才是 2.5。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py04.k3.q1","body":"逐行写出：运行到这一行时，屏幕上新显示了什么。这一行什么也不显示，就填 NOTHING。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12.34\nround(signal, 1)\nprint(round(signal, 1))\nprint(signal)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"运行到"},{"id":"display","header":"这一行显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","display":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","display":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","display":"12.3"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","display":"12.34"}}]}],"explanation":"第 1、2 行都显示 **NOTHING**：赋值不显示；第 2 行的调用算出了 12.3，但单独一行，不显示也不保存。第 3 行把返回值交给 `print`，显示 **12.3**。第 4 行显示的是 `signal` 本身，它一直没变，仍是 **12.34**。\n"},{"id":"py04.k3.q2","body":"`signal` 是 12.34。下一步要用它保留一位小数以后的值，再乘 2。下面四段代码之后都接着一行 `print(doubled)`。哪一段会显示 24.6？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"discarded","content":"```python\nround(signal, 1)\ndoubled = signal * 2\n```\n","feedback":"第一行的结果没有存下，第二行用的还是 12.34。"},{"id":"stored","content":"```python\nrounded = round(signal, 1)\ndoubled = rounded * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"printed","content":"```python\nrounded = print(round(signal, 1))\ndoubled = rounded * 2\n```\n","feedback":"print 只负责显示，rounded 拿到的是 None，第二行会报错。"},{"id":"late","content":"```python\ndoubled = round(signal * 2, 1)\n```\n","feedback":"这是先乘 2 再保留一位：24.68 保留一位得 24.7。"}],"key":"stored"}],"explanation":"先把返回值存进 `rounded`、再拿 `rounded` 乘 2 的那一段显示 **24.6**。单独一行的 `round(signal, 1)` 算完就丢了；`print` 交回 None，拿 None 乘 2 会报错；先乘 2 再保留一位，顺序反了，得到 24.7。\n"},{"id":"py04.k3.q3","body":"宿主准备了 `minutes`，是一次实验用的分钟数。后面的步骤要用换算成小时、保留两位小数的值，所以要求：\n\n> 把结果存进 `hours`，再显示 `hours`。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里：它把结果显示出来了，`hours` 却拿不到这个值。请改好它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"hours = print(round(minutes / 60, 2))\n","solution":"hours = round(minutes / 60, 2)\nprint(hours)\n","accepts":["hours = round(minutes / 60, ndigits=2)\nprint(hours)\n","hours = minutes / 60\nhours = round(hours, 2)\nprint(hours)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"round(minutes / 60, 2)\nprint(hours)\n","why":"调用的结果没有存下，hours 没有赋值"},{"code":"hours = minutes / 60\nprint(round(hours, 2))\n","why":"只在显示时保留两位，hours 本身没有保留两位"},{"code":"hours = round(minutes / 60, 2)","why":"存下了，但没有显示"},{"code":"hours = round(minutes / 60)\nprint(hours)\n","why":"没有给位数，取成了整数"},{"code":"hours = 2.25\nprint(hours)\n","why":"把这一次的结果写死了"}],"tests":[{"name":"135 分钟","setup":"minutes = 135","expect":{"hours":"2.25"},"stdout":"2.25"},{"name":"除不尽的分钟数","hidden":true,"setup":"minutes = 50","expect":{"hours":"0.83"},"stdout":"0.83"},{"name":"再换一个","hidden":true,"setup":"minutes = 200","expect":{"hours":"3.33"},"stdout":"3.33"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nhours = round(minutes / 60, 2)\nprint(hours)\n```\n\n先把返回值存进 `hours`，再把 `hours` 交给 `print`。原来的写法里，`round` 的结果交给了 `print`，`hours` 得到的是 `print` 交回的 None。只在 `print` 里保留两位也不够：显示的是两位小数，`hours` 本身仍是 0.8333… 这样的长小数，后面的步骤拿到的不是要求的值。\n"},{"id":"py04.k3.q4","body":"print 自己也有返回值。两次显示分别是什么？\n\n```python\nsaved = print(\"ready\")\nprint(saved)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"message","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行","key":"ready"},{"id":"returned","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"None"}],"explanation":"内层 print 先显示 ready，但它返回 None，因此 saved 保存的是 None，不是刚显示的文字。第二行把这个返回值显示出来。"},{"id":"py04.k3.q5","body":"下一步需要用整数做加法。哪种写法把转换的返回值保存下来，而不是只显示一下就丢掉？\n","slots":[{"id":"pipeline","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"display","content":"先 `print(int(\"12\"))`，再 `result = \"12\" + 1`"},{"id":"save","content":"先 `number = int(\"12\")`，再 `result = number + 1`"},{"id":"returned","content":"先 `number = print(int(\"12\"))`，再 `result = number + 1`"}],"key":"save"}],"explanation":"int 的返回值要交给 number，后面的加法才能使用它。仅显示转换结果不会改变原文字；把 print 的返回值交给 number 则得到 None。"}],"review":[{"id":"py04.k3.r1","body":"本意是先把体积保留两位小数，再乘 2。程序却显示 4.912。\n\n```python startLine=1\nvolume_ml = 2.456\nround(volume_ml, 2)\ntotal_ml = volume_ml * 2\nprint(total_ml)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪一行？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"}],"key":"l2"},{"id":"fixed","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"把这一行改成 `volume_ml = round(volume_ml, 2)` 以后，程序显示什么？","key":"4.92"}],"explanation":"问题在**第 2 行**：`round` 算出了 2.46，但结果没有存下，第 3 行用的仍是 2.456，所以显示 4.912。改成 `volume_ml = round(volume_ml, 2)` 以后，`volume_ml` 指向 2.46，显示 **4.92**。\n"},{"id":"py04.k3.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\ntotal = 4 + 5\nshown = print(total)\nprint(shown)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"屏幕上第一行显示什么？","key":"9"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"屏幕上第二行显示什么？","key":"None","feedback":[{"when":"9","message":"第 2 行的 print 显示了 9，但它交回的不是 9；shown 存下的是 print 的返回值。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **9**：第 2 行的 `print(total)` 把 9 显示出来。第二行显示 **None**：`print` 交回的是 None，`shown` 存下的就是它，第 3 行把它显示出来。\n"},{"id":"py04.k3.r3","body":"显示返回值不会改变原文字。这里计算后还要真正把返回值交给下一步。\n\n```python\ntext = \"8\"\nnumber = int(text)\nprint(number + 2)\nprint(repr(text))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"10"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"'8'"}],"explanation":"int 的结果保存在 number，后续加法用的是它；原来的 text 仍指向文字 '8'。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py04.k3.x1","body":"按运行顺序填写每行执行后 `value` 与 `result` 的值。还没有赋值的填“尚未定义”，没有值的写 None。\n\n```python startLine=1\nvalue = abs(-2.4)\nround(value)\nresult = print(value)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"value","header":"value","input":{"type":"text","quick":["尚未定义","None"]}},{"id":"result","header":"result","input":{"type":"text","quick":["尚未定义","None"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","value":"2.4","result":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","value":"2.4","result":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":"2.4","result":"None"}}]}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | value | result |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第 1 行 | 2.4 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | 2.4 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 3 行 | 2.4 | None |\n\n第 2 行的 `round(value)` 算出 2，但没有存下，`value` 不变。第 3 行显示 2.4，`print` 交回 None，`result` 指向 None。\n"},{"id":"py04.k3.x2","body":"下面这段 AI 写的代码运行到某一行报错停下了。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntotal_ml = 12.5 + 7.5\nprint(total_ml)\naverage_ml = print(total_ml / 2)\ncheck_ml = average_ml * 2\nprint(check_ml)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"在哪一行报错？","options":[{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l5","content":"第 5 行"}],"key":"l4"},{"id":"average","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"报错时，`average_ml` 指向什么？（像 print 那样写出它的显示）","key":"None"}],"explanation":"在**第 4 行**报错。第 3 行显示了 10.0，可是 `average_ml` 存下的是 `print` 交回的 **None**；第 4 行拿 None 乘 2，就报错了。要接着用平均值，第 3 行应写成 `average_ml = total_ml / 2`，需要看结果时再另写一行 `print(average_ml)`。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py05","title":"清理一段文字","summary":"读懂 strip、lower、replace 这类点号方法：它们得到新文字、不改原来的名字；调用链从左往右，每一步接着上一步的结果。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py04","py03"],"intro":"实验记录里的样本标签和组名常常写得不统一：两端多了空格，大小写不一致，连字符和空格混用。这一节读懂清理文字的三个常用工具 `strip`、`lower`、`replace`：每一步得到什么，原来的名字有没有变。\n\n有些题要你写出一段文字的值。这时照 Python 的写法加上引号，例如 `'drug_a'`；引号之间的空格也是文字的一部分，要照实写。用 `print` 显示出来的结果不带引号，照屏幕上的样子写。\n","wrapup":"清理文字时记住三件事：方法得到的是一段新文字，要赋给名字才留得住；`strip` 只管两端，`lower` 只管字母，`replace` 换掉每一处并且区分大小写；调用链从左往右，每一步接着上一步的结果。\n\n读 AI 写的清理代码时，可以把一长串调用拆开，逐步写下得到的文字，再和你想要的结果对一对。\n","kps":[{"id":"py05.k1","title":"字符串不可原位改写","key":["py04","py01"],"links":["py03.k1","py04.k1","py04.k3"],"card":{"name":"方法得到新文字","aliases":["字符串不可变","方法调用"],"definition":"`label.strip()` 这类方法不会改动原来的文字，而是另外得到一段新文字；不把结果赋给名字，它就丢掉了。","conditions":["`label.strip()` 单独一行时，`label` 不变，算出的结果也没有留下。","要保留结果，写 `label = label.strip()`，或存进新名字，如 `clean = label.strip()`。"],"example":"```python\nlabel = \" Drug A \"\nclean = label.strip()\nlabel.upper()\nlabel = label.strip()\n```\n第 2 行让 clean 指向 'Drug A'，label 不变；第 3 行算出的大写文字没有赋给任何名字，丢掉了；第 4 行之后 label 才变成 'Drug A'。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"实验记录里的标签常带多余的空格，比如 `\" Drug A \"`。Python 的[文字（str）](repa:concept/py03.k1)带着一组清理用的工具，写在文字后面，用点号接上：\n\n```python\nclean = label.strip()\n```\n\n`label.strip()` 叫**方法调用**：点号前是要处理的文字，点号后是方法名和括号。它和[函数调用](repa:concept/py04.k1)一样会算出一个结果：`strip()` 得到去掉两端空格的文字，`lower()` 得到字母全变小写的文字，`upper()` 得到字母全变大写的文字。\n\n要紧的是：这些方法**不改动原来的文字**，而是另外得到一段新文字，原来的名字仍然指向旧的那一段。\n\n| 执行到 | label | clean |\n|---|---|---|\n| `label = \"  Ctrl \"` | `'  Ctrl '` | 尚未定义 |\n| `label.lower()` | `'  Ctrl '` | 尚未定义 |\n| `clean = label.strip()` | `'  Ctrl '` | `'Ctrl'` |\n| `label = label.strip()` | `'Ctrl'` | `'Ctrl'` |\n\n第 2 行算出了 `'  ctrl '`，却没有交给任何名字，结果就丢了，和[返回结果没有接住](repa:concept/py04.k3)一样。要保留结果，就把它赋给名字：存进新名字 `clean`，或者写 `label = label.strip()`，先算右边得到新文字，再让 `label` 改为指向它。\n\n表里文字的值都带着引号：引号之间的内容就是这段文字，两端的空格也算在内。\n","example":{"id":"py05.k1.e0","body":"一个样本的组名录成了 `\" Drug A \"`，两端各多了一个空格。按运行顺序填写每行执行后 `label` 和 `clean` 的值，写成带引号的形式，例如 `'Drug A'`，引号里的空格照实写。\n\n```python startLine=1\nlabel = \" Drug A \"\nclean = label.strip()\nlabel.upper()\nlabel = label.strip()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","label":"状态表","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"label","header":"label","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}},{"id":"clean","header":"clean","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","label":"' Drug A '","clean":{"value":"尚未定义"}}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","label":"' Drug A '","clean":"'Drug A'"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","label":"' Drug A '","clean":"'Drug A'"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","label":"'Drug A'","clean":"'Drug A'"}}]},{"id":"kept","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行算出的 `' DRUG A '` 存到了哪里？","options":[{"id":"label","content":"存进了 `label`，label 变成大写"},{"id":"nowhere","content":"没有赋给任何名字，丢掉了"},{"id":"clean","content":"存进了 `clean`"}],"key":"nowhere"}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | label | clean |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第 1 行 | `' Drug A '` | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | `' Drug A '` | `'Drug A'` |\n| 第 3 行 | `' Drug A '` | `'Drug A'` |\n| 第 4 行 | `'Drug A'` | `'Drug A'` |\n\n第 2 行的 `strip()` 得到一段新文字 `'Drug A'`，交给了 `clean`，`label` 没有变。第 3 行算出了 `' DRUG A '`，但这一行没有等号，结果**没有赋给任何名字，丢掉了**。直到第 4 行写成 `label = label.strip()`，`label` 才改为指向去掉空格的新文字。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py05.k1.q1","body":"```python\ncode = \"ctrl-01\"\ncode.upper()\nprint(code)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"ctrl-01","feedback":[{"when":"CTRL-01","message":"第 2 行算出了大写的文字，但没有赋给任何名字；`code` 还是原来的文字。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **ctrl-01**。第 2 行的 `code.upper()` 得到一段新文字 `'CTRL-01'`，但这一行没有把它赋给任何名字，结果丢掉了；`code` 仍然指向原来的 `'ctrl-01'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.q2","body":"哪一段程序运行完以后，`label` 本身指向 `'drug a'`？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"alone","content":"```python\nlabel = \"Drug A\"\nlabel.lower()\n```\n","feedback":"`label.lower()` 单独一行，算出的结果没有留下。"},{"id":"other","content":"```python\nlabel = \"Drug A\"\nsmall = label.lower()\n```\n","feedback":"小写的文字存进了 `small`，`label` 没有变。"},{"id":"assigned","content":"```python\nlabel = \"Drug A\"\nlabel = label.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"shown","content":"```python\nlabel = \"Drug A\"\nprint(label.lower())\n```\n","feedback":"print 只把结果显示出来，`label` 没有变。"}],"key":"assigned"}],"explanation":"写成 `label = label.lower()` 的那一段：先算右边得到 `'drug a'`，再让 `label` 改为指向它。另外三段里，`'drug a'` 要么没有留下，要么存进了别的名字，要么只是显示了一次，`label` 都还是 `'Drug A'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.q3","body":"宿主已经给 `label` 赋了一个样本标签，例如 `'  S_07 '`。后面的代码都直接用 `label`，所以需要 `label` **本身**变成去掉两端空格的文字。作答框里的代码没有做到，请改好它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"label.strip()\n","solution":"label = label.strip()\n","rejects":[{"code":"clean = label.strip()","why":"结果存进了新名字，label 本身没有变"},{"code":"print(label.strip())","why":"只显示了一次结果，label 没有变"},{"code":"label = \"S_07\"","why":"照着例子写死了一个标签"},{"code":"label = label.replace(\" \", \"\")","why":"把中间的空格也删掉了"}],"tests":[{"name":"两端有空格的标签","setup":"label = \"  S_07 \"","expect":{"label":"\"S_07\""}},{"name":"另一个标签","hidden":true,"setup":"label = \" ctrl-02  \"","expect":{"label":"\"ctrl-02\""}},{"name":"中间也有空格的标签","hidden":true,"setup":"label = \" Drug A \"","expect":{"label":"\"Drug A\""}},{"name":"本来就没有多余空格","hidden":true,"setup":"label = \"S_10\"","expect":{"label":"\"S_10\""}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nlabel = label.strip()\n```\n\n`label.strip()` 单独一行时，算出的新文字没有留下。写成赋值，先算右边，再让 `label` 改为指向新文字。存进 `clean` 这样的新名字，`label` 本身仍然不变，后面用 `label` 的代码拿到的还是带空格的标签。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.q4","body":"门牌号只需改第一个字母。下面程序会改变原字符串吗？\n\n```python\nroom = \"a12\"\nroom[0] = \"A\"\nprint(room)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"effect","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"changed","content":"原字符串变成 A12"},{"id":"ignored","content":"修改被忽略，显示 a12"},{"id":"immutable","content":"字符串不能这样原位修改，执行会报错"}],"key":"immutable"}],"explanation":"str 的单个位置不能通过下标赋值改写，这一行会抛出 TypeError。需要构造新字符串并重新赋值，而不是修改旧字符串内部。"},{"id":"py05.k1.q5","body":"这里重新给 room 起名，而不是在旧字符串内部改字母。两个名字最后各是什么？\n\n```python\nroom = \"a12\"\noriginal = room\nroom = \"A12\"\nprint(original)\nprint(room)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"original","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"a12"},{"id":"room","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"A12"}],"explanation":"original 保留原来的 'a12'；最后一次赋值只让 room 指向新的 'A12'。重新绑定名字与修改字符串本身是两件不同的事。"}],"review":[{"id":"py05.k1.r1","body":"按运行顺序填写第 2–4 行执行后 `site` 和 `title` 的值，写成带引号的形式，例如 `'North Slope'`。第 1 行执行后，`site` 是 `'North Slope'`。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsite = \"North Slope\"\ntitle = site.upper()\nsite.lower()\nsite = title\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"site","header":"site","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}},{"id":"title","header":"title","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","site":"'North Slope'","title":"'NORTH SLOPE'"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","site":"'North Slope'","title":"'NORTH SLOPE'"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","site":"'NORTH SLOPE'","title":"'NORTH SLOPE'"}}]}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | site | title |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第 2 行 | `'North Slope'` | `'NORTH SLOPE'` |\n| 第 3 行 | `'North Slope'` | `'NORTH SLOPE'` |\n| 第 4 行 | `'NORTH SLOPE'` | `'NORTH SLOPE'` |\n\n第 2 行的大写结果交给了 `title`，`site` 不变。第 3 行算出的 `'north slope'` 没有赋给任何名字，什么也没改。第 4 行让 `site` 指向 `title` 的值，`site` 这才变成大写。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.r2","body":"同事想让 `sample_id` 去掉两端的空格，用方括号把它包起来打印，应当显示 `[S-12]`。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsample_id = \" S-12 \"\nsample_id.strip()\nprint(\"[\" + sample_id + \"]\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"这段程序实际显示什么？方括号里的空格照实写。","key":"[ S-12 ]"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"把第 2 行换成哪一行，就会显示 `[S-12]`？","options":[{"id":"shown","content":"```python\nprint(sample_id.strip())\n```\n"},{"id":"assigned","content":"```python\nsample_id = sample_id.strip()\n```\n"},{"id":"other","content":"```python\nclean = sample_id.strip()\n```\n"}],"key":"assigned"}],"explanation":"实际显示 **[ S-12 ]**，两端的空格还在：第 2 行算出的新文字没有赋给任何名字，`sample_id` 没有变。\n\n改成 `sample_id = sample_id.strip()` 才会显示 `[S-12]`。只 print 一次，会多显示一行 `S-12`，第 3 行照样带空格；存进 `clean`，第 3 行用的 `sample_id` 也还是旧的。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.r3","body":"调用字符串方法返回新值，但不接收这个返回值时，原名字保持原样。\n\n```python\nlabel = \"small\"\nlabel.replace(\"s\", \"S\")\nprint(repr(label))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"'small'"}],"explanation":"replace 产生了新字符串，但这里没有保存它。原 label 仍是 'small'；方法并没有原位改写字符串。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py05.k1.x1","body":"```python\nunit = \"mL\"\nunit.lower()\nsmall = unit.lower()\nprint(unit + \" / \" + small)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"mL / ml","feedback":[{"when":"ml / ml","message":"第 2 行的结果没有留下，`unit` 还是 `'mL'`；只有 `small` 指向小写的文字。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **mL / ml**。第 2 行算出的 `'ml'` 没有赋给任何名字；第 3 行把它存进了 `small`。两次 `lower()` 都没有改动 `unit`，所以拼起来是原来的 `mL` 加上小写的 `ml`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.x2","body":"`label` 开始时是 `'Ctrl 01'`。下面每一行都单独接在 `label = \"Ctrl 01\"` 后面运行。哪几行运行之后，`label` 指向的文字变了？选出所有。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"options":[{"id":"a","content":"```python\nlabel.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"b","content":"```python\nlabel = label.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"c","content":"```python\nclean = label.upper()\n```\n"},{"id":"d","content":"```python\nlabel = label.upper()\n```\n"},{"id":"e","content":"```python\nprint(label.lower())\n```\n"}],"key":["b","d"]}],"explanation":"只有 `label = label.lower()` 和 `label = label.upper()` 两行：等号左边是 `label`，它才改为指向新文字。单独一行的 `label.lower()` 把结果丢掉了；`clean = label.upper()` 把结果交给了 `clean`；`print(...)` 只显示一次。这三行之后 `label` 都还是 `'Ctrl 01'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k1.x3","body":"即使方法成功返回了新字符串，也只有明确赋值的名字会接收它。\n\n```python\nlabel = \"fixed\"\nchanged = label.replace(\"f\", \"F\")\nprint(label)\nprint(changed)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"fixed"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"Fixed"}],"explanation":"label 仍指向旧字符串，changed 接收新字符串。replace 不会在原字符串内部修改首字母。"}]},{"id":"py05.k2","title":"strip/lower/replace 的结果","key":["py03","py04"],"links":["py05.k1"],"card":{"name":"strip/lower/replace","aliases":["去空格","改小写","替换"],"definition":"`strip()` 去掉两端的空白，`lower()` 把字母改成小写，`replace(旧, 新)` 把每一处“旧”换成“新”；三者都得到新文字。","conditions":["`strip()` 不动中间的空格；`lower()` 只改字母，数字和符号不变。","`replace` 区分大小写，换掉所有出现的地方；找不到“旧”时原样返回，不报错。"],"example":"raw 为 `' Drug A-1 '`：`raw.strip()` 得 `'Drug A-1'`，`raw.lower()` 得 `' drug a-1 '`，`raw.replace(\"-\", \"_\")` 得 `' Drug A_1 '`；`raw.replace(\"a\", \"o\")` 找不到小写的 a，原样得到 `' Drug A-1 '`。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"三个最常用的清理方法，各管一件事：\n\n| 写法 | 做什么 | `\"  Ctrl B-2 \"` 得到 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `.strip()` | 去掉**两端**的空格（换行等空白也算） | `'Ctrl B-2'` |\n| `.lower()` | 把**字母**改成小写，数字和符号不变；`.upper()` 改成大写 | `'  ctrl b-2 '` |\n| `.replace(\"-\", \"_\")` | 把**每一处** `-` 换成 `_` | `'  Ctrl B_2 '` |\n\n容易看错的几处：\n\n- `strip()` 只管两端，中间的空格不动：`\" control group \".strip()` 得到 `'control group'`。要去掉所有空格，用 `replace(\" \", \"\")`，把空格换成空文字。\n- `replace(旧, 新)` 括号里先写要找的，再写换成什么。它区分大小写：`\"Ctrl\".replace(\"ctrl\", \"c\")` 找不到小写的 ctrl，原样得到 `'Ctrl'`，也不报错。\n- 三个方法都[得到新文字](repa:concept/py05.k1)，原来的名字不变。\n\n用 print 显示文字时，两端的空格看不出来。题目里常写 `print(\"[\" + label + \"]\")`，用方括号把文字包起来：显示 `[ Ctrl ]`，就说明两端各有一个空格。\n","example":{"id":"py05.k2.e0","body":"先运行下面一行。表里每个写法都单独作用在这个 `raw` 上，填出各自得到的文字，写成带引号的形式，例如 `'Drug'`，引号里的空格照实写。\n\n```python\nraw = \" Drug A-1 \"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"写法"},{"id":"value","header":"得到的文字","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"strip","cells":{"expr":"raw.strip()","value":"'Drug A-1'"}},{"id":"lower","cells":{"expr":"raw.lower()","value":"' drug a-1 '"}},{"id":"dash","cells":{"expr":"raw.replace(\"-\", \"_\")","value":"' Drug A_1 '"}},{"id":"case","cells":{"expr":"raw.replace(\"a\", \"o\")","value":"' Drug A-1 '"}}]}],"explanation":"| 写法 | 得到的文字 |\n|---|---|\n| `raw.strip()` | `'Drug A-1'` |\n| `raw.lower()` | `' drug a-1 '` |\n| `raw.replace(\"-\", \"_\")` | `' Drug A_1 '` |\n| `raw.replace(\"a\", \"o\")` | `' Drug A-1 '` |\n\n`strip()` 去掉了两端的空格，中间的空格还在；`lower()` 只改字母，两端的空格、`-` 和 `1` 原样保留；`replace(\"-\", \"_\")` 只换连字符。最后一行要找的是小写的 `a`，而 `raw` 里只有大写的 `A`，什么也没换，原样得到 `' Drug A-1 '`。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py05.k2.q1","body":"```python\ngroup = \"  control group  \"\nprint(\"[\" + group.strip() + \"]\")\nprint(\"[\" + group.replace(\" \", \"\") + \"]\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[control group]","feedback":[{"when":"[controlgroup]","message":"`strip()` 只去两端的空格，中间那个不动。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[controlgroup]","feedback":[{"when":"[control group]","message":"`replace(\" \", \"\")` 换掉每一个空格，包括中间那个。"}]}],"explanation":"先显示 **[control group]**，再显示 **[controlgroup]**。`strip()` 只去掉两端的空格，中间的空格不动；`replace(\" \", \"\")` 把每一个空格都换成空文字，中间那个也去掉了。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.q2","body":"```python\nnote = \"Ctrl-01 / ctrl-02\"\nprint(note.replace(\"ctrl\", \"ctl\"))\nprint(note.replace(\"-\", \"\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"Ctrl-01 / ctl-02","feedback":[{"when":"ctl-01 / ctl-02","message":"`replace` 区分大小写，开头的 `Ctrl` 是大写的 C，不等于 `ctrl`。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"Ctrl01 / ctrl02","feedback":[{"when":"Ctrl01 / ctrl-02","message":"`replace` 换掉的是每一处，不只是第一处。"}]}],"explanation":"先显示 **Ctrl-01 / ctl-02**，再显示 **Ctrl01 / ctrl02**。`replace` 区分大小写，只换掉了小写的 `ctrl`；它换的是每一处，所以两个连字符都去掉了。两次 `replace` 都作用在原来的 `note` 上，第二行不受第一行影响。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.q3","body":"样本编号录成了 `'S 07'`、`'S 12'` 这样，中间夹着一个空格，要统一写成 `'S07'`、`'S12'`。`sample` 是其中一个编号，哪一行能做到？\n","slots":[{"id":"method","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"no_space","content":"```python\nfixed = sample.replace(\" \", \"\")\n```\n"},{"id":"strip","content":"```python\nfixed = sample.strip()\n```\n","feedback":"`strip()` 只去两端的空格，中间的空格还在。"},{"id":"lower","content":"```python\nfixed = sample.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"drop_s","content":"```python\nfixed = sample.replace(\"S\", \"\")\n```\n"}],"key":"no_space"}],"explanation":"`fixed = sample.replace(\" \", \"\")`：把空格换成空文字，`'S 07'` 得到 `'S07'`。`strip()` 不动中间的空格，结果仍是 `'S 07'`；`lower()` 把 S 改成了小写；`replace(\"S\", \"\")` 去掉的是字母 S，得到 `' 07'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.q4","body":"对同一份标签分别做三种清理。写出 Python 显示的字符串，保留结果中的空格。\n\n```python\nprint(repr(\" A-B \".strip()))\nprint(repr(\" A-B \".lower()))\nprint(repr(\" A-B \".replace(\"-\", \"_\")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"strip","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"'A-B'"},{"id":"lower","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"' a-b '"},{"id":"replace","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"' A_B '"}],"explanation":"strip 只去两端空白；lower 只改变字母大小写；replace 只替换指定片段。三次操作分别从原文字开始，互不接续。"},{"id":"py05.k2.q5","body":"要去掉编号两端的空格，但保留编号中间的空格。哪段程序符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"clean","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"replace","content":"`result = text.replace(\" \", \"\")`"},{"id":"strip","content":"`result = text.strip()`"},{"id":"lower","content":"`result = text.lower()`"}],"key":"strip"}],"explanation":"strip 只处理两端，能够保留编号中间作为分隔的空格；replace 会删掉所有匹配的空格，lower 则不处理空白。"}],"review":[{"id":"py05.k2.r1","body":"```python\ns = \"Site-3 north\"\n```\n\n下面每个写法都单独作用在这个 `s` 上。哪几个得到的文字与 `s` 完全相同？选出所有。\n","slots":[{"id":"same","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"options":[{"id":"a","content":"```python\ns.strip()\n```\n"},{"id":"b","content":"```python\ns.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"c","content":"```python\ns.replace(\"South\", \"S\")\n```\n"},{"id":"d","content":"```python\ns.replace(\"north\", \"N\")\n```\n"},{"id":"e","content":"```python\ns.upper()\n```\n"}],"key":["a","c"]}],"explanation":"`s.strip()` 和 `s.replace(\"South\", \"S\")` 两个。`s` 两端没有空格，`strip()` 没有可去的；`s` 里找不到 `South`，`replace` 原样返回，也不报错。`lower()` 把 S 改成了 s，`upper()` 把字母都改成大写，`replace(\"north\", \"N\")` 找到了 north，得到 `'Site-3 N'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.r2","body":"`len(文字)` 数出一段文字有几个字符，空格也算一个。\n\n```python\ncode = \"  S 08 \"\nprint(len(code.strip()))\nprint(len(code.replace(\" \", \"\")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":3,"message":"`strip()` 不去中间的空格，`'S 08'` 有 4 个字符。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":3}],"explanation":"先显示 **4**，再显示 **3**。`code.strip()` 得到 `'S 08'`，中间的空格还在，共 4 个字符；`code.replace(\" \", \"\")` 去掉了全部空格，得到 `'S08'`，共 3 个字符。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.r3","body":"strip 不会删除词中间的空格；replace 可以处理所有匹配片段。分别读出结果。\n\n```python\nprint(repr(\" A A \".strip()))\nprint(repr(\" A A \".replace(\" \", \"_\")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"'A A'"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"'_A_A_'"}],"explanation":"strip 只处理两端，因此中间空格保留；replace 匹配所有空格，包括两端与中间。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py05.k2.x1","body":"先运行下面一行。表里每个写法都单独作用在这个 `unit` 上，填出各自得到的文字，写成带引号的形式，引号里的空格照实写。\n\n```python\nunit = \" Mg/mL \"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"写法"},{"id":"value","header":"得到的文字","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"strip","cells":{"expr":"unit.strip()","value":"'Mg/mL'"}},{"id":"lower","cells":{"expr":"unit.lower()","value":"' mg/ml '"}},{"id":"upper_m","cells":{"expr":"unit.replace(\"M\", \"m\")","value":"' mg/mL '"}},{"id":"per","cells":{"expr":"unit.replace(\"/\", \" per \")","value":"' Mg per mL '"}}]}],"explanation":"| 写法 | 得到的文字 |\n|---|---|\n| `unit.strip()` | `'Mg/mL'` |\n| `unit.lower()` | `' mg/ml '` |\n| `unit.replace(\"M\", \"m\")` | `' mg/mL '` |\n| `unit.replace(\"/\", \" per \")` | `' Mg per mL '` |\n\n`strip()` 只去两端；`lower()` 把 M 和 L 都改成小写，两端的空格留着；`replace(\"M\", \"m\")` 只换大写的 M，`mL` 里的 L 不受影响；`replace(\"/\", \" per \")` 把斜杠换成前后带空格的 per。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.x2","body":"比较两条记录的组名时，`'drug '` 和 `'drug'` 被当成了两个不同的组：前一个末尾多了一个空格。对两个组名都用同一个写法处理，哪一个能让它们变得完全一样？`x` 代表其中一个组名。\n","slots":[{"id":"method","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"lower","content":"```python\nx.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"upper","content":"```python\nx.upper()\n```\n"},{"id":"strip","content":"```python\nx.strip()\n```\n"},{"id":"capital","content":"```python\nx.replace(\"d\", \"D\")\n```\n"}],"key":"strip"}],"explanation":"`x.strip()`：两个组名都得到 `'drug'`。另外三个写法只改字母，末尾的空格还在，处理后仍然一个带空格、一个不带。\n"},{"id":"py05.k2.x3","body":"替换匹配的是完整指定片段，不是把目标片段里的字符分别去掉。\n\n```python\nprint(\"a-b-a\".replace(\"a-\", \"X\"))\nprint(\"a-b-a\".lower())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"Xb-a"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"a-b-a"}],"explanation":"replace 只匹配开头的 'a-'，末尾单独的 a 不匹配；文字原本已是小写，lower 不再改变它。"}]},{"id":"py05.k3","title":"点号方法调用与调用链从左到右","key":["py04"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"调用链","aliases":["方法链","点号调用"],"definition":"`raw.strip().lower()` 从左往右算：先对 raw 调用 strip()，再对得到的新文字调用 lower()；每个点号前面都是上一步的结果。","conditions":["顺序会改变结果：先 `replace(\" \", \"_\")` 再 `strip()`，两端的空格已成下划线，strip 去不掉。","调用链也不改原来的名字，最后的结果要赋给名字才留得住。"],"example":"```python\nraw = \" Ctrl 01 \"\nlabel = raw.strip().lower().replace(\" \", \"-\")\n```\n依次得到 'Ctrl 01'、'ctrl 01'、'ctrl-01'；raw 仍是 ' Ctrl 01 '。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"点号后面还可以接着点下去：\n\n```python\nraw = \" Drug A \"\nlabel = raw.strip().lower().replace(\" \", \"_\")\n```\n\n这一串叫**调用链**，从左往右读：先对 `raw` 调用 `strip()`，得到一段新文字；再对这段新文字调用 `lower()`；再对结果调用 `replace`。每个点号前面，都是上一步得到的文字。\n\n| 读到 | 得到 |\n|---|---|\n| `raw` | `' Drug A '` |\n| `.strip()` | `'Drug A'` |\n| `.lower()` | `'drug a'` |\n| `.replace(\" \", \"_\")` | `'drug_a'` |\n\n它和分成三行写是一回事：\n\n```python\nstep1 = raw.strip()\nstep2 = step1.lower()\nlabel = step2.replace(\" \", \"_\")\n```\n\n顺序会改变结果。把 `replace` 放到 `strip` 前面，`raw.replace(\" \", \"_\").strip()` 先把两端的空格也换成了下划线，得到 `'_Drug_A_'`，之后的 `strip()` 已经没有空格可去。\n\n和单个方法一样，调用链也不改动 `raw`，最后的结果要赋给名字才留得住。读 AI 写的一长串调用时，照上面的表一步步写下得到的文字，就不容易看漏。\n","example":{"id":"py05.k3.e0","body":"按调用链从左往右的顺序，写出每一步得到的文字，再写出运行完以后 `raw` 的值。都写成带引号的形式，引号里的空格照实写。\n\n```python\nraw = \" Ctrl 01 \"\nlabel = raw.strip().lower().replace(\" \", \"-\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"读到"},{"id":"value","header":"得到","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"step":"raw.strip()","value":"'Ctrl 01'"}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"step":"再 .lower()","value":"'ctrl 01'"}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"step":"再 .replace(\" \", \"-\")","value":"'ctrl-01'"}}]},{"id":"raw","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"运行完以后，`raw` 是什么？","key":"' Ctrl 01 '"}],"explanation":"| 读到 | 得到 |\n|---|---|\n| `raw.strip()` | `'Ctrl 01'` |\n| 再 `.lower()` | `'ctrl 01'` |\n| 再 `.replace(\" \", \"-\")` | `'ctrl-01'` |\n\n每一步都作用在上一步的结果上：`lower()` 收到的是已经去掉两端空格的 `'Ctrl 01'`，`replace` 收到的是 `'ctrl 01'`，只剩中间一个空格可换。最后的 `'ctrl-01'` 交给了 `label`；`raw` 没有被赋值，仍是 `' Ctrl 01 '`。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py05.k3.q1","body":"```python\nraw = \" Ctrl 01 \"\na = raw.strip().replace(\" \", \"_\")\nb = raw.replace(\" \", \"_\").strip()\nprint(\"[\" + a + \"]\")\nprint(\"[\" + b + \"]\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[Ctrl_01]"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[_Ctrl_01_]","feedback":[{"when":"[Ctrl_01]","message":"`b` 那一行先做 replace：两端的空格已经变成下划线，之后的 strip() 没有空格可去。"}]}],"explanation":"先显示 **[Ctrl_01]**，再显示 **[_Ctrl_01_]**。`a` 先去掉两端空格，再换中间的空格；`b` 先把三个空格都换成下划线，得到 `'_Ctrl_01_'`，这时两端已经没有空格，`strip()` 什么也没去掉。\n"},{"id":"py05.k3.q2","body":"组名要统一成：去掉两端的空格、字母全大写、中间的空格换成下划线，例如 `\" drug a \"` 变成 `'DRUG_A'`。下面四行分步做这件事，顺序被打乱了，把它们排成能得到正确结果的程序，每一行都要用上。宿主已经给 `raw` 赋了值。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","items":[{"id":"upper","code":"label = label.upper()"},{"id":"replace","code":"label = label.replace(\" \", \"_\")"},{"id":"start","code":"label = raw"},{"id":"strip","code":"label = label.strip()"}],"key":["start","strip","upper","replace"],"alternatives":[["start","upper","strip","replace"],["start","strip","replace","upper"]],"tests":[{"name":"两端有空格的组名","setup":"raw = \" drug a \"","expect":{"label":"\"DRUG_A\""}},{"name":"另一个组名","hidden":true,"setup":"raw = \"  ctrl 01 \"","expect":{"label":"\"CTRL_01\""}}]}],"explanation":"一种正确的顺序：\n\n```python\nlabel = raw\nlabel = label.strip()\nlabel = label.upper()\nlabel = label.replace(\" \", \"_\")\n```\n\n`label = raw` 必须在最前面，后面几行才有 `label` 可用。关键是 `strip` 要排在 `replace` 前面：先换空格，两端的空格就成了下划线，再也去不掉。改大写放在哪一步都可以，它不影响空格。判分时会把你排好的程序换几个组名运行。\n"},{"id":"py05.k3.q3","body":"需求：把记录里的剂量组名 `raw` 统一成小写、去掉两端的空格、中间的空格换成连字符，存进 `label`。例如 `\" High Dose \"` 要得到 `'high-dose'`。\n\n作答框里的代码结果不对，请改好它。宿主已经给 `raw` 赋了值，换一个组名时代码也要能用。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"label = raw.replace(\" \", \"-\").lower().strip()\n","solution":"label = raw.strip().lower().replace(\" \", \"-\")\n","accepts":["label = raw.lower().strip().replace(\" \", \"-\")","label = raw.strip().replace(\" \", \"-\").lower()","trimmed = raw.strip()\nlowered = trimmed.lower()\nlabel = lowered.replace(\" \", \"-\")\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"label = raw.strip().lower()","why":"没有把中间的空格换成连字符"},{"code":"label = raw.lower().replace(\" \", \"-\")","why":"没有去掉两端的空格，两端变成了连字符"},{"code":"raw.strip().lower().replace(\" \", \"-\")","why":"结果没有赋给 label"},{"code":"label = raw.replace(\" \", \"\").lower()","why":"把所有空格都删掉了，中间没有连字符"},{"code":"label = \"high-dose\"","why":"照着例子写死了结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"例子里的组名","setup":"raw = \" High Dose \"","expect":{"label":"\"high-dose\""}},{"name":"换一个组名","hidden":true,"setup":"raw = \"  Low Dose 2  \"","expect":{"label":"\"low-dose-2\""}},{"name":"没有多余空格的组名","hidden":true,"setup":"raw = \"Control\"","expect":{"label":"\"control\""}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nlabel = raw.strip().lower().replace(\" \", \"-\")\n```\n\n原来的代码先做 `replace`，两端的空格先变成了连字符，得到 `'-high-dose-'`，后面的 `strip()` 已经去不掉。把 `strip()` 挪到 `replace` 前面就对了；`lower()` 放在哪一步都可以。判分时还会换两个组名运行。\n"},{"id":"py05.k3.q4","body":"两条链只有调用次序不同。填写各自最后的 Python 显示内容。\n\n```python\nprint(repr(\" X \".replace(\"X\", \" \").strip()))\nprint(repr(\" X \".strip().replace(\"X\", \" \")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"''"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"' '"}],"explanation":"第一条链先把 X 换成空格，再把得到的三个空格全部去掉，结果为空串。第二条链先得到 'X'，最后换成一个空格，此后没有再次 strip。"},{"id":"py05.k3.q5","body":"链式调用不会把后面的规则提前应用。下面的结果是什么？\n\n```python\nprint(\"AB\".replace(\"A\", \"b\").lower().replace(\"bb\", \"done\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"最后一行显示","key":"done"}],"explanation":"从左到右先得到 'bB'，lower 把它变成 'bb'，最后 replace 才能匹配 'bb' 并得到 'done'。后一次调用接收的是前一次的返回字符串。"}],"review":[{"id":"py05.k3.r1","body":"实验记录里的体积单位写成了 `' ML '`、`'mL'`、`' ml'` 几种，要都变成 `'ml'`。`u` 代表其中一个写法。下面哪几个写法对这三种都得到 `'ml'`？选出所有。\n","slots":[{"id":"chain","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"options":[{"id":"a","content":"```python\nu.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"b","content":"```python\nu.strip().upper()\n```\n"},{"id":"c","content":"```python\nu.strip().lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"d","content":"```python\nu.lower().strip()\n```\n"},{"id":"e","content":"```python\nu.replace(\" \", \"\").upper()\n```\n"}],"key":["c","d"]}],"explanation":"`u.strip().lower()` 和 `u.lower().strip()` 两个。去空格和改小写互不影响，谁先谁后结果一样。只用 `lower()`，`' ML '` 两端的空格还在；另外两个写法改成了大写，得到 `'ML'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k3.r2","body":"```python\ntag = \"Batch-B\"\nfirst = tag.lower().replace(\"b\", \"p\")\nsecond = tag.replace(\"b\", \"p\").lower()\nprint(first)\nprint(second)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"patch-p"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"batch-b","feedback":[{"when":"patch-p","message":"`second` 先做 replace：`'Batch-B'` 里没有小写的 b，什么也没换，之后才改小写。"}]}],"explanation":"先显示 **patch-p**，再显示 **batch-b**。`first` 先改小写，得到 `'batch-b'`，两个 b 都被换成了 p；`second` 先做 `replace`，这时 `'Batch-B'` 里只有大写的 B，`replace` 区分大小写，什么也没换，之后的 `lower()` 才得到 `'batch-b'`。\n"},{"id":"py05.k3.r3","body":"一次替换的结果交给下一次调用。同样的初值，交换两次调用的顺序会怎样？\n\n```python\nprint(\"ab\".replace(\"a\", \"b\").replace(\"bb\", \"x\"))\nprint(\"ab\".replace(\"bb\", \"x\").replace(\"a\", \"b\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"x"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"bb"}],"explanation":"第一条链先得到 bb，因此后一步能匹配并变为 x；第二条链起初没有 bb，第一次替换无效，最后才得到 bb。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py05.k3.x1","body":"按调用链从左往右的顺序，写出每一步得到的文字，写成带引号的形式，引号里的空格照实写。\n\n```python\nsample = \"  s-07 b \"\nclean = sample.strip().upper().replace(\" \", \"\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"读到"},{"id":"value","header":"得到","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"step":"sample.strip()","value":"'s-07 b'"}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"step":"再 .upper()","value":"'S-07 B'"}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"step":"再 .replace(\" \", \"\")","value":"'S-07B'"}}]}],"explanation":"| 读到 | 得到 |\n|---|---|\n| `sample.strip()` | `'s-07 b'` |\n| 再 `.upper()` | `'S-07 B'` |\n| 再 `.replace(\" \", \"\")` | `'S-07B'` |\n\n`strip()` 去掉两端的空格，中间那个留着；`upper()` 只改字母，`-` 和数字不变；最后 `replace` 去掉中间剩下的空格。\n"},{"id":"py05.k3.x2","body":"同事想把组名里的空格换成下划线，并去掉两端的空格，例如 `\" Placebo 2 \"` 要得到 `'Placebo_2'`。他写的是：\n\n```python startLine=1\nraw = \" Placebo 2 \"\nclean = raw.replace(\" \", \"_\").strip()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"value","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"这段代码运行后，`clean` 是什么？写成带引号的形式，引号里的字符照实写。","key":"'_Placebo_2_'"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"把第 2 行换成哪一行，对 `\" Placebo 2 \"` 和 `\"  High Dose \"` 这样的组名都能得到想要的结果？","options":[{"id":"no_space","content":"```python\nclean = raw.replace(\" \", \"\").strip()\n```\n"},{"id":"strip_only","content":"```python\nclean = raw.strip()\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nclean = raw.strip().replace(\"_\", \" \")\n```\n"},{"id":"reordered","content":"```python\nclean = raw.strip().replace(\" \", \"_\")\n```\n"}],"key":"reordered"}],"explanation":"`clean` 是 **'_Placebo_2_'**：`replace` 先把三个空格都换成下划线，两端已经没有空格，`strip()` 什么也没去掉。\n\n换成 `clean = raw.strip().replace(\" \", \"_\")`，先去两端再换中间，得到 `'Placebo_2'`。`replace(\" \", \"\")` 把空格删掉，得到 `'Placebo2'`；只用 `strip()`，中间的空格没换；`replace(\"_\", \" \")` 把两个参数写反了，找的是下划线，结果仍是 `'Placebo 2'`。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py06","title":"列表：位置和一段范围","summary":"读懂列表：len 数出有几个元素，位置从 0 开始取出一个，切片包含起点、不包含终点取出一段。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py03","py04"],"intro":"这一节读**列表**：一组按顺序排好的值，比如一次实验先后记下的几次读数。会练三件事：一共有几个、第几个是什么、取出其中一段。\n\n程序照旧当作短脚本从上往下运行，只有 `print` 才显示。题目问“显示什么”时，如果程序在那一行报错停下，就填 ERROR。\n","wrapup":"读到方括号，先分清三种写法：`[12, 15, 9]` 是写下一个列表；`readings[2]` 是按位置取出一个元素，位置从 0 开始数；`readings[1:3]` 是取出一段，包含起点、不包含终点，结果仍是列表。\n\nAI 写的代码里出现 `[0]`、`[-1]`、`[:3]` 时，先数清它取的是第几个、到哪里为止，再对照你的要求。\n","kps":[{"id":"py06.k1","title":"有序列表与 len","key":["py03","py04"],"links":["py03.k1","py04.k1"],"card":{"name":"列表","aliases":["list","len"],"definition":"方括号里用逗号隔开的一组值，按写入的顺序保存；len(列表) 返回其中有几个元素。","conditions":["len 数的是元素个数：一个元素是一段文字，也只算 1 个；重复的值各算一个。","空列表 [] 的 len 是 0；print 一个列表时，里面的文字带引号显示。"],"example":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\"]\nprint(len(readings))\nprint(ids)\n```\n显示 4 和 `['S01', 'S02', 'S03']`。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"一次实验常常有好几次读数。与其起四个名字，不如把它们放进一个**列表**：\n\n```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\"]\n```\n\n方括号括起来，元素之间用逗号隔开。列表按写入的顺序保存元素：不会自动排序，也不会合并重复的值。元素可以是数，也可以是[文字](repa:concept/py03.k1)。\n\n`len(列表)` 是一次[函数调用](repa:concept/py04.k1)，返回列表里有几个元素：`len(readings)` 是 4。它数的是元素，不是字符：`[\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\"]` 有 3 个元素，每个编号自己有几个字符不影响。空列表 `[]` 的 len 是 0。\n\n`print` 一个列表时，会显示方括号和逗号，里面的文字带引号：`print(ids)` 显示 `['S01', 'S02', 'S03']`（代码里写的是双引号，显示成单引号，意思一样）。而 `print(\"S01\")` 只显示 `S01`，不带引号。\n","example":{"id":"py06.k1.e0","body":"一次实验记下了四次读数和三个样本编号。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\"]\nprint(len(readings))\nprint(ids)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示哪个整数？","key":4},{"id":"shown","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？照屏幕上的样子写。","key":"['S01', 'S02', 'S03']"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **4**：`readings` 里有 12、15、9、20 四个元素。\n\n第二行显示 **['S01', 'S02', 'S03']**。print 一个列表时，会连同方括号、逗号一起显示，里面的文字带上引号，表示它们是文字；代码里写双引号，显示成单引号，是同一个意思。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py06.k1.q1","body":"```python\ngroups = [\"control\", \"drug\"]\nprint(len(groups))\nprint(len(\"control\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":2,"feedback":[{"when":11,"message":"len 用在列表上，数的是元素个数；两个组名是 2 个元素，不是把字母加起来。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":7}],"explanation":"先显示 **2**，再显示 **7**。`groups` 是一个有两个元素的列表，len 数的是元素个数；`\"control\"` 本身是一段文字，len 用在文字上数的是字符，c-o-n-t-r-o-l 共 7 个。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.q2","body":"```python\ngroups = [\"drug\", \"control\", \"drug\"]\nprint(groups)\nprint(len(groups))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"['drug', 'control', 'drug']","feedback":[{"when":"['control', 'drug', 'drug']","message":"列表按写入的顺序保存，不会自动排序。"},{"when":"['drug', 'control']","message":"重复的值不会被合并，两个 drug 都还在。"}]},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":2,"message":"两个 drug 是两个元素，各算一个。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **['drug', 'control', 'drug']** 和 **3**。列表照写入的顺序保存三个元素，不排序，也不把两个 drug 合成一个；len 数到 3 个。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.q3","body":"```python\na = []\nb = [0]\nc = [\"\", \"\"]\nd = [\"12 15 9\"]\n```\n\n填写这四个列表各自的 len。\n","slots":[{"id":"sizes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"列表"},{"id":"size","header":"len","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"name":"a","size":0}},{"id":"b","cells":{"name":"b","size":1}},{"id":"c","cells":{"name":"c","size":2}},{"id":"d","cells":{"name":"d","size":1}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **0、1、2、1**。\n\n- `a` 是空列表，没有元素。\n- `b` 有一个元素 0。0 也是一个值，同样算一个。\n- `c` 有两个元素，都是空文字 `\"\"`；元素里没有字符，也照样各算一个。\n- `d` 只有一个元素：引号把 `12 15 9` 整段括成了一段文字。要存三个读数，应写成 `[12, 15, 9]`。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.q4","body":"列表里可以存重复的值。下面两行分别显示多少？len 数的是位置数，不是不同值的种类数。\n\n```python\nprint(len([\"A\", \"A\", \"B\"]))\nprint(len([]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"repeated","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":3},{"id":"empty","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":0}],"explanation":"第一个列表有三个位置，两个 A 仍分别占一个位置；空列表没有位置，所以长度是 0。"},{"id":"py06.k1.q5","body":"下面分别是一个含逗号的字符串、一个含该字符串的列表和三个元素的列表。写出三次 len 的结果。\n\n```python\nprint(len(\"A,B\"))\nprint(len([\"A,B\"]))\nprint(len([\"A\", \",\", \"B\"]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"string","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":3},{"id":"one","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":1},{"id":"three","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行","key":3}],"explanation":"文字里的逗号是一个字符；放在引号里面时，它不是列表的分隔符。因此 [\"A,B\"] 只有一个列表元素，第三行的列表才有三个元素。"}],"review":[{"id":"py06.k1.r1","body":"三个采样点分别是北坡、南坡、东坡。下面哪一段程序会显示 3？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"joined","content":"```python\nsites = [\"北坡 南坡 东坡\"]\nprint(len(sites))\n```\n"},{"id":"text","content":"```python\nsites = \"北坡南坡东坡\"\nprint(len(sites))\n```\n"},{"id":"list","content":"```python\nsites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\"]\nprint(len(sites))\n```\n"},{"id":"extra","content":"```python\nsites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\", \"\"]\nprint(len(sites))\n```\n"}],"key":"list"}],"explanation":"把三个名字分别写成三个元素的那一段显示 3。三个名字写在同一对引号里，列表只有 1 个元素；不加方括号写成一段文字，len 数的是 6 个字；末尾多了一个空文字 `\"\"`，它也算一个元素，共 4 个。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\nlabels = []\nprint(len(labels))\nlabels = [\"low\", \"high\", \"low\"]\nprint(labels)\nprint(len(labels))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":0},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"['low', 'high', 'low']"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行显示","key":3}],"explanation":"依次显示 **0**、**['low', 'high', 'low']**、**3**。第 2 行执行时 `labels` 还是空列表，len 为 0；第 3 行让 `labels` 改指向一个三元素的列表，照写入顺序显示，两个 low 各算一个。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.r3","body":"空列表与包含一个空字符串的列表，长度并不相同。\n\n```python\nprint(len([]))\nprint(len([\"\"]))\nprint(len([\"\", \"\"]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"0"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"1"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"2"}],"explanation":"len 数列表的元素个数，不数元素内部的字符。即使元素是空字符串，它仍占一个位置。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py06.k1.x1","body":"要把三个样本编号 S01、S02、S03 存成一个列表 `ids`，让 `len(ids)` 是 3。哪一行写对了？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"one_text","content":"```python\nids = [\"S01, S02, S03\"]\n```\n","feedback":"整段放在一对引号里，列表只有 1 个元素。"},{"id":"no_quotes","content":"```python\nids = [S01, S02, S03]\n```\n","feedback":"编号是文字，要加引号；不加引号时 Python 把 S01 当成名字去找，会报错。"},{"id":"correct","content":"```python\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nids = \"S01 S02 S03\"\n```\n","feedback":"没有方括号，这是一整段文字，len 数的是 11 个字符。"}],"key":"correct"}],"explanation":"`ids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\"]` 正确：每个编号各自加引号，用逗号隔开，放在方括号里，共 3 个元素。把三个编号写在一对引号里只有 1 个元素；不加引号会报错；不加方括号得到的是一段文字，len 为 11。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.x2","body":"同事想把四次读数 12、15、9、20 存成列表，再数出有几个。可是运行后 `count` 是 1。\n\n请改动作答框里的代码：让 `readings` 是含这四个整数读数的列表（顺序不变），`count` 用 len 数出来，等于 4。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"readings = [\"12, 15, 9, 20\"]\ncount = len(readings)\n","solution":"readings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\ncount = len(readings)\n","rejects":[{"code":"readings = [\"12\", \"15\", \"9\", \"20\"]\ncount = len(readings)\n","why":"四个读数存成了文字，不是整数"},{"code":"readings = [\"12, 15, 9, 20\"]\ncount = 4\n","why":"只把 count 写死成 4，列表仍只有一个元素"},{"code":"readings = [20, 15, 12, 9]\ncount = len(readings)\n","why":"改动了读数的顺序"}],"tests":[{"name":"列表和个数","expect":{"readings":"[12, 15, 9, 20]","count":"4"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\ncount = len(readings)\n```\n\n原来的列表只有一个元素：一整段文字 `\"12, 15, 9, 20\"`。把四个读数分别写成元素、不加引号，它们才是四个整数，len 才数到 4。\n"},{"id":"py06.k1.x3","body":"列表中的文字长度不同，列表自身仍按元素个数计长。\n\n```python\nprint(len([\"long-name\", \"x\"]))\nprint(len([\"long-name\"]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"2"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"1"}],"explanation":"第一份列表有两个元素，第二份有一个。元素包含多少字符不会改变它各占一个列表位置的事实。"}]},{"id":"py06.k2","title":"从 0 开始的索引和 -1","key":["py03"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"索引","aliases":["下标","位置"],"definition":"列表名[位置] 取出一个元素；位置从 0 开始数，第 n 个元素的位置是 n - 1，-1 是最后一个。","conditions":["位置超出范围会报错（IndexError）：4 个元素时，能用的位置是 0 到 3，或 -1 到 -4。","取出的是元素本身，不是列表：readings[0] 是 12，不是 [12]。"],"example":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nprint(readings[0])\nprint(readings[2])\nprint(readings[-1])\n```\n依次显示 12、9、20：位置 2 是第 3 个，-1 是最后一个。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"在列表名后面加方括号和位置，取出其中一个元素，例如 `readings[0]`。位置（也叫下标）**从 0 开始数**：\n\n| 位置 | 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 元素 | 12 | 15 | 9 | 20 |\n| 负数位置 | -4 | -3 | -2 | -1 |\n\n所以第 1 个是 `readings[0]`，第 n 个是 `readings[n - 1]`。负数从末尾倒着数：`readings[-1]` 是最后一个，`readings[-2]` 是倒数第二个。列表变长或变短时，`[-1]` 始终是最后一个；同样的意思也可以写成 `readings[len(readings) - 1]`。\n\n有 4 个元素时，能用的位置只有 0 到 3（或 -1 到 -4）。写 `readings[4]` 会让程序报错（IndexError）停下：位置 4 已经是“第 5 个”了。\n\n取出来的是元素本身：`readings[0]` 是数 12，不是只含一个元素的列表。\n\n这里的位置就是编程里常说的“索引”（index）。后面读数据表时，会遇到另一个也叫“索引”的东西：表的**行索引**。它是每一行的标签，不一定从 0 开始，和这里的“第几个”不是一回事，到时再分清。\n","example":{"id":"py06.k2.e0","body":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nprint(readings[0])\nprint(readings[2])\nprint(readings[-1])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":12},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":9},{"id":"third","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行显示","key":20}],"explanation":"依次显示 **12、9、20**。位置从 0 开始：`[0]` 是第 1 个 12，`[2]` 是第 3 个 9（不是第 2 个 15）；`[-1]` 从末尾数，是最后一个 20。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py06.k2.q1","body":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\n```\n\n填写每一行代码显示什么。每一行都单独从上面的 `readings` 出发运行；如果会报错，填 ERROR。\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"代码"},{"id":"value","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"p1","cells":{"code":"print(readings[1])","value":"15"}},{"id":"p3","cells":{"code":"print(readings[3])","value":"20"}},{"id":"m2","cells":{"code":"print(readings[-2])","value":"9"}},{"id":"p4","cells":{"code":"print(readings[4])","value":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"| 代码 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `print(readings[1])` | 15 |\n| `print(readings[3])` | 20 |\n| `print(readings[-2])` | 9 |\n| `print(readings[4])` | ERROR |\n\n位置 1 是第 2 个，位置 3 是第 4 个也就是最后一个，-2 是倒数第二个。列表只有 4 个元素，位置最大到 3，`readings[4]` 会报错（IndexError）。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.q2","body":"同事想显示**第 3 个**样本编号 S03，写了：\n\n```python startLine=1\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\", \"S04\"]\nprint(ids[3])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"这段程序实际显示什么？","key":"S04","feedback":[{"when":"S03","message":"位置从 0 开始，位置 3 是第 4 个。"}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"last","content":"```python\nprint(ids[-1])\n```\n"},{"id":"four","content":"```python\nprint(ids[4])\n```\n"},{"id":"two","content":"```python\nprint(ids[2])\n```\n"},{"id":"neg3","content":"```python\nprint(ids[-3])\n```\n"}],"key":"two"}],"explanation":"实际显示 **S04**：位置从 0 开始，`ids[3]` 是第 4 个。第 3 个的位置是 3 - 1 = 2，应改成 `print(ids[2])`。`ids[-1]` 是最后一个 S04；`ids[-3]` 从末尾倒数第三个，是 S02；`ids[4]` 超出范围，会报错。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.q3","body":"如果某一行报错，填 ERROR。\n\n```python startLine=1\nreadings = [7, 11, 4, 18, 9]\nlast = len(readings) - 1\nprint(last)\nprint(readings[last])\nprint(readings[len(readings)])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 3 行显示","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"len(readings) 是 5，再减 1 是 4。"}]},{"id":"line4","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":9},{"id":"line5","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 5 行显示什么？","key":"ERROR"}],"explanation":"第 3 行显示 **4**：5 个元素，减 1 得 4。第 4 行显示 **9**：位置 4 是最后一个元素。第 5 行 **ERROR**：`len(readings)` 是 5，位置 5 已经超出 0 到 4 的范围，程序报 IndexError 停下。最后一个的位置是长度减 1，不是长度本身。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.q4","body":"只有三项的队列，想取第三项却写成了下面这样。程序会显示哪个值，还是报错？\n\n```python\nqueue = [\"first\", \"second\", \"third\"]\nprint(queue[3])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"effect","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"third","content":"third"},{"id":"first","content":"first"},{"id":"error","content":"IndexError，因为下标 3 已越过末尾"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"三个位置的非负下标是 0、1、2。下标 3 不会绕回开头，而是越界；要取第三项应使用 2 或 -1。"},{"id":"py06.k2.q5","body":"负下标从末尾开始数。请把两个方向的下标映射到同一份名单。\n\n```python\nnames = [\"Li\", \"Wu\", \"He\", \"Sun\"]\nprint(names[0])\nprint(names[-1])\nprint(names[-4])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行","key":"Li"},{"id":"last","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行","key":"Sun"},{"id":"back","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第三行","key":"Li"}],"explanation":"0 是第一个位置；-1 是最后一个位置；长度为 4 的列表中，-4 又回到第一个位置，但继续用 -5 就会越界。"}],"review":[{"id":"py06.k2.r1","body":"`depths` 是按采样先后记下的土层深度（厘米）。以后还会加入新的采样点，列表会变长。要始终取出**最后一个**深度，下面哪些写法可以？选出所有可以的。\n\n```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 30, 28]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"four","content":"```python\ndepths[4]\n```\n"},{"id":"neg1","content":"```python\ndepths[-1]\n```\n"},{"id":"neg0","content":"```python\ndepths[-0]\n```\n"},{"id":"len_minus","content":"```python\ndepths[len(depths) - 1]\n```\n"},{"id":"len","content":"```python\ndepths[len(depths)]\n```\n"}],"key":["neg1","len_minus"]}],"explanation":"`depths[-1]` 和 `depths[len(depths) - 1]` 可以：前者从末尾数第一个，后者用长度减 1 算出最后的位置，列表变长后都会跟着变。\n\n`depths[4]` 现在碰巧是最后一个，加入新采样点后就不是了；`depths[len(depths)]` 超出范围，会报错；`-0` 就是 0，取到的是第一个。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.r2","body":"一个列表里按顺序存了 6 个样本编号。不用看具体内容，只按位置回答。\n","slots":[{"id":"fourth","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 4 个编号的位置是多少（用正数写）？","key":3},{"id":"first_neg","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 1 个编号用负数位置怎样写？","key":-6},{"id":"biggest","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"能用的最大正数位置是多少？","key":5}],"explanation":"第 4 个的位置是 **3**（从 0 开始数，减 1）。负数从末尾倒数，-1 是第 6 个，-6 是第 1 个，所以写 **-6**。6 个元素的位置是 0 到 5，最大是 **5**；写 6 会报错。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.r3","body":"一个元素的列表中，下标 0 与 -1 指向同一个位置。\n\n```python\nnames = [\"only\"]\nprint(names[0])\nprint(names[-1])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"only"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"only"}],"explanation":"正向第一个和反向最后一个都是这份列表唯一的位置，因此两次都取到 only。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py06.k2.x1","body":"`readings` 是一次实验按时间先后记下的读数，每次实验的读数个数不一样，但至少有一个。作答框里的代码想显示**最后一个**读数，却只在恰好有 4 个读数时才对。\n\n请改动它并提交。宿主已经准备好 `readings`，不用自己写。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"print(readings[3])\n","solution":"print(readings[-1])\n","accepts":["print(readings[len(readings) - 1])","last = readings[-1]\nprint(last)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"print(readings[4])","why":"位置 4 是第 5 个，4 个读数时会报错"},{"code":"print(readings[len(readings)])","why":"长度本身已经超出范围"},{"code":"print(readings[-0])","why":"-0 就是 0，取到的是第一个"},{"code":"print(readings[-1:])","why":"切片得到的是列表，会显示成 [20]"}],"tests":[{"name":"四个读数","setup":"readings = [12, 15, 9, 20]","stdout":"20"},{"name":"五个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [7, 11, 4, 18, 9]","stdout":"9"},{"name":"只有一个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [30]","stdout":"30"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nprint(readings[-1])\n```\n\n`[-1]` 从末尾数，不管列表多长都是最后一个；写成 `readings[len(readings) - 1]` 也对。固定写 `[3]` 只在恰好 4 个时才是最后一个，读数更多时取错，更少时报错。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.x2","body":"```python\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\", \"S04\", \"S05\"]\nprint(ids[k])\n```\n\n程序显示 S04。`k` 可能是下面哪些值？选出所有可能的。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"p4","content":"4"},{"id":"m2","content":"-2"},{"id":"p3","content":"3"},{"id":"m4","content":"-4"},{"id":"m1","content":"-1"}],"key":["m2","p3"]}],"explanation":"**3** 和 **-2**。S04 是 5 个编号里的第 4 个，位置是 3；从末尾倒数它是第二个，位置是 -2。4 取到的是第 5 个 S05，-1 也是 S05，-4 是 S02。\n"},{"id":"py06.k2.x3","body":"从列表的两端取元素，保留各自原有的数据类型。\n\n```python\nmixed = [\"007\", 8, \"end\"]\nprint(repr(mixed[0]))\nprint(repr(mixed[-1]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"'007'"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"'end'"}],"explanation":"下标取出对应元素，不会自动把看似数字的 '007' 转成整数；-1 取最后的字符串 'end'。"}]},{"id":"py06.k3","title":"切片左闭右开","key":[],"links":["py06.k2"],"card":{"name":"切片","aliases":["slice","左闭右开"],"definition":"列表名[起点:终点] 取出从起点开始、到终点之前为止的一段，结果是一个新列表，有“终点 - 起点”个元素。","conditions":["包含起点、不包含终点；省略起点就从头开始，省略终点就取到末尾。","只取到一个元素也是列表（[9]，不是 9）；起点、终点超出范围不报错，只取到实际有的部分。"],"example":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nprint(readings[1:3])\n```\n取位置 1、2，不取位置 3，显示 [15, 9]。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"方括号里写成 `起点:终点`，取出的是一段，叫**切片**。它包含起点、不包含终点（常说“左闭右开”），所以切片里有 `终点 - 起点` 个元素。\n\n以 `readings = [12, 15, 9, 20]` 为例：\n\n| 写法 | 取到的位置 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `readings[1:3]` | 1、2 | `[15, 9]` |\n| `readings[:2]` | 0、1 | `[12, 15]` |\n| `readings[2:]` | 2、3 | `[9, 20]` |\n| `readings[-2:]` | 倒数第二个到末尾 | `[9, 20]` |\n\n省略起点表示从头开始，省略终点表示一直取到末尾。“前 3 个”就写 `[:3]`，“最后两个”就写 `[-2:]`。\n\n切片的结果总是列表：`readings[2:3]` 是 `[9]`，而[按位置取出](repa:concept/py06.k2)的 `readings[2]` 是 9。起点或终点超出范围时切片不报错，只取到实际存在的部分：`readings[2:10]` 是 `[9, 20]`。起点等于终点时什么也取不到，得到空列表 `[]`。切片是新列表，原来的 `readings` 不变。\n","example":{"id":"py06.k3.e0","body":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nprint(readings[1:3])\nprint(readings[:2])\nprint(readings[-2:])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[15, 9]"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[12, 15]"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"[9, 20]"}],"explanation":"- `[1:3]` 取位置 1、2，不取 3，显示 **[15, 9]**，共 3 - 1 = 2 个。\n- `[:2]` 从头开始，取位置 0、1，显示 **[12, 15]**，也就是前两个。\n- `[-2:]` 从倒数第二个取到末尾，显示 **[9, 20]**，也就是最后两个。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py06.k3.q1","body":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nprint(readings[2:3])\nprint(readings[2])\nprint(readings[2:10])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[9]","feedback":[{"when":"9","message":"切片的结果总是列表，只取到一个元素也带方括号。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"9"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示（如果报错，填 ERROR）","key":"[9, 20]","feedback":[{"when":"ERROR","message":"切片超出范围不报错，只取到实际有的部分。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **[9]**、**9**、**[9, 20]**。`[2:3]` 是切片，只取到位置 2 一个元素，结果仍是列表；`[2]` 是按位置取一个元素，得到的是 9 本身。`[2:10]` 的终点超出了范围，切片不报错，取到末尾为止。\n"},{"id":"py06.k3.q2","body":"```python\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\", \"S04\", \"S05\", \"S06\"]\n```\n\n不用写出内容，填写每个切片里有几个元素。\n","slots":[{"id":"sizes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"切片"},{"id":"size","header":"元素个数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"s14","cells":{"code":"ids[1:4]","size":3}},{"id":"s05","cells":{"code":"ids[:5]","size":5}},{"id":"s4e","cells":{"code":"ids[4:]","size":2}},{"id":"s22","cells":{"code":"ids[2:2]","size":0}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **3、5、2、0**。\n\n- `ids[1:4]`：4 - 1 = 3 个（位置 1、2、3）。\n- `ids[:5]`：从 0 开始，5 - 0 = 5 个。\n- `ids[4:]`：从位置 4 取到末尾，6 个元素的末尾是位置 5，所以是位置 4、5 两个。\n- `ids[2:2]`：起点等于终点，一个也取不到，是空列表。\n"},{"id":"py06.k3.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 从 `readings` 取出**前 3 个**读数，存成列表 `first_three`，不改动 `readings`。读数的个数每次不同，但至少有 3 个。\n\n作答框里的代码取错了。请改动它并提交。宿主已经准备好 `readings`，不用自己写。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"first_three = readings[1:3]\n","solution":"first_three = readings[:3]\n","accepts":["first_three = readings[0:3]","first_three = [readings[0], readings[1], readings[2]]"],"rejects":[{"code":"first_three = readings[0:2]","why":"终点 2 不包含在内，只取到 2 个"},{"code":"first_three = readings[1:4]","why":"从位置 1 开始，漏掉了第一个读数"},{"code":"first_three = readings[:4]","why":"取到了 4 个"},{"code":"first_three = readings[-3:]","why":"取的是最后 3 个"},{"code":"first_three = [12, 15, 9]","why":"照着这次的数据把结果写死了"}],"tests":[{"name":"四个读数","setup":"readings = [12, 15, 9, 20]","expect":{"first_three":"[12, 15, 9]","readings":"readings"}},{"name":"六个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [5, 8, 13, 21, 34, 55]","expect":{"first_three":"[5, 8, 13]","readings":"readings"}},{"name":"恰好三个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [7, 3, 6]","expect":{"first_three":"[7, 3, 6]","readings":"readings"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nfirst_three = readings[:3]\n```\n\n前 3 个是位置 0、1、2。切片不包含终点，所以终点要写 3；起点从头开始，可以省略，写成 `[0:3]` 也一样。原来的 `[1:3]` 从位置 1 开始，漏了第一个，而且只取到 2 个。\n"},{"id":"py06.k3.q4","body":"单个下标越界会报错；切片的上界超过长度时会怎样？填写两个切片的 Python 显示内容。\n\n```python\nitems = [10, 20, 30]\nprint(items[1:99])\nprint(items[3:99])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"tail","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"[20, 30]"},{"id":"empty","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"[]"}],"explanation":"切片会截到实际末尾，不要求上界对应一个有效元素。起点已经在末尾时，范围里没有位置，得到空列表。"},{"id":"py06.k3.q5","body":"在三个时间窗口里分别有哪些预约？切片保留原顺序，并且不包括右端位置。\n\n```python\nslots = [\"08:00\", \"09:00\", \"10:00\", \"11:00\"]\nprint(slots[:2])\nprint(slots[2:])\nprint(slots[2:2])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"early","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"['08:00', '09:00']"},{"id":"late","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"['10:00', '11:00']"},{"id":"empty","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"[]"}],"explanation":"[:2] 包含位置 0、1；[2:] 从位置 2 到末尾；[2:2] 的起止相同，区间为空，而不是取位置 2 的一个元素。"}],"review":[{"id":"py06.k3.r1","body":"```python\nids = [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\", \"S04\", \"S05\", \"S06\"]\n```\n\n要取出**第 2 个到第 4 个**样本编号（两头都要），存进 `part`。哪一行写对了？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"s24","content":"```python\npart = ids[2:4]\n```\n"},{"id":"s13","content":"```python\npart = ids[1:3]\n```\n"},{"id":"s25","content":"```python\npart = ids[2:5]\n```\n"},{"id":"s14","content":"```python\npart = ids[1:4]\n```\n"}],"key":"s14"}],"explanation":"`part = ids[1:4]`。第 2 个的位置是 1，第 4 个的位置是 3；切片不包含终点，终点要比 3 多一，写 4，得到 ['S02', 'S03', 'S04']。`[2:4]` 从第 3 个开始；`[1:3]` 漏了第 4 个；`[2:5]` 整体往后错了一位。\n"},{"id":"py06.k3.r2","body":"下面几块代码打乱了顺序，其中有的用不上。拼出一段程序，让它显示最后两次读数 `[20, 31]`。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"wrong_end","code":"last_two = readings[-2:-1]"},{"id":"show","code":"print(last_two)"},{"id":"right","code":"last_two = readings[-2:]"},{"id":"data","code":"readings = [12, 15, 9, 20, 31]"},{"id":"wrong_pos","code":"last_two = readings[3:4]"}],"key":["data","right","show"],"tests":[{"name":"显示最后两次读数","stdout":"[20, 31]","expect":{"last_two":"[20, 31]"}}]}],"explanation":"先写出 `readings`，再用 `readings[-2:]` 取最后两个，最后 `print`。`[-2:-1]` 不包含终点 -1，只取到 [20]；`[3:4]` 也只取到位置 3 一个元素。终点省略，才会一直取到末尾。\n"},{"id":"py06.k3.r3","body":"负数端点也遵守左闭右开。填写去掉末项和只取末项的两个切片。\n\n```python\nvalues = [1, 3, 5, 7]\nprint(values[:-1])\nprint(values[-1:])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[1, 3, 5]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[7]"}],"explanation":"[:-1] 在最后一个位置之前结束，不包含末项；[-1:] 从末项开始到结尾，仍返回列表而不是单个数。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py06.k3.x1","body":"如果某一行报错，填 ERROR。\n\n```python\ngroups = [\"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\", \"control\", \"drug\"]\nprint(groups[-3:])\nprint(groups[1:2])\nprint(groups[4:4])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"['drug', 'control', 'drug']"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"['drug']"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"[]"}],"explanation":"- `[-3:]` 是最后三个：位置 2、3、4，显示 **['drug', 'control', 'drug']**。\n- `[1:2]` 只取位置 1 一个元素，结果仍是列表，显示 **['drug']**。\n- `[4:4]` 起点等于终点，什么也取不到，显示空列表 **[]**，不报错。\n"},{"id":"py06.k3.x2","body":"同事要取出**第 3 到第 5 个**读数（共 3 个），写了：\n\n```python startLine=1\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20, 31, 26]\npart = readings[3:5]\nprint(part)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序实际显示什么？","key":"[20, 31]"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`part` 里有几个读数？","key":2},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"s36","content":"```python\npart = readings[3:6]\n```\n"},{"id":"s25","content":"```python\npart = readings[2:5]\n```\n"},{"id":"s24","content":"```python\npart = readings[2:4]\n```\n"}],"key":"s25"}],"explanation":"实际显示 **[20, 31]**，只有 **2** 个：`[3:5]` 取位置 3、4，是第 4、第 5 个。第 3 个的位置是 2，第 5 个的位置是 4，终点要多写一位，所以是 `readings[2:5]`，得到 [9, 20, 31]。`[3:6]` 取的是第 4 到第 6 个；`[2:4]` 漏了第 5 个。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py07","title":"拼接列表，汇总一组数","summary":"读懂列表的 + 和 *：是拼接与重复，不是逐个数相加相乘；用 sum、len、min、max 把一组数汇总成一个数，平均值写成 sum(x) / len(x)。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py06","py04","py02"],"intro":"上一节把几次读数放进了[列表](repa:concept/py06.k1)。这一节读两件事：列表之间写 `+` 和 `*` 会得到什么；怎样把一组读数汇总成一个数，比如合计、平均、最大和最小。\n\n如果你习惯 Excel 里整列加减，第一件事最容易读错，要特别留意。程序照旧当作短脚本从上往下运行，只有 `print` 才显示。\n","wrapup":"读到列表的 `+` 和 `*`，记住它们是在“接”和“重复”：列表变长了，里面的数一个也没变。读到 `sum`、`len`、`min`、`max`，就是把一组数换成一个数；看平均值时，检查分母是不是 `len(...)`，而不是写死的个数。\n\n向同事或 AI 提需求时，如果要的是“每个读数各加 5”或“两组读数逐个相加”，要明说“逐个”，拿到结果后再核对长度有没有变。\n","kps":[{"id":"py07.k1","title":"列表 + 拼接、* 重复，不自动逐元素运算","key":["py06"],"links":["py03.k1"],"card":{"name":"列表拼接","aliases":["列表的 +","列表的 *","重复"],"definition":"列表 + 列表把两段接成一个新列表，列表 * 整数把整段重复几遍；它们不会对里面的数逐个做加法或乘法。","conditions":["两个等长的数字列表相加，是接在一起，长度变成两者之和，不是逐个相加。","列表 + 一个数会报 TypeError；要添上一个元素，写成 `+ [5]`。","拼接得到新列表，原来的列表不变。"],"example":"```python\nmorning = [12, 15]\nevening = [11, 14]\nboth = morning + evening\n```\n`both` 是 `[12, 15, 11, 14]`，4 个元素；不是逐个相加得到的 `[23, 29]`。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"列表之间也能写 `+` 和 `*`，但意思和数不一样：\n\n| 写法 | 结果 | 做了什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `[10, 20] + [30]` | `[10, 20, 30]` | 把两段接起来 |\n| `[10, 20] * 2` | `[10, 20, 10, 20]` | 把整段重复两遍 |\n| `[10, 20] + [1, 2]` | `[10, 20, 1, 2]` | 还是接起来，不是逐个相加 |\n| `[10, 20] + 5` | 报 TypeError | 列表只能和列表接 |\n\n这和[文字](repa:concept/py03.k1)的 `+` 一样：`\"3\" + \"4\"` 是接成 `\"34\"`，不是算成 7。\n\n最容易读错的是第三行。如果你习惯 Excel 里整列相加，会以为两组等长的读数相加是逐个相加；在 Python 的列表上不是，得到的是一个更长的列表，长度是两者之和：`len(a + b)` 等于 `len(a) + len(b)`。想让每个读数都加 5，或者两组读数逐个相加，要用后面讲的循环或 pandas 的整列运算，这一节先认出 `+` 和 `*` 不做这件事。\n\n拼接和重复都得到一个新列表，原来的列表不变；要留着结果，就把它存进一个名字。\n","example":{"id":"py07.k1.e0","body":"同一批样本上午、下午各测了两次。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nmorning = [12, 15]\nevening = [11, 14]\nboth = morning + evening\nprint(both)\nprint(len(both))\nprint(morning)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"both","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示什么？照屏幕上的样子写。","key":"[12, 15, 11, 14]"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 5 行显示哪个整数？","key":4},{"id":"morning","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 6 行显示什么？","key":"[12, 15]"},{"id":"how","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行的 `+` 做了什么？","options":[{"id":"added","content":"把两次读数逐个相加"},{"id":"joined","content":"把两个列表接成一个更长的列表"}],"key":"joined"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **[12, 15, 11, 14]**、**4**、**[12, 15]**。\n\n第 3 行的 `+` 把两个列表**接在一起**：morning 的两个在前，evening 的两个在后，共 4 个元素。它不会逐个相加成 `[23, 29]`。拼接得到的是新列表，`morning` 本身没有变。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py07.k1.q1","body":"写出每一行显示什么，照屏幕上的样子写。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint([1, 2] + [3])\nprint([0] * 3)\nprint([5, 6] + [5, 6])\nprint([\"A\"] * 2 + [\"B\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"output","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","output":"[1, 2, 3]"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","output":"[0, 0, 0]"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","output":"[5, 6, 5, 6]"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","output":"['A', 'A', 'B']"}}]}],"explanation":"- 第 1 行：接上一个元素，得 **[1, 2, 3]**。\n- 第 2 行：`[0]` 重复 3 遍，得 **[0, 0, 0]**，常用来先建一个全是 0 的列表。\n- 第 3 行：两个一样的列表相加，仍是接起来，得 **[5, 6, 5, 6]**，不是 [10, 12]。\n- 第 4 行：先算 `[\"A\"] * 2` 得 `['A', 'A']`，再接上 `['B']`，得 **['A', 'A', 'B']**。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.q2","body":"同事想让每个读数都加上 5（仪器的校正量），写了：\n\n```python startLine=1\nreadings = [12, 15, 9]\nshifted = readings + 5\nprint(shifted)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"what","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"added","content":"显示 `[17, 20, 14]`"},{"id":"appended","content":"显示 `[12, 15, 9, 5]`"},{"id":"error","content":"第 2 行报错"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"bracketed","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"如果把第 2 行改成 `shifted = readings + [5]`，第 3 行显示什么？","key":"[12, 15, 9, 5]"}],"explanation":"第 2 行**报错**（TypeError）：列表只能和列表接，不能直接加一个数。\n\n改成 `readings + [5]` 以后不报错了，但显示的是 **[12, 15, 9, 5]**：5 被接在末尾，成了第四个元素，仍然不是“每个读数加 5”。列表的 `+` 不做逐个加法；要逐个加，得用后面讲的循环或 pandas 的整列运算。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.q3","body":"要建一个列表，记下 4 个样本的初始体积，每个都是 8（mL）。哪一行能得到 `[8, 8, 8, 8]`？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"inside","content":"```python\nvolumes = [8 * 4]\n```\n","feedback":"方括号里先算 8 * 4，得到只有一个元素的 [32]。"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nvolumes = [4] * 8\n```\n"},{"id":"repeat","content":"```python\nvolumes = [8] * 4\n```\n"},{"id":"number","content":"```python\nvolumes = 8 * 4\n```\n"}],"key":"repeat"}],"explanation":"`volumes = [8] * 4`：把只有一个 8 的列表重复 4 遍。\n\n`[8 * 4]` 先在方括号里算出 32，得到 `[32]`；`[4] * 8` 是 8 个 4；`8 * 4` 两边都是数，就是普通乘法，得到 32，不是列表。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.q4","body":"仓库把两段队列接起来，再把一段队列重复。写出最终列表，不要逐元素相加或相乘。\n\n```python\nprint([2, 5] + [8])\nprint([2, 5] * 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"concat","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"[2, 5, 8]"},{"id":"repeat","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"[2, 5, 2, 5]"}],"explanation":"列表 + 把右侧整段接到末尾；列表 * 整数则重复整段。元素本身的值仍然是 2、5，而不是变成 4、10。"},{"id":"py07.k1.q5","body":"要把新编号 9 接到末尾，下面三种写法中哪一种能得到 [3, 6, 9]？\n","slots":[{"id":"append","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"scalar","content":"`result = [3, 6] + 9`"},{"id":"repeat","content":"`result = [3, 6] * 9`"},{"id":"list","content":"`result = [3, 6] + [9]`"}],"key":"list"}],"explanation":"列表拼接两边都必须是列表，所以新编号要放进 [9]。直接加整数会报 TypeError；乘 9 会把原列表重复九遍。"}],"review":[{"id":"py07.k1.r1","body":"两批样本编号先合在一起，后来第一批又补了一个。\n\n```python startLine=1\nbatch_a = [\"S01\", \"S02\"]\nbatch_b = [\"S03\"]\nall_ids = batch_a + batch_b\nbatch_a = batch_a + [\"S04\"]\nprint(all_ids)\nprint(batch_a)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 5 行显示什么？","key":"['S01', 'S02', 'S03']"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 6 行显示什么？","key":"['S01', 'S02', 'S04']"}],"explanation":"第 5 行显示 **['S01', 'S02', 'S03']**，第 6 行显示 **['S01', 'S02', 'S04']**。\n\n第 3 行拼接出一个新列表存进 `all_ids`；第 4 行又拼接出另一个新列表，让 `batch_a` 改为指向它。`all_ids` 是第 3 行那一刻接好的结果，不会因为 `batch_a` 后来变了就跟着多出 S04。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.r2","body":"每个样本测了两次，两组读数按样本顺序排好。同事想得到每个样本两次读数的和 `[13, 25, 21]`，写了：\n\n```python\nfirst = [10, 20, 15]\nsecond = [3, 5, 6]\nsums = first + second\n```\n\n运行之后，哪一句说法正确？\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"error","content":"第 3 行报错，两个列表不能相加"},{"id":"joined","content":"`sums` 有 6 个元素：前 3 个是 first 的，后 3 个是 second 的"},{"id":"added","content":"`sums` 是 `[13, 25, 21]`，和想要的一样"},{"id":"doubled","content":"`sums` 是 first 重复两遍"}],"key":"joined"}],"explanation":"“`sums` 有 6 个元素，前 3 个是 first 的，后 3 个是 second 的”正确：`sums` 是 `[10, 20, 15, 3, 5, 6]`。\n\n两个列表可以相加，不会报错，但 `+` 是把它们接起来，长度从 3 变成 6，不是逐个相加。这正是要警惕的地方：程序不报错，结果的长度却已经不是样本数了。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.r3","body":"空列表参与拼接与重复时，分别观察结果，不把空列表当作零。\n\n```python\nprint([] + [4, 5])\nprint([4, 5] * 0)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[4, 5]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[]"}],"explanation":"拼接空列表不增添任何元素；重复零遍则没有任何元素，结果仍是空列表。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py07.k1.x1","body":"一块小板上有 4 个孔：前 3 个没加样（记 0），最后一个加了样（记 1）。用下面的块排出一段程序，让它显示 `[0, 0, 0, 1]`。不是每一块都要用到。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"wrong_order","code":"result = ones + zeros"},{"id":"zeros","code":"zeros = [0] * 3"},{"id":"show","code":"print(result)"},{"id":"wrong_zeros","code":"zeros = [0 * 3]"},{"id":"ones","code":"ones = [1]"},{"id":"result","code":"result = zeros + ones"}],"key":["zeros","ones","result","show"],"alternatives":[["ones","zeros","result","show"]],"tests":[{"name":"显示四个孔的记录","stdout":"[0, 0, 0, 1]"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nzeros = [0] * 3\nones = [1]\nresult = zeros + ones\nprint(result)\n```\n\n前两行谁先都可以。`[0] * 3` 得到三个 0；`[0 * 3]` 先算 0 * 3，只得到 `[0]`。拼接时谁在前，结果里谁就在前，`ones + zeros` 会得到 `[1, 0, 0, 0]`。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.x2","body":"宿主已经给 `a`、`b` 赋好了值：`a` 是有 3 个元素的列表，`b` 是有 5 个元素的列表，里面具体是什么不影响答案。写出每一行显示的整数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(len(a + b))\nprint(len(a * 4))\nprint(len(b + a * 2))\nprint(len((b + a) * 2))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lengths","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"value","header":"显示","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","value":8}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","value":12}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":11}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","value":16}}]}],"explanation":"**8、12、11、16**。拼接后的长度是两段长度相加，重复几遍长度就乘几。\n\n- 第 1 行：3 + 5 = 8。\n- 第 2 行：3 × 4 = 12。\n- 第 3 行：和数的运算一样，先算 `a * 2`（6 个），再接上 b，5 + 6 = 11。\n- 第 4 行：括号里先接成 8 个，再重复两遍，得 16。\n"},{"id":"py07.k1.x3","body":"列表重复与拼接可以接续执行。先读清括号决定的整段，再观察元素顺序。\n\n```python\nprint(([1] + [2]) * 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[1, 2, 1, 2]"}],"explanation":"先拼成 [1, 2]，再重复整段两遍，并不是把每个数都乘 2。"},{"id":"py07.k1.x4","body":"左右两边的顺序会影响拼接结果，哪怕两边包含相同的数字种类。\n\n```python\nprint([1, 2] + [3])\nprint([3] + [1, 2])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[1, 2, 3]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[3, 1, 2]"}],"explanation":"列表拼接保留左段再接右段，所以不满足数值加法的交换顺序习惯。"}]},{"id":"py07.k2","title":"sum/len/min/max 对一组数做汇总","key":["py04","py06","py02"],"links":["py04.k1","py02.k1"],"card":{"name":"汇总一组数","aliases":["sum","min","max","平均值"],"definition":"sum、len、min、max 各自把一个数字列表变成一个数：合计、个数、最小、最大；平均值写成 sum(x) / len(x)。","conditions":["平均值的分母写 len(x)，不要写死个数；用 / 除，结果总带小数点。","调用先算出数，再按运算顺序往下算：`sum(x) / len(x) + 1` 是平均值再加 1。","空列表：sum([]) 是 0，max([])、min([]) 报 ValueError，平均值会因为除以 0 报错。"],"example":"```python\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\nmean = sum(readings) / len(readings)\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n```\n合计 56、个数 4，`mean` 是 14.0；最大 20、最小 9，`spread` 是 11。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"有了一组读数，常常要把它们汇总成一个数。Python 自带四个函数：\n\n| 调用（`readings = [12, 15, 9, 20]`） | 返回值 | 意思 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `sum(readings)` | 56 | 合计 |\n| `len(readings)` | 4 | 有几个 |\n| `min(readings)` | 9 | 最小的 |\n| `max(readings)` | 20 | 最大的 |\n\n它们都是[函数调用](repa:concept/py04.k1)：交回一个数，调用处就换成这个数。读懂函数调用时的 `max(3, 9, 5)` 是把几个数分别写进括号；这里括号里放一整个列表，比的是列表里的元素。\n\n平均值是合计除以个数：\n\n```python\nmean = sum(readings) / len(readings)\n```\n\n得到 **14.0**，用 `/` 除，结果总带小数点。分母写 `len(readings)`，不要写数出来的 4：读数多一个、少一个，代码照样对。极差（最大减最小）写成 `max(readings) - min(readings)`，得 11。\n\n调用换成数以后，照[运算顺序](repa:concept/py02.k1)往下算：`sum(readings) / len(readings) + 1` 是平均值再加 1，得 15.0；`sum(readings) / (len(readings) + 1)` 是除以 5，得 11.2。\n\n空列表要小心：`sum([])` 是 0，`len([])` 也是 0；`max([])`、`min([])` 会报 ValueError；平均值 `sum([]) / len([])` 是除以 0，同样会报错。\n","example":{"id":"py07.k2.e0","body":"一份样本测了四次。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nreadings = [12, 15, 9, 20]\ntotal = sum(readings)\ncount = len(readings)\nmean = total / count\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\nprint(mean)\nprint(spread)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","label":"total","prompt":"`total` 是多少？","key":56},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","label":"count","prompt":"`count` 是多少？","key":4},{"id":"mean","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 6 行显示什么？","key":"14.0"},{"id":"spread","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 7 行显示什么？","key":"11"}],"explanation":"`total` 是 **56**（12 + 15 + 9 + 20），`count` 是 **4**。第 6 行显示 **14.0**：56 / 4，用 `/` 除，结果带小数点。第 7 行显示 **11**：最大的 20 减最小的 9。\n\n每个调用都交回一个数，存进名字以后，下一行就能接着用。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py07.k2.q1","body":"写出三行各显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndoses = [2, 4, 6]\nprint(sum(doses) / len(doses))\nprint(sum(doses) / len(doses) + 1)\nprint(sum(doses) / (len(doses) + 1))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 行显示","key":"4.0","feedback":[{"when":"4","message":"用 / 除，结果总带小数点。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 行显示","key":"5.0"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":"3.0","feedback":[{"when":"5.0","message":"括号让 len(doses) + 1 先算，分母变成 4。"}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **4.0、5.0、3.0**。合计 12、个数 3。\n\n第 3 行先算除法得 4.0，再加 1；第 4 行有括号，先算 3 + 1 = 4，再用 12 除以 4。两行只差一对括号，意思完全不同：前一行是“平均值加 1”，后一行是“除以个数加 1”。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.q2","body":"这一批还没有任何读数。写出第 2–4 行各显示什么；如果某一行会报错，那一格填 ERROR。\n\n```python startLine=1\nvalues = []\nprint(len(values))\nprint(sum(values))\nprint(max(values))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"output","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","output":"0"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","output":"0"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","output":"ERROR"}}]},{"id":"mean","type":"choice","prompt":"如果第 4 行换成 `print(sum(values) / len(values))`，会怎样？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"显示 0"},{"id":"error","content":"报错"},{"id":"zero_float","content":"显示 0.0"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"第 2、3 行都显示 **0**：没有元素，个数是 0，合计也是 0。第 4 行 **ERROR**：空列表里没有最大的那个，`max` 报 ValueError。\n\n换成平均值也会**报错**：分子分母都是 0，除以 0 会报 ZeroDivisionError。所以拿到一组可能为空的数据时，要先说清楚“没有读数时输出什么”。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 根据读数列表 `readings` 算出平均值 `mean` 和极差 `spread`（最大减最小）。读数有几个都不一定，代码都要能用。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，它只在恰好 4 个读数时算对平均值。宿主已经给 `readings` 赋好了值。请改正它并提交，两个结果仍存在 `mean` 和 `spread` 里。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"mean = sum(readings) / 4\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n","solution":"mean = sum(readings) / len(readings)\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n","accepts":["total = sum(readings)\ncount = len(readings)\nmean = total / count\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"mean = sum(readings) / 5\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n","why":"只是换了一个写死的个数"},{"code":"mean = sum(readings) // len(readings)\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n","why":"用了整除，平均值丢了小数部分"},{"code":"mean = (max(readings) + min(readings)) / 2\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n","why":"算的是最大最小的中点，不是平均值"},{"code":"print(sum(readings) / len(readings))\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n","why":"只显示了平均值，没有存进 mean"},{"code":"mean = sum(readings) / len(readings)\n","why":"删掉了算 spread 的那一行"}],"tests":[{"name":"五个读数","setup":"readings = [12, 15, 9, 20, 14]","expect":{"mean":"14.0","spread":"11"}},{"name":"三个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [2, 4, 6]","expect":{"mean":"4.0","spread":"4"}},{"name":"只有一个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [10]","expect":{"mean":"10.0","spread":"0"}},{"name":"平均值不是整数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]","expect":{"mean":"4.5","spread":"7"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nmean = sum(readings) / len(readings)\nspread = max(readings) - min(readings)\n```\n\n分母改成 `len(readings)`，读数有几个就除以几；极差那一行本来就对。判分时会换 3 个、1 个、8 个读数运行你的代码，写死任何一个个数都会在某组上出错。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.q4","body":"汇总含负数的读数时，最大值不是绝对值最大的数。写出三个显示结果。\n\n```python\nprint(sum([-8, -3, -5]))\nprint(min([-8, -3, -5]))\nprint(max([-8, -3, -5]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"总和","key":-16},{"id":"low","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最小值","key":-8},{"id":"high","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最大值","key":-3}],"explanation":"sum 把各读数相加得到 -16；数轴上 -8 最小，-3 最大。max 比较的是数值顺序，不是离零的距离。"},{"id":"py07.k2.q5","body":"同一份读数原样重复一遍之后，观察哪些汇总量翻倍、哪些保持不变。\n\n```python\nreadings = [2, 6]\ndoubled = readings * 2\nprint(sum(doubled))\nprint(len(doubled))\nprint(max(doubled))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"总和","key":16},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"个数","key":4},{"id":"high","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最大值","key":6}],"explanation":"doubled 是 [2, 6, 2, 6]，所以总和与个数都翻倍，但最大值仍是 6。重复数据不会创造更大的单次读数。"}],"review":[{"id":"py07.k2.r1","body":"冷库一天记了四次温度。填写程序运行完以后各个名字的值。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntemps = [4, 6, 5, 9]\nhigh = max(temps)\nlow = min(temps)\ngap = high - low\navg = sum(temps) / len(temps)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"high","cells":{"name":"high","value":"9"}},{"id":"low","cells":{"name":"low","value":"4"}},{"id":"gap","cells":{"name":"gap","value":"5"}},{"id":"avg","cells":{"name":"avg","value":"6.0"}}]}],"explanation":"`high` 是 **9**，`low` 是 **4**，`gap` 是 **5**，`avg` 是 **6.0**（合计 24 除以 4 个，用 `/` 除，带小数点）。程序里没有 `print`，屏幕上什么也不显示，但每个调用的返回值都存进了名字。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.r2","body":"仪器读数整体偏低 1，同事想算出“读数的平均值再加 1”。`r` 是读数列表。哪一行算对了？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"denominator","content":"```python\nfixed = sum(r) / (len(r) + 1)\n```\n"},{"id":"numerator","content":"```python\nfixed = (sum(r) + 1) / len(r)\n```\n"},{"id":"inside","content":"```python\nfixed = sum(r + 1) / len(r)\n```\n"},{"id":"after","content":"```python\nfixed = sum(r) / len(r) + 1\n```\n"}],"key":"after"}],"explanation":"`fixed = sum(r) / len(r) + 1`：除法先算，得到平均值，再加 1。\n\n`sum(r) / (len(r) + 1)` 把 1 加到了个数上；`(sum(r) + 1) / len(r)` 只给合计加了 1，平均下来每个读数只多了一小部分；`sum(r + 1)` 想把列表加 1，会报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.r3","body":"只有一个数的列表，总和、最小值和最大值都来自同一项，但个数仍是 1。\n\n```python\nvalues = [9]\nprint(sum(values))\nprint(len(values))\nprint(min(values))\nprint(max(values))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"9"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"1"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"9"},{"id":"v3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 项","key":"9"}],"explanation":"单项列表的三个数值汇总都是 9，len 计算个数而不是数值，因而为 1。"},{"id":"py07.k2.r4","body":"求平均值要除以条目数量，不能除以最大读数。\n\n```python\nreadings = [2, 4, 6]\nprint(sum(readings) / len(readings))\nprint(sum(readings) / max(readings))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"4.0"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"2.0"}],"explanation":"总和是 12，数量是 3，因此平均为 4.0；把总和除以最大值 6 得到 2.0，并不是平均值。"},{"id":"py07.k2.r5","body":"读数顺序变了，sum、min、max 的结果不会因此改变。分别填写总和与最小值。\n\n```python\nprint(sum([5, 1, 4]))\nprint(min([4, 5, 1]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"10"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"1"}],"explanation":"这些汇总针对全部元素的数值，列表没有预先排序也可以求和、取最小值。"},{"id":"py07.k2.r6","body":"大小值相同也会分别计入总和与长度，不会自动去重。\n\n```python\nvalues = [3, 3, 3]\nprint(sum(values))\nprint(len(values))\nprint(max(values) - min(values))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"9"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"0"}],"explanation":"三项都计入，总和 9、长度 3；最大最小都为 3，所以它们的差为 0。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py07.k2.x1","body":"下面这段代码用 `signal = [10, 30, 20]` 运行时，四个名字都算对了：合计、个数、平均值、最大值。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntotal = sum(signal)\ncount = len(signal)\nmean = total / 3\ntop = max(signal)\n```\n\n现在 `signal` 换成了 `[10, 30, 20, 30]`。\n","slots":[{"id":"wrong","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一个名字的值不再是它该表示的量？","options":[{"id":"total","content":"`total`（合计）"},{"id":"count","content":"`count`（个数）"},{"id":"mean","content":"`mean`（平均值）"},{"id":"top","content":"`top`（最大值）"}],"key":"mean"},{"id":"value","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"换了数据以后，`mean` 实际是多少？照 Python 显示的样子写。","key":"30.0"},{"id":"right","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"真正的平均值应当是多少？","key":"22.5"}],"explanation":"是 **mean**：第 3 行把个数写死成了 3。合计变成 90，代码算出 90 / 3 = **30.0**，而真正的平均值是 90 / 4 = **22.5**。\n\n`total`、`count`、`top` 都用函数现算，换了数据仍然对。第 3 行改成 `mean = total / count` 才能跟着数据走。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.x2","body":"`values` 是一组读数。读下面这一行：\n\n```python\nresult = (sum(values) - max(values)) / (len(values) - 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"number","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`values` 为 `[8, 12, 10, 30]` 时，`result` 是多少？照 Python 显示的样子写。","key":"10.0"},{"id":"meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"这一行算的是什么？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"全部读数的平均值，再减去最大值"},{"id":"b","content":"去掉最大的一个读数以后，其余读数的平均值"},{"id":"c","content":"最大值和其余读数的差"},{"id":"d","content":"去掉最大值和最小值以后的平均值"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"`result` 是 **10.0**：合计 60 减去最大的 30 得 30，个数 4 减 1 得 3，30 / 3 = 10.0。\n\n这一行算的是**去掉最大的一个读数以后，其余读数的平均值**：分子去掉了最大值，分母也相应少算一个。括号让减法先算，再做除法。\n"},{"id":"py07.k2.x3","body":"不同汇总量回答不同问题：总量、个数和最大值不能互相代替。\n\n```python\nloads = [0, 4, 4, 8]\nprint(sum(loads))\nprint(len(loads))\nprint(max(loads))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"16"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"4"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"8"}],"explanation":"零也算一条记录，所以有四项；总和是 16，单项最大为 8。重复的 4 仍分别计入总量与条目数。"},{"id":"py07.k2.x4","body":"差距与平均值都由汇总量计算，但使用的分母和操作不同。\n\n```python\nvalues = [2, 8]\nprint(max(values) - min(values))\nprint(sum(values) / len(values))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"6"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"5.0"}],"explanation":"最大最小之差为 6；平均值是总和 10 除以数量 2，得到 5.0。"}]}]},{"id":"py08","title":"比较得到 True 或 False","summary":"读懂比较：==、!=、<、>、<=、>= 得到 True 或 False；把“至少”“超过”这类说法落实成比较符，并用恰好等于阈值的值检查。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py03","py02"],"intro":"这一节读的是“比较”：拿两个值比一比，结果只有两种，`True`（成立）或 `False`（不成立）。\n\n后面按条件做事、从表格里挑出符合要求的行，都从这一步开始。程序仍当作一段短脚本，从第一行往下运行，只有 `print` 才在屏幕上显示。\n","wrapup":"读到一个比较，先认比较符：两个等号 `==` 才是比较，带等号的 `>=`、`<=` 包含阈值本身。\n\n提需求时，把“至少”“超过”说清楚恰好等于阈值算不算；拿到代码后，用一个恰好等于阈值的值试一下，看结果是不是你要的。\n","kps":[{"id":"py08.k1","title":"==、!=、大小比较的结果","key":["py03"],"links":["py01.k1","py03.k1"],"card":{"name":"比较","aliases":["比较符","布尔值","True/False"],"definition":"用 ==、!=、<、>、<=、>= 比较两个值，结果是 True（成立）或 False（不成立）；这个结果也是一个值，可以存进名字，也可以用 print 显示。","conditions":["`=` 是赋值，`==` 才是比较两边是否相等。","两边有算式时，先算完算式再比较。","数和文字不相等：`10 == \"10\"` 是 False；文字和数比大小会报 TypeError。"],"example":"```python\nsignal = 12\nlimit = 10\npassed = signal >= limit\nprint(passed)\n```\n第 3 行先算出比较的结果 True，再让 `passed` 指向它；最后显示 True。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"比较两个值时，结果只有两种：`True`（成立）或 `False`（不成立）。\n\n| 写法 | 读作 | 例子 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `==` | 等于 | `10 == 10` | True |\n| `!=` | 不等于 | `10 != 12` | True |\n| `>` | 大于 | `9 > 10` | False |\n| `<` | 小于 | `9 < 10` | True |\n| `>=` | 大于或等于 | `10 >= 10` | True |\n| `<=` | 小于或等于 | `12 <= 10` | False |\n\nTrue 和 False 也是值，可以像数一样存进名字。`passed = signal >= limit` 仍按[赋值](repa:concept/py01.k1)来读：先算右边的比较，得到 True 或 False，再让 `passed` 指向它。`print(passed)` 就显示 True 或 False。\n\n三处容易读错：\n\n- 一个等号 `=` 是赋值，两个等号 `==` 才是比较。\n- 两边有算式时，先把算式算完再比较：`4 + 6 >= 10` 先得到 10，再比较，结果是 True。\n- 值的类别会影响比较（见[三类值](repa:concept/py03.k1)）：数 10 和文字 `\"10\"` 不相等，`10 == \"10\"` 是 False；拿文字和数比大小，例如 `\"10\" < 9`，会报 TypeError。文字比较区分大小写，`\"Drug\" == \"drug\"` 是 False。整数和小数按数值比，`3 == 3.0` 是 True。\n","example":{"id":"py08.k1.e0","body":"阅读程序，写出两行输出，再说说 `passed` 指向的是什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\nlimit = 10\npassed = signal >= limit\nprint(passed)\nprint(signal == limit)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"True"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"False"},{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行执行后，`passed` 指向什么？","options":[{"id":"number","content":"数字 12"},{"id":"truth","content":"比较的结果 True"},{"id":"text","content":"文字 `\"signal >= limit\"`"}],"key":"truth"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **True**、**False**。\n\n第 3 行先算右边：12 大于或等于 10，成立，得到 True；再让 `passed` 指向这个 True。它存的是比较的结果，不是 12，也不是那段写法本身。第 5 行比较 12 和 10 是否相等，不相等，显示 False。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py08.k1.q1","body":"下面每一行都是一个比较。逐行写出它的结果是 True 还是 False。\n\n```python startLine=1\n7 != 7\n5 + 5 == 10\n\"drug\" == \"Drug\"\n3 == 3.0\n12 <= 9\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"比较"},{"id":"value","header":"结果","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","value":false}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","value":true}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":false}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","value":true}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","value":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、True、False、True、False**。\n\n- 第 1 行：7 等于 7，所以“不等于”不成立。\n- 第 2 行：先算 5 + 5 得 10，再比较，成立。\n- 第 3 行：大小写不同的两段文字不相等。\n- 第 4 行：整数 3 和小数 3.0 按数值比较，相等。\n- 第 5 行：12 不小于或等于 9。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.q2","body":"下面的程序想显示“signal 是否等于 limit”，应当显示 True 或 False。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\nlimit = 10\nsignal = limit\nprint(signal)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序实际显示什么？","key":10},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"把第 3、4 行换成下面哪一行，才能显示 signal 是否等于 limit？","options":[{"id":"keyword","content":"```python\nprint(signal = limit)\n```\n","feedback":"括号里的 `signal = limit` 不是比较；这一行运行时会报错。"},{"id":"always","content":"```python\nprint(limit == limit)\n```\n","feedback":"limit 总是等于它自己，这一行无论 signal 是多少都显示 True。"},{"id":"compare","content":"```python\nprint(signal == limit)\n```\n"}],"key":"compare"}],"explanation":"实际显示 **10**。第 3 行只有一个等号，是赋值：它让 `signal` 改为指向 limit 的值 10，没有做任何比较，第 4 行显示的就是这个 10。\n\n要比较，写两个等号：`print(signal == limit)`，这里显示 False。`print(signal = limit)` 会报错；`print(limit == limit)` 永远显示 True，和 signal 无关。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.q3","body":"`count` 是数，`label` 是从表单里读进来的文字。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount = 10\nlabel = \"10\"\nprint(count == label)\nprint(count != label)\nprint(count == int(label))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"False","feedback":[{"when":"True","message":"label 有引号，是文字；数 10 和文字 \"10\" 不相等。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"True"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行输出","key":"True"},{"id":"extra","type":"choice","prompt":"如果在最后再加一行 `print(label < 9)`，这一行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"true","content":"显示 True"},{"id":"error","content":"报错"},{"id":"false","content":"显示 False"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **False、True、True**。\n\n`label` 指向的是文字 `\"10\"`，它和数 10 不相等，所以 `==` 得 False、`!=` 得 True。`int(label)` 先把文字转成数 10，再比较就相等了。\n\n拿文字和数比大小（`label < 9`）会报 TypeError：Python 不替你决定按数还是按文字比较。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.q4","body":"标签看起来都像数字，但比较时仍须区分数值和文字。分别填写 True 或 False。\n\n```python\nprint(7 == 7.0)\nprint(7 == \"7\")\nprint(\"7\" != \"07\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"numeric","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"True"},{"id":"mixed","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"False"},{"id":"labels","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"True"}],"explanation":"整数 7 与浮点数 7.0 数值相等；数值不会自动与文字 '7' 相等；两个文字标签 '7' 与 '07' 也不相同。"},{"id":"py08.k1.q5","body":"比较产生布尔值，不是给名字赋值。读出比较结果和比较之后的原值。\n\n```python\ncount = 4\nprint(count == 5)\nprint(count)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"compare","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"False"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":4}],"explanation":"count == 5 只检查相等关系并得到 False，没有把 5 赋给 count。count 仍是 4；赋值动作只用单个等号。"}],"review":[{"id":"py08.k1.r1","body":"`signal` 和 `limit` 已经有值。要让 `same` 存下“signal 是否恰好等于 limit”的结果（True 或 False），并且不改变 `signal` 和 `limit`，应当写哪一行？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"chain","content":"```python\nsame = signal = limit\n```\n"},{"id":"opposite","content":"```python\nsame = signal != limit\n```\n"},{"id":"undefined","content":"```python\nsame == signal == limit\n```\n"},{"id":"store","content":"```python\nsame = signal == limit\n```\n"}],"key":"store"}],"explanation":"`same = signal == limit` 正确：先算右边的比较，得到 True 或 False，再让 `same` 指向它。\n\n`same = signal = limit` 里没有比较，它让 `same` 和 `signal` 都指向 limit 的值，还改掉了 signal；`same == signal == limit` 开头就用到还没有值的 `same`，会报错；`same = signal != limit` 存下的是“不相等”，正好相反。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.r2","body":"写出三个 `print` 各显示什么。如果某一行会报错，那一格填 ERROR。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsite = \"North\"\ndepth = 30\nprint(site == \"north\")\nprint(depth != 30)\nprint(depth >= \"25\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 5 行显示","key":"ERROR"}],"explanation":"依次是 **False、False、ERROR**。\n\n第 3 行：`\"North\"` 和 `\"north\"` 大小写不同，不相等。第 4 行：depth 就是 30，“不等于 30”不成立。第 5 行：`\"25\"` 带引号，是文字，拿数和文字比大小会报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.r3","body":"比较产生布尔结果；相等时，严格大于与大于等于的结论不同。\n\n```python\nprint(5 > 5)\nprint(5 >= 5)\nprint(5 != 5)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"相等不满足严格大于，但满足大于等于；!= 检查不相等，因此为 False。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py08.k1.x1","body":"填写第 2–4 行各自执行后 `dose_mg` 与 `ok` 的值。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndose_mg = 5\nok = dose_mg <= 4\ndose_mg = dose_mg - 1\nok = dose_mg <= 4\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"dose_mg","header":"dose_mg","input":"integer"},{"id":"ok","header":"ok","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","dose_mg":5,"ok":false}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","dose_mg":4,"ok":false}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","dose_mg":4,"ok":true}}]}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | dose_mg | ok |\n|---|---:|---|\n| 第 2 行 | 5 | False |\n| 第 3 行 | 4 | False |\n| 第 4 行 | 4 | True |\n\n`ok` 存的是比较那一刻的结果。第 3 行把 dose_mg 改成 4 时，`ok` 不会跟着重新比较，仍是第 2 行算出的 False；第 4 行再比较一次，才变成 True。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.x2","body":"`reading` 是从仪器导出的文字。\n\n```python startLine=1\nreading = \"15\"\nlimit = 12\nhigh = reading > limit\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"what","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这三行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"true","content":"`high` 是 True"},{"id":"false","content":"`high` 是 False"},{"id":"error","content":"第 3 行报错"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要按数的大小比较，第 3 行应改成哪一句？","options":[{"id":"quoted","content":"```python\nhigh = \"reading\" > limit\n```\n"},{"id":"number","content":"```python\nhigh = int(reading) > limit\n```\n"},{"id":"text","content":"```python\nhigh = reading > str(limit)\n```\n","feedback":"两边都成了文字，比的是字符的先后，不是数的大小。例如 \"9\" > \"12\" 也会得到 True。"}],"key":"number"}],"explanation":"第 3 行**报错**（TypeError）：`reading` 是文字 `\"15\"`，文字和数不能比大小。\n\n改成 `high = int(reading) > limit`：先把文字转成数 15，再和 12 比，得到 True。`reading > str(limit)` 不报错，但两边都是文字，比的是字符先后，换成 `\"9\"` 时也会得到 True；`\"reading\" > limit` 把名字写成了文字，同样报错。\n"},{"id":"py08.k1.x3","body":"比较左右对调时，关系也需要相应反转。检查三条实际表达式。\n\n```python\nprint(3 < 8)\nprint(8 > 3)\nprint(8 < 3)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"前两条都表达 3 比 8 小，第三条表达相反关系，因此为 False。"},{"id":"py08.k1.x4","body":"!= 与 == 是互补的相等关系判断，不会修改作为输入的两个值。\n\n```python\na = 6\nb = 9\nprint(a != b)\nprint(a == b)\nprint(a)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"6"}],"explanation":"两个数不相等，所以 != 为 True、== 为 False；比较不是赋值，a 仍为 6。"}]},{"id":"py08.k2","title":"阈值含不含等号与边界例子","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"阈值边界","aliases":["边界例子","含不含等号"],"definition":"把“至少”“超过”“不超过”“低于”分别写成 >=、>、<=、<；恰好等于阈值的值，是唯一能分出含不含等号的检查例子。","conditions":["至少、不低于 → >=；超过、大于 → >；不超过、最多 → <=；低于、少于 → <。","检查一个比较写得对不对时，一定要试一个恰好等于阈值的值。"],"example":"limit 为 10 时，signal 为 9 或 12，`>=` 和 `>` 结果相同；只有 signal 恰好为 10 时，`signal >= limit` 得 True，`signal > limit` 得 False。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"需求里的阈值常用日常说法给出。写成代码时，要选对比较符，区别全在“恰好等于阈值算不算”：\n\n| 需求里的说法 | 写法（阈值为 10） | 恰好等于 10 时 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 至少 10、不低于 10 | `signal >= 10` | True |\n| 超过 10、大于 10 | `signal > 10` | False |\n| 不超过 10、最多 10 | `signal <= 10` | True |\n| 低于 10、少于 10 | `signal < 10` | False |\n\n`>=` 和 `>` 只在一处不同：值恰好等于阈值时。signal 为 9 或 12，两种写法结果一样；只有 signal 为 10，`>=` 得 True，`>` 得 False。所以检查一个比较时，除了一个明显高于、一个明显低于阈值的值，一定再试一个**恰好等于阈值**的值。\n\n阈值常放在一个名字里，例如 `limit = 10`，比较写成 `signal >= limit`。换一次分析只改 `limit`，比较那一行不用动。\n","example":{"id":"py08.k2.e0","body":"约定：signal **至少**为 limit 的样本算达标。下面这段代码分别用 signal 为 9、10、12 运行：\n\n```python\nlimit = 10\npassed = signal >= limit\n```\n\n另一位同事把第 2 行写成了 `passed = signal > limit`。\n","slots":[{"id":"table","type":"table","prompt":"填写两种写法下 `passed` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"ge","header":"signal >= limit","input":"bool"},{"id":"gt","header":"signal > limit","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"s9","cells":{"signal":"9","ge":false,"gt":false}},{"id":"s10","cells":{"signal":"10","ge":true,"gt":false}},{"id":"s12","cells":{"signal":"12","ge":true,"gt":true}}]},{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个 signal 值让两种写法给出不同的结果？","options":[{"id":"v9","content":"9"},{"id":"v10","content":"10"},{"id":"v12","content":"12"}],"key":"v10"},{"id":"right","type":"choice","prompt":"按“至少为 limit”的约定，哪种写法对？","options":[{"id":"gt","content":"`signal > limit`"},{"id":"ge","content":"`signal >= limit`"}],"key":"ge"}],"explanation":"| signal | `>=` | `>` |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 9 | False | False |\n| 10 | True | False |\n| 12 | True | True |\n\n只有 **10** 让两种写法不同。“至少为 10”包含 10 本身，所以 **`signal >= limit`** 对。只用 9 和 12 检查，两种写法看起来一样好，漏掉等号的错误就查不出来。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py08.k2.q1","body":"把每条需求对应到一个比较符。阈值都是 10，比较的都是 signal。\n","slots":[{"id":"phrases","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"phrase","header":"需求里的说法"},{"id":"operator","header":"比较符","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ge","label":">="},{"id":"gt","label":">"},{"id":"le","label":"<="},{"id":"lt","label":"<"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"p1","cells":{"phrase":"signal 不低于 10","operator":"ge"}},{"id":"p2","cells":{"phrase":"signal 大于 10","operator":"gt"}},{"id":"p3","cells":{"phrase":"signal 最多为 10","operator":"le"}},{"id":"p4","cells":{"phrase":"signal 少于 10","operator":"lt"}}]}],"explanation":"**>=、>、<=、<**。\n\n判断时只问一件事：signal 恰好是 10 的时候算不算？“不低于 10”“最多为 10”都包含 10，所以带等号；“大于 10”“少于 10”不包含 10，不带等号。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.q2","body":"需求是：count **至少为 3** 才算合格（恰好为 3 也算）。同事写成了：\n\n```python\nok = count > 3\n```\n\n你想分别用几个 count 值运行它，看结果对不对。用下面哪些值能发现写错了？选出全部能发现的。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"c2","content":"2"},{"id":"c3","content":"3"},{"id":"c4","content":"4"},{"id":"c10","content":"10"}],"key":["c3"]}],"explanation":"只有 **3**。count 为 3 时，需求要合格，`count > 3` 却得 False。2、4、10 在“至少为 3”和 `count > 3` 下结果一样，用它们试，看不出任何问题。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> signal **至少达到** limit 的样本算达标，`passed` 存下 True 或 False。limit 换成别的值时，代码仍按这条规则工作。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。宿主已经给 `signal` 和 `limit` 赋好了值。请改正它并提交，结果仍存在 `passed` 里。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"passed = signal > limit\n","solution":"passed = signal >= limit\n","accepts":["passed = limit <= signal"],"rejects":[{"code":"passed = signal >= 10","why":"把阈值写死成 10"},{"code":"passed = signal == limit","why":"只有恰好等于阈值才算达标"},{"code":"passed = signal <= limit","why":"方向反了"},{"code":"print(signal >= limit)","why":"只显示了结果，没有存进 passed"}],"tests":[{"name":"恰好等于阈值","setup":"signal = 10\nlimit = 10\n","expect":{"passed":"True"}},{"name":"高于阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"signal = 12\nlimit = 10\n","expect":{"passed":"True"}},{"name":"低于阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"signal = 9\nlimit = 10\n","expect":{"passed":"False"}},{"name":"换一个阈值，恰好相等","hidden":true,"setup":"signal = 15\nlimit = 15\n","expect":{"passed":"True"}},{"name":"换一个阈值，低于它","hidden":true,"setup":"signal = 14\nlimit = 15\n","expect":{"passed":"False"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\npassed = signal >= limit\n```\n\n“至少达到”包含恰好等于 limit 的情况，要用 `>=`。写成 `limit <= signal` 意思相同，也对。判分时会换几组 signal 和 limit 运行你的代码，其中一定有恰好等于阈值的一组。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.q4","body":"年龄至少为 18（包括 18）才可报名。三个候选条件中，哪个同时满足 17、18、19 这三个边界检查？\n","slots":[{"id":"condition","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"strict","content":"`age > 18`"},{"id":"inclusive","content":"`age >= 18`"},{"id":"equality","content":"`age == 18`"}],"key":"inclusive"}],"explanation":"> 会漏掉刚好 18 的人；== 又漏掉 19 及更大年龄。>= 同时包含边界与边界以上的值。"},{"id":"py08.k2.q5","body":"页面规定金额低于 100 才显示补差提示。把三个临界附近的金额代入实际条件，填写 True 或 False。\n\n```python\nprint(99 < 100)\nprint(100 < 100)\nprint(101 < 100)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"below","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"金额 99","key":"True"},{"id":"at","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"金额 100","key":"False"},{"id":"above","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"金额 101","key":"False"}],"explanation":"“低于”不包含恰好等于阈值的金额。99 满足条件；100 已到阈值，101 超过阈值，都不显示补差提示。"}],"review":[{"id":"py08.k2.r1","body":"冷库规定：温度**低于 5** 的样品要重新冷藏（恰好为 5 的不用）。有人写了下面这一行，分别用 temp 为 4、5、6 运行：\n\n```python\nrecool = temp <= 5\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"table","type":"table","prompt":"填写每次运行后 `recool` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"temp","header":"temp"},{"id":"recool","header":"recool","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"t4","cells":{"temp":"4","recool":true}},{"id":"t5","cells":{"temp":"5","recool":true}},{"id":"t6","cells":{"temp":"6","recool":false}}]},{"id":"wrong","type":"choice","prompt":"这一行在哪个温度上和规定不符？","options":[{"id":"t4","content":"4"},{"id":"none","content":"都符合"},{"id":"t6","content":"6"},{"id":"t5","content":"5"}],"key":"t5"}],"explanation":"三次分别是 **True、True、False**。\n\n问题出在 **5**：规定是“低于 5”，恰好为 5 的不用重新冷藏，但 `temp <= 5` 在 5 上得 True。应当写 `recool = temp < 5`。4 和 6 在两种写法下结果相同，查不出这个错误。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.r2","body":"冷库的另一条规定：温度**不高于 8** 的样品记为合格，`ok` 为 True。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行符合这条规定？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"```python\nok = temperature < 8\n```\n"},{"id":"b","content":"```python\nok = temperature >= 8\n```\n"},{"id":"c","content":"```python\nok = temperature <= 8\n```\n"},{"id":"d","content":"```python\nok = temperature > 8\n```\n"}],"key":"c"},{"id":"at8","type":"choice","prompt":"按这条规定，温度恰好为 8 的样品算不算合格？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"不算"},{"id":"b","content":"算"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"**`ok = temperature <= 8`**，温度恰好为 8 的**算合格**。“不高于 8”就是小于或等于 8，包含 8 本身；`< 8` 漏掉了 8，`>= 8` 和 `> 8` 方向反了。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.r3","body":"整数数量“至少为 1”和“大于 0”在此范围等价。观察零与边界值 1。\n\n```python\nprint(0 >= 1)\nprint(1 >= 1)\nprint(1 > 0)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"0 低于“至少 1”的门槛，1 正好达到门槛；对整数数量而言，大于 0 也包括 1。"},{"id":"py08.k2.r4","body":"库存不多于 5 包括恰好 5；把阈值上下各一个整数都代进去检查。\n\n```python\nprint(4 <= 5)\nprint(5 <= 5)\nprint(6 <= 5)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"<= 包括相等边界，所以 4、5 都符合，6 超过上限。"},{"id":"py08.k2.r5","body":"温度低于零与不高于零的区别只在边界。填写两个条件在零度时的结果。\n\n```python\nprint(0 < 0)\nprint(0 <= 0)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"严格的“低于”排除零度，“不高于”包含零度。边界例子能直接检出这项差异。"},{"id":"py08.k2.r6","body":"免运条件为金额达到 200。恰好缺一元与恰好达到门槛应得到不同结论。\n\n```python\nprint(199 >= 200)\nprint(200 >= 200)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"达到门槛使用 >=，199 还没达到，200 已经满足；若写 >，会错误排除正好达到门槛的订单。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py08.k2.x1","body":"脚本里有一行比较，决定一个采样点是不是“保留”。你只看到它的运行结果：把 depth 分别设成 20、30、40 运行，`keep` 依次是\n\n| depth | keep |\n|---:|---|\n| 20 | True |\n| 30 | False |\n| 40 | False |\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"这一行最可能是哪一种写法？","options":[{"id":"lt","content":"```python\nkeep = depth < 30\n```\n"},{"id":"le","content":"```python\nkeep = depth <= 30\n```\n"},{"id":"gt","content":"```python\nkeep = depth > 30\n```\n"},{"id":"ge","content":"```python\nkeep = depth >= 30\n```\n"}],"key":"lt"},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"20、30、40 三个值里，哪一个能分出带等号和不带等号的写法？","key":30}],"explanation":"20 得 True、40 得 False：留下的是小于 30 的一边，所以是 `<` 或 `<=`，排除 `>`、`>=`。再看 **30**：结果是 False，说明恰好等于 30 的不保留，是 `depth < 30`。如果写的是 `depth <= 30`，30 这一行应当是 True。\n\n20 和 40 离阈值很远，带不带等号结果都一样；只有恰好等于阈值的 **30** 才分得出来。这也是检查阈值时一定要试恰好等于它的值的原因。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.x2","body":"```python startLine=1\nlimit = 12\nsignal = 12\nprint(signal > limit)\nprint(signal >= limit)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":"True"},{"id":"alarm","type":"choice","prompt":"需求是“signal **超过** limit 才报警”。哪一行的比较符合这条需求？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"第 4 行的写法"},{"id":"b","content":"第 3 行的写法"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **False**、**True**。signal 恰好等于 limit：`>` 不包含等号，`>=` 包含。\n\n“超过 12”不包含 12 本身，所以符合需求的是**第 3 行**的写法 `signal > limit`；恰好为 12 时不该报警。\n"},{"id":"py08.k2.x3","body":"票价折扣只适用于小于 12 岁的人，恰好 12 岁不适用。把两个临界输入代入。\n\n```python\nprint(11 < 12)\nprint(12 < 12)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"“小于”排除等号边界，因此 11 符合、12 不符合。>= 或 <= 会表达别的范围。"},{"id":"py08.k2.x4","body":"风速上限是 6，允许恰好等于 6。核对边界与超过边界的输入。\n\n```python\nprint(6 <= 6)\nprint(7 <= 6)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"<= 同时包含低于和等于上限，6 已被允许，7 超出范围。"}]}]},{"id":"py09","title":"把两个条件接起来","summary":"用 and、or、not 把比较接成一个 True 或 False；用括号定下先接哪两个，再用小真值表核对两种写法在哪些情况下不同。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py08"],"intro":"上一节的比较一次只问一件事。实际的要求常常同时有两三个条件，比如“drug 组里，signal 至少 10 的样本”。\n\n这一节读 `and`、`or`、`not` 怎样把几个 True/False 接成一个结果，以及括号怎样决定先接哪两个。程序仍当作短脚本，从第一行往下运行，只有 `print` 才显示。\n","wrapup":"读一个组合条件，先把每个比较算成 True 或 False，再按 not、and、or 的先后接起来；有括号的先算括号里面。\n\n向同事或 AI 提需求时，把“并且”“或者”各管哪几个条件说清楚；拿到代码后，挑一个只满足部分条件的例子试一下，看结果是不是你要的。\n","kps":[{"id":"py09.k1","title":"单个布尔值的 and/or/not","key":["py08"],"links":["py08.k1"],"card":{"name":"and/or/not","aliases":["逻辑运算","并且","或者","取反"],"definition":"and 两边都是 True 才得 True；or 两边有一个是 True 就得 True；not 把 True 变成 False、False 变成 True。","conditions":["先把每个比较算成 True 或 False，再按 and、or 接起来。","“在 10 到 20 之间（含两端）”是两个比较：`signal >= 10 and signal <= 20`。","“control 组和 drug 组的样本”是属于任一组都要，写成 or；写成 and 永远得 False。"],"example":"signal 为 12、group 为 \"control\" 时，`signal >= 10 and group == \"drug\"` 左边 True、右边 False，结果 False；换成 `or`，结果 True。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"[比较](repa:concept/py08.k1)每次得到一个 True 或 False。`and`、`or`、`not` 把这样的值接起来：\n\n| a | b | `a and b` | `a or b` |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| True | True | True | True |\n| True | False | False | True |\n| False | True | False | True |\n| False | False | False | False |\n\n`and` 要两边都成立；`or` 只要有一边成立。`not` 只管一个值：`not True` 是 False，`not False` 是 True。\n\n读一个组合条件，先把每个比较算出来，再接起来。例如 signal 为 12、group 为 `\"control\"` 时，`signal >= 10 and group == \"drug\"`：左边 True，右边 False，`and` 要两边都成立，结果是 False。\n\n日常说法里，“并且”“同时”“既……又……”对应 `and`；“或者”“任一”对应 `or`；“不是”“没有”对应 `not`。两处容易写错：\n\n- “在 10 到 20 之间（含两端）”要写成两个比较：`signal >= 10 and signal <= 20`。Python 也接受连写 `10 <= signal <= 20`，意思相同。\n- “control 组和 drug 组的样本”是说属于任一组都要，写成 `group == \"control\" or group == \"drug\"`。一个样本不可能同时属于两组，写成 `and` 永远得 False。\n","example":{"id":"py09.k1.e0","body":"先填出第 4、5 行里左右两个比较各自的结果，再填组合后的结果；最后写出第 6 行显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\ngroup = \"control\"\nflagged = False\nprint(signal >= 10 and group == \"drug\")\nprint(signal >= 10 or group == \"drug\")\nprint(not flagged)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"parts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"left","header":"左边 signal >= 10","input":"bool"},{"id":"right","header":"右边 group == \"drug\"","input":"bool"},{"id":"result","header":"组合后的结果","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行（and）","left":true,"right":false,"result":false}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行（or）","left":true,"right":false,"result":true}}]},{"id":"line6","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 6 行显示什么？","key":"True"}],"explanation":"两行的左边都是 True（12 至少为 10），右边都是 False（group 是 control）。\n\n- 第 4 行用 `and`，要两边都成立，结果 **False**。\n- 第 5 行用 `or`，有一边成立就行，结果 **True**。\n- 第 6 行：flagged 是 False，`not` 把它反过来，显示 **True**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py09.k1.q1","body":"写出第 3–7 行各显示 True 还是 False。\n\n```python startLine=1\na = True\nb = False\nprint(a and b)\nprint(a or b)\nprint(not a)\nprint(not b)\nprint(b or b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"value","header":"显示","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":false}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","value":true}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","value":false}},{"id":"l6","cells":{"line":"第 6 行","value":true}},{"id":"l7","cells":{"line":"第 7 行","value":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、True、False、True、False**。`a and b` 有一边是 False，所以 False；`a or b` 有一边是 True，所以 True；`not` 把值反过来；`b or b` 两边都是 False，结果 False。\n"},{"id":"py09.k1.q2","body":"需求是：留下 control 组和 drug 组的样本，属于这两组中任一组的都要，别的组（例如 blank）不要。`keep` 应存下 True 或 False。哪一行写对了？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both","content":"```python\nkeep = group == \"control\" and group == \"drug\"\n```\n","feedback":"一个样本只有一个组名，不可能同时等于两个，这一行永远得 False。"},{"id":"either","content":"```python\nkeep = group == \"control\" or group == \"drug\"\n```\n"},{"id":"neither","content":"```python\nkeep = group != \"control\" and group != \"drug\"\n```\n"},{"id":"one","content":"```python\nkeep = group == \"control\"\n```\n"}],"key":"either"}],"explanation":"`keep = group == \"control\" or group == \"drug\"`：属于任一组，其中一个比较就成立。\n\n日常说“control 组和 drug 组的样本”，这个“和”是把两组的样本放在一起，写成代码是 `or`。用 `and` 要求一个样本同时属于两组，永远是 False；两个 `!=` 用 `and` 接起来，留下的恰好是别的组；只写一个比较，漏掉了 drug 组。\n"},{"id":"py09.k1.q3","body":"需求是：signal 在 10 到 20 之间（含 10 和 20）的样本留下。代码是：\n\n```python\nkeep = signal >= 10 and signal <= 20\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"table","type":"table","prompt":"分别用下面的 signal 值运行，填写 `keep`。","columns":[{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"keep","header":"keep","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"s9","cells":{"signal":"9","keep":false}},{"id":"s10","cells":{"signal":"10","keep":true}},{"id":"s15","cells":{"signal":"15","keep":true}},{"id":"s20","cells":{"signal":"20","keep":true}},{"id":"s21","cells":{"signal":"21","keep":false}}]},{"id":"changed","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"如果把 `and` 写成 `or`，上面哪些 signal 值的结果会改变？","options":[{"id":"s9","content":"9"},{"id":"s10","content":"10"},{"id":"s15","content":"15"},{"id":"s20","content":"20"},{"id":"s21","content":"21"}],"key":["s9","s21"]}],"explanation":"`keep` 依次是 **False、True、True、True、False**：10 和 20 两端都包含。\n\n写成 `or` 以后，任何数至少满足其中一个比较（不是至少 10，就一定不超过 20），五个值全部得 True。原来是 False 的 **9 和 21** 改变了。\n"},{"id":"py09.k1.q4","body":"同时检查两个布尔开关。三个表达式的结果分别是什么？\n\n```python\nprint(True and False)\nprint(True or False)\nprint(not False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"both","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"False"},{"id":"either","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"True"},{"id":"inverted","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"True"}],"explanation":"and 要求两边都为 True；or 只要求至少一边为 True；not 把单个布尔值反转。"},{"id":"py09.k1.q5","body":"“两个开关不同时开启”与“两个开关都关闭”并不是同一句话。a 为 True、b 为 False 时，哪一个表达式为 True？\n","slots":[{"id":"logic","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"neither","content":"`(not a) and (not b)`"},{"id":"not_both","content":"`not (a and b)`"},{"id":"both","content":"`a and b`"}],"key":"not_both"}],"explanation":"a 与 b 并没有同时开启，所以 not (a and b) 为 True；但 a 已开启，因此“都关闭”的条件为 False。"}],"review":[{"id":"py09.k1.r1","body":"冷藏温度要求在 2 到 8 之间（含 2 和 8）。有人写了：\n\n```python\nok = temp >= 2 or temp <= 8\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"at12","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"temp 为 12 时，`ok` 是什么？","key":"True"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应当改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"open","content":"```python\nok = temp > 2 and temp < 8\n```\n"},{"id":"outside","content":"```python\nok = temp <= 2 or temp >= 8\n```\n"},{"id":"closed","content":"```python\nok = temp >= 2 and temp <= 8\n```\n"}],"key":"closed"}],"explanation":"temp 为 12 时 `ok` 是 **True**：12 至少为 2，`or` 只要一边成立就得 True。用 `or` 接这两个比较，任何温度都会得 True。\n\n应改成 `ok = temp >= 2 and temp <= 8`：两个条件都要成立。`temp > 2 and temp < 8` 漏掉了 2 和 8 两端；`temp <= 2 or temp >= 8` 挑出的是范围外面（还多算了两端）。\n"},{"id":"py09.k1.r2","body":"写出三个 `print` 各显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\ngroup = \"drug\"\nflagged = True\nprint(not flagged)\nprint(group != \"control\" and not flagged)\nprint(group == \"control\" or flagged)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 5 行显示","key":"True"}],"explanation":"依次是 **False、False、True**。\n\n第 3 行：flagged 是 True，`not` 反过来得 False。第 4 行：左边 `group != \"control\"` 是 True，右边 `not flagged` 是 False，`and` 得 False。第 5 行：左边 False，右边 flagged 是 True，`or` 得 True。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py09.k1.x1","body":"要留下 drug 组里没有被标记（flagged 为 False）的样本。代码是：\n\n```python\nkeep = group == \"drug\" and not flagged\n```\n\n把表里每个样本的 group 和 flagged 代进去运行一次。\n","slots":[{"id":"keep","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"sample","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"keep","header":"keep","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"S1","cells":{"sample":"S1","keep":true}},{"id":"S2","cells":{"sample":"S2","keep":false}},{"id":"S3","cells":{"sample":"S3","keep":false}},{"id":"S4","cells":{"sample":"S4","keep":false}}]}],"explanation":"只有 **S1** 是 True：它在 drug 组，flagged 是 False，`not flagged` 为 True，两边都成立。S2 在 drug 组但被标记了；S3、S4 不在 drug 组，`and` 的左边已经是 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"四个样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S1","S2","S3","S4"],"group":["drug","drug","control","control"],"flagged":[false,true,false,true]}}]},{"id":"py09.k1.x2","body":"需要复查的样本：signal 低于 5 的，或者高于 50 的（恰好为 5 或 50 的都不用复查）。`recheck` 应存下 True 或 False。哪一行写对了？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ends","content":"```python\nrecheck = signal <= 5 or signal >= 50\n```\n"},{"id":"inside","content":"```python\nrecheck = signal > 5 and signal < 50\n```\n"},{"id":"never","content":"```python\nrecheck = signal < 5 and signal > 50\n```\n"},{"id":"outside","content":"```python\nrecheck = signal < 5 or signal > 50\n```\n"}],"key":"outside"}],"explanation":"`recheck = signal < 5 or signal > 50`：偏低或偏高，满足任一个就要复查；两端不算，所以不带等号。\n\n用 `and` 接“低于 5”和“高于 50”，没有任何数能同时满足，永远是 False；`signal > 5 and signal < 50` 挑出的是正常范围；带等号的写法把恰好为 5 和 50 的也算了进去。\n"},{"id":"py09.k1.x3","body":"一对布尔输入都为 False，分别求 or 和 not 的结果。\n\n```python\nprint(False or False)\nprint(not False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"or 两边都不成立时返回 False；not 只把给定的单个布尔值反转为 True。"},{"id":"py09.k1.x4","body":"not 不会同时反转后面的两个实参；这里只让它作用在括号给出的单个布尔表达式上。\n\n```python\nprint(not (False or True))\nprint(not (False and True))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"第一组 or 得到 True，取反为 False；第二组 and 得到 False，取反为 True。"}]},{"id":"py09.k2","title":"括号确定条件组合并用小真值表验证","key":["py08"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"条件的括号","aliases":["运算先后","真值表"],"definition":"没有括号时先算 not，再算 and，最后算 or；要改变组合方式就加括号，再用列出全部 True/False 组合的小真值表核对两种写法在哪几行不同。","conditions":["`a or b and c` 等于 `a or (b and c)`，不等于 `(a or b) and c`。","两个条件有 4 种组合，三个条件有 8 种；逐行算一遍就看出差在哪。","拿不准先后时直接加括号，读的人也不用去记规则。"],"example":"需求“drug 组里，signal 至少 10 或者被标记的”要写成 `group == \"drug\" and (signal >= 10 or flagged)`；不加括号时，control 组里被标记的样本也会留下。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"三个条件接在一起，先接哪两个会改变结果。比如需求：\n\n> drug 组里，signal 至少 10 或者被标记了的样本。\n\n意思是先限定 drug 组，在这个组里再看“signal 至少 10”或“被标记”。写成代码要加括号：\n\n```python\nkeep = group == \"drug\" and (signal >= 10 or flagged)\n```\n\n如果不加括号，写成 `group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10 or flagged`：Python 在没有括号时先算 `not`，再算 `and`，最后算 `or`，所以它等于 `(group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10) or flagged`。这样任何组里被标记的样本都会留下，包括 control 组的。\n\n两种写法差在哪，用一张小真值表最清楚：把每个比较当作一个 True/False，列出全部组合，逐行算两种写法。\n\n| drug 组 | signal ≥ 10 | flagged | 加括号 | 不加括号 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| True | True | True | True | True |\n| True | True | False | True | True |\n| True | False | True | True | True |\n| True | False | False | False | False |\n| False | True | True | False | **True** |\n| False | True | False | False | False |\n| False | False | True | False | **True** |\n| False | False | False | False | False |\n\n只有“不在 drug 组、但被标记”的两行不同。两个条件只有 4 行，三个条件 8 行，算一遍并不费事。拿不准先后时，直接加括号。\n","example":{"id":"py09.k2.e0","body":"需求是“drug 组里，signal 至少 10 或者被标记了的样本留下”。两位同事各写了一行，拿同一个样本运行：\n\n```python startLine=1\ngroup = \"control\"\nsignal = 4\nflagged = True\nkeep_a = group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10 or flagged\nkeep_b = group == \"drug\" and (signal >= 10 or flagged)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"keep_a","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`keep_a` 是什么？","key":"True"},{"id":"keep_b","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`keep_b` 是什么？","key":"False"},{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 行实际按哪种方式组合？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"```python\ngroup == \"drug\" and (signal >= 10 or flagged)\n```\n"},{"id":"left","content":"```python\n(group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10) or flagged\n```\n"}],"key":"left"},{"id":"follows","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行符合需求？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"`keep_a` 那一行"},{"id":"b","content":"`keep_b` 那一行"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"`keep_a` 是 **True**，`keep_b` 是 **False**。\n\n第 4 行没有括号，先算 `and`：`group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10` 是 False；再算 `or flagged`，flagged 为 True，结果 True。所以它等于 **`(group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10) or flagged`**。\n\n第 5 行先算括号里的 `signal >= 10 or flagged`，得 True；再和 `group == \"drug\"`（False）用 `and` 接，结果 False。需求先限定 drug 组，这个 control 组的样本不该留下，**`keep_b` 那一行**符合需求。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py09.k2.q1","body":"对比两种写法：`not a or b` 和 `not (a or b)`。把 a、b 的四种组合逐行算一遍。\n","slots":[{"id":"table","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"a","header":"a"},{"id":"b","header":"b"},{"id":"first","header":"not a or b","input":"bool"},{"id":"second","header":"not (a or b)","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"tt","cells":{"a":"True","b":"True","first":true,"second":false}},{"id":"tf","cells":{"a":"True","b":"False","first":false,"second":false}},{"id":"ft","cells":{"a":"False","b":"True","first":true,"second":false}},{"id":"ff","cells":{"a":"False","b":"False","first":true,"second":true}}]},{"id":"differ","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"两种写法有几行结果不同？","key":2}],"explanation":"| a | b | `not a or b` | `not (a or b)` |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| True | True | True | False |\n| True | False | False | False |\n| False | True | True | False |\n| False | False | True | True |\n\n`not a or b` 先算 `not a`，再和 b 用 `or` 接；`not (a or b)` 先算括号里的 `a or b`，再整个取反。两种写法在 **2** 行不同：a、b 都为 True 的一行，以及 a 为 False、b 为 True 的一行。\n"},{"id":"py09.k2.q2","body":"下面哪一种写法和 `not flagged and signal >= 10` 意思相同？\n","slots":[{"id":"same","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"whole","content":"```python\nnot (flagged and signal >= 10)\n```\n"},{"id":"first","content":"```python\n(not flagged) and signal >= 10\n```\n"},{"id":"either","content":"```python\nnot (flagged or signal >= 10)\n```\n"}],"key":"first"}],"explanation":"`(not flagged) and signal >= 10`。`not` 比 `and` 先算，它只管紧跟着的 `flagged`，不管后面整段。\n\n`not (flagged and signal >= 10)` 把整段取反：比如 flagged 为 False、signal 为 5 时，原写法得 False，它却得 True。`not (flagged or signal >= 10)` 要求两个都不成立，意思又不一样。\n"},{"id":"py09.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> control 组里，signal 低于 `limit` 或者被标记了的样本要复查，`recheck` 存下 True 或 False。别的组一律不复查。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，它会把 drug 组里被标记的样本也算进去。宿主已经给 `group`、`signal`、`flagged`、`limit` 赋好了值。请改正它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"recheck = group == \"control\" and signal < limit or flagged\n","solution":"recheck = group == \"control\" and (signal < limit or flagged)\n","accepts":["recheck = (signal < limit or flagged) and group == \"control\"","recheck = group == \"control\" and (flagged or signal < limit)"],"rejects":[{"code":"recheck = (group == \"control\" and signal < limit) or flagged","why":"和原来一样，只是把默认的先后写了出来"},{"code":"recheck = group == \"control\" and signal < limit and flagged","why":"要求低于阈值和被标记同时成立"},{"code":"recheck = group == \"control\" or signal < limit or flagged","why":"别的组里低于阈值或被标记的也算了进去"},{"code":"recheck = group == \"control\" and (signal <= limit or flagged)","why":"恰好等于阈值的也算了进去"},{"code":"recheck = group == \"control\" and (signal < 5 or flagged)","why":"把阈值写死成 5"}],"tests":[{"name":"drug 组里被标记的样本","setup":"group = \"drug\"\nsignal = 3\nflagged = True\nlimit = 5\n","expect":{"recheck":"False"}},{"name":"control 组，低于阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"group = \"control\"\nsignal = 3\nflagged = False\nlimit = 5\n","expect":{"recheck":"True"}},{"name":"control 组，被标记","hidden":true,"setup":"group = \"control\"\nsignal = 9\nflagged = True\nlimit = 5\n","expect":{"recheck":"True"}},{"name":"control 组，恰好等于阈值、没被标记","hidden":true,"setup":"group = \"control\"\nsignal = 5\nflagged = False\nlimit = 5\n","expect":{"recheck":"False"}},{"name":"drug 组，低于阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"group = \"drug\"\nsignal = 3\nflagged = False\nlimit = 5\n","expect":{"recheck":"False"}},{"name":"换一个阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"group = \"control\"\nsignal = 6\nflagged = False\nlimit = 8\n","expect":{"recheck":"True"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nrecheck = group == \"control\" and (signal < limit or flagged)\n```\n\n括号把“低于阈值或被标记”先接成一个条件，再要求它和“在 control 组”同时成立。不加括号时先算 `and`，末尾的 `or flagged` 单独成了一条路，drug 组里被标记的样本也会得 True。判分时会换几组输入运行你的代码，包括 drug 组被标记、恰好等于阈值和换一个阈值的情况。\n"},{"id":"py09.k2.q4","body":"括号让 not 作用的范围不同。写出两次显示的布尔值。\n\n```python\nprint(not (True or True))\nprint((not True) or True)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"group","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"False"},{"id":"part","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"True"}],"explanation":"第一行先得到 True，再整体取反为 False；第二行只把前面的 True 取反，后面仍有一个 True，使 or 的结果为 True。"},{"id":"py09.k2.q5","body":"希望只有 a 为 True 且 b、c 至少一个为 True 时才通过。选择符合全部八种布尔输入的表达式。\n","slots":[{"id":"formula","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"escaped","content":"`(a and b) or c`"},{"id":"all","content":"`a and (b and c)`"},{"id":"grouped","content":"`a and (b or c)`"}],"key":"grouped"}],"explanation":"必须把 b or c 放在同一组，再与 a 做 and。第一项允许 c 单独绕过 a，第二项又把“至少一个”收窄成了“两者都要”。"}],"review":[{"id":"py09.k2.r1","body":"两位同事写了两行，只差一对括号：\n\n```python\nfirst = urgent or drug and high\nsecond = (urgent or drug) and high\n```\n\n下面四组取值里，哪几组能让 `first` 和 `second` 得到不同的结果？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"combos","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"ttf","content":"urgent=True，drug=True，high=False"},{"id":"ftt","content":"urgent=False，drug=True，high=True"},{"id":"tff","content":"urgent=True，drug=False，high=False"},{"id":"fft","content":"urgent=False，drug=False，high=True"}],"key":["ttf","tff"]}],"explanation":"**urgent=True、high=False** 的两组（drug 是 True 还是 False 都一样）。\n\n`first` 没有括号，先算 `drug and high`，等于 `urgent or (drug and high)`：urgent 为 True 时直接得 True。`second` 先算括号，再要求 high 成立：high 为 False 时一定得 False。所以 urgent 为 True、high 为 False 时两者不同；另外两组两种写法结果一样。\n"},{"id":"py09.k2.r2","body":"写出三个 `print` 各显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\nlow = True\ndrug = False\nchecked = True\nprint(low or drug and checked)\nprint(not checked or low)\nprint(not (checked or low))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":"True"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 5 行显示","key":"True"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 6 行显示","key":"False"}],"explanation":"依次是 **True、True、False**。\n\n第 4 行先算 `drug and checked`（False），再 `low or False`，得 True。第 5 行先算 `not checked`（False），再 `False or low`，得 True。第 6 行先算括号里的 `checked or low`（True），再取反，得 False。\n"},{"id":"py09.k2.r3","body":"验证两个逻辑表达式是否会在同一个输入下给出不同判断，不能只看括号外观。\n\n```python\na = False\nb = True\nc = True\nprint(a and (b or c))\nprint((a and b) or c)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"第一式必须满足 a，所以失败；第二式允许 c 单独通过。这个输入正好揭示了分组含义的差异。"},{"id":"py09.k2.r4","body":"目标规则是 `not (a and b)`。下面哪一项在 a、b 的四种布尔输入上都与目标规则相同？只挑一项。\n","slots":[{"id":"equivalent","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"neither","content":"`(not a) and (not b)`"},{"id":"de_morgan","content":"`(not a) or (not b)`"},{"id":"partial","content":"`(not a) or b`"}],"key":"de_morgan"}],"explanation":"两项不同时成立，等价于至少一项不成立，因此用 or 连接两个取反。and 要求两项都不成立，第三项则没有对 b 取反，都会在某些输入上与目标规则不同。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py09.k2.x1","body":"需求是“drug 组里，signal 至少 10 或者被标记了的样本留下”。代码写成：\n\n```python\nkeep = group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10 or flagged\n```\n\n把表里每个样本代进去运行一次。\n","slots":[{"id":"keep","type":"table","prompt":"填写代码算出的 `keep`。","columns":[{"id":"sample","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"keep","header":"keep","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"A1","cells":{"sample":"A1","keep":true}},{"id":"A2","cells":{"sample":"A2","keep":true}},{"id":"A3","cells":{"sample":"A3","keep":true}},{"id":"A4","cells":{"sample":"A4","keep":false}}]},{"id":"wrong","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个样本的结果和需求不符？","options":[{"id":"A1","content":"A1"},{"id":"A2","content":"A2"},{"id":"A3","content":"A3"},{"id":"A4","content":"A4"}],"key":"A2"}],"explanation":"代码算出 **True、True、True、False**。\n\n**A2** 不符：它在 control 组，需求不要它，但代码先算 `group == \"drug\" and signal >= 10`（False），再 `or flagged`，flagged 为 True，就留下了。A3 在 drug 组、被标记，按需求也该留下，代码的结果碰巧对。应写成 `group == \"drug\" and (signal >= 10 or flagged)`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"batch","caption":"一批样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A1","A2","A3","A4"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[12,15,4,4],"flagged":[false,true,true,false]}}]},{"id":"py09.k2.x2","body":"下面这行代码挑出要复查的样本。哪一句话准确说出了它挑的是哪些样本？\n\n```python\nrecheck = not checked and (low or high)\n```\n\n（`checked` 表示已经复查过，`low`、`high` 分别表示读数偏低、偏高。）\n","slots":[{"id":"meaning","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"还没复查过并且偏低的样本，再加上所有偏高的样本"},{"id":"b","content":"偏低或偏高的样本，再加上所有还没复查过的样本"},{"id":"c","content":"已经复查过的样本里，偏低或偏高的"},{"id":"d","content":"还没复查过的样本里，偏低或偏高的"}],"key":"d"}],"explanation":"“还没复查过的样本里，偏低或偏高的”。括号先把 `low or high` 接成“偏低或偏高”，`not checked` 只管 checked，再用 `and` 要求两件事同时成立。\n\n“还没复查过并且偏低，再加上所有偏高的”是 `(not checked and low) or high`，也就是去掉括号后的写法；“偏低或偏高，再加上所有没复查过的”用的是 or；“已经复查过的样本里”漏看了 `not`。\n"},{"id":"py09.k2.x3","body":"一个反例就能推翻两个规则等价的断言。对同一输入比较两个分组。\n\n```python\na = True\nb = False\nc = False\nprint(a or (b and c))\nprint((a or b) and c)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"第一式中 a 单独使 or 成立；第二式必须最终与 c 合取，c 为 False，所以失败。"},{"id":"py09.k2.x4","body":"三个布尔条件已经固定，分别核对“整体不全成立”和“每项都不成立”。\n\n```python\na = True\nb = False\nprint(not (a and b))\nprint((not a) and (not b))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"False"}],"explanation":"两项没有同时成立，所以整体取反为 True；但 a 的确成立，因此“每项都不成立”为 False。"}]}]},{"id":"py10","title":"有条件地做一件事","summary":"读懂 if/elif/else：一组分支只走一条路径；缩进划出哪些行受条件控制；按实际走过的路径追踪变量的值。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py09","py01"],"intro":"这一节读带条件的代码：程序走到 `if` 时先算出条件是 True 还是 False，再决定下面几行做不做。\n\n代码仍当作短脚本从上往下运行。有些题会说“宿主事先给 `signal` 赋了值”，这时代码里不写这一行，同一段代码会换不同的值运行，你要分别说出结果。题里的阈值都是题目自己的约定。\n","wrapup":"读一段带 `if` 的代码，可以按三步走：先算条件，找出这次走的是哪一条路径；再看缩进，分清哪些行属于这条路径、哪些行之后无论如何都会执行；最后只执行这条路径上的赋值，写下各个名字的值。\n\n向 AI 描述分类规则时，也按这个顺序说：每一档的条件（含不含等号）、档与档的先后、都不满足时怎么办。\n","kps":[{"id":"py10.k1","title":"if/elif/else 的互斥路径","key":["py08"],"links":["py08.k1","py09.k1"],"card":{"name":"if/elif/else","aliases":["条件分支","分支"],"definition":"从上往下依次检查条件，第一个为 True 的分支执行，同一组里其余的分支都跳过；条件都不成立时执行 else。","conditions":["一组 if/elif/else 只走一条路径；前面的条件成立以后，后面的 elif 不再检查，所以条件的先后会影响结果。","分开写的两个 if 是两组，各查各的，可能都执行。"],"example":"```python\nsignal = 12\nif signal >= 15:\n    level = \"高\"\nelif signal >= 10:\n    level = \"中\"\nelse:\n    level = \"低\"\nprint(level)\n```\n`signal >= 15` 为 False，接着查 `signal >= 10`，为 True，于是 level 为“中”，else 被跳过；显示“中”。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"程序走到 `if` 这一行时，先算出冒号前面的条件，也就是 [比较](repa:concept/py08.k1) 或 [and/or/not](repa:concept/py09.k1) 得到的 True 或 False。条件为 True，就执行它下面缩进的几行；为 False，就跳过这几行。\n\n几种情况可以连成一组：`elif` 是“否则，如果……”，`else` 是“否则”，`else` 后面不写条件。\n\n```python\nif signal >= 15:\n    level = \"高\"\nelif signal >= 10:\n    level = \"中\"\nelse:\n    level = \"低\"\n```\n\nPython 从上往下检查：\n\n1. 先看 `signal >= 15`。成立就让 level 为“高”，**这一组到此结束**，后面的 elif 和 else 都不再看。\n2. 不成立，才看 `signal >= 10`。\n3. 前面的条件都不成立，执行 else 下面的行。\n\n| signal | `signal >= 15` | `signal >= 10` | level |\n|---:|---|---|---|\n| 18 | True | （不再检查） | 高 |\n| 12 | False | True | 中 |\n| 7 | False | False | 低 |\n\n所以一组 if/elif/else 恰好走一条路径；没有 else 时，条件都不成立就一条也不走。signal 为 18 时 `signal >= 10` 其实也成立，但它排在后面，轮不到它：**条件的先后会影响结果**。\n\n如果写成两个分开的 `if`，就是两组，第二个 if 不管第一个成不成立都会检查，两块可能都执行。\n","example":{"id":"py10.k1.e0","body":"把测量值分成高、中、低三档。阅读代码。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\nif signal >= 15:\n    level = \"高\"\nelif signal >= 10:\n    level = \"中\"\nelse:\n    level = \"低\"\nprint(level)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"conds","type":"table","prompt":"这次运行时，下面两个条件分别是 True 还是 False？","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"cond","header":"条件"},{"id":"value","header":"结果","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","cond":"`signal >= 15`","value":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","cond":"`signal >= 10`","value":true}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第 8 行显示什么？","key":"中"}],"explanation":"signal 是 12：第 2 行的 `signal >= 15` 为 **False**，跳过第 3 行，接着查第 4 行；`signal >= 10` 为 **True**，执行第 5 行，level 为“中”。这一组到此结束，else 下面的第 7 行不执行。最后显示 **中**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py10.k1.q1","body":"还是分三档的代码，这次测量值恰好是 15。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 15\nif signal >= 15:\n    level = \"高\"\nelif signal >= 10:\n    level = \"中\"\nelse:\n    level = \"低\"\nprint(level)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第 8 行显示什么？","key":"高","feedback":[{"when":"中","message":"15 满足 `signal >= 15`（`>=` 包含等号），第一个分支就执行了，轮不到 elif。"}]},{"id":"checked","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 行的条件 `signal >= 10` 这次有没有被检查？","options":[{"id":"no","content":"没有，第 2 行的条件已经成立，这一组到此结束"},{"id":"yes","content":"检查了，而且也是 True"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"显示 **高**。15 满足 `signal >= 15`，执行第 3 行；一组 if/elif/else 只走一条路径，所以第 4 行的条件**没有被检查**，else 也被跳过。虽然 15 也满足 `signal >= 10`，但它排在后面，轮不到它。\n"},{"id":"py10.k1.q2","body":"有人想把测量值分成高（至少 15）、中（10 到 14）、低（低于 10）三档，写成了下面的样子。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 18\nif signal >= 10:\n    level = \"中\"\nelif signal >= 15:\n    level = \"高\"\nelse:\n    level = \"低\"\nprint(level)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第 8 行显示什么？","key":"中"},{"id":"when_high","type":"choice","prompt":"把第 1 行换成别的整数，level 什么时候会是“高”？","options":[{"id":"at_least_15","content":"signal 至少为 15 时"},{"id":"between","content":"signal 在 10 到 14 之间时"},{"id":"never","content":"不管 signal 是多少，都不会"}],"key":"never"}],"explanation":"显示 **中**。18 满足第 2 行的 `signal >= 10`，执行第 3 行后这一组就结束了。\n\n而且**不管 signal 是多少，level 都不会是“高”**：能满足 `signal >= 15` 的值一定也满足 `signal >= 10`，早在第 2 行就走掉了，第 4 行的分支永远轮不到。要把“高”分出来，得把更严格的 `signal >= 15` 放在前面。\n"},{"id":"py10.k1.q3","body":"两段代码只差一个词：A 用了两个分开的 `if`，B 的第二个是 `elif`。\n\nA：\n\n```python\nsignal = 16\nif signal >= 10:\n    print(\"达标\")\nif signal >= 15:\n    print(\"偏高\")\n```\n\nB：\n\n```python\nsignal = 16\nif signal >= 10:\n    print(\"达标\")\nelif signal >= 15:\n    print(\"偏高\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a_lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"A 一共显示几行？","key":2},{"id":"b_lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"B 一共显示几行？","key":1,"feedback":[{"when":2,"message":"B 是一组 if/elif，第一个条件成立后，elif 不再检查。"}]}],"explanation":"A 显示 **2** 行：“达标”“偏高”。两个分开的 if 是两组，各查各的，16 两个条件都满足。\n\nB 只显示 **1** 行：“达标”。`elif` 和前面的 `if` 是一组，第一个条件成立以后，elif 就不再检查。\n"},{"id":"py10.k1.q4","body":"两个条件本来都成立，但它们在同一条 if/elif 链里。最终显示哪一行？\n\n```python\nscore = 95\nif score >= 60:\n    print(\"pass\")\nelif score >= 90:\n    print(\"excellent\")\nelse:\n    print(\"retry\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"显示内容","key":"pass"}],"explanation":"第一条条件已经成立，执行 pass 后就跳过同一条链的其他分支。elif 不是再独立检查一次；如果要优先优秀档，应把较高阈值放在前面。"},{"id":"py10.k1.q5","body":"改为两个独立的 if 以后，屏幕会显示几行？填写行数。\n\n```python\nscore = 95\nif score >= 60:\n    print(\"pass\")\nif score >= 90:\n    print(\"excellent\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"显示行数","key":2}],"explanation":"两个 if 各自判断，95 同时满足两条条件，所以显示两行。它们不再是互斥的 if/elif 分支链。"}],"review":[{"id":"py10.k1.r1","body":"冷藏样本要求温度在 2 到 8 度之间（含 2 和 8）。宿主事先给 `temp` 赋了值，代码里没有这一行。\n\n```python\nif temp > 8:\n    status = \"过热\"\nelif temp < 2:\n    status = \"过冷\"\nelse:\n    status = \"正常\"\n```\n\n这段代码分别在下表的四个温度下运行，写出每次运行后 `status` 的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"status","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"temp","header":"temp"},{"id":"status","header":"status","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"t1","cells":{"temp":"1","status":"过冷"}},{"id":"t2","cells":{"temp":"2","status":"正常"}},{"id":"t8","cells":{"temp":"8","status":"正常"}},{"id":"t9","cells":{"temp":"9","status":"过热"}}]}],"explanation":"| temp | `temp > 8` | `temp < 2` | status |\n|---:|---|---|---|\n| 1 | False | True | 过冷 |\n| 2 | False | False | 正常 |\n| 8 | False | False | 正常 |\n| 9 | True | （不再检查） | 过热 |\n\n2 和 8 恰好在边界上：`temp > 8` 和 `temp < 2` 都不含等号，两个条件都不成立，走到 else。\n"},{"id":"py10.k1.r2","body":"要求：pH 低于 6 记为“酸”，高于 8 记为“碱”，其余（包括恰好为 6 和 8）记为“中性”。宿主事先给 `ph` 赋了值。\n\n哪一段代码对任何 pH 值都符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"wide","content":"```python\nif ph <= 6:\n    label = \"酸\"\nelif ph >= 8:\n    label = \"碱\"\nelse:\n    label = \"中性\"\n```\n","feedback":"恰好为 6 或 8 时应记为“中性”，`<=` 和 `>=` 把它们分进了酸和碱。"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nif ph < 6:\n    label = \"酸\"\nelif ph > 8:\n    label = \"碱\"\nelse:\n    label = \"中性\"\n```\n"},{"id":"two_ifs","content":"```python\nlabel = \"中性\"\nif ph < 6:\n    label = \"酸\"\nif ph < 8:\n    label = \"碱\"\n```\n","feedback":"第二个条件写成了 `ph < 8`：pH 为 5 时先记为“酸”，接着又被改成“碱”。"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"用 `ph < 6`、`ph > 8`，再用 else 接住其余情况的那一段符合要求：恰好 6 和 8 两个条件都不成立，走到 else，记为“中性”。\n\n写成 `<=`、`>=` 的那段把 6 和 8 分错了档。两个分开的 if 那段，第二个条件写反了方向，pH 为 5 时会先记“酸”又被改成“碱”，pH 为 7 也会被记成“碱”。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py10.k1.x1","body":"```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\ngroup = \"drug\"\nif signal >= 10 and group == \"control\":\n    note = \"对照组达标\"\nelif signal >= 10:\n    note = \"达标\"\nelse:\n    note = \"未达标\"\nprint(note)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4、6、8 行里，哪一行被执行了？","options":[{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l6","content":"第 6 行"},{"id":"l8","content":"第 8 行"}],"key":"l6"},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第 9 行显示什么？","key":"达标"}],"explanation":"第 3 行的条件要两边都成立：`signal >= 10` 为 True，但 `group == \"control\"` 为 False，所以整个条件是 False。接着查第 5 行，`signal >= 10` 为 True，执行**第 6 行**，这一组结束。显示 **达标**。\n"},{"id":"py10.k1.x2","body":"要求：signal 至少 20 记为“很高”，至少 10（但不到 20）记为“高”，其余记为“低”。有人写成了下面的代码，宿主事先给 `signal` 赋了值。\n\n```python\nif signal >= 10:\n    level = \"高\"\nelif signal >= 20:\n    level = \"很高\"\nelse:\n    level = \"低\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"wrong","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"用下面哪些 signal 运行，得到的 level 会和要求不一致？选出所有不一致的。","options":[{"id":"s5","content":"5"},{"id":"s12","content":"12"},{"id":"s20","content":"20"},{"id":"s25","content":"25"}],"key":["s20","s25"]}],"explanation":"**20 和 25** 不一致：按要求应记为“很高”，但它们先满足了第 1 行的 `signal >= 10`，被记成“高”，elif 轮不到。5 记为“低”、12 记为“高”，都与要求一致。\n\n更严格的条件 `signal >= 20` 要放在前面检查。\n"},{"id":"py10.k1.x3","body":"同一条分支链只选择第一条成立路径。观察中间档是否还会执行。\n\n```python\nscore = 92\nif score >= 90:\n    print(\"high\")\nelif score >= 60:\n    print(\"middle\")\nelse:\n    print(\"low\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"high"}],"explanation":"第一条已经命中，因此不再执行 elif，即使 score >= 60 本来也成立。"}]},{"id":"py10.k2","title":"缩进划定执行范围","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"缩进","aliases":["代码块","缩进块"],"definition":"冒号下面向右缩进的连续几行属于这个 if（或 elif、else），条件决定它们整块做或不做；回到原来位置的第一行起，就不再受这个条件控制。","conditions":["一行和哪一行左边对齐，就和它同级；同一块里的行要对齐，习惯每层 4 个空格。","冒号下面没有缩进的行、或同一块没有对齐，Python 读不懂，一行都不会运行（IndentationError）。"],"example":"两段代码只差最后一行 `print(total)` 的缩进：放在 if 外面，signal 为 12 时也会显示 0；缩进到 if 里面，条件不成立时整块跳过，什么也不显示。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"`if` 这一行末尾的冒号表示“下面是一块”。冒号下面**向右缩进**的连续几行都属于这个 if：条件成立就整块执行，不成立就整块跳过。第一条**回到原来位置**的行，是这块之后的普通代码，无论条件如何都会执行。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 25\nif signal > 20:\n    print(\"偏高\")\n    checked = \"需复核\"\nprint(\"记录完成\")\n```\n\n第 3、4 行属于这个 if；第 5 行和 `if` 左边对齐，不属于它。signal 为 25 时显示“偏高”“记录完成”；把第 1 行换成 `signal = 12`，只显示“记录完成”，第 4 行的赋值也没有发生。\n\n所以两段代码哪怕只差一行的缩进，意思也可能完全不同。读的时候竖着看左边：一行和哪一行对齐，就和它同级。elif、else 下面的块也是这样划分的。\n\n缩进由空格组成，习惯每层 4 个空格。冒号下面一行缩进都没有，或同一块里的行没有对齐，Python 读不懂这段代码，会报 IndentationError，程序一行都不会运行。\n","example":{"id":"py10.k2.e0","body":"两段代码只差最后一行的缩进。\n\nA：\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\ntotal = 0\nif signal > 20:\n    print(\"偏高\")\n    total = total + 1\nprint(total)\n```\n\nB：\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 12\ntotal = 0\nif signal > 20:\n    print(\"偏高\")\n    total = total + 1\n    print(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"choice","prompt":"A 显示什么？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"0"},{"id":"one","content":"1"},{"id":"nothing","content":"什么也不显示"}],"key":"zero"},{"id":"b","type":"choice","prompt":"B 显示什么？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"0"},{"id":"one","content":"1"},{"id":"nothing","content":"什么也不显示"}],"key":"nothing"}],"explanation":"signal 是 12，`signal > 20` 为 False，if 下面缩进的那一块整块跳过。\n\n- A 的第 6 行和 `if` 对齐，不属于这块，照常执行，显示 **0**。\n- B 的第 6 行缩进到了块里，和第 4、5 行一起被跳过，**什么也不显示**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py10.k2.q1","body":"```python startLine=1\nsignal = 14\nif signal < 10:\n    print(\"偏低\")\n    signal = 10\nprint(signal)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","prompt":"这次运行，第 1–5 行里哪几行执行了？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l5","content":"第 5 行"}],"key":["l1","l2","l5"]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"显示什么？","key":14}],"explanation":"执行了**第 1、2、5 行**。第 2 行要先算条件，所以它总会执行；`14 < 10` 为 False，缩进的第 3、4 行整块跳过；第 5 行回到了左边，不属于 if，照常执行，显示 **14**。\n"},{"id":"py10.k2.q2","body":"要求：signal 超过 20 时显示“偏高”并把 `flagged` 设为 1；不管 signal 是多少，最后都显示“完成”。宿主事先给 `signal` 和 `flagged = 0` 赋了值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nif signal > 20:\n    print(\"偏高\")\n    flagged = 1\n    print(\"完成\")\n```\n\nsignal 为 12 时，这段代码什么也不显示。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行的缩进错了？","options":[{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"}],"key":"l4"}],"explanation":"**第 4 行**。`print(\"完成\")` 缩进在 if 的块里，只在 signal 超过 20 时才执行。要求是“不管 signal 是多少都显示”，它应该和 `if` 左边对齐，放到块外面。第 2、3 行只在超过 20 时做，缩进是对的。\n"},{"id":"py10.k2.q3","body":"要求：温度 `temp` 高于 8 时，先显示“过热”，再显示“请检查”；不管温度如何，最后都显示“记录完成”。宿主事先给 `temp` 赋了值。\n\n把下面四行排成程序，并给每一行设好缩进。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","indent":1,"items":[{"id":"done","code":"print(\"记录完成\")"},{"id":"check","code":"print(\"请检查\")"},{"id":"cond","code":"if temp > 8:"},{"id":"hot","code":"print(\"过热\")"}],"key":["cond","hot","check","done"],"indents":{"cond":0,"hot":1,"check":1,"done":0},"tests":[{"name":"温度为 10","setup":"temp = 10","stdout":"过热\n请检查\n记录完成"},{"name":"温度为 5","setup":"temp = 5","stdout":"记录完成"},{"name":"温度恰好为 8","hidden":true,"setup":"temp = 8","stdout":"记录完成"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nif temp > 8:\n    print(\"过热\")\n    print(\"请检查\")\nprint(\"记录完成\")\n```\n\n“过热”和“请检查”只在高于 8 时显示，所以缩进到 if 的块里，先后按要求排；“记录完成”每次都要显示，和 `if` 对齐放在块外。判分时会用不同的温度运行你排出的程序。\n"},{"id":"py10.k2.q4","body":"条件为 False，观察哪一行仍会执行。\n\n```python\nenabled = False\nif enabled:\n    print(\"inside\")\nprint(\"outside\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"显示内容","key":"outside"}],"explanation":"inside 属于缩进的 if 代码块，被 False 跳过；outside 已经退回外层，不受这个条件控制。"},{"id":"py10.k2.q5","body":"希望 disabled 时一行都不显示。只把最后一行向右缩进一级，能否达到这个效果？\n\n```python\nenabled = False\nif enabled:\n    print(\"open\")\nprint(\"audit\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"works","content":"能，audit 也进入同一个 if 代码块"},{"id":false,"content":"不能，缩进只影响外观"},{"id":"always","content":"不能，print 总会运行"}],"key":"works"}],"explanation":"缩进决定代码块的归属。把最后一行缩进后，两次 print 都属于 if enabled；enabled 为 False 时两行都被跳过。"}],"review":[{"id":"py10.k2.r1","body":"要求：`weight` 为负数时，先显示“读数为负，按 0 处理”，再把 `weight` 改为 0；不是负数时保持原值。最后无论如何都显示 `weight`。宿主事先给 `weight` 赋了值。\n\n作答框里的代码缩进有问题：`weight` 为 3 时也显示 0。只改缩进，让它符合要求。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"if weight < 0:\n    print(\"读数为负，按 0 处理\")\nweight = 0\nprint(weight)\n","solution":"if weight < 0:\n    print(\"读数为负，按 0 处理\")\n    weight = 0\nprint(weight)\n","rejects":[{"code":"if weight < 0:\n    print(\"读数为负，按 0 处理\")\n    weight = 0\n    print(weight)\n","why":"把最后的 print 也缩进了，不是负数时什么也不显示"},{"code":"if weight < 0:\n    print(\"读数为负，按 0 处理\")\nweight = 0\nprint(weight)\n","why":"没有改动，赋值 0 仍在块外"}],"tests":[{"name":"weight 为 -2","setup":"weight = -2","stdout":"读数为负，按 0 处理\n0"},{"name":"weight 为 3","setup":"weight = 3","stdout":"3"},{"name":"weight 恰好为 0","hidden":true,"setup":"weight = 0","stdout":"0"}]}],"explanation":"`weight = 0` 要缩进到 if 的块里，只在负数时执行；`print(weight)` 留在块外，每次都显示。\n\n```python\nif weight < 0:\n    print(\"读数为负，按 0 处理\")\n    weight = 0\nprint(weight)\n```\n\n原来的第 3 行和 `if` 对齐，不受条件控制，所以不管 weight 是多少都被改成了 0。\n"},{"id":"py10.k2.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\ndose = 3\nif dose > 5:\n    print(\"高剂量\")\n    group = \"A\"\nelse:\n    print(\"低剂量\")\n    group = \"B\"\nprint(group)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","prompt":"这次运行，下面哪几行执行了？","options":[{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l6","content":"第 6 行"},{"id":"l7","content":"第 7 行"},{"id":"l8","content":"第 8 行"}],"key":["l6","l7","l8"]},{"id":"last","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第 8 行显示什么？","key":"B"}],"explanation":"`3 > 5` 为 False，if 下面的第 3、4 行整块跳过，执行 else 下面缩进的**第 6、7 行**；第 8 行和 `if`、`else` 对齐，不属于任何一块，总会执行，显示 **B**。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py10.k2.x1","body":"要求：`group` 是 \"drug\" 时，显示“用药组”，并把 `n_drug` 加 1；否则显示“对照组”。最后不管哪一组，都显示 `n_drug`。宿主事先给 `group` 和 `n_drug` 赋了值。\n\n把下面的块排成程序，并设好缩进。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","indent":1,"items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(n_drug)"},{"id":"other","code":"else:"},{"id":"add","code":"n_drug = n_drug + 1"},{"id":"cond","code":"if group == \"drug\":"},{"id":"control","code":"print(\"对照组\")"},{"id":"drug","code":"print(\"用药组\")"}],"key":["cond","drug","add","other","control","show"],"indents":{"cond":0,"drug":1,"add":1,"other":0,"control":1,"show":0},"tests":[{"name":"用药组","setup":"group = \"drug\"\nn_drug = 4\n","stdout":"用药组\n5"},{"name":"对照组","setup":"group = \"control\"\nn_drug = 4\n","stdout":"对照组\n4"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nif group == \"drug\":\n    print(\"用药组\")\n    n_drug = n_drug + 1\nelse:\n    print(\"对照组\")\nprint(n_drug)\n```\n\n加 1 只在用药组做，所以和“用药组”一起缩进在 if 的块里（这两行谁先谁后都可以）；`else:` 和 `if` 对齐；最后的 `print(n_drug)` 回到左边，两组都会执行。\n"},{"id":"py10.k2.x2","body":"两段代码只差最后一行的缩进。宿主事先给 `x` 赋了值。\n\nA：\n\n```python\nif x > 5:\n    print(\"超出\")\n    x = 5\nprint(x)\n```\n\nB：\n\n```python\nif x > 5:\n    print(\"超出\")\n    x = 5\n    print(x)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"counts","type":"table","prompt":"填写每段代码在两种 x 下各显示几行。","columns":[{"id":"program","header":"代码"},{"id":"x3","header":"x 为 3 时","input":"integer"},{"id":"x9","header":"x 为 9 时","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"program":"A","x3":1,"x9":2}},{"id":"b","cells":{"program":"B","x3":0,"x9":2}}]}],"explanation":"| 代码 | x 为 3 时 | x 为 9 时 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| A | 1 | 2 |\n| B | 0 | 2 |\n\nx 为 9 时条件成立，两段都显示“超出”和 5。x 为 3 时块被跳过：A 的 `print(x)` 在块外，照样显示 3；B 的 `print(x)` 在块里，跟着被跳过，什么也不显示。\n"},{"id":"py10.k2.x3","body":"同一份 False 条件只控制缩进块，退回外层后的显示仍会执行。\n\n```python\nready = False\nif ready:\n    print(\"A\")\n    print(\"B\")\nprint(\"C\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"C"}],"explanation":"A、B 都位于 if 块中，被 False 一起跳过；C 没有缩进进该块，因此正常显示。"}]},{"id":"py10.k3","title":"每条路径后的变量值","key":["py01","py08"],"links":["py01.k2"],"card":{"name":"分支后的变量","aliases":["默认值","路径追踪"],"definition":"一组 if 之后某个名字的值，取决于这次实际走了哪条路径；没走到的分支里的赋值不会发生。","conditions":["只在某个分支里赋值的名字，没走那条路时保持原来的值；原来就没有值的，之后一用就报 NameError。","在 if 之前先给一个默认值，或者用 else 接住其余情况，可以保证每条路径之后都有值。"],"example":"```python\nflag = \"正常\"\nif signal > 20:\n    flag = \"偏高\"\nprint(flag)\n```\nsignal 为 25 时显示“偏高”；为 12 时第 3 行没有执行，flag 保持默认值，显示“正常”。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"读完一组 if，要回答“之后这个名字是多少”，先确定这次走的是哪条路径，再只执行这条路径上的赋值，[按顺序记下每个名字的值](repa:concept/py01.k2)。没走到的分支，里面写了什么赋值都不算数。\n\n常见的写法是**先给默认值，再在分支里改**：\n\n```python startLine=1\nflag = \"正常\"\nif signal > 20:\n    flag = \"偏高\"\nprint(flag)\n```\n\n| signal | 走的路径 | 第 4 行时 flag |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 25 | 执行第 3 行 | 偏高 |\n| 12 | 跳过第 3 行 | 正常 |\n\n如果去掉第 1 行，signal 为 12 时 `flag` 从来没有被赋值，第 4 行用到它就会报 NameError：这个名字还不存在。\n\n有几个分开的 if 时，每个 if 都可能改同一个名字。逐个看条件，成立一次就执行一次那里的赋值，例如成立两次就加了两次。\n","example":{"id":"py10.k3.e0","body":"宿主事先给 `signal` 赋了值，代码里没有这一行。\n\n```python startLine=1\nflag = \"正常\"\nif signal > 20:\n    flag = \"偏高\"\nprint(flag)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","prompt":"这段代码分别在 signal 为 25 和 12 时运行，第 4 行各显示什么？","columns":[{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"flag","header":"显示","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"s25","cells":{"signal":"25","flag":"偏高"}},{"id":"s12","cells":{"signal":"12","flag":"正常"}}]},{"id":"line3","type":"choice","prompt":"signal 为 12 时，第 3 行执行了吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"执行了"},{"id":"no","content":"没有执行"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"signal 为 25 时条件成立，第 3 行把 flag 改为“偏高”，显示 **偏高**。signal 为 12 时条件不成立，第 3 行**没有执行**，flag 保持第 1 行给的默认值，显示 **正常**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py10.k3.q1","body":"和例题相比，这段代码少了默认值那一行。宿主事先给 `signal` 赋了 12。\n\n```python startLine=1\nif signal > 20:\n    flag = \"偏高\"\nprint(flag)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"运行结果是什么？","options":[{"id":"high","content":"显示“偏高”"},{"id":"nothing","content":"什么也不显示，正常结束"},{"id":"error","content":"第 3 行报错：`flag` 这个名字还没有值"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"**第 3 行报错**（NameError）。12 不满足 `signal > 20`，第 2 行没有执行，`flag` 从来没有被赋值；第 3 行要用它，Python 找不到这个名字。\n\n补上 `flag = \"正常\"` 作为默认值，或者加一个 else 分支，每条路径之后 `flag` 就都有值了。\n"},{"id":"py10.k3.q2","body":"宿主事先给 `a` 和 `b` 赋了值。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount = 0\nif a >= 10:\n    count = count + 1\nif b >= 10:\n    count = count + 1\nprint(count)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"table","prompt":"分别按下表的值运行，第 6 行显示多少？","columns":[{"id":"a","header":"a"},{"id":"b","header":"b"},{"id":"count","header":"显示","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"a":"12","b":"7","count":1}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"a":"12","b":"15","count":2}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"a":"3","b":"4","count":0}}]}],"explanation":"两个 if 是分开的两组，各查各的，每成立一个就给 count 加一次 1。\n\n| a | b | 成立的条件 | count |\n|---:|---:|---|---:|\n| 12 | 7 | 只有 `a >= 10` | 1 |\n| 12 | 15 | 两个都成立 | 2 |\n| 3 | 4 | 都不成立 | 0 |\n"},{"id":"py10.k3.q3","body":"宿主事先给 `signal` 赋了值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nscore = 0\nnote = \"无\"\nif signal >= 15:\n    score = 2\n    note = \"高\"\nelif signal >= 10:\n    score = 1\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"state","type":"table","prompt":"分别在下表的 signal 下运行，写出运行完以后 `score` 和 `note` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"score","header":"score","input":"integer"},{"id":"note","header":"note","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"s16","cells":{"signal":"16","score":2,"note":"高"}},{"id":"s12","cells":{"signal":"12","score":1,"note":"无"}},{"id":"s5","cells":{"signal":"5","score":0,"note":"无"}}]}],"explanation":"| signal | 走的路径 | score | note |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 16 | 第 4、5 行 | 2 | 高 |\n| 12 | 第 7 行 | 1 | 无 |\n| 5 | 两个分支都不走 | 0 | 无 |\n\nsignal 为 12 时只执行了第 7 行，它只改 score；note 没有被改，仍是默认的“无”。signal 为 5 时一个分支都不走，两个名字都保持默认值。\n"},{"id":"py10.k3.q4","body":"阅读完整路径，填写最后的余额，而不是只看初值。\n\n```python\nbalance = 8\nif balance >= 5:\n    balance = balance - 5\nelse:\n    balance = balance + 2\nprint(balance)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"balance","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示","key":3}],"explanation":"条件成立，只执行扣除 5 的路径，余额变成 3；else 中加 2 的动作不会再发生。"},{"id":"py10.k3.q5","body":"这里不是每条路径都会重新赋值。条件为 False 时，最后保留什么值？\n\n```python\nresult = 10\nadjust = False\nif adjust:\n    result = 99\nprint(result)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示","key":10}],"explanation":"result 在进入判断前已有值 10；条件为 False 时不执行重新赋值，所以它保留 10。跳过分支不会清空已经存在的名字。"}],"review":[{"id":"py10.k3.r1","body":"宿主事先给 `ph` 赋了值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nif ph < 6:\n    label = \"酸\"\nelif ph > 8:\n    label = \"碱\"\nprint(label)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fails","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"分别用下面的 ph 运行，哪几次会在第 5 行报错？选出所有会报错的。","options":[{"id":"p5","content":"5"},{"id":"p6","content":"6"},{"id":"p7","content":"7"},{"id":"p9","content":"9"}],"key":["p6","p7"]}],"explanation":"**6 和 7** 会报错。这两个值 `ph < 6` 和 `ph > 8` 都不成立，两个分支都不走，`label` 从来没有被赋值，第 5 行用到它时报 NameError。5 走第一个分支、9 走第二个分支，label 都有值。\n\n这里少了一条“其余情况”的路径：加一个 else，或者在 if 之前给 label 一个默认值。\n"},{"id":"py10.k3.r2","body":"宿主事先给 `signal` 赋了值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nbonus = 0\nif signal >= 15:\n    bonus = bonus + 2\nelif signal >= 10:\n    bonus = bonus + 1\ntotal = signal + bonus\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"table","prompt":"分别在下表的 signal 下运行，写出运行完以后 `total` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"total","header":"total","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"s15","cells":{"signal":"15","total":17}},{"id":"s12","cells":{"signal":"12","total":13}},{"id":"s9","cells":{"signal":"9","total":9}}]}],"explanation":"| signal | 走的路径 | bonus | total |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|\n| 15 | 第 3 行 | 2 | 17 |\n| 12 | 第 5 行 | 1 | 13 |\n| 9 | 都不走 | 0 | 9 |\n\n15 满足第一个条件，只加 2，elif 不再检查；第 6 行不在任何块里，每次都执行。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py10.k3.x1","body":"按实验第几天 `day` 决定组别和剂量。宿主事先给 `day` 赋了值。\n\n```python startLine=1\ngroup = \"对照\"\ndose = 0\nif day >= 3 and day <= 5:\n    group = \"用药\"\n    dose = 10\nelif day > 5:\n    dose = 5\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"state","type":"table","prompt":"分别在下表的 day 下运行，写出运行完以后 `group` 和 `dose` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"day","header":"day"},{"id":"group","header":"group","input":"text"},{"id":"dose","header":"dose","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"d2","cells":{"day":"2","group":"对照","dose":0}},{"id":"d3","cells":{"day":"3","group":"用药","dose":10}},{"id":"d6","cells":{"day":"6","group":"对照","dose":5}}]}],"explanation":"| day | 走的路径 | group | dose |\n|---:|---|---|---:|\n| 2 | 都不走 | 对照 | 0 |\n| 3 | 第 4、5 行 | 用药 | 10 |\n| 6 | 第 7 行 | 对照 | 5 |\n\nday 为 3 时 `day >= 3` 和 `day <= 5` 都成立。day 为 6 时第 3 行的 and 不成立，走 elif，只改了 dose；group 没有被改，仍是默认的“对照”。\n"},{"id":"py10.k3.x2","body":"要求：`count` 小于 0 时 `label` 为“无效”，否则为“有效”。宿主事先给 `count` 赋了值，每段代码之后都会执行 `print(label)`。\n\n哪几段代码对任何整数 `count` 都符合要求，并且 `print(label)` 不会报错？选出所有符合的。\n","slots":[{"id":"programs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"default","content":"```python\nlabel = \"有效\"\nif count < 0:\n    label = \"无效\"\n```\n"},{"id":"only_if","content":"```python\nif count < 0:\n    label = \"无效\"\n```\n"},{"id":"with_else","content":"```python\nif count < 0:\n    label = \"无效\"\nelse:\n    label = \"有效\"\n```\n"},{"id":"two_ifs","content":"```python\nif count < 0:\n    label = \"无效\"\nif count > 0:\n    label = \"有效\"\n```\n"}],"key":["default","with_else"]}],"explanation":"**先给默认值的那段**和**带 else 的那段**符合要求：不论走哪条路径，label 最后都有值，而且值是对的。\n\n只有一个 if 的那段，count 不小于 0 时 label 从来没被赋值，print 会报 NameError。两个 if 的那段漏掉了 count 恰好为 0 的情况：两个条件都不成立，同样报错。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py11","title":"报错告诉你停在了哪里","summary":"分清语法错误（一行都不运行）和运行时异常（停在出错的那一行）；从错误类型和指向的行出发，找出造成问题的值和它是在哪一行定下的。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py03","py06"],"intro":"程序出错时，Python 会停下来，显示一段报错。这一节练习读它：是哪一种错、停在了哪一行、问题可能出在哪里。\n\n题里的程序都当作一个名为 clean.py 的脚本，从第一行往下运行。报错按课程使用的 Python 3.14 的样子给出；别的版本里说明文字可能稍有不同，但错误类型和行号的读法一样。题目只问类型、行号和原因，不要求背说明文字。\n","wrapup":"看到报错，先读最后一行的错误类型，再看它指向第几行，然后回到代码里，找出那一行用到的值是在哪里定下的。语法错误一行都不运行；运行时异常停在出错的那一行，之前的行已经做完了。\n\n把报错交给 AI 或同事时，带上完整的报错和它指向的那几行代码，比只说“程序报错了”有用得多。\n","kps":[{"id":"py11.k1","title":"区分语法错误与运行时异常","key":["py03"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"语法错误与运行时异常","aliases":["SyntaxError","异常","报错"],"definition":"语法错误是 Python 读不懂这段代码，一行都不运行；运行时异常是代码读得懂，运行到某一行出了问题，停在那一行，之前的行已经执行过。","conditions":["看报错最后一行冒号前的类型名：SyntaxError 是语法错误；NameError、TypeError、ValueError 等是运行时异常。","运行时异常之前的 print 已经显示出来了；语法错误时，连第 1 行的 print 也不会显示。"],"example":"```python\nprint(\"开始核对\")\ncount = 3\nlabel = \"样本数：\" + count\n```\n第 3 行把文字和整数相加，报 TypeError，是运行时异常：第 1 行已经显示了“开始核对”，第 3 行之后的代码不再运行。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"Python 运行一个程序分两步：先把整段代码**读一遍**，确认写法合规；读懂了，才从第一行开始**逐行运行**。两步各有一种报错。\n\n**语法错误**：写法不合规，例如括号没有配对、引号没有收尾。Python 在第一步就停下，**一行都不运行**，所以即使第 1 行是 print，也什么都不显示。报错指向 Python 发现读不下去的位置：\n\n```text\n  File \"clean.py\", line 3\n    total = (count + 2\n            ^\nSyntaxError: '(' was never closed\n```\n\n**运行时异常**：写法没有问题，运行到某一行时出了状况，例如把文字和数字相加、用了还没有赋值的名字。这一行之前的代码**已经执行**，它们的 print 已经显示出来；**程序停在出错的这一行**，后面的行不再运行：\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 3, in <module>\n    label = \"样本数：\" + count\n            ~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str\n```\n\n两种报错都先看**最后一行**：冒号前面是错误类型，后面是说明。类型是 SyntaxError 的是语法错误；NameError、TypeError、ValueError、ZeroDivisionError 这些都是运行时异常。`line 3` 是报错指向的行号。\n","example":{"id":"py11.k1.e0","body":"运行 clean.py，最后出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(\"开始核对\")\ncount = 3\nlabel = \"样本数：\" + count\nprint(label)\nprint(\"核对结束\")\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 3, in <module>\n    label = \"样本数：\" + count\n            ~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"这是哪一种报错？","options":[{"id":"syntax","content":"语法错误：Python 读不懂这段代码"},{"id":"runtime","content":"运行时异常：运行到某一行时出了问题"}],"key":"runtime"},{"id":"shown","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"报错出现之前，屏幕上显示了哪些内容？按显示的先后排列，没有显示的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"start","content":"开始核对"},{"id":"label","content":"样本数：3"},{"id":"end","content":"核对结束"}],"key":["start"]},{"id":"after","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4、5 行执行了吗？","options":[{"id":"both","content":"都执行了"},{"id":"neither","content":"都没有执行"},{"id":"last","content":"只执行了第 5 行"}],"key":"neither"}],"explanation":"最后一行的类型是 TypeError，是**运行时异常**：代码读得懂，运行到第 3 行时，文字 `\"样本数：\"` 和整数 `count` 不能直接相加。\n\n运行时异常之前的行已经执行，所以第 1 行的“**开始核对**”已经显示出来了；程序停在第 3 行，第 4、5 行**都没有执行**，“样本数：3”和“核对结束”都不会出现。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py11.k1.q1","body":"这次第 3 行少了一个引号。运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(\"开始核对\")\ncount = 3\nlabel = \"样本数： + str(count)\nprint(label)\nprint(\"核对结束\")\n```\n\n```text\n  File \"clean.py\", line 3\n    label = \"样本数： + str(count)\n            ^\nSyntaxError: unterminated string literal (detected at line 3)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"choice","prompt":"报错出现之前，屏幕上显示了什么？","options":[{"id":"start","content":"显示了“开始核对”"},{"id":"nothing","content":"什么也没有显示"},{"id":"two","content":"显示了“开始核对”和“样本数：3”"}],"key":"nothing"},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么会这样？","options":[{"id":"read_first","content":"Python 先读整段代码，读不懂就一行都不运行"},{"id":"line1_bad","content":"第 1 行本身也写错了"},{"id":"stops_at_3","content":"程序运行到第 3 行才停下"}],"key":"read_first"}],"explanation":"**什么也没有显示。** 最后一行是 SyntaxError：第 3 行的文字少了收尾的引号，Python 在读代码这一步就停下了，一行都没有运行，所以第 1 行写得没错，也不会显示“开始核对”。\n\n对比例题：那里是运行时异常，第 1 行已经运行，“开始核对”显示出来了。\n"},{"id":"py11.k1.q2","body":"下面四段代码各自单独保存成一个文件运行，都会报错。\n\n代码 1：\n\n```python\nratio = 12 / 0\n```\n\n代码 2：\n\n```python\nname = \"S_A\n```\n\n代码 3：\n\n```python\nprint(sample_count)\n```\n\n代码 4：\n\n```python\ntotal = (3 + 4\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"kinds","type":"table","prompt":"每段代码的报错是哪一种？","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"代码"},{"id":"kind","header":"哪一种报错","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"syntax","label":"语法错误"},{"id":"runtime","label":"运行时异常"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"code":"代码 1","kind":"runtime"}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"code":"代码 2","kind":"syntax"}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"code":"代码 3","kind":"runtime"}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"code":"代码 4","kind":"syntax"}}]}],"explanation":"| 代码 | 报错 | 哪一种 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | ZeroDivisionError：除数是 0 | 运行时异常 |\n| 2 | SyntaxError：文字少了收尾的引号 | 语法错误 |\n| 3 | NameError：`sample_count` 还没有赋值 | 运行时异常 |\n| 4 | SyntaxError：括号没有配对 | 语法错误 |\n\n判断的办法：写法本身合不合规？代码 1 和代码 3 写法都没问题，Python 读得懂，是运行时才发现除数为 0、名字不存在。代码 2 和代码 4 缺了引号或括号，Python 读都读不下去。\n"},{"id":"py11.k1.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\nprint(\"第一步：读入\")\nraw = \"12.5\"\nprint(\"第二步：转换\")\nvalue = int(raw)\nprint(\"第三步：完成\")\nprint(value)\n```\n\n提示：`int()` 只认得整数的写法，`int(\"12.5\")` 会报 ValueError。\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"报错之前，屏幕上一共显示了几行？","key":2},{"id":"stop","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序停在第几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"显示了 **2** 行：“第一步：读入”和“第二步：转换”。这是运行时异常，第 1–3 行正常执行；第 **4** 行的 `int(\"12.5\")` 报 ValueError，程序停在这里，第 5、6 行不再运行。\n"},{"id":"py11.k1.q4","body":"这是一整段脚本，不是逐行输入的交互命令。语法错误出现在后面时，前面的 print 会先执行吗？\n\n```python\nprint(\"start\")\nif True\n    print(\"inside\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"出错前显示几行？","key":0},{"id":"error","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"异常类型","key":"SyntaxError"}],"explanation":"整段脚本必须先通过语法分析。if 行缺少冒号使编译失败，所以连第一行 print 也没有开始执行。"},{"id":"py11.k1.q5","body":"这一段语法正确，但运行时会停止。填写已经显示的内容以及异常类型。\n\n```python\nprint(\"start\")\nvalue = 1 / 0\nprint(\"end\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"printed","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"停止前显示的内容","key":"start"},{"id":"error","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"异常类型","key":"ZeroDivisionError"}],"explanation":"脚本能开始运行，先显示 start；第二行除零时才抛出 ZeroDivisionError，因此 end 没有显示。这与编译阶段的 SyntaxError 不同。"}],"review":[{"id":"py11.k1.r1","body":"```python startLine=1\ntotal = 24\ngroups = 0\nprint(\"开始计算\")\nper_group = total / groups\nprint(\"每组的份数：\")\nprint(per_group)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","prompt":"运行这段代码，下面三行 print 各自的内容显示出来了吗？","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示了吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":true}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","shown":false}},{"id":"l6","cells":{"line":"第 6 行","shown":false}}]},{"id":"stop","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序停在第几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"第 4 行除以 0，报 ZeroDivisionError，是运行时异常，程序停在第 **4** 行。之前的第 3 行已经执行，“开始计算”**显示了**；第 5、6 行在出错的行之后，**都没有显示**。\n"},{"id":"py11.k1.r2","body":"运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(\"开始\")\nwidth = 4\nheight = 3\narea = width * height\nprint(\"面积是\" + str(area)\nprint(\"结束\")\n```\n\n```text\n  File \"clean.py\", line 5\n    print(\"面积是\" + str(area)\n         ^\nSyntaxError: '(' was never closed\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"下面哪些说法正确？选出所有正确的。","options":[{"id":"printed","content":"报错之前，屏幕上先显示了“开始”"},{"id":"none_ran","content":"第 1–4 行一行都没有运行"},{"id":"syntax","content":"这是语法错误，第 5 行的括号没有配对"},{"id":"runtime","content":"这是运行时异常，程序运行到第 5 行时停下"}],"key":["none_ran","syntax"]}],"explanation":"正确的是“**第 1–4 行一行都没有运行**”和“**这是语法错误，第 5 行的括号没有配对**”。\n\n最后一行是 SyntaxError：Python 在读代码时发现第 5 行的左括号没有对应的右括号，读不下去，于是一行都没有运行。第 1 行虽然写得没错，“开始”也不会显示。它不是运行到第 5 行才停下的。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py11.k1.x1","body":"下面五段代码各自单独保存成一个文件运行，第 1 行都是 `print(\"开始\")`，第 2 行都有问题。\n\n代码 1：\n\n```python\nprint(\"开始\")\nlabel = \"第\" + 3 + \"组\"\n```\n\n代码 2：\n\n```python\nprint(\"开始\")\ncount = 3 +\n```\n\n代码 3：\n\n```python\nprint(\"开始\")\nname = 'S_A\"\n```\n\n代码 4：\n\n```python\nprint(\"开始\")\nvalue = float(\"abc\")\n```\n\n代码 5：\n\n```python\nprint(\"开始\")\nratio = 5 / (2 - 2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","prompt":"运行每一段，报错之前屏幕上有没有显示“开始”？","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"代码"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示了“开始”","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"code":"代码 1","shown":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"code":"代码 2","shown":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"code":"代码 3","shown":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"code":"代码 4","shown":true}},{"id":"c5","cells":{"code":"代码 5","shown":true}}]},{"id":"common","type":"choice","prompt":"没有显示“开始”的那几段，有什么共同点？","options":[{"id":"syntax","content":"都是语法错误：Python 读不懂整段代码，一行都没有运行"},{"id":"line1","content":"都是第 1 行的 print 写错了"},{"id":"name_error","content":"报的都是 NameError"}],"key":"syntax"}],"explanation":"| 代码 | 报错 | 屏幕上有“开始”吗 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | TypeError：文字和整数不能直接相加，停在第 2 行 | 有，第 1 行已经运行了 |\n| 2 | SyntaxError：`+` 后面缺了东西 | 没有，整段读不懂，一行也没运行 |\n| 3 | SyntaxError：单引号开头、双引号结尾，文字没有收尾 | 没有 |\n| 4 | ValueError：`\"abc\"` 不是数的写法，停在第 2 行 | 有 |\n| 5 | ZeroDivisionError：`2 - 2` 是 0，停在第 2 行 | 有 |\n\n显示不显示“开始”，正好分出两种报错：语法错误发生在读代码的时候，第 1 行也不会运行；运行时异常发生在运行到那一行的时候，前面的行已经执行了。\n"},{"id":"py11.k1.x2","body":"列表 `signals` 里有三个测量值，位置从 0 开始数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\nprint(\"第一个：\")\nprint(signals[0])\nprint(\"第四个：\")\nprint(signals[3])\nprint(\"读完了\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行这段代码，报错之前屏幕上一共显示了几行？","key":3},{"id":"last","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"报错之前显示的最后一行是什么？","key":"第四个："},{"id":"stop","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序停在第几行？","key":5}],"explanation":"列表只有位置 0、1、2，`signals[3]` 超出范围，第 **5** 行报 IndexError，这是运行时异常。之前的第 2–4 行已经执行，显示了“第一个：”“8”“第四个：”共 **3** 行，最后一行是“**第四个：**”；“读完了”不会显示。\n"},{"id":"py11.k1.x3","body":"这是一份完整脚本。语法分析失败时，前面的显示也不会开始。填写屏幕显示的行数。\n\n```python\nprint(\"before\")\nprint(\"unclosed\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"0"}],"explanation":"第二行缺少右括号，整段脚本在编译阶段就发生 SyntaxError，没有任何一行开始运行。"},{"id":"py11.k1.x4","body":"语法正确而运行时停止的脚本，可以保留停止前的显示。只填实际已经显示的一行。\n\n```python\nprint(\"ready\")\nprint(unknown_value)\nprint(\"finished\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"ready"}],"explanation":"第一行已执行，第二行读取未定义名字时发生 NameError；finished 所在行不会执行。"}]},{"id":"py11.k2","title":"从异常类型和指向的行缩小原因","key":["py03","py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"读报错","aliases":["traceback","报错信息","异常类型"],"definition":"先读最后一行的错误类型，再看它指向的行和这一行用到的值；程序停下的行不一定是要改的行，造成问题的值可能在更早的行就定下了。","conditions":["NameError 看拼写和这个名字之前有没有赋值；TypeError 看值的类型；ValueError 看值的写法；ZeroDivisionError 看除数从哪里来。","修改要针对原因：在出错的行上硬改一个值让它不报错，可能得到错误的结果。"],"example":"```python\nused = 5\nleft = total - used\ntotal = 12\n```\n报错指向第 2 行的 NameError：用到 total 时它还没有赋值。要改的是顺序，把 `total = 12` 移到前面，而不是在第 2 行前面随便给 total 一个值。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"一段报错从下往上读最快。\n\n**1. 最后一行：错误类型和说明。** 类型告诉你是哪一类问题：\n\n| 类型 | 意思 | 先去看 |\n|---|---|---|\n| NameError | 这个名字还不存在 | 拼写（大小写也算）；用到它之前有没有赋过值 |\n| TypeError | 这种类型的值不能这样用 | 这一行里各个值是什么类型，例如文字和整数直接相加，或者值是 None |\n| ValueError | 类型对了，但内容不认得 | 值的写法，例如 `int(\"12.5\")`、`float(\"12,5\")` |\n| ZeroDivisionError | 除数是 0 | 除数是从哪里算出来的 |\n| IndexError | 位置超出了列表的范围 | 列表有几项，位置从 0 开始数 |\n\n**2. 上面的 `File \"clean.py\", line 5`：程序停在第几行。** 下面一行是那一行代码，`^` 和 `~` 标出出问题的那一段。\n\n**3. 回到代码里**：找出这一行用到了哪些值，再往上找它们是在哪一行定下的。\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 5, in <module>\n    per_sample = total / usable\n                 ~~~~~~^~~~~~~~\nZeroDivisionError: division by zero\n```\n\n这个报错指向第 5 行，但第 5 行本身写得没错：问题是 `usable` 是 0。要往上看 usable 是怎样算出 0 的，也许是第 4 行的减法，也许是更早的数据。**程序停下的行，不一定是要改的行。**\n\n改的时候要针对原因。在出错的行前面随手加一个 `usable = 1`，报错没了，结果却是错的。\n\n以后读 AI 或别人写的代码，报错可能有很多层，夹着库里的文件。办法一样：最后一行看类型，再在报错里找到你自己的文件名和那一行。\n","example":{"id":"py11.k2.e0","body":"运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount = 3\nlabel = \"样本数：\" + count\nprint(label)\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 2, in <module>\n    label = \"样本数：\" + count\n            ~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"undefined","content":"`count` 这个名字还没有赋值"},{"id":"number","content":"`count` 是整数，不能直接和文字相加"},{"id":"label","content":"文字“样本数：”写错了"}],"key":"number"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要显示“样本数：3”，第 2 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"quoted","content":"```python\nlabel = \"样本数：\" + \"count\"\n```\n"},{"id":"to_int","content":"```python\nlabel = \"样本数：\" + int(count)\n```\n"},{"id":"to_str","content":"```python\nlabel = \"样本数：\" + str(count)\n```\n"}],"key":"to_str"}],"explanation":"最后一行是 TypeError：这一行里有一个值的类型不对。第 2 行用到两个值，`\"样本数：\"` 是文字，`count` 是第 1 行赋的整数 3；文字只能和文字相加，所以问题是 **count 是整数**。\n\n改法是先把 count 转成文字：`\"样本数：\" + str(count)`，得到“样本数：3”。写成 `\"count\"` 会接上字母 count 本身，显示“样本数：count”；`int(count)` 还是整数，报同样的错。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py11.k2.q1","body":"运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。程序原本应显示 7。\n\n```python startLine=1\nused = 5\nleft = total - used\ntotal = 12\nprint(left)\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 2, in <module>\n    left = total - used\n           ^^^^^\nNameError: name 'total' is not defined\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"typo","content":"`total` 拼错了"},{"id":"not_yet","content":"第 2 行用到 `total` 时，它还没有被赋值"},{"id":"minus","content":"整数不能做减法"}],"key":"not_yet"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改，程序才会显示 7？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"在第 2 行前面加一行 `total = 0`"},{"id":"move","content":"把第 3 行 `total = 12` 移到第 2 行前面"},{"id":"rename","content":"把第 2 行的 `total` 改成 `used`"}],"key":"move"}],"explanation":"NameError 说 `total` 还不存在。拼写没有问题，第 3 行确实给 total 赋了值，但程序从上往下运行，第 2 行**用到 total 时，第 3 行还没有执行**。\n\n要改的是顺序：**把 `total = 12` 移到第 2 行前面**，left 就是 12 - 5 = 7。在第 2 行前面加 `total = 0` 也不会报错，但 left 成了 -5；把 total 改成 used 得到 0。两种都只是让报错消失，结果是错的。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.q2","body":"从一份表格里抄来的读数是 `\"12,5\"`。运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nraw = \"12,5\"\nvalue = float(raw)\ndoubled = value * 2\nprint(doubled)\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 2, in <module>\n    value = float(raw)\nValueError: could not convert string to float: '12,5'\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"text","content":"raw 是文字，文字都不能转成小数"},{"id":"comma","content":"小数点写成了逗号，float 认不出这种写法"},{"id":"multiply","content":"第 3 行的乘法写错了"}],"key":"comma"},{"id":"fixed","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"如果把第 1 行改成 `raw = \"12.5\"`，第 4 行显示什么？","key":"25.0","feedback":[{"when":"25","message":"value 是 float 转出来的小数，乘 2 以后仍是小数，显示 25.0。"}]}],"explanation":"ValueError 说明类型没问题（float 本来就是把文字转成小数），但**内容的写法认不出来**：`\"12,5\"` 用逗号当小数点，Python 只认 `\"12.5\"` 这种写法。文字并不是都不能转，`float(\"12.5\")` 就可以；报错停在第 2 行，第 3 行根本没有运行。\n\n改成 `\"12.5\"` 以后，value 是 12.5，doubled 是 **25.0**。真实数据里，这类问题要先弄清整列读数是怎样写的，再决定怎样转换，而不是改一个值了事。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.q3","body":"宿主事先给 `count` 赋了一个文字形式的整数，例如 `\"12\"`，它是从文件里读来的。要求：显示加上 3 份以后的总数，例如 count 为 `\"12\"` 时显示 15。\n\n作答框里的代码运行时报 TypeError：\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 1, in <module>\n    total = count + 3\n            ~~~~~~^~~\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str\n```\n\n改动代码，让它符合要求。不要自己给 count 赋值。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"total = count + 3\nprint(total)\n","solution":"total = int(count) + 3\nprint(total)\n","accepts":["count = int(count)\ntotal = count + 3\nprint(total)\n","print(int(count) + 3)"],"rejects":[{"code":"total = count + \"3\"\nprint(total)\n","why":"把 3 也写成文字，得到的是拼接出的“123”"},{"code":"total = 15\nprint(total)\n","why":"照着例子写死了结果"},{"code":"total = float(count) + 3\nprint(total)\n","why":"转成了小数，显示 15.0"}],"tests":[{"name":"count 为 \"12\"","setup":"count = \"12\"","stdout":"15"},{"name":"count 为 \"40\"","hidden":true,"setup":"count = \"40\"","stdout":"43"}]}],"explanation":"TypeError 说文字和整数不能直接相加：count 虽然看起来是 12，其实是文字 `\"12\"`。先用 `int(count)` 把它转成整数，再加 3：\n\n```python\ntotal = int(count) + 3\nprint(total)\n```\n\n写成 `count + \"3\"` 不会报错，但得到的是两段文字接起来的“123”。判分时还会换一个 count 运行你的代码。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.q4","body":"只根据异常类型和停止行定位问题。哪一项是对原因的准确判断？\n\n```python startLine=1\nnames = [\"Li\", \"Wu\"]\nselected = names[2]\nprint(selected)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"index","content":"第 2 行 IndexError，列表没有下标 2"},{"id":"print","content":"第 3 行 NameError，因为 print 不认识 selected"},{"id":"syntax","content":"第 1 行 SyntaxError，因为列表不能存文字"}],"key":"index"}],"explanation":"列表只有下标 0、1，第 2 行取下标 2 时就停止了。第 3 行没有执行，不能把后续可能遇到的问题当成这次的原因。"},{"id":"py11.k2.q5","body":"同一个 + 号，输入类型不同时可能报错。填写出错行号和异常类型。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount = \"3\"\nnext_count = count + 1\nprint(next_count)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"出错行号","key":2},{"id":"error","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"异常类型","key":"TypeError"}],"explanation":"count 已经定义，但它指向文字 '3'。第 2 行试图把 str 与 int 相加，因此是 TypeError，而不是未定义名字的 NameError。"}],"review":[{"id":"py11.k2.r1","body":"运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntotal = 24\nsamples = 5\nper_box = 8\nboxes = int(samples / per_box)\nper_box_signal = total / boxes\nprint(per_box_signal)\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 5, in <module>\n    per_box_signal = total / boxes\n                     ~~~~~~^~~~~~~\nZeroDivisionError: division by zero\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"第 5 行里，哪个值出了问题？","options":[{"id":"total","content":"`total`"},{"id":"boxes","content":"`boxes`"},{"id":"per_box_signal","content":"`per_box_signal`"}],"key":"boxes"},{"id":"set_at","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这个值是在第几行变成 0 的？","key":4},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"它为什么是 0？","options":[{"id":"floor","content":"5 个样本装不满一盒 8 个的盒子：5 / 8 是 0.625，`int()` 直接截掉小数部分，所以是 0"},{"id":"minus","content":"5 减 8 得到 0"},{"id":"zero_input","content":"`samples` 本来就是 0"}],"key":"floor"}],"explanation":"ZeroDivisionError 说除数是 0。第 5 行的除数是 **`boxes`**；往上找，它是第 **4** 行 `int(samples / per_box)` 算出来的：5 / 8 是 0.625，`int()` 直接截掉小数部分，得到 0。\n\n第 5 行本身写得没错，要追问的是第 4 行的结果：样本不够装满一盒时，盒数算成 0 对不对，还要不要往下算？这是数据和需求上的问题，不是把除数改成 1 就能解决的。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.r2","body":"下面是四段报错的最后一行。为每一段选出最可能的原因，每个原因只对应一段。\n\n报错 1：\n\n```text\nNameError: name 'Signal' is not defined. Did you mean: 'signal'?\n```\n\n报错 2：\n\n```text\nTypeError: can only concatenate str (not \"int\") to str\n```\n\n报错 3：\n\n```text\nValueError: invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'abc'\n```\n\n报错 4：\n\n```text\nZeroDivisionError: division by zero\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"causes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"error","header":"报错"},{"id":"cause","header":"最可能的原因","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"case","label":"名字的大小写写错了"},{"id":"mix","label":"把文字和整数直接相加"},{"id":"content","label":"要转成整数的文字不是整数的写法"},{"id":"divisor","label":"除数算出来是 0"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"e1","cells":{"error":"报错 1","cause":"case"}},{"id":"e2","cells":{"error":"报错 2","cause":"mix"}},{"id":"e3","cells":{"error":"报错 3","cause":"content"}},{"id":"e4","cells":{"error":"报错 4","cause":"divisor"}}]}],"explanation":"- 报错 1：NameError 是名字不存在；“Did you mean: 'signal'?”提示有一个只差大小写的名字，原因是**大小写写错了**。\n- 报错 2：TypeError 是类型不对，说明里说只能把文字和文字接起来，原因是**把文字和整数直接相加**。\n- 报错 3：ValueError 是内容不认得，`int()` 收到的 `'abc'` 不是整数的写法。\n- 报错 4：ZeroDivisionError 就是**除数为 0**。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.r3","body":"错误行中出现的名字，不一定就是未定义的名字。这里读到了已定义的整数，但不支持所用操作；填写异常类型。\n\n```python\ncount = 3\nprint(count[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"TypeError"}],"explanation":"count 已经定义，问题在于整数不能按下标取元素，实际异常是 TypeError，而不是 NameError。"},{"id":"py11.k2.r4","body":"程序在访问列表越界位置时停止，后面的显示没有执行。只填写停止前已经显示的一行。\n\n```python\nprint(\"before\")\nvalues = [1, 2]\nprint(values[4])\nprint(\"after\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"before"}],"explanation":"第二次 print 求值时出现 IndexError，after 不会执行；应定位越界访问而不是修改后面的输出语句。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py11.k2.x1","body":"基线读数是从表格里抄来的。运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignal = 15\nbaseline = \"3\"\nnote = \"基线从表格读入\"\nchange = signal - baseline\nprint(change)\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 4, in <module>\n    change = signal - baseline\n             ~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~\nTypeError: unsupported operand type(s) for -: 'int' and 'str'\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 行里，哪个值让减法做不下去？","options":[{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"baseline","content":"`baseline`"},{"id":"change","content":"`change`"}],"key":"baseline"},{"id":"set_at","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这个值是在第几行定下的？","key":2}],"explanation":"TypeError 的说明是：减法的两边一个是 int（整数）、一个是 str（文字）。第 4 行的 `signal` 是整数 15，**`baseline`** 是带引号的 `\"3\"`，是文字，文字不能参加减法。它是第 **2** 行定下的。\n\n`change` 在第 4 行还没有算出来，不会是原因。要改的是 baseline 的类型，例如用 `int(baseline)` 转成整数；如果整列读数都是这样读进来的，更该在读入的地方一次处理好。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.x2","body":"想显示列表里最后一个测量值 13。运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\nprint(\"最后一个测量值：\")\nprint(signals[3])\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 3, in <module>\n    print(signals[3])\n          ~~~~~~~^^^\nIndexError: list index out of range\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fixes","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"把第 3 行改成下面哪几种写法，能显示 13？选出所有可以的。","options":[{"id":"two","content":"```python\nprint(signals[2])\n```\n"},{"id":"minus_one","content":"```python\nprint(signals[-1])\n```\n"},{"id":"one","content":"```python\nprint(signals[1])\n```\n"},{"id":"four","content":"```python\nprint(signals[4])\n```\n"}],"key":["two","minus_one"]}],"explanation":"IndexError 说位置超出了列表的范围：三个值的位置是 0、1、2，没有位置 3。最后一个值在位置 **2**，也可以用 **-1** 表示“倒数第一个”。`signals[1]` 是 10；`signals[4]` 同样超出范围。\n"},{"id":"py11.k2.x3","body":"名字确实存在，但对象类型不支持这项运算。填写实际异常类型，而不是笼统写“名字有问题”。\n\n```python\ntext = \"4\"\nprint(text - 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"TypeError"}],"explanation":"text 已经定义为 str，问题是字符串不能与整数做减法，因此是 TypeError，而不是 NameError。"},{"id":"py11.k2.x4","body":"先看异常发生的位置，区分“变量不存在”和“列表位置不存在”。填写实际异常类型。\n\n```python\nvalues = [8]\nprint(values[1])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"IndexError"}],"explanation":"values 这个名字存在，但只有位置 0；访问不存在的位置 1 导致 IndexError。"}]}]},{"id":"py12","title":"把“处理一下”变成可核对的要求","summary":"把一句含糊的数据处理要求说成别人能照做、能核对的规则，并用边界例子检查它。","minutes":20,"prereq":[],"intro":"这一节不写 Python。你会看到一些小表，任务是把一句含糊的要求，说成别人拿到同一张表就能照做、结果也能核对的规则。\n\n题目里的阈值都是题目自己的约定，不是科研结论。\n","wrapup":"当你把“多一点”“正常”“处理一下”改成可以检查的规则时，你在帮双方少猜一步。遇到还没定下的统计口径，能问出问题本身就够了，不必替研究者作科学判断。\n","kps":[{"id":"py12.k1","title":"说清输入、筛选规则和输出","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"可核对的要求","aliases":["需求","筛选规则"],"definition":"一份要求说清从哪张表取数、按哪一列用什么条件留下哪些行、输出哪些列、按什么顺序，别人照做时不用再猜。","conditions":["“至少”“超过”这类词要落实成 ≥ 或 >，写明等于阈值的算不算。","还没确定的条件要追问，不能替对方补成既定事实。"],"example":"“把高的挑出来”确认之后写成：从 samples 表中保留 signal 大于或等于 10 的行，只输出 sample_id 一列，保持输入中的原顺序。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"同事说“把高的挑出来给我”。这句话听着清楚，交给别人去做，却至少留下三处要猜的空白：\n\n- **比较哪一列**：是 signal，还是别的测量值？\n- **多高算高**：阈值是多少？恰好等于阈值的算不算？\n- **要什么结果**：只要样本编号，还是整行？按原来的顺序，还是重新排序？\n\n把已经确认的条件写成一句别人能照做的话：“从 samples 表中保留 signal 大于或等于 10 的行，只输出 sample_id 一列，保持输入中的原顺序。”这样写之后，任何人拿到同一张表，都会得到同一个结果。\n\n还没确定的条件要去问，而不是替对方补上。数据来自哪张表、每行代表什么、缺失值怎样处理，只要会影响结果，也要说明或者追问。\n","example":{"id":"py12.k1.e0","body":"同事说：“把高的挑出来给我。”你向同事确认了：\n\n- 输入是 samples 表，sample_id 各不相同，signal 是完整的整数列；\n- “高”指 signal 至少为 10；\n- 只要样本编号，并保持输入行的顺序。\n\n把这条要求填成下面五个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"按哪一列筛选","options":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"sample_id"},{"id":"signal","content":"signal"}],"key":"signal"},{"id":"operator","type":"choice","prompt":"比较关系","options":[{"id":"ge","content":"大于或等于（≥）"},{"id":"gt","content":"大于（>）"},{"id":"eq","content":"等于（=）"},{"id":"le","content":"小于或等于（≤）"}],"key":"ge"},{"id":"threshold","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"阈值","key":10},{"id":"output","type":"choice","prompt":"输出哪些列","options":[{"id":"id_signal","content":"sample_id 和 signal"},{"id":"all","content":"全部列"},{"id":"id_only","content":"只有 sample_id"}],"key":"id_only"},{"id":"order","type":"choice","prompt":"行的顺序","options":[{"id":"desc","content":"按 signal 从高到低"},{"id":"original","content":"输入中的原顺序"},{"id":"by_id","content":"按 sample_id 排序"}],"key":"original"}],"explanation":"可以写成：**从 samples 表中保留 signal 大于或等于 10 的行，只输出 sample_id 一列，保持输入中的原顺序。**\n\n这句话没有擅自排序，也没有改变“至少”的含义。“不低于 10”与“大于或等于 10”说的是同一件事，用自己的话写也可以。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py12.k1.q1","body":"输入还是 samples 表，各列含义同上。负责人明确说：“signal 严格大于 12 的样本，只给 sample_id，按原顺序。”把它填成五个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"按哪一列筛选","options":[{"id":"signal","content":"signal"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"sample_id"}],"key":"signal"},{"id":"operator","type":"choice","prompt":"比较关系","options":[{"id":"ge","content":"大于或等于（≥）","feedback":"“严格大于”不包含 12 本身。"},{"id":"eq","content":"等于（=）"},{"id":"gt","content":"大于（>）"},{"id":"le","content":"小于或等于（≤）"}],"key":"gt"},{"id":"threshold","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"阈值","key":12},{"id":"output","type":"choice","prompt":"输出哪些列","options":[{"id":"id_signal","content":"sample_id 和 signal"},{"id":"all","content":"全部列"},{"id":"id_only","content":"只有 sample_id"}],"key":"id_only"},{"id":"order","type":"choice","prompt":"行的顺序","options":[{"id":"by_id","content":"按 sample_id 排序"},{"id":"desc","content":"按 signal 从高到低"},{"id":"original","content":"输入中的原顺序"}],"key":"original"}],"explanation":"signal；大于（>）；12；只有 sample_id；原顺序。“严格大于 12”不包含恰好等于 12 的样本，所以不能选“大于或等于”。\n"},{"id":"py12.k1.q2","body":"已确认的要求是：“signal 至少 10，只输出 sample_id，保留原顺序。”有人把它改写成：\n\n> signal 大于 10 的行全部留下，输出所有列，并按 signal 从高到低排序。\n\n这份改写在哪几处改变了要求？选出所有改变了的地方。\n","slots":[{"id":"changes","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"threshold","content":"阈值是否包含等号"},{"id":"columns","content":"输出列"},{"id":"order","content":"行顺序"},{"id":"table","content":"输入表"}],"key":["threshold","columns","order"]}],"explanation":"改变了三处：“大于 10”去掉了等于 10 的行；“输出所有列”多出了 sample_id 以外的列；“按 signal 从高到低排序”打乱了原顺序。输入表没有变。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分；只有三处都选出、并且没有误选输入表，才算完全答对。\n"},{"id":"py12.k1.q4","body":"同事说：“把报名表整理一下，只要成年人，发我结果。”输入已有 age、name、email 三列。\n为了让另一个人能独立执行，还应优先补清哪组信息？\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"style","content":"喜欢浅色还是深色界面"},{"id":"contract","content":"成年是否包含 18 岁，以及输出哪些列、保存成什么文件"},{"id":"tool","content":"对方最喜欢用什么编辑器"}],"key":"contract"}],"explanation":"年龄边界决定筛选结果；输出列与文件形式决定交付内容。编辑器和界面外观不会消除这份数据处理要求中的歧义。"},{"id":"py12.k1.q5","body":"“列出库存不足的商品”已有明确输入文件和输出列。下面哪条补充让筛选规则可以直接核对？\n","slots":[{"id":"rule","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"vague","content":"把不太够用的挑出来"},{"id":"fixed","content":"保留 stock 小于 5 的行，stock 恰好为 5 时不保留"},{"id":"pretty","content":"尽量整理得清楚一些"}],"key":"fixed"}],"explanation":"stock < 5 给出了字段、运算与阈值，还明确了等号边界，因此不同执行者能得到同一份筛选结果。"}],"review":[{"id":"py12.k1.r1","body":"负责人确认的要求是：“保留 depth 不超过 30 的样本，输出 sample_id 和 depth 两列，保持原顺序。”下面哪一种改写与它完全一致？\n","slots":[{"id":"rewrite","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"strict","content":"保留 depth 小于 30 的样本，输出 sample_id 和 depth，保持原顺序","feedback":"“不超过 30”包含恰好等于 30 的样本，“小于 30”不包含。"},{"id":"all_columns","content":"保留 depth 不超过 30 的样本，输出全部列，保持原顺序"},{"id":"sorted","content":"保留 depth 不超过 30 的样本，输出 sample_id 和 depth，按 depth 从小到大排列"},{"id":"faithful","content":"保留 depth 小于或等于 30 的样本，只输出 sample_id 和 depth 两列，行的顺序与输入相同"}],"key":"faithful"}],"explanation":"“小于或等于 30、只输出 sample_id 和 depth 两列、行的顺序与输入相同”这一种。“不超过 30”就是“小于或等于 30”；写成“小于 30”会去掉等于 30 的样本，“输出全部列”多出了列，“按 depth 从小到大排列”改了行的顺序。\n"},{"id":"py12.k1.r2","body":"同事写下的要求是：“从 samples 表保留 temperature 低于 5 的样本，等于 5 的不要，按 temperature 从低到高排列。”别人照做时，还要猜哪几项？选出所有缺少的信息。\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"table","content":"用哪张表"},{"id":"comparison","content":"等于 5 的样本算不算"},{"id":"columns","content":"输出哪些列"},{"id":"order","content":"行的顺序"}],"key":["columns"]}],"explanation":"只缺**输出哪些列**。表名写了；“等于 5 的不要”说清了等于阈值的算不算；排序方式也写了。缺的那一项要补上，别人才不用猜。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py12.k1.x1","body":"负责人确认：“保留 count 至少为 3 的记录，只输出 site 一列，保持原顺序。”把它填成五个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"按哪一列筛选","options":[{"id":"count","content":"count"},{"id":"site","content":"site"}],"key":"count"},{"id":"operator","type":"choice","prompt":"比较关系","options":[{"id":"gt","content":"大于（>）"},{"id":"lt","content":"小于（<）"},{"id":"ge","content":"大于或等于（≥）"},{"id":"le","content":"小于或等于（≤）"}],"key":"ge"},{"id":"threshold","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"阈值","key":3},{"id":"output","type":"choice","prompt":"输出哪些列","options":[{"id":"site_count","content":"site 和 count"},{"id":"site_only","content":"只有 site"},{"id":"all","content":"全部列"}],"key":"site_only"},{"id":"order","type":"choice","prompt":"行的顺序","options":[{"id":"desc","content":"按 count 从多到少"},{"id":"by_site","content":"按 site 排序"},{"id":"original","content":"输入中的原顺序"}],"key":"original"}],"explanation":"count；大于或等于（≥）；3；只有 site；原顺序。“至少为 3”包含恰好为 3 的记录。\n"},{"id":"py12.k1.x2","body":"同事说：“把信号弱的样本去掉。”你还不知道“弱”指什么，也没有被授权自己决定。下一步最合适的是哪一句？\n","slots":[{"id":"next","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"assume","content":"“我先按 signal < 10 去掉了。”"},{"id":"half","content":"“我把 signal 最低的一半样本去掉了。”"},{"id":"ask","content":"“‘信号弱’是指 signal 低于多少？恰好等于这个值的要不要去掉？”"},{"id":"proceed","content":"“好的，马上处理。”"}],"key":"ask"}],"explanation":"应当先追问：阈值是多少、等于阈值的算不算。自己定一个阈值或比例，都是替对方补上了还没确认的条件；直接答应则把猜测留给了后面的人。\n"},{"id":"py12.k1.x3","body":"需求是：“把活动报名表里合适的人选出来，发我名单。”输入文件已经给出。\n下列哪项补充同时明确了筛选规则与输出内容？\n","slots":[{"id":"contract","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"concrete","content":"保留 age 至少为 18 的行，只输出 name 和 email 两列为名单 CSV"},{"id":"vague","content":"挑年龄差不多的人，整理得好看一些"},{"id":"implementation","content":"让 AI 随便选一个 Python 库"}],"key":"concrete"}],"explanation":"“保留 age 至少为 18 的行，只输出 name 和 email 两列为名单 CSV”写清了筛选列、包含等号的阈值、输出列与文件形式，能让执行者独立得到可核对的结果。"},{"id":"py12.k1.x4","body":"输入表有 stock 和 reserved 两列。需求方已经说清“输出商品编号为 CSV”，但只说“找库存紧张的商品”。\n下一步最需要确认什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"clarification","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"color","content":"CSV 用什么界面颜色打开"},{"id":"rule","content":"紧张是按 stock 还是扣除 reserved 后的可用量判断，阈值是多少、等号是否包含"},{"id":"repeat","content":"再问一次是否要输出商品编号，忽略筛选规则"}],"key":"rule"}],"explanation":"输出已清楚，剩下的歧义在筛选的字段含义与阈值边界。补清这一项才能让不同执行者选出同一批商品。"}]},{"id":"py12.k2","title":"用正常、边界和无结果例子消除歧义","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"边界例子","aliases":["反例","测试例子"],"definition":"用一个应留下的普通值、一个应丢弃的普通值、一个恰好等于阈值的值，以及“没有任何行满足”的情况，检查一条规则有没有歧义。","conditions":["恰好等于阈值的行专门检查等号：≥ 10 与 > 10 只在等于 10 的行上不同。","例子用来检查规则，不能代替适用于新输入的规则。"],"example":"要求 signal ≥ 10，输入 A=9、B=10、C=12：输出 B、C。B 恰好等于 10，专门检查“包含等号”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"输入表 samples","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B","C"],"signal":[9,10,12]}}]},"lesson":"一句要求读起来没问题，落到一行具体数据上，分歧才会暴露出来。检查一条要求时，可以按顺序举四种例子：\n\n1. 一个**应当留下**的普通值，例如 signal 为 12；\n2. 一个**应当丢弃**的普通值，例如 signal 为 9；\n3. 一个**恰好等于阈值**的值，例如 signal 为 10：“至少 10”留下它，“超过 10”丢弃它；\n4. **没有任何行满足**时输出什么：一张只有列名、没有行的表，而不是写着“无”的一行，也不是数字 0。\n\n这些例子帮你和对方确认规则，但例子本身不是规则：换一张新表，仍要按规则逐行判断。\n","example":{"id":"py12.k2.e0","body":"要求：保留 signal 大于或等于 10 的行，只输出 sample_id，保持原顺序。\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按输出的先后顺序排出留下的 sample_id；不该留下的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"A","content":"A"},{"id":"B","content":"B"},{"id":"C","content":"C"}],"key":["B","C"]},{"id":"boundary","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行专门检查“包含等号”？","options":[{"id":"A","content":"A"},{"id":"B","content":"B"},{"id":"C","content":"C"}],"key":"B"}],"explanation":"输出 **B、C**，B 是边界例子：它恰好等于 10，“至少 10”留下它，“超过 10”会丢掉它。A 检查低于阈值的情况，C 检查高于阈值的情况。结果是一列两行的样本编号，不把 signal 也加进输出。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"输入表 samples","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B","C"],"signal":[9,10,12]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py12.k2.q1","body":"要求仍是：保留 signal 大于或等于 10 的行，只输出 sample_id，保持原顺序。\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按输出的先后顺序排出留下的 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"A","content":"A"},{"id":"B","content":"B"},{"id":"C","content":"C"},{"id":"D","content":"D"}],"key":["B","C","D"]}],"explanation":"输出 **B、C、D**。B 和 D 恰好等于 10，也要留下；顺序保持输入中的先后，不按 signal 排序。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"输入表 samples","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B","C","D"],"signal":[9,10,11,10]}}]},{"id":"py12.k2.q2","body":"要求不变：保留 signal 大于或等于 10 的行，只输出 sample_id，保持原顺序。需求还规定：没有结果时，也要保留输出的列名。\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"输出有几行？","key":0},{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"输出里保留哪一列的列名？","options":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"sample_id"},{"id":"none","content":"不保留任何列，写一行“无”"},{"id":"both","content":"sample_id 和 signal"}],"key":"sample_id"}],"explanation":"**0 行**，仍然有 **sample_id** 这一列的列名。没有结果不等于输出一行写着“无”，也不是数字 0，更不能沿用上一次的结果。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"输入表 samples","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B"],"signal":[8,9]}}]},{"id":"py12.k2.q3","body":"实现甲按“signal ≥ 10”筛选，实现乙按“signal > 10”筛选。请构造一行输入，让两个实现给出不同的结果：填一个样本编号和 signal 值，再分别写出这一行在甲、乙中是否留下。\n","slots":[{"id":"sample","type":"text","prompt":"样本编号（自己起一个）","match":"nonempty"},{"id":"signal","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"signal 值","key":10},{"id":"first","type":"choice","prompt":"在实现甲中","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"留下"},{"id":"drop","content":"丢弃"}],"key":"keep"},{"id":"second","type":"choice","prompt":"在实现乙中","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"留下"},{"id":"drop","content":"丢弃"}],"key":"drop"}],"explanation":"signal 必须**恰好是 10**：甲留下，乙丢弃。样本编号写什么都可以，只要不是空的；关键是这个值落在两条规则唯一的分歧上。\n"},{"id":"py12.k2.q4","body":"规则是“分数至少 60 才通过”。只能增加一条检查来区分 score > 60 与 score >= 60，应该用哪个分数？\n","slots":[{"id":"boundary","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"low","content":"20"},{"id":"at","content":"60"},{"id":"high","content":"90"}],"key":"at"}],"explanation":"两种条件在 20 与 90 上给出相同结果，只有恰好位于边界的 60 能把漏掉等号的问题暴露出来。"},{"id":"py12.k2.q5","body":"规则是“把库存小于 5 的行输出成表”。输入的库存只有 8、9、10。\n下面哪项应当补进验收例子，才能约定无结果时的行为？\n","slots":[{"id":"empty","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"no_file","content":"不管是否有结果，都直接省略输出约定"},{"id":"extra","content":"再加一条库存为 1 的正常例子就够了"},{"id":"defined","content":"这份输入输出 0 行，但仍保留约定的列名和输出文件"}],"key":"defined"}],"explanation":"原输入没有任何行满足条件，正适合核对无结果行为。明确保留列名和文件，可以避免有人不输出、有人输出空表的分歧。"}],"review":[{"id":"py12.k2.r1","body":"同事的实现在这张 samples 上运行，输出是 B、C、D 三个 sample_id（只有这一列，保持原顺序）。他说这个实现是照要求写的，可你没看到要求原文。\n","slots":[{"id":"rules","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"下面哪些要求，用在这张表上都会得到 B、C、D？选出全部。","options":[{"id":"ge7","content":"signal 大于或等于 7"},{"id":"gt7","content":"signal 大于 7"},{"id":"gt4","content":"signal 大于 4"},{"id":"ge8","content":"signal 大于或等于 8"}],"key":["ge7","gt4"]},{"id":"value","type":"choice","prompt":"要分清“大于或等于 7”和“大于 4”到底是哪一个，在表里补一行，signal 取下面哪个值最合适？","options":[{"id":"v3","content":"3"},{"id":"v5","content":"5"},{"id":"v7","content":"7"},{"id":"v9","content":"9"}],"key":"v5"}],"explanation":"按这张表的四个 signal（4、7、7、12）算：“大于或等于 7”留下 B、C、D；“大于 4”也留下 B、C、D（4 本身不大于 4）；“大于 7”只留下 D；“大于或等于 8”也只留下 D。所以输出 B、C、D 只能排除后两种要求，剩下的两种分不开。\n\n这说明一个例子可以和好几条规则都对得上，例子不能代替规则。要分开“≥ 7”和“> 4”，就补一行落在两个阈值之间的值：signal 为 5 时，前者丢掉它，后者留下它。取 3 两者都丢，取 7 或 9 两者都留，查不出区别。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"输入表 samples","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B","C","D"],"signal":[4,7,7,12]}}]},{"id":"py12.k2.r2","body":"要求是“signal ≥ 15”。你想用一行数据检查实现有没有漏掉等号。下面哪个 signal 值最合适？\n","slots":[{"id":"value","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"v14","content":"14"},{"id":"v15","content":"15"},{"id":"v16","content":"16"},{"id":"v30","content":"30"}],"key":"v15"}],"explanation":"**15**。只有恰好等于阈值的值，在“≥ 15”和“> 15”下结果不同；14、16、30 在两种写法下结果一样，查不出等号的问题。\n"},{"id":"py12.k2.r3","body":"规则是“大于 10 才保留”。用边界附近的三种输入核对，按顺序填写每个输入是否保留。\n\n```python\nprint(9 > 10)\nprint(10 > 10)\nprint(11 > 10)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"False"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"这组三点包含边界以下、恰好边界和边界以上；只有 11 保留，能够检出把 > 错写成 >= 的实现。"},{"id":"py12.k2.r4","body":"规则是“保留库存小于 2 的行，输出 id、stock 两列”。验收输入只有 stock 为 3、4 的两行。\n哪个期望结果把无命中情境写清楚了？\n","slots":[{"id":"empty","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"defined","content":"输出 0 行，但保留 id、stock 两个列名"},{"id":"omitted","content":"反正没有命中，什么都不约定"},{"id":"include","content":"任取一行，避免出现空结果"}],"key":"defined"}],"explanation":"两行都不满足条件，因此验收应明确零行结果及其结构。不能为了回避空结果而补入不符合条件的行。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py12.k2.x1","body":"一位同事想用这张小表，检查某个实现有没有把“signal ≥ 10”写成了“signal > 10”。\n","slots":[{"id":"enough","type":"choice","prompt":"这三行够不够查出这个错误？","options":[{"id":"not_enough","content":"不够，没有一行在两种写法下结果不同"},{"id":"enough","content":"够，三行在两种写法下结果不同"}],"key":"not_enough"},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"补一行数据，它的 signal 应该是多少？","key":10}],"explanation":"**不够**。8、12、15 在“≥ 10”和“> 10”下结果都一样，查不出等号的问题；要补一行 signal 恰好为 **10** 的数据。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"检查用的小表","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B","C"],"signal":[8,12,15]}}]},{"id":"py12.k2.x2","body":"实现甲按“signal ≥ 10”筛选，实现乙按“signal > 10”筛选，两者都只输出 sample_id，保持原顺序。\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"实现甲输出哪些 sample_id？按先后顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"A","content":"A"},{"id":"B","content":"B"},{"id":"C","content":"C"},{"id":"D","content":"D"},{"id":"E","content":"E"}],"key":["A","C","D","E"]},{"id":"second","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"实现乙输出哪些 sample_id？按先后顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"A","content":"A"},{"id":"B","content":"B"},{"id":"C","content":"C"},{"id":"D","content":"D"},{"id":"E","content":"E"}],"key":["C","E"]}],"explanation":"甲输出 **A、C、D、E**，乙输出 **C、E**。两者只在 signal 恰好为 10 的 A 和 D 上不同。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"输入表 samples","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["A","B","C","D","E"],"signal":[10,7,13,10,11]}}]},{"id":"py12.k2.x3","body":"规则是“温度高于 30 才报警”。已有温度 20 的不报警例子和 40 的报警例子。\n加入哪一条最能检出把 > 错写成 >= 的问题？\n","slots":[{"id":"boundary","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"below","content":"温度 25，不报警"},{"id":"at","content":"温度 30，不报警"},{"id":"above","content":"温度 35，报警"}],"key":"at"}],"explanation":"> 与 >= 在 25、35 上结果相同；只有正好 30 时，一个不报警、一个报警，因此边界例子最有区分力。"},{"id":"py12.k2.x4","body":"需求改成“金额达到 100 才免运”。只检查金额 80、120 会漏掉什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"gap","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"boundary","content":"漏掉正好 100 的情况，无法区分 > 100 和 >= 100"},{"id":"none","content":"两侧都有例子，所有边界已经覆盖"},{"id":"average","content":"只需要再算 80 和 120 的平均值，不必约定期望结果"}],"key":"boundary"}],"explanation":"两侧的正常例子不能决定等号归属，验收还应包含 100 并明确此时免运。算出一个平均值也不能代替写清该例子的期望。"}]}]},{"id":"py13","title":"导入工具，读一小段文档","summary":"用 import、import as、from import 让模块里的名字可用；从签名、说明和 >>> 示例读出参数、默认值、返回值和副作用。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py04","py11"],"intro":"这一节学两件事：用 import 把现成的工具拿进来；读一小段文档，弄清一个函数要什么、交回什么、还做了什么。\n\n代码仍当作脚本运行，只有 print 会显示内容。第二个知识点会引入文档里常见的交互形式：`>>>` 后面是输入的一行，下一行是 Python 显示的结果。\n","wrapup":"读到 import，先记下它创建了哪个名字，后面的代码就只能用这个名字。用一个不熟的函数，先看签名里有哪些参数、哪些带默认值，再看说明里它返回什么、有没有副作用和例外，最后用示例核对自己的理解。\n\n请 AI 写代码时，也可以要求它“写明从哪个模块导入、用到的参数是什么意思”，读起来就有据可查。\n","kps":[{"id":"py13.k1","title":"import/as 让名称可用","key":["py04","py11"],"links":["py11.k1"],"card":{"name":"import","aliases":["导入","模块","import as"],"definition":"import 让模块里的工具在之后的代码里可用，用的名字取决于写法：`import math` 创建 math，`import pandas as pd` 只创建 pd，`from math import sqrt` 只创建 sqrt。","conditions":["import 那一行要在用到这个名字之前运行；忘了导入，用到时报 NameError。","后面写的名字要和导入时创建的一致：写了 `as pd`，就用 `pd.`，不能写 `pandas.`。"],"example":"```python\nimport math\nroot = math.sqrt(16)\n```\n第 1 行创建名字 math；`math.sqrt` 是“math 里面的 sqrt”，算出 4.0。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"Python 一开始只认识少数内置的名字，例如 `print`、`int`、`round`。更多的工具放在**模块**里，要先导入才能用：\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport math\nroot = math.sqrt(16)\n```\n\n第 1 行运行之后，名字 `math` 才存在。`math.sqrt` 读作“math 里面的 sqrt”：点号前面是模块的名字，后面是模块里的函数。\n\n导入有三种常见写法，区别在于**之后能用哪个名字**：\n\n| 写法 | 之后能用的名字 | 怎样调用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `import math` | math | `math.sqrt(16)` |\n| `import pandas as pd` | pd，**不是** pandas | `pd.DataFrame()` |\n| `from math import sqrt` | sqrt，**不是** math | `sqrt(16)` |\n\n`as` 给模块起一个短名字。数据分析的代码几乎都以 `import pandas as pd` 开头，之后看到 `pd.`，指的就是 pandas。\n\n导入出问题时的报错，都可以用 [读报错](repa:concept/py11.k1) 的办法看：\n\n- 用到 `math.sqrt` 之前没有运行 `import math`：NameError，名字还不存在。\n- 写了 `import pandas as pd`，后面却写 `pandas.`：也是 NameError，因为只创建了 pd。\n- 模块名拼错，例如 `import maths`：ModuleNotFoundError，找不到这个模块。\n- 模块里没有这个名字，例如 `math.squareroot`：AttributeError。\n","example":{"id":"py13.k1.e0","body":"`math.sqrt(x)` 算 x 的平方根，结果是小数（float）。\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport math\nside = 16\nroot = math.sqrt(side)\nprint(root)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"name","type":"choice","prompt":"第 1 行运行之后，多了哪个可以用的名字？","options":[{"id":"math","content":"`math`"},{"id":"sqrt","content":"`sqrt`"},{"id":"both","content":"`math` 和 `sqrt` 都有"}],"key":"math"},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示什么？","key":"4.0","feedback":[{"when":"4","message":"sqrt 的结果是小数，显示 4.0。"}]}],"explanation":"`import math` 只创建了名字 **math**；sqrt 在 math 里面，要写成 `math.sqrt`，单独写 `sqrt` 是不存在的名字。\n\n第 3 行算 16 的平方根，结果是小数，显示 **4.0**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py13.k1.q1","body":"填写表格：每一行的导入语句单独运行之后，下面三个名字能不能用？\n\n提示：`import math as m` 和 `import pandas as pd` 是同一种写法。\n","slots":[{"id":"names","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"stmt","header":"导入语句"},{"id":"math","header":"能用 math 吗","input":"bool"},{"id":"m","header":"能用 m 吗","input":"bool"},{"id":"sqrt","header":"能用 sqrt 吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"plain","cells":{"stmt":"`import math`","math":true,"m":false,"sqrt":false}},{"id":"alias","cells":{"stmt":"`import math as m`","math":false,"m":true,"sqrt":false}},{"id":"from","cells":{"stmt":"`from math import sqrt`","math":false,"m":false,"sqrt":true}}]}],"explanation":"| 导入语句 | math | m | sqrt |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `import math` | 能 | 不能 | 不能 |\n| `import math as m` | 不能 | 能 | 不能 |\n| `from math import sqrt` | 不能 | 不能 | 能 |\n\n每种写法只创建一个名字。`as m` 之后只有 m，要写 `m.sqrt`；`from math import sqrt` 之后只有 sqrt，直接写 `sqrt(...)`，math 这个名字并不存在。\n"},{"id":"py13.k1.q2","body":"`math.floor(x)` 去掉 x 的小数部分，向下取整。运行 clean.py，出现了报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport math as m\nvalue = math.floor(7.8)\nprint(value)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"choice","prompt":"报错是哪一种？","options":[{"id":"name","content":"NameError：名字 math 不存在"},{"id":"module","content":"ModuleNotFoundError：找不到 math 模块"},{"id":"attribute","content":"AttributeError：math 里面没有 floor"}],"key":"name"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行应改成哪一种，程序才会显示 7？","options":[{"id":"alias","content":"```python\nvalue = m.floor(7.8)\n```\n"},{"id":"bare","content":"```python\nvalue = floor(7.8)\n```\n"},{"id":"same","content":"```python\nvalue = math.floor(m)\n```\n"}],"key":"alias"}],"explanation":"第 1 行写了 `as m`，只创建了名字 m，第 2 行用到的 math 不存在，报 **NameError**。math 模块本身找得到，floor 也确实在里面。\n\n改成 **`m.floor(7.8)`**，显示 7。单独写 `floor` 同样是没有导入的名字。\n"},{"id":"py13.k1.q3","body":"下面四段代码各自单独运行，都会报错。\n\n代码 1：\n\n```python\nprint(math.pi)\n```\n\n代码 2：\n\n```python\nimport maths\n```\n\n代码 3：\n\n```python\nimport math\nprint(math.squareroot(9))\n```\n\n代码 4：\n\n```python\nimport math as m\nprint(math.sqrt(9))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"errors","type":"table","prompt":"每段代码报的是哪一种错？","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"代码"},{"id":"error","header":"报错类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"NameError","label":"NameError"},{"id":"ModuleNotFoundError","label":"ModuleNotFoundError"},{"id":"AttributeError","label":"AttributeError"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"code":"代码 1","error":"NameError"}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"code":"代码 2","error":"ModuleNotFoundError"}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"code":"代码 3","error":"AttributeError"}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"code":"代码 4","error":"NameError"}}]}],"explanation":"| 代码 | 报错 | 原因 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | NameError | 没有导入，math 这个名字不存在 |\n| 2 | ModuleNotFoundError | 模块叫 math，没有叫 maths 的模块 |\n| 3 | AttributeError | math 导入了，但里面没有 squareroot，平方根叫 sqrt |\n| 4 | NameError | `as m` 只创建了 m，没有 math |\n\n三种报错分别指向三个问题：名字不存在、模块找不到、模块里没有这一项。\n"},{"id":"py13.k1.q4","body":"as 决定导入后使用哪个名字。填写这个实际调用的结果。\n\n```python\nimport math as m\nprint(m.sqrt(81))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"最后显示","key":"9.0"}],"explanation":"模块被绑定到别名 m，因此通过 m.sqrt 找到平方根函数。sqrt 返回浮点数 9.0；别名不会改变函数的计算含义。"},{"id":"py13.k1.q5","body":"这是全新脚本，之前没有导入 math。只执行下面两行，会怎样？\n\n```python\nimport math as m\nprint(math.sqrt(81))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"name","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"alias","content":"NameError；这次导入绑定的是 m，不是 math"},{"id":"both","content":"显示 9.0；两个名字总会一起绑定"},{"id":"syntax","content":"SyntaxError；as 不能用在导入里"}],"key":"alias"}],"explanation":"import math as m 只在当前脚本中建立 m 这个名字。要使用这个导入，应调用 m.sqrt；模块原名不会自动成为另一个局部名字。"}],"review":[{"id":"py13.k1.r1","body":"要求：显示 30.25 的平方根。作答框里的代码运行时报 NameError：`name 'sqrt' is not defined`。补上导入，让它正常显示 5.5。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"value = sqrt(30.25)\nprint(value)\n","solution":"from math import sqrt\nvalue = sqrt(30.25)\nprint(value)\n","accepts":["import math\nvalue = math.sqrt(30.25)\nprint(value)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"import math\nvalue = sqrt(30.25)\nprint(value)\n","why":"`import math` 只创建 math，sqrt 仍不存在"},{"code":"value = sqrt(30.25)\nfrom math import sqrt\nprint(value)\n","why":"导入写在用到 sqrt 之后"}],"tests":[{"name":"显示平方根","stdout":"5.5"}]}],"explanation":"第 1 行用到了 sqrt，就要在它前面创建这个名字：\n\n```python\nfrom math import sqrt\nvalue = sqrt(30.25)\nprint(value)\n```\n\n也可以写 `import math`，再把调用改成 `math.sqrt(30.25)`。只加 `import math` 而不改调用不行，那样只有 math，没有 sqrt；导入写在后面也不行，用到时名字还不存在。\n"},{"id":"py13.k1.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\nprint(\"开始\")\nroot = math.sqrt(9)\nimport math\nprint(root)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"运行结果是什么？","options":[{"id":"works","content":"显示“开始”和 3.0，正常结束"},{"id":"start_then_error","content":"显示“开始”，然后第 2 行报 NameError"},{"id":"nothing","content":"什么也不显示，直接报错"}],"key":"start_then_error"},{"id":"stop","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序停在第几行？","key":2}],"explanation":"程序从上往下运行。第 1 行显示“开始”；第 2 行用到 math 时，第 3 行的 import 还没有运行，名字不存在，报 **NameError**，停在第 **2** 行。这是运行时异常，不是语法错误，所以第 1 行已经显示出来了。\n\nimport 和赋值一样，要写在用到这个名字之前；通常把所有 import 放在文件最上面。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py13.k1.x1","body":"`sqrt` 在 math 模块里，算平方根，结果是小数。下面哪几段程序能正常运行并显示 3.0？选出所有可以的。\n","slots":[{"id":"programs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nimport math\nprint(math.sqrt(9))\n```\n"},{"id":"alias_wrong","content":"```python\nimport math as m\nprint(math.sqrt(9))\n```\n"},{"id":"from","content":"```python\nfrom math import sqrt\nprint(sqrt(9))\n```\n"},{"id":"from_wrong","content":"```python\nfrom math import sqrt\nprint(math.sqrt(9))\n```\n"},{"id":"late","content":"```python\nprint(math.sqrt(9))\nimport math\n```\n"}],"key":["plain","from"]}],"explanation":"能显示 3.0 的是 **`import math` 加 `math.sqrt(9)`** 和 **`from math import sqrt` 加 `sqrt(9)`**：用的名字和导入时创建的一致。\n\n`as m` 之后只有 m，`from math import sqrt` 之后只有 sqrt，这两段再写 `math.` 都会报 NameError；import 写在 print 之后，用到时 math 还不存在，也报 NameError。\n"},{"id":"py13.k1.x2","body":"`pd.DataFrame()` 建一张空表，`len(表)` 是它的行数。运行 clean.py，出现了下面的报错。\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport pandas as pd\ntable = pandas.DataFrame()\nprint(len(table))\n```\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"clean.py\", line 2, in <module>\n    table = pandas.DataFrame()\n            ^^^^^^\nNameError: name 'pandas' is not defined\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"missing","content":"电脑上没有装 pandas"},{"id":"alias","content":"第 1 行只创建了名字 pd，没有创建 pandas"},{"id":"attribute","content":"pandas 里面没有 DataFrame"}],"key":"alias"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"pd","content":"```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame()\n```\n"},{"id":"bare","content":"```python\ntable = DataFrame()\n```\n"},{"id":"lower","content":"```python\ntable = pd.dataframe()\n```\n"}],"key":"pd"}],"explanation":"报错是第 2 行的 NameError：名字 pandas 不存在。第 1 行没有报错，说明 pandas 装好了（没装会在第 1 行报 ModuleNotFoundError）；只是 `as pd` 让它以 **pd** 这个名字出现。\n\n第 2 行改成 **`pd.DataFrame()`**，显示 0。单独写 `DataFrame` 是没有导入的名字；`pd.dataframe` 大小写不对，pandas 里没有这一项。\n"},{"id":"py13.k1.x3","body":"from 导入只把指定对象放入当前名字空间；名字的拼写由 as 决定。填写成功调用的结果。\n\n```python\nfrom math import sqrt as root\nprint(root(49))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"7.0"}],"explanation":"root 绑定到导入的 sqrt 函数，调用返回平方根 7.0。原函数的功能没有因为别名改变。"},{"id":"py13.k1.x4","body":"在全新脚本中导入函数并起别名后，旧函数名不会自动额外绑定。填写实际异常类型。\n\n```python\nfrom math import sqrt as root\nprint(sqrt(49))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"NameError"}],"explanation":"当前只建立了 root，未建立 sqrt。要调用这次导入的函数，应该用 root 这个名字。"}]},{"id":"py13.k2","title":"从签名和示例找参数、返回值与副作用","key":["py04"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"读函数文档","aliases":["签名","文档","返回值","副作用","默认值"],"definition":"签名列出参数的名字和顺序，带 = 的参数有默认值、可以省略；说明和示例告诉你函数交回什么（返回值），以及在返回之外还做了什么（副作用）。","conditions":["返回值要赋给名字或交给下一步才能继续用；显示在屏幕上是副作用，print 显示了内容，交回的却是 None。","文档示例里 `>>>` 后面是输入，下一行是显示的结果；交互窗口会自动显示表达式的值，脚本不会。"],"example":"`round(number, ndigits=None)`：ndigits 有默认值，可以省略。`round(3.14159, 2)` 是 3.14，`round(3.14159)` 是 3；恰好在正中间时取偶数，`round(2.5)` 是 2。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"用一个不熟的函数之前，先读它的文档。一条文档通常有三部分。\n\n**签名**，例如 `round(number, ndigits=None)`：\n\n- 括号里是参数的名字，按位置排列：第一个是 number，第二个是 ndigits。\n- 写了 `=` 的参数有**默认值**，调用时可以省略，省略时就用默认值；没有 `=` 的参数必须给。\n- 可以按位置给，`round(3.14159, 2)`；也可以写参数名，`round(3.14159, ndigits=2)`。\n\n**说明**：它返回什么，有没有例外。round 的说明大意是：把 number 舍入到小数点后 ndigits 位，返回舍入后的数；省略 ndigits 时，返回最接近的整数。还有一句容易漏掉：恰好在两个整数正中间时，取偶数的那一个，所以 `round(2.5)` 是 2，`round(3.5)` 是 4。\n\n**示例**：文档里的示例常写成交互形式。`>>>` 后面是输入的一行，下一行是 Python 显示的结果：\n\n```text\n>>> round(3.14159, 2)\n3.14\n>>> round(3.14159)\n3\n>>> x = round(2.5)\n>>> x\n2\n```\n\n交互窗口里，输入一个有值的表达式会**自动显示**它的值；赋值和 import 什么也不显示。脚本里不会自动显示，要用 print。本课的 WWPD 题（Python 会显示什么）就用这种形式：什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。\n\n最后分清**返回值**和**副作用**。返回值是函数交回来的结果，可以赋给名字，交给下一步。副作用是函数在交回结果之外做的事，例如在屏幕上显示、写入文件。print 的作用是显示，它交回的是 None：\n\n```text\n>>> x = print(\"已保存\")\n已保存\n>>> print(x)\nNone\n```\n\n“已保存”是 print 的副作用；x 得到的是返回值 None。所以要继续用一个结果，就把返回值赋给名字，而不是只把它显示出来。\n","example":{"id":"py13.k2.e0","body":"round 的文档摘要：\n\n> **round(number, ndigits=None)**\n>\n> 把 number 舍入到小数点后 ndigits 位，返回舍入后的数。省略 ndigits 时，返回最接近的整数。恰好在两个整数正中间时，取偶数的那一个。\n","slots":[{"id":"omit","type":"choice","prompt":"调用 round 时，哪个参数可以省略？","options":[{"id":"number","content":"number"},{"id":"ndigits","content":"ndigits"},{"id":"none","content":"两个都必须给"}],"key":"ndigits"},{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行，Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> round(3.14159, 2)`","shown":"3.14"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> round(3.14159)`","shown":"3"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> round(2.5)`","shown":"2"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> round(7.46, ndigits=1)`","shown":"7.5"}}]}],"explanation":"签名里 ndigits 写了 `=None`，有默认值，**可以省略**；number 没有 `=`，必须给。\n\n| 输入 | 显示 | 读法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `round(3.14159, 2)` | 3.14 | 第二个参数按位置给了 ndigits，保留两位 |\n| `round(3.14159)` | 3 | 省略 ndigits，返回最接近的整数 |\n| `round(2.5)` | 2 | 正中间取偶数，不是 3 |\n| `round(7.46, ndigits=1)` | 7.5 | 用参数名给 ndigits，保留一位 |\n\n`round(2.5)` 是 2，这一点只有读了说明才知道；按“四舍五入”的习惯会以为是 3。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py13.k2.q1","body":"math.log 的文档摘要：\n\n> **math.log(x, base)**\n>\n> 只给 x 时，返回 x 的自然对数（以 e 为底）。给了 base 时，返回以 base 为底的 x 的对数。结果是小数。\n","slots":[{"id":"base","type":"choice","prompt":"在 `math.log(8, 2)` 里，2 是什么？","options":[{"id":"x","content":"要取对数的数"},{"id":"base","content":"对数的底"},{"id":"digits","content":"保留的小数位数"}],"key":"base"},{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行，Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> import math`","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> math.log(8, 2)`","shown":"3.0"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> math.log(100, 10)`","shown":"2.0"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> math.log(1)`","shown":"0.0"}}]}],"explanation":"第二个参数是**对数的底**：`math.log(8, 2)` 问“2 的几次方是 8”，答案 3，结果是小数，显示 **3.0**。\n\n| 输入 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `import math` | NOTHING：import 什么也不显示 |\n| `math.log(8, 2)` | 3.0 |\n| `math.log(100, 10)` | 2.0 |\n| `math.log(1)` | 0.0：只给 x，取自然对数，1 的对数是 0 |\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.q2","body":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行。print 把内容显示在屏幕上，它交回的是 None；交互窗口不显示 None 这个值本身。\n","slots":[{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> y = round(3.7)`","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> y`","shown":"4"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> x = print(\"已保存\")`","shown":"已保存"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> x`","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"input":"`>>> print(x)`","shown":"None"}}]},{"id":"side","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行显示的“已保存”是什么？","options":[{"id":"effect","content":"print 的副作用，不是它的返回值"},{"id":"value","content":"print 的返回值，已经存进了 x"}],"key":"effect"}],"explanation":"| 输入 | 显示 | 原因 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `y = round(3.7)` | NOTHING | 赋值不显示 |\n| `y` | 4 | y 是 round 的返回值 |\n| `x = print(\"已保存\")` | 已保存 | 赋值本身不显示，但 print 运行时把文字显示了出来 |\n| `x` | NOTHING | x 是 print 的返回值 None，交互窗口不显示 None |\n| `print(x)` | None | 用 print 才把 None 显示出来 |\n\n“已保存”是 print 的**副作用**，x 得到的是返回值 None。round 正好相反：没有副作用，靠返回值交出结果。\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.q3","body":"宿主事先给 `mean` 赋了一个平均值，例如 3.14159。要求：把它舍入到小数点后 2 位，**存进 `result`**，后面的代码还要用 result 继续计算。\n\n作答框里的代码只把结果显示了出来，result 并没有得到它。按 round 的签名 `round(number, ndigits=None)` 改动代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"print(round(mean, 2))\n","solution":"result = round(mean, 2)\n","accepts":["result = round(mean, ndigits=2)","result = round(mean, 2)\nprint(result)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = round(mean)","why":"省略了 ndigits，得到的是整数"},{"code":"result = print(round(mean, 2))","why":"result 接住的是 print 的返回值 None"},{"code":"result = round(2, mean)","why":"参数顺序反了，2 被当成要舍入的数"},{"code":"result = 3.14","why":"照着例子写死了结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"mean 为 3.14159","setup":"mean = 3.14159","expect":{"result":"3.14"}},{"name":"mean 为 2.71828","hidden":true,"setup":"mean = 2.71828","expect":{"result":"2.72"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = round(mean, 2)\n```\n\nround 的返回值要赋给 result 才能继续用。`print(round(mean, 2))` 只是显示，result 没有得到任何值；`result = print(...)` 得到的是 print 的返回值 None。第二个参数按位置给 ndigits，写成 `ndigits=2` 也可以；写成 `round(2, mean)` 就把顺序弄反了。\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.q4","body":"一段文档写着：`sorted(iterable, *, key=None, reverse=False)`，返回一个新列表，不改变原输入；`reverse=True` 表示降序。\n想保留原输入并得到降序的新列表，应该选哪个调用？\n","slots":[{"id":"call","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"positional","content":"`sorted(values, True)`"},{"id":"keyword","content":"`sorted(values, reverse=True)`"},{"id":"ascending","content":"`sorted(values)`"}],"key":"keyword"}],"explanation":"签名中的 * 表示其后的参数只能按关键字传入，因此 reverse=True 要带上参数名。文档同时说明 sorted 返回新列表，不在原输入上排序。"},{"id":"py13.k2.q5","body":"文档注明：“`sorted(values)` 返回新列表，不修改 values。”程序作者看到返回值已经排好序，就断言 values 也变了。\n根据这条约定，哪个判断成立？\n","slots":[{"id":"effect","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"original","content":"返回值和原输入要分别看；values 保持原顺序"},{"id":"changed","content":"返回值排好序就证明原输入也已修改"},{"id":"none","content":"所有排序函数都返回 None"}],"key":"original"}],"explanation":"返回值与副作用是文档中的两项独立信息。这里已经明确“不修改 values”，不能从返回值有序反推原输入也被修改。"}],"review":[{"id":"py13.k2.r1","body":"print 的文档摘要：\n\n> **print(值1, 值2, …, sep=\" \")**\n>\n> 把各个值依次显示在一行里，相邻两个值之间插入 sep，sep 默认是一个空格。返回 None。\n","slots":[{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行，Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> print(\"A\", \"B\")`","shown":"A B"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> print(\"A\", \"B\", sep=\"-\")`","shown":"A-B"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> print(\"2026\", \"10\", \"12\", sep=\"/\")`","shown":"2026/10/12"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> print(\"A\", \"B\", sep=\"\")`","shown":"AB"}}]}],"explanation":"| 输入 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `print(\"A\", \"B\")` | A B：没给 sep，用默认的一个空格 |\n| `print(\"A\", \"B\", sep=\"-\")` | A-B |\n| `print(\"2026\", \"10\", \"12\", sep=\"/\")` | 2026/10/12：每两个相邻的值之间插一个 sep |\n| `print(\"A\", \"B\", sep=\"\")` | AB：sep 是空文字，什么也不插 |\n\nsep 只能用参数名给：前面的位置都是要显示的值，写成 `print(\"A\", \"B\", \"-\")` 会把 - 当成第三个值显示出来。\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.r2","body":"宿主事先给 `year`、`month`、`day` 赋了文字，例如 `\"2026\"`、`\"10\"`、`\"12\"`。要求：显示成一行 `2026-10-12` 这样的日期。\n\n作答框里的代码显示的是 `2026 10 12`。参照 print 的签名 `print(值1, 值2, …, sep=\" \")` 改动它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"print(year, month, day)\n","solution":"print(year, month, day, sep=\"-\")\n","accepts":["print(year + \"-\" + month + \"-\" + day)"],"rejects":[{"code":"print(year, \"-\", month, \"-\", day)","why":"把 - 当成了要显示的值，两边还各有一个默认的空格"},{"code":"print(year, month, day, \"-\")","why":"按位置给的 - 只是多显示了一个值"},{"code":"print(\"2026-10-12\")","why":"照着例子写死了日期"}],"tests":[{"name":"2026 年 10 月 12 日","setup":"year = \"2026\"\nmonth = \"10\"\nday = \"12\"\n","stdout":"2026-10-12"},{"name":"另一个日期","hidden":true,"setup":"year = \"2025\"\nmonth = \"03\"\nday = \"07\"\n","stdout":"2025-03-07"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nprint(year, month, day, sep=\"-\")\n```\n\nsep 有默认值一个空格，所以原来显示 `2026 10 12`；用参数名把它改成 `\"-\"`。把 `\"-\"` 写成普通的值，它只会被当成又一个要显示的值，两边还会各插一个空格。\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.r3","body":"文档给定 round(number, ndigits=None)，ndigits 是保留的小数位数，省略时返回整数。依约读出两种调用的显示结果。\n\n```python\nprint(round(3.25))\nprint(round(3.25, ndigits=1))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"3"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"3.2"}],"explanation":"省略 ndigits 返回整数 3；指定一位小数返回浮点 3.2。这里的文档同时给出了可选参数与返回类型的线索。"},{"id":"py13.k2.r4","body":"文档注明 list.sort() 原位排序并返回 None。把返回值接到 result 不会得到排序后的列表。\n\n```python\nvalues = [3, 1, 2]\nresult = values.sort()\nprint(values)\nprint(result)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[1, 2, 3]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"None"}],"explanation":"原位副作用发生在 values 上；result 接收的是文档声明的返回值 None，不能把两者混为一谈。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py13.k2.x1","body":"math 模块的文档摘要：\n\n> **math.floor(x)**：返回不大于 x 的最大整数（向下取整）。\n>\n> **math.ceil(x)**：返回不小于 x 的最小整数（向上取整）。\n\n一共 200 个样本，每块板最多装 96 个。至少需要几块板？宿主已经运行了 `import math`。哪一行算得对？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"round","content":"```python\nplates = round(200 / 96)\n```\n"},{"id":"floor","content":"```python\nplates = math.floor(200 / 96)\n```\n"},{"id":"ceil","content":"```python\nplates = math.ceil(200 / 96)\n```\n"},{"id":"int","content":"```python\nplates = int(200 / 96)\n```\n"}],"key":"ceil"}],"explanation":"200 / 96 约等于 2.08。两块板只能装 192 个，剩下的 8 个还要一块板，所以至少 3 块：要“不小于它的最小整数”，也就是 **`math.ceil`**，得 3。\n\n`math.floor` 和 `int` 都去掉小数部分得 2；`round` 取最接近的整数，也得 2。它们都少算了一块板。\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.x2","body":"`math.ceil` 交回向上取整的结果；print 显示内容，交回 None。这段代码当作脚本运行。\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport math\na = math.ceil(4.2)\nb = print(a)\nc = round(4.2)\nprint(b)\nprint(c)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"table","prompt":"按顺序写出屏幕上显示的每一行。","columns":[{"id":"order","header":"显示顺序"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"order":"第 1 行","shown":"5"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"order":"第 2 行","shown":"None"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"order":"第 3 行","shown":"4"}}]}],"explanation":"一共显示三行：**5**、**None**、**4**。\n\n第 3 行的 print 先把 a（5）显示出来，这是它的副作用；它交回的 None 存进了 b，所以第 5 行显示 None。第 4 行的 round 没有副作用，只把 4 交回给 c，这一行本身什么也不显示，到第 6 行才显示出来。\n"},{"id":"py13.k2.x3","body":"文档说明 sorted 返回新列表、不修改原输入；reverse=True 令新列表降序。根据这条约定对照两个对象。\n\n```python\nvalues = [2, 5, 1]\nresult = sorted(values, reverse=True)\nprint(result)\nprint(values)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[5, 2, 1]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[2, 5, 1]"}],"explanation":"返回值 result 按要求降序，原 values 则保持原顺序；返回结果与副作用必须分别从文档核对。"},{"id":"py13.k2.x4","body":"文档给出 len(obj, /)，斜线表示 obj 只能用位置参数传入。错误地写成关键字会怎样？填写异常类型。\n\n```python\nprint(len(obj=[1, 2]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"TypeError"}],"explanation":"obj 在斜线之前，必须按位置传入；len(obj=...) 不符合调用签名，抛出 TypeError。"}]}]},{"id":"py14","title":"一张数据表里有什么","summary":"认出 DataFrame 的行、列、行索引和取出的一列 Series；用 shape 看大小、head 看样子；读出每列的类型，并说清一行代表什么。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py06","py13","py03"],"intro":"这一节开始读数据表。宿主已经运行了 `import pandas as pd`，并把题目用到的表准备好，题面最前面会显示这张表；你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。每道题都从题面的表重新开始。\n\n有些题用交互窗口的形式：`>>>` 后面是输入的一行，你填写 Python 显示的内容。交互窗口会自动显示表达式的值；赋值什么也不显示，填 NOTHING；报错填 ERROR。\n","wrapup":"拿到一张表，先回答四个问题：有哪些列，列名怎样拼写；有多少行、多少列（shape）；前几行长什么样（head）；每列是什么类型，一行代表什么。\n\n这四件事说清了，再向同事或 AI 提要求，例如“表 visits 一行是一个样本某一天的一次称重，sample_id 是文字编号”，对方就不会把称重次数当成样本数。\n","kps":[{"id":"py14.k1","title":"DataFrame、Series、行列和索引","key":["py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"DataFrame","aliases":["数据表","表","Series","行索引"],"definition":"DataFrame 是一张有列名和行索引的表；用 `df[\"列名\"]` 取出其中一列，得到 Series，它带着和原表相同的行索引。","conditions":["左边的行索引是每一行的标签，不是表里的一列，也不一定是 0、1、2……","方括号里的列名要和表里的完全一样，大小写和空格都算。"],"example":"表 T 有 sample_id、signal、group 三列，四行的行索引是 31、7、22、4。`df[\"group\"]` 是一列四个值的 Series，行索引仍是 31、7、22、4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"lesson":"pandas 用 **DataFrame** 表示一张表。后面的代码默认已经 `import pandas as pd`。下面是表 T，宿主把它放在名字 `df` 里：\n\n| 行索引 | sample_id | signal | group |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 31 | S_A | 8 | control |\n| 7 | S_B | 10 | drug |\n| 22 | S_C | 13 | drug |\n| 4 | S_D | 10 | control |\n\n- **列**：每列有一个列名，例如 `signal`。同一列放同一种量。\n- **行**：每行是一条记录，这里是一个样本。\n- **行索引**：最左边的 31、7、22、4 是每一行的**标签**。它不是表里的一列，也不一定从 0 开始、按大小排；表经过筛选或排序以后，原来的标签会跟着行走。\n\n取出一列，在方括号里写列名：`df[\"signal\"]`。列名要带引号，大小写要和表里一致，写成 `df[\"Signal\"]` 会报错。取出来的是 **Series**：一列值，带着和原表相同的行索引。用 print 显示它是这样的：\n\n```text\n31     8\n7     10\n22    13\n4     10\nName: signal, dtype: int64\n```\n\n左边是行索引，右边是值，最后一行写着它来自哪一列（Name）和值的类型（dtype）。\n\n还有几个查看表的写法：`len(df)` 是行数；`list(df.columns)` 把列名排成一个列表；`list(df.index)` 把行索引排成一个列表。\n","example":{"id":"py14.k1.e0","body":"读题面最前面的表 T，回答下面的问题。\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"表 T 有几行？","key":4},{"id":"label","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"样本 S_C 所在那一行的行索引是多少？","key":22},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"行索引为 7 的那一行，signal 是多少？","key":10},{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"`df[\"group\"]` 得到的是什么？","options":[{"id":"series","content":"一列值（Series），共 4 个，行索引仍是 31、7、22、4"},{"id":"unique","content":"group 列里出现过的组别：control 和 drug"},{"id":"first","content":"第一行的组别 control"}],"key":"series"}],"explanation":"表 T 有 **4** 行。S_C 在第三行，它的行索引是 **22**；行索引为 7 的是 S_B 那一行，signal 是 **10**。注意行索引是标签，不是第几行：7 在第二行。\n\n`df[\"group\"]` 取出整列，是一个 **Series**，有 4 个值 control、drug、drug、control，行索引仍是 31、7、22、4。它不会去重，也不只取第一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py14.k1.q1","body":"表 T 里，下面四样东西各是什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"parts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"item","header":"表里的"},{"id":"part","header":"它是","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"index","label":"行索引"},{"id":"column","label":"列名"},{"id":"value","label":"表里的一个值"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"i31","cells":{"item":"最左边的 31","part":"index"}},{"id":"isignal","cells":{"item":"最上面的 signal","part":"column"}},{"id":"isb","cells":{"item":"S_B","part":"value"}},{"id":"icontrol","cells":{"item":"control","part":"value"}}]}],"explanation":"31 是**行索引**，标出第一行；signal 是**列名**；S_B 和 control 都是表里的**值**，分别在 sample_id 列和 group 列里。\n\n行索引不是表里的一列：`list(df.columns)` 里只有 sample_id、signal、group。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k1.q2","body":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行。`df` 是表 T。\n","slots":[{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> len(df)`","shown":"4"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(df.columns)`","shown":"['sample_id', 'signal', 'group']"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(df.index)`","shown":"[31, 7, 22, 4]"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> df[\"Signal\"]`","shown":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"| 输入 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `len(df)` | 4：表有 4 行 |\n| `list(df.columns)` | `['sample_id', 'signal', 'group']`：列名，按表里的顺序 |\n| `list(df.index)` | `[31, 7, 22, 4]`：行索引，按表里的顺序，不按大小 |\n| `df[\"Signal\"]` | ERROR：列名是小写的 signal，大小写不同就找不到这一列 |\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k1.q3","body":"```python\ndepths = soil[\"depth\"]\nprint(depths)\n```\n\n显示的是：\n\n```text\n5     30\n12    25\n3     35\n8     30\nName: depth, dtype: int64\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`depths` 里有几个值？","key":4},{"id":"left","type":"choice","prompt":"左边的 5、12、3、8 是什么？","options":[{"id":"index","content":"原表 soil 的行索引"},{"id":"position","content":"每个值是第几个"},{"id":"values","content":"depth 列的另一部分值"}],"key":"index"},{"id":"at3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"行索引为 3 的那个值是多少？","key":35}],"explanation":"`soil[\"depth\"]` 取出 depth 这一列，是一个 Series，有 **4** 个值。左边的 5、12、3、8 是**原表 soil 的行索引**，取出这一列时跟着带了过来；它们不是第几个的意思。行索引为 3 的是东坡那一行，值是 **35**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]},{"id":"py14.k1.q4","body":"表的行标签不是行号。直接读下面的数据，填写行标签与列标签的 Python 显示内容。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"name\": [\"Li\", \"Wu\"], \"score\": [8, 9]}, index=[20, 10])\nprint(table.index.tolist())\nprint(table.columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"行标签","key":"[20, 10]"},{"id":"columns","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"列标签","key":"['name', 'score']"}],"explanation":"index 明确给出了按顺序排列的行标签 20、10；name、score 是列标签。行标签不要求从 0 开始，也不要求按数值排序。"},{"id":"py14.k1.q5","body":"同样读取 score 列，一层方括号与两层方括号得到的对象不同。填写类名。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"score\": [8, 9]})\nprint(type(table[\"score\"]).__name__)\nprint(type(table[[\"score\"]]).__name__)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"series","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一行","key":"Series"},{"id":"frame","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二行","key":"DataFrame"}],"explanation":"单个列名取出一维 Series；列名列表即使只有一项，也保留二维 DataFrame。这一题辨认对象的形状，后面的选列课还会继续使用它。"}],"review":[{"id":"py14.k1.r1","body":"读题面最前面的表 field，回答下面的问题。\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"表有几行？","key":3},{"id":"cols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"表有几列（不算行索引）？","key":2},{"id":"p2","type":"choice","prompt":"P2 是什么？","options":[{"id":"value","content":"crop 列里的一个值"},{"id":"index","content":"一行的行索引"},{"id":"column","content":"一个列名"}],"key":"index"},{"id":"crop","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"行索引为 P3 的那一行，crop 是什么？","key":"大豆"}],"explanation":"3 行、2 列（crop 和 yield_kg）。左边的 P1、P2、P3 是**行索引**，这里用文字作标签，不是 crop 列的值。行索引为 P3 的那一行，crop 是**大豆**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三块试验田的产量（千克）","index":["P1","P2","P3"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"crop":["小麦","玉米","大豆"],"yield_kg":[520,610,480]}}]},{"id":"py14.k1.r2","body":"想取出 soil 表的 depth 这一列。下面哪几种写法能做到？选出所有可以的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"exact","content":"```python\ndepths = soil[\"depth\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"upper","content":"```python\ndepths = soil[\"Depth\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"bare","content":"```python\ndepths = soil[depth]\n```\n"},{"id":"space","content":"```python\ndepths = soil[\"depth \"]\n```\n"}],"key":["exact"]}],"explanation":"只有 `soil[\"depth\"]` 可以。列名要和表里的一模一样：`\"Depth\"` 大小写不同，`\"depth \"` 多了一个空格，都找不到这一列；不加引号的 `depth` 被当成一个名字，而这个名字没有赋过值，报 NameError。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py14.k1.x1","body":"同事看着表 field 说：“这张表的第一列是 P1、P2、P3。”\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这句话对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，P1、P2、P3 就是第一列"},{"id":"wrong","content":"不对，P1、P2、P3 是行索引，不是表里的列"}],"key":"wrong"},{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"表里第一列的列名是什么？","key":"crop"}],"explanation":"**不对。** P1、P2、P3 显示在最左边，但它们是每一行的标签，也就是行索引；`list(field.columns)` 里只有 crop 和 yield_kg。表里的第一列是 **crop**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三块试验田的产量（千克）","index":["P1","P2","P3"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"crop":["小麦","玉米","大豆"],"yield_kg":[520,610,480]}}]},{"id":"py14.k1.x2","body":"表 field 已经准备好。下面每个表达式单独求值，得到的是什么东西？会报错的选“报错”。\n","slots":[{"id":"kinds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"kind","header":"得到","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"table","label":"一张表（DataFrame）"},{"id":"series","label":"一列（Series）"},{"id":"number","label":"一个数"},{"id":"items","label":"一个列表"},{"id":"error","label":"报错"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"whole","cells":{"expr":"`field`","kind":"table"}},{"id":"column","cells":{"expr":"`field[\"crop\"]`","kind":"series"}},{"id":"size","cells":{"expr":"`len(field)`","kind":"number"}},{"id":"names","cells":{"expr":"`list(field.columns)`","kind":"items"}},{"id":"missing","cells":{"expr":"`field[\"产量\"]`","kind":"error"}}]}],"explanation":"| 表达式 | 得到 | 为什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `field` | 一张表 | 整张表，有列名和行索引 |\n| `field[\"crop\"]` | 一列（Series） | 用列名取出的一列，带着原表的行索引 P1、P2、P3 |\n| `len(field)` | 一个数 | 表有几行，这里是 3 |\n| `list(field.columns)` | 一个列表 | 把列名排成列表：`['crop', 'yield_kg']` |\n| `field[\"产量\"]` | 报错 | 列名是 yield_kg，没有叫“产量”的列，KeyError |\n\n看到一个表达式，先想它交回的是哪种东西，再想下一步能对它做什么。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三块试验田的产量（千克）","index":["P1","P2","P3"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"crop":["小麦","玉米","大豆"],"yield_kg":[520,610,480]}}]},{"id":"py14.k1.x3","body":"DataFrame 的行标签可以是文字；它们不是列名，也不是被选中后才临时出现的编号。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"amount\": [3, 4]}, index=[\"north\", \"south\"])\nprint(table.index.tolist())\nprint(table.columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['north', 'south']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"['amount']"}],"explanation":"north、south 属于 index，是两条记录的行标签；amount 是唯一的列标签。"}]},{"id":"py14.k2","title":"shape 与 head 分别告诉你什么","key":["py04","py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"shape 与 head","aliases":["shape","head","行数","列数"],"definition":"`df.shape` 是（行数, 列数）两个数，告诉你表有多大；`df.head(n)` 取出前 n 行（省略 n 时是 5 行）看看样子，不会改变 df。","conditions":["shape 不把行索引算作一列，后面不加括号；head 按表里现在的先后取前几行，不是取行索引最小的几行。","表不足 n 行时，head(n) 给出全部行，不会报错。"],"example":"表 M 有 7 行 3 列，`df.shape` 是 (7, 3)。`df.head(3)` 取出行索引为 12、3、25 的前三行；之后 df 仍有 7 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：七次测量","index":[12,3,25,8,40,17,5],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_A","S_G","S_C","S_F","S_B","S_D"],"signal":[11,8,15,10,9,13,12],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]},"lesson":"拿到一张表，先问两件事：它有多大？长什么样？\n\n**`df.shape` 回答“有多大”**：两个数，（行数, 列数）。行索引不算一列。shape 是表自带的一项信息，后面**不加括号**，写成 `df.shape()` 会报错。`df.shape[0]` 是行数，`df.shape[1]` 是列数；`len(df)` 也是行数。\n\n**`df.head(n)` 回答“长什么样”**：取出表里**前 n 行**，组成一张小表；n 省略时是 5。真实的数据可能有几千行，先看前几行，就能确认列名和值的样子对不对。有三点要注意：\n\n- “前 n 行”按表里现在的先后，不是按行索引的大小。表 M 的行索引是 12、3、25、8……，`head(3)` 取的是 12、3、25 这三行，不是 3、5、8。\n- head 只是取出来看，**df 本身一行都没有少**。想留着这几行，要把结果赋给一个新名字，例如 `top = df.head(3)`。\n- 表不足 n 行时，给出全部的行，不会报错。\n","example":{"id":"py14.k2.e0","body":"`df` 是表 M。阅读代码。\n\n```python\nprint(df.shape)\ntop = df.head(3)\nprint(top.shape)\nprint(len(df))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`df.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":7},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`df.shape` 的第二个数（列数）","key":3},{"id":"top","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`top` 里有哪几行？按先后排出它们的行索引，没有的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"25","content":"25"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"40","content":"40"},{"id":"17","content":"17"},{"id":"5","content":"5"}],"key":["12","3","25"]},{"id":"after","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后一行显示的 `len(df)` 是多少？","key":7}],"explanation":"表 M 有 7 行、3 列（sample_id、signal、group），`df.shape` 是 **(7, 3)**，行索引不算一列。\n\n`df.head(3)` 按表里的先后取前三行：行索引 **12、3、25**，所以 `top.shape` 是 (3, 3)。它不是取行索引最小的 3、5、8。head 不改变 df，最后 `len(df)` 仍是 **7**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：七次测量","index":[12,3,25,8,40,17,5],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_A","S_G","S_C","S_F","S_B","S_D"],"signal":[11,8,15,10,9,13,12],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py14.k2.q1","body":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行。`df` 是表 M。\n","slots":[{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> df.shape`","shown":"(7, 3)"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> df.shape[0]`","shown":"7"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> df.head(2).shape`","shown":"(2, 3)"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> df.head(10).shape`","shown":"(7, 3)"}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"input":"`>>> df.shape()`","shown":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"| 输入 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `df.shape` | (7, 3) |\n| `df.shape[0]` | 7：行数 |\n| `df.head(2).shape` | (2, 3)：前两行，列不变 |\n| `df.head(10).shape` | (7, 3)：表只有 7 行，就给出全部 7 行 |\n| `df.shape()` | ERROR：shape 后面不加括号 |\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：七次测量","index":[12,3,25,8,40,17,5],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_A","S_G","S_C","S_F","S_B","S_D"],"signal":[11,8,15,10,9,13,12],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k2.q2","body":"`df` 是表 M。\n\n```python\nfirst = df.head(4)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`first` 里有哪几行？按先后排出它们的行索引。","items":[{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"17","content":"17"},{"id":"25","content":"25"},{"id":"40","content":"40"}],"key":["12","3","25","8"]},{"id":"last","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"`first` 最后一行的 sample_id 是什么？","key":"S_C"}],"explanation":"head 按表里现在的先后取前四行：行索引 **12、3、25、8**，不按大小排成 3、5、8、12。第四行是行索引 8 的那一行，sample_id 是 **S_C**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：七次测量","index":[12,3,25,8,40,17,5],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_A","S_G","S_C","S_F","S_B","S_D"],"signal":[11,8,15,10,9,13,12],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k2.q3","body":"同事说：“我运行了 `df.head()`，现在 df 只剩 5 行了。”`df` 是表 M。\n\n```python\ndf.head()\nprint(len(df))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 2 行显示什么？","key":7},{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"同事的说法对吗？","options":[{"id":"wrong","content":"不对，head 只是取出前几行组成新表，df 本身没有变"},{"id":"right","content":"对，head 会把 df 截成前 5 行"}],"key":"wrong"}],"explanation":"显示 **7**。`df.head()` 取出前 5 行组成一张新表，这里没有把它赋给任何名字，也没有改动 df。df 仍是完整的 7 行，同事的说法**不对**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：七次测量","index":[12,3,25,8,40,17,5],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_A","S_G","S_C","S_F","S_B","S_D"],"signal":[11,8,15,10,9,13,12],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k2.q4","body":"head 只返回开头部分，原表的行数不会因此减少。填写两个形状。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"x\": [1, 2, 3], \"y\": [4, 5, 6]})\nprint(table.head(1).shape)\nprint(table.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"preview","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"head(1) 的形状","key":"(1, 2)"},{"id":"original","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"原表形状","key":"(3, 2)"}],"explanation":"shape 按“行数、列数”排列。head(1) 返回 1 行 2 列的预览；table 仍是 3 行 2 列。"},{"id":"py14.k2.q5","body":"表只有两行时，要求 head(5) 会补足到五行吗？填写返回的行数与列数。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"id\": [\"A\", \"B\"], \"value\": [3, 4], \"unit\": [\"kg\", \"kg\"]})\npreview = table.head(5)\nprint(preview.shape[0])\nprint(preview.shape[1])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"行数","key":2},{"id":"columns","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"列数","key":3}],"explanation":"head(5) 最多返回前五行，不会凭空补行，因此仍是 2 行；列也没有筛掉，仍是 3 列。"}],"review":[{"id":"py14.k2.r1","body":"`df` 是表 T。\n\n```python\nsmall = df.head()\ntwo = df.head(2)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`small.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":4},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`small.shape` 的第二个数（列数）","key":3},{"id":"two","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`two` 里有哪几行？按先后排出它们的行索引。","items":[{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"31","content":"31"}],"key":["31","7"]}],"explanation":"表 T 只有 4 行，不足 head 默认的 5 行，`df.head()` 就给出全部 4 行，`small.shape` 是 **(4, 3)**，不会报错。`df.head(2)` 按表里的先后取前两行：**31、7**，不是行索引最小的 4、7。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k2.r2","body":"`df` 是表 M。下面哪几个表达式的值等于 df 的行数？选出所有等于的。\n","slots":[{"id":"exprs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"len","content":"`len(df)`"},{"id":"shape0","content":"`df.shape[0]`"},{"id":"shape1","content":"`df.shape[1]`"},{"id":"head0","content":"`df.head().shape[0]`"},{"id":"columns","content":"`len(df.columns)`"}],"key":["len","shape0"]}],"explanation":"**`len(df)` 和 `df.shape[0]`** 都是 7。`df.shape[1]` 和 `len(df.columns)` 是列数 3；`df.head().shape[0]` 是取出来的前几行有几行，表 M 有 7 行，head 只取 5 行，所以是 5，不是整张表的行数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：七次测量","index":[12,3,25,8,40,17,5],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_A","S_G","S_C","S_F","S_B","S_D"],"signal":[11,8,15,10,9,13,12],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py14.k2.x1","body":"你和同事各写了一段，想看 runs 表的前 3 行。每段都从题面的表 runs 开始运行。\n\n甲：\n\n```python\nfirst = runs.head(3)\nprint(runs.shape)\n```\n\n乙：\n\n```python\nruns = runs.head(3)\nprint(runs.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"甲显示什么？","key":"(6, 2)"},{"id":"b","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"乙显示什么？","key":"(3, 2)"},{"id":"lost","type":"choice","prompt":"乙运行之后，原来表里的哪些行在 `runs` 里不见了？","options":[{"id":"tail","content":"排在后面的三行，行索引是 6、11、1"},{"id":"biggest","content":"行索引最大的三行，行索引是 14、11、9"},{"id":"none","content":"没有行不见"}],"key":"tail"}],"explanation":"甲把前三行放进了新名字 `first`，`runs` 本身没有变，仍是 6 行 2 列，显示 **(6, 2)**。\n\n乙把名字 `runs` 改成指向前三行的那张小表，**(3, 2)**。`head(3)` 取的是表里排在最前的三行（行索引 9、2、14），不是行索引最小的三行；排在后面的 6、11、1 这三行，`runs` 里再也看不到了。要看一眼前几行，不要把结果赋回原来的名字。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：六次仪器运行的时长（分钟）","index":[9,2,14,6,11,1],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"run_id":["R05","R02","R07","R04","R06","R01"],"minutes":[42,38,51,40,45,36]}}]},{"id":"py14.k2.x2","body":"同事说：“`runs.shape` 应该是 (6, 3)：左边的行索引也算一列。”\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这句话对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，shape 把行索引也算作一列"},{"id":"wrong","content":"不对，行索引不是表里的列，shape 不算它"}],"key":"wrong"},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`runs.shape` 的第二个数是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"**不对。** 行索引是每一行的标签，不是表里的一列，shape 不算它。runs 只有 run_id 和 minutes 两列，`runs.shape` 是 (6, **2**)。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：六次仪器运行的时长（分钟）","index":[9,2,14,6,11,1],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"run_id":["R05","R02","R07","R04","R06","R01"],"minutes":[42,38,51,40,45,36]}}]},{"id":"py14.k2.x3","body":"head(0) 返回零行预览，仍保留列结构，不会清空原表。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"a\": [1, 2], \"b\": [3, 4]})\nprint(table.head(0).shape)\nprint(table.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"(0, 2)"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"(2, 2)"}],"explanation":"预览要求零行，但两列仍在。head 返回新结果，原 table 仍是两行两列。"}]},{"id":"py14.k3","title":"每列 dtype 与样本单位","key":["py03"],"links":["py03.k1"],"card":{"name":"dtype 与样本单位","aliases":["dtype","列类型","样本单位","一行代表什么"],"definition":"每列有一个类型（dtype），常见的是 int64 整数、float64 小数、str 文字、bool 真假；样本单位是一行代表的那个东西，例如一个样本，或者一个样本的一次测量。","conditions":["编号这类“像数的名字”应当是 str；而存成 str 的数字不能直接拿来算。","同一个编号出现在好几行时，一行是一次测量而不是一个样本；数样本要数不同的编号，不是数行。"],"example":"表 visits 的 sample_id 是 str，day 是 int64，weight 是 float64，passed 是 bool。001 出现在两行，一行是“一个样本某一天的一次称重”：5 行，3 个样本。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"visits","caption":"表 visits：样本称重记录（克）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","001","002","002","003"],"day":[1,3,1,3,1],"weight":[2.5,2.7,3.1,3.0,2.2],"passed":[true,true,false,true,true]},"dtypes":{"weight":"float"}}]},"lesson":"一列里的值是同一种类型，pandas 把它叫做这一列的 **dtype**。`print(visits.dtypes)` 列出表 visits 每列的类型：\n\n```text\nsample_id        str\nday            int64\nweight       float64\npassed          bool\ndtype: object\n```\n\n最后一行 `dtype: object` 说的是这份清单本身，不用管。\n\n| dtype | 意思 | visits 里的例子 |\n|---|---|---|\n| int64 | 整数 | day：1、3 |\n| float64 | 小数 | weight：2.5、3.0 |\n| str | 文字 | sample_id：\"001\" |\n| bool | True 或 False | passed |\n\n类型决定了这一列能怎样用。数值列可以加减、比较大小；文字列不行，[文字 \"12\" 和整数 12 是两回事](repa:concept/py03.k1)。所以要留意两种情况：\n\n- **编号**这类“看起来像数、其实是名字”的列应当是 str，否则 001 会变成 1，001 和 01 也分不开了。读入文件时怎样保住它，后面讲读 CSV 时再说。\n- **存成 str 的数字**，例如一列 \"12\"、\"9\"、\"30\"，看起来是数，却不能直接加减。\n\n另一件要先弄清的事是**样本单位**：一行代表什么？表 visits 里，001 出现了两行，day 不同。所以它的一行是“一个样本在某一天的一次称重”，不是一个样本：表有 5 行，样本只有 3 个。问“有几个样本”时数不同的编号；问“称了几次”时才数行。\n\n判断一行代表什么，可以看**哪几列合起来才能唯一确定一行**：visits 里单看 sample_id 有重复，sample_id 加上 day 就没有重复了，一行就是“某个样本、某一天”。这里是从这张表的数据看出来的；一行到底代表什么，最后要由数据是怎样记录的来定，后面讲去重时会再回到这一点。\n","example":{"id":"py14.k3.e0","body":"读题面最前面的表 visits，回答下面的问题。\n","slots":[{"id":"dtypes","type":"table","prompt":"`visits.dtypes` 里，每列显示的类型是什么？","columns":[{"id":"column","header":"列"},{"id":"dtype","header":"dtype","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int64","label":"int64"},{"id":"float64","label":"float64"},{"id":"str","label":"str"},{"id":"bool","label":"bool"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"sample_id","cells":{"column":"sample_id","dtype":"str"}},{"id":"day","cells":{"column":"day","dtype":"int64"}},{"id":"weight","cells":{"column":"weight","dtype":"float64"}},{"id":"passed","cells":{"column":"passed","dtype":"bool"}}]},{"id":"unit","type":"choice","prompt":"表 visits 的一行代表什么？","options":[{"id":"sample","content":"一个样本"},{"id":"weighing","content":"一个样本在某一天的一次称重"},{"id":"day","content":"某一天的全部称重"}],"key":"weighing"},{"id":"samples","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"表里一共有几个不同的样本？","key":3}],"explanation":"sample_id 是编号，存成文字 **str**（所以 001 前面的零还在）；day 是整数 **int64**；weight 有小数，是 **float64**；passed 只有 True 和 False，是 **bool**。\n\n001 和 002 各出现了两次，day 不同：sample_id 加上 day 才能确定一行，一行是**一个样本在某一天的一次称重**。表有 5 行，不同的样本只有 001、002、003 这 **3** 个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"visits","caption":"表 visits：样本称重记录（克）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","001","002","002","003"],"day":[1,3,1,3,1],"weight":[2.5,2.7,3.1,3.0,2.2],"passed":[true,true,false,true,true]},"dtypes":{"weight":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py14.k3.q1","body":"表 lab 里，count 和 note 两列看起来一样。\n","slots":[{"id":"note_dtype","type":"choice","prompt":"`lab.dtypes` 里，note 显示的类型是什么？","options":[{"id":"int64","content":"int64"},{"id":"str","content":"str"},{"id":"float64","content":"float64"}],"key":"str"},{"id":"plus_count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`lab[\"count\"] + 3` 得到的一列里，第一个值是多少？","key":15},{"id":"plus_note","type":"choice","prompt":"`lab[\"note\"] + 3` 会怎样？","options":[{"id":"numbers","content":"得到 15、12、33"},{"id":"error","content":"报错（TypeError），文字不能和整数相加"},{"id":"text","content":"得到文字 \"123\"、\"93\"、\"303\""}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"表里显示的样子一样，类型却不同：count 是 int64，note 存的是文字，dtype 是 **str**。\n\n整列加 3 是逐个值做的：`lab[\"count\"] + 3` 得到 15、12、33，第一个是 **15**。`lab[\"note\"] + 3` 是文字加整数，**报 TypeError**。（如果写成 `+ \"3\"`，文字会被接起来，得到 \"123\" 这样的结果，也不是想要的数。）\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"lab","caption":"表 lab：三块板的计数","columns":{"plate":["P1","P2","P3"],"count":[12,9,30],"note":["12","9","30"]}}]},{"id":"py14.k3.q2","body":"读题面最前面的表 water，回答下面的问题。\n","slots":[{"id":"key","type":"choice","prompt":"哪两列合起来能唯一确定一行？","options":[{"id":"site_date","content":"site 和 date"},{"id":"site_ph","content":"site 和 ph"},{"id":"site_only","content":"只要 site 就够了"}],"key":"site_date"},{"id":"unit","type":"choice","prompt":"一行代表什么？","options":[{"id":"site","content":"一个采样点"},{"id":"visit","content":"一个采样点在某一天的一次测量"},{"id":"date","content":"某一天的全部测量"}],"key":"visit"},{"id":"sites","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共有几个不同的采样点？","key":3}],"explanation":"每个采样点出现两次，日期不同，所以只看 site 有重复；site 和 date 合起来，每行都不一样。一行是**一个采样点在某一天的一次测量**，表有 6 行，采样点只有 S1、S2、S3 这 **3** 个。\n\nsite 和 ph 不行：S1 两次测得的都是 7.1。ph 是测出来的值，本来就可能相同，不能用来标识一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：三个采样点的 pH","columns":{"site":["S1","S1","S2","S2","S3","S3"],"date":["2026-05-01","2026-05-08","2026-05-01","2026-05-08","2026-05-01","2026-05-08"],"ph":[7.1,7.1,6.8,6.9,7.4,7.2]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]},{"id":"py14.k3.q3","body":"原始记录里的编号是 001、002、010。两个人分别整理成了表 a 和表 b。\n","slots":[{"id":"keeps","type":"choice","prompt":"哪张表保留了原来的编号？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"表 a"},{"id":"b","content":"表 b"}],"key":"b"},{"id":"a_dtype","type":"choice","prompt":"表 a 的 sample_id 是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"int64","content":"int64"},{"id":"str","content":"str"}],"key":"int64"}],"explanation":"**表 b** 的 sample_id 是文字（str），001、002、010 原样保留。表 a 把编号当成了整数（**int64**），前面的零没了，变成 1、2、10。编号是名字，不是拿来计算的数，应当存成文字；否则 001 和 01 这样的编号就分不开了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a","columns":{"sample_id":[1,2,10],"signal":[8,10,13]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","010"],"signal":[8,10,13]}}]},{"id":"py14.k3.q4","body":"编号应保留前导零，数量用于计算。只根据这两个独立 Series 的实际 dtype，填写 dtype 的文字形式。\n\n```python\ncodes = pd.Series([\"001\", \"002\"])\ncounts = pd.Series([1, 2])\nprint(str(codes.dtype))\nprint(str(counts.dtype))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"codes","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"编号列 dtype","key":"str"},{"id":"counts","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"数量列 dtype","key":"int64"}],"explanation":"锁定的 pandas 3 中，文字列默认 dtype 为 str；整数数量列是 int64。长得像数字的编号仍可保留为文字，避免丢失前导零。"},{"id":"py14.k3.q5","body":"只看前两行，两列似乎都像整数。实际 dtype 是否也相同？填写显示结果。\n\n```python\nwhole = pd.Series([1, 2, 3])\nmixed = pd.Series([1, 2, 3.5])\nprint(str(whole.dtype))\nprint(str(mixed.dtype))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"whole","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第一列 dtype","key":"int64"},{"id":"mixed","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"第二列 dtype","key":"float64"}],"explanation":"dtype 描述整列，不只描述预览的头两项。mixed 含有 3.5，因此整列使用 float64，不能凭前两项推断它是整数列。"}],"review":[{"id":"py14.k3.r1","body":"读题面最前面的表 plants，回答下面的问题。\n","slots":[{"id":"numeric","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"哪几列的类型是数值（int64 或 float64）？选出所有是的。","options":[{"id":"plant_id","content":"plant_id"},{"id":"height_cm","content":"height_cm"},{"id":"leaves","content":"leaves"},{"id":"flowering","content":"flowering"}],"key":["height_cm","leaves"]},{"id":"height","type":"choice","prompt":"height_cm 是哪一种？","options":[{"id":"int64","content":"int64"},{"id":"float64","content":"float64"},{"id":"str","content":"str"}],"key":"float64"}],"explanation":"数值列是 **height_cm 和 leaves**：height_cm 带小数，是 **float64**（13.0 也是小数的写法）；leaves 是整数 int64。plant_id 是编号，是文字 str；flowering 只有 True 和 False，是 bool。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：四株植物","columns":{"plant_id":["A01","A02","A03","A04"],"height_cm":[12.5,13.0,11.8,12.2],"leaves":[6,7,5,6],"flowering":[false,true,false,true]},"dtypes":{"height_cm":"float"}}]},{"id":"py14.k3.r2","body":"同事要报告“这项研究有几位受试者”，写了 `len(doses)`，得到 6。\n","slots":[{"id":"right","type":"choice","prompt":"这个数对吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"对，一行就是一位受试者"},{"id":"no","content":"不对，一行是一位受试者的一次访视，同一位受试者占好几行"}],"key":"no"},{"id":"subjects","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"实际有几位受试者？","key":3}],"explanation":"**不对。** K01 出现了三行、K02 两行，visit 不同：一行是一位受试者的一次访视，`len(doses)` 数的是访视次数 6。受试者只有 K01、K02、K03 这 **3** 位，要数不同的 subject。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"doses","caption":"表 doses：受试者的给药记录","columns":{"subject":["K01","K01","K01","K02","K02","K03"],"visit":[1,2,3,1,2,1],"dose_mg":[10,10,20,10,15,10]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py14.k3.x1","body":"读题面最前面的表 cells。\n","slots":[{"id":"dtypes","type":"table","prompt":"`cells.dtypes` 里，每列显示的类型是什么？","columns":[{"id":"column","header":"列"},{"id":"dtype","header":"dtype","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int64","label":"int64"},{"id":"float64","label":"float64"},{"id":"str","label":"str"},{"id":"bool","label":"bool"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"well","cells":{"column":"well","dtype":"str"}},{"id":"cells_k","cells":{"column":"cells_k","dtype":"float64"}},{"id":"treated","cells":{"column":"treated","dtype":"bool"}},{"id":"batch","cells":{"column":"batch","dtype":"str"}}]}],"explanation":"| 列 | dtype | 依据 |\n|---|---|---|\n| well | str | 孔位编号 A1、B2 是文字 |\n| cells_k | float64 | 写成 12.0、8.0，是小数，即使小数部分是 0 |\n| treated | bool | 只有 True 和 False |\n| batch | str | \"07\"、\"12\" 是批号，存成了文字，前导零还在 |\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"cells","caption":"表 cells：细胞计数","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2"],"cells_k":[12.0,8.0,15.0,9.0],"treated":[true,false,true,false],"batch":["07","07","12","12"]},"dtypes":{"cells_k":"float"}}]},{"id":"py14.k3.x2","body":"读题面最前面的表 plots：在几个样方里数了各种植物的株数，一行是“某个样方里某种植物的一次计数”。\n\n下面四件事，各要数出几个？\n","slots":[{"id":"counts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"要数的"},{"id":"n","header":"个数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"rows","cells":{"what":"表有几行","n":6}},{"id":"plots","cells":{"what":"一共调查了几个样方","n":3}},{"id":"species","cells":{"what":"一共记录到几种植物","n":3}},{"id":"dandelion","cells":{"what":"蒲公英出现在几个样方里","n":2}}]}],"explanation":"同一个样方（Q1）占了三行，同一种植物（蒲公英）占了两行，所以要数的东西不同，数法也不同：\n\n- 表有几行：**6**，每行是一次计数；\n- 样方个数：数 plot 列里**不同的**编号，Q1、Q2、Q3，**3** 个，不是 6；\n- 植物种数：数 species 列里不同的名字，蒲公英、车前草、狗尾草，**3** 种；\n- 蒲公英出现在几个样方里：只看 species 是蒲公英的两行，它们在 Q1 和 Q2，**2** 个样方。\n\n先想清楚一行代表什么，再决定数行，还是数某一列里不同的值。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：样方调查","columns":{"plot":["Q1","Q1","Q1","Q2","Q2","Q3"],"species":["蒲公英","车前草","狗尾草","蒲公英","狗尾草","车前草"],"count":[4,2,7,3,5,1]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py15","title":"读入 CSV，先确认没有读错","summary":"用 read_csv 的路径、sep 和 encoding 把文件读对；用 dtype={\"列名\": \"str\"} 保住编号的前导零；读完核对列名、行数和前几行。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py14","py04"],"intro":"这一节把文件读成表。题目会先显示文件的内容，也就是用记事本打开看到的样子；宿主已经运行了 `import pandas as pd`，并把文件放在了题目说的位置。\n\n读文件最怕的不是报错，而是没报错却读错了。所以每次读完，都要核对一下读出来的表。\n","wrapup":"读一个 CSV，先说清四件事：文件在哪里（路径）、用什么隔开（sep）、按什么编码存的（encoding）、哪些编号列要按文字读（dtype）。读完马上核对列名、行数和前几行。\n\n请别人或 AI 写读入代码时，可以把这几件事和核对结果一起写进要求，例如：“data/plates.csv，分号分隔，GBK 编码，well 和 batch 按文字读；读入后应有 96 行、5 列。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py15.k1","title":"read_csv 的路径、分隔符和编码","key":["py04","py14"],"links":["py04.k2"],"card":{"name":"read_csv","aliases":["读入 CSV","sep","encoding","路径"],"definition":"`pd.read_csv(路径, sep=分隔符, encoding=编码)` 按路径找到文件，用 sep 把每行切成列，用 encoding 把文件里的字节解读成文字，得到一张表；sep 默认是逗号，encoding 默认是 UTF-8。","conditions":["分隔符不对时不报错，整行挤成一列：列数是 1，列名里还带着分号或制表符。","中文 Windows 上 Excel 另存的 CSV 常是 GBK 编码，按默认的 UTF-8 读会报 UnicodeDecodeError，要写 encoding=\"gbk\"。"],"example":"samples.csv 用分号隔开。`pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\")` 读成 3 行 1 列，列名是一整串 sample_id;signal;group；加上 `sep=\";\"` 才是 3 列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id;signal;group\\nS_A;8;control\\nS_B;10;drug\\nS_C;13;drug\\n\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id;signal;group\nS_A;8;control\nS_B;10;drug\nS_C;13;drug\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"CSV 是用纯文字存的表格：一行是一条记录，同一行的值用分隔符隔开，第一行通常是列名。用 pandas 的 read_csv 把它读成一张表：\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"data/samples.csv\")\n```\n\n读之前要说清三件事。\n\n**路径**：第一个参数，文件在哪里。`\"data/samples.csv\"` 是相对路径：从程序运行的文件夹出发，进入 data 文件夹，找 samples.csv。路径写错、或者文件不在那里，报 FileNotFoundError。\n\nWindows 上复制来的完整路径带反斜杠，例如 `C:\\Users\\wang\\samples.csv`。直接放进引号里不行：引号里的 `\\U` 这类组合对 Python 有特殊含义，会报语法错误。改成正斜杠 `\"C:/Users/wang/samples.csv\"`，或者在引号前加一个 r：`r\"C:\\Users\\wang\\samples.csv\"`。\n\n**分隔符 sep**：默认是逗号。有的文件用分号（不少欧洲语言版本的 Excel 这样存）或制表符隔开，要写 `sep=\";\"` 或 `sep=\"\\t\"`（`\\t` 代表制表符）。分隔符不对，read_csv **不会报错**，而是把整行当成一个值：表只剩一列，列名是 `sample_id;signal;group` 这样一整串。\n\n**编码 encoding**：文件里的中文是按某种编码存成字节的，read_csv 默认按 UTF-8 解读。中文 Windows 上 Excel 另存的 CSV 常常是 GBK 编码，按默认方式读会报 UnicodeDecodeError，写 `encoding=\"gbk\"` 让它按 GBK 解读。\n\nsep 和 encoding 都是[关键字参数](repa:concept/py04.k2)，可以一起写，先后不限：\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", sep=\";\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n```\n\n读完先看 `df.shape` 和 `list(df.columns)`：列数和列名对了，分隔符就对了。\n","example":{"id":"py15.k1.e0","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\")\nprint(df.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"读进来的表有几行？","key":3},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"有几列？","key":1},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要读成 sample_id、signal、group 三列，第 1 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"comma","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", sep=\",\")\n```\n"},{"id":"semicolon","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", sep=\";\")\n```\n"},{"id":"encoding","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n```\n"}],"key":"semicolon"}],"explanation":"文件用分号隔开，read_csv 默认按逗号切分。整行里一个逗号也没有，于是每行成了一个值：表有 **3** 行、**1** 列，列名是一整串 `sample_id;signal;group`。这时程序不报错，只有看 shape 或列名才会发现。\n\n改成 **`sep=\";\"`** 就读成了 3 列。`sep=\",\"` 就是默认值，结果不变；编码和这个问题无关。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id;signal;group\\nS_A;8;control\\nS_B;10;drug\\nS_C;13;drug\\n\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id;signal;group\nS_A;8;control\nS_B;10;drug\nS_C;13;drug\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py15.k1.q1","body":"```python\nplate = pd.read_csv(\"plate.tsv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"读进来的表有几列？","key":1},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"tab","content":"```python\nplate = pd.read_csv(\"plate.tsv\", sep=\"\\t\")\n```\n"},{"id":"space","content":"```python\nplate = pd.read_csv(\"plate.tsv\", sep=\" \")\n```\n"},{"id":"word","content":"```python\nplate = pd.read_csv(\"plate.tsv\", sep=\"tab\")\n```\n"}],"key":"tab"}],"explanation":"文件用制表符隔开，按默认的逗号切分，每行都切不开，只有 **1** 列。\n\n制表符在引号里写成 **`\"\\t\"`**。看起来像空格，但它不是空格，`sep=\" \"` 切不开；写成英文单词 `\"tab\"`，read_csv 会去找“tab”这三个字母，同样切不开。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"plate.tsv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"well\\tcount\\nA1\\t120\\nA2\\t98\\nB1\\t143\\n\")\n","display":"文件 plate.tsv 的内容，同一行的值之间是一个制表符（Tab 键）：\n\n```text\nwell\tcount\nA1\t120\nA2\t98\nB1\t143\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.q2","body":"```python\ngroups = pd.read_csv(\"groups.csv\")\n```\n\n运行时报错，最后一行是：\n\n```text\nUnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode byte 0xb1 in position 0: invalid start byte\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"path","content":"路径不对，找不到文件"},{"id":"encoding","content":"文件是 GBK 编码，read_csv 按默认的 UTF-8 去解读"},{"id":"sep","content":"分隔符不对"}],"key":"encoding"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"gbk","content":"```python\ngroups = pd.read_csv(\"groups.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n```\n"},{"id":"sep_gbk","content":"```python\ngroups = pd.read_csv(\"groups.csv\", sep=\"gbk\")\n```\n"},{"id":"utf8","content":"```python\ngroups = pd.read_csv(\"groups.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n```\n"}],"key":"gbk"}],"explanation":"UnicodeDecodeError 说的是：按 'utf-8' 解读文件里的字节时，碰到了解读不了的字节。文件找到了（否则是 FileNotFoundError），分隔符的问题也不会报这个错；问题是**文件按 GBK 存、却按 UTF-8 读**。\n\n改成 **`encoding=\"gbk\"`**。编码要写给 encoding，写给 sep 没有用；`encoding=\"utf-8\"` 就是默认值，结果不变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"groups.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"gbk\") as f:\n    f.write(\"编号,组别,信号\\nS_A,对照,8\\nS_B,用药,10\\nS_C,用药,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 groups.csv 是在中文 Windows 上用 Excel 另存的，编码是 GBK。内容：\n\n```text\n编号,组别,信号\nS_A,对照,8\nS_B,用药,10\nS_C,用药,13\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.q3","body":"要求：把 data 文件夹里的 plates.csv 读成一张表，存进 `plates`，三列依次是孔位、计数、处理。\n\n作答框里的代码报 FileNotFoundError。改动它，让读出来的表正确。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"plates = pd.read_csv(\"plates.csv\")\n","solution":"plates = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", sep=\";\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n","accepts":["plates = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\", sep=\";\")","plates = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", sep=\";\", encoding=\"gb18030\")"],"rejects":[{"code":"plates = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\")","why":"只改了路径和编码，没写分号分隔，读成一列"},{"code":"plates = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", sep=\";\")","why":"没写编码，按 UTF-8 读 GBK 文件报错"},{"code":"plates = pd.read_csv(\"plates.csv\", sep=\";\", encoding=\"gbk\")","why":"路径没改，文件在 data 文件夹里"}],"tests":[{"name":"读出三列三行","expect":{"plates.shape":"(3, 3)","list(plates.columns)":"[\"孔位\", \"计数\", \"处理\"]","list(plates[\"计数\"])":"[120, 98, 143]"}},{"name":"换一份同样格式的文件","hidden":true,"data":["data_plates2"],"expect":{"plates.shape":"(4, 3)","list(plates.columns)":"[\"孔位\", \"计数\", \"处理\"]","list(plates[\"孔位\"])":"[\"C1\", \"C2\", \"D1\", \"D2\"]"}}]}],"explanation":"三处都要说清：路径带上 data 文件夹，分号分隔，GBK 编码。\n\n```python\nplates = pd.read_csv(\"data/plates.csv\", sep=\";\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n```\n\nsep 和 encoding 都是关键字参数，谁先谁后都可以。只改一两处，要么还是报错，要么不报错却读成一列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nimport pandas as pd\nos.makedirs(\"data\", exist_ok=True)\nwith open(\"data/plates.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"gbk\") as f:\n    f.write(\"孔位;计数;处理\\nA1;120;对照\\nA2;98;用药\\nB1;143;对照\\n\")\n","display":"程序运行的文件夹里有一个 data 文件夹，plates.csv 在 data 里面。它用分号隔开，编码是 GBK。内容：\n\n```text\n孔位;计数;处理\nA1;120;对照\nA2;98;用药\nB1;143;对照\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.q4","body":"samples.csv 使用分号分隔。两种读法都不报错，但各读出几列？\n\n```python\nprint(pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\").shape[1])\nprint(pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", sep=\";\").shape[1])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"default","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"默认读法列数","key":1},{"id":"explicit","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"指定分号后的列数","key":3}],"explanation":"默认 sep 是逗号，所以第一种读法把整行当成一列。指定分号后才把 sample_id、signal、group 拆成三列；“没报错”不保证读对了。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id;signal;group\\nS_A;8;control\\nS_B;10;drug\\nS_C;13;drug\\n\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id;signal;group\nS_A;8;control\nS_B;10;drug\nS_C;13;drug\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.q5","body":"当前工作目录下只有 data 文件夹，assays.csv 在 data 里面。为什么下面的相对路径失败？选择正确的修订。\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"assays.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"path","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"nested","content":"`pd.read_csv(\"data/assays.csv\")`"},{"id":"parent","content":"`pd.read_csv(\"../assays.csv\")`"},{"id":"format","content":"`pd.read_csv(\"assays.csv\", sep=\";\")`"}],"key":"nested"}],"explanation":"相对路径从当前工作目录出发，必须进入 data 才能找到文件。改分隔符不能修正文件位置，../ 则走向上一级目录。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nimport pandas as pd\nos.makedirs(\"data\", exist_ok=True)\nwith open(\"data/assays.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\nS_B,10\\n\")\n","display":"程序运行的文件夹叫 project，里面有一个 data 文件夹，assays.csv 在 data 里面：\n\n```text\nproject/\n    data/\n        assays.csv\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py15.k1.r1","body":"同事上次读的文件是分号分隔的，这次照抄了那一行代码，只改了文件名。\n\n```python\nsites = pd.read_csv(\"sites.csv\", sep=\";\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"运行结果是什么？","options":[{"id":"error","content":"报错，因为文件里没有分号"},{"id":"one_column","content":"不报错，读成 3 行 1 列，列名是 site,depth"},{"id":"right","content":"不报错，读成 3 行 2 列"}],"key":"one_column"},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`sites.shape` 的第二个数是多少？","key":1}],"explanation":"这个文件用逗号隔开，却让 read_csv 按分号切分。行里一个分号也没有，整行成了一个值：**不报错**，读成 3 行 **1** 列，列名是一整串 `site,depth`。\n\n分隔符不对时 read_csv 不会提醒你，所以读完要看列数和列名。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"sites.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"site,depth\\n北坡,30\\n南坡,25\\n东坡,35\\n\")\n","display":"文件 sites.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsite,depth\n北坡,30\n南坡,25\n东坡,35\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.r2","body":"AI 给的代码里，路径是从 Windows 的资源管理器复制的：\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"C:\\Users\\wang\\samples.csv\")\n```\n\n运行时报语法错误：`SyntaxError: (unicode error) 'unicodeescape' codec can't decode bytes ...`\n","slots":[{"id":"fixes","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"改成下面哪几种写法，可以消除这个错误、仍然指向同一个文件？选出所有可以的。","options":[{"id":"forward","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"C:/Users/wang/samples.csv\")\n```\n"},{"id":"raw","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(r\"C:\\Users\\wang\\samples.csv\")\n```\n"},{"id":"encoding","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"C:\\Users\\wang\\samples.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n```\n"},{"id":"single","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv('C:\\Users\\wang\\samples.csv')\n```\n"}],"key":["forward","raw"]}],"explanation":"问题出在引号里的反斜杠：`\\U` 对 Python 有特殊含义（后面应当跟一串十六进制数字），这里跟的是 sers，读不下去，所以连程序都没有开始运行。\n\n可以的是**改成正斜杠**，Windows 同样认得；或者**在引号前加 r**，让反斜杠按原样保留。加 encoding 不碰引号里的写法；换成单引号也一样，单双引号在这里没有区别。（把每个反斜杠写成两个 `\\\\` 也可以。）\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py15.k1.x1","body":"分别用下面三行代码读 survey.csv，结果各是什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"outcomes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"代码"},{"id":"outcome","header":"结果","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"decode_error","label":"报 UnicodeDecodeError"},{"id":"one_column","label":"不报错，读成 1 列"},{"id":"three_columns","label":"不报错，读成 3 列"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"plain","cells":{"call":"`pd.read_csv(\"survey.csv\", sep=\";\")`","outcome":"decode_error"}},{"id":"enc","cells":{"call":"`pd.read_csv(\"survey.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\")`","outcome":"one_column"}},{"id":"both","cells":{"call":"`pd.read_csv(\"survey.csv\", sep=\";\", encoding=\"gbk\")`","outcome":"three_columns"}}]}],"explanation":"这个文件有两处和默认不同：分号分隔、GBK 编码。\n\n| 代码 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| 只写 `sep=\";\"` | 仍按 UTF-8 解读 GBK 的字节，报 UnicodeDecodeError |\n| 只写 `encoding=\"gbk\"` | 中文读对了，但按逗号切分，读成 1 列 |\n| 两个都写 | 读成样方、物种、株数 3 列 |\n\n编码不对会报错；分隔符不对不报错，只会读成一列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"survey.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"gbk\") as f:\n    f.write(\"样方;物种;株数\\nQ1;蒲公英;4\\nQ1;车前草;2\\nQ2;狗尾草;7\\n\")\n","display":"文件 survey.csv 用分号隔开，编码是 GBK。内容：\n\n```text\n样方;物种;株数\nQ1;蒲公英;4\nQ1;车前草;2\nQ2;狗尾草;7\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.x2","body":"程序在 project 文件夹里运行。下面哪一行能读到 assays.csv？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"bare","content":"```python\nassays = pd.read_csv(\"assays.csv\")\n```\n"},{"id":"data","content":"```python\nassays = pd.read_csv(\"data/assays.csv\")\n```\n"},{"id":"project","content":"```python\nassays = pd.read_csv(\"project/data/assays.csv\")\n```\n"}],"key":"data"}],"explanation":"相对路径从**程序运行的文件夹**，也就是 project 出发。文件在 project 下面的 data 里，所以写 **`\"data/assays.csv\"`**。\n\n只写 `\"assays.csv\"`，会在 project 里直接找，找不到；写 `\"project/data/assays.csv\"`，会去找 project 里面的又一个 project 文件夹，也找不到。两者都报 FileNotFoundError。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nimport pandas as pd\nos.makedirs(\"data\", exist_ok=True)\nwith open(\"data/assays.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\nS_B,10\\n\")\n","display":"程序运行的文件夹叫 project，里面有一个 data 文件夹，assays.csv 在 data 里面：\n\n```text\nproject/\n    data/\n        assays.csv\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k1.x3","body":"文件中使用分号，不能仅凭没有异常就宣告读取成功。对照默认读取和指定分隔符后的列名。\n\n```python\nprint(pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\").columns.tolist())\nprint(pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", sep=\";\").columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['sample_id;signal;group']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"['sample_id', 'signal', 'group']"}],"explanation":"默认读取把整条标题当成一个列名，显式 sep=';' 才按文件实际分隔方式拆列。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id;signal;group\\nS_A;8;control\\nS_B;10;drug\\nS_C;13;drug\\n\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id;signal;group\nS_A;8;control\nS_B;10;drug\nS_C;13;drug\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py15.k2","title":"读懂 dtype={\"id\": \"str\"} 的列名到类型配置，保留前导零","key":["py03","py14"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"dtype 参数","aliases":["保留前导零","按文字读入","列名到类型"],"definition":"`dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}` 告诉 read_csv：sample_id 这一列按文字读，001 就保持 001；没写到的列仍由 pandas 自己判断类型。","conditions":["大括号里每一项写成 \"列名\": \"类型\"，冒号前是列名、后是类型，几项之间用逗号隔开。","要在读入时指定：读成整数以后，原来的 001 已经变成 1，事后转回文字也只能得到 \"1\"。"],"example":"ids.csv 的编号是 001、002、010。不写 dtype 时读成 1、2、10；写了 `dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}`，读成 '001'、'002'、'010'，signal 仍是整数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"ids.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,8\\n002,10\\n010,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 ids.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,8\n002,10\n010,13\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"read_csv 会自己猜每一列的类型。一列全是 001、002、010 这样的值，它当成整数，读成 1、2、10：前导零丢了，001 和 01 也分不开了。编号、邮编、批号这类列，要告诉它“按文字读”：\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n\n`dtype=` 后面大括号里是一份**对照表**，每一项写成 `\"列名\": \"类型\"`：冒号前是列名，冒号后是要读成的类型。这里只有一项，意思是“sample_id 这一列读成 str”。要设好几列，项与项之间用逗号隔开：\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\", \"batch\": \"str\"})\n```\n\n没写到的列照旧由 pandas 判断，signal 仍是整数。大括号这种写法以后讲字典时会细说，这里只要读懂、会写这一种固定形式。\n\n两点要注意：\n\n- **在读入时就指定。** 读成整数以后，原来是 001 还是 1 已经没有记录了，事后再转成文字只能得到 \"1\"。\n- **冒号两边不能写反。** `{\"str\": \"sample_id\"}` 的意思成了“名叫 str 的列读成 sample_id 类型”，read_csv 不认识 sample_id 这种类型，会报错。另外，`dtype=\"str\"` 不带大括号，会把**所有列**都读成文字，数值列也不能算了。\n","example":{"id":"py15.k2.e0","body":"```python\na = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\")\nb = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","prompt":"在交互窗口里输入下面两行，各显示什么？","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(a[\"sample_id\"])`","shown":"[1, 2, 10]"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(b[\"sample_id\"])`","shown":"['001', '002', '010']"}}]},{"id":"signal","type":"choice","prompt":"表 b 的 signal 列是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"int64","content":"int64，没写到的列照旧按整数读"},{"id":"str","content":"str，dtype 让所有列都按文字读"}],"key":"int64"}],"explanation":"不写 dtype 时，read_csv 把 sample_id 当成整数：**[1, 2, 10]**，前导零丢了。写了 `dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}`，这一列按文字读：**['001', '002', '010']**，带引号，因为是文字。\n\n对照表里只写了 sample_id，signal 照旧由 pandas 判断，仍是 **int64**，可以计算。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"ids.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,8\\n002,10\\n010,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 ids.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,8\n002,10\n010,13\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py15.k2.q1","body":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行。\n","slots":[{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> df = pd.read_csv(\"batches.csv\")`","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(df[\"batch\"])`","shown":"[7, 7, 12]"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> df2 = pd.read_csv(\"batches.csv\", dtype={\"batch\": \"str\"})`","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(df2[\"batch\"])`","shown":"['07', '07', '12']"}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(df2[\"count\"])`","shown":"[120, 98, 143]"}}]}],"explanation":"| 输入 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `df = pd.read_csv(\"batches.csv\")` | NOTHING：赋值不显示 |\n| `list(df[\"batch\"])` | [7, 7, 12]：批号被当成整数，07 成了 7 |\n| `df2 = pd.read_csv(..., dtype={\"batch\": \"str\"})` | NOTHING |\n| `list(df2[\"batch\"])` | ['07', '07', '12']：按文字读，零还在 |\n| `list(df2[\"count\"])` | [120, 98, 143]：count 没写进对照表，仍是整数 |\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batches.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"well,batch,count\\nA1,07,120\\nA2,07,98\\nB1,12,143\\n\")\n","display":"文件 batches.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nwell,batch,count\nA1,07,120\nA2,07,98\nB1,12,143\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.q2","body":"要求：读入 ids.csv，sample_id 保留 001 这样的写法，signal 仍是可以计算的整数。哪一行符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"reversed","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\", dtype={\"str\": \"sample_id\"})\n```\n","feedback":"冒号两边写反了，成了“名叫 str 的列读成 sample_id 类型”，会报错。"},{"id":"all_str","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\", dtype=\"str\")\n```\n","feedback":"不带大括号，所有列都按文字读，signal 也成了文字。"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n"},{"id":"none","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\")\n```\n","feedback":"不写 dtype，sample_id 被读成整数 1、2、10。"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"**`dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}`** 那一行：冒号前是列名 sample_id，冒号后是类型 str，只改这一列，signal 照旧读成整数。\n\n写反的那行会报错；`dtype=\"str\"` 把 signal 也读成了文字；不写 dtype，编号丢了前导零。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"ids.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,8\\n002,10\\n010,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 ids.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,8\n002,10\n010,13\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.q3","body":"要求：读入 records.csv 存进 `df`，sample_id 和 batch 两列都保留原来的写法（例如 001、07），signal 仍是可以计算的整数。改动作答框里的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\")\n","solution":"df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\", \"batch\": \"str\"})\n","accepts":["df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"batch\": \"str\", \"sample_id\": \"str\"})","df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": str, \"batch\": str})"],"rejects":[{"code":"df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})","why":"只写了 sample_id，batch 的 07 成了 7"},{"code":"df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype=\"str\")","why":"所有列都成了文字，signal 也不能算了"},{"code":"df = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"str\": \"sample_id\", \"str\": \"batch\"})","why":"冒号两边写反了"}],"tests":[{"name":"编号和批号保留原样","expect":{"list(df[\"sample_id\"])":"[\"001\", \"002\", \"010\"]","list(df[\"batch\"])":"[\"07\", \"07\", \"12\"]","str(df[\"signal\"].dtype)":"\"int64\""}},{"name":"换一份文件","hidden":true,"data":["records2"],"expect":{"list(df[\"sample_id\"])":"[\"0105\", \"0107\", \"0110\", \"0200\"]","list(df[\"batch\"])":"[\"003\", \"003\", \"004\", \"004\"]","str(df[\"signal\"].dtype)":"\"int64\""}}]}],"explanation":"对照表里写两项，用逗号隔开：\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\", \"batch\": \"str\"})\n```\n\n两项的先后不要紧。只写 sample_id，batch 会读成 7、7、12；`dtype=\"str\"` 会把 signal 也读成文字。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"records.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,batch,signal\\n001,07,8\\n002,07,10\\n010,12,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 records.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,batch,signal\n001,07,8\n002,07,10\n010,12,13\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.q4","body":"只指定 batch 按文字读，不会让其他所有列都变成文字。写出两个 dtype。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.read_csv(\"batches.csv\", dtype={\"batch\": \"str\"})\nprint(str(table[\"batch\"].dtype))\nprint(str(table[\"count\"].dtype))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"batch","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"batch 的 dtype","key":"str"},{"id":"count","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"count 的 dtype","key":"int64"}],"explanation":"对照表只约束指定的 batch 列，因此批号保留为 str，count 仍由 pandas 按内容推断为整数。它与 dtype=\"str\" 作用到所有列不同。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batches.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"well,batch,count\\nA1,07,120\\nA2,07,98\\nB1,12,143\\n\")\n","display":"文件 batches.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nwell,batch,count\nA1,07,120\nA2,07,98\nB1,12,143\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.q5","body":"先猜成数字再转文字，能把丢失的前导零补回来吗？对照下面两种结果。\n\n```python\nlate = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\")[\"sample_id\"].astype(\"str\")\nearly = pd.read_csv(\"ids.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})[\"sample_id\"]\nprint(late.tolist())\nprint(early.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"late","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"['1', '2', '10']"},{"id":"early","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"['001', '002', '010']"}],"explanation":"第一种读法已经把编号当作数值，前导零的信息随之丢失；事后转 str 只能得到没有前导零的文字。在读入时指定 dtype 才能保留原编号。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"ids.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,8\\n002,10\\n010,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 ids.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,8\n002,10\n010,13\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py15.k2.r1","body":"分别用下面三行代码读 stations.csv。\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","prompt":"每种读法下，在交互窗口里输入 `list(df[\"zip\"])` 显示什么？count 列是什么类型？","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"dtype 参数"},{"id":"zip","header":"list(df[\"zip\"])","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}},{"id":"count","header":"count 的类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int64","label":"int64"},{"id":"str","label":"str"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"none","cells":{"call":"不写 dtype","zip":"[10020, 100871]","count":"int64"}},{"id":"zip_only","cells":{"call":"`dtype={\"zip\": \"str\"}`","zip":"['010020', '100871']","count":"int64"}},{"id":"both","cells":{"call":"`dtype={\"zip\": \"str\", \"count\": \"str\"}`","zip":"['010020', '100871']","count":"str"}}]}],"explanation":"| dtype 参数 | `list(df[\"zip\"])` | count |\n|---|---|---|\n| 不写 | [10020, 100871]：邮编被当成整数，010020 开头的 0 没了 | int64 |\n| `{\"zip\": \"str\"}` | ['010020', '100871']：按文字读，0 还在 | int64：没写到，照旧 |\n| `{\"zip\": \"str\", \"count\": \"str\"}` | ['010020', '100871'] | str：写进了对照表，也按文字读 |\n\n对照表里写了哪一列，就只改哪一列。count 是要计算的数，不该写进去。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"stations.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"station,zip,count\\n北站,010020,5\\n南站,100871,3\\n\")\n","display":"文件 stations.csv 的内容，zip 是邮政编码：\n\n```text\nstation,zip,count\n北站,010020,5\n南站,100871,3\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.r2","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"batches.csv\", dtype={\"batch\": \"str\"})\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"parts","type":"table","prompt":"这一行里，下面两样东西各是什么？","columns":[{"id":"item","header":"代码里的"},{"id":"part","header":"它是","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"column","label":"文件里的一个列名"},{"id":"type","label":"这一列要读成的类型"},{"id":"file","label":"文件名"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"batch","cells":{"item":"`\"batch\"`","part":"column"}},{"id":"str","cells":{"item":"`\"str\"`","part":"type"}}]},{"id":"count","type":"choice","prompt":"文件里的 count 列会怎样读？","options":[{"id":"str","content":"也读成文字，因为写了 dtype"},{"id":"int64","content":"没写进对照表，照旧由 pandas 判断，读成整数"}],"key":"int64"}],"explanation":"冒号前的 `\"batch\"` 是**文件里的列名**，冒号后的 `\"str\"` 是**这一列要读成的类型**。对照表里只有 batch 这一项，count 没写，照旧由 pandas 判断，读成整数 int64。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batches.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"well,batch,count\\nA1,07,120\\nA2,07,98\\nB1,12,143\\n\")\n","display":"文件 batches.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nwell,batch,count\nA1,07,120\nA2,07,98\nB1,12,143\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py15.k2.x1","body":"要求：读入 patients.csv 存进 `pts`，patient_id 保留 0042 这样的写法，visit 和 dose 仍是整数。\n\n作答框里的代码运行时报 TypeError。改动它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"pts = pd.read_csv(\"patients.csv\", dtype={\"str\": \"patient_id\"})\n","solution":"pts = pd.read_csv(\"patients.csv\", dtype={\"patient_id\": \"str\"})\n","accepts":["pts = pd.read_csv(\"patients.csv\", dtype={\"patient_id\": str})"],"rejects":[{"code":"pts = pd.read_csv(\"patients.csv\")","why":"删掉了 dtype，编号读成整数 42"},{"code":"pts = pd.read_csv(\"patients.csv\", dtype=\"str\")","why":"所有列都成了文字"}],"tests":[{"name":"编号保留原样","expect":{"list(pts[\"patient_id\"])":"[\"0042\", \"0042\", \"0107\"]","list(pts[\"dose\"])":"[10, 10, 15]"}},{"name":"换一份文件","hidden":true,"data":["patients2"],"expect":{"list(pts[\"patient_id\"])":"[\"0009\", \"0090\", \"0900\"]","list(pts[\"visit\"])":"[1, 1, 2]"}}]}],"explanation":"冒号两边写反了：原来的意思是“名叫 str 的列读成 patient_id 类型”，read_csv 不认识这种类型，报错。列名放在冒号前，类型放在冒号后：\n\n```python\npts = pd.read_csv(\"patients.csv\", dtype={\"patient_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"patients.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"patient_id,visit,dose\\n0042,1,10\\n0042,2,10\\n0107,1,15\\n\")\n","display":"文件 patients.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\npatient_id,visit,dose\n0042,1,10\n0042,2,10\n0107,1,15\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.x2","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"wells.csv\", dtype={\"well\": \"str\"})\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"batch","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"在交互窗口里输入 `list(df[\"batch\"])`，显示什么？","key":"[7, 7, 12]"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要让 well 和 batch 都保留原来的写法，应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"two_items","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"wells.csv\", dtype={\"well\": \"str\", \"batch\": \"str\"})\n```\n"},{"id":"list_names","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"wells.csv\", dtype={\"well\", \"batch\": \"str\"})\n```\n"},{"id":"two_args","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"wells.csv\", dtype={\"well\": \"str\"}, dtype={\"batch\": \"str\"})\n```\n"}],"key":"two_items"}],"explanation":"对照表里只有 well，batch 照旧由 pandas 判断，读成整数：**[7, 7, 12]**，007 和 012 前面的零丢了。\n\n要两列都按文字读，在**同一个对照表里写两项**，每项都是 `\"列名\": \"类型\"`，用逗号隔开。只在最后写一次类型不行，每一项都要有冒号和类型；dtype 也不能写两次。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"wells.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"well,batch,count\\n01,007,120\\n02,007,98\\n03,012,143\\n\")\n","display":"文件 wells.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nwell,batch,count\n01,007,120\n02,007,98\n03,012,143\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k2.x3","body":"同时设置两列为文字时，每一项分别说明列名与类型，其他列仍按内容推断。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.read_csv(\"records.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\", \"batch\": \"str\"})\nprint(table[\"sample_id\"].tolist())\nprint(table[\"batch\"].tolist())\nprint(str(table[\"signal\"].dtype))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['001', '002', '010']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"['07', '07', '12']"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"int64"}],"explanation":"两项配置分别保留 sample_id、batch 的前导零；未指定的 signal 仍是整数，字典不是把整张表一律变成文字。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"records.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,batch,signal\\n001,07,8\\n002,07,10\\n010,12,13\\n\")\n","display":"文件 records.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,batch,signal\n001,07,8\n002,07,10\n010,12,13\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py15.k3","title":"核对列名、行数与样例","key":["py14"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"读入后核对","aliases":["核对读入","列名检查","行数检查"],"definition":"读入以后马上核对三件事：列名和预期一致（拼写、大小写、空格）；行数等于文件里的数据行数（不算列名那一行）；前几行的值落在该在的列里，类型也对。","conditions":["列名多了空格或换了大小写，之后 `df[\"列名\"]` 会报 KeyError。","文件没有列名行时，第一行数据会被当成列名：行数少 1，列名看起来像数据。"],"example":"batch2.csv 有 4 行数据、没有列名行。读进来是 3 行，列名成了 S_A、8、control：第一行数据被当成了列名。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batch2.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A,8,control\\nS_B,10,drug\\nS_C,13,drug\\nS_D,10,control\\n\")\n","display":"同事导出的 batch2.csv 一共 4 行，内容：\n\n```text\nS_A,8,control\nS_B,10,drug\nS_C,13,drug\nS_D,10,control\n```\n\n按约定，这三列应当是 sample_id、signal、group。\n"}]},"lesson":"read_csv 不报错，不等于读对了。读完花半分钟核对三件事：\n\n1. **列名**：`list(df.columns)` 和预期的一样吗？常见的问题有：列名首尾多了空格（`' signal'`）、大小写不同（`Depth` 和 `depth`），或者整行挤成了一个列名（分隔符不对）。列名不对，后面写 `df[\"signal\"]` 就会报 KeyError。\n2. **行数**：`len(df)` 应当等于文件里的**数据行数**，也就是用记事本看到的总行数减去列名那一行。少了一行，最常见的原因是文件根本没有列名行，第一行数据被当成了列名。\n3. **样例**：`df.head()` 看前几行，值是不是落在了该在的列里，编号的前导零还在不在，数值列是不是数（`df.dtypes`）。\n\n核对的结果可以写成一句话，交给同事或 AI 时就是一份验收条件：“读入后应有 4 行、3 列，列名依次是 sample_id、signal、group，sample_id 是文字。”\n","example":{"id":"py15.k3.e0","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"batch2.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`len(df)` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"`list(df.columns)` 的第一个列名是什么？","key":"S_A"},{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"读对了吗？","options":[{"id":"ok","content":"读对了，只是列名和约定的不一样"},{"id":"header","content":"没读对，文件没有列名行，第一行数据被当成了列名，少了一行"},{"id":"sep","content":"没读对，分隔符不对"}],"key":"header"}],"explanation":"read_csv 默认把文件的第一行当成列名。这个文件没有列名行，第一行 `S_A,8,control` 就成了列名：`list(df.columns)` 是 ['S_A', '8', 'control']，第一个是 **S_A**。剩下的 3 行才是数据，`len(df)` 是 **3**，而文件里有 4 条记录。\n\n所以**没读对**：样本 S_A 的数据丢进了列名里。分隔符是对的，三列都切开了。只看程序没报错，发现不了这个问题，要拿行数和列名去和文件、和约定比。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batch2.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A,8,control\\nS_B,10,drug\\nS_C,13,drug\\nS_D,10,control\\n\")\n","display":"同事导出的 batch2.csv 一共 4 行，内容：\n\n```text\nS_A,8,control\nS_B,10,drug\nS_C,13,drug\nS_D,10,control\n```\n\n按约定，这三列应当是 sample_id、signal、group。\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py15.k3.q1","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"spaced.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"在交互窗口里输入 `list(df.columns)`，显示什么？","key":"['sample_id', ' signal', ' group']"},{"id":"get","type":"choice","prompt":"接着输入 `df[\"signal\"]`，会怎样？","options":[{"id":"series","content":"取出 signal 这一列"},{"id":"error","content":"报 KeyError，表里没有叫 signal 的列"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"第一行的逗号后面有空格，read_csv 把空格也算进了列名：**['sample_id', ' signal', ' group']**，后两个列名以空格开头。\n\n所以 `df[\"signal\"]` 找不到这一列，**报 KeyError**。这类问题肉眼看文件很难发现，看 `list(df.columns)` 时注意引号里的空格。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"spaced.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id, signal, group\\nS_A,8,control\\nS_B,10,drug\\n\")\n","display":"文件 spaced.csv 的内容，第一行的逗号后面各有一个空格：\n\n```text\nsample_id, signal, group\nS_A,8,control\nS_B,10,drug\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k3.q2","body":"你要请同事读入 quadrats.csv。先根据文件内容，写出读入后应当满足的核对条件。\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"item","header":"核对项"},{"id":"expected","header":"应当是","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"rows","cells":{"item":"行数（不算列名）","expected":"5"}},{"id":"cols","cells":{"item":"列数","expected":"3"}},{"id":"last","cells":{"item":"最后一列的列名","expected":"count"}}]},{"id":"plot_type","type":"choice","prompt":"plot 列读进来应当是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"str","content":"str"},{"id":"int64","content":"int64"}],"key":"str"}],"explanation":"文件有 6 行，第一行是列名，所以数据是 **5** 行；每行 **3** 个值，最后一列叫 **count**。plot 列是 Q01 这样的样方编号，应当是文字 **str**。\n\n写成一句话：读入后应有 5 行、3 列，列名依次是 plot、species、count，plot 是文字。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"quadrats.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"plot,species,count\\nQ01,蒲公英,4\\nQ01,车前草,2\\nQ02,狗尾草,7\\nQ03,蒲公英,3\\nQ03,狗尾草,5\\n\")\n","display":"文件 quadrats.csv 的内容：\n\n```text\nplot,species,count\nQ01,蒲公英,4\nQ01,车前草,2\nQ02,狗尾草,7\nQ03,蒲公英,3\nQ03,狗尾草,5\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k3.q3","body":"四次读入的情况如下，预期的列都是 id 和 value。每次最可能是哪里出了问题？\n","slots":[{"id":"causes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"seen","header":"读入后看到的"},{"id":"cause","header":"最可能的问题","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"sep","label":"分隔符不对"},{"id":"header","label":"文件没有列名行"},{"id":"encoding","label":"编码不对"},{"id":"none","label":"没有问题"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"seen":"shape 是 (4, 1)，列名是 `id;value`","cause":"sep"}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"seen":"文件有 4 行，shape 是 (3, 2)，列名是 `A01` 和 `7`","cause":"header"}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"seen":"报 UnicodeDecodeError","cause":"encoding"}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"seen":"文件有 5 行，shape 是 (4, 2)，列名是 `id` 和 `value`","cause":"none"}}]}],"explanation":"| 看到的 | 问题 |\n|---|---|\n| 只有 1 列，列名里有分号 | 分隔符不对，整行没切开 |\n| 行数比文件少 1，列名像数据 | 文件没有列名行，第一行数据成了列名 |\n| UnicodeDecodeError | 编码不对 |\n| 5 行文件读出 4 行数据，列名正确 | 没有问题：第一行本来就是列名 |\n"},{"id":"py15.k3.q4","body":"文件有四条记录，没有标题行。直接使用默认参数读入以后还有几条数据行？这次核对只问行数。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.read_csv(\"batch2.csv\")\nprint(table.shape[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"数据行数","key":3}],"explanation":"默认把第一行当成列名，因此四条原始记录只剩三条数据行。核对输入行数能暴露这种静默丢掉首条记录的问题。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batch2.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A,8,control\\nS_B,10,drug\\nS_C,13,drug\\nS_D,10,control\\n\")\n","display":"同事导出的 batch2.csv 一共 4 行，内容：\n\n```text\nS_A,8,control\nS_B,10,drug\nS_C,13,drug\nS_D,10,control\n```\n\n按约定，这三列应当是 sample_id、signal、group。\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k3.q5","body":"读完后直接核对列名，不凭屏幕上差不多的外观猜。填写 Python 显示的列名列表。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.read_csv(\"spaced.csv\")\nprint(table.columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"names","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"列名列表","key":"['sample_id', ' signal', ' group']"}],"explanation":"默认读取保留逗号后的空格，后两个列名分别以一个空格开头。程序里的 'signal' 和文件里的 ' signal' 是不同名字，核对列名能看出差异。","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"spaced.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id, signal, group\\nS_A,8,control\\nS_B,10,drug\\n\")\n","display":"文件 spaced.csv 的内容，第一行的逗号后面各有一个空格：\n\n```text\nsample_id, signal, group\nS_A,8,control\nS_B,10,drug\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py15.k3.r1","body":"```python\nruns = pd.read_csv(\"week2.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shape","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"在交互窗口里输入 `runs.shape`，显示什么？","key":"(5, 3)"},{"id":"where","type":"choice","prompt":"运行 R01 的那条记录在读出的表里吗？","options":[{"id":"first_row","content":"在，是第一行数据"},{"id":"header","content":"不在数据里，它成了列名"},{"id":"lost","content":"被丢掉了，哪里都没有"}],"key":"header"}],"explanation":"文件没有列名行，read_csv 照样把第一行当成列名：6 条记录只剩 5 行数据，`runs.shape` 是 **(5, 3)**。R01 那条记录**成了列名** R01、42、ok，不在数据里。\n\n文件 6 行、表 5 行，这个差就是线索。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"week2.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"R01,42,ok\\nR02,38,ok\\nR03,51,fail\\nR04,40,ok\\nR05,45,ok\\nR06,36,fail\\n\")\n","display":"文件 week2.csv 一共 6 行，每行是一次仪器运行的编号、时长和状态：\n\n```text\nR01,42,ok\nR02,38,ok\nR03,51,fail\nR04,40,ok\nR05,45,ok\nR06,36,fail\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py15.k3.r2","body":"如果读入 batch2.csv 时第一行数据被当成了列名，下面哪几项核对能发现这个问题？选出所有能发现的。\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"rows","content":"`len(df)` 是否等于文件里的记录数 4"},{"id":"columns","content":"`list(df.columns)` 是否是 sample_id、signal、group"},{"id":"error","content":"程序运行时有没有报错"},{"id":"suffix","content":"文件名是否以 .csv 结尾"}],"key":["rows","columns"]}],"explanation":"**行数**和**列名**这两项都能发现：读出 3 行而不是 4 行，列名是 S_A、8、control 而不是约定的名字。\n\n程序不会报错，文件名也没有问题，这两项看不出任何异常。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"batch2.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A,8,control\\nS_B,10,drug\\nS_C,13,drug\\nS_D,10,control\\n\")\n","display":"同事导出的 batch2.csv 一共 4 行，内容：\n\n```text\nS_A,8,control\nS_B,10,drug\nS_C,13,drug\nS_D,10,control\n```\n\n按约定，这三列应当是 sample_id、signal、group。\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py15.k3.x1","body":"读入 survey2.csv 以后，`df.shape` 是 (12, 1)，`list(df.columns)` 显示 `['site\\tspecies\\tcount']`（`\\t` 是制表符）。最可能是哪里出了问题？\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"header","content":"文件没有列名行"},{"id":"encoding","content":"编码不对"},{"id":"sep","content":"文件用制表符分隔，却按逗号切分"},{"id":"none","content":"没有问题"}],"key":"sep"}],"explanation":"只有 1 列、列名里夹着制表符，说明每行都没有被切开：文件**用制表符分隔，read_csv 却按默认的逗号切分**，要加 `sep=\"\\t\"`。编码不对会报错；没有列名行时列数是对的，只是列名像数据。\n"},{"id":"py15.k3.x2","body":"约定：depths.csv 读入后应有 4 行，列名依次是 site、depth，site 是文字。\n\n```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"depths.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"table","prompt":"逐项核对，哪几项通过？","columns":[{"id":"item","header":"核对项"},{"id":"passed","header":"通过了吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"rows","cells":{"item":"有 4 行","passed":true}},{"id":"columns","cells":{"item":"列名依次是 site、depth","passed":false}},{"id":"site","cells":{"item":"site 是文字","passed":true}}]},{"id":"columns","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"在交互窗口里输入 `list(df.columns)`，显示什么？","key":"['site', 'Depth ']"}],"explanation":"行数和 site 的类型都对，**列名没有通过**：文件里写的是 `Depth `，大写 D，后面还有一个空格，读出来是 **['site', 'Depth ']**。之后写 `df[\"depth\"]` 会报 KeyError。\n\n只看文件很难发现末尾的空格，按约定逐项核对就能抓到。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"depths.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"site,Depth \\n北坡,30\\n南坡,25\\n东坡,35\\n西坡,30\\n\")\n","display":"文件 depths.csv 的内容（第一行末尾 Depth 后面有一个空格，记事本里看不出来）：\n\n```text\nsite,Depth\n北坡,30\n南坡,25\n东坡,35\n西坡,30\n```\n"}]}]}]},{"id":"py16","title":"取列、取行，先辨认用的是哪种索引","summary":"分清 df[\"列\"] 和 df[[\"列\", …]] 取出的形状；loc 按标签、iloc 按位置取行和值；同样写 2:4，loc 包含右端、iloc 不包含。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py14","py06"],"intro":"这一节从表里取出需要的列、行和值。宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，题面最前面会显示要用的表；每道题都从题面的表重新开始。\n\n很多题用表 T。它左边的行索引是 31、7、22、4，是每一行的标签，不是从 0 开始的序号；这一节的关键就是分清“标签”和“第几个”。有些题用交互窗口的形式：`>>>` 后面是输入，什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。\n","wrapup":"读到取数据的代码，先认写法：`df[\"列\"]` 是一列，`df[[\"列\", …]]` 是一张表；`loc` 用标签和列名，`iloc` 用从 0 开始的位置；切片时 loc 包含右端，iloc 不包含。\n\n向 AI 描述要哪几行时，说清是“行索引为 22 的样本”还是“表里的第 3 行”，是“第 2 天到第 5 天，含第 5 天”还是“前 4 行”。这两种说法在表经过筛选、排序以后会指向不同的行。\n","kps":[{"id":"py16.k1","title":"单列与多列选择返回不同形状","key":["py14","py06"],"links":["py14.k1","py06.k1"],"card":{"name":"取列","aliases":["选列","单列","多列","双层方括号"],"definition":"`df[\"signal\"]` 取出一列，得到 Series，shape 只有一个数；`df[[\"signal\"]]`、`df[[\"group\", \"sample_id\"]]` 用列名列表取列，得到 DataFrame，列按列表里的顺序排。","conditions":["外层方括号是“从表里取”，里层方括号是列名列表；列表只有一项时，结果也是一张表。","取几列要写成列表：`df[\"a\", \"b\"]` 不是取两列，会报 KeyError。"],"example":"表 T 里，`df[\"signal\"]` 是 Series，shape 为 (4,)；`df[[\"signal\"]]` 是只有一列的表，(4, 1)；`df[[\"group\", \"sample_id\"]]` 是两列的表，group 在前，(4, 2)。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"lesson":"[取出一列](repa:concept/py14.k1)写 `df[\"signal\"]`，得到 Series：一列值，带着行索引。它只有一个方向，shape 只有一个数，写成 `(4,)`。\n\n要取几列，在方括号里放一个**列名列表**：`df[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]`。外层的方括号是“从 df 里取”，里层的方括号是一个[列表](repa:concept/py06.k1)。得到的是一张表（DataFrame），列按列表里的顺序排列，行和行索引不变。\n\n| 写法 | 得到 | 表 T 上的 shape |\n|---|---|---|\n| `df[\"signal\"]` | Series，一列值 | (4,) |\n| `df[[\"signal\"]]` | DataFrame，只有一列的表 | (4, 1) |\n| `df[[\"group\", \"sample_id\"]]` | DataFrame，两列，group 在前 | (4, 2) |\n\n列表里只有一个列名时，结果仍是一张表。要把结果当表继续用（例如再选行、导出），就写成列表。\n\n少写一层方括号，`df[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]`，pandas 会去找一个名叫 ('sample_id', 'signal') 的列，找不到，报 KeyError。\n","example":{"id":"py16.k1.e0","body":"```python\na = df[\"signal\"]\nb = df[[\"signal\"]]\nc = df[[\"group\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"kinds","type":"table","prompt":"a、b、c 各是什么？在交互窗口里输入 `a.shape` 这样的表达式，显示什么？","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"kind","header":"是什么","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"series","label":"一列（Series）"},{"id":"dataframe","label":"表（DataFrame）"}]}},{"id":"shape","header":"shape 显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"name":"a","kind":"series","shape":"(4,)"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"name":"b","kind":"dataframe","shape":"(4, 1)"}},{"id":"c","cells":{"name":"c","kind":"dataframe","shape":"(4, 2)"}}]},{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"c 的第一列是哪一列？","key":"group"}],"explanation":"- `a` 是 **Series**，一列 4 个值，shape 是 **(4,)**：只有一个数，后面的逗号表示这是只有一项的一组数。\n- `b` 用列名列表取列，即使只有一项，也是一张表（**DataFrame**），4 行 1 列，**(4, 1)**。\n- `c` 是 4 行 2 列的表，**(4, 2)**，列按列表的顺序排，第一列是 **group**，不按原表的顺序。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py16.k1.q1","body":"在交互窗口里依次输入下面几行。\n","slots":[{"id":"wwpd","type":"table","prompt":"Python 显示什么？什么也不显示填 NOTHING，报错填 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"input","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"input":"`>>> soil[\"depth\"].shape`","shown":"(4,)"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"input":"`>>> soil[[\"depth\"]].shape`","shown":"(4, 1)"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"input":"`>>> list(soil[[\"depth\", \"site\"]].columns)`","shown":"['depth', 'site']"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"input":"`>>> soil[\"depth\", \"site\"]`","shown":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"| 输入 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `soil[\"depth\"].shape` | (4,)：一列 Series |\n| `soil[[\"depth\"]].shape` | (4, 1)：只有一列的表 |\n| `list(soil[[\"depth\", \"site\"]].columns)` | ['depth', 'site']：按列表的顺序，depth 在前 |\n| `soil[\"depth\", \"site\"]` | ERROR：少了一层方括号，pandas 去找一个叫 ('depth', 'site') 的列，报 KeyError |\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]},{"id":"py16.k1.q2","body":"需要一张**表**（DataFrame），只有 sample_id 一列，行和行索引不变。哪一行做得到？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"single","content":"```python\nresult = df[\"sample_id\"]\n```\n","feedback":"这是一列（Series），不是表。"},{"id":"list","content":"```python\nresult = df[[\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"two","content":"```python\nresult = df[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n```\n","feedback":"多了 signal 一列。"}],"key":"list"}],"explanation":"**`df[[\"sample_id\"]]`**：里层是只有一项的列名列表，结果是 4 行 1 列的表。`df[\"sample_id\"]` 得到的是一列 Series；`df[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]` 多了一列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k1.q3","body":"想要一张只有 signal 和 group 两列的表，运行下面这行报 KeyError：\n\n```python\nresult = df[\"signal\", \"group\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"names","content":"表里没有 signal 或 group 这两列"},{"id":"brackets","content":"少了一层方括号，两个列名没有写成列表"},{"id":"order","content":"signal 和 group 的顺序写反了"}],"key":"brackets"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"list","content":"```python\nresult = df[[\"signal\", \"group\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"two_lookups","content":"```python\nresult = df[\"signal\"][\"group\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"parens","content":"```python\nresult = df[(\"signal\", \"group\")]\n```\n"}],"key":"list"}],"explanation":"两列都在表里。问题是**少了一层方括号**：`df[\"signal\", \"group\"]` 让 pandas 去找一个名叫 ('signal', 'group') 的列。取几列要把列名写成列表，**`df[[\"signal\", \"group\"]]`**。\n\n`df[\"signal\"][\"group\"]` 先取出 signal 这一列，再去这一列里找标签 group，同样报错；加圆括号和原来是一回事。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k1.q4","body":"按列名列表选择时，输出列按列表给出的顺序排列。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"a\": [1, 2], \"b\": [3, 4], \"c\": [5, 6]})\nselected = table[[\"c\", \"a\"]]\nprint(selected.columns.tolist())\nprint(selected.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"列名顺序","key":"['c', 'a']"},{"id":"shape","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"形状","key":"(2, 2)"}],"explanation":"选择列表明确要求先 c 后 a，不必沿用原表的 a、b、c 顺序。选择了两列，保留原来的两行。"},{"id":"py16.k1.q5","body":"即使只有一行，单列与单列列表仍有不同维数。填写 ndim（维数）的结果。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"score\": [8]})\nprint(table[\"score\"].ndim)\nprint(table[[\"score\"]].ndim)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"one","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"单个列名","key":1},{"id":"two","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"列名列表","key":2}],"explanation":"table['score'] 是一维 Series，table[['score']] 是二维 DataFrame。行数只有一行也不会改变这项区别。"}],"review":[{"id":"py16.k1.r1","body":"```python\nresult = df[[\"group\", \"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","prompt":"`result` 的列依次是什么？","items":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"group","content":"`group`"}],"key":["group","signal","sample_id"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第一个数","key":4},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第二个数","key":3}],"explanation":"列按列表里的顺序排：**group、signal、sample_id**，不再是原表的顺序。行没有变，shape 是 **(4, 3)**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k1.r2","body":"下面哪几个表达式得到的是一张表（DataFrame）？选出所有是表的。\n","slots":[{"id":"tables","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"single","content":"`df[\"group\"]`"},{"id":"list1","content":"`df[[\"group\"]]`"},{"id":"list2","content":"`df[[\"group\", \"signal\"]]`"},{"id":"head","content":"`df.head(2)`"},{"id":"column_head","content":"`df[\"signal\"].head(2)`"}],"key":["list1","list2","head"]}],"explanation":"是表的有：**`df[[\"group\"]]`**、**`df[[\"group\", \"signal\"]]`**（列名列表）和 **`df.head(2)`**（表的前两行仍是表）。\n\n`df[\"group\"]` 是一列 Series；`df[\"signal\"].head(2)` 先取出一列，再取它的前两个值，仍是 Series。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py16.k1.x1","body":"需求：得到一张表 `result`，只有 signal 和 sample_id 两列，signal 在前；行和行索引不变，不改变 `df`。\n\n作答框里的代码报 KeyError。改动它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"result = df[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]\n","solution":"result = df[[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]\n","rejects":[{"code":"result = df[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]","why":"列的顺序反了"},{"code":"result = df[\"signal\"]","why":"只取了一列，还是 Series"},{"code":"result = df","why":"留下了全部列"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 T","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"signal\": [8, 10, 13, 10], \"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]}, index=[31, 7, 22, 4])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["T2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"signal\": [5, 12, 12, 9], \"sample_id\": [\"X_A\", \"X_B\", \"X_C\", \"X_D\"]}, index=[90, 2, 60, 11])","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"两个列名要写成列表，再放进取列的方括号里，顺序按需求：\n\n```python\nresult = df[[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k1.x2","body":"同事说：“`field[[\"crop\"]]` 和 `field[\"crop\"]` 是一样的，只是多写了一对括号。”\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这句话对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，两者完全一样"},{"id":"wrong","content":"不对，一个是只有一列的表，一个是一列 Series"}],"key":"wrong"},{"id":"shapes","type":"table","prompt":"两者的 shape 在交互窗口里各显示什么？","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"shape","header":"shape 显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"double","cells":{"expr":"`field[[\"crop\"]].shape`","shape":"(3, 1)"}},{"id":"single","cells":{"expr":"`field[\"crop\"].shape`","shape":"(3,)"}}]}],"explanation":"**不对。** `field[[\"crop\"]]` 里层是列名列表，得到 3 行 1 列的表，shape 是 **(3, 1)**；`field[\"crop\"]` 是一列 Series，shape 是 **(3,)**。两者的值相同，但是两种东西，后面能接的操作也不完全一样。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三块试验田的产量（千克）","index":["P1","P2","P3"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"crop":["小麦","玉米","大豆"],"yield_kg":[520,610,480]}}]},{"id":"py16.k1.x3","body":"列名列表不仅决定保留哪些列，还决定输出列顺序。只有一列时仍保留二维形状。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"a\": [1, 2], \"b\": [3, 4]})\nresult = table[[\"b\"]]\nprint(result.columns.tolist())\nprint(result.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['b']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"(2, 1)"}],"explanation":"选择列表只含 b，输出两行一列的 DataFrame，不是二维结构消失后的一维对象。"}]},{"id":"py16.k2","title":"loc 用标签，iloc 用位置","key":["py14","py06"],"links":["py06.k2"],"card":{"name":"loc 与 iloc","aliases":["loc","iloc","标签","位置"],"definition":"`df.loc[行标签, 列名]` 按行索引里的标签和列名取；`df.iloc[行位置, 列位置]` 按从 0 开始数的位置取。","conditions":["行索引不是 0、1、2…… 时，同一个数在 loc 和 iloc 里指的是不同的行，或者根本不存在。","loc 找不到标签报 KeyError；iloc 的位置超出范围报 IndexError。"],"example":"表 T 里，`df.loc[22, \"signal\"]` 和 `df.iloc[2, 1]` 都是 13：标签 22 的那一行恰好在位置 2。`df.loc[2]` 报 KeyError，因为没有标签为 2 的行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"lesson":"要从表里取某一个值或某一行，先分清用的是哪一种“地址”。\n\n- **`df.loc[...]` 按标签**：行用行索引里写的标签，列用列名。`df.loc[22, \"signal\"]` 是“行索引为 22 的那一行的 signal”。\n- **`df.iloc[...]` 按位置**：行和列都用[从 0 开始数的位置](repa:concept/py06.k2)。`df.iloc[2, 1]` 是“位置 2 的行、位置 1 的列”，也就是第 3 行、第 2 列。\n\n逗号前是行，逗号后是列。用表 T 对照：\n\n| 位置 | 行索引（标签） | sample_id | signal | group |\n|---:|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 0 | 31 | S_A | 8 | control |\n| 1 | 7 | S_B | 10 | drug |\n| 2 | 22 | S_C | 13 | drug |\n| 3 | 4 | S_D | 10 | control |\n\n- `df.loc[22, \"signal\"]` 和 `df.iloc[2, 1]` 都是 13。\n- 只写行，取到的是一整行：`df.loc[7]` 是标签 7 的那一行，也就是 S_B 那一行；`df.iloc[0]` 是位置 0 的那一行 S_A，它的标签是 31。\n- `df.loc[2]` 报 KeyError：没有标签为 2 的行。`df.iloc[4]` 报 IndexError：位置只有 0 到 3。`df.iloc[-1]` 是最后一行。\n\n行索引恰好是 0、1、2…… 时，两种写法取到同一行，看不出区别；表经过筛选、排序以后，标签和位置就分开了。读代码时先看是 loc 还是 iloc，再去对应的地址找。\n","example":{"id":"py16.k2.e0","body":"读下面四个表达式，填写各自取到的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"取到的值","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"loc22","cells":{"expr":"`df.loc[22, \"signal\"]`","value":"13"}},{"id":"iloc21","cells":{"expr":"`df.iloc[2, 1]`","value":"13"}},{"id":"loc7","cells":{"expr":"`df.loc[7, \"sample_id\"]`","value":"S_B"}},{"id":"iloc00","cells":{"expr":"`df.iloc[0, 0]`","value":"S_A"}}]},{"id":"loc2","type":"choice","prompt":"`df.loc[2, \"signal\"]` 会怎样？","options":[{"id":"value","content":"取到 13，第 3 行的 signal"},{"id":"keyerror","content":"报 KeyError，没有标签为 2 的行"},{"id":"indexerror","content":"报 IndexError，位置超出范围"}],"key":"keyerror"}],"explanation":"| 表达式 | 怎样找 | 值 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `df.loc[22, \"signal\"]` | 标签 22 的行，signal 列 | 13 |\n| `df.iloc[2, 1]` | 位置 2 的行（第 3 行），位置 1 的列（signal） | 13 |\n| `df.loc[7, \"sample_id\"]` | 标签 7 的行，它在第 2 行 | S_B |\n| `df.iloc[0, 0]` | 第 1 行第 1 列 | S_A |\n\n`df.loc[2, \"signal\"]` 按标签找 2，表里的标签只有 31、7、22、4，**报 KeyError**。它不会退回去按位置找。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py16.k2.q1","body":"读下面四个表达式，填写各自取到的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"取到的值","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"loc4","cells":{"expr":"`df.loc[4, \"group\"]`","value":"control"}},{"id":"iloc32","cells":{"expr":"`df.iloc[3, 2]`","value":"control"}},{"id":"ilocm1","cells":{"expr":"`df.iloc[-1, 0]`","value":"S_D"}},{"id":"loc31","cells":{"expr":"`df.loc[31, \"signal\"]`","value":"8"}}]}],"explanation":"| 表达式 | 怎样找 | 值 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `df.loc[4, \"group\"]` | 标签 4 的行，在最后一行 | control |\n| `df.iloc[3, 2]` | 位置 3 的行（第 4 行），位置 2 的列（group） | control |\n| `df.iloc[-1, 0]` | 最后一行，第 1 列 | S_D |\n| `df.loc[31, \"signal\"]` | 标签 31 的行，在第 1 行 | 8 |\n\n标签 4 的行在位置 3，标签 31 的行在位置 0：数字大小和位置没有关系。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k2.q2","body":"想取表里第一行（样本 S_A）的 signal，写了下面这行，报 KeyError：\n\n```python\nvalue = df.loc[0, \"signal\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fixes","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"改成下面哪几种写法，能取到 S_A 的 signal？选出所有可以的。","options":[{"id":"iloc","content":"```python\nvalue = df.iloc[0, 1]\n```\n"},{"id":"label","content":"```python\nvalue = df.loc[31, \"signal\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"one","content":"```python\nvalue = df.loc[1, \"signal\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"mixed","content":"```python\nvalue = df.iloc[0, \"signal\"]\n```\n"}],"key":["iloc","label"]}],"explanation":"loc 按标签找 0，表里没有标签 0。要么改用位置，**`df.iloc[0, 1]`**（第 1 行、第 2 列）；要么用这一行真正的标签，**`df.loc[31, \"signal\"]`**。\n\n`df.loc[1, \"signal\"]` 同样没有标签 1；`df.iloc[0, \"signal\"]` 把位置和列名混在一起，iloc 只认位置，会报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k2.q3","body":"下面四行各自单独运行，结果是什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"outcomes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"代码"},{"id":"outcome","header":"结果","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"row","label":"取到一行"},{"id":"keyerror","label":"报 KeyError"},{"id":"indexerror","label":"报 IndexError"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"loc7","cells":{"expr":"`row = df.loc[7]`","outcome":"row"}},{"id":"loc3","cells":{"expr":"`row = df.loc[3]`","outcome":"keyerror"}},{"id":"iloc3","cells":{"expr":"`row = df.iloc[3]`","outcome":"row"}},{"id":"iloc7","cells":{"expr":"`row = df.iloc[7]`","outcome":"indexerror"}}]}],"explanation":"| 代码 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| `df.loc[7]` | 有标签 7，取到 S_B 那一行 |\n| `df.loc[3]` | 没有标签 3，报 KeyError |\n| `df.iloc[3]` | 位置 3 是最后一行，取到 S_D 那一行 |\n| `df.iloc[7]` | 只有位置 0 到 3，报 IndexError |\n\n同一个数字，换成 loc 或 iloc，能不能取到、取到哪一行都不一样。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k2.q4","body":"行标签不按位置排序时，loc 和 iloc 会取到不同的行。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"name\": [\"first\", \"second\", \"third\"]}, index=[2, 0, 1])\nprint(table.loc[0, \"name\"])\nprint(table.iloc[0, 0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"label","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"loc 的结果","key":"second"},{"id":"position","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"iloc 的结果","key":"first"}],"explanation":"loc 的 0 是行标签，位于第二行；iloc 的 0 是第一个位置，所以得到 first。标签中的数字不是隐含的位置编号。"},{"id":"py16.k2.q5","body":"表里没有行标签 1，但确实有第二行。哪一段能取到第二行的 value？\n","slots":[{"id":"access","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"label","content":"`result = table.loc[1, \"value\"]`"},{"id":"position","content":"`result = table.iloc[1, 0]`"},{"id":"first","content":"`result = table.iloc[0, 0]`"}],"key":"position"}],"explanation":"第二行对应位置 1，所以要用 iloc；loc 查找的是标签，表中没有标签 1 时会报 KeyError。"}],"review":[{"id":"py16.k2.r1","body":"同事在表 soil 上取了一行，打印出来是：\n\n```text\nsite     东坡\ndepth    35\nName: 3, dtype: object\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"exprs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"下面哪些表达式取到的就是这一行？选出所有的。","options":[{"id":"loc3","content":"```python\nrow = soil.loc[3]\n```\n"},{"id":"iloc2","content":"```python\nrow = soil.iloc[2]\n```\n"},{"id":"loc2","content":"```python\nrow = soil.loc[2]\n```\n","feedback":"没有标签为 2 的行，会报 KeyError。"},{"id":"iloc3","content":"```python\nrow = soil.iloc[3]\n```\n","feedback":"位置 3 是第 4 行，那是西坡，行索引是 8。"}],"key":["loc3","iloc2"]},{"id":"name","type":"choice","prompt":"最后一行的 `Name: 3` 里，3 是什么？","options":[{"id":"label","content":"这一行的行索引，也就是标签"},{"id":"position","content":"这一行排第几，也就是位置"},{"id":"column","content":"一个列名"}],"key":"label"}],"explanation":"打印出来的是东坡那一行。`Name: 3` 里的 3 是这一行的**行索引**（标签），不是它的位置：东坡在表里排第 3 个，位置是 2，标签才是 3。\n\n所以 `soil.loc[3]`（按标签 3 取）和 `soil.iloc[2]`（按位置 2 取）取到同一行。`soil.loc[2]` 没有这个标签，报 KeyError；`soil.iloc[3]` 取到位置 3 的西坡，Name 会是 8。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]},{"id":"py16.k2.r2","body":"同事说：“`soil.loc[5]` 和 `soil.iloc[0]` 取到的是同一行；`soil.loc[8]` 和 `soil.iloc[3]` 也是同一行。所以 loc 和 iloc 在这张表上没有区别。”\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这个结论对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，在这张表上两者总是取到同一行"},{"id":"wrong","content":"不对，那两对只是碰巧对上，换个数就不一样"}],"key":"wrong"},{"id":"example","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一对能说明两者不同？","options":[{"id":"pair12","content":"`soil.loc[12]` 和 `soil.iloc[1]`"},{"id":"pair3","content":"`soil.loc[3]` 和 `soil.iloc[3]`"},{"id":"pair8","content":"`soil.loc[8]` 和 `soil.iloc[3]`"}],"key":"pair3"}],"explanation":"**不对。** 标签 5 恰好在位置 0、标签 8 恰好在位置 3，所以那两对取到同一行。换成 **`soil.loc[3]` 和 `soil.iloc[3]`**：前者是标签 3 的东坡，后者是位置 3 的西坡，不是同一行。`soil.loc[12]` 和 `soil.iloc[1]` 又碰巧是同一行（南坡）。\n\nloc 和 iloc 用的是两种地址，结果相同只能说明这张表上这两个地址指向同一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py16.k2.x1","body":"宿主事先给 `label` 赋了一个行索引，例如 22。需求：取出行索引为 `label` 的那一行的 signal，存进 `value`。表换了、label 换了，代码都要能用。\n\n作答框里的代码报 IndexError。改动它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"value = df.iloc[label, 1]\n","solution":"value = df.loc[label, \"signal\"]\n","rejects":[{"code":"value = df.iloc[2, 1]","why":"照着表 T 写死了位置"},{"code":"value = df.loc[label, \"group\"]","why":"取错了列"},{"code":"value = df.loc[22, \"signal\"]","why":"写死了标签，没有用 label"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 T，label 为 22","setup":"label = 22","expect":{"value":"13"}},{"name":"表 T，label 为 4","hidden":true,"setup":"label = 4","expect":{"value":"10"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["T3"],"setup":"label = 15","expect":{"value":"10"}}]}],"explanation":"label 是行索引里的标签，要用 loc 按标签找，列用列名：\n\n```python\nvalue = df.loc[label, \"signal\"]\n```\n\n`df.iloc[label, 1]` 把 22 当成位置，表只有 4 行，报 IndexError。照着表 T 写成 `df.iloc[2, 1]` 只在这张表、这个 label 上碰巧对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k2.x2","body":"表 field 的行索引是文字 P1、P2、P3。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","prompt":"填写各自取到的值；会报错的写“报错”。","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"结果","input":{"type":"text","quick":["报错"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"locp2","cells":{"expr":"`field.loc[\"P2\", \"crop\"]`","value":"玉米"}},{"id":"iloc21","cells":{"expr":"`field.iloc[2, 1]`","value":"480"}},{"id":"iloc0","cells":{"expr":"`field.iloc[0, 0]`","value":"小麦"}},{"id":"loc1","cells":{"expr":"`field.loc[1, \"crop\"]`","value":"报错"}}]}],"explanation":"| 表达式 | 怎样找 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `field.loc[\"P2\", \"crop\"]` | 标签 P2 的行，crop 列 | 玉米 |\n| `field.iloc[2, 1]` | 位置 2 的行（P3），位置 1 的列（yield_kg） | 480 |\n| `field.iloc[0, 0]` | 第 1 行第 1 列 | 小麦 |\n| `field.loc[1, \"crop\"]` | 标签里没有 1 | 报错（KeyError） |\n\n行索引是文字时，loc 要写文字标签；数字只能交给 iloc 当位置用。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三块试验田的产量（千克）","index":["P1","P2","P3"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"crop":["小麦","玉米","大豆"],"yield_kg":[520,610,480]}}]},{"id":"py16.k2.x3","body":"行标签是文字时，位置 1 仍表示第二行；loc 则按给出的标签找行。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"v\": [4, 8]}, index=[\"second\", \"first\"])\nprint(table.loc[\"first\", \"v\"])\nprint(table.iloc[0, 0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"8"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"4"}],"explanation":"标签 first 恰好在第二行，loc 取到 8；iloc 的第一个位置取到 4，标签文字不决定位置。"}]},{"id":"py16.k3","title":"标签切片与位置切片的右端差异","key":["py06"],"links":["py06.k3"],"card":{"name":"切片的右端","aliases":["loc 切片","iloc 切片","右端"],"definition":"`df.iloc[a:b]` 按位置切片，取位置 a 到 b-1，不含 b，和列表一样；`df.loc[a:b]` 按标签切片，从标签 a 取到标签 b，包含 b。","conditions":["同样写 2:4，loc 和 iloc 的起点和终点都可能指向不同的行，取到的行数也可能不同。","本课只在行索引不重复、按顺序排好的表上用标签切片。"],"example":"表 daily 的行索引是第几天（1 到 6）。`daily.loc[2:4]` 取第 2、3、4 天，3 行；`daily.iloc[2:4]` 取位置 2、3，也就是第 3、4 天，2 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：逐日记录，行索引是第几天","index":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"indexHeader":"第几天（行索引）","columns":{"temp":[18,21,19,24,22,20],"rain":[0,3,0,1,5,0]}}]},"lesson":"[列表的切片](repa:concept/py06.k3) `values[1:3]` 取位置 1 和 2，不含 3：左闭右开。`df.iloc[1:3]` 按位置切行，规则完全一样。\n\n`df.loc[a:b]` 按**标签**切片，规则不同：从标签 a 一直取到标签 b，**包含 b**。标签不一定是连续的整数，可能是编号或日期；“取到 S04 为止”时，通常就是要包括 S04。\n\n用逐日记录表 daily 对照，它的行索引是第几天，从 1 开始，所以标签总比位置大 1：\n\n| 位置 | 第几天（标签） | temp |\n|---:|---:|---:|\n| 0 | 1 | 18 |\n| 1 | 2 | 21 |\n| 2 | 3 | 19 |\n| 3 | 4 | 24 |\n| 4 | 5 | 22 |\n| 5 | 6 | 20 |\n\n- `daily.loc[2:4]`：从第 2 天取到第 4 天，含第 4 天，3 行。\n- `daily.iloc[2:4]`：位置 2、3，也就是第 3、4 天，2 行。\n\n同样写 `2:4`，起点一个是标签 2、一个是位置 2；终点一个包含、一个不包含。省略一端的写法也一样：`daily.loc[4:]` 是第 4 天到最后，`daily.iloc[4:]` 是位置 4 到最后，即第 5、6 天。\n\n读代码时先认出是 loc 还是 iloc，再决定冒号两边的数指的是什么、右端算不算。\n","example":{"id":"py16.k3.e0","body":"```python\na = daily.loc[2:4]\nb = daily.iloc[2:4]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`a` 里有哪几天？按先后排出它们的行索引。","items":[{"id":"1","content":"1"},{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"6","content":"6"}],"key":["2","3","4"]},{"id":"b","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`b` 里有哪几天？按先后排出它们的行索引。","items":[{"id":"1","content":"1"},{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"6","content":"6"}],"key":["3","4"]}],"explanation":"`a = daily.loc[2:4]` 按标签：从第 **2** 天取到第 **4** 天，包含第 4 天，共 3 行。\n\n`b = daily.iloc[2:4]` 按位置：位置 2、3，不含 4。位置 2 是第 **3** 天，位置 3 是第 **4** 天，共 2 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：逐日记录，行索引是第几天","index":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"indexHeader":"第几天（行索引）","columns":{"temp":[18,21,19,24,22,20],"rain":[0,3,0,1,5,0]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py16.k3.q1","body":"```python\na = daily.loc[4:]\nb = daily.iloc[4:]\nc = daily.iloc[:3]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"table","prompt":"每个结果取到第几天到第几天？","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"start","header":"从第几天","input":"integer"},{"id":"end","header":"到第几天（含）","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"name":"a","start":4,"end":6}},{"id":"b","cells":{"name":"b","start":5,"end":6}},{"id":"c","cells":{"name":"c","start":1,"end":3}}]}],"explanation":"| 名字 | 怎样切 | 取到的天 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `daily.loc[4:]` | 从标签 4 到最后 | 第 4–6 天 |\n| `daily.iloc[4:]` | 从位置 4 到最后 | 第 5–6 天 |\n| `daily.iloc[:3]` | 位置 0、1、2 | 第 1–3 天 |\n\n`daily.loc[:3]` 也是第 1–3 天：这里碰巧相同，因为 iloc 少取的右端，正好被标签比位置大 1 抵消了。不能凭这一次相同就认为两者一样。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：逐日记录，行索引是第几天","index":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"indexHeader":"第几天（行索引）","columns":{"temp":[18,21,19,24,22,20],"rain":[0,3,0,1,5,0]}}]},{"id":"py16.k3.q2","body":"表 samples 的行索引是样本编号。\n\n```python\na = samples.loc[\"S02\":\"S04\"]\nb = samples.iloc[1:3]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`a` 里有哪些样本？按先后排列。","items":[{"id":"S01","content":"S01"},{"id":"S02","content":"S02"},{"id":"S03","content":"S03"},{"id":"S04","content":"S04"},{"id":"S05","content":"S05"}],"key":["S02","S03","S04"]},{"id":"b","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`b` 里有哪些样本？按先后排列。","items":[{"id":"S01","content":"S01"},{"id":"S02","content":"S02"},{"id":"S03","content":"S03"},{"id":"S04","content":"S04"},{"id":"S05","content":"S05"}],"key":["S02","S03"]}],"explanation":"`samples.loc[\"S02\":\"S04\"]` 按标签，从 S02 取到 S04，包含 S04：**S02、S03、S04**。\n\n`samples.iloc[1:3]` 按位置，取位置 1、2，不含 3：**S02、S03**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：行索引是样本编号","index":["S01","S02","S03","S04","S05"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"signal":[8,10,13,9,11],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"]}}]},{"id":"py16.k3.q3","body":"需求：取出第 2 天到第 5 天（含第 5 天）的记录，存进 `result`。行索引就是第几天；换一段从别的日子开始的记录，代码也要按天数取。\n\n作答框里的代码取到的是第 3 天到第 5 天。改动它。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"result = daily.iloc[2:5]\n","solution":"result = daily.loc[2:5]\n","rejects":[{"code":"result = daily.iloc[1:5]","why":"照着这张表改了位置，记录换成从第 3 天开始就错了"},{"code":"result = daily.loc[2:4]","why":"按列表的习惯少取了右端，loc 本来就包含右端"},{"code":"result = daily.loc[2:6]","why":"多取了第 6 天"}],"tests":[{"name":"第 1–6 天的记录","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"temp\": [21, 19, 24, 22], \"rain\": [3, 0, 1, 5]}, index=[2, 3, 4, 5])"}},{"name":"从第 3 天开始的记录","hidden":true,"data":["daily2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"temp\": [17, 20, 23], \"rain\": [2, 0, 0]}, index=[3, 4, 5])"}}]}],"explanation":"需求说的是第几天，也就是行索引的标签，用 loc；loc 的切片包含右端，直接写 5：\n\n```python\nresult = daily.loc[2:5]\n```\n\n改成 `daily.iloc[1:5]` 在这张表上也能得到第 2–5 天，但那是照着“标签比位置大 1”凑出来的；记录从第 3 天开始时，位置 1 到 4 就成了第 4–7 天。判分时会换一段这样的记录运行你的代码。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：逐日记录，行索引是第几天","index":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"indexHeader":"第几天（行索引）","columns":{"temp":[18,21,19,24,22,20],"rain":[0,3,0,1,5,0]}}]},{"id":"py16.k3.q4","body":"标签切片与位置切片的右端规则不同。下面用相应的两个范围对照右端是否包含。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"v\": [1, 2, 3]}, index=[10, 20, 30])\nprint(table.loc[10:20].index.tolist())\nprint(table.iloc[0:1].index.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"loc","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"[10, 20]"},{"id":"iloc","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"[10]"}],"explanation":"有序标签索引中，loc 的终点标签 20 也保留；iloc 的位置右端 1 不保留，所以只得到位置 0 的标签 10。"},{"id":"py16.k3.q5","body":"起点与终点相同的范围在两个接口里也不相同。填写各自保留几行。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"v\": [1, 2, 3]}, index=[10, 20, 30])\nprint(table.loc[20:20].shape[0])\nprint(table.iloc[1:1].shape[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"loc","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"loc 行数","key":1},{"id":"iloc","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"iloc 行数","key":0}],"explanation":"loc 包含两端，20:20 保留标签 20 的一行；iloc 左闭右开，1:1 是空范围，保留零行。"}],"review":[{"id":"py16.k3.r1","body":"```python\na = plates.loc[\"P02\":\"P05\"]\nb = plates.iloc[2:5]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`a` 有几行？","key":4},{"id":"b","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`b` 里有哪几块板？按先后排列。","items":[{"id":"P01","content":"P01"},{"id":"P02","content":"P02"},{"id":"P03","content":"P03"},{"id":"P04","content":"P04"},{"id":"P05","content":"P05"},{"id":"P06","content":"P06"}],"key":["P03","P04","P05"]}],"explanation":"`plates.loc[\"P02\":\"P05\"]` 从 P02 取到 P05，含 P05：P02、P03、P04、P05，**4** 行。\n\n`plates.iloc[2:5]` 取位置 2、3、4：**P03、P04、P05**。位置 2 是第 3 块板，右端位置 5（P06）不含。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plates","caption":"表 plates：六块板的细胞数（千个）","index":["P01","P02","P03","P04","P05","P06"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"cells_k":[12,8,15,9,11,14]}}]},{"id":"py16.k3.r2","body":"要取出第 3、4、5 天的记录。下面哪几种写法可以？选出所有可以的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"loc35","content":"`daily.loc[3:5]`"},{"id":"iloc25","content":"`daily.iloc[2:5]`"},{"id":"iloc35","content":"`daily.iloc[3:5]`"},{"id":"loc36","content":"`daily.loc[3:6]`"}],"key":["loc35","iloc25"]}],"explanation":"可以的是 **`daily.loc[3:5]`**（标签 3 到 5，含 5）和 **`daily.iloc[2:5]`**（位置 2、3、4，正是第 3、4、5 天）。\n\n`daily.iloc[3:5]` 是位置 3、4，即第 4、5 天；`daily.loc[3:6]` 多了第 6 天。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：逐日记录，行索引是第几天","index":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"indexHeader":"第几天（行索引）","columns":{"temp":[18,21,19,24,22,20],"rain":[0,3,0,1,5,0]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py16.k3.x1","body":"下面四个切片各取到几行？\n","slots":[{"id":"counts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"rows","header":"行数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"loc13","cells":{"expr":"`daily.loc[1:3]`","rows":3}},{"id":"iloc13","cells":{"expr":"`daily.iloc[1:3]`","rows":2}},{"id":"loc5","cells":{"expr":"`daily.loc[5:]`","rows":2}},{"id":"iloc2","cells":{"expr":"`daily.iloc[:2]`","rows":2}}]}],"explanation":"| 表达式 | 取到 | 行数 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| `daily.loc[1:3]` | 第 1、2、3 天，含右端 | 3 |\n| `daily.iloc[1:3]` | 位置 1、2，即第 2、3 天 | 2 |\n| `daily.loc[5:]` | 第 5 天到最后：第 5、6 天 | 2 |\n| `daily.iloc[:2]` | 位置 0、1，即第 1、2 天 | 2 |\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：逐日记录，行索引是第几天","index":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"indexHeader":"第几天（行索引）","columns":{"temp":[18,21,19,24,22,20],"rain":[0,3,0,1,5,0]}}]},{"id":"py16.k3.x2","body":"需求：取出样本 S02 到 S04（含 S04）的记录。你和同事各写了一行，都在题面的表 samples（编号 S01 到 S05）上试过，取到的都是 S02、S03、S04：\n\n甲：\n\n```python\nresult = samples.loc[\"S02\":\"S04\"]\n```\n\n乙：\n\n```python\nresult = samples.iloc[1:4]\n```\n\n下一批样本的表也叫 samples，但编号从 S02 开始：\n\n| 行索引 | signal | group |\n|---|---:|---|\n| S02 | 7 | drug |\n| S03 | 12 | control |\n| S04 | 9 | drug |\n| S05 | 15 | control |\n| S06 | 6 | drug |\n\n把这两行代码用在下一批上，各会取到哪几个样本？\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"甲取到的样本，按先后排列。","items":[{"id":"S02","content":"S02"},{"id":"S03","content":"S03"},{"id":"S04","content":"S04"},{"id":"S05","content":"S05"},{"id":"S06","content":"S06"}],"key":["S02","S03","S04"]},{"id":"b","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"乙取到的样本，按先后排列。","items":[{"id":"S02","content":"S02"},{"id":"S03","content":"S03"},{"id":"S04","content":"S04"},{"id":"S05","content":"S05"},{"id":"S06","content":"S06"}],"key":["S03","S04","S05"]},{"id":"safe","type":"choice","prompt":"要“按编号取 S02 到 S04”，换一批样本也不出错的是哪一行？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"甲，用 loc 按编号取"},{"id":"b","content":"乙，用 iloc 按位置取"}],"key":"a"}],"explanation":"需求说的是编号，编号是行索引的标签，用 `loc`，右端 S04 也包含在内：甲换一批仍取到 **S02、S03、S04**。\n\n乙按位置取，位置 1 到 3（不含 4）。在第一批里位置 1 到 3 碰巧就是 S02 到 S04；下一批的位置 0 是 S02，位置 1 到 3 变成 **S03、S04、S05**：少了 S02，多了 S05。试一次得到想要的结果，不等于写法在换批次之后还对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：行索引是样本编号","index":["S01","S02","S03","S04","S05"],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"signal":[8,10,13,9,11],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py17","title":"先算条件，再留下需要的行","summary":"用单列比较得到布尔掩码，再用 df.loc[掩码, 列名列表] 留下需要的行和列，并读出结果的形状。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py16","py08"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始，前面题目里的 `mask`、`result` 等变量都已清除。大多数题用表 T：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`signal` 是一次测量的值（任意单位），`group` 是实验组标签；左边的行索引是原表的行标签，不是从小到大的序号；筛选以后各行带着自己的标签走，所以这一节叫它“原行索引”。题目里的“达标”只是人为约定的筛选规则，不代表科研结论。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提需求时，可以直接说：“在原表中保留 signal 至少达到 limit 的行，包括恰好等于阈值的行；输出 sample_id 一列，仍然是表，保留原行顺序和原索引。”\n\n拿到代码后，先看比较符是否包含等号，再看 `.loc` 逗号后面的列名是否符合要求，最后找出原表中恰好等于阈值的行，核对它有没有留下。\n","kps":[{"id":"py17.k1","title":"单列比较生成逐行布尔掩码","key":["py16","py08"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"布尔掩码","aliases":["mask","掩码","逐行比较"],"definition":"对一列做比较时，pandas 逐行判断，得到一列与原表行一一对应的 True/False，叫布尔掩码。","conditions":["掩码只标记哪些行符合条件，这一步还没有从表里去掉任何行。","掩码保留原来的行索引；>= 包含等号，> 不包含。"],"example":"```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\n```\n表 T 的 signal 依次为 8、10、13、10，mask 依次为 False、True、True、True。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"lesson":"先看条件作用在哪一列。`df[\"signal\"]` 取出 signal 这一列；把这一列与 10 比较时，pandas 对每一行分别做同样的比较，所以结果是一列 True/False。它的长度仍然是 4，索引也和原来的列一一对应。\n\n| 原行索引 | signal | `df[\"signal\"] >= 10` |\n|---:|---:|---|\n| 31 | 8 | False |\n| 7 | 10 | True |\n| 22 | 13 | True |\n| 4 | 10 | True |\n\n这列结果叫**布尔掩码**。它告诉你哪些行符合条件，但这一步还没有把任何行从 `df` 里去掉：`df` 仍然是原来的四行表。把结果赋给 `mask`，只是给这列 True/False 起了个名字。\n\n比较符决定边界上的行：`>=` 包含等号，`>` 不包含；`==` 是比较是否相等，`=` 是赋值。\n","example":{"id":"py17.k1.e0","body":"我们约定 signal 至少为 10 的样本符合筛选条件。阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值，并写出现在 `df` 有几行。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","label":"mask 的值","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","mask":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"10","mask":true}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","mask":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"10","mask":true}}]},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行这一行之后，`df` 有几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"`mask` 依次为 **False、True、True、True**。索引 7 和 4 的测量值恰好是 10，`>=` 包含等号，所以都是 True。\n\n`mask` 是一列布尔值（布尔 Series），共 4 个值；`df` 没有变，仍有 **4** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py17.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值。不要填写筛选后的样本编号。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] > 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","mask":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"10","mask":false}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","mask":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"10","mask":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、False、True、False**。恰好等于 10 的两行不满足“严格大于 10”：`>` 不包含等号。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k1.q2","body":"这次要标记的是测量值恰好为 10 的行。阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] == 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","mask":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"10","mask":true}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","mask":false}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"10","mask":true}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、True、False、True**。`==` 逐行比较是否相等；索引 22 的值虽然更大，但不等于 10，所以是 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k1.q3","body":"有人把下面这行代码解释为“得到 signal 小于 10 的样本表”。请用五个字段给出准确的解释。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] < 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"被比较的列","options":[{"id":"group","content":"group"},{"id":"signal","content":"signal"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"sample_id"}],"key":"signal"},{"id":"object","type":"choice","prompt":"mask 是什么","options":[{"id":"bool_series","content":"一列布尔值（布尔 Series）"},{"id":"dataframe","content":"筛选后的表（DataFrame）"},{"id":"bool","content":"单个 True 或 False"}],"key":"bool_series"},{"id":"count","type":"choice","prompt":"mask 里有几个值","options":[{"id":"1","content":"1"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"4","content":"4"}],"key":"4"},{"id":"meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"某一行的 True 表示什么","options":[{"id":"removed","content":"这一行已经从原表删除"},{"id":"at_least","content":"这一行的 signal 至少为 10"},{"id":"below","content":"这一行的 signal 小于 10"}],"key":"below"},{"id":"rows","type":"choice","prompt":"运行之后 df 有几行","options":[{"id":"1","content":"1"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"4","content":"4"}],"key":"4"}],"explanation":"signal；一列布尔值；4 个值；True 表示这一行的 signal 小于 10；df 仍有 4 行。\n\n连起来说：取出 signal 列，对每一行判断是否小于 10，把四个判断结果保存为 mask；True 标出符合条件的行，df 仍是原来的四行表。“得到样本表”说错了两处：这一步得到的不是表，也没有去掉任何行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k1.q4","body":"掩码逐行比较，保留原来的行标签。写出比较产生的列表以及掩码的索引。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"score\": [8, 10, 7]}, index=[30, 10, 20])\nmask = table[\"score\"] >= 8\nprint(mask.tolist())\nprint(mask.index.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"掩码值","key":"[True, True, False]"},{"id":"labels","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"掩码索引","key":"[30, 10, 20]"}],"explanation":"8 和 10 满足 >= 8，7 不满足；比较不会排序或重编号，因此掩码仍带有原来的 30、10、20。"},{"id":"py17.k1.q5","body":"比较只生成掩码，并没有把原数值列改成布尔列。读出原列与比较结果。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"value\": [0, 5]})\nmask = table[\"value\"] > 0\nprint(table[\"value\"].tolist())\nprint(mask.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"original","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"原列","key":"[0, 5]"},{"id":"mask","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"掩码","key":"[False, True]"}],"explanation":"> 0 返回一列布尔判断；原表中的 0、5 保持原样。要筛选行还要把这个掩码交给选行操作。"}],"review":[{"id":"py17.k1.r1","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值。\n\n```python\nmask = soil[\"depth\"] >= 30\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"depth","header":"depth"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","depth":"30","mask":true}},{"id":"r12","cells":{"index":"12","depth":"25","mask":false}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","depth":"35","mask":true}},{"id":"r8","cells":{"index":"8","depth":"30","mask":true}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **True、False、True、True**。深度恰好为 30 的两行也满足“至少 30”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]},{"id":"py17.k1.r2","body":"同事对题面里这张表（变量名 `df`）的 signal 列做了一次比较，把结果存进 `mask`，打印出来是：\n\n```text\n90    False\n2      True\n60     True\n11    False\nName: signal, dtype: bool\n```\n\n他没有写代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"这一行最可能是哪一种写法？","options":[{"id":"ge12","content":"```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 12\n```\n"},{"id":"gt12","content":"```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] > 12\n```\n","feedback":"结果会全是 False，因为 signal 最大是 12，不大于 12。"},{"id":"ge9","content":"```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 9\n```\n","feedback":"signal 为 9 的那一行（原行索引 11）也会是 True。"},{"id":"eq9","content":"```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] == 9\n```\n","feedback":"只有 signal 恰好为 9 的那一行是 True。"}],"key":"ge12"},{"id":"edge","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"在这张表里，哪几行能分出 `>= 12` 和 `> 12`（也就是在两种写法下结果不同）？选出所有。","options":[{"id":"r90","content":"原行索引 90（signal 为 5）"},{"id":"r2","content":"原行索引 2（signal 为 12）"},{"id":"r60","content":"原行索引 60（signal 为 12）"},{"id":"r11","content":"原行索引 11（signal 为 9）"}],"key":["r2","r60"]}],"explanation":"True 的两行 signal 都是 12，False 的两行是 5 和 9，所以留下的是“至少 12”：`df[\"signal\"] >= 12`。`> 12` 一行也留不下，`>= 9` 会连 signal 为 9 的那行也标 True，`== 9` 只标 signal 为 9 的那行。\n\n`>=` 和 `>` 只在恰好等于阈值的行上不同，这里就是 signal 为 12 的两行（原行索引 2 和 60）。别的行离 12 很远或没有恰好等于 12，两种写法给出同样的结果。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一张同结构的表","index":[90,2,60,11],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["X_A","X_B","X_C","X_D"],"signal":[5,12,12,9],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py17.k1.x1","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"true_rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`mask` 里为 True 的是哪几行？按表里的先后顺序，排出它们的原行索引。","items":[{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"40","content":"40"},{"id":"15","content":"15"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"27","content":"27"}],"key":["8","15","3"]},{"id":"size","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`mask` 里一共有几个值？","key":5},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行之后，`df` 有几行？","key":5}],"explanation":"题面里的表，signal 依次是 14、9、10、12、7，原行索引依次是 8、40、15、3、27。“至少 10”（含 10）的是 14、10、12，对应原行索引 **8、15、3**，其他两行是 False。\n\n`mask` 对每一行各有一个值，所以有 **5** 个；它只是标记，没有把任何行从 `df` 里去掉，`df` 仍是 **5** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"第三张同结构的表","index":[8,40,15,3,27],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["Z_C","Z_A","Z_E","Z_B","Z_D"],"signal":[14,9,10,12,7],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k1.x2","body":"运行下面这行代码之后，哪一句说法正确？\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 13\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"table","content":"mask 是只剩下索引 22 那一行的表","feedback":"比较得到的是一列 True/False，还没有用它去选行。"},{"id":"shrunk","content":"df 现在只剩 1 行","feedback":"计算掩码不会改变 df。"},{"id":"single","content":"mask 只有 1 个值","feedback":"比较是逐行做的，有几行就有几个值。"},{"id":"series","content":"mask 有 4 个值，只有索引 22 那一个为 True；df 仍有 4 行"}],"key":"series"}],"explanation":"“mask 有 4 个值，只有索引 22 那一个为 True；df 仍有 4 行”这一句正确。掩码逐行给出 True/False，共 4 个值，只有 signal 为 13 的索引 22 满足条件；计算掩码不会从 df 中去掉任何行，也还不是一张表。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k1.x3","body":"比较相等产生逐行布尔值，重复的值分别在各自的位置得到 True。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([4, 2, 4], index=[9, 3, 7])\nmask = values == 4\nprint(mask.tolist())\nprint(mask.index.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[True, False, True]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[9, 3, 7]"}],"explanation":"第一、第三项都等于 4；比较仍保留全部三个位置和原索引，不会自动筛掉 False。"},{"id":"py17.k1.x4","body":"严格阈值与包含等号的阈值对边界行有不同判断，但掩码长度不变。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([5, 6, 7])\nprint((values > 6).tolist())\nprint((values >= 6).tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[False, False, True]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[False, True, True]"}],"explanation":"> 6 只让 7 通过，>= 6 还让恰好 6 的行通过；两种比较都为每个原位置产生一个布尔值。"}]},{"id":"py17.k2","title":"用掩码留下行，再明确需要的列","key":["py16","py08"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"loc 筛选","aliases":["df.loc","选行选列"],"definition":"df.loc[掩码, 列名列表] 用掩码选行、用列名列表选列：True 的行按原顺序留下并保留原索引，列按列表里的顺序排列。","conditions":["结果不会自动排序，索引也不会重新编号。","列名列表只有一项时，例如 [\"sample_id\"]，结果仍是一张表（DataFrame）。"],"example":"```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n```\n留下索引 7、22、4 三行和 sample_id、signal 两列，shape 为 (3, 2)。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"lesson":"得到 `mask` 之后，把它放在 `.loc` 方括号里逗号的前面，就是用它选行；逗号后面的列名列表决定留下哪些列，以及列的排列顺序。True 对应的行留下，False 对应的行不进入结果。\n\n```python\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n```\n\n筛选保留原表中入选行的先后顺序和原索引：不会自动按测量值排序，也不会把索引重新编号。即使只要一列，写成 `[\"sample_id\"]` 仍然得到一张表（DataFrame），便于继续把结果当表使用。\n\n读一个筛选结果时，可以依次回答三个问题：留下哪些行、按什么顺序；留下哪些列、按什么顺序；形状 shape 是多少，也就是（行数, 列数）。\n","example":{"id":"py17.k2.e0","body":"研究记录需要“signal 至少为 10 的样本，只导出 sample_id 和 signal”。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 留下了哪些行？按结果里的先后顺序排出它们的原行索引，没留下的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"}],"key":["7","22","4"]},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 有哪些列？按结果里的顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"group","content":"`group`"}],"key":["sample_id","signal"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":3},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第二个数（列数）","key":2},{"id":"cell","type":"text","prompt":"结果里原行索引为 22 的那一行，sample_id 是什么？","key":"S_C"}],"explanation":"| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 7 | S_B | 10 |\n| 22 | S_C | 13 |\n| 4 | S_D | 10 |\n\n留下索引 **7、22、4**，顺序与原表相同；列依次是 **sample_id、signal**；shape 为 **(3, 2)**。索引仍是 7、22、4，而不是 0、1、2；值随行一起带出，索引 22 那一行的 sample_id 是 **S_C**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py17.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] < 10\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"}],"key":["31"]},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"group","content":"`group`"}],"key":["sample_id"]},{"id":"object","type":"choice","prompt":"`result` 是什么？","options":[{"id":"series","content":"一列（Series）","feedback":"列名写成列表 [\"sample_id\"]，即使只有一项，结果也是表。"},{"id":"dataframe","content":"表（DataFrame）"}],"key":"dataframe"},{"id":"shape","type":"choice","prompt":"`result.shape` 是多少？","options":[{"id":"s4x1","content":"`(4, 1)`"},{"id":"s1","content":"`(1,)`"},{"id":"s1x1","content":"`(1, 1)`"}],"key":"s1x1"}],"explanation":"只留下索引 **31** 一行和 **sample_id** 一列，单元格是 S_A。列名写成列表，所以结果是表（DataFrame），shape 为 **(1, 1)**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.q2","body":"我们要复核测量值恰好为 10 的样本，并把 signal 放在 sample_id 前面。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] == 10\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"}],"key":["7","4"]},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"group","content":"`group`"}],"key":["signal","sample_id"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"行数","key":2},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"列数","key":2},{"id":"cell","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"结果里原行索引为 4 的那一行，signal 是多少？","key":10}],"explanation":"留下索引 **7、4** 两行，保持原表的先后顺序，而不是按索引大小排成 4、7；列依次是 **signal、sample_id**，由列表决定；shape 为 **(2, 2)**；索引 4 那一行的 signal 是 **10**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 保留 signal 至少达到 `limit` 的行，只输出 sample_id 一列，结果仍是一张表。保留原行顺序和原索引，不改变 `df`。`limit` 或原表的测量值变化时，代码仍按这一规则工作。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。宿主另外提供了 `limit = 10`，它表示本次分析的阈值，换一次分析可以取别的值。不用写函数、导入或构造数据；可以分两行，也可以把条件直接放进 `.loc`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"mask = df[\"signal\"] > limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","solution":"mask = df[\"signal\"] >= limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\"]]\n","accepts":["result = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= limit, [\"sample_id\"]]","result = df[df[\"signal\"] >= limit][[\"sample_id\"]]"],"rejects":[{"code":"mask = df[\"signal\"] >= limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"只改了比较符，仍多输出 signal 列"},{"code":"mask = df[\"signal\"] > limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\"]]\n","why":"只删了列，仍漏掉恰好等于阈值的行"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= 10, [\"sample_id\"]]","why":"把阈值写死成 10"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= limit, \"sample_id\"]","why":"列名没有写成列表，结果成了一列（Series）"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= limit, [\"sample_id\"]].reset_index(drop=True)","why":"把索引重新编号成 0、1、2"},{"code":"df = df[df[\"signal\"] >= limit]\nresult = df[[\"sample_id\"]]\n","why":"把 df 换成了筛选后的表"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= limit, [\"sample_id\"]].sort_values(\"sample_id\")","why":"按 sample_id 重新排了序"}],"tests":[{"name":"基本情况与等号边界","setup":"limit = 10","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]}, index=[7, 22, 4])","df":"df"}},{"name":"没有符合条件的行","hidden":true,"setup":"limit = 14","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame(columns=[\"sample_id\"])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一个阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"limit = 8","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]}, index=[31, 7, 22, 4])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张索引不按大小排列的表","hidden":true,"data":["T2"],"setup":"limit = 12","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_B\", \"X_C\"]}, index=[2, 60])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张编号不按顺序排列的表","hidden":true,"data":["T3"],"setup":"limit = 10","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"Z_C\", \"Z_E\", \"Z_B\"]}, index=[8, 15, 3])","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"要改两处：比较符改成 `>=`，才包含恰好等于 `limit` 的行；列名列表只留 `[\"sample_id\"]`，结果才只有一列且仍是表。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n\n直接写成 `result = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= limit, [\"sample_id\"]]` 也对。本例结果的索引是 7、22、4，shape 为 (3, 1)。判分时还会换阈值、换一张表运行你的代码，检查结果的类型、形状、行列顺序、全部值，以及 `df` 没有被改变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.q4","body":"先按行筛选，再按明确的顺序选择列。填写输出的行标签和列名。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"name\": [\"Li\", \"Wu\", \"He\"], \"score\": [5, 9, 8]}, index=[7, 2, 9])\nresult = table.loc[table[\"score\"] >= 8, [\"score\", \"name\"]]\nprint(result.index.tolist())\nprint(result.columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"行标签","key":"[2, 9]"},{"id":"columns","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"列名","key":"['score', 'name']"}],"explanation":"满足条件的是原标签 2、9 两行，不会重编号。列名列表要求 score 在前、name 在后，这与原表顺序不同。"},{"id":"py17.k2.q5","body":"没有任何行满足条件时，结果仍保留所选列。填写结果形状。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"name\": [\"Li\", \"Wu\"], \"score\": [5, 9]})\nresult = table.loc[table[\"score\"] > 100, [\"name\"]]\nprint(result.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shape","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"结果形状","key":"(0, 1)"}],"explanation":"条件全为 False，因此没有数据行；name 这一列的结构仍保留，所以是 0 行 1 列，而不是 0 行 0 列。"}],"review":[{"id":"py17.k2.r1","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = soil.loc[soil[\"depth\"] >= 30, [\"site\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"8","content":"8"}],"key":["5","3","8"]},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"site","content":"`site`"},{"id":"depth","content":"`depth`"}],"key":["site"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"行数","key":3},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"列数","key":1}],"explanation":"留下索引 **5、3、8**，顺序与原表相同；只有 **site** 一列；shape 为 **(3, 1)**。深度恰好为 30 的两行也留下了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.r2","body":"同事在表 T 上筛了一次，把结果存进 `result`，打印出来是：\n\n```text\n   group sample_id\n7   drug       S_B\n22  drug       S_C\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行代码能得到这个 `result`？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"group\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"sample_id\", \"group\"]]\n```\n","feedback":"列的先后反了，应当 group 在前。"},{"id":"other_group","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"control\", [\"group\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","feedback":"留下的是 control 组的行，原行索引是 31 和 4。"},{"id":"one_column","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"group\"]]\n```\n","feedback":"只有 group 一列，少了 sample_id。"}],"key":"right"},{"id":"cell","type":"text","prompt":"在这个 `result` 里，原行索引为 22 的那一行，sample_id 是什么？","key":"S_C"}],"explanation":"行索引 7 和 22 对应表 T 里 group 是 drug 的两行，所以条件是 `df[\"group\"] == \"drug\"`；列是 group 在前、sample_id 在后，所以逗号后面写 `[\"group\", \"sample_id\"]`。\n\n换成 control，留下的是 31 和 4；列的先后写反，打印出来 sample_id 在前；只写 `[\"group\"]` 会少一列。原行索引 22 那一行的 sample_id 是 S_C。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.r3","body":"筛选后仍保留原来的标签；选择单列列表时，结果也仍是二维表。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"id\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"], \"score\": [1, 9, 8]}, index=[8, 3, 6])\nresult = table.loc[table[\"score\"] >= 8, [\"id\"]]\nprint(result.index.tolist())\nprint(result.shape)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[3, 6]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"(2, 1)"}],"explanation":"B、C 两行符合条件，原标签 3、6 被保留；用列名列表选择 id，得到 2 行 1 列的 DataFrame。"},{"id":"py17.k2.r4","body":"已有下面的表。要求保留 score 大于 0 的行，并且输出中只保留 id 一列，仍返回 DataFrame。哪条语句符合全部要求？\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"id\": [\"A\", \"B\"], \"score\": [8, 9]})\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"select","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"all_columns","content":"`table.loc[table[\"score\"] > 0]`"},{"id":"series","content":"`table.loc[table[\"score\"] > 0, \"id\"]`"},{"id":"frame","content":"`table.loc[table[\"score\"] > 0, [\"id\"]]`"}],"key":"frame"}],"explanation":"两行都满足条件，但仍需明确输出列；第一项带出了 score，第二项返回 Series，只有列名列表形式得到只含 id 的 DataFrame。"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py17.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码，判断每句话对不对。\n\n```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] >= 12, [\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"`result` 有 2 行","ok":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"`result` 的第一列是 sample_id","ok":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"`result` 的行索引是 0、1","ok":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"运行之后，`df` 也只剩 2 行","ok":false}},{"id":"c5","cells":{"claim":"`result` 里原行索引为 60 的那一行，sample_id 是 X_C","ok":true}}]}],"explanation":"题面里的表中 signal 至少为 12 的是原行索引 2 和 60 两行，所以 `result` 有 2 行。\n\n- 逗号后面列的先后是 `[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]`，第一列是 signal，不是 sample_id；\n- 筛选保留原行索引 2 和 60，不会重新编号成 0、1；\n- `df` 本身没有变，仍是 4 行；\n- 原行索引 60 那一行是 X_C。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一张同结构的表","index":[90,2,60,11],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["X_A","X_B","X_C","X_D"],"signal":[5,12,12,9],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 保留 group 为 drug 的行，依次输出 sample_id 和 signal 两列，保留原行顺序和原索引，不改变 `df`。\n\n作答框里的代码筛错了组，列的顺序也不对。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"result = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"control\", [\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]\n","solution":"result = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","accepts":["mask = df[\"group\"] == \"drug\"\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]]","why":"列的顺序没改"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"control\", [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]","why":"仍筛的是 control 组"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\"]","why":"留下了全部列"},{"code":"result = df.loc[[7, 22], [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]","why":"照着这张表写死了行索引"},{"code":"result = df.iloc[1:3][[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]","why":"照着这张表按位置取了第 2、3 行"},{"code":"result = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].sort_values(\"sample_id\")","why":"按 sample_id 重新排了序"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 T","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_B\", \"S_C\"], \"signal\": [10, 13]}, index=[7, 22])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["T2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_B\", \"X_C\"], \"signal\": [12, 12]}, index=[2, 60])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张组别排列不同、编号不按顺序的表","hidden":true,"data":["T3"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"Z_C\", \"Z_E\", \"Z_D\"], \"signal\": [14, 10, 7]}, index=[8, 15, 27])","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n```\n\n逗号前的条件改成 `== \"drug\"`，逗号后的列名列表按需求的顺序写成 `[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]`。结果留下索引 7、22 两行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]},{"id":"py17.k2.x3","body":"从满足条件的行里只交付编号列，结果中不会附带未选中的数值列。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"id\": [\"X\", \"Y\", \"Z\"], \"n\": [2, 0, 3]})\nresult = table.loc[table[\"n\"] > 0, [\"id\"]]\nprint(result[\"id\"].tolist())\nprint(result.columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['X', 'Z']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"['id']"}],"explanation":"X、Z 满足条件，n 只参与选行，没有被列入输出列表，因此结果里只有 id。"},{"id":"py17.k2.x4","body":"没有命中行也保留选定的两列及其顺序。填写输出形状与列名。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"id\": [\"X\"], \"n\": [2]})\nresult = table.loc[table[\"n\"] < 0, [\"n\", \"id\"]]\nprint(result.shape)\nprint(result.columns.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"(0, 2)"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"['n', 'id']"}],"explanation":"唯一一行不符合条件，所以是零行；列名列表仍定义了 n、id 两列及其次序。"}]}]},{"id":"py18","title":"筛选多个条件","summary":"用 &、|、~ 把两列布尔掩码逐行组合；每个比较各加括号，用 isin 表示“属于这几个值之一”。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py17","py09"],"intro":"上一节用一个条件留下行，这一节把两个条件接起来：“signal 至少 10，并且不是对照组”“低剂量组或高剂量组”。\n\n宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 T：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`signal` 是测量值（任意单位），`group` 是实验组：`control` 对照、`low` 低剂量、`high` 高剂量。左边的原行索引是行标签。题目里的筛选规则都是人为约定，不代表科研结论。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提多条件的要求时，说清是“同时满足”还是“满足其一”，属于哪几个组就把组名逐个列出来，例如：“保留 group 为 low 或 high、并且 signal 至少为 10 的行”。\n\n拿到代码后，先看“并且”是不是写成了 `&`、“或者”是不是 `|`；再看每个比较是否各有一对括号；最后用一行恰好只满足一个条件的数据，核对它有没有被错误地留下。\n","kps":[{"id":"py18.k1","title":"逐元素 &、|、~ 与单值 and/or 的区别","key":["py17","py09"],"links":["py17.k1"],"card":{"name":"组合掩码","aliases":["&","|","~","多条件筛选"],"definition":"&、|、~ 把布尔掩码逐行组合：& 要同一行两个条件都为 True，| 只要其中一个为 True，~ 把每一行的 True 和 False 对调。","conditions":["and、or、not 只判断单个 True 或 False；用在一整列布尔值上会报 ValueError。","组合后仍是一列与原表逐行对应的 True/False，原表没有变；用它选行仍写 df.loc[掩码, 列名列表]。"],"example":"```python\nhigh = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\ntreated = df[\"group\"] != \"control\"\nboth = high & treated\n```\n表 T 里只有索引 22、4 两行同时满足，both 依次为 False、False、True、True、False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},"lesson":"[布尔掩码](repa:concept/py17.k1)是一列与原表逐行对应的 True/False。要同时用两个条件，可以先把每个条件各算成一列掩码，再把两列逐行组合起来：\n\n```python\nhigh = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\ntreated = df[\"group\"] != \"control\"\nboth = high & treated\neither = high | treated\n```\n\n| 原行索引 | signal | group | high | treated | `high & treated` | `high \\| treated` |\n|---:|---:|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 31 | 8 | low | False | True | False | True |\n| 7 | 10 | control | True | False | False | True |\n| 22 | 13 | high | True | True | True | True |\n| 4 | 10 | low | True | True | True | True |\n| 18 | 6 | control | False | False | False | False |\n\n- `&` 读作“并且”：同一行两个都是 True，结果才是 True。\n- `|` 读作“或者”：同一行只要有一个是 True，结果就是 True。它是键盘上的竖线，在回车键上方，按 Shift 输入。\n- `~` 读作“不是”：把每一行的 True 和 False 对调，`~high` 依次为 True、False、False、False、True。\n\n组合得到的仍是一列掩码，放进 `.loc` 就能选行：`df.loc[high & treated, [\"sample_id\"]]` 留下索引 22 和 4。\n\n为什么不用学过的 `and`、`or`、`not`？它们一次只判断一个 True 或 False。写 `high and treated` 时，Python 要先回答“`high` 这一整列算 True 还是 False”，可这一列里两种都有，pandas 不替你猜，直接报 `ValueError`。所以：单个值用 `and`、`or`、`not`，一整列逐行组合用 `&`、`|`、`~`。\n","example":{"id":"py18.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `both` 和 `either` 的值。\n\n```python\nhigh = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\ntreated = df[\"group\"] != \"control\"\nboth = high & treated\neither = high | treated\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"masks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"group","header":"group"},{"id":"both","header":"both","input":"bool"},{"id":"either","header":"either","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","group":"low","both":false,"either":true}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"10","group":"control","both":false,"either":true}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","group":"high","both":true,"either":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"10","group":"low","both":true,"either":true}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","signal":"6","group":"control","both":false,"either":false}}]}],"explanation":"| 原行索引 | high | treated | both | either |\n|---:|---|---|---|---|\n| 31 | False | True | **False** | **True** |\n| 7 | True | False | **False** | **True** |\n| 22 | True | True | **True** | **True** |\n| 4 | True | True | **True** | **True** |\n| 18 | False | False | **False** | **False** |\n\n先逐行写出两个条件各自的结果，再组合：`both` 只在两个都为 True 的索引 22、4 上为 True；`either` 只在两个都为 False 的索引 18 上为 False。索引 7 的 signal 恰好是 10，满足 `>= 10`，但它是对照组，所以 `both` 为 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py18.k1.q1","body":"我们要标记“测量值偏低，或者属于高剂量组”的样本。阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值。\n\n```python\nlow_signal = df[\"signal\"] < 10\nis_high = df[\"group\"] == \"high\"\nmask = low_signal | is_high\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"group","header":"group"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","group":"low","mask":true}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"10","group":"control","mask":false}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","group":"high","mask":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"10","group":"low","mask":false}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","signal":"6","group":"control","mask":true}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **True、False、True、False、True**。索引 31 和 18 的 signal 小于 10；索引 22 是高剂量组；`|` 只要满足一个就是 True。索引 7 和 4 的 signal 恰好是 10，不小于 10，又都不是高剂量组，所以是 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k1.q2","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\ncontrol = df[\"group\"] == \"control\"\nstrong = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\nresult = df.loc[~control & strong, [\"sample_id\", \"group\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["22","4"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":2},{"id":"dropped","type":"choice","prompt":"索引 7 那一行为什么没有留下？","options":[{"id":"weak","content":"它的 signal 没有达到 10"},{"id":"control","content":"它是对照组，`~control` 在这一行是 False"},{"id":"order","content":"它排在后面，被挤掉了"}],"key":"control"}],"explanation":"`~control` 把“是对照组”对调成“不是对照组”：依次为 True、False、True、True、False。`strong` 依次为 False、True、True、True、False。两者 `&` 之后只有索引 **22、4** 为 True，所以留下这两行，行数是 **2**。\n\n索引 7 的 signal 恰好是 10，满足 `strong`；它没留下，是因为它属于对照组，`~control` 在这一行是 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k1.q3","body":"同事想留下“signal 至少为 10，并且不是对照组”的样本，写了下面的代码。\n\n```python startLine=1\nhigh = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\ntreated = df[\"group\"] != \"control\"\nresult = df.loc[high and treated, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段代码会怎样？","options":[{"id":"rows2","content":"得到索引 22、4 两行"},{"id":"error","content":"第 3 行报 ValueError，没有得到 result"},{"id":"all","content":"得到全部 5 行"},{"id":"empty","content":"得到一张没有行的表"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"amp","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[high & treated, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"pipe","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[high | treated, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","feedback":"`|` 是“或者”，只满足一个条件的行也会留下。"},{"id":"two","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[high, treated, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","feedback":"`.loc` 的方括号里，逗号前是选行、逗号后是选列，不能再加第三项。"}],"key":"amp"}],"explanation":"第 3 行会报 **ValueError**。`and` 要先把 `high` 整列当成一个 True 或 False，这一列里两种都有，pandas 无法判断，于是报错。\n\n改成 `df.loc[high & treated, [\"sample_id\"]]`：`&` 逐行组合，留下索引 22、4 两行。`|` 会把只满足一个条件的索引 31、7 也留下。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k1.q4","body":"两个掩码逐元素组合，不是把整列当成一个布尔值。填写 &、|、~ 的结果列表。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([True, False, True])\nb = pd.Series([False, False, True])\nprint((a & b).tolist())\nprint((a | b).tolist())\nprint((~a).tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"both","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"a & b","key":"[False, False, True]"},{"id":"either","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"a | b","key":"[True, False, True]"},{"id":"invert","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"~a","key":"[False, True, False]"}],"explanation":"&、| 分别在同一位置上做“都成立”和“至少一个成立”的判断；~ 逐个反转 a 的值，结果仍是一列掩码。"},{"id":"py18.k1.q5","body":"把逐元素 & 错写成 and 时，Python 无法从整列提取单一真假。填写实际异常类型。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([True, False])\nb = pd.Series([False, True])\nresult = a and b\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"异常类型","key":"ValueError"}],"explanation":"and 需要先判断整个 a 的真假，但 Series 包含多个布尔值，没有唯一真假，因此抛出 ValueError。应使用逐元素的 &。"}],"review":[{"id":"py18.k1.r1","body":"要找出“计数低于 100，或者在 p3 板上”的孔。哪一行代码能得到这些孔？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"or_word","content":"```python\nresult = wells.loc[(wells[\"count\"] < 100) or (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p3\"), [\"well\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"amp","content":"```python\nresult = wells.loc[(wells[\"count\"] < 100) & (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p3\"), [\"well\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"pipe","content":"```python\nresult = wells.loc[(wells[\"count\"] < 100) | (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p3\"), [\"well\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"negated","content":"```python\nresult = wells.loc[~(wells[\"count\"] < 100) | (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p3\"), [\"well\"]]\n```\n"}],"key":"pipe"},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这样得到的 `result` 有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"用 `|` 的那一行正确，留下 A2、B2、C1 共 **3** 行：A2 和 B2 的计数低于 100，C1 在 p3 板上。\n\n`or` 用在整列上会报 ValueError；`&` 要求两个条件同时满足，这张表里没有这样的孔；`~(wells[\"count\"] < 100)` 把“低于 100”对调成了“不低于 100”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k1.r2","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `flag` 的值。\n\n```python\ndeep = soil[\"depth\"] >= 30\nacidic = soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0\nflag = deep & ~acidic\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"flag","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"depth","header":"depth"},{"id":"ph","header":"ph"},{"id":"flag","header":"flag","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","depth":"30","ph":"6.5","flag":true}},{"id":"r12","cells":{"index":"12","depth":"25","ph":"5.8","flag":false}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","depth":"35","ph":"7.1","flag":true}},{"id":"r8","cells":{"index":"8","depth":"30","ph":"5.5","flag":false}},{"id":"r20","cells":{"index":"20","depth":"40","ph":"6.0","flag":true}}]}],"explanation":"`flag` 依次为 **True、False、True、False、True**：要深度至少 30，并且不偏酸（pH 不低于 6.0）。\n\n索引 12 太浅；索引 8 深度够，但 pH 5.5 偏酸，`~acidic` 在这一行是 False；索引 20 的 pH 恰好是 6.0，不小于 6.0，所以不算偏酸。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土层深度（厘米）和 pH","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","南坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30,40],"ph":[6.5,5.8,7.1,5.5,6.0]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py18.k1.x1","body":"表里每一行是 `a`、`b` 两列掩码在同一行上的值，`c` 是用其中一种写法由 `a`、`b` 逐行算出的。\n","slots":[{"id":"op","type":"choice","prompt":"`c` 是用哪一种写法算出的？","options":[{"id":"and_","content":"`a & b`"},{"id":"or_","content":"`a | b`"},{"id":"not_a","content":"`~a`"},{"id":"a_not_b","content":"`a & ~b`"}],"key":"a_not_b"},{"id":"meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"用这种写法筛选，留下的是哪些行？","options":[{"id":"both","content":"a、b 都为 True 的行"},{"id":"only_a","content":"a 为 True 而 b 为 False 的行"},{"id":"any","content":"a、b 至少一个为 True 的行"}],"key":"only_a"}],"explanation":"`c` 由 **`a & ~b`** 算出：`~b` 依次为 False、True、False、True，再与 `a` 逐行“并且”，只有第二行（a 为 True、b 为 False）是 True。\n\n用它筛选，留下的是 **a 为 True 而 b 为 False** 的行。`a & b` 只在第一行为 True，`a | b` 在前三行为 True，`~a` 在后两行为 True，都和 `c` 不同。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"masks","caption":"两列掩码 a、b，以及由它们算出的 c","showIndex":false,"columns":{"a":[true,true,false,false],"b":[true,false,true,false],"c":[false,true,false,false]}}]},{"id":"py18.k1.x2","body":"宿主已经算好两列掩码：\n\n```python\ndeep = soil[\"depth\"] >= 30\nacidic = soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0\n```\n\n下面每一行都单独接在这两行后面运行。哪几行会报错？选出所有会报错的。\n","slots":[{"id":"errors","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"amp","content":"`flag = deep & acidic`"},{"id":"and_","content":"`flag = deep and acidic`"},{"id":"tilde","content":"`flag = ~acidic`"},{"id":"not_","content":"`flag = not acidic`"},{"id":"pipe","content":"`flag = deep | acidic`"},{"id":"or_","content":"`flag = deep or acidic`"}],"key":["and_","not_","or_"]}],"explanation":"用 **`and`、`not`、`or`** 的三行会报 ValueError：它们要把整列当成一个 True 或 False，这列里两种都有，无法判断。`&`、`~`、`|` 逐行组合，不会报错。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土层深度（厘米）和 pH","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","南坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30,40],"ph":[6.5,5.8,7.1,5.5,6.0]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]},{"id":"py18.k1.x3","body":"先逐元素组合，再取反。取反的对象是整个括号中的布尔掩码。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([True, True, False])\nb = pd.Series([True, False, False])\nprint((~(a & b)).tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[False, True, True]"}],"explanation":"a & b 是 [True, False, False]，对整列取反得到 [False, True, True]。"},{"id":"py18.k1.x4","body":"全 False 的掩码与另一列用 | 组合时，逐行结果仍来自另一列，而不是把整列压成单个真假。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([False, False, False])\nb = pd.Series([True, False, True])\nprint((a | b).tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[True, False, True]"}],"explanation":"每一行 False or b 都等于该行的 b，因此结果保持 b 的三个布尔值。"}]},{"id":"py18.k2","title":"每个比较加括号，isin 表示属于一个集合","key":["py17"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"括号与 isin","aliases":["isin","运算顺序","属于集合"],"definition":"把比较直接写进 & 或 | 时，每个比较各加一对括号；判断一列的值是否属于几个值之一，用 列.isin([值1, 值2])。","conditions":["& 和 | 比 >=、== 先算；缺括号时有的写法报错，有的不报错却算出别的结果。","isin 要一个列表，只有一个值也写成 [\"low\"]；“不属于”写成 ~列.isin([...])。","“属于 low 或 high”和“不是 control”只在表里没有别的组时相同。"],"example":"```python\ntreated = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"])\nresult = df.loc[treated & (df[\"signal\"] < 12), [\"sample_id\", \"group\"]]\n```\n`treated` 与 `(df[\"group\"] == \"low\") | (df[\"group\"] == \"high\")` 相同；表 T 里留下索引 31、4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},"lesson":"上一个知识点先把每个条件存成一个名字，再组合。把比较直接写在一行里时，要注意 Python 算式子的先后：`&` 和 `|` 比 `>=`、`==` 这些比较**先算**，就像乘法比加法先算。所以\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10 & df[\"group\"] == \"low\"\n```\n\n会被读成先算 `10 & df[\"group\"]`：拿一个数和一列文字做 `&`，没有意义，报 `TypeError`。办法是给每个比较各加一对括号，让两列 True/False 先算出来，再组合：\n\n```python\nmask = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10) & (df[\"group\"] == \"low\")\n```\n\n缺括号不一定报错。`~df[\"signal\"] >= 10` 会先对数字做 `~`，得到 -9、-11 这样的数，再和 10 比较，结果全是 False，程序照常运行；要写 `~(df[\"signal\"] >= 10)`。同时用 `&` 和 `|` 时，`&` 又比 `|` 先算，所以想先组合的部分要再套一层括号。范围条件也写成两个带括号的比较：`(df[\"signal\"] >= 10) & (df[\"signal\"] <= 13)`。\n\n判断“group 是 low 或 high”，可以写两个比较再用 `|` 连起来，也可以用 `isin`：\n\n```python\ntreated = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"])\n```\n\n`isin` 逐行检查这一格的值在不在列表里，得到的也是一列掩码。列表里的顺序不影响结果；只有一个值也要写成列表 `[\"low\"]`。“不属于”写成 `~df[\"group\"].isin([\"control\"])`，这里 `~` 作用在 `isin` 算出的掩码上，不用另加括号。\n\n注意“属于 low 或 high”和“不是 control”不是一回事：表里一旦出现别的组（例如溶剂对照 `vehicle`），两种写法就会得到不同的行。需求里列的是哪几个组，代码里就列哪几个组。\n","example":{"id":"py18.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，回答下面的问题。\n\n```python\ntreated = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"])\nresult = df.loc[treated & (df[\"signal\"] < 12), [\"sample_id\", \"group\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"`treated` 与哪一种写法得到同一列 True/False？","options":[{"id":"pipe","content":"```python\n(df[\"group\"] == \"low\") | (df[\"group\"] == \"high\")\n```\n"},{"id":"amp","content":"```python\n(df[\"group\"] == \"low\") & (df[\"group\"] == \"high\")\n```\n"},{"id":"bare","content":"```python\ndf[\"group\"] == \"low\" | df[\"group\"] == \"high\"\n```\n"}],"key":"pipe"},{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["31","4"]}],"explanation":"`treated` 与 **`(df[\"group\"] == \"low\") | (df[\"group\"] == \"high\")`** 相同：属于 low 或 high，依次为 True、False、True、True、False。用 `&` 连接的写法要求同一格既是 low 又是 high，永远是 False；不加括号的写法会先算 `\"low\" | df[\"group\"]`，报错。\n\n`df[\"signal\"] < 12` 依次为 True、True、False、True、True。两者 `&` 之后，留下索引 **31、4**：索引 22 是高剂量组，但 signal 13 不小于 12。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py18.k2.q1","body":"同事想标记“signal 至少为 10 的低剂量组样本”，写了这一行，运行时报错了。\n\n```python\nmask = df[\"signal\"] >= 10 & df[\"group\"] == \"low\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"choice","prompt":"Python 最先算的是哪一部分？","options":[{"id":"cmp","content":"`df[\"signal\"] >= 10`"},{"id":"amp","content":"`10 & df[\"group\"]`"},{"id":"eq","content":"`df[\"group\"] == \"low\"`"}],"key":"amp"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"outer","content":"```python\nmask = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10 & df[\"group\"] == \"low\")\n```\n","feedback":"整行套一对括号不改变里面的先后，仍会先算 10 & df[\"group\"]。"},{"id":"each","content":"```python\nmask = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10) & (df[\"group\"] == \"low\")\n```\n"},{"id":"and_","content":"```python\nmask = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10) and (df[\"group\"] == \"low\")\n```\n","feedback":"`and` 不能逐行组合两列，会报 ValueError。"}],"key":"each"}],"explanation":"`&` 比 `>=`、`==` 先算，所以 Python 最先算的是 **`10 & df[\"group\"]`**：一个数和一列文字做 `&`，报 TypeError。\n\n给两个比较**各加一对括号**：`(df[\"signal\"] >= 10) & (df[\"group\"] == \"low\")`，先得到两列 True/False，再逐行“并且”，结果只有索引 4 为 True。整行套一对括号不改变里面的先后；`and` 不能逐行组合。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k2.q2","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值。\n\n```python\nmask = ~df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] >= 10)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"group","header":"group"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","group":"low","mask":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"10","group":"control","mask":true}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","group":"high","mask":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"10","group":"low","mask":false}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","signal":"6","group":"control","mask":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、True、True、False、False**。`~df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\"])` 是“不属于低剂量组”：False、True、True、False、True；`df[\"signal\"] >= 10` 是 False、True、True、True、False。两者都为 True 的只有索引 7 和 22。\n\n`~` 作用在 `isin` 算出的掩码上；后面的比较加了括号，所以先算出 True/False 再组合。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 保留 group 为 low 或 high、并且 signal 至少达到 `limit` 的行，依次输出 sample_id 和 signal 两列，保留原行顺序和原索引，不改变 `df`。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，运行时报错。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。宿主另外提供了 `limit`，本例为 10，换一次分析可以取别的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"mask = df[\"group\"] == \"low\" | df[\"group\"] == \"high\" & df[\"signal\"] >= limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","solution":"mask = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","accepts":["mask = ((df[\"group\"] == \"low\") | (df[\"group\"] == \"high\")) & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","result = df[df[\"group\"].isin([\"high\", \"low\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)][[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]"],"rejects":[{"code":"mask = (df[\"group\"] == \"low\") | (df[\"group\"] == \"high\") & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"& 先于 | 算，低剂量组的行不论 signal 多少都留下"},{"code":"mask = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"]) | (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"把“并且”写成了 |"},{"code":"mask = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] > limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"漏掉恰好等于 limit 的行"},{"code":"mask = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"]) & df[\"signal\"] >= limit\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"比较没加括号，不报错却算出全为 False 的掩码"},{"code":"mask = ~df[\"group\"].isin([\"control\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"写成“不是 control”，表里有别的组时会多留下"},{"code":"mask = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] >= 10)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","why":"把阈值写死成 10"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 T，limit 为 10","setup":"limit = 10","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_C\", \"S_D\"], \"signal\": [13, 10]}, index=[22, 4])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张有 vehicle 组的表","hidden":true,"data":["T2"],"setup":"limit = 12","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_C\"], \"signal\": [12]}, index=[60])","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一个阈值","hidden":true,"data":["T2"],"setup":"limit = 5","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_A\", \"X_C\", \"X_D\", \"X_F\"], \"signal\": [5, 12, 9, 11]}, index=[90, 60, 11, 5])","df":"df"}},{"name":"第三张表","hidden":true,"data":["T3"],"setup":"limit = 12","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"Z_C\", \"Z_B\"], \"signal\": [14, 12]}, index=[8, 3])","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nmask = df[\"group\"].isin([\"low\", \"high\"]) & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)\nresult = df.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n```\n\n原代码缺括号，先算了 `\"low\" | df[\"group\"]` 这类没有意义的组合，所以报错。用 `isin` 写“属于 low 或 high”，再给阈值比较加括号，用 `&` 连起来。也可以写成 `((df[\"group\"] == \"low\") | (df[\"group\"] == \"high\")) & (df[\"signal\"] >= limit)`：外面那层括号让 `|` 先算，不能省。\n\n本例留下索引 22、4。判分时还会换阈值、换一张含 vehicle 组的表运行，检查结果的行列、值和 `df` 没有被改变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,6],"group":["low","control","high","low","control"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k2.q4","body":"括号分别包住比较条件；isin 把“属于任一允许组”写成一个掩码。读出组合结果。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"group\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"A\"], \"score\": [9, 7, 10, 6]})\nmask = table[\"group\"].isin([\"A\", \"B\"]) & (table[\"score\"] >= 8)\nprint(mask.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"掩码列表","key":"[True, False, False, False]"}],"explanation":"第 1 行同时在允许组中且达到阈值；B 组的分数不足，C 组不在允许名单，最后一行 A 组的分数也不足。"},{"id":"py18.k2.q5","body":"已给定 `values = pd.Series([1, 5, 9])`。两个比较都要加括号，再用 | 组合，选择唯一能得到 [True, False, True] 的表达式。\n","slots":[{"id":"expression","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both","content":"`(values < 3) & (values > 7)`"},{"id":"either","content":"`(values < 3) | (values > 7)`"},{"id":"middle","content":"`(values >= 3) & (values <= 7)`"}],"key":"either"}],"explanation":"目标保留两端、排除中间值 5，因此用 | 连接“小于 3”与“大于 7”。& 要求两边同时成立，不能表示保留两端。"}],"review":[{"id":"py18.k2.r1","body":"下面哪些写法与 `soil[\"site\"].isin([\"北坡\", \"南坡\"])` 在这张表上得到同一列 True/False？选出所有相同的；会报错的不算相同。\n","slots":[{"id":"same","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"pipe","content":"`(soil[\"site\"] == \"北坡\") | (soil[\"site\"] == \"南坡\")`"},{"id":"amp","content":"`(soil[\"site\"] == \"北坡\") & (soil[\"site\"] == \"南坡\")`"},{"id":"bare","content":"`soil[\"site\"] == \"北坡\" | soil[\"site\"] == \"南坡\"`"},{"id":"swapped","content":"`soil[\"site\"].isin([\"南坡\", \"北坡\"])`"},{"id":"string","content":"`soil[\"site\"].isin(\"北坡南坡\")`"}],"key":["pipe","swapped"]}],"explanation":"相同的是**两个比较加括号再用 `|` 连接**的写法，以及**把列表顺序换过来**的 `isin`：列表顺序不影响结果。\n\n用 `&` 连接的写法要求一格同时是北坡和南坡，全为 False；不加括号的写法会先算 `\"北坡\" | soil[\"site\"]`，报错；`isin` 要的是列表，传一个字符串会报 TypeError。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土层深度（厘米）和 pH","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","南坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30,40],"ph":[6.5,5.8,7.1,5.5,6.0]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]},{"id":"py18.k2.r2","body":"要留下“深度不到 30 厘米”的样地。下面的代码运行时没有报错。\n\n```python\nresult = soil.loc[~soil[\"depth\"] >= 30, [\"plot\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":0},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"wrap","content":"```python\nresult = soil.loc[~(soil[\"depth\"] >= 30), [\"plot\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"same","content":"```python\nresult = soil.loc[(~soil[\"depth\"]) >= 30, [\"plot\"]]\n```\n"},{"id":"not_","content":"```python\nresult = soil.loc[not soil[\"depth\"] >= 30, [\"plot\"]]\n```\n"}],"key":"wrap"}],"explanation":"`result` 有 **0** 行。`~` 先作用在深度的数字上，得到 -31、-26 这类负数，再和 30 比较，全为 False，于是一行也没留下，也不报错。\n\n要先算比较、再取反：`~(soil[\"depth\"] >= 30)`，留下深度 25 的 P2。把 `~soil[\"depth\"]` 单独括起来与原来相同；`not` 不能用在一整列上。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土层深度（厘米）和 pH","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","南坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30,40],"ph":[6.5,5.8,7.1,5.5,6.0]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py18.k2.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 保留 p1 或 p3 板上、计数低于 `limit` 的孔，只输出 well 一列（结果仍是表），保留原行顺序和原索引，不改变 `wells`。\n\n作答框里已经写好第二行，请把第一行的 `...` 换成筛选条件。宿主另外提供了 `limit`，本例为 100。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"mask = ...\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n","solution":"mask = wells[\"plate\"].isin([\"p1\", \"p3\"]) & (wells[\"count\"] < limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n","accepts":["mask = ((wells[\"plate\"] == \"p1\") | (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p3\")) & (wells[\"count\"] < limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"mask = (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p1\") | (wells[\"plate\"] == \"p3\") & (wells[\"count\"] < limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n","why":"& 先于 | 算，p1 板的孔不论计数都留下"},{"code":"mask = wells[\"plate\"].isin([\"p1\", \"p3\"]) | (wells[\"count\"] < limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n","why":"把“并且”写成了 |"},{"code":"mask = wells[\"plate\"].isin([\"p1\", \"p3\"]) & (wells[\"count\"] <= limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n","why":"把恰好等于 limit 的孔也留下了"},{"code":"mask = ~wells[\"plate\"].isin([\"p2\"]) & (wells[\"count\"] < limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n","why":"写成“不是 p2”，有别的板时会多留下"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 wells，limit 为 100","setup":"limit = 100","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"A2\"]}, index=[11])","wells":"wells"}},{"name":"换一张有 p4 板的记录","hidden":true,"data":["wells2"],"setup":"limit = 100","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"D1\", \"F2\"]}, index=[7, 1])","wells":"wells"}},{"name":"换一个阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"limit = 120","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"A2\", \"C1\"]}, index=[11, 14])","wells":"wells"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nmask = wells[\"plate\"].isin([\"p1\", \"p3\"]) & (wells[\"count\"] < limit)\nresult = wells.loc[mask, [\"well\"]]\n```\n\n“p1 或 p3 板”用 `isin([\"p1\", \"p3\"])`，“计数低于 limit”加括号，两者用 `&` 连接。本例只留下 A2：A1 在 p1 板但计数 120 不低于 100，C1 在 p3 板但计数 110 也不低于 100。判分时还会换一张有 p4 板的记录、换阈值运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"]}}]},{"id":"py18.k2.x2","body":"需求是：“site 为北坡或南坡，并且 pH 低于 6.0”。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一种写法符合这个需求？","options":[{"id":"bare","content":"```python\nmask = soil[\"site\"].isin([\"北坡\", \"南坡\"]) & soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0\n```\n"},{"id":"priority","content":"```python\nmask = (soil[\"site\"] == \"北坡\") | (soil[\"site\"] == \"南坡\") & (soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0)\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nmask = soil[\"site\"].isin([\"北坡\", \"南坡\"]) & (soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0)\n```\n"},{"id":"either","content":"```python\nmask = soil[\"site\"].isin([\"北坡\", \"南坡\"]) | (soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0)\n```\n"}],"key":"right"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按这个需求，表 soil 里有几行符合？","key":1}],"explanation":"**`soil[\"site\"].isin([\"北坡\", \"南坡\"]) & (soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0)`** 符合需求，只有 P2（南坡，pH 5.8）**1** 行。\n\n比较不加括号的写法不报错，却先算了 `isin(...) & soil[\"ph\"]`，结果每行都是 True；第二种写法里 `&` 先于 `|` 算，北坡的 P1 不论 pH 都会被留下；用 `|` 的写法把“并且”写成了“或者”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土层深度（厘米）和 pH","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","南坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30,40],"ph":[6.5,5.8,7.1,5.5,6.0]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]},{"id":"py18.k2.x3","body":"isin 的列表表示任一允许值，再通过 ~ 排除这整组值。\n\n```python\ngroups = pd.Series([\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"A\"])\nprint((~groups.isin([\"A\", \"C\"])).tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[False, True, False, False]"}],"explanation":"isin 先标出 A 或 C，再逐行取反，所以只有 B 为 True。~ 作用的是比较后的布尔列。"},{"id":"py18.k2.x4","body":"两个带括号的比较使用 | 表示落在范围外，边界本身不在“严格超出”的范围里。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([0, 1, 2, 3])\nmask = (values < 1) | (values > 2)\nprint(mask.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[True, False, False, True]"}],"explanation":"0 低于下界，3 高于上界；恰好为 1、2 的两个边界都不满足严格比较。"}]}]},{"id":"py19","title":"缺失不等于零，也不等于空串","summary":"用 isna/notna 找出缺失值；认出 NaN、None 和“看起来像缺失”的记号的区别；删除、填补还是保留缺失，要按业务规则写进需求。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py14","py17","py12"],"intro":"真实的数据表里总有空着的格：仪器没给出读数、有人漏填、某一项不适用。这一节先学会准确地找出它们，再学会把“空着的格怎么办”说成一条明确的规则。\n\n宿主已经导入了 pandas（`pd`）和 NumPy（`np`），并准备好数据表；每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 M：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`signal` 是测量值，`note` 是备注。表里显示为 `NaN` 的格就是缺失。\n","wrapup":"读到 `NaN`，先问它为什么空着；读到 0、空白或 `NA` 这样的字，先问它是真实的值还是别人用来表示“没有”的记号。\n\n向同事或 AI 提需求时，可以这样说：“signal 缺失的样本不参加筛选和平均，在结果里报告有几个；note 缺失的行照常保留。”拿到代码后，检查找缺失用的是 `isna()` 而不是 `== np.nan`，`dropna` 有没有写 `subset`，`fillna` 填进去的值是不是需求里说的那个。\n","kps":[{"id":"py19.k1","title":"isna/notna 识别缺失而不靠 ==","key":["py17"],"links":["py17.k1"],"card":{"name":"isna 找缺失","aliases":["isna","notna","NaN","缺失值"],"definition":"列.isna() 逐行判断这一格是否缺失，得到一列布尔掩码；列.notna() 正好相反，标出有值的行。","conditions":["不能用 == np.nan 找缺失：NaN 和任何值比较都不相等，连和它自己比也不相等。","缺失的行在 >=、< 这类比较里都得到 False，两边的筛选都不会留下它。","0 是测到了零，不是缺失。"],"example":"```python\nmissing = df[\"signal\"].isna()\nwrong = df[\"signal\"] == np.nan\n```\n表 M 里 `missing` 在 S_B、S_E 两行为 True，`wrong` 全是 False；S_C 的 0.0 不算缺失。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"表 M 里，S_C 的 signal 是 0.0：仪器测了，读数是零。S_B 和 S_E 显示 `NaN`（Not a Number，“不是一个数”）：这一格**没有值**。0 和缺失意思完全不同，不能混为一谈。\n\n找缺失要用 `isna()`，它逐行判断这一格是不是缺失，得到一列[布尔掩码](repa:concept/py17.k1)；`notna()` 正好相反，标出有值的行：\n\n```python\nmissing = df[\"signal\"].isna()\nresult = df.loc[df[\"signal\"].notna(), [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n\n| 原行索引 | signal | `isna()` | `notna()` |\n|---:|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | 8.0 | False | True |\n| 7 | NaN | True | False |\n| 22 | 0.0 | False | True |\n| 4 | 13.0 | False | True |\n| 18 | NaN | True | False |\n\n为什么不用 `df[\"signal\"] == np.nan`？`np.nan` 是 NumPy 里表示缺失的值，但 NaN 有个特别的规定：它和任何值比较都不相等，连和它自己比也不相等。所以 `== np.nan` 每一行都是 False，一个缺失也找不出来；`!= np.nan` 则每一行都是 True。\n\n同样的规定还有一个后果：缺失的行在 `>=`、`<` 这些比较里都得到 False。`df[\"signal\"] >= 10` 留不下 S_B，`df[\"signal\"] < 10` 也留不下它。把表按“至少 10”和“低于 10”分成两份，两份加起来会少掉缺失的那几行。\n\n想知道缺了几个，可以写 `df[\"signal\"].isna().sum()`：求和时 True 算 1、False 算 0，结果就是 True 的个数，这里是 2。\n","example":{"id":"py19.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `missing` 和 `wrong` 的值，再写出缺失的个数。\n\n```python\nmissing = df[\"signal\"].isna()\nwrong = df[\"signal\"] == np.nan\nn = missing.sum()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"masks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"missing","header":"missing","input":"bool"},{"id":"wrong","header":"wrong","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8.0","missing":false,"wrong":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"NaN","missing":true,"wrong":false}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"0.0","missing":false,"wrong":false}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"13.0","missing":false,"wrong":false}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","signal":"NaN","missing":true,"wrong":false}}]},{"id":"n","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`n` 是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"`missing` 依次为 **False、True、False、False、True**：只有显示 NaN 的索引 7 和 18 缺失，索引 22 的 0.0 是一个真实的读数。\n\n`wrong` **全是 False**：NaN 和任何值比较都不相等，连和 `np.nan` 自己比也不相等，所以 `== np.nan` 一个缺失也找不出来。\n\n`n` 是 **2**：求和时 True 算 1、False 算 0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py19.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"signal\"].notna(), [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["31","22","4"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"留下索引 **31、22、4**，共 **3** 行。`notna()` 标出有值的行；索引 22 的 signal 是 0.0，是一个真实的读数，也留下了。只有显示 NaN 的索引 7、18 被去掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k1.q2","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `high` 和 `low` 的值。\n\n```python\nhigh = df[\"signal\"] >= 10\nlow = df[\"signal\"] < 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"masks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"high","header":"high","input":"bool"},{"id":"low","header":"low","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8.0","high":false,"low":true}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"NaN","high":false,"low":false}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"0.0","high":false,"low":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"13.0","high":true,"low":false}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","signal":"NaN","high":false,"low":false}}]},{"id":"neither","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"有几行的 `high` 和 `low` 都是 False？","key":2}],"explanation":"| 原行索引 | signal | high | low |\n|---:|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | 8.0 | False | True |\n| 7 | NaN | **False** | **False** |\n| 22 | 0.0 | False | True |\n| 4 | 13.0 | True | False |\n| 18 | NaN | **False** | **False** |\n\n有 **2** 行两个都是 False，就是 signal 缺失的索引 7 和 18：缺失的值在任何比较里都得到 False。用“至少 10”和“低于 10”把表分成两份，这两行哪份都不在。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k1.q3","body":"同事想数出 signal 缺了几个，写了下面这行，结果显示 0。\n\n```python\nprint((df[\"signal\"] == np.nan).sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"none","content":"```python\nprint((df[\"signal\"] == None).sum())\n```\n","feedback":"和 None 比较同样逐行得到 False，缺失找不出来。"},{"id":"zero","content":"```python\nprint((df[\"signal\"] == 0).sum())\n```\n","feedback":"这数的是读数恰好为 0 的样本，0 不是缺失。"},{"id":"isna","content":"```python\nprint(df[\"signal\"].isna().sum())\n```\n"}],"key":"isna"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"改对以后显示几？","key":2}],"explanation":"改成 **`df[\"signal\"].isna().sum()`**，显示 **2**。\n\nNaN 和任何值比较都不相等，所以 `== np.nan` 每一行都是 False，求和得到 0。和 None 比较也一样找不出缺失；`== 0` 数的是 S_C 那样读数为 0 的样本，那是真实的测量。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k1.q4","body":"零是一个有效测量，不是缺失。对照等于 NaN 与 isna 的结果。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([0.0, np.nan, 2.0])\nprint((values == np.nan).tolist())\nprint(values.isna().tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"compare","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"等于 NaN","key":"[False, False, False]"},{"id":"missing","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"isna","key":"[False, True, False]"}],"explanation":"NaN 与自身也不相等，所以 == 找不到缺失。isna 专门识别缺失，只有中间一项为 True，零仍是非缺失值。"},{"id":"py19.k1.q5","body":"isna 和 notna 互相补足。分别数出缺失与有值的数量。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([np.nan, 0, 5, np.nan])\nprint(int(values.isna().sum()))\nprint(int(values.notna().sum()))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"缺失个数","key":2},{"id":"present","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"非缺失个数","key":2}],"explanation":"两个 NaN 是缺失，0 和 5 都有有效数值。把两类计数加起来，正好是原来的四个位置。"}],"review":[{"id":"py19.k1.r1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nprint(birds[\"count\"].isna().sum())\nprint((birds[\"count\"] == 0).sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":2},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":1}],"explanation":"第一行 **2**：南坡和山顶的 count 缺失。第二行 **1**：只有东坡记下了 0 个巢，那是调查过、确实没有找到，不是缺失。两个数分开报告，才说得清“几个样地没调查”和“几个样地没有巢”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"birds","caption":"表 birds：五个样地一次调查记下的鸟巢数","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶"],"count":[3,null,0,5,null]},"dtypes":{"count":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k1.r2","body":"有人想把样地分成“偏酸”和“不偏酸”两组。\n\n```python\nacid = soil.loc[soil[\"ph\"] < 6.0, [\"plot\"]]\nother = soil.loc[soil[\"ph\"] >= 6.0, [\"plot\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"acid","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`acid` 有几行？","key":1},{"id":"other","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`other` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"lost","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"哪几行两组里都没有？按原行索引的先后顺序排出。","items":[{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"20","content":"20"}],"key":["12","20"]}],"explanation":"`acid` 有 **1** 行（P3），`other` 有 **2** 行（P1、P4），加起来只有 3 行。pH 缺失的索引 **12、20** 在 `< 6.0` 和 `>= 6.0` 里都得到 False，哪组都不在。分组之前要先决定缺失的行算哪一类，或者单独列出来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土壤 pH","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"ph":[6.5,null,5.5,7.0,null]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py19.k1.x1","body":"要只留下记录到了气温的气象站，气温缺失的站不要。下面哪些写法能做到？选出所有能做到的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"notna","content":"`temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].notna()]`"},{"id":"ne_nan","content":"`temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"] != np.nan]`"},{"id":"positive","content":"`temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"] > 0]`"},{"id":"isna_false","content":"`temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].isna() == False]`"}],"key":["notna","isna_false"]}],"explanation":"**`notna()`** 和 **`isna() == False`** 都标出有值的行，留下 T1、T3、T4。\n\n`!= np.nan` 每一行都是 True（NaN 和谁都不相等），连缺失的 T2 也留下了；`> 0` 只留下 T4，把 -2.5 ℃ 和 0 ℃ 这两个真实的读数也去掉了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：四个气象站的凌晨气温（℃）","index":[1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"station":["T1","T2","T3","T4"],"temp":[-2.5,null,0,3.5]},"dtypes":{"temp":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k1.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 列出没有记录到气温的气象站，只输出 station 一列（结果仍是表），保留原行顺序和原索引，不改变 `temps`。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，运行后得到一张没有行的表。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"] == np.nan, [\"station\"]]\n","solution":"result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].isna(), [\"station\"]]\n","accepts":["result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].notna() == False, [\"station\"]]"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"] == None, [\"station\"]]","why":"和 None 比较同样找不出缺失"},{"code":"result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"] == 0, [\"station\"]]","why":"把读数为 0 的站当成了缺失"},{"code":"result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].notna(), [\"station\"]]","why":"留下的是有记录的站"},{"code":"result = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].isna(), \"station\"]","why":"列名没写成列表，结果成了一列（Series）"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 temps","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"station\": [\"T2\"]}, index=[2])","temps":"temps"}},{"name":"换一份有两个缺失的记录","hidden":true,"data":["temps2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"station\": [\"K1\", \"K3\"]}, index=[10, 20])","temps":"temps"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = temps.loc[temps[\"temp\"].isna(), [\"station\"]]\n```\n\n`== np.nan` 每一行都是 False，所以原来的代码一行也留不下。改用 `isna()` 标出缺失的行，留下 T2。和 None 比较一样找不出缺失；`== 0` 会把真的读到 0 ℃ 的 T3 当成缺失。判分时还会换一份有两个缺失的记录运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：四个气象站的凌晨气温（℃）","index":[1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"station":["T1","T2","T3","T4"],"temp":[-2.5,null,0,3.5]},"dtypes":{"temp":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k1.x3","body":"isna 不把零当作缺失，notna 对每一项给出相反的判断。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([np.nan, 0.0, np.nan])\nprint(values.isna().tolist())\nprint(values.notna().tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[True, False, True]"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[False, True, False]"}],"explanation":"两端是缺失，中间的零是有效数；两种掩码逐项互补。"}]},{"id":"py19.k2","title":"不同 dtype 下缺失表示可能不同","key":["py14","py03"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"缺失的样子","aliases":["NaN","None","NaT","空串"],"definition":"pandas 用 NaN、None、NaT（日期）、<NA> 等表示缺失，isna() 都认；整数列里有缺失时，整列会存成浮点。","conditions":["空串 \"\"、空格、手打的 NA、0、-999 这类记号不是缺失，isna() 判为 False。","整数列有缺失时，3 会显示成 3.0，dtype 是 float64。"],"example":"表 log 的 count 是 3.0、NaN、0.0、-999.0，note 是 ok、NaN、\"\"、NA；`log.isna()` 只在 S_B 那一行为 True。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nlog = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"], \"count\": [3, None, 0, -999], \"note\": [\"ok\", None, \"\", \"NA\"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4],\n)\n","display":"表 log：一份旧记录。写成 `\"\"` 的格是**空串**，也就是一段一个字也没有的文字，pandas 显示它时这一格是空白；note 里的 `NA` 是有人手打的两个字母。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | count | note |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 31 | S_A | 3.0 | ok |\n| 7 | S_B | NaN | NaN |\n| 22 | S_C | 0.0 | `\"\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | -999.0 | NA |\n"}]},"lesson":"缺失在不同类型的列里，显示出来的样子不完全一样：\n\n| 列的内容 | 缺失显示为 |\n|---|---|\n| 数（float64） | `NaN` |\n| 文字（pandas 3 的 str 列） | `NaN` |\n| 混放各种对象的列（object） | 可能是 `None` |\n| 日期时间 | `NaT` |\n| 可以有缺失的整数（Int64） | `<NA>` |\n\n这些写法 `isna()` 都认得，都判为 True。\n\n整数列有一个容易让人困惑的地方：原始记录里的 3、（空）、0，读成表以后显示为 3.0、NaN、0.0。普通的整数列放不下缺失，pandas 就把整列存成浮点（dtype 为 float64；`df[\"列\"].dtype` 可以查看一列的类型）。看到一列编号或计数突然带了 `.0`，先想想是不是有缺失。\n\n反过来，有些值**看起来**像“没有”，pandas 却不认为它们是缺失：\n\n- 空串 `\"\"`：一段一个字也没有的文字，显示时是一格空白；\n- 一个空格 `\" \"`；\n- 手打的 `NA`、`N/A`、`无`：它们只是几个字；\n- 0，以及旧仪器用来表示“没读到”的 -999 这类记号：它们是数。\n\n对这些值，`isna()` 都是 False。它们算不算缺失、要不要改成缺失，是下一步要和需求方确认的事。\n","example":{"id":"py19.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `log.isna()` 中 count 和 note 两列的值，再回答 count 列的类型。\n\n```python\nflags = log.isna()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"flags","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"count","header":"count","input":"bool"},{"id":"note","header":"note","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","count":false,"note":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","count":true,"note":true}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","count":false,"note":false}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","count":false,"note":false}}]},{"id":"dtype","type":"choice","prompt":"`log[\"count\"]` 是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"int","content":"整数（int64）"},{"id":"float","content":"浮点（float64）"},{"id":"str","content":"文字（str）"}],"key":"float"}],"explanation":"只有索引 7（S_B）那一行两格都是 **True**，其余都是 **False**。\n\n- 0.0 是一个数，-999.0 也是一个数，哪怕它原本是“没读到”的记号；\n- 空串 `\"\"` 是一段没有字的文字，`NA` 是两个字母，都不是缺失。\n\ncount 列是**浮点（float64）**：它有一个缺失，pandas 把整列存成浮点，所以 3 显示为 3.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nlog = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"], \"count\": [3, None, 0, -999], \"note\": [\"ok\", None, \"\", \"NA\"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4],\n)\n","display":"表 log：一份旧记录。写成 `\"\"` 的格是**空串**，也就是一段一个字也没有的文字，pandas 显示它时这一格是空白；note 里的 `NA` 是有人手打的两个字母。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | count | note |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 31 | S_A | 3.0 | ok |\n| 7 | S_B | NaN | NaN |\n| 22 | S_C | 0.0 | `\"\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | -999.0 | NA |\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py19.k2.q1","body":"表 birds 的原始调查表里，count 记的是整数 3、（空）、0、5、（空）。阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nprint(birds[\"count\"].iloc[0])\nprint(birds[\"count\"].dtype)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"3.0","feedback":[{"when":"3","message":"这一列有缺失，pandas 把整列存成了浮点，3 显示为 3.0。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"float64"}],"explanation":"第一行 **3.0**，第二行 **float64**。原始记录是整数，但这一列有两个缺失，普通的整数列放不下缺失，pandas 就把整列存成浮点。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"birds","caption":"表 birds：五个样地一次调查记下的鸟巢数","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶"],"count":[3,null,0,5,null]},"dtypes":{"count":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k2.q2","body":"下面每个值单独放进一列，再对这一列用 `isna()`。哪些值会被判为缺失（True）？选出所有会的。\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"none","content":"`None`"},{"id":"nan","content":"`np.nan`"},{"id":"empty","content":"`\"\"`（空串）"},{"id":"na_text","content":"`\"NA\"`（两个字母）"},{"id":"zero","content":"`0`"},{"id":"code","content":"`-999`"}],"key":["none","nan"]}],"explanation":"只有 **`None`** 和 **`np.nan`** 是缺失。空串是一段没有字的文字，`\"NA\"` 是两个字母，0 和 -999 都是数；即使它们在某份记录里表示“没有”，`isna()` 也不会替你这样理解。\n"},{"id":"py19.k2.q3","body":"有人想找出“note 没有写内容”的样本，写了下面的代码。\n\n```python\nresult = log.loc[log[\"note\"].isna(), [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"}],"key":["7"]},{"id":"s_c","type":"choice","prompt":"S_C 的 note 是空串，它在结果里吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"在，空串也是缺失"},{"id":"no","content":"不在，空串不是缺失"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"只留下索引 **7**（S_B）。S_C 的 note 是空串，看起来什么也没写，但它是一段文字，`isna()` 判为 False，所以**不在**结果里。如果需求说的“没有写内容”也包括空串，就要在需求里写明，再另行处理。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nlog = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"], \"count\": [3, None, 0, -999], \"note\": [\"ok\", None, \"\", \"NA\"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4],\n)\n","display":"表 log：一份旧记录。写成 `\"\"` 的格是**空串**，也就是一段一个字也没有的文字，pandas 显示它时这一格是空白；note 里的 `NA` 是有人手打的两个字母。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | count | note |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 31 | S_A | 3.0 | ok |\n| 7 | S_B | NaN | NaN |\n| 22 | S_C | 0.0 | `\"\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | -999.0 | NA |\n"}]},{"id":"py19.k2.q4","body":"下列文字是在内存里直接构造的，不经过 CSV 的缺失推断。哪些被 isna 识别为缺失？\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([\"\", \" \", \"NA\", None], dtype=\"str\")\nprint(values.isna().tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"掩码列表","key":"[False, False, False, True]"}],"explanation":"空串、空格和文字 'NA' 都是实际字符串；这里只有 None 被转换成缺失。看起来像缺失的标记不会在内存构造时自动按业务含义解释。"},{"id":"py19.k2.q5","body":"记录中插入一个缺失值后，普通整数列的 dtype 会怎样变化？\n\n```python\ncomplete = pd.Series([1, 0, 2])\nabsent = pd.Series([1, 0, None])\nprint(str(complete.dtype))\nprint(str(absent.dtype))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"complete","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"完整列 dtype","key":"int64"},{"id":"absent","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"含缺失列 dtype","key":"float64"}],"explanation":"普通 int64 无法直接容纳缺失，因此含 None 的这一列被推断为 float64。零本身不会触发这种变化，缺失与零仍应分别看待。"}],"review":[{"id":"py19.k2.r1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nprint(plants[\"height\"].dtype)\nprint(plants[\"height\"].sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"float64"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"20.0","feedback":[{"when":"20","message":"这一列存成了浮点，求和的结果也是浮点，显示为 20.0。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行 **float64**：原始记录虽然是整数，但有一株没量，整列存成了浮点。第二行 **20.0**：两个有值的高度相加，结果也是浮点。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nplants = pd.DataFrame({\"plant\": [\"G1\", \"G2\", \"G3\"], \"height\": [12, None, 8]}, index=[0, 1, 2])\n","display":"表 plants：原始记录里三株苗的高度（厘米）是整数 12、（没量）、8，读成表以后是这样：\n\n| 原行索引 | plant | height |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | G1 | 12.0 |\n| 1 | G2 | NaN |\n| 2 | G3 | 8.0 |\n"}]},{"id":"py19.k2.r2","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 留下了哪些行。\n\n```python\nresult = visits.loc[visits[\"reason\"].notna(), [\"patient\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"11","content":"11"},{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"13","content":"13"},{"id":"14","content":"14"},{"id":"15","content":"15"}],"key":["11","13","14","15"]}],"explanation":"留下索引 **11、13、14、15**，只去掉 reason 为 NaN 的索引 12。空串、一个空格和手打的 `N/A` 都是文字，`notna()` 判为 True。要不要把它们也当成“没有填写”，得由需求说明。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nvisits = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"patient\": [\"P1\", \"P2\", \"P3\", \"P4\", \"P5\"], \"reason\": [\"\", None, \"复查\", \" \", \"N/A\"]},\n    index=[11, 12, 13, 14, 15],\n)\n","display":"表 visits：五次就诊记录。写成 `\"\"` 的格是空串，写成 `\" \"` 的格是一个空格，`N/A` 是手打的文字。\n\n| 原行索引 | patient | reason |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 11 | P1 | `\"\"` |\n| 12 | P2 | NaN |\n| 13 | P3 | 复查 |\n| 14 | P4 | `\" \"` |\n| 15 | P5 | N/A |\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py19.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码，写出输出。\n\n```python\nprint(len(runs.loc[runs[\"remark\"].isna()]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"显示什么？","key":2}],"explanation":"显示 **2**：只有 R1、R5 的 remark 是 NaN。手打的“无”、空串和 `NA` 都是文字，`isna()` 判为 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nruns = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"run\": [\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"R4\", \"R5\"], \"remark\": [None, \"无\", \"\", \"NA\", None]},\n    index=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4],\n)\n","display":"表 runs：五次实验的备注。写成 `\"\"` 的格是空串。\n\n| 原行索引 | run | remark |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 0 | R1 | NaN |\n| 1 | R2 | 无 |\n| 2 | R3 | `\"\"` |\n| 3 | R4 | NA |\n| 4 | R5 | NaN |\n"}]},{"id":"py19.k2.x2","body":"一列批次号的原始记录是整数 1、2、（空）。读成表以后，这一列显示为 1.0、2.0、NaN。\n","slots":[{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么 1 和 2 变成了 1.0 和 2.0？","options":[{"id":"divided","content":"读入时每个值都被除以了 1"},{"id":"missing","content":"这一列有缺失，普通的整数列放不下缺失，pandas 把整列存成了浮点"},{"id":"text","content":"NaN 是一段文字，整列变成了文字列"}],"key":"missing"},{"id":"without","type":"choice","prompt":"如果第三批也有记录，是整数 3，这一列会是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"int","content":"整数（int64）"},{"id":"float","content":"浮点（float64）"}],"key":"int"}],"explanation":"这一列**有缺失**，普通的整数列放不下缺失，pandas 就把整列存成浮点，于是 1、2 显示成 1.0、2.0。三批都有记录时没有缺失，这一列就是**整数（int64）**。\n"},{"id":"py19.k2.x3","body":"相同的“无值”在 object 列与普通浮点列里显示不同，但都可以被 isna 识别。\n\n```python\nobjects = pd.Series([None], dtype=\"object\")\nnumbers = pd.Series([np.nan], dtype=\"float64\")\nprint(repr(objects.iloc[0]))\nprint(bool(objects.isna().iloc[0]))\nprint(bool(numbers.isna().iloc[0]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"None"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"True"},{"id":"v2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 项","key":"True"}],"explanation":"object 列保留 None 的表示；浮点列使用 NaN。isna 的用途就是统一识别这些不同表示的缺失。"}]},{"id":"py19.k3","title":"删除、保留或填补需要业务规则","key":["py12","py17"],"links":["py12.k1"],"card":{"name":"缺失处理规则","aliases":["dropna","fillna","缺失值处理"],"definition":"缺失是删掉（dropna）、填上（fillna）还是留着，会改变留下的行和算出的结果，要按缺失的原因写进需求。","conditions":["dropna 不写 subset 时，任何一列有缺失的整行都会被删掉。","fillna(0) 等于把“没测到”当成“测得 0”，会改变筛选结果和平均值。","这两种做法都得到新的结果，原表不变。"],"example":"表 M 里 signal 低于 10 的原本是 S_A、S_C；`fillna(0)` 之后，缺失的 S_B、S_E 也被当成低信号样本留下。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"空着的格怎么办，程序替你决定不了。常见的做法有三种，以表 M 为例：\n\n1. **删除。**`df.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])` 得到一张去掉 signal 缺失行的新表，留下 S_A、S_C、S_D。`subset` 写明看哪一列；不写时，任何一列有缺失的整行都会被删掉。表 M 的 note 也有缺失，`df.dropna()` 只剩下 S_D 一行，S_A、S_C 好好的测量也被删了。\n2. **填补。**`df[\"signal\"].fillna(0)` 把缺失换成 0，等于说“没测到就是测得 0”。之后再筛“signal 低于 10”的样本，S_B、S_E 也会被当成低信号样本留下，平均值也会被拉低。\n3. **保留。**不删也不填，后面每一步说明怎样对待缺失，并报告缺了几个。\n\n这两个方法都返回新的结果，`df` 本身不变。\n\n选哪一种，取决于**为什么缺**。S_B 是仪器故障，读数根本不存在，填 0 就是编造了一个测量；有些检测里“低于检出限”会按约定记成 0 或某个固定值，那是研究者定下的规则。这些判断属于业务，不属于代码。\n\n所以[写需求](repa:concept/py12.k1)时，除了筛选条件，还要说清三件事：哪一列的缺失；删除、填补（填什么）还是保留；要不要报告受影响的行数。\n","example":{"id":"py19.k3.e0","body":"阅读代码，比较两种处理方式。\n\n```python\nlow_raw = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 10, [\"sample_id\"]]\nfilled = df[\"signal\"].fillna(0)\nlow_filled = df.loc[filled < 10, [\"sample_id\"]]\nkept = df.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"raw","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`low_raw` 留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["31","22"]},{"id":"filled","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`low_filled` 留下了哪些行？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["31","7","22","18"]},{"id":"kept","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`kept` 有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"`low_raw` 留下 **31、22**：缺失的 S_B、S_E 在比较里得到 False，没有留下。\n\n`low_filled` 留下 **31、7、22、18**：缺失被填成 0 以后，S_B、S_E 就成了“signal 为 0”的样本，也被当成低信号留下了。这等于替仪器编了两个读数。\n\n`kept` 有 **3** 行：去掉 signal 缺失的 S_B、S_E，留下 S_A、S_C、S_D。哪一种对，要看需求方怎样看待这两个没有读数的样本。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py19.k3.q1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nprint(len(df.dropna()))\nprint(len(df.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":1},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":3},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"第一行为什么把 S_A 也删掉了？","options":[{"id":"signal","content":"S_A 的 signal 缺失"},{"id":"note","content":"S_A 的 note 缺失，不写 subset 时任何一列缺失都会删掉整行"},{"id":"low","content":"S_A 的 signal 太低"}],"key":"note"}],"explanation":"第一行 **1**，第二行 **3**。`dropna()` 不写 `subset` 时，只要某一行有任何一列缺失就删掉整行：S_A、S_C 的 note 空着，S_B、S_E 的 signal 空着，只剩 S_D。S_A 的读数是好的，它被删掉只因为**备注没写**。\n\n写成 `dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])`，只看 signal 这一列，留下 S_A、S_C、S_D。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k3.q2","body":"负责人看了表 M 以后说：“仪器故障和漏测的样本没有读数，不能当成 0，也不参加后面的筛选；S_C 的 0.0 是真实读数，要保留。备注空着不影响什么。最后告诉我去掉了几个样本。”把这条规则填成下面三个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"按哪一列的缺失处理","options":[{"id":"signal","content":"只看 signal"},{"id":"note","content":"只看 note"},{"id":"any","content":"任何一列缺失都算"}],"key":"signal"},{"id":"action","type":"choice","prompt":"缺失的行怎么办","options":[{"id":"fill0","content":"把缺失填成 0，照常参加筛选"},{"id":"drop","content":"删除这些行，不参加后面的筛选"},{"id":"keep","content":"保留原样，不做处理"}],"key":"drop"},{"id":"report","type":"choice","prompt":"要不要报告受影响的行数","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"要，报告删掉了几个样本"},{"id":"no","content":"不用"}],"key":"yes"}],"explanation":"只看 **signal**；**删除**这些行；**要**报告删掉了几个。对应的代码是 `df.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])`，删掉 S_B、S_E 两个，报告“去掉 2 个没有读数的样本”。\n\n“任何一列缺失都算”会因为备注空着把 S_A、S_C 也删掉；填 0 违背了“不能当成 0”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k3.q4","body":"规则只要求删除 score 缺失的行，note 缺失应保留。对照带 subset 与不带 subset 的结果行数。\n\n```python\ntable = pd.DataFrame({\"score\": [8, None, 9], \"note\": [None, \"ok\", \"ok\"]})\nprint(table.dropna(subset=[\"score\"]).shape[0])\nprint(table.dropna().shape[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"subset","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"只检查 score","key":2},{"id":"all","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"检查全部列","key":1}],"explanation":"只检查 score 时保留第一、第三行；检查全部列还会删掉 note 缺失的第一行。规则限定哪一列，就要在 subset 中写清楚。"},{"id":"py19.k3.q5","body":"把缺失填成零会改变后续筛选的人群。分别数出原值和填零后“小于 5”的个数。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([2.0, np.nan, 8.0])\nprint(int((values < 5).sum()))\nprint(int((values.fillna(0) < 5).sum()))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"original","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"原值满足个数","key":1},{"id":"filled","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"填零后满足个数","key":2}],"explanation":"原缺失不满足数值比较，只有 2 小于 5；填零后，缺失被当成了零，也进入筛选结果。是否这样处理必须由业务规则决定。"}],"review":[{"id":"py19.k3.r1","body":"有人要找出“鸟巢少于 3 个”的样地，比较两种处理缺失的方式。\n\n```python\na = birds.dropna(subset=[\"count\"])\nrule_a = a.loc[a[\"count\"] < 3, [\"site\"]]\nb = birds[\"count\"].fillna(0)\nrule_b = birds.loc[b < 3, [\"site\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`rule_a` 有几行？","key":1},{"id":"b","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`rule_b` 有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"`rule_a` 有 **1** 行：先删掉没调查的南坡、山顶，剩下的样地里只有东坡少于 3 个。`rule_b` 有 **3** 行：南坡、山顶被填成 0，和东坡一起被当成“鸟巢很少”的样地。\n\n同一张表、同一个筛选条件，只因缺失的处理不同，结果就从 1 个变成了 3 个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"birds","caption":"表 birds：五个样地一次调查记下的鸟巢数","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶"],"count":[3,null,0,5,null]},"dtypes":{"count":"float"}}]},{"id":"py19.k3.r2","body":"负责人确认的规则是：“depth 没有记录的样地不参加平均，但要在报告里写明有几个；其他列缺失不影响。”下面哪一种说法与它完全一致？\n","slots":[{"id":"rewrite","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"把 depth 缺失的样地记为 0，再和其他样地一起算平均，报告里写明有几个"},{"id":"b","content":"删除任何一列有缺失的样地，再算 depth 的平均，报告里写明有几个"},{"id":"c","content":"只删除 depth 缺失的样地，用其余样地算 depth 的平均，并在报告里写明删去了几个"},{"id":"d","content":"只删除 depth 缺失的样地，用其余样地算 depth 的平均"}],"key":"c"}],"explanation":"“只删除 depth 缺失的样地，用其余样地算平均，并写明删去了几个”这一种与规则一致。\n\n记为 0 等于编了一个深度，平均会被拉低；“任何一列有缺失”会把 depth 完好、只是别的列空着的样地也删掉；最后一种漏了“报告有几个”。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py19.k3.x1","body":"负责人说：“count 空着的孔是漏数了，不是没有细胞，不能当成 0。这些孔先留在表里，但不参加平均；结果里写明漏数了几个孔。备注列空着没关系。”把这条规则填成下面三个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"按哪一列的缺失处理","options":[{"id":"any","content":"任何一列缺失都算"},{"id":"note","content":"只看备注列"},{"id":"count","content":"只看 count"}],"key":"count"},{"id":"action","type":"choice","prompt":"缺失的孔怎么办","options":[{"id":"fill0","content":"填成 0，参加平均"},{"id":"keep","content":"留在表里，不参加平均"},{"id":"drop_all","content":"从表里删掉，也不再提"}],"key":"keep"},{"id":"report","type":"choice","prompt":"要不要报告受影响的个数","options":[{"id":"no","content":"不用"},{"id":"yes","content":"要，写明漏数了几个孔"}],"key":"yes"}],"explanation":"只看 **count**；**留在表里，不参加平均**；**要**写明漏数了几个孔。“不能当成 0”排除了填 0；“先留在表里”排除了删掉；备注空着不影响。\n"},{"id":"py19.k3.x2","body":"需求是：“删除 signal 缺失的行，其他列有缺失的行照常保留。”\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行代码符合这个需求？","options":[{"id":"all","content":"```python\nresult = df.dropna()\n```\n"},{"id":"fill","content":"```python\nresult = df.fillna(0)\n```\n"},{"id":"subset","content":"```python\nresult = df.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"nonzero","content":"```python\nresult = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] != 0]\n```\n"}],"key":"subset"},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按需求处理后，表 M 剩几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"**`df.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])`** 符合需求，剩 **3** 行（S_A、S_C、S_D）。\n\n`dropna()` 不写 subset，会因为 note 空着把 S_A、S_C 也删掉；`fillna(0)` 没有删任何行，还把缺失改成了 0；`!= 0` 删掉的是读数为 0 的 S_C，缺失的 S_B、S_E 反而留下了（NaN 和 0 不相等）。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,null,0,13,null],"note":[null,"仪器故障",null,"重测","漏测"]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}]}]},{"id":"py20","title":"把文字转成数字时怎样处理坏值","summary":"用 pd.to_numeric 把文字列转成数；读懂转换失败的报错，用 errors=\"coerce\" 把坏值变成缺失，并数清、列出坏值，把处理规则写进需求。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py19","py03","py11"],"intro":"从表格软件或仪器导出的数据，常有一列“看起来是数，其实是文字”：有人在格子里写了“未称”，有人把 10.2 写成了“10,2”。这一节学怎样把这样的列转成数，又不让写坏的值悄悄消失。\n\n宿主已经导入了 pandas（`pd`）和 NumPy（`np`），并准备好数据表；每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。有的题用 `pd.Series([…])` 直接造出一列值，方括号里是各格的内容；`.mean()` 求一列的平均值。\n","wrapup":"把文字列转成数时，先不加 `errors=\"coerce\"` 试一次：报错信息会告诉你第一个转不了的值。决定用 coerce 以后，转换前后各数一次缺失，把多出来的那些原值列出来，交给需求方决定哪些能修正、哪些记为缺失。\n\n向同事或 AI 提需求时，可以这样说：“把 weight 转成数；写成小数逗号的先把逗号改成点；其余转不了的记为缺失，不参加计算；在结果里报告转换失败的个数和原值。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py20.k1","title":"to_numeric 的失败与 errors=\"coerce\"","key":["py03","py19","py11"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"to_numeric 转数字","aliases":["to_numeric","coerce","文字转数字"],"definition":"pd.to_numeric(列) 把一列文字逐个转成数；有一个转不了就报 ValueError，加 errors=\"coerce\" 则把转不了的变成 NaN。","conditions":["前后的空格不影响；“未称”“10,2”“1,200”这类写法转不了。","coerce 不会提示丢了哪些值，转换前后要数一数缺失。","旧代码里的 errors=\"ignore\" 在 pandas 3 里会报 ValueError。"],"example":"```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n表 D 的 weight 依次为 \"12.5\"、\"8\"、NaN、\"未称\"、\"10,2\"、\" 9.5 \"，num 依次为 12.5、8.0、NaN、NaN、NaN、9.5。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"weight\": [\"12.5\", \"8\", None, \"未称\", \"10,2\", \" 9.5 \"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 D（宿主已准备好，变量名 `df`）：六个样本的称重记录，单位是克。weight 列是**文字**，这里每格都加了引号，好看清里面写了什么；S_C 没有记录，显示为 NaN。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\"12.5\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"8\"` |\n| 22 | S_C | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"未称\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"10,2\"` |\n| 9 | S_F | `\" 9.5 \"` |\n"}]},"lesson":"表 D 的 weight 看起来是一列重量，但有人写了“未称”，还有一格写成了“10,2”，所以整列读进来是**文字**。文字不能直接相加：`\"12.5\" + \"8\"` 得到 `\"12.58\"`，是把两段字接起来。要计算，先转成数。\n\n学过的 `float(\"12.5\")` 一次转一个值；`pd.to_numeric` 是整列版，逐个把文字转成数：\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"])\n```\n\n这一行会报错：`ValueError: Unable to parse string \"未称\" at position 3`。信息里写明了第一个转不了的值是“未称”，它在第 3 个位置（从 0 数起，和原行索引无关）。整列转换要么全部成功，要么一个也不转。\n\n加上 `errors=\"coerce\"`，转不了的值变成 NaN，其余照常转换：\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n\n| 原行索引 | weight（文字） | num |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 31 | `\"12.5\"` | 12.5 |\n| 7 | `\"8\"` | 8.0 |\n| 22 | NaN | NaN |\n| 4 | `\"未称\"` | NaN |\n| 18 | `\"10,2\"` | NaN |\n| 9 | `\" 9.5 \"` | 9.5 |\n\n前后的空格不影响转换；“未称”是字，“10,2”用逗号当小数点，都转不了。结果是一列浮点数，原本空着的 S_C 仍是 NaN。\n\ncoerce 很安静：它不提示任何东西。“10,2”本来是一次真实的称重，现在和“未称”一样成了 NaN。所以用 coerce 之后，一定要看看丢了什么，这是下一个知识点。\n\n另外两种常见写法：`df[\"weight\"].astype(float)` 和 `float()` 一样，遇到转不了的值就报错；旧代码里的 `errors=\"ignore\"` 在 pandas 3 里已经去掉了，会报 ValueError。\n","example":{"id":"py20.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `num` 的值。转成缺失的格填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"num","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"weight","header":"weight（文字）"},{"id":"num","header":"num","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","weight":"\"12.5\"","num":12.5}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","weight":"\"8\"","num":8}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","weight":"NaN","num":"NaN"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","weight":"\"未称\"","num":"NaN"}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","weight":"\"10,2\"","num":"NaN"}},{"id":"r9","cells":{"index":"9","weight":"\" 9.5 \"","num":9.5}}]},{"id":"dtype","type":"choice","prompt":"`num` 是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"str","content":"文字（str）"},{"id":"float","content":"浮点（float64）"},{"id":"int","content":"整数（int64）"}],"key":"float"}],"explanation":"`num` 依次为 **12.5、8.0、NaN、NaN、NaN、9.5**，类型是**浮点（float64）**。\n\n“8”转成 8.0：这一列有缺失，整列存成浮点。“ 9.5 ”前后的空格不影响。索引 22 原本就空着，仍是 NaN；“未称”和“10,2”转不了，被 coerce 变成了 NaN。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"weight\": [\"12.5\", \"8\", None, \"未称\", \"10,2\", \" 9.5 \"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 D（宿主已准备好，变量名 `df`）：六个样本的称重记录，单位是克。weight 列是**文字**，这里每格都加了引号，好看清里面写了什么；S_C 没有记录，显示为 NaN。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\"12.5\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"8\"` |\n| 22 | S_C | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"未称\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"10,2\"` |\n| 9 | S_F | `\" 9.5 \"` |\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py20.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这一行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"nan","content":"转不了的值变成 NaN，其余转成数"},{"id":"error","content":"报 ValueError，num 没有得到值"},{"id":"text","content":"不报错，num 仍是原来的文字"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"value","type":"choice","prompt":"报错信息里点名的是哪个值？","options":[{"id":"v12","content":"`\"12.5\"`"},{"id":"vnone","content":"S_C 的 NaN"},{"id":"vunk","content":"`\"未称\"`"},{"id":"vcomma","content":"`\"10,2\"`"}],"key":"vunk"},{"id":"position","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"信息里说它在第几个位置（position 后面的数）？","key":3}],"explanation":"报 **ValueError**：`Unable to parse string \"未称\" at position 3`。不加 coerce 时，遇到第一个转不了的值就停下，整列一个也不转。\n\n点名的是 **“未称”**，它是第一个转不了的值；“10,2”排在它后面，还没轮到。position 是 **3**：从 0 数起的位置（依次是 \"12.5\"、\"8\"、NaN、\"未称\"），不是原行索引 4。原本空着的 S_C 不算转换失败。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"weight\": [\"12.5\", \"8\", None, \"未称\", \"10,2\", \" 9.5 \"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 D（宿主已准备好，变量名 `df`）：六个样本的称重记录，单位是克。weight 列是**文字**，这里每格都加了引号，好看清里面写了什么；S_C 没有记录，显示为 NaN。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\"12.5\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"8\"` |\n| 22 | S_C | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"未称\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"10,2\"` |\n| 9 | S_F | `\" 9.5 \"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k1.q2","body":"下面每个文字单独放进一列，再用 `pd.to_numeric(..., errors=\"coerce\")` 转换。哪些能转成数（不是 NaN）？选出所有能转的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ok","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"dec","content":"`\"3.5\"`"},{"id":"spaced","content":"`\" 42 \"`（前后各有一个空格）"},{"id":"thousands","content":"`\"1,200\"`"},{"id":"unit","content":"`\"12mg\"`"},{"id":"negative","content":"`\"-7\"`"},{"id":"na_text","content":"`\"N/A\"`"}],"key":["dec","spaced","negative"]}],"explanation":"**\"3.5\"、\" 42 \"、\"-7\"** 能转：前后的空格和负号都没问题。\n\n\"1,200\" 里的逗号、\"12mg\" 里的单位、\"N/A\" 这几个字，都让它转不了，coerce 会把它们变成 NaN。其中 \"1,200\" 和 \"12mg\" 本来是有意义的数，如果直接 coerce，就丢了真实的值。\n"},{"id":"py20.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把 weight 转成数，转不了的当作缺失、不计入；算出总重量 `total`。不改变 `df`。\n\n作答框里是从一篇旧教程抄来的代码，在课程的 pandas 版本里一运行就报 ValueError。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `total`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"num = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"ignore\")\ntotal = num.sum()\n","solution":"num = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\ntotal = num.sum()\n","accepts":["total = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\").sum()","total = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\").fillna(0).sum()"],"rejects":[{"code":"num = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"])\ntotal = num.sum()\n","why":"不加 coerce，遇到转不了的值就报错"},{"code":"num = df[\"weight\"].astype(float)\ntotal = num.sum()\n","why":"astype(float) 遇到转不了的值同样报错"},{"code":"total = df[\"weight\"].sum()","why":"文字直接求和，得到的是首尾相接的一串字"},{"code":"total = 30.0","why":"照着这张表写死了结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 D","expect":{"total":"30.0","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一份记录","hidden":true,"data":["D2"],"expect":{"total":"7.5","df":"df"}},{"name":"每格都能转换的记录","hidden":true,"data":["D3"],"expect":{"total":"6.5","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\ntotal = num.sum()\n```\n\n`errors=\"ignore\"` 是旧版 pandas 的写法，pandas 3 已经去掉了它，传进去就报 ValueError。按需求“转不了的当作缺失”，应改成 `errors=\"coerce\"`。求和时缺失不计入，本例总重量是 12.5 + 8 + 9.5 = 30.0。判分时还会换两份记录运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"weight\": [\"12.5\", \"8\", None, \"未称\", \"10,2\", \" 9.5 \"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 D（宿主已准备好，变量名 `df`）：六个样本的称重记录，单位是克。weight 列是**文字**，这里每格都加了引号，好看清里面写了什么；S_C 没有记录，显示为 NaN。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\"12.5\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"8\"` |\n| 22 | S_C | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"未称\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"10,2\"` |\n| 9 | S_F | `\" 9.5 \"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k1.q4","body":"coerce 保留能转换的数，把坏值变成缺失。填写转换后的缺失掩码。\n\n```python\nvalues = pd.Series([\" 3.5 \", \"bad\", \"0\", None])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(values, errors=\"coerce\")\nprint(numeric.isna().tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"缺失掩码","key":"[False, True, False, True]"}],"explanation":"前后空格不妨碍 3.5 转换，'0' 也能转成数；bad 转不了，None 原本就是缺失。coerce 不会把坏值变成零。"},{"id":"py20.k1.q5","body":"默认遇到坏值会报错，而不是静默跳过。填写下面这段转换的异常类型。\n\n```python\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(pd.Series([\"1\", \"oops\", \"2\"]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"异常类型","key":"ValueError"}],"explanation":"默认 errors='raise'，第一个无法解析的文字 oops 会让整次转换失败。只有明确使用 coerce，才会把坏值转换成缺失并继续。"}],"review":[{"id":"py20.k1.r1","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `t` 的值。转成缺失的格填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nt = pd.to_numeric(readings[\"temp\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"t","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"temp","header":"temp（文字）"},{"id":"t","header":"t","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"index":"1","temp":"\"21.5\"","t":21.5}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"index":"2","temp":"\"-\"","t":"NaN"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","temp":"\"19\"","t":19}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","temp":"\"error\"","t":"NaN"}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","temp":"\"20.0\"","t":20}}]},{"id":"missing","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`t.isna().sum()` 是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"`t` 依次为 **21.5、NaN、19.0、NaN、20.0**，有 **2** 个缺失。单独一个减号和“error”都不是数，被 coerce 变成 NaN；“19”和“20.0”都转成浮点。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nreadings = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"station\": [\"T1\", \"T2\", \"T3\", \"T4\", \"T5\"], \"temp\": [\"21.5\", \"-\", \"19\", \"error\", \"20.0\"]},\n    index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5],\n)\n","display":"表 readings：五个温度探头导出的读数（℃），temp 列是文字，每格加了引号。\n\n| 原行索引 | station | temp |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | T1 | `\"21.5\"` |\n| 2 | T2 | `\"-\"` |\n| 3 | T3 | `\"19\"` |\n| 4 | T4 | `\"error\"` |\n| 5 | T5 | `\"20.0\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k1.r2","body":"宿主先运行了这一行：\n\n```python\ns = pd.Series([\"5\", \"n.d.\", \"7\"])\n```\n\n下面每一行都单独接在它后面运行。哪几行会报错？选出所有会报错的。\n","slots":[{"id":"errors","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"plain","content":"`num = pd.to_numeric(s)`"},{"id":"coerce","content":"`num = pd.to_numeric(s, errors=\"coerce\")`"},{"id":"astype","content":"`num = s.astype(float)`"},{"id":"ignore","content":"`num = pd.to_numeric(s, errors=\"ignore\")`"}],"key":["plain","astype","ignore"]}],"explanation":"**不加参数的 to_numeric、`astype(float)`、`errors=\"ignore\"`** 这三行会报 ValueError。前两个遇到“n.d.”转不了；`errors=\"ignore\"` 是 pandas 3 已经去掉的旧写法，传入时就报错。只有 `errors=\"coerce\"` 不报错，把“n.d.”变成 NaN。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py20.k1.x1","body":"阅读代码，写出三行输出。\n\n```python\ncounts = pd.Series([\"12\", \"20\", \"n.d.\"])\nprint(counts.iloc[0] + counts.iloc[1])\nnum = pd.to_numeric(counts, errors=\"coerce\")\nprint(num.sum())\nprint(num.dtype)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"1220","feedback":[{"when":"32","message":"这两格还是文字，+ 把两段字接起来，不是相加。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"32.0"},{"id":"third","type":"text","prompt":"第三行输出","key":"float64"}],"explanation":"第一行 **1220**：两格都是文字，`+` 把“12”和“20”接成“1220”。\n\n第二行 **32.0**：转换以后“n.d.”成了 NaN，求和时不计入，12 + 20 = 32，结果是浮点。第三行 **float64**：有缺失的数值列存成浮点。\n"},{"id":"py20.k1.x2","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nod = pd.to_numeric(lab[\"od\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`od` 里哪些行是 NaN？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"1","content":"1"},{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"6","content":"6"}],"key":["2","4","5"]},{"id":"original","type":"choice","prompt":"其中哪一行在转换之前就已经缺失？","options":[{"id":"2","content":"索引 2"},{"id":"4","content":"索引 4"},{"id":"5","content":"索引 5"}],"key":"5"}],"explanation":"索引 **2、4、5** 是 NaN。“0,48”用逗号当小数点，“超量程”是字，都转不了；索引 **5** 在转换之前就没有读数。“ 0.7”开头的空格不影响转换。\n\n这三个 NaN 来历不同：一个是原本就缺，两个是转换失败。只看转换后的结果，分不出它们。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nlab = pd.DataFrame({\"od\": [\"0.52\", \"0,48\", \"0.61\", \"超量程\", None, \" 0.7\"]}, index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6])\n","display":"表 lab：六个孔的吸光度读数，od 列是文字，每格加了引号；第 5 个孔没有读数。\n\n| 原行索引 | od |\n|---:|---|\n| 1 | `\"0.52\"` |\n| 2 | `\"0,48\"` |\n| 3 | `\"0.61\"` |\n| 4 | `\"超量程\"` |\n| 5 | NaN |\n| 6 | `\" 0.7\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k1.x3","body":"同一个坏值，在默认策略与 coerce 中会走不同路径。这里明确使用 coerce，填写能否转换的掩码。\n\n```python\noriginal = pd.Series([\"5\", \"5x\", \" 6 \"])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(original, errors=\"coerce\")\nprint(numeric.notna().tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"[True, False, True]"}],"explanation":"纯数字文字和两端带空格的数字都能转，带单位样式的 5x 不能，因而变成缺失。"},{"id":"py20.k1.x4","body":"数字转换只返回新列；不赋回原列时，原文字中的前导零仍保留。\n\n```python\noriginal = pd.Series([\"003\", \"004\"])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(original)\nprint(original.tolist())\nprint(numeric.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['003', '004']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"[3, 4]"}],"explanation":"numeric 接到转换后的数值，original 没有被改写，仍是原文字。转换结果本身不再具有前导零信息。"}]},{"id":"py20.k2","title":"保留坏值计数并把处理规则写进需求","key":["py19","py12"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"坏值清单","aliases":["转换失败","坏值计数"],"definition":"转换后新增的缺失就是转换失败的值；先数出个数、列出原值，再按需求决定哪些修正、哪些记为缺失。","conditions":["失败个数 = 转换后的缺失数 − 转换前的缺失数。","有的坏值能按规则修正（例如把小数逗号改成点），有的只能记为缺失，这要由需求方决定。"],"example":"```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nbad = df[\"weight\"].loc[num.isna()].dropna()\n```\n表 D 转换前缺 1 个、转换后缺 3 个，失败 2 个：“未称”和“10,2”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"weight\": [\"12.5\", \"8\", None, \"未称\", \"10,2\", \" 9.5 \"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 D（宿主已准备好，变量名 `df`）：六个样本的称重记录，单位是克。weight 列是**文字**，这里每格都加了引号，好看清里面写了什么；S_C 没有记录，显示为 NaN。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\"12.5\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"8\"` |\n| 22 | S_C | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"未称\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"10,2\"` |\n| 9 | S_F | `\" 9.5 \"` |\n"}]},"lesson":"coerce 不会告诉你丢了什么，那就自己数。转换后多出来的缺失，就是转换失败的值：\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nbefore = df[\"weight\"].isna().sum()\nafter = num.isna().sum()\nbad = df[\"weight\"].loc[num.isna()].dropna()\n```\n\n- `before` 是 1：S_C 原本就空着；`after` 是 3。两者相减，**转换失败 2 个**。\n- `df[\"weight\"].loc[num.isna()]` 取出转换后成了缺失的那些**原值**，再用 `dropna()` 去掉原本就空着的，剩下的就是**坏值清单**：“未称”“10,2”。\n\n有了清单，才能作出有根据的决定：“10,2”多半是用逗号写的小数 10.2，可以先把逗号换成点再转；“未称”确实没有数，只能记为缺失。哪些能修、怎样修，是需求方的决定，不是 coerce 替你做的。\n\n把这些写进需求，别人照做时就不会悄悄丢数据：\n\n> 把 weight 转成数：写成小数逗号的，先把逗号改成点；其余转不了的记为缺失，不参加计算；在结果里报告转换失败的个数和原值。\n\n拿到 AI 写的转换代码时，也按这三件事核对：失败的值去了哪里；有没有数出来；有没有列出原值给人看。\n","example":{"id":"py20.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，回答下面的问题。\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nbefore = df[\"weight\"].isna().sum()\nafter = num.isna().sum()\nbad = df[\"weight\"].loc[num.isna()].dropna()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"before","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`before` 是多少？","key":1},{"id":"after","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`after` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"failed","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"转换失败了几个值？","key":2},{"id":"bad","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`bad` 里有哪些原值？按先后顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"a","content":"`\"12.5\"`"},{"id":"b","content":"`\"8\"`"},{"id":"c","content":"`\"未称\"`"},{"id":"d","content":"`\"10,2\"`"},{"id":"e","content":"`\" 9.5 \"`"}],"key":["c","d"]}],"explanation":"`before` 是 **1**（S_C），`after` 是 **3**，转换失败 **2** 个。`bad` 依次是 **“未称”“10,2”**：先取出转换后成了缺失的原值（NaN、“未称”“10,2”），再用 `dropna()` 去掉原本就空着的 NaN。\n\n看到清单，就能和需求方商量：“10,2”可以改成 10.2 再转，“未称”记为缺失。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"weight\": [\"12.5\", \"8\", None, \"未称\", \"10,2\", \" 9.5 \"]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 D（宿主已准备好，变量名 `df`）：六个样本的称重记录，单位是克。weight 列是**文字**，这里每格都加了引号，好看清里面写了什么；S_C 没有记录，显示为 NaN。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\"12.5\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"8\"` |\n| 22 | S_C | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"未称\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"10,2\"` |\n| 9 | S_F | `\" 9.5 \"` |\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py20.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nnum = pd.to_numeric(df[\"weight\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nprint(num.isna().sum() - df[\"weight\"].isna().sum())\nprint(list(df[\"weight\"].loc[num.isna()].dropna()))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":2},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"['n/a', '2,5']"}],"explanation":"第一行 **2**：转换后缺 3 个，转换前缺 1 个（X_D），失败 2 个。第二行 **['n/a', '2,5']**：转换后成了缺失的原值是 “n/a”、NaN、“2,5”，`dropna()` 去掉原本就空着的那个。\n\n“2,5”多半是小数 2.5，值得问一句要不要修正；“n/a”是没有数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"X_A\", \"X_B\", \"X_C\", \"X_D\", \"X_E\"], \"weight\": [\"3\", \"n/a\", \"4.5\", None, \"2,5\"]},\n    index=[90, 2, 60, 11, 45],\n)\n","display":"另一份称重记录（变量名 `df`），weight 列是文字，每格加了引号。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 90 | X_A | `\"3\"` |\n| 2 | X_B | `\"n/a\"` |\n| 60 | X_C | `\"4.5\"` |\n| 11 | X_D | NaN |\n| 45 | X_E | `\"2,5\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k2.q2","body":"转换 dose 列时，坏值清单是：`\"1,5\"`、`\"未测\"`、`\"约2\"`。负责人看了清单后说：\n\n> “1,5”是用逗号写的小数，改成 1.5 再转；“未测”就是没有数；“约2”是估计值，不能当测量用。转不了的都别参加计算，最后把失败的个数和原值列给我。\n\n把每个坏值的处理填进表里，再回答要不要报告。\n","slots":[{"id":"rules","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"value","header":"坏值"},{"id":"action","header":"怎样处理","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"fix","label":"修正后再转"},{"id":"missing","label":"记为缺失"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"comma","cells":{"value":"\"1,5\"","action":"fix"}},{"id":"untested","cells":{"value":"\"未测\"","action":"missing"}},{"id":"approx","cells":{"value":"\"约2\"","action":"missing"}}]},{"id":"report","type":"choice","prompt":"要不要报告转换失败的个数和原值？","options":[{"id":"no","content":"不用，缺失不参加计算就够了"},{"id":"yes","content":"要"}],"key":"yes"}],"explanation":"“1,5”**修正后再转**；“未测”和“约2”**记为缺失**；**要**报告失败的个数和原值。\n\n“约2”能读出一个 2，但负责人说估计值不能当测量用，所以和“未测”一样记为缺失。这种判断来自业务，不能由 coerce 或写代码的人替对方决定。\n"},{"id":"py20.k2.q4","body":"转换后缺失总量包含“原本就空着”和“新转换失败”两部分。分别数出来。\n\n```python\noriginal = pd.Series([None, \"bad\", \"2\", \"oops\"])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(original, errors=\"coerce\")\nbefore = int(original.isna().sum())\nafter = int(numeric.isna().sum())\nprint(before)\nprint(after)\nprint(after - before)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"before","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"原本缺失","key":1},{"id":"after","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"转换后缺失","key":3},{"id":"added","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"新转换失败","key":2}],"explanation":"原本只有 None 缺失；转换又让 bad、oops 成为缺失，因此转换后有 3 个，新增失败数是 3 - 1 = 2，而不是 3。"},{"id":"py20.k2.q5","body":"审计需要列出转换失败的原文字，但不把原本缺失的记录也算进去。填写坏值清单。\n\n```python\noriginal = pd.Series([\"3\", None, \"3kg\", \"?\", \"4\"])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(original, errors=\"coerce\")\nbad = original.loc[numeric.isna()].dropna()\nprint(bad.tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"bad","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"坏值清单","key":"['3kg', '?']"}],"explanation":"numeric.isna 先找到 None、3kg、? 的位置；再对原值 dropna，去掉原本就空着的 None，留下需要审查的两个坏字符串。"}],"review":[{"id":"py20.k2.r1","body":"阅读代码，回答下面的问题。\n\n```python\nod = pd.to_numeric(plates[\"od\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nbefore = plates[\"od\"].isna().sum()\nafter = od.isna().sum()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"before","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`before` 是多少？","key":1},{"id":"after","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`after` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"bad","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"哪些孔的读数是转换失败的？选出所有转换失败的。","options":[{"id":"A1","content":"A1"},{"id":"A3","content":"A3"},{"id":"A4","content":"A4"},{"id":"A5","content":"A5"},{"id":"A6","content":"A6"}],"key":["A3","A5"]}],"explanation":"`before` 是 **1**（A4 原本就没有读数），`after` 是 **3**。转换失败的是 **A3 和 A5**：一条长横线不是数；“0.3O”的最后一个字符是字母 O，也转不了。A4 原本就缺，不算转换失败。\n\nA5 多半是把 0.30 打错了，值得列出来请人确认，而不是悄悄变成缺失。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nplates = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"well\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"A3\", \"A4\", \"A5\", \"A6\"], \"od\": [\"0.31\", \"0.29\", \"—\", None, \"0.3O\", \"0.33\"]},\n    index=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5],\n)\n","display":"表 plates：一块板上六个孔的读数，od 列是文字，每格加了引号。A5 的最后一个字符是大写字母 O，不是数字 0。\n\n| 原行索引 | well | od |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 0 | A1 | `\"0.31\"` |\n| 1 | A2 | `\"0.29\"` |\n| 2 | A3 | `\"—\"` |\n| 3 | A4 | NaN |\n| 4 | A5 | `\"0.3O\"` |\n| 5 | A6 | `\"0.33\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k2.r2","body":"负责人确认的规则是：“把 od 转成数；转不了的记为缺失，不参加计算；在结果里报告转换失败的个数和原值。”下面哪一种做法与它完全一致？\n","slots":[{"id":"plan","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"用 errors=\"coerce\" 转换，再直接算平均值"},{"id":"b","content":"转不了的填成 0 再算平均值，并报告转换失败的个数和原值"},{"id":"c","content":"用 errors=\"coerce\" 转换；列出转换前有值、转换后成了缺失的原值和个数；这些值不参加计算"},{"id":"d","content":"只要有一个值转不了，就把整列都当作缺失"}],"key":"c"}],"explanation":"“列出转换前有值、转换后成了缺失的原值和个数，这些值不参加计算”这一种与规则一致。\n\n直接算平均值漏了报告；填成 0 违背了“记为缺失、不参加计算”，还会拉低平均值；把整列当作缺失会丢掉所有能转的值。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py20.k2.x1","body":"你请 AI 算一列剂量的平均值，它交来的代码是：\n\n```python\nmean_dose = pd.to_numeric(df[\"dose\"], errors=\"coerce\").mean()\n```\n\n结果看起来没问题，但你知道 dose 列里有人手写过一些备注。为了不让坏值悄悄消失，需求里最应当补上哪一句？\n","slots":[{"id":"add","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"“把 errors 改成 ignore。”"},{"id":"b","content":"“转不了的值先填成 0 再算平均。”"},{"id":"c","content":"“平均值四舍五入到整数。”"},{"id":"d","content":"“报告转换失败的个数和这些原值。”"}],"key":"d"}],"explanation":"应补上“**报告转换失败的个数和这些原值**”。coerce 会把手写的备注和写坏的数一起变成缺失，平均值里看不出少了几个、少了什么。\n\nerrors=\"ignore\" 在 pandas 3 里会报错；填 0 是替对方编造测量；四舍五入和坏值无关。\n"},{"id":"py20.k2.x2","body":"阅读代码，回答下面的问题。\n\n```python\nage = pd.to_numeric(survey[\"age\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nbad = survey[\"age\"].loc[age.isna()].dropna()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`bad` 里有几个值？","key":2},{"id":"values","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`bad` 里有哪些原值？按先后顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"a","content":"`\"34\"`"},{"id":"b","content":"`\"二十八\"`"},{"id":"c","content":"`\"41\"`"},{"id":"d","content":"`\"29岁\"`"},{"id":"e","content":"`\"57\"`"}],"key":["b","d"]}],"explanation":"`bad` 里有 **2** 个值：**“二十八”“29岁”**。R4 原本就没填，被 `dropna()` 去掉了，不算转换失败。\n\n这两个值其实都能读出年龄，只是写法不对；列出来以后，可以按负责人确认的规则改成 28、29 再转，而不是直接丢掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nsurvey = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"person\": [\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"R4\", \"R5\", \"R6\"], \"age\": [\"34\", \"二十八\", \"41\", None, \"29岁\", \"57\"]},\n    index=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5],\n)\n","display":"表 survey：一份问卷里填写的年龄，age 列是文字，每格加了引号。\n\n| 原行索引 | person | age |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 0 | R1 | `\"34\"` |\n| 1 | R2 | `\"二十八\"` |\n| 2 | R3 | `\"41\"` |\n| 3 | R4 | NaN |\n| 4 | R5 | `\"29岁\"` |\n| 5 | R6 | `\"57\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py20.k2.x3","body":"没有原始缺失时，转换后缺失总量才恰好等于失败数；不能把这种巧合推广到所有输入。\n\n```python\noriginal = pd.Series([\"1\", \"bad\", \"2\"])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(original, errors=\"coerce\")\nprint(int(original.isna().sum()))\nprint(int(numeric.isna().sum()))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"0"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"1"}],"explanation":"这份输入原来零个缺失，只有 bad 转换失败，因此新增失败一项；遇到原始缺失时应再减去原来的数量。"},{"id":"py20.k2.x4","body":"数量相同不代表原值相同，审计需要保留坏值本身供后续决定如何修复。\n\n```python\noriginal = pd.Series([None, \"2kg\", \"?\", \"3\"])\nnumeric = pd.to_numeric(original, errors=\"coerce\")\nbad = original.loc[numeric.isna()].dropna()\nprint(bad.tolist())\nprint(len(bad))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"v0","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 1 项","key":"['2kg', '?']"},{"id":"v1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 项","key":"2"}],"explanation":"先取转换后缺失位置的原值，再去掉原本的 None，得到两个不同坏值及计数；保留它们才能决定后续修复规则。"}]}]},{"id":"py21","title":"从已有列算出新列","summary":"对整列做算术、换算单位并存成新列；分步写中间列，按赋值顺序追踪数据流；两个 Series 运算时按标签对齐，不一律按位置。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py16","py02","py07"],"intro":"这一节在表的右边添新列：把毫克换成克、算出浓度、扣掉容器的重量。新列都由已有的列算出来，关键是看清每一列从哪里来。\n\n宿主已经导入了 pandas（`pd`）并准备好数据表；每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 W：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`mass_mg` 是称得的质量（毫克），`volume_ml` 是溶液体积（毫升）。\n","wrapup":"新列的名字带上单位（`mass_g`、`conc_g_per_l`），换算分步写，每一步挑一行手算核对。读别人的代码时，按从上到下的顺序记下每一列是在哪一行、用哪些列算出来的；后面再改来源列，前面算好的列不会跟着变。\n\n两个 Series 相加、相除时，pandas 按标签配对。来源不同的两列放在一起算之前，先确认它们的标签是不是一一对应。\n","kps":[{"id":"py21.k1","title":"整列算术与单位转换","key":["py02","py16"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"整列运算","aliases":["新列","衍生列","单位换算"],"definition":"df[\"新列\"] = 整列算式：pandas 对每一行做同样的运算，得到一列与原表逐行对应的结果，赋给新列名就在表右边多出一列。","conditions":["列与数运算，每一行都和这个数算；列与列运算，同一行的两个值相算。","Python 的列表没有这种逐个运算：[1500, 820] * 2 是把列表重复两遍。","换算后挑一行手算核对单位：毫克换成克是除以 1000，不是乘。"],"example":"```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"]\n```\nS_A 的 mass_g 是 1500 ÷ 1000 = 1.5，conc 是 1500 ÷ 50 = 30.0（毫克每毫升）。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},"lesson":"`df[\"mass_mg\"]` 取出一列。对这一列做算术，pandas 会对**每一行**做同样的运算，得到一列新的结果：\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\n```\n\n等号左边写一个还没有的列名，结果就作为新列加在表的最右边。表 W 原来 3 列，现在 4 列；行数和行索引都不变。\n\n两列之间也可以运算，这时是**同一行**的两个值相算：\n\n```python\ndf[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"]\n```\n\n| 原行索引 | mass_mg | volume_ml | mass_g | conc |\n|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 31 | 1500 | 50 | 1.5 | 30.0 |\n| 7 | 820 | 20 | 0.82 | 41.0 |\n| 22 | 2400 | 80 | 2.4 | 30.0 |\n| 4 | 960 | 40 | 0.96 | 24.0 |\n\n这种逐行运算是 pandas 列的本事。Python 的列表没有：`[1500, 820] * 2` 得到的是 `[1500, 820, 1500, 820]`，把列表重复了两遍。\n\n算式里的先后照常：先乘除后加减，括号里的先算。华氏度换成摄氏度要写 `(df[\"temp_f\"] - 32) * 5 / 9`，括号不能省。\n\n换算单位最容易错在方向上：毫克换成克是**除以** 1000，分钟换成小时是**除以** 60。新列的名字带上单位，再挑一行手算一遍：S_A 是 1500 mg，1500 ÷ 1000 = 1.5 g，对得上。\n","example":{"id":"py21.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写两列新列的值，再写出运行后 `df.shape` 的列数。\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"mass_mg","header":"mass_mg"},{"id":"volume_ml","header":"volume_ml"},{"id":"mass_g","header":"mass_g","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}},{"id":"conc","header":"conc","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","mass_mg":"1500","volume_ml":"50","mass_g":1.5,"conc":30}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","mass_mg":"820","volume_ml":"20","mass_g":0.82,"conc":41}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","mass_mg":"2400","volume_ml":"80","mass_g":2.4,"conc":30}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","mass_mg":"960","volume_ml":"40","mass_g":0.96,"conc":24}}]},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后 `df` 有几列？","key":5}],"explanation":"mass_g 依次为 **1.5、0.82、2.4、0.96**：每一行的 mass_mg 各除以 1000。conc 依次为 **30.0、41.0、30.0、24.0**：同一行的 mass_mg 除以 volume_ml，单位是毫克每毫升。\n\n原表 3 列，加了两列新列，共 **5** 列，行数不变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py21.k1.q1","body":"同事想把质量换成克，写了下面这行。\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] * 1000\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后，S_A（索引 31）的 mass_g 是多少？","key":1500000},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"div","content":"```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\n```\n"},{"id":"floor","content":"```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] // 1000\n```\n","feedback":"`//` 是整除，820 mg 会变成 0 g。"},{"id":"sub","content":"```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 1000\n```\n"}],"key":"div"}],"explanation":"S_A 的 mass_g 成了 **1500000**：乘以 1000 是把克换成毫克的方向，换反了。1 g = 1000 mg，所以毫克换成克要**除以** 1000：`df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000`，S_A 得到 1.5。\n\n`//` 是整除，S_B 的 820 mg 会变成 0；减去 1000 更不是换算。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k1.q2","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nvalues = [1500, 820]\nprint(values * 2)\nprint(list(df[\"mass_mg\"] * 2))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"[1500, 820, 1500, 820]","feedback":[{"when":"[3000, 1640]","message":"列表乘以 2 是把列表重复两遍，不是每个数乘以 2。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"[3000, 1640, 4800, 1920]"}],"explanation":"第一行 **[1500, 820, 1500, 820]**：列表乘以 2 是把列表重复两遍。第二行 **[3000, 1640, 4800, 1920]**：pandas 的列乘以 2，是每一行各乘以 2；`list(...)` 只是把结果写成列表显示。\n\n同样写 `* 2`，对列表和对表的列意思不同。整列运算是 pandas 列才有的。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 在 runs 表里新增一列 `hours`，把 duration_min 换算成小时（可以带小数）。其他列保持不变。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"runs[\"hours\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] * 60\n","solution":"runs[\"hours\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60\n","rejects":[{"code":"runs[\"hours\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] // 60","why":"整除把 90 分钟算成 1 小时，丢了小数"},{"code":"runs[\"duration_min\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60","why":"覆盖了原来的 duration_min，没有新增 hours"},{"code":"runs[\"hours\"] = [1.5, 0.75, 2.5]","why":"照着这张表写死了结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 runs","expect":{"runs":"pd.DataFrame({\"run\": [\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\"], \"duration_min\": [90, 45, 150], \"cells\": [1800, 1350, 6000], \"hours\": [1.5, 0.75, 2.5]}, index=[3, 11, 6])"}},{"name":"换一份记录","hidden":true,"data":["runs2"],"expect":{"runs":"pd.DataFrame({\"run\": [\"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\", \"Q4\"], \"duration_min\": [60, 30, 135, 200], \"cells\": [600, 900, 2700, 5000], \"hours\": [1.0, 0.5, 2.25, 200 / 60]}, index=[5, 1, 9, 2])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nruns[\"hours\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60\n```\n\n1 小时 = 60 分钟，分钟换成小时要除以 60。乘以 60 是反方向；整除 `//` 会把 90 分钟算成 1 小时；直接给 duration_min 赋值会把原始记录换掉。本例 hours 依次为 1.5、0.75、2.5。判分时还会换一份记录运行，检查新列和原有的列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：三次培养的时长（分钟）和细胞计数","index":[3,11,6],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"run":["R1","R2","R3"],"duration_min":[90,45,150],"cells":[1800,1350,6000]}}]},{"id":"py21.k1.q4","body":"想按培养时长折算每小时的细胞数，需要在 runs 表里新增 `cells_per_hour`：每行的细胞数除以该行的培养小时数。哪一行满足这个要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"rate","content":"```python\nruns[\"cells_per_hour\"] = runs[\"cells\"] / (runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60)\n```\n"},{"id":"chain","content":"```python\nruns[\"cells_per_hour\"] = runs[\"cells\"] / runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60\n```\n"},{"id":"minutes","content":"```python\nruns[\"cells_per_hour\"] = runs[\"cells\"] / runs[\"duration_min\"]\n```\n"}],"key":"rate"}],"explanation":"先把每行的分钟数除以 60 换成小时，再用该行的细胞数除以小时数。因此选择先把分钟换成小时、再整列相除的写法。三行记录分别得到 1200、1800、2400 个细胞／小时；连续除以 60 会把每分钟的速率继续缩小，而不是换算成每小时的速率。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：三次培养的时长（分钟）和细胞计数","index":[3,11,6],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"run":["R1","R2","R3"],"duration_min":[90,45,150],"cells":[1800,1350,6000]}}]},{"id":"py21.k1.q5","body":"华氏度换算成摄氏度，要先减去 32，再除以 1.8。运行下面的整列计算，按样点填写结果。\n\n```python\nfield[\"temp_c\"] = (field[\"temp_f\"] - 32) / 1.8\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"site","header":"样点"},{"id":"original","header":"temp_f","input":"integer"},{"id":"converted","header":"temp_c","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"site":"河滩","original":50,"converted":10}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"site":"林缘","original":68,"converted":20}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"site":"山脊","original":86,"converted":30}}]}],"explanation":"新列依次是 10、20、30 摄氏度。括号里的减法和后面的除法都会对整列逐行执行；赋值左边是 temp_c，所以 temp_f 仍然保留 50、68、86。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三个样点的气温（华氏度 °F）","index":[1,2,3],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["河滩","林缘","山脊"],"temp_f":[50,68,86]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py21.k1.r1","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `temp_c` 的值。\n\n```python\nfield[\"temp_c\"] = (field[\"temp_f\"] - 32) * 5 / 9\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"temp_c","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"temp_f","header":"temp_f"},{"id":"temp_c","header":"temp_c","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"index":"1","temp_f":"50","temp_c":10}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"index":"2","temp_f":"68","temp_c":20}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","temp_f":"86","temp_c":30}}]}],"explanation":"`temp_c` 依次为 **10.0、20.0、30.0**。括号让每一行先减去 32，再乘以 5、除以 9：(50 − 32) × 5 ÷ 9 = 10。去掉括号就会先算 32 × 5 ÷ 9，结果完全不同。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三个样点的气温（华氏度 °F）","index":[1,2,3],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["河滩","林缘","山脊"],"temp_f":[50,68,86]}}]},{"id":"py21.k1.r2","body":"要新增一列 `depth_m`，把 depth（厘米）换算成米。哪一行正确？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"times","content":"```python\nsoil[\"depth_m\"] = soil[\"depth\"] * 100\n```\n"},{"id":"div","content":"```python\nsoil[\"depth_m\"] = soil[\"depth\"] / 100\n```\n"},{"id":"div1000","content":"```python\nsoil[\"depth_m\"] = soil[\"depth\"] / 1000\n```\n"},{"id":"list","content":"```python\nsoil[\"depth_m\"] = [0.3, 0.25, 0.35, 0.3]\n```\n"}],"key":"div"},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"按正确的写法，P3（索引 3）的 depth_m 是多少？","key":0.35}],"explanation":"**`soil[\"depth\"] / 100`** 正确：1 米 = 100 厘米，厘米换成米除以 100。P3 的 35 厘米是 **0.35** 米。\n\n乘以 100 方向反了；除以 1000 是毫米换成米；直接写一个列表虽然在这张表上碰巧对，换一张表就错了，也看不出是怎样算的。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个样地的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py21.k1.x1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"half_g\"] = df[\"mass_g\"] / 2\nprint(df.shape)\nprint(df.loc[7, \"half_g\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shape","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"(4, 5)"},{"id":"value","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"0.41"}],"explanation":"第一行 **(4, 5)**：行数不变，原有 3 列加上 mass_g、half_g 两列。第二行 **0.41**：索引 7 的 mass_mg 是 820，先换成 0.82 g，再除以 2。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k1.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 新增一列 `conc`，表示每毫升溶液里有多少毫克（mass_mg 除以 volume_ml）。其他列保持不变。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"df[\"conc\"] = df[\"volume_ml\"] / df[\"mass_mg\"]\n","solution":"df[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"]\n","rejects":[{"code":"df[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000 / df[\"volume_ml\"]","why":"算成了每毫升多少克"},{"code":"df[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] // df[\"volume_ml\"]","why":"整除丢了小数"},{"code":"df[\"conc\"] = [30.0, 41.0, 30.0, 24.0]","why":"照着这张表写死了结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 W","expect":{"df[\"conc\"]":"pd.Series([30.0, 41.0, 30.0, 24.0], index=[31, 7, 22, 4], name=\"conc\")","df[[\"sample_id\", \"mass_mg\", \"volume_ml\"]]":"df"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["W2"],"expect":{"df[\"conc\"]":"pd.Series([20.0, 25.0, 30.0], index=[90, 2, 60], name=\"conc\")","df[[\"sample_id\", \"mass_mg\", \"volume_ml\"]]":"df"}},{"name":"浓度不是整数的表","hidden":true,"data":["W2"],"setup":"df[\"volume_ml\"] = [40, 50, 120]","expect":{"df[\"conc\"]":"pd.Series([12.5, 25.0, 25.0], index=[90, 2, 60], name=\"conc\")"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndf[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"]\n```\n\n“每毫升有多少毫克”是毫克数除以毫升数，被除数和除数换了位置就成了“每毫克对应多少毫升”。本例 conc 依次为 30.0、41.0、30.0、24.0。判分时还会换一张表运行，检查 conc 和原有的列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]}]},{"id":"py21.k2","title":"用中间列或分步赋值说明数据流","key":["py01","py02"],"links":["py01.k2"],"card":{"name":"分步赋值","aliases":["中间列","数据流"],"definition":"把一个换算拆成几行，每行算出一列中间结果；每一列都在它那一行执行时算定，之后再改它依据的列，它不会跟着重算。","conditions":["覆盖原列（df[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100）会丢掉原始读数；想保留就存进新列。","读代码时从上往下，记下每一列是在哪一行、用哪些列算出的。"],"example":"```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\ndf[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\n```\nS_A 的 mass_g 仍是 1.5，net_g 是 1.4：mass_g 在第 1 行就算定了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},"lesson":"复杂一点的换算，分几行写，每一行算出一列**中间列**，读的人可以一步一步核对：\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"volume_l\"] = df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000\ndf[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"mass_g\"] / df[\"volume_l\"]\n```\n\n每一行只做一件事，列名写着单位。核对时挑一行手算：S_A 是 1500 mg = 1.5 g，50 mL = 0.05 L，1.5 ÷ 0.05 = 30 g/L。一行写完 `df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000 / (df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000)` 结果相同，但算错时不好找是哪一步。\n\n和[重新赋值](repa:concept/py01.k2)一样，一列是在**那一行执行时**算出来的。之后再改它依据的列，它不会跟着重算：\n\n```python startLine=1\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\n```\n\n第 2 行想扣掉称量瓶的 100 mg。它执行之后 mass_mg 变了，mass_g 却还是第 1 行用扣除**之前**的数算的。要先扣除再换算，就要把两行的顺序对调。\n\n第 2 行还有一个问题：它用新值**覆盖**了 mass_mg，原始读数从表里消失了。想留着原始读数，就把扣除后的结果存进新列，例如 `df[\"net_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100`。\n\n读别人的代码时，从上往下记下每一列是在哪一行、用哪些列算出来的，就能看清数据是怎样一步步流到结果里的。\n","example":{"id":"py21.k2.e0","body":"按运行顺序，填写每行执行后**索引 31（S_A）**这一行的三列的值。还没有这一列时填“尚未定义”。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\ndf[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"mass_mg","header":"mass_mg","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"mass_g","header":"mass_g","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"net_g","header":"net_g","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["尚未定义"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","mass_mg":1500,"mass_g":1.5,"net_g":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","mass_mg":1400,"mass_g":1.5,"net_g":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","mass_mg":1400,"mass_g":1.5,"net_g":1.4}}]}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | mass_mg | mass_g | net_g |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 第 1 行 | 1500 | 1.5 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | 1400 | 1.5 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 3 行 | 1400 | 1.5 | 1.4 |\n\n第 1 行用 1500 算出 mass_g = 1.5。第 2 行把 mass_mg 覆盖成 1400，mass_g **不会**跟着重算，仍是 1.5。第 3 行用的是覆盖后的 1400，所以 net_g 是 1.4。原始读数 1500 已经不在表里了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py21.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"mass_mg\"] = 0\nprint(df.loc[22, \"mass_g\"])\nprint(df.loc[22, \"mass_mg\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"2.4","feedback":[{"when":"0.0","message":"mass_g 在第 1 行就算定了，之后改 mass_mg 不会让它重算。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"0"},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句解释了第一行的结果？","options":[{"id":"recompute","content":"mass_g 会随 mass_mg 的变化重新计算"},{"id":"fixed","content":"mass_g 存的是第 1 行执行时算出的结果"}],"key":"fixed"}],"explanation":"第一行 **2.4**，第二行 **0**。`df[\"mass_mg\"] = 0` 把整列每一格都换成 0；mass_g 存的是第 1 行执行时用 2400 算出的 2.4，不会跟着重算。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k2.q2","body":"下面三行算出每升溶液里有多少克溶质。\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"volume_l\"] = df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000\ndf[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"mass_g\"] / df[\"volume_l\"]\n```\n\n如果只用一行写出 conc_g_per_l，哪一种写法的结果与它相同？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"chain","content":"```python\ndf[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000 / df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000\n```\n"},{"id":"paren","content":"```python\ndf[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000 / (df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000)\n```\n"},{"id":"once","content":"```python\ndf[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000\n```\n"}],"key":"paren"},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"S_B（索引 7）的 conc_g_per_l 是多少？","key":41}],"explanation":"**`df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000 / (df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000)`** 与三行的结果相同：括号让体积先换成升，再拿克数去除。不加括号时，从左往右依次除，最后的 `/ 1000` 又把结果缩小了 1000 倍。\n\nS_B 是 0.82 g ÷ 0.02 L = **41** g/L。分三行写时，每一步都能单独核对，这正是中间列的好处。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 每个样本都装在 100 mg 的称量瓶里。新增一列 `net_g`：扣掉瓶重后的净质量，单位是克。表里原有的 mass_mg 要保留原始读数，不能改。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，结果是对的，却改掉了原始读数。请改动它并提交。可以新增中间列。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"df[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\ndf[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\n","solution":"df[\"net_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\ndf[\"net_g\"] = df[\"net_mg\"] / 1000\n","accepts":["df[\"net_g\"] = (df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100) / 1000"],"rejects":[{"code":"df[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100 / 1000","why":"没加括号，只从毫克里减去了 0.1"},{"code":"df[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\n","why":"先换算后扣除，net_g 没有扣掉瓶重，还改了原始读数"},{"code":"df[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000 - 100","why":"从克数里减去了 100，单位不一致"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 W","expect":{"df[\"net_g\"]":"pd.Series([1.4, 0.72, 2.3, 0.86], index=[31, 7, 22, 4], name=\"net_g\")","df[\"mass_mg\"]":"df[\"mass_mg\"]"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["W2"],"expect":{"df[\"net_g\"]":"pd.Series([0.4, 1.15, 2.9], index=[90, 2, 60], name=\"net_g\")","df[\"mass_mg\"]":"df[\"mass_mg\"]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndf[\"net_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\ndf[\"net_g\"] = df[\"net_mg\"] / 1000\n```\n\n把扣除后的结果存进新列 net_mg，原始的 mass_mg 就留下了；再从 net_mg 换算成克。也可以一行写成 `(df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100) / 1000`，括号保证先扣除再换算。本例 net_g 依次为 1.4、0.72、2.3、0.86。判分时还会换一张表运行，并检查 mass_mg 没有被改。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k2.q4","body":"每个样本的称量读数包含 100 mg 的瓶重。下面三张指令卡要先扣瓶重，再换成克，最后算每升的净克数。把卡片排成可以直接执行的顺序；每张卡恰好用一次。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","items":[{"id":"ratio","code":"df[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"net_g\"] / (df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000)"},{"id":"net","code":"df[\"net_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100"},{"id":"grams","code":"df[\"net_g\"] = df[\"net_mg\"] / 1000"}],"key":["net","grams","ratio"]}],"explanation":"先用原读数建立 net_mg，再从 net_mg 算 net_g，最后用 net_g 除以体积的升数。后一步总要用到前一步刚建立的中间列，所以不能交换顺序。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k2.q5","body":"从原表 W 开始运行。表格中的三个值都填写整段代码执行完以后的结果。\n\n```python\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"mass_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] + 100\ndf[\"conc\"] = df[\"mass_g\"] / (df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000)\ndf[\"mass_g\"] = 0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"label","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"source","header":"mass_mg","input":"integer"},{"id":"intermediate","header":"mass_g","input":"integer"},{"id":"final","header":"conc","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"label":"31","source":1600,"intermediate":0,"final":30}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"label":"7","source":920,"intermediate":0,"final":41}}]}],"explanation":"第 1 行已经把原读数换成克，所以第 2 行增加 mass_mg 后，mass_g 仍是原来的值。第 3 行据此算出浓度 30 和 41；第 4 行再把 mass_g 清零，也不会让已经存好的 conc 重新计算。每次赋值都保存当时算出的整列结果。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py21.k2.r1","body":"阅读代码。第 2 行是发现计时器每次都少记了 10 分钟，补上。\n\n```python startLine=1\nruns[\"hours\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60\nruns[\"duration_min\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] + 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"minutes","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后，R1（索引 3）的 duration_min 是多少？","key":100},{"id":"hours","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"运行后，R1 的 hours 是多少？","key":1.5},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要让 hours 用上补齐后的时长，应当怎样改？","options":[{"id":"swap","content":"把两行的顺序对调"},{"id":"again","content":"什么都不用改，hours 会自动更新"},{"id":"delete","content":"删掉第 2 行"}],"key":"swap"}],"explanation":"duration_min 是 **100**，hours 仍是 **1.5**：第 1 行用补齐之前的 90 分钟算出了 hours，第 2 行改了 duration_min，hours 不会跟着重算。\n\n把两行**对调**，先补齐再换算，R1 的 hours 才是 100 ÷ 60 ≈ 1.67。删掉第 2 行就没有补上那 10 分钟。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：三次培养的时长（分钟）和细胞计数","index":[3,11,6],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"run":["R1","R2","R3"],"duration_min":[90,45,150],"cells":[1800,1350,6000]}}]},{"id":"py21.k2.r2","body":"要在 runs 表里新增两列：`hours` 是培养时长（小时），`rate` 是每小时增加的细胞数（cells 除以 hours）。把需要的代码行排成正确的顺序；有一行用不到。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"hours","code":"runs[\"hours\"] = runs[\"duration_min\"] / 60"},{"id":"rate","code":"runs[\"rate\"] = runs[\"cells\"] / runs[\"hours\"]"},{"id":"wrong","code":"runs[\"rate\"] = runs[\"cells\"] / runs[\"duration_min\"]"}],"key":["hours","rate"],"tests":[{"name":"新增 hours 和 rate","expect":{"runs[\"hours\"]":"pd.Series([1.5, 0.75, 2.5], index=[3, 11, 6], name=\"hours\")","runs[\"rate\"]":"pd.Series([1200.0, 1800.0, 2400.0], index=[3, 11, 6], name=\"rate\")"}}]}],"explanation":"先算 hours，再用它算 rate。rate 那一行用到 hours 这一列，如果排在前面，hours 还不存在，会报 KeyError。用 duration_min 直接去除的那一行算的是“每分钟”的细胞数，单位不对。本例 rate 依次为 1200、1800、2400。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：三次培养的时长（分钟）和细胞计数","index":[3,11,6],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"run":["R1","R2","R3"],"duration_min":[90,45,150],"cells":[1800,1350,6000]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py21.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码。第 2 行是发现温度计读数整体偏低 9 °F，补上。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfield[\"temp_c\"] = (field[\"temp_f\"] - 32) * 5 / 9\nfield[\"temp_f\"] = field[\"temp_f\"] + 9\nfield[\"temp_c2\"] = (field[\"temp_f\"] - 32) * 5 / 9\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","prompt":"运行后，林缘（索引 2）这一行的三列各是多少？","columns":[{"id":"column","header":"列"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"temp_f","cells":{"column":"temp_f","value":77}},{"id":"temp_c","cells":{"column":"temp_c","value":20}},{"id":"temp_c2","cells":{"column":"temp_c2","value":25}}]}],"explanation":"temp_f 是 **77**（68 + 9）；temp_c 是 **20.0**，它在第 1 行用补正之前的 68 °F 算定，没有跟着重算；temp_c2 在第 3 行用补正之后的 77 °F 算出，是 **25.0**。\n\n同一张表里两列摄氏温度对不上，就是因为它们在不同的时刻、用不同的 temp_f 算出。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：三个样点的气温（华氏度 °F）","index":[1,2,3],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["河滩","林缘","山脊"],"temp_f":[50,68,86]}}]},{"id":"py21.k2.x2","body":"需求是：先扣掉 100 mg 的瓶重，再换算成克，最后算出每升溶液里有多少克（`conc_g_per_l`）。同事写了下面四行，结果偏大。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndf[\"net_mg\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] - 100\ndf[\"net_g\"] = df[\"mass_mg\"] / 1000\ndf[\"volume_l\"] = df[\"volume_ml\"] / 1000\ndf[\"conc_g_per_l\"] = df[\"net_g\"] / df[\"volume_l\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"从哪一行开始和需求不符？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"}],"key":"l2"},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"改正以后，S_A（索引 31）的 conc_g_per_l 是多少？","key":28}],"explanation":"**第 2 行**用的是原始的 mass_mg，没有用扣除瓶重后的 net_mg，所以 net_g 其实没扣瓶重，后面的浓度跟着偏大。应写 `df[\"net_g\"] = df[\"net_mg\"] / 1000`。\n\n改正后，S_A 是 (1500 − 100) ÷ 1000 = 1.4 g，除以 0.05 L，得到 **28** g/L。逐列核对中间列，就能停在第一个出错的地方。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]}]},{"id":"py21.k3","title":"两个 Series 运算按标签对齐而非一律按位置","key":["py14","py16"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"按标签对齐","aliases":["对齐","标签对齐","alignment"],"definition":"两个 Series 相加、相除时，pandas 按行索引的标签配对，而不是按第几个配对；一边有、另一边没有的标签，结果是 NaN。","conditions":["同一张表里的两列标签一一对应，所以看起来像逐行运算。","从别处来的 Series（取出的一部分、另一张表的列）参与运算或赋成新列时，先核对标签。"],"example":"```python\na = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nb = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[\"y\", \"x\"])\ntotal = a + b\n```\ntotal 在 x 上是 10 + 2 = 12，在 y 上是 20 + 1 = 21，不是按位置得到的 11、22。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"`pd.Series(值的列表, index=标签的列表)` 造出一列带标签的数。看两个各有 2 个值的 Series：\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nb = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[\"y\", \"x\"])\ntotal = a + b\n```\n\n| 标签 | a | b | a + b |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| x | 10 | 2 | 12 |\n| y | 20 | 1 | 21 |\n\npandas 先按**标签**配对：x 和 x 相加，y 和 y 相加。b 在第一个位置的是 y 的值 1，但它没有和 a 的第一个值相加。结果是 x 为 12、y 为 21，而不是按位置得到的 11、22。\n\n一边有、另一边没有的标签，配不上对，结果是 NaN：\n\n```python\nc = pd.Series([5, 7], index=[\"y\", \"z\"])\n```\n\n`a + c` 在 x 和 z 上是 NaN（只有一边有值），在 y 上是 20 + 5 = 25。标签不完全相同时，结果包含两边全部的标签，还会按标签排好顺序。\n\n同一张表里的两列，行索引一模一样，所以 `df[\"mass_mg\"] / df[\"volume_ml\"]` 看起来就是逐行运算。要留神的是**从别处来的** Series：\n\n- 只取出一部分行，例如 `df.loc[[22, 31], \"volume_ml\"]`（逗号前的方括号里写行标签，这里是 22 和 31 两行），再和整列运算，其余行得到 NaN；\n- 把另一个 Series 赋成新列，`df[\"ref\"] = ref`，pandas 按 df 的行索引去 ref 里找同名标签，找不到的行是 NaN，而不是按先后顺序填进去。\n","example":{"id":"py21.k3.e0","body":"阅读代码，按标签填写 `total` 的值。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nb = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[\"y\", \"x\"])\ntotal = a + b\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"label","header":"标签"},{"id":"value","header":"total","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"x","cells":{"label":"x","value":12}},{"id":"y","cells":{"label":"y","value":21}}]},{"id":"rule","type":"choice","prompt":"pandas 是怎样把 a、b 的值配成对的？","options":[{"id":"position","content":"按第几个配对：第一个和第一个、第二个和第二个"},{"id":"label","content":"按标签配对：x 和 x、y 和 y"}],"key":"label"}],"explanation":"total 在 x 上是 **12**（10 + 2），在 y 上是 **21**（20 + 1）。pandas **按标签配对**：b 的第一个值 1 属于标签 y，所以和 a 的 20 相加。按位置相加会得到 11、22，那不是 pandas 的做法。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py21.k3.q1","body":"阅读代码，按标签填写 `result` 的值。没有值的填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nc = pd.Series([5, 7], index=[\"y\", \"z\"])\nresult = a + c\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"label","header":"标签"},{"id":"value","header":"result","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"x","cells":{"label":"x","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"y","cells":{"label":"y","value":25}},{"id":"z","cells":{"label":"z","value":"NaN"}}]}],"explanation":"x 是 **NaN**，y 是 **25**，z 是 **NaN**。只有 y 两边都有，20 + 5 = 25；x 只在 a 里，z 只在 c 里，配不上对。结果包含两边全部的标签。\n"},{"id":"py21.k3.q2","body":"另一张表给出了两个样本的参考质量，存成 `ref`，标签是样本在表 W 里的原行索引。阅读代码，按原行索引填写新列 `ref` 的值。没有值的填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nref = pd.Series([100, 200], index=[4, 31])\ndf[\"ref\"] = ref\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"value","header":"ref","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","value":200}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","value":100}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **200、NaN、NaN、100**。赋成新列时，pandas 拿 df 的每个行索引去 ref 里找同名标签：31 找到 200，4 找到 100，7 和 22 找不到，是 NaN。它不会把 100、200 按先后顺序填进前两行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k3.q3","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `ratio` 的值，没有值的填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\npart = df.loc[[22, 31], \"volume_ml\"]\nratio = df[\"mass_mg\"] / part\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"value","header":"ratio","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","value":30}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","value":30}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","value":"NaN"}}]},{"id":"missing","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`ratio` 里有几个 NaN？","key":2}],"explanation":"31 和 22 都是 **30.0**，7 和 4 是 **NaN**，共 **2** 个 NaN。`part` 只取出了 22、31 两行的体积，其余标签在 part 里找不到，配不上对。\n\n结果仍有四个标签，而且按标签排成了 4、7、22、31 的顺序；这是标签不完全相同时 pandas 的做法，读结果时按标签找值，不要按位置找。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]},{"id":"py21.k3.q4","body":"两列的标签顺序不同，但每个标签都能找到对应项。写出两行输出。\n\n```python\namount = pd.Series([12, 20], index=[\"a\", \"b\"])\nvolume = pd.Series([5, 3], index=[\"b\", \"a\"])\nratio = amount / volume\nprint(ratio[\"a\"])\nprint(ratio[\"b\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"4.0"},{"id":"b","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"4.0"}],"explanation":"两行都显示 4.0。a 的分母是标签 a 对应的 3，b 的分母是标签 b 对应的 5。标签顺序不同不会造成缺失；也不会把位置上的 12 和 5、20 和 3 配成对。\n"},{"id":"py21.k3.q5","body":"ref 里有表 W 没有的标签 99。把它赋成新列后，按原行索引填写 offset，并填写结果表的行数。没有对应值的填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nref = pd.Series([7, 9], index=[7, 99])\ndf[\"offset\"] = ref\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"label","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"value","header":"offset","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"label":"31","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"label":"7","value":7}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"label":"22","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"label":"4","value":"NaN"}}]},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后 df 有几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"只有原行索引 7 能在 ref 中找到同名标签，因此 offset 是 7；另外三行都是 NaN。赋成新列时按 df 已有的行索引寻找值，ref 多出来的标签 99 不会给 df 增加一行，所以 df 仍有四行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 W","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"mass_mg":[1500,820,2400,960],"volume_ml":[50,20,80,40]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py21.k3.r1","body":"阅读代码，写出输出。\n\n```python\na = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[0, 1])\nb = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[1, 0])\nprint(list(a + b))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"显示什么？","key":"[21, 12]","feedback":[{"when":"[11, 22]","message":"这是按位置相加的结果；pandas 按标签配对，标签 0 的 1 和标签 0 的 20 相加。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **[21, 12]**。标签 0 上是 1 + 20 = 21，标签 1 上是 2 + 10 = 12。标签恰好是 0、1 这样的数，也是按标签配对，不是按位置。\n"},{"id":"py21.k3.r2","body":"复测了两个样地的深度，存成 `recheck`，标签是样地在表 soil 里的原行索引。阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `diff` 的值，没有值的填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nrecheck = pd.Series([33, 27], index=[8, 12])\ndiff = recheck - soil[\"depth\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"value","header":"diff","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r12","cells":{"index":"12","value":2}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","value":"NaN"}},{"id":"r8","cells":{"index":"8","value":3}}]}],"explanation":"索引 12 是 27 − 25 = **2**，索引 8 是 33 − 30 = **3**，5 和 3 没有复测，是 **NaN**。recheck 的第一个值 33 属于标签 8，没有和 soil 的第一行（索引 5）相减。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个样地的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py21.k3.x1","body":"表 runs 里 R1、R2、R3 三次培养的接种量依次是 500、300、450。同事想算每次培养的细胞计数除以接种量，把接种量存成 `seed`，并给它配了标签 0、1、2：\n\n```python\nseed = pd.Series([500, 300, 450], index=[0, 1, 2])\nruns[\"rate\"] = runs[\"cells\"] / seed\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nan","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行之后，`runs[\"rate\"]` 里有几个 NaN？","key":3},{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么会这样？","options":[{"id":"labels","content":"`seed` 的标签 0、1、2 和 `runs` 的原行索引 3、11、6 一个也对不上，pandas 按标签配对，配不上的就是 NaN"},{"id":"missing","content":"三个接种量里有缺失"},{"id":"dtype","content":"`cells` 是整数，不能除以 `seed`"}],"key":"labels"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"要让 R1 除以 500、R2 除以 300、R3 除以 450，第一行应改成哪几种？选出所有可以的。","options":[{"id":"labels","content":"```python\nseed = pd.Series([500, 300, 450], index=[3, 11, 6])\n```\n"},{"id":"same_index","content":"```python\nseed = pd.Series([500, 300, 450], index=runs.index)\n```\n"},{"id":"default","content":"```python\nseed = pd.Series([500, 300, 450])\n```\n"},{"id":"shuffled","content":"```python\nseed = pd.Series([500, 300, 450], index=[11, 3, 6])\n```\n"}],"key":["labels","same_index"]}],"explanation":"`runs` 的原行索引是 3、11、6，`seed` 的标签是 0、1、2，两边一个标签也对不上，三个格子都是 **NaN**。pandas 先按标签配对，位置在前不在前不起作用。\n\n让两边的标签对上就行：标签写成 3、11、6，或者直接用 `runs.index`，R1 用 500、R2 用 300、R3 用 450。不写 `index` 时标签默认是 0、1、2，和 `runs` 仍然对不上；写成 11、3、6 能对上，但配错了对象：原行索引 3 的 R1 会除以 300。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"runs","caption":"表 runs：三次培养的时长（分钟）和细胞计数","index":[3,11,6],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"run":["R1","R2","R3"],"duration_min":[90,45,150],"cells":[1800,1350,6000]}}]},{"id":"py21.k3.x2","body":"哪一段代码得到的 `total` 在标签 x 上是 11、在标签 y 上是 22？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\na = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nb = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[\"y\", \"x\"])\ntotal = a + b\n```\n"},{"id":"same","content":"```python\na = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nb = pd.Series([20, 10], index=[\"y\", \"x\"])\ntotal = a + b\n```\n"},{"id":"shifted","content":"```python\na = pd.Series([1, 2], index=[\"x\", \"y\"])\nb = pd.Series([10, 20], index=[\"x\", \"z\"])\ntotal = a + b\n```\n"}],"key":"same"}],"explanation":"b 写成 `[20, 10]`、标签 `[\"y\", \"x\"]` 的那一段：b 在 x 上是 10、在 y 上是 20，按标签相加得到 x 为 11、y 为 22。\n\nb 写成 `[10, 20]`、标签 `[\"y\", \"x\"]` 时，x 上是 1 + 20 = 21；b 的标签是 x、z 时，y 和 z 配不上对，得到 NaN。看 Series 的值，要连同它的标签一起看。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py22","title":"明确改的是原表还是新结果","summary":"用一次 df.loc[行, 列] = 值 改原表里选中的格；分清别名、派生结果和 copy：在 pandas 3 里，改派生结果不会改到原表。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py21","py17","py01"],"intro":"前几节的代码大多是从原表算出新的结果：筛选出的行、新加的列。这一节要改原表里已有的格，例如把扣除本底后成了负数的读数改成 0。关键是说清楚：改的是哪张表的哪些格。\n\n宿主已经导入了 pandas（`pd`）并准备好数据表；每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 T：`signal` 是扣除本底以后的读数，可能是负数。题里常用 `.min()` 取出一列的最小值，用来看还有没有负数。\n","wrapup":"要改原表，就写一次 `df.loc[行, 列] = 值`，行和列都写在同一对方括号里。要一份可以随便改、又不影响原表的表，就写 `df.copy()`，让读代码的人一眼看出来。\n\n向 AI 提需求时，说清“直接改原表”还是“得到一张新表、原表不动”。拿到代码后，找出每一处修改：它改的是 df 本身，还是某个筛选结果或副本；`b = df` 这样的一行，意味着之后改 b 就是在改 df。\n","kps":[{"id":"py22.k1","title":"单次 loc 赋值表达修改目标","key":["py17","py21"],"links":["py17.k2"],"card":{"name":"loc 赋值","aliases":["修改原表","链式赋值"],"definition":"df.loc[掩码, 列名] = 值 把原表里选中行、选中列的格改成新值，其余的格不动；行和列要写在同一对方括号里。","conditions":["链式赋值 df[掩码][\"列\"] = 值 先得到一张新表再改它，原表不变；pandas 3 只给一条警告，不报错。","列名还不存在时，选中的行得到新值，其余行是 NaN。"],"example":"```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0\n```\n表 T 的 signal 从 8、-1、13、-3 变成 8、0、13、0，df 自己被改了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},"lesson":"要改原表里的格，用一次 `.loc` 赋值，把**行**和**列**都写在同一对方括号里：\n\n```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0\n```\n\n读作：在 df 里，signal 小于 0 的那些行、signal 这一列，改成 0。逗号前选行，和[用掩码筛选](repa:concept/py17.k2)时一样；逗号后是要改的列；等号右边是新值。只有选中的格被改，其他格不动，被改的是 df 自己。\n\n| 原行索引 | signal（改之前） | signal（改之后） |\n|---:|---:|---:|\n| 31 | 8 | 8 |\n| 7 | -1 | 0 |\n| 22 | 13 | 13 |\n| 4 | -3 | 0 |\n\n逗号后写一个还没有的列名，就是给选中的行写一列新值：`df.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"flag\"] = \"below\"` 让索引 7、4 的 flag 是 below，其余行的 flag 是 NaN。\n\n常见的错误写法是分两步选：\n\n```python\ndf[df[\"signal\"] < 0][\"signal\"] = 0\n```\n\n`df[df[\"signal\"] < 0]` 先得到一张**新表**（筛选结果），后面的 `[\"signal\"] = 0` 改的是这张新表。新表用完就没了，df 一格也没变。pandas 3 会给出一条 ChainedAssignmentError 警告，但程序照常往下运行，很容易漏看。`df[\"signal\"][df[\"signal\"] < 0] = 0` 也是两步，同样改不到 df。\n\n规则只有一条：要改原表，写一次 `df.loc[行, 列] = 值`。\n","example":{"id":"py22.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写运行后 df 的 signal。\n\n```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"signal","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"before","header":"signal（运行前）"},{"id":"after","header":"signal（运行后）","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","before":"8","after":8}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","before":"-1","after":0}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","before":"13","after":13}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","before":"-3","after":0}}]},{"id":"changed","type":"choice","prompt":"运行后，df 自己变了吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"变了，选中的两格改成了 0"},{"id":"no","content":"没变，改的是一张新表"}],"key":"yes"}],"explanation":"运行后 signal 依次为 **8、0、13、0**。逗号前的掩码选中 signal 小于 0 的索引 7、4，逗号后选 signal 列，这两格改成 0；其余的格不动。这是一次 `.loc` 赋值，被改的是 **df 自己**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py22.k1.q1","body":"同事想把负的读数改成 0，写了下面这行。运行时只出现一条警告，没有报错。\n\n```python\ndf[df[\"signal\"] < 0][\"signal\"] = 0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"after","type":"table","prompt":"运行后，df 的 signal 是多少？","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal（运行后）","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":8}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":-1}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":13}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":-3}}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"loc","content":"```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0\n```\n"},{"id":"col_first","content":"```python\ndf[\"signal\"][df[\"signal\"] < 0] = 0\n```\n","feedback":"这还是分两步：先取出 signal 这一列，再改取出的那一列，df 不变。"},{"id":"rows_only","content":"```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0] = 0\n```\n","feedback":"逗号后没写列名，会把选中行的每一列都改成 0；文字列放不下数，这里会报 TypeError。"}],"key":"loc"}],"explanation":"df 一格也没变，仍是 **8、-1、13、-3**。`df[df[\"signal\"] < 0]` 先得到一张新表，`[\"signal\"] = 0` 改的是这张新表，用完就没了。\n\n改成一次 **`df.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0`**，行和列写在同一对方括号里，才改到 df。先取出 signal 列再改，同样是两步；不写列名会去改整行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k1.q2","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写运行后新列 `flag` 的值。没有值的填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"flag\"] = \"below\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"flag","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"flag","header":"flag","input":{"type":"text","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","signal":"8","flag":"NaN"}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","signal":"-1","flag":"below"}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","signal":"13","flag":"NaN"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","signal":"-3","flag":"below"}}]},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后 df 有几列？","key":4}],"explanation":"flag 依次为 **NaN、below、NaN、below**。flag 原来不存在，这一行给 df 加了一列：选中的行写进 below，没选中的行没有值，是 NaN。df 原有 3 列，现在 **4** 列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 直接修改 df：signal 超过 `limit` 的读数一律改成 `limit`，其他格保持不变。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，运行后 df 没有任何变化。请改动它并提交。宿主另外提供了 `limit`，本例为 10。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"df[df[\"signal\"] > limit][\"signal\"] = limit\n","solution":"df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > limit, \"signal\"] = limit\n","accepts":["df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > limit, [\"signal\"]] = limit","df[\"signal\"] = df[\"signal\"].clip(upper=limit)"],"rejects":[{"code":"df[\"signal\"][df[\"signal\"] > limit] = limit","why":"仍是分两步，改的是取出的那一列"},{"code":"df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > limit] = limit","why":"没写列名，去改整行"},{"code":"df = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] <= limit]","why":"把超过的行删掉了，而不是改成 limit"},{"code":"df[\"signal\"] = limit","why":"把每一行都改成了 limit"},{"code":"df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > 10, \"signal\"] = 10","why":"把 limit 写死成 10"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 T，limit 为 10","setup":"limit = 10","expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"], \"signal\": [8, -1, 10, -3], \"group\": [\"low\", \"control\", \"high\", \"low\"]}, index=[31, 7, 22, 4])"}},{"name":"换一张表和阈值","hidden":true,"data":["T2"],"setup":"limit = 6","expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_A\", \"X_B\", \"X_C\", \"X_D\", \"X_E\"], \"signal\": [-2, 6, 5, -7, 6], \"group\": [\"high\", \"control\", \"low\", \"high\", \"low\"]}, index=[90, 2, 60, 11, 45])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] > limit, \"signal\"] = limit\n```\n\n原来的写法先筛出一张新表，再改新表，df 不变。改成一次 `.loc` 赋值：逗号前选出超过 limit 的行，逗号后是 signal 列。本例只有索引 22 的 13 改成 10。判分时还会换一张表、换阈值运行，检查整张 df。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py22.k1.r1","body":"复测发现东坡的深度记错了。阅读代码，按原行索引填写运行后的 depth。\n\n```python\nsoil.loc[soil[\"site\"] == \"东坡\", \"depth\"] = 32\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"depth","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"site","header":"site"},{"id":"depth","header":"depth（运行后）","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","site":"北坡","depth":30}},{"id":"r12","cells":{"index":"12","site":"南坡","depth":25}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","site":"东坡","depth":32}},{"id":"r8","cells":{"index":"8","site":"西坡","depth":30}}]}],"explanation":"depth 依次为 **30、25、32、30**。只有 site 为东坡的索引 3 被选中，它的 depth 从 35 改成 32；其他格不动。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个样地的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]},{"id":"py22.k1.r2","body":"要把 wells 里计数低于 100 的孔改成 100。下面每一行单独运行，哪几行会真的改到 wells？选出所有会改到的。\n","slots":[{"id":"works","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"loc","content":"`wells.loc[wells[\"count\"] < 100, \"count\"] = 100`"},{"id":"filter_first","content":"`wells[wells[\"count\"] < 100][\"count\"] = 100`"},{"id":"column_first","content":"`wells[\"count\"][wells[\"count\"] < 100] = 100`"},{"id":"loc_then","content":"`wells.loc[wells[\"count\"] < 100][\"count\"] = 100`"}],"key":["loc"]}],"explanation":"只有**行和列写在同一个 `.loc[...]` 里**的那一行会改到 wells。其余三行都是分两步：先得到一张新表或一列（哪怕第一步用的也是 `.loc`），再改它，wells 不变。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数和状态","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"],"status":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py22.k1.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 直接修改 wells：p2 板上的孔，status 一律改成 `recheck`；其他孔的 status 和其他列都保持原样。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，运行后 wells 没有变化。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"p2 = wells[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p2\"]\np2[\"status\"] = \"recheck\"\n","solution":"wells.loc[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p2\", \"status\"] = \"recheck\"\n","rejects":[{"code":"p2 = wells.loc[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p2\"]\np2.loc[:, \"status\"] = \"recheck\"\n","why":"改的仍是筛选出来的新表"},{"code":"wells[\"status\"] = \"recheck\"","why":"把每个孔都改成了 recheck"},{"code":"wells.loc[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p2\"] = \"recheck\"","why":"没写列名，把整行都改成了 recheck"},{"code":"wells = wells.loc[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p2\"]","why":"只剩 p2 板的孔，status 也没改"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 wells","expect":{"wells":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"B1\", \"B2\", \"C1\"], \"count\": [120, 95, 150, 80, 110], \"plate\": [\"p1\", \"p1\", \"p2\", \"p2\", \"p3\"], \"status\": [\"ok\", \"ok\", \"recheck\", \"recheck\", \"ok\"]}, index=[3, 11, 6, 9, 14])"}},{"name":"换一块板的记录","hidden":true,"data":["wells2"],"expect":{"wells":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"D1\", \"D2\", \"E1\", \"E2\"], \"count\": [60, 140, 90, 100], \"plate\": [\"p3\", \"p2\", \"p2\", \"p1\"], \"status\": [\"ok\", \"recheck\", \"recheck\", \"ok\"]}, index=[7, 2, 13, 5])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nwells.loc[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p2\", \"status\"] = \"recheck\"\n```\n\n原来的代码先筛出 p2 板的孔，存成新表 `p2`，再改 `p2`；wells 不变。要改 wells，就在 wells 上写一次 `.loc` 赋值，逗号前选 p2 板的行，逗号后是 status 列。判分时还会换一块板的记录运行，检查整张表。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数和状态","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"],"status":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k1.x2","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\ntemps[temps[\"temp\"] < 0][\"temp\"] = 0\nprint(temps[\"temp\"].min())\ntemps.loc[temps[\"temp\"] < 0, \"temp\"] = 0\nprint(temps[\"temp\"].min())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"-2.5","feedback":[{"when":"0.0","message":"第 1 行改的是筛选出来的新表，temps 还没变。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"0.0"}],"explanation":"第一行 **-2.5**：第 1 行先筛出一张新表再改它，temps 不变，最低气温仍是 -2.5。第二行 **0.0**：第 3 行是一次 `.loc` 赋值，把 temps 里的两个负数改成了 0，最低的就是 0.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：四个气象站的凌晨气温（℃）","index":[1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"station":["T1","T2","T3","T4"],"temp":[-2.5,1,0,-0.5]},"dtypes":{"temp":"float"}}]}]},{"id":"py22.k2","title":"区分别名、派生结果与显式 copy，按 pandas 3 CoW 理解","key":["py01","py17"],"links":["py01.k1"],"card":{"name":"别名与副本","aliases":["copy","别名","Copy-on-Write"],"definition":"b = df 只是给同一张表多起一个名字，改 b 就是改 df；筛选结果、取出的一列等派生结果在 pandas 3 里与原表互不影响；df.copy() 明确得到一份独立的表。","conditions":["名字改指向派生结果以后（t = t.loc[...]），再改 t 就不会影响原表。","旧教程里 view、copy、SettingWithCopyWarning 的说法不适用于 pandas 3。"],"example":"```python\nalias = df\nsub = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > 0, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\nalias.loc[7, \"signal\"] = 0\nsub.loc[31, \"signal\"] = 99\n```\ndf 的索引 7 变成 0（alias 就是 df），索引 31 仍是 8（sub 是派生结果）。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},"lesson":"[赋值](repa:concept/py01.k1)是让名字指向一个值。写 `b = df`，并没有复制出第二张表，只是同一张表多了一个名字 b，叫作**别名**。之后通过 b 改（`b.loc[...] = ...`、`b[\"new\"] = ...`），df 也跟着变，因为它们本来就是同一张表。\n\n由 df 算出来的东西，例如筛选结果 `df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > 0]`、取出的一列 `df[\"signal\"]`、`df.dropna()` 的结果，是**派生结果**。在 pandas 3 里，派生结果和原表互不影响：改派生结果不会改到 df，之后改 df 也不会改到已经得到的派生结果。pandas 在背后用一种叫 Copy-on-Write（写时复制）的办法省内存，但你看到的效果就是彼此独立。\n\n| 写法 | 和 df 的关系 | 改它会改到 df 吗 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `b = df` | 同一张表的另一个名字 | 会 |\n| `sub = df.loc[掩码]`、`col = df[\"signal\"]` | 派生结果 | 不会 |\n| `c = df.copy()` | 明确复制出的独立表 | 不会 |\n\n既然派生结果已经独立，为什么还要 `copy()`？想要“一份可以随便改、又不影响原表的表”时，`b = df` 是错的写法，`b = df.copy()` 才对；写出 `copy()` 也让读代码的人一眼看出这是副本。\n\n还有一种情形要留心：\n\n```python\nt = df\nt = t.loc[t[\"signal\"] > 0]\n```\n\n第一行 t 是 df 的别名；第二行让 t 改指向一个派生结果。从这时起，t 和 df 已经是两张表，再改 t 不会影响 df。\n\n旧教程和旧版 pandas 讲过“视图（view）”“副本（copy）”和 SettingWithCopyWarning，那套说法不适用于 pandas 3。判断时只问三件事：这个名字是不是 df 的别名；它是不是由 df 算出来的；有没有写 `copy()`。\n","example":{"id":"py22.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，写出四行全部运行后的几个值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nalias = df\nsub = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] > 0, [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\nalias.loc[7, \"signal\"] = 0\nsub.loc[31, \"signal\"] = 99\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"df7","cells":{"what":"df.loc[7, \"signal\"]","value":0}},{"id":"df31","cells":{"what":"df.loc[31, \"signal\"]","value":8}},{"id":"sub31","cells":{"what":"sub.loc[31, \"signal\"]","value":99}}]},{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"alias 和 df 是什么关系？","options":[{"id":"same","content":"同一张表的两个名字"},{"id":"copy","content":"两张内容相同、互不影响的表"}],"key":"same"}],"explanation":"- `df.loc[7, \"signal\"]` 是 **0**：alias 就是 df，第 3 行通过 alias 改的就是 df。\n- `df.loc[31, \"signal\"]` 是 **8**：sub 是筛选出来的派生结果，第 4 行改 sub 不会改到 df。\n- `sub.loc[31, \"signal\"]` 是 **99**：sub 自己被改了。\n\nalias 和 df 是**同一张表的两个名字**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py22.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nbackup = df.copy()\nsame = df\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0\nprint(backup[\"signal\"].min())\nprint(same[\"signal\"].min())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":-3},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":0,"feedback":[{"when":-3,"message":"same = df 没有复制出新表，same 和 df 是同一张表。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行 **-3**：backup 是改之前用 `copy()` 复制出的独立的表，df 后来的修改与它无关。第二行 **0**：`same = df` 只是给同一张表多起一个名字，df 的负数改成 0 以后，通过 same 看到的也是改过的表。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k2.q2","body":"需求是：先留一份原始表 `raw`，再直接把 df 里的负数改成 0；raw 要保持原始读数。同事写了下面的代码，结果 raw 里也没有负数了。\n\n```python startLine=1\nraw = df\ndf.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0, \"signal\"] = 0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 1 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"alias","content":"```python\nraw = df.loc[df[\"signal\"] < 0]\n```\n","feedback":"这样 raw 只剩负数的那几行，不是一份完整的原始表。"},{"id":"copy","content":"```python\nraw = df.copy()\n```\n"},{"id":"swap","content":"```python\ndf = raw\n```\n","feedback":"这时还没有 raw 这个名字，会报 NameError。"}],"key":"copy"},{"id":"raw_min","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"改好以后，`raw[\"signal\"].min()` 是多少？","key":-3}],"explanation":"第 1 行改成 **`raw = df.copy()`**。原来的 `raw = df` 只是别名，第 2 行改 df，raw 看到的也是改过的表。用 `copy()` 先复制出一份独立的表，raw 的最小值仍是 **-3**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k2.q3","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python startLine=1\nt = df\nt = t.loc[t[\"signal\"] > 0]\nt.loc[22, \"signal\"] = 100\nprint(len(df))\nprint(df.loc[22, \"signal\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":4},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":13,"feedback":[{"when":100,"message":"第 2 行之后 t 已经改指向筛选结果，不再是 df 的别名。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行 **4**，第二行 **13**。第 1 行 t 是 df 的别名；第 2 行让 t 改指向一个筛选结果（派生结果），从这时起 t 和 df 是两张表。第 3 行改的是 t，df 仍有 4 行，索引 22 仍是 13。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py22.k2.r1","body":"宿主依次运行了下面四行。\n\n```python\na = wells\nb = wells.copy()\nc = wells.loc[wells[\"count\"] > 100]\nd = a\n```\n\n之后通过哪些名字去改（例如 `名字.loc[3, \"count\"] = 0`），会改到 wells？选出所有会改到的。\n","slots":[{"id":"names","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"a","content":"`a`"},{"id":"b","content":"`b`"},{"id":"c","content":"`c`"},{"id":"d","content":"`d`"}],"key":["a","d"]}],"explanation":"**a 和 d**。a 是 wells 的别名；d = a 让 d 也指向同一张表。b 是 `copy()` 复制出的独立的表；c 是筛选结果，在 pandas 3 里与 wells 互不影响。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数和状态","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"],"status":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k2.r2","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\ncol = df[\"signal\"]\ncol.iloc[0] = 99\nprint(df[\"signal\"].iloc[0])\ndf.loc[31, \"signal\"] = 50\nprint(col.iloc[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":8,"feedback":[{"when":99,"message":"col 是从 df 取出的一列，是派生结果；在 pandas 3 里改它不会改到 df。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":99}],"explanation":"第一行 **8**：col 是从 df 取出的一列，是派生结果，改 col 不会改到 df。第二行 **99**：反过来，之后改 df 也不会改到已经取出的 col，它仍是自己改过的 99。两者从取出那一刻起就互不影响。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,-1,13,-3],"group":["low","control","high","low"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py22.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码，写出全部运行后的几个值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nbackup = wells.copy()\nview = wells\npart = wells.loc[wells[\"plate\"] == \"p1\"]\nview.loc[3, \"count\"] = 0\npart.loc[11, \"count\"] = 0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"w3","cells":{"what":"wells.loc[3, \"count\"]","value":0}},{"id":"w11","cells":{"what":"wells.loc[11, \"count\"]","value":95}},{"id":"b3","cells":{"what":"backup.loc[3, \"count\"]","value":120}},{"id":"p3","cells":{"what":"part.loc[3, \"count\"]","value":120}}]}],"explanation":"- `wells.loc[3, \"count\"]` 是 **0**：view 是 wells 的别名，第 4 行改的就是 wells。\n- `wells.loc[11, \"count\"]` 是 **95**：part 是筛选结果，第 5 行改 part 不会改到 wells。\n- `backup.loc[3, \"count\"]` 是 **120**：backup 是改之前复制出的独立的表。\n- `part.loc[3, \"count\"]` 是 **120**：part 在第 3 行就得到了，之后 wells 的修改不会传到它。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数和状态","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"],"status":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"]}}]},{"id":"py22.k2.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 得到一张新表 `clean`：计数低于 100 的孔，count 改成 100；其他格保持原样。原表 wells 不能改。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，clean 是对的，却把 wells 也改了。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"clean = wells\nclean.loc[clean[\"count\"] < 100, \"count\"] = 100\n","solution":"clean = wells.copy()\nclean.loc[clean[\"count\"] < 100, \"count\"] = 100\n","accepts":["clean = wells.copy()\nclean[\"count\"] = clean[\"count\"].clip(lower=100)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"wells.loc[wells[\"count\"] < 100, \"count\"] = 100\nclean = wells\n","why":"先改了 wells"},{"code":"clean = wells.copy()\nclean[clean[\"count\"] < 100][\"count\"] = 100\n","why":"链式赋值，clean 没有改"},{"code":"clean = wells.loc[wells[\"count\"] >= 100]","why":"把计数低于 100 的孔删掉了，而不是改成 100"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 wells","expect":{"clean":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"B1\", \"B2\", \"C1\"], \"count\": [120, 100, 150, 100, 110], \"plate\": [\"p1\", \"p1\", \"p2\", \"p2\", \"p3\"], \"status\": [\"ok\", \"ok\", \"ok\", \"ok\", \"ok\"]}, index=[3, 11, 6, 9, 14])","wells":"wells"}},{"name":"换一块板的记录","hidden":true,"data":["wells2"],"expect":{"clean":"pd.DataFrame({\"well\": [\"D1\", \"D2\", \"E1\", \"E2\"], \"count\": [100, 140, 100, 100], \"plate\": [\"p3\", \"p2\", \"p2\", \"p1\"], \"status\": [\"ok\", \"ok\", \"hold\", \"ok\"]}, index=[7, 2, 13, 5])","wells":"wells"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nclean = wells.copy()\nclean.loc[clean[\"count\"] < 100, \"count\"] = 100\n```\n\n`clean = wells` 只是给 wells 多起一个名字，改 clean 就是改 wells。用 `copy()` 先复制出一份独立的表，再在它上面做一次 `.loc` 赋值。判分时会检查 clean 的每一格，并确认 wells 没有被改；还会换一块板的记录运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数和状态","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,150,80,110],"plate":["p1","p1","p2","p2","p3"],"status":["ok","ok","ok","ok","ok"]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py23","title":"排序后，位置不再等于原来的标签","summary":"用 sort_values 按一列或多列排序，并列时写明次要排序键或稳定排序；排序后分清位置和标签，按需求决定 reset_index 还是保留原索引。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py16","py12"],"intro":"排序看起来最简单：从大到小排一下。但两个样本数值相同时谁在前？排好以后说“第一行”，指的是排在最前面的那行，还是原来编号为 0 的那行？这一节把这两件事说清楚。\n\n宿主已经导入了 pandas（`pd`）并准备好数据表；每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提排序需求时，说全四件事：按哪一列、什么方向；并列时按哪一列、什么方向，或者保持原来的先后；结果要不要重新编号。例如：“按 signal 从高到低，signal 相同的按 sample_id 从小到大；输出时重新编号为 0、1、2……，不保留原行号。”\n\n读排序后的代码，看到 `.loc[0]` 要停一下：它取的是标签为 0 的那一行，不一定排在最前面。\n","kps":[{"id":"py23.k1","title":"按一列或多列排序及并列顺序","key":["py12"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"排序与并列","aliases":["sort_values","次要排序键","稳定排序"],"definition":"df.sort_values(列) 得到按这一列排好的新表，整行连同行索引一起移动；并列行的先后要由次要排序键或 kind=\"stable\" 写明。","conditions":["默认排序不保证并列行谁先谁后，碰巧的顺序不能当成结果。","多列排序写 sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"], ascending=[False, True])：先按第一列，相同再按第二列。","业务要求“同值保持原来的先后”时，用单列的 kind=\"stable\"。"],"example":"```python\nresult = df.sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"], ascending=[False, True])\n```\n表 T 排成 18、22、7、4、31：signal 同为 10 的 S_B、S_D 按 sample_id 排，S_B 在前。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,15]}}]},"lesson":"`df.sort_values(\"signal\")` 按 signal 从小到大排好，得到一张**新表**；df 本身不变，要用结果就存进一个名字。从大到小写 `ascending=False`。排序时整行一起移动，行索引跟着各自的行走：\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 31 | S_A | 8 |\n| 7 | S_B | 10 |\n| 4 | S_D | 10 |\n| 22 | S_C | 13 |\n| 18 | S_E | 15 |\n\nS_B 和 S_D 的 signal 都是 10，叫作**并列**。pandas 默认的排序**不保证**并列的行谁先谁后，这一次的顺序可能只是碰巧。结果要能复核，就要在需求和代码里写明并列时怎么办，有两种办法：\n\n1. **次要排序键**：`df.sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"])` 先按 signal 排，signal 相同再按 sample_id 排。两列方向不同时，给 `ascending` 一个同样长的列表：`ascending=[False, True]` 表示 signal 从大到小、sample_id 从小到大。\n2. **保持原来的先后**：如果业务上要求“同值按录入顺序”，用稳定排序 `df.sort_values(\"signal\", kind=\"stable\")`，它保证并列的行保持原表里的先后。\n\n所以一条排序需求要说全：按哪一列、什么方向；并列时按哪一列、什么方向，或者保持原来的先后。只说“按 signal 排一下”，并列的那几行就留给了运气。\n","example":{"id":"py23.k1.e0","body":"需求是“按 signal 从高到低排；signal 相同的，按 sample_id 从小到大”。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = df.sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"], ascending=[False, True])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"按 `result` 里的先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["18","22","7","4","31"]},{"id":"unchanged","type":"choice","prompt":"运行后，df 本身的行顺序怎样了？","options":[{"id":"sorted","content":"也排好了"},{"id":"same","content":"没变，排好的是新表 result"}],"key":"same"}],"explanation":"顺序是 **18、22、7、4、31**。signal 从高到低是 15、13、10、10、8；并列的两个 10 再按 sample_id 从小到大，S_B（索引 7）在 S_D（索引 4）前面。行索引跟着各自的行走。\n\ndf 本身**没变**：sort_values 得到的是新表，存进了 result。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,15]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py23.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nresult = df.sort_values(\"signal\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"choice","prompt":"`result` 最前面一行的原行索引是？","options":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":"31"},{"id":"last","type":"choice","prompt":"最后一行的原行索引是？","options":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":"18"},{"id":"tie","type":"choice","prompt":"索引 7 和 4 谁排在前面？","options":[{"id":"7","content":"一定是 7，因为它在原表里更靠前"},{"id":"4","content":"一定是 4，因为 4 比 7 小"},{"id":"unspecified","content":"不一定：它们的 signal 并列，默认排序不保证谁先谁后"}],"key":"unspecified"}],"explanation":"最前面是 **31**（signal 8），最后是 **18**（signal 15）。\n\n索引 7 和 4 的 signal 都是 10，是并列；默认排序**不保证**它们谁先谁后。即使这一次 7 在前，也只是碰巧。要固定顺序，就加次要排序键，或者在需要保持原顺序时用 `kind=\"stable\"`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,15]}}]},{"id":"py23.k1.q2","body":"需求是“按 signal 从高到低排；signal 相同的，按 sample_id 从小到大（S_A 在前）”。同事写了下面这行。\n\n```python\nresult = df.sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"], ascending=False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"这行代码得到的 `result`，原行索引依次是？","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["18","22","4","7","31"]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"list","content":"```python\nresult = df.sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"], ascending=[False, True])\n```\n"},{"id":"swap","content":"```python\nresult = df.sort_values([\"sample_id\", \"signal\"], ascending=[True, False])\n```\n","feedback":"列的先后决定先按谁排；这样会先按 sample_id 排，signal 几乎不起作用。"},{"id":"asc","content":"```python\nresult = df.sort_values([\"signal\", \"sample_id\"])\n```\n","feedback":"两列都成了从小到大，signal 的方向反了。"}],"key":"list"}],"explanation":"这行得到 **18、22、4、7、31**：`ascending=False` 让两列都从大到小，并列的 S_D（索引 4）排到了 S_B（索引 7）前面。\n\n两列方向不同，要给 `ascending` 一个列表：**`ascending=[False, True]`**，与列名列表一一对应。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,15]}}]},{"id":"py23.k1.q3","body":"负责人要求：按 signal 从低到高排；signal 相同的，保持原表里的先后。阅读代码。\n\n```python\nresult = df.sort_values(\"signal\", kind=\"stable\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"按 `result` 里的先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"18","content":"18"}],"key":["31","7","4","22","18"]},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"索引 7 为什么排在索引 4 前面？","options":[{"id":"label","content":"因为 7 这个标签比 4 小"},{"id":"stable","content":"因为两行 signal 并列，稳定排序保持了原表里 7 在 4 前面的先后"},{"id":"chance","content":"碰巧如此，下次运行可能不同"}],"key":"stable"}],"explanation":"顺序是 **31、7、4、22、18**。并列的两个 10 里，原表中 S_B（索引 7）排在 S_D（索引 4）前面；`kind=\"stable\"` 是**稳定排序**，保证并列的行保持原来的先后，所以 7 在 4 前面。这不是碰巧，也和标签的大小无关：标签 7 其实比 4 大。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 T","index":[31,7,22,4,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[8,10,13,10,15]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py23.k1.r1","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = soil.sort_values([\"depth\", \"plot\"], ascending=[False, True])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"按 `result` 里的先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"20","content":"20"}],"key":["20","3","5","8","12"]},{"id":"third","type":"text","prompt":"排在第 3 位的是哪个样地（plot）？","key":"P1"}],"explanation":"顺序是 **20、3、5、8、12**：深度 40、35、30、30、25。P1 和 P4 的深度都是 30，再按 plot 从小到大，P1 在前，所以第 3 位是 **P1**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个样地的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"depth":[30,25,35,30,40]}}]},{"id":"py23.k1.r2","body":"负责人说：“把孔按细胞数从多到少排；细胞数一样的，按孔号（well）从小到大。”把这条要求填成下面四个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"column","type":"choice","prompt":"先按哪一列排","options":[{"id":"well","content":"well"},{"id":"count","content":"count"}],"key":"count"},{"id":"direction","type":"choice","prompt":"这一列的方向","options":[{"id":"asc","content":"从小到大"},{"id":"desc","content":"从大到小"}],"key":"desc"},{"id":"tie","type":"choice","prompt":"并列时按哪一列排","options":[{"id":"well","content":"well"},{"id":"count","content":"count"},{"id":"none","content":"不用管"}],"key":"well"},{"id":"tie_direction","type":"choice","prompt":"并列时那一列的方向","options":[{"id":"asc","content":"从小到大"},{"id":"desc","content":"从大到小"}],"key":"asc"}],"explanation":"先按 **count**、**从大到小**；并列时按 **well**、**从小到大**。对应的代码是 `wells.sort_values([\"count\", \"well\"], ascending=[False, True])`。“不用管”会把并列的先后留给运气。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py23.k1.x1","body":"需求是“按细胞数从多到少排；细胞数一样的，按孔号 well 从小到大”。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行符合需求？","options":[{"id":"both_desc","content":"```python\nresult = wells.sort_values([\"count\", \"well\"], ascending=False)\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = wells.sort_values([\"count\", \"well\"], ascending=[False, True])\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nresult = wells.sort_values([\"well\", \"count\"], ascending=[True, False])\n```\n"},{"id":"both_asc","content":"```python\nresult = wells.sort_values([\"count\", \"well\"])\n```\n"}],"key":"right"},{"id":"second","type":"text","prompt":"按需求排好以后，排第 2 的是哪个孔（well）？","key":"B1"}],"explanation":"**`ascending=[False, True]`** 那一行符合需求。A1 和 B1 的细胞数都是 120，并列时按 well 从小到大，A1 第一、**B1** 第二。\n\n两列都从大到小会把 B1 排到 A1 前面；把 well 写在前面会先按孔号排；都从小到大则细胞数的方向反了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wells","caption":"表 wells：培养板上各孔的细胞计数","index":[3,11,6,9,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"count":[120,95,120,80,110]}}]},{"id":"py23.k1.x2","body":"同事说：“把样本按 signal 从高到低排一下发我。”你看了数据，有几个样本的 signal 一样。他没有说这些样本谁先谁后。下一步最合适的是哪一句？\n","slots":[{"id":"next","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"“好的，直接用默认的排序发给你。”"},{"id":"b","content":"“signal 一样的样本，按什么排？比如按 sample_id，还是保持原表里的先后？”"},{"id":"c","content":"“我把 signal 一样的样本删掉了，免得顺序不确定。”"},{"id":"d","content":"“我按 signal 从低到高排好了。”"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"应当先**追问并列时怎么排**：按哪一列，还是保持原来的先后。默认排序不保证并列的先后，直接发出去，下次再跑可能不同；删掉并列的样本改变了数据；从低到高与要求相反。\n"}]},{"id":"py23.k2","title":"reset_index 与保留原索引的取舍","key":["py16"],"links":["py16.k2"],"card":{"name":"排序后的位置与标签","aliases":["reset_index","iloc","原行索引"],"definition":"排序后行带着原标签换了位置；iloc 按位置取（排第几），loc 按标签取；reset_index(drop=True) 重新编号为 0、1、2……，reset_index() 把原标签存成一列。","conditions":["行索引从 0 开始的表，排序前位置和标签恰好相同，排序后不再相同。","还要回原表追查某一行时保留原标签；交出排名表、不需要原行号时才 drop。"],"example":"表 R 按 signal 从高到低排序后，`ranked.iloc[0]` 是 S_C（排第一），`ranked.loc[0]` 是 S_A（原行索引为 0，排第三）。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 R：刚从文件读进来的表，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[12,5,20,9,16]}}]},"lesson":"排序以后，行带着原来的标签换了位置：**位置**（排第几）和**标签**（原行索引）不再一致。刚从文件读进来的表，行索引通常是 0、1、2……，排序前位置和标签恰好相等，最容易混用。\n\n```python\nranked = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)\n```\n\n| 位置 | 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | 2 | S_C | 20 |\n| 1 | 4 | S_E | 16 |\n| 2 | 0 | S_A | 12 |\n| 3 | 3 | S_D | 9 |\n| 4 | 1 | S_B | 5 |\n\n[loc 和 iloc](repa:concept/py16.k2) 在这里分得很清楚：`ranked.iloc[0]` 按位置取，得到排第一的 S_C；`ranked.loc[0]` 按标签取，得到原行索引为 0 的 S_A，它排在第三。要“排名第一”，用 `iloc`。同样，`ranked.head(3)` 取的是排在最前的 3 行。\n\n想让标签重新和位置一致，用 `reset_index`：\n\n- `ranked.reset_index(drop=True)`：重新编号为 0、1、2……，原来的行索引**丢掉**；\n- `ranked.reset_index()`：同样重新编号，但把原来的行索引**存成一列**，列名是 `index`。\n\n该选哪一种？原行索引是回到原始表找到这一行的线索。之后还要和原表对照、追查某个样本，就保留它：不重新编号，或者用 `reset_index()` 存成一列。要交出一张从 0 开始编号的排名表、不再需要原行号，才用 `reset_index(drop=True)`。需求里要写明是哪一种。\n","example":{"id":"py23.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，写出 a、b、c 三个名字的值。\n\n```python\nranked = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)\na = ranked.iloc[0][\"sample_id\"]\nb = ranked.loc[0, \"sample_id\"]\nc = ranked.reset_index(drop=True).loc[0, \"sample_id\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","prompt":"`a` 是什么？","key":"S_C"},{"id":"b","type":"text","prompt":"`b` 是什么？","key":"S_A"},{"id":"c","type":"text","prompt":"`c` 是什么？","key":"S_C"}],"explanation":"- `a` 是 **S_C**：`iloc[0]` 按位置取排在最前的一行，signal 20。\n- `b` 是 **S_A**：`loc[0]` 按标签取原行索引为 0 的行，它的 signal 是 12，排在第三。\n- `c` 是 **S_C**：`reset_index(drop=True)` 重新编号以后，标签 0 就是排在最前的那一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 R：刚从文件读进来的表，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[12,5,20,9,16]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py23.k2.q1","body":"同事想取出 signal 最高的样本，写了：\n\n```python startLine=1\nranked = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)\ntop = ranked.loc[0]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"got","type":"text","prompt":"`top[\"sample_id\"]` 实际是什么？","key":"S_A"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"iloc","content":"```python\ntop = ranked.iloc[0]\n```\n"},{"id":"label2","content":"```python\ntop = ranked.loc[2]\n```\n","feedback":"这只在这张表上碰巧对：最高的那行原行索引是 2，换一张表就不是了。"},{"id":"df0","content":"```python\ntop = df.loc[0]\n```\n","feedback":"df 没有排序，标签 0 的行是 S_A。"}],"key":"iloc"}],"explanation":"`top[\"sample_id\"]` 是 **S_A**：`loc[0]` 取的是原行索引为 0 的行，排序后它排在第三。\n\n要“排在最前的一行”，按位置取：**`ranked.iloc[0]`**，得到 S_C。写死 `loc[2]` 只在这张表上碰巧对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 R：刚从文件读进来的表，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[12,5,20,9,16]}}]},{"id":"py23.k2.q2","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nranked = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)\na = ranked.reset_index()\nb = ranked.reset_index(drop=True)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a_columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`a` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"index","content":"`index`"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"}],"key":["index","sample_id","signal"]},{"id":"b_columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`b` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"index","content":"`index`"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"}],"key":["sample_id","signal"]},{"id":"a_first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`a.loc[0, \"index\"]` 是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"`a` 有 **index、sample_id、signal** 三列：`reset_index()` 把原来的行索引存成了最前面的 index 列。`b` 只有 **sample_id、signal**：`drop=True` 把原行索引丢掉了。\n\n两者的行都重新编号为 0 到 4。`a.loc[0, \"index\"]` 是 **2**：排第一的 S_C 原来的行索引是 2，靠这一列还能回原表找到它。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 R：刚从文件读进来的表，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[12,5,20,9,16]}}]},{"id":"py23.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 按 signal 从高到低，取前 3 名，只输出 sample_id 和 signal 两列；做成排名表，行索引重新编号为 0、1、2，不保留原行号。不改变 `df`。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。这张表的 signal 没有并列。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"result = df.head(3).sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]\n","solution":"result = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False).head(3)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index(drop=True)\n","accepts":["ranked = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)\nresult = ranked.iloc[0:3][[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index(drop=True)\n","result = df.nlargest(3, \"signal\")[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index(drop=True)"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False).head(3)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]]","why":"没有重新编号，行索引仍是原行号"},{"code":"result = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False).head(3)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index()","why":"原行号存成了 index 列，多了一列"},{"code":"result = df.sort_values(\"signal\").head(3)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index(drop=True)","why":"从低到高排，取到的是最低的 3 个"},{"code":"result = df.head(3).sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index(drop=True)","why":"先取前 3 行再排序，取的是原表的前 3 行"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 R","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_C\", \"S_E\", \"S_A\"], \"signal\": [20, 16, 12]})","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["R2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_B\", \"X_E\", \"X_D\"], \"signal\": [30, 25, 18]})","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False).head(3)[[\"sample_id\", \"signal\"]].reset_index(drop=True)\n```\n\n原来的代码有两处不对：先 `head(3)` 再排序，取的是原表的前 3 行，不是最高的 3 个；结果的行索引还是原行号。先排序再取前 3 行，最后 `reset_index(drop=True)` 重新编号。本例得到 S_C、S_E、S_A，行索引 0、1、2。判分时还会换一张表运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 R：刚从文件读进来的表，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[12,5,20,9,16]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py23.k2.r1","body":"表 plates 按 od 从小到大排好以后，存成 `r`，打印出来是：\n\n```text\n  well    od\n1   A2  0.18\n3   A4  0.27\n2   A3  0.35\n0   A1  0.42\n4   A5  0.51\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"third","type":"text","prompt":"`r.iloc[2][\"well\"]`，也就是按位置数排在第 3 的孔，是哪个？","key":"A3"},{"id":"label3","type":"text","prompt":"`r.loc[3, \"well\"]`，也就是行索引为 3 的孔，是哪个？","key":"A4"},{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"`r.iloc[3]` 和 `r.loc[3]` 取到的是同一行吗？","options":[{"id":"same","content":"是同一行，写的都是 3"},{"id":"different","content":"不是：`iloc[3]` 是排在第 4 的 A1，`loc[3]` 是行索引为 3 的 A4"}],"key":"different"}],"explanation":"打印出来的表，最左边是行索引（原来的标签），从上到下的先后才是排名的位置。\n\n`iloc[2]` 按位置取：位置从 0 数起，位置 2 是排在第 3 的一行，是 **A3**。`loc[3]` 按标签取：行索引为 3 的是排在第 2 的 **A4**。\n\n同样写 3，`iloc[3]` 取位置 3（第 4 行，A1，它的行索引是 0），`loc[3]` 取标签 3（A4），两者不是同一行。排序以后，位置和标签不再一致。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plates","caption":"表 plates：五个孔的吸光度，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5"],"od":[0.42,0.18,0.35,0.27,0.51]},"dtypes":{"od":"float"}}]},{"id":"py23.k2.r2","body":"宿主已经运行了 `r = plates.sort_values(\"od\")`。排序结果要交给同事，他会拿着原行索引回到原始表核对每个孔。下面哪些做法交出的 `out` 能让他找回原行索引？选出所有能的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"`out = r`"},{"id":"column","content":"`out = r.reset_index()`"},{"id":"drop","content":"`out = r.reset_index(drop=True)`"},{"id":"drop_well","content":"`out = r[[\"well\"]].reset_index(drop=True)`"}],"key":["keep","column"]}],"explanation":"**直接交出 r** 和 **`reset_index()`** 都能：前者原行索引还是行标签，后者把它存成了 index 列。用了 `drop=True` 的两种做法都把原行索引丢掉了，同事只能看到 0、1、2……\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plates","caption":"表 plates：五个孔的吸光度，行索引从 0 开始","index":[0,1,2,3,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"well":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5"],"od":[0.42,0.18,0.35,0.27,0.51]},"dtypes":{"od":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py23.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码，写出几个值。\n\n```python\nranked = df.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)\ntop = ranked.reset_index(drop=True)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"iloc1","cells":{"what":"ranked.iloc[1][\"sample_id\"]","value":"X_E"}},{"id":"loc1","cells":{"what":"ranked.loc[1, \"sample_id\"]","value":"X_B"}},{"id":"top1","cells":{"what":"top.loc[1, \"sample_id\"]","value":"X_E"}}]},{"id":"label","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`ranked.index[0]` 是多少？","key":1}],"explanation":"signal 从高到低是 30（X_B）、25（X_E）、18（X_D）……\n\n- `ranked.iloc[1][\"sample_id\"]` 是 **X_E**：排第二的那行。\n- `ranked.loc[1, \"sample_id\"]` 是 **X_B**：原行索引为 1 的那行，它排第一。\n- `top.loc[1, \"sample_id\"]` 是 **X_E**：重新编号后，标签 1 就是排第二的那行。\n\n`ranked.index[0]` 是 **1**：排第一的 X_B 原来的行索引是 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一张从文件读进来的表","index":[0,1,2,3,4,5],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["X_A","X_B","X_C","X_D","X_E","X_F"],"signal":[7,30,2,18,25,11]}}]},{"id":"py23.k2.x2","body":"两份排序结果要交出去：\n\n- 甲：按 signal 从高到低排好的表，同事要拿着每一行的原行索引回原始数据里核对仪器记录；\n- 乙：一张前 10 名的排名表，放进报告，读者不需要知道原始数据里的行号，只看 0 到 9 的名次编号。\n\n两份结果的行索引各应怎样处理？\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"choice","prompt":"甲","options":[{"id":"drop","content":"用 reset_index(drop=True) 重新编号"},{"id":"keep","content":"保留原行索引（或用 reset_index() 存成一列）"}],"key":"keep"},{"id":"second","type":"choice","prompt":"乙","options":[{"id":"drop","content":"用 reset_index(drop=True) 重新编号"},{"id":"keep","content":"保留原行索引（或用 reset_index() 存成一列）"}],"key":"drop"}],"explanation":"甲要**保留原行索引**：同事要靠它回原始数据核对，丢了就找不回去。乙用 **reset_index(drop=True)** 重新编号：报告只要 0 到 9 的名次编号，原行号对读者没用。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py24","title":"清理整列文字但保留编号含义","summary":"用 .str.strip()、.str.lower() 逐格清理一整列文字；清理后为空的格按需求处理成缺失；编号列只做约定好的清理，不转成数、不改大小写。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py05","py19","py15"],"intro":"手工录入的文字列常有多余的空格、大小写不统一的写法：\" Low\"、\"HIGH \"、\"low\" 其实是同两个组，比较和计数时却会被当成不同的组。这一节学怎样一次清理整列，同时不把空白和编号处理坏。\n\n宿主已经导入了 pandas（`pd`）和 NumPy（`np`），并准备好数据表；每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。题面里的文字格都加了引号，好看清首尾的空格；`\"\"` 是空串，`NaN` 是缺失。有的题用 `pd.Series([…])` 直接造出一列值，方括号里是各格的内容。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提清理要求时，按列说清楚：哪些列去首尾空白、统一大小写；清理后为空的格算不算缺失、要不要报告个数；编号列只去首尾空白，不转成数、不改大小写。\n\n拿到代码后，看每一步有没有 `.str`、顺序是不是先 strip 再处理空串；对编号列，清理前后各数一次 `nunique()`，个数变了就要问为什么。\n","kps":[{"id":"py24.k1","title":"str.strip/str.lower 的逐元素作用","key":["py05"],"links":["py05.k2","py05.k3"],"card":{"name":".str 逐格清理","aliases":["str.strip","str.lower","清理文字列"],"definition":"列.str.strip()、列.str.lower() 把字符串方法逐格用到一整列上，得到一列新的结果；缺失的格仍是缺失。","conditions":["少了 .str 会报 AttributeError；链式写法的每一步都要带 .str。","strip 只去掉首尾的空白，中间的空格不动。","结果是新的一列，要保留就赋回：df[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.strip()。"],"example":"```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n表 G 的 \" Low\"、\"HIGH \" 变成 \"low\"、\"high\"；两个空格的格变成空串 \"\"，缺失的格仍是 NaN。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},"lesson":"学过对一段文字用 [strip、lower](repa:concept/py05.k2)：`\" Low\".strip()` 得到 `\"Low\"`。表里的一列有很多格，要逐格做同样的事，就在列后面加 `.str`：\n\n```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n\n[调用链从左往右](repa:concept/py05.k3)：先 `.str.strip()` 去掉每格首尾的空白，再 `.str.lower()` 变成小写。每一步都要带 `.str`。\n\n| 原行索引 | group | `.str.strip()` | 再 `.str.lower()` |\n|---:|---|---|---|\n| 31 | `\" Low\"` | `\"Low\"` | `\"low\"` |\n| 7 | `\"HIGH \"` | `\"HIGH\"` | `\"high\"` |\n| 22 | `\"control\"` | `\"control\"` | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | `\"low\"` | `\"low\"` | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | `\"  \"` | `\"\"` | `\"\"` |\n| 9 | NaN | NaN | NaN |\n\n缺失的格不会报错，仍是 NaN。只有两个空格的那一格成了空串 `\"\"`，下一个知识点专门讲它。\n\n为什么要清理？`df[\"group\"] == \"low\"` 只找到索引 4 一行：`\" Low\"` 多了一个空格、大小写也不同，在比较、计数、分组时都会被当成另一个组。清理以后，低剂量组有两行。\n\n常见的错误：\n\n- 少了 `.str`：`df[\"group\"].strip()` 报 `AttributeError`，因为一整列本身没有 strip，要经过 `.str` 才能逐格用字符串方法。`df[\"group\"].str.strip().lower()` 第二步少了 `.str`，也一样报错。\n- 用 `.str.replace(\" \", \"\")` 去空格：它会把中间的空格也删掉，`\"high dose \"` 变成 `\"highdose\"`。strip 只去首尾。\n\n`clean` 是一列新的值，df 没有变。要换掉原来的列，就把结果赋回去：\n\n```python\ndf[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n\n等号左边写列名，意思是把这一列换成右边算出的新列。\n","example":{"id":"py24.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `clean` 的值。空串填 `\"\"`，缺失填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"clean","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"raw","header":"group"},{"id":"clean","header":"clean","input":{"type":"text","quick":["NaN","\"\""]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","raw":"\" Low\"","clean":"low"}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","raw":"\"HIGH \"","clean":"high"}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","raw":"\"control\"","clean":"control"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","raw":"\"low\"","clean":"low"}},{"id":"r18","cells":{"index":"18","raw":"\"  \"","clean":"\"\""}},{"id":"r9","cells":{"index":"9","raw":"NaN","clean":"NaN"}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **low、high、control、low、\"\"、NaN**。每一格先去首尾空白、再变小写。两个空格去掉以后什么也不剩，成了空串；缺失的格仍是缺失，不报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py24.k1.q1","body":"需求是把 group 去掉首尾空白并统一成小写。同事写了下面这行。\n\n```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].strip().lower()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这一行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"ok","content":"得到清理好的一列"},{"id":"attr","content":"报 AttributeError：一整列没有 strip 方法"},{"id":"first","content":"只清理了第一格"}],"key":"attr"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n"},{"id":"half","content":"```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().lower()\n```\n","feedback":"第二步也要带 .str，否则同样报 AttributeError。"},{"id":"replace","content":"```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.replace(\" \", \"\").str.lower()\n```\n","feedback":"这会把中间的空格也删掉，例如 \"high dose\" 变成 \"highdose\"。"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"这一行报 **AttributeError**：`df[\"group\"]` 是一整列，它本身没有 strip 方法。要逐格用字符串方法，每一步都写 `.str`：**`df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()`**。\n\n第二步漏了 `.str` 同样报错；用 `.str.replace(\" \", \"\")` 会把中间的空格也删掉，不只是首尾。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k1.q2","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nprint((df[\"group\"] == \"low\").sum())\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\nprint((clean == \"low\").sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"before","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":1},{"id":"after","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":2}],"explanation":"第一行 **1**：清理之前，只有索引 4 的格恰好是 \"low\"，\" Low\" 多了空格、首字母大写，不相等。第二行 **2**：清理之后，\" Low\" 也成了 \"low\"。\n\n不清理就去筛选或计数，同一个组会被拆成几份。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 直接把 df 的 group 列换成清理后的值：去掉每格首尾的空白，统一成小写。中间的空格保留，缺失的格保持缺失，其他列不变。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"df[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.lower()\n","solution":"df[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n","accepts":["df[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.lower().str.strip()"],"rejects":[{"code":"df[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.strip()","why":"没有统一成小写"},{"code":"df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()","why":"算出了结果却没有赋回，df 没变"},{"code":"df[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.replace(\" \", \"\").str.lower()","why":"把中间的空格也删掉了"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 G","expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\"low\", \"high\", \"control\", \"low\", \"\", None]}, index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9])"}},{"name":"换一张有中间空格的表","hidden":true,"data":["G2"],"expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_A\", \"X_B\", \"X_C\", \"X_D\", \"X_E\"], \"group\": [\"high dose\", \"control\", \"\", None, \"low\"]}, index=[90, 2, 60, 11, 45])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndf[\"group\"] = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n\n原来的代码只统一了大小写，\" Low\" 变成 \" low\"，前面的空格还在。加上 `.str.strip()`，再把结果赋回 group 列。这里先 strip 再 lower、先 lower 再 strip 结果相同。判分时还会换一张有中间空格的表运行，检查整张 df。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py24.k1.r1","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `site` 的值。缺失填 `NaN`。\n\n```python\nsite = plots[\"site\"].str.strip()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"site","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"raw","header":"site（原值）"},{"id":"clean","header":"site","input":{"type":"text","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","raw":"\"  北坡\"","clean":"北坡"}},{"id":"r12","cells":{"index":"12","raw":"\"南坡  \"","clean":"南坡"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","raw":"\"东 坡\"","clean":"东 坡"}},{"id":"r8","cells":{"index":"8","raw":"NaN","clean":"NaN"}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **北坡、南坡、东 坡、NaN**。strip 只去掉首尾的空白；“东 坡”中间的空格不在首尾，保留。缺失的格仍是缺失。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nplots = pd.DataFrame({\"plot\": [\"P1\", \"P2\", \"P3\", \"P4\"], \"site\": [\"  北坡\", \"南坡  \", \"东 坡\", None]}, index=[5, 12, 3, 8])\n","display":"表 plots：四个样地的坡向，site 每格加了引号。\n\n| 原行索引 | plot | site |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 5 | P1 | `\"  北坡\"` |\n| 12 | P2 | `\"南坡  \"` |\n| 3 | P3 | `\"东 坡\"` |\n| 8 | P4 | NaN |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k1.r2","body":"宿主先运行了 `s = df[\"group\"]`。下面每一行单独接在它后面运行。哪几行不报错，并且把每格清理成去掉首尾空白的小写文字？选出所有符合的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"strip_lower","content":"`clean = s.str.strip().str.lower()`"},{"id":"lower_strip","content":"`clean = s.str.lower().str.strip()`"},{"id":"no_str","content":"`clean = s.strip().lower()`"},{"id":"half","content":"`clean = s.str.strip().lower()`"}],"key":["strip_lower","lower_strip"]}],"explanation":"**`s.str.strip().str.lower()`** 和 **`s.str.lower().str.strip()`** 都符合：两步都带 `.str`，这两步谁先谁后结果一样。另外两行报 AttributeError：一整列没有 strip、lower 方法，要经过 `.str`。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py24.k1.x1","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `mask` 的值。\n\n```python\nmask = lab[\"unit\"].str.strip().str.lower() == \"mg\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"unit","header":"unit"},{"id":"mask","header":"mask","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"index":"1","unit":"\" mg\"","mask":true}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"index":"2","unit":"\"MG\"","mask":true}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","unit":"\"mg \"","mask":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","unit":"\"g\"","mask":false}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","unit":"\"Mg\"","mask":true}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **True、True、True、False、True**。四种写法的毫克清理后都是 \"mg\"，只有 R4 的单位是克。不清理直接比较，五格里没有一格恰好等于 \"mg\"，mask 会全是 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nlab = pd.DataFrame({\"reagent\": [\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"R4\", \"R5\"], \"unit\": [\" mg\", \"MG\", \"mg \", \"g\", \"Mg\"]}, index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5])\n","display":"表 lab：五种试剂用量的单位，unit 每格加了引号。\n\n| 原行索引 | reagent | unit |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | R1 | `\" mg\"` |\n| 2 | R2 | `\"MG\"` |\n| 3 | R3 | `\"mg \"` |\n| 4 | R4 | `\"g\"` |\n| 5 | R5 | `\"Mg\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k1.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 在 lab 里新增一列 `unit_clean`：unit 去掉首尾空白并统一成小写。原来的 unit 列保留原样，缺失的格保持缺失。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"lab[\"unit_clean\"] = lab[\"unit\"].str.strip()\n","solution":"lab[\"unit_clean\"] = lab[\"unit\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n","accepts":["lab[\"unit_clean\"] = lab[\"unit\"].str.lower().str.strip()"],"rejects":[{"code":"lab[\"unit\"] = lab[\"unit\"].str.strip().str.lower()","why":"改掉了原来的 unit 列，也没有新增 unit_clean"},{"code":"lab[\"unit_clean\"] = lab[\"unit\"].str.lower()","why":"没有去掉首尾空白"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 lab","expect":{"lab[\"unit_clean\"]":"pd.Series([\"mg\", \"mg\", \"mg\", \"g\", \"mg\"], index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5], name=\"unit_clean\")","lab[\"unit\"]":"lab[\"unit\"]"}},{"name":"换一张有缺失的表","hidden":true,"data":["lab2"],"expect":{"lab[\"unit_clean\"]":"pd.Series([\"g\", \"mg\", \"mg\", None], index=[7, 3, 9, 2], name=\"unit_clean\")","lab[\"unit\"]":"lab[\"unit\"]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nlab[\"unit_clean\"] = lab[\"unit\"].str.strip().str.lower()\n```\n\n原来的代码只去了空白，\"MG\"、\"Mg\" 还是大写。再接一步 `.str.lower()`，结果存进新列 unit_clean，unit 原列不动。判分时还会换一张有缺失的表运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nlab = pd.DataFrame({\"reagent\": [\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"R4\", \"R5\"], \"unit\": [\" mg\", \"MG\", \"mg \", \"g\", \"Mg\"]}, index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5])\n","display":"表 lab：五种试剂用量的单位，unit 每格加了引号。\n\n| 原行索引 | reagent | unit |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | R1 | `\" mg\"` |\n| 2 | R2 | `\"MG\"` |\n| 3 | R3 | `\"mg \"` |\n| 4 | R4 | `\"g\"` |\n| 5 | R5 | `\"Mg\"` |\n"}]}]},{"id":"py24.k2","title":"空串与缺失分别处理","key":["py19","py05"],"links":["py19.k2","py19.k3"],"card":{"name":"空串转缺失","aliases":["空串","空白格","replace"],"definition":"strip 以后只剩空白的格成了空串 \"\"，它不是缺失；需求把它当作缺失时，用 列.replace(\"\", np.nan) 把整格等于空串的换成 NaN。","conditions":["先 strip 再 replace：只有空格的格要先变成 \"\"，才会被换掉。","列.replace 换整格，.str.replace 改一格里的部分文字，两者不同。","空白算不算缺失、“N/A”这类文字怎么办，按业务规则写进需求。"],"example":"表 G 的 group strip 以后有 1 个缺失、1 个空串；`replace(\"\", np.nan)` 以后缺失变成 2 个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},"lesson":"清理 group 以后，原来只有两个空格的那一格成了空串 `\"\"`。[空串不是缺失](repa:concept/py19.k2)：`isna()` 判它为 False，要用 `(clean == \"\").sum()` 才数得到。\n\n这一格多半是录入时漏填了。按需求要把它当作缺失时，把整格等于空串的换成 NaN：\n\n```python\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip().str.lower()\nclean = clean.replace(\"\", np.nan)\n```\n\n`列.replace(旧值, 新值)` 换的是**整格**等于旧值的格；学过的 `.str.replace` 改的是一格里的**一部分**文字。这里要的是前一种。\n\n顺序要对：**先 strip，再 replace**。写反成 `df[\"group\"].replace(\"\", np.nan).str.strip()`，replace 的时候那一格还是两个空格，不等于 `\"\"`，没有被换掉；strip 之后它又成了空串。\n\n换不换、换成什么，是[业务规则](repa:concept/py19.k3)：录入漏填的当作缺失；有的表里空白就表示“没有”，那就不该换。手打的“N/A”“无”是文字，replace(\"\", ...) 不会动它们，要不要处理也得另行约定。写需求时说清：清理后为空的格怎样处理，要不要报告个数。\n","example":{"id":"py24.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，写出 a、b、c 的值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nclean = df[\"group\"].str.strip()\na = clean.isna().sum()\nb = (clean == \"\").sum()\nclean = clean.replace(\"\", np.nan)\nc = clean.isna().sum()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`a` 是多少？","key":1},{"id":"b","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`b` 是多少？","key":1},{"id":"c","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`c` 是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"`a` 是 **1**：strip 以后只有索引 9 原本就缺失。`b` 是 **1**：索引 18 的两个空格成了空串，它不是缺失，`isna()` 不算它。`c` 是 **2**：第 4 行把整格等于空串的换成 NaN，缺失变成了 2 个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py24.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\nwrong = df[\"group\"].replace(\"\", np.nan).str.strip()\nright = df[\"group\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", np.nan)\nprint(wrong.isna().sum())\nprint(right.isna().sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"wrong","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行输出","key":1},{"id":"right","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行输出","key":2},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么两行不一样？","options":[{"id":"order","content":"wrong 先 replace 时那一格还是两个空格，不等于 \"\"，没被换掉"},{"id":"replace","content":"replace 只能用在 strip 之后，否则不起作用"},{"id":"random","content":"两次运行的结果本来就可能不同"}],"key":"order"}],"explanation":"第一行 **1**，第二行 **2**。`wrong` 先 replace：那时索引 18 的格是两个空格，不等于 `\"\"`，没被换掉；strip 之后它成了空串，仍不是缺失。`right` 先 strip，那一格先变成 `\"\"`，再被换成 NaN。\n\nreplace 本身在哪里都能用，只是它换的是“此刻整格等于空串”的格，所以要排在 strip 后面。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\", \"S_F\"], \"group\": [\" Low\", \"HIGH \", \"control\", \"low\", \"  \", None]},\n    index=[31, 7, 22, 4, 18, 9],\n)\n","display":"表 G（变量名 `df`）：六个样本的实验组，手工录入。group 每格加了引号；索引 18 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | group |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | S_A | `\" Low\"` |\n| 7 | S_B | `\"HIGH \"` |\n| 22 | S_C | `\"control\"` |\n| 4 | S_D | `\"low\"` |\n| 18 | S_E | `\"  \"` |\n| 9 | S_F | NaN |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k2.q2","body":"清理 group 列之前，负责人说：\n\n> 空白的 group 是录入时漏填的，算作缺失，不参加分组比较；结果里写明有几个。有人写的“N/A”是特意注明“不适用”，保留原样。\n\n把这条规则填成下面三个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"blank","type":"choice","prompt":"清理后为空的格","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"保留空串"},{"id":"missing","content":"换成缺失"},{"id":"unknown","content":"填成 \"unknown\""}],"key":"missing"},{"id":"na_text","type":"choice","prompt":"写着“N/A”的格","options":[{"id":"missing","content":"换成缺失"},{"id":"keep","content":"保留原样"}],"key":"keep"},{"id":"report","type":"choice","prompt":"要不要报告个数","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"要，写明有几个漏填"},{"id":"no","content":"不用"}],"key":"yes"}],"explanation":"清理后为空的格**换成缺失**；“N/A”**保留原样**；**要**报告个数。代码上是先 `.str.strip()`，再 `.replace(\"\", np.nan)`，最后数 `isna().sum()`；“N/A”不是空串，replace 不会动它。\n"},{"id":"py24.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 直接把 df 的 note 列换成清理后的值：去掉每格首尾的空白；清理后为空的格换成缺失；其他列不变。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，结果里仍有空串。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"df[\"note\"] = df[\"note\"].replace(\"\", np.nan).str.strip()\n","solution":"df[\"note\"] = df[\"note\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", np.nan)\n","accepts":["clean = df[\"note\"].str.strip()\ndf[\"note\"] = clean.replace(\"\", None)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"df[\"note\"] = df[\"note\"].str.strip()","why":"空串没有换成缺失"},{"code":"df[\"note\"] = df[\"note\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", \"NA\")","why":"换成了两个字母 NA，那是文字，不是缺失"},{"code":"df = df.dropna(subset=[\"note\"])","why":"删掉了行，也没有清理空白"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 N","expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\"], \"note\": [\"复测\", None, None, None, \"污染\"]}, index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5])"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["N2"],"expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"X_A\", \"X_B\", \"X_C\", \"X_D\"], \"note\": [\"ok\", None, \"重做\", None]}, index=[8, 6, 4, 2])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndf[\"note\"] = df[\"note\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", np.nan)\n```\n\n原来的代码先 replace 再 strip：索引 3 的两个空格在 replace 时还不是空串，strip 以后才变成空串，就漏掉了。把两步对调。本例 note 依次为 复测、NaN、NaN、NaN、污染。判分时还会换一张表运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\"], \"note\": [\" 复测 \", \"\", \"  \", None, \"污染\"]}, index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5])\n","display":"表 N（变量名 `df`）：五个样本的备注，note 每格加了引号；索引 3 那一格是两个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | note |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | S_A | `\" 复测 \"` |\n| 2 | S_B | `\"\"` |\n| 3 | S_C | `\"  \"` |\n| 4 | S_D | NaN |\n| 5 | S_E | `\"污染\"` |\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py24.k2.r1","body":"阅读代码，回答下面的问题。\n\n```python\nc = visits[\"reason\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", np.nan)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`c.isna().sum()` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"na_text","type":"choice","prompt":"索引 15 那一格（原来是 \"N/A\"）在 c 里是什么？","options":[{"id":"missing","content":"缺失 NaN"},{"id":"text","content":"仍是文字 \"N/A\""},{"id":"empty","content":"空串 \"\""}],"key":"text"}],"explanation":"缺失有 **3** 个：索引 11 的空串、索引 14 的一个空格（strip 后成了空串）都被换成 NaN，再加上原本就缺失的索引 12。\n\n索引 15 **仍是文字 \"N/A\"**：它不是空串，replace(\"\", ...) 不会动它。要不要把它也当作缺失，得另行约定。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nvisits = pd.DataFrame(\n    {\"patient\": [\"P1\", \"P2\", \"P3\", \"P4\", \"P5\"], \"reason\": [\"\", None, \"复查\", \" \", \"N/A\"]},\n    index=[11, 12, 13, 14, 15],\n)\n","display":"表 visits：五次就诊记录，reason 每格加了引号；索引 14 那一格是一个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | patient | reason |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 11 | P1 | `\"\"` |\n| 12 | P2 | NaN |\n| 13 | P3 | `\"复查\"` |\n| 14 | P4 | `\" \"` |\n| 15 | P5 | `\"N/A\"` |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k2.r2","body":"负责人确认的规则是：“备注去掉首尾的空白；清理后为空的当作缺失；手写的‘无’保留原样。”下面哪一种做法与它完全一致？\n","slots":[{"id":"plan","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"先去掉每格首尾的空白，再把整格为空的换成缺失；“无”不动"},{"id":"b","content":"先把整格为空的换成缺失，再去掉每格首尾的空白；“无”不动"},{"id":"c","content":"先去掉每格首尾的空白，再把整格为空的和写着“无”的都换成缺失"},{"id":"d","content":"先删掉每格里所有的空格（包括中间的），再把整格为空的换成缺失；“无”不动"}],"key":"a"}],"explanation":"“先去掉首尾空白，再把整格为空的换成缺失，‘无’不动”这一种与规则一致。\n\n先换缺失再去空白，只有空格的格会漏掉，清理后仍是空串；把“无”也换成缺失违背了“保留原样”；删掉所有空格会改动中间的空格，规则只说首尾。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py24.k2.x1","body":"需求是“备注清理后为空的格当作缺失”。AI 交来的代码是：\n\n```python\ndf[\"note\"] = df[\"note\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", \"NA\")\n```\n\n这行代码的问题是什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"problem","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"a","content":"strip 和 replace 的顺序反了"},{"id":"b","content":"换进去的 \"NA\" 是两个字母，不是缺失；isna() 数不到它"},{"id":"c","content":"replace 只能换数字，不能换文字"},{"id":"d","content":"没有问题，\"NA\" 就是缺失"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"问题在于**换进去的 \"NA\" 是两个字母**：它是一段文字，`isna()` 判为 False，后面按缺失处理的步骤都数不到它。应换成真正的缺失：`.replace(\"\", np.nan)`。\n\n这行先 strip 再 replace，顺序是对的；replace 也可以换文字。\n"},{"id":"py24.k2.x2","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nc = comments[\"comment\"].str.strip().replace(\"\", np.nan)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`c` 里哪些行是缺失？按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"1","content":"1"},{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"5","content":"5"}],"key":["1","3","4"]},{"id":"last","type":"text","prompt":"索引 5 那一格在 c 里是什么文字？","key":"待查"}],"explanation":"索引 **1、3、4** 是缺失：1 是一个空格，strip 后成了空串，被换掉；3 原本就缺失；4 原本就是空串。索引 5 的 \" 待查\" 去掉首尾空白后是 **待查**，不是空串，保留。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ncomments = pd.DataFrame({\"run\": [\"R1\", \"R2\", \"R3\", \"R4\", \"R5\"], \"comment\": [\" \", \"ok\", None, \"\", \" 待查\"]}, index=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5])\n","display":"表 comments：五次实验的评语，comment 每格加了引号；索引 1 那一格是一个空格。\n\n| 原行索引 | run | comment |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | R1 | `\" \"` |\n| 2 | R2 | `\"ok\"` |\n| 3 | R3 | NaN |\n| 4 | R4 | `\"\"` |\n| 5 | R5 | `\" 待查\"` |\n"}]}]},{"id":"py24.k3","title":"编号列不要任意转数值或改写","key":["py15","py03"],"links":["py15.k2"],"card":{"name":"编号保持原样","aliases":["编号","sample_id","前导零","nunique"],"definition":"编号是名字，不是数量；清理时只做需求约定的改动（通常只去首尾空白），不转成数、不改大小写、不补零也不去零。","conditions":["转成数会去掉前导零：\"007\" 和 \"7\" 成了同一个 7，带字母的编号成了缺失或报错。","改大小写可能把本来不同的编号并成一个；清理前后各数一次 nunique()。","从文件读入时用 dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}，编号就保持文字。"],"example":"表 ids 有 5 个不同的编号；`pd.to_numeric` 以后成了 7、12、70、7、NaN，只剩 3 个不同的值。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nids = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"007\", \"012\", \"070\", \"7\", \"S-12\"], \"signal\": [5, 8, 3, 6, 9]}, index=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4])\n","display":"表 ids：五个样本，sample_id 是文字，每格加了引号。“007”和“7”是两个不同的样本。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | `\"007\"` | 5 |\n| 1 | `\"012\"` | 8 |\n| 2 | `\"070\"` | 3 |\n| 3 | `\"7\"` | 6 |\n| 4 | `\"S-12\"` | 9 |\n"}]},"lesson":"sample_id 这样的编号看起来像数，其实是**名字**：没有人拿它加减，“007”和“7”可能是两个不同的样本。清理文字列时，编号列要格外小心。\n\n```python\nn = pd.to_numeric(ids[\"sample_id\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | n |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | `\"007\"` | 7.0 |\n| 1 | `\"012\"` | 12.0 |\n| 2 | `\"070\"` | 70.0 |\n| 3 | `\"7\"` | 7.0 |\n| 4 | `\"S-12\"` | NaN |\n\n前导零没了，“007”和“7”成了同一个数，“S-12”成了缺失。`astype(int)` 遇到“S-12”会报错；编号全是数字时它不报错，但同样丢掉前导零。\n\n改大小写也会出事：`.str.lower()` 把“M-01”和“m-01”变成同一个编号。如果它们本来是两只不同的小鼠，就被悄悄并成了一只。\n\n检查的办法是清理前后各数一次**不同编号的个数**。`列.nunique()` 给出一列里有多少个不同的值（不算缺失）：表 ids 原来 5 个，转成数以后只剩 3 个，说明有编号被并掉或丢了。\n\n所以对编号列：\n\n- 只做需求约定的清理，通常是去掉首尾空白 `.str.strip()`；\n- 不转成数、不改大小写、不补零也不去零，除非需求方明确说可以，例如确认“p01 和 P01 是同一个样地”；\n- 从文件读入时，用 [dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}](repa:concept/py15.k2) 让编号保持文字，前导零就不会丢。\n","example":{"id":"py24.k3.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `n` 的值（缺失填 `NaN`），再写出两个 nunique 的结果。\n\n```python\nn = pd.to_numeric(ids[\"sample_id\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nbefore = ids[\"sample_id\"].nunique()\nafter = n.nunique()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"n","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"raw","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"index":"0","raw":"\"007\"","n":7}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"index":"1","raw":"\"012\"","n":12}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"index":"2","raw":"\"070\"","n":70}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","raw":"\"7\"","n":7}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","raw":"\"S-12\"","n":"NaN"}}]},{"id":"before","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`before` 是多少？","key":5},{"id":"after","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`after` 是多少？","key":3}],"explanation":"`n` 依次为 **7.0、12.0、70.0、7.0、NaN**。`before` 是 **5**，`after` 是 **3**：“007”和“7”成了同一个 7，“S-12”成了缺失（nunique 不算缺失）。五个不同的样本，转成数以后只认得出三个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nids = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"007\", \"012\", \"070\", \"7\", \"S-12\"], \"signal\": [5, 8, 3, 6, 9]}, index=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4])\n","display":"表 ids：五个样本，sample_id 是文字，每格加了引号。“007”和“7”是两个不同的样本。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | `\"007\"` | 5 |\n| 1 | `\"012\"` | 8 |\n| 2 | `\"070\"` | 3 |\n| 3 | `\"7\"` | 6 |\n| 4 | `\"S-12\"` | 9 |\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py24.k3.q1","body":"同事为了“统一编号格式”，写了下面这行。四个编号都是数字，运行没有报错。\n\n```python\ndf[\"sample_id\"] = df[\"sample_id\"].astype(int)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后，索引 0 的 sample_id 是多少？","key":7},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行后，`df[\"sample_id\"].nunique()` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"better","type":"choice","prompt":"对这一列，合适的做法是哪一种？","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"保持文字，最多去掉首尾空白"},{"id":"float","content":"改用 astype(float)，就不会丢东西"},{"id":"zfill","content":"先转成数，再统一补成三位"}],"key":"keep"}],"explanation":"索引 0 成了 **7**，不同编号只剩 **3** 个：“007”和“7”并成了一个。\n\n编号应当**保持文字**，最多去掉首尾空白。改成浮点照样丢前导零；转成数再补成三位，会把本来是“7”的样本改成“007”，和真正的“007”撞在一起。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"007\", \"012\", \"070\", \"7\"], \"signal\": [5, 8, 3, 6]}, index=[0, 1, 2, 3])\n","display":"表 codes（变量名 `df`）：四个样本，sample_id 是文字，每格加了引号，四个编号各不相同。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | `\"007\"` | 5 |\n| 1 | `\"012\"` | 8 |\n| 2 | `\"070\"` | 3 |\n| 3 | `\"7\"` | 6 |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k3.q2","body":"阅读代码，写出 a、b、c 的值。\n\n```python\na = mice[\"mouse_id\"].nunique()\nb = mice[\"mouse_id\"].str.strip().nunique()\nc = mice[\"mouse_id\"].str.strip().str.lower().nunique()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`a` 是多少？","key":4},{"id":"b","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`b` 是多少？","key":4},{"id":"c","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`c` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"step","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一步把两只不同的小鼠并成了一个编号？","options":[{"id":"strip","content":".str.strip()"},{"id":"lower","content":".str.lower()"},{"id":"none","content":"哪一步都没有"}],"key":"lower"}],"explanation":"`a`、`b` 都是 **4**，`c` 是 **3**。strip 只去掉了“M-03 ”末尾的空格，不同编号还是 4 个；`.str.lower()` 把“M-01”和“m-01”都变成“m-01”，两只不同的小鼠并成了一个编号。\n\n每清理一步就数一次 nunique，数目变了的那一步就是要追问的地方。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nmice = pd.DataFrame({\"mouse_id\": [\"M-01\", \"m-01\", \"M-02\", \"M-03 \"], \"weight\": [21, 19, 23, 20]}, index=[0, 1, 2, 3])\n","display":"表 mice：四只小鼠，mouse_id 每格加了引号。实验记录显示 M-01 和 m-01 是两只不同的小鼠。\n\n| 原行索引 | mouse_id | weight |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | `\"M-01\"` | 21 |\n| 1 | `\"m-01\"` | 19 |\n| 2 | `\"M-02\"` | 23 |\n| 3 | `\"M-03 \"` | 20 |\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py24.k3.r1","body":"宿主先运行了 `s = pd.Series([\"007\", \"7\"])`，这是两个不同样本的编号。下面每一行单独接在它后面运行。哪几行会让两个编号变得一样？选出所有会的；报错的不算。\n","slots":[{"id":"merged","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"strip","content":"`t = s.str.strip()`"},{"id":"numeric","content":"`t = pd.to_numeric(s)`"},{"id":"integer","content":"`t = s.astype(int)`"},{"id":"lower","content":"`t = s.str.lower()`"}],"key":["numeric","integer"]}],"explanation":"**`pd.to_numeric`** 和 **`astype(int)`** 会让两个编号都成为 7，前导零丢了。strip 和 lower 对这两个编号不起作用，它们仍然不同。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nids = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"007\", \"012\", \"070\", \"7\", \"S-12\"], \"signal\": [5, 8, 3, 6, 9]}, index=[0, 1, 2, 3, 4])\n","display":"表 ids：五个样本，sample_id 是文字，每格加了引号。“007”和“7”是两个不同的样本。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 0 | `\"007\"` | 5 |\n| 1 | `\"012\"` | 8 |\n| 2 | `\"070\"` | 3 |\n| 3 | `\"7\"` | 6 |\n| 4 | `\"S-12\"` | 9 |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k3.r2","body":"阅读代码，写出两行输出。\n\n```python\na = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\")\nb = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nprint(a.loc[0, \"sample_id\"])\nprint(b.loc[0, \"sample_id\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行输出","key":"7"},{"id":"second","type":"text","prompt":"第二行输出","key":"007"}],"explanation":"第一行 **7**：不指定类型时，read_csv 看到一列全是数字，就读成了整数，前导零在读入时就丢了。第二行 **007**：`dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}` 让这一列按文字读入，编号保持原样。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as file:\n    file.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n007,5\\n012,8\\n120,3\\n\")\n","display":"宿主准备好了文件 samples.csv，内容是：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n007,5\n012,8\n120,3\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py24.k3.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 直接修改 df 的 sample_id：只去掉每格首尾的空白，其余保持原样（不转成数、不改大小写）。其他列不变。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"df[\"sample_id\"] = df[\"sample_id\"].str.strip().str.upper()\n","solution":"df[\"sample_id\"] = df[\"sample_id\"].str.strip()\n","rejects":[{"code":"df[\"sample_id\"] = df[\"sample_id\"].str.strip().str.lower()","why":"改了大小写，S-01 和 s-01 并成了一个"},{"code":"df[\"sample_id\"] = pd.to_numeric(df[\"sample_id\"], errors=\"coerce\")","why":"转成了数，前导零丢了，带字母的编号成了缺失"},{"code":"df[\"sample_id\"] = df[\"sample_id\"].str.lstrip(\"0\").str.strip()","why":"去掉了前导零"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 ids2","expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"007\", \"S-01\", \"s-01\", \"012\"], \"signal\": [4, 7, 2, 9]}, index=[10, 20, 30, 40])"}},{"name":"换一张编号表","hidden":true,"data":["ids3"],"expect":{"df":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"0042\", \"0042\", \"B-7\"], \"signal\": [1, 2, 3]}, index=[5, 6, 7])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndf[\"sample_id\"] = df[\"sample_id\"].str.strip()\n```\n\n原来的代码多做了一步 `.str.upper()`，把“S-01”和“s-01”变成同一个编号。需求只允许去首尾空白，就只写 strip。本例结果是 007、S-01、s-01、012，四个编号仍然各不相同。判分时还会换一张编号表运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\ndf = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\" 007\", \"S-01 \", \"s-01\", \"012\"], \"signal\": [4, 7, 2, 9]}, index=[10, 20, 30, 40])\n","display":"表 ids2（变量名 `df`）：四个样本，sample_id 每格加了引号。S-01 和 s-01 是两个不同的样本。\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|\n| 10 | `\" 007\"` | 4 |\n| 20 | `\"S-01 \"` | 7 |\n| 30 | `\"s-01\"` | 2 |\n| 40 | `\"012\"` | 9 |\n"}]},{"id":"py24.k3.x2","body":"一张样地表的 plot_id 有“P01”“p01”“ P02”这样的写法。负责人确认：“P01 和 p01 是同一个样地，只是录入时大小写不统一；编号里的 0 都要保留。”把 plot_id 的清理规则填成下面三个字段。\n","slots":[{"id":"strip","type":"choice","prompt":"首尾空白","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"保留"},{"id":"remove","content":"去掉"}],"key":"remove"},{"id":"case","type":"choice","prompt":"大小写","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"保持原样"},{"id":"upper","content":"统一成大写"}],"key":"upper"},{"id":"numeric","type":"choice","prompt":"要不要转成数","options":[{"id":"no","content":"不转，保持文字"},{"id":"yes","content":"转成数"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"首尾空白**去掉**；大小写**统一成大写**；**不转成数**。\n\n这里能统一大小写，是因为负责人确认了“P01 和 p01 是同一个样地”。编号能不能改、怎样改，要有需求方的明确规定；没有这种确认时，大小写应保持原样。“0 都要保留”排除了转成数。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py25","title":"一条记录是否重复，取决于什么","summary":"先按“一行代表什么”定出业务键，再用 duplicated/drop_duplicates 的 subset 和 keep 标出或去掉重复，分清录了两遍和数值冲突。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py14","py12"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始，前面题目里的变量都已清除。\n\n大多数题用表 M：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`day` 是第几天测的，`signal` 是一次测量的值（任意单位）。约定每个样本每天只测一次；表里行的先后就是录入的先后。左边的原行索引是原表的行标签，不是从小到大的序号。\n\n代码结果里的 True/False 读作“是/否”。`len(表)` 是这张表的行数。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提去重需求时，可以直接说：“表的一行代表某个样本某一天的一次测量，按 sample_id 和 day 判断是不是同一条记录。同一样本同一天出现不止一次的，先全部列出来给我核对，不要自动挑一条留下。”\n\n拿到去重代码后，先看 `subset` 里写的是不是业务键，再看 `keep` 留的是哪一次，最后数一数结果少了几行、少的是不是你预期的那几行。\n","kps":[{"id":"py25.k1","title":"业务键与整行重复的区别","key":["py14"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"业务键","aliases":["整行重复","同一条记录"],"definition":"按“一行代表什么”，能认出同一条记录的那几列叫业务键；业务键相同才是同一条记录，整行完全相同只是其中一种情况。","conditions":["不写 subset 的 duplicated() 只认整行完全相同；业务键相同、测量值不同的冲突行，它认不出来。","当前这张表里碰巧不重复的列，不一定是业务键；业务键来自一行代表什么，而不是来自这次的数据。","冲突不能让程序悄悄留一条，要按事先定好的规则处理，或去问负责数据的人。"],"example":"```python\nfull = df.duplicated()\nby_key = df.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"])\n```\n表 M 里，`full` 只标出与索引 31 整行相同的索引 4；`by_key` 还标出了索引 15：它和索引 7 是 S_B 同一天的测量，signal 却一个是 10、一个是 11，这是冲突。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]},"lesson":"说“去重”之前，先问一行代表什么。表 M 的一行是“一个样本在某一天的一次测量”，并且约定每个样本每天只测一次。所以要认出“同一条记录”，看的是 sample_id 和 day 两列合起来：这两列都相同，说的就是同一个样本同一天的那次测量。这样一组列叫**业务键**。\n\n按业务键看表 M，有三种情况：\n\n| 原行索引 | sample_id | day | signal | 和前面的行比 |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|---|\n| 31 | S_A | 1 | 8 | 第一次出现 |\n| 7 | S_B | 1 | 10 | 第一次出现 |\n| 22 | S_A | 2 | 9 | 同一个样本的第 2 天：不是重复 |\n| 4 | S_A | 1 | 8 | 与 31 整行相同：多半是录了两遍 |\n| 15 | S_B | 1 | 11 | 与 7 业务键相同、signal 不同：**冲突** |\n\n整行相同的两行，去掉一行不丢信息。冲突不一样：10 和 11 至少有一个不对，留哪个是业务上的决定，要按事先说好的规则处理，或者去问负责数据的人，不能让程序悄悄留下一条。\n\npandas 用 `duplicated` 方法标出重复。它对每一行回答：“这一行是不是和前面某一行重复？”结果是一列 True/False，与原表的行一一对应，索引不变；第一次出现的那行是 False，后面重复的是 True。\n\n```python\nfull = df.duplicated()\nby_key = df.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"])\n```\n\n不写 `subset` 时，每一列都相同才算重复，所以 `full` 只标出索引 4，认不出冲突的索引 15。`subset=` 后面写一个列名列表，就只比较这几列：`by_key` 把 4 和 15 都标了出来。\n\n还要注意：某几列在**这张表里**碰巧没有重复，不等于它们是业务键。比如某张表的 signal 恰好各不相同，下一批数据里两个样本完全可能测出同一个值。业务键来自“一行代表什么”，不来自这一次的数据。\n","example":{"id":"py25.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `full` 和 `by_key` 的值，再回答索引 15 属于哪种情况。\n\n```python\nfull = df.duplicated()\nby_key = df.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"marks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"day","header":"day"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"full","header":"full","input":"bool"},{"id":"by_key","header":"by_key","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","sample_id":"S_A","day":"1","signal":"8","full":false,"by_key":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","sample_id":"S_B","day":"1","signal":"10","full":false,"by_key":false}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","sample_id":"S_A","day":"2","signal":"9","full":false,"by_key":false}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","sample_id":"S_A","day":"1","signal":"8","full":true,"by_key":true}},{"id":"r15","cells":{"index":"15","sample_id":"S_B","day":"1","signal":"11","full":false,"by_key":true}}]},{"id":"kind","type":"choice","prompt":"索引 15 被 `by_key` 标成 True，`full` 却是 False。它和前面的索引 7 是什么关系？","options":[{"id":"double","content":"两行整行相同，录了两遍","feedback":"两行的 signal 一个是 10、一个是 11，并不完全相同。"},{"id":"conflict","content":"同一个样本同一天的测量，signal 不同，是冲突"},{"id":"other_day","content":"同一个样本不同天的测量，不是重复","feedback":"两行的 day 都是 1。"}],"key":"conflict"}],"explanation":"| 原行索引 | full | by_key |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 31 | False | False |\n| 7 | False | False |\n| 22 | False | False |\n| 4 | **True** | **True** |\n| 15 | False | **True** |\n\n索引 4 与 31 每一列都相同，两种写法都标出它。索引 15 与 7 的 sample_id、day 相同，signal 不同：整行比较时它不算重复，按业务键比较时它是同一条记录的第二次出现，所以是**冲突**。索引 22 是 S_A 的第 2 天，按业务键也不重复。第一次出现的行（31、7）都是 False。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py25.k1.q1","body":"有人只按样本编号去找重复。阅读代码，按原行索引填写 `marks` 的值，再判断这样做是否合适。\n\n```python\nmarks = df.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"marks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"day","header":"day"},{"id":"marks","header":"marks","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r31","cells":{"index":"31","sample_id":"S_A","day":"1","marks":false}},{"id":"r7","cells":{"index":"7","sample_id":"S_B","day":"1","marks":false}},{"id":"r22","cells":{"index":"22","sample_id":"S_A","day":"2","marks":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","sample_id":"S_A","day":"1","marks":true}},{"id":"r15","cells":{"index":"15","sample_id":"S_B","day":"1","marks":true}}]},{"id":"fit","type":"choice","prompt":"表 M 的一行代表某个样本某一天的一次测量。只按 sample_id 找重复，合适吗？","options":[{"id":"too_wide","content":"不合适：索引 22 是 S_A 第 2 天的正常测量，也被当成了重复"},{"id":"fits","content":"合适：同一个样本只应该有一行","feedback":"每个样本每天测一次，同一个样本可以有好几天的记录。"}],"key":"too_wide"}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、False、True、True、True**。只比较 sample_id 时，S_A 第二、三次出现（22、4）和 S_B 第二次出现（15）都是 True。\n\n这**不合适**：索引 22 是 S_A 第 2 天的测量，按“一行代表某样本某天”它是一条新记录，却被当成了重复。只看 sample_id 认重复的范围太宽了，业务键要包括 day。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]},{"id":"py25.k1.q2","body":"这份记录也约定每个样本每天只测一次，行的先后就是录入的先后。从上往下看，按 sample_id 和 day 判断，给每一行选一种情况。\n","slots":[{"id":"kinds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"day","header":"day"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal"},{"id":"kind","header":"情况","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"new","label":"新记录（这个样本这一天第一次出现）"},{"id":"double","label":"与前面某行整行相同"},{"id":"conflict","label":"与前面某行业务键相同、signal 不同"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r12","cells":{"index":"12","sample_id":"S_C","day":"1","signal":"7","kind":"new"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"index":"3","sample_id":"S_D","day":"1","signal":"12","kind":"new"}},{"id":"r40","cells":{"index":"40","sample_id":"S_C","day":"1","signal":"7","kind":"double"}},{"id":"r8","cells":{"index":"8","sample_id":"S_D","day":"2","signal":"12","kind":"new"}},{"id":"r21","cells":{"index":"21","sample_id":"S_C","day":"2","signal":"6","kind":"new"}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"index":"5","sample_id":"S_D","day":"1","signal":"13","kind":"conflict"}}]}],"explanation":"| 原行索引 | 情况 |\n|---:|---|\n| 12 | 新记录 |\n| 3 | 新记录 |\n| 40 | 与 12 整行相同 |\n| 8 | 新记录 |\n| 21 | 新记录 |\n| 5 | 与 3 业务键相同、signal 不同（冲突） |\n\n容易看错的是索引 8：它的 sample_id 和 signal 都与索引 3 一样，但 day 是 2，是 S_D 第 2 天的测量，属于新记录。测量值碰巧相同不说明是同一条记录。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一份同样格式的测量记录","index":[12,3,40,8,21,5],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_C","S_D","S_C","S_D"],"day":[1,1,1,2,2,1],"signal":[7,12,7,12,6,13]}}]},{"id":"py25.k1.q3","body":"表 mice 的一行代表“一只小鼠在某一周的一次称重”，约定每只小鼠每周称一次。\n\n“按 `subset` 里的列找不出重复”意思是：`mice.duplicated(subset=…)` 每一行都是 False。\n","slots":[{"id":"unique","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"在**这张表**里，按下面哪些列组合找，都找不出重复？选出所有符合的。","options":[{"id":"id_only","content":"`mouse_id`"},{"id":"week_only","content":"`week`"},{"id":"weight_only","content":"`weight`"},{"id":"id_week","content":"`mouse_id` 和 `week`"}],"key":["weight_only","id_week"]},{"id":"key","type":"choice","prompt":"按一行代表什么，哪一组才是这张表的业务键？","options":[{"id":"id_only","content":"`mouse_id`"},{"id":"week_only","content":"`week`"},{"id":"weight_only","content":"`weight`"},{"id":"id_week","content":"`mouse_id` 和 `week`"}],"key":"id_week"}],"explanation":"在这张表里，**weight** 一列和 **mouse_id 加 week** 都找不出重复；mouse_id、week 单独看都有重复。\n\n但业务键是 **mouse_id 和 week**：一行代表“某只小鼠某一周”，这两列合起来才说明是哪一次称重。weight 碰巧各不相同，再称一周，两只小鼠完全可能一样重；拿它当业务键，会把同一只小鼠同一周录了两次、体重又不同的冲突当成两条不同的记录。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"mice","caption":"表 mice：每周称一次的小鼠体重（克）","showIndex":false,"columns":{"mouse_id":["M1","M1","M2","M2","M3"],"week":[1,2,1,2,1],"weight":[20,21,19,22,18]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py25.k1.r1","body":"表 plots 的一行代表“一个采样点在某一年的一次株高测量”，约定每个采样点每年只测一次。\n\n```python\nfull = plots.duplicated()\nby_key = plots.duplicated(subset=[\"site\", \"year\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"full_true","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`full` 里有几个 True？","key":0},{"id":"key_true","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`by_key` 里有几个 True？","key":1},{"id":"row","type":"choice","prompt":"`by_key` 标为 True 的是哪一行（原行索引）？","options":[{"id":"5","content":"5"},{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"20","content":"20"}],"key":"8"},{"id":"relation","type":"choice","prompt":"这一行和前面与它业务键相同的那一行是什么关系？","options":[{"id":"other_year","content":"同一个采样点的不同年份，不是重复"},{"id":"double","content":"整行相同，录了两遍"},{"id":"conflict","content":"同一个采样点同一年，株高不同，是冲突"}],"key":"conflict"}],"explanation":"`full` 有 **0** 个 True：五行里没有两行每一列都相同。`by_key` 有 **1** 个 True，是索引 **8**：它和索引 5 都是北坡 2024 年，株高一个 31、一个 35，是**冲突**。\n\n索引 20 和 12 的株高都是 28，但年份不同，是两条不同的记录，两种写法都不标它。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：采样点每年一次的株高测量（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","北坡","南坡"],"year":[2024,2024,2025,2024,2025],"height":[31,28,33,35,28]}}]},{"id":"py25.k1.r2","body":"表 water 的一行代表“一个采样点在某一天的一次浊度测量”，约定每个采样点每天只测一次。同事检查之后说：\n\n> `water.duplicated()` 全是 False，所以这张表里没有重复记录。\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这个结论对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对：没有两行完全相同，就说明没有重复记录"},{"id":"same_value","content":"不对：有两行浊度相同，它们是同一条记录录了两遍","feedback":"浊度都是 30 的两行日期不同，是两条不同的记录。"},{"id":"conflict","content":"不对：有两行是同一个采样点同一天的测量，只是浊度不同"}],"key":"conflict"},{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"属于同一条记录的是哪几行？按原表里的先后排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"9","content":"9"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"7","content":"7"}],"key":["2","4"]}],"explanation":"结论**不对**。不写 `subset` 的 `duplicated()` 只认整行相同；索引 **2 和 4** 都是 W1 在 10-01 的测量，浊度一个 12、一个 15，整行不同，却是同一条记录，属于冲突。要用 `water.duplicated(subset=[\"site\", \"date\"])` 才查得出来。\n\n索引 9 和 7 的浊度都是 30，但日期不同，是两条不同的记录。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：采样点每天一次的浊度测量","index":[2,9,4,7],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["W1","W2","W1","W2"],"date":["10-01","10-01","10-01","10-02"],"turbidity":[12,30,15,30]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py25.k1.x1","body":"表 survey 的一行代表“一位受访者在某一轮问卷里的一次作答”，约定每人每轮只答一次。阅读代码。\n\n```python\nfull = survey.duplicated()\nby_key = survey.duplicated(subset=[\"respondent\", \"wave\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"full_rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`full` 为 True 的行有哪些？按原表里的先后排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"14","content":"14"},{"id":"6","content":"6"},{"id":"30","content":"30"},{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"11","content":"11"},{"id":"25","content":"25"}],"key":["2"]},{"id":"key_rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`by_key` 为 True 的行有哪些？按原表里的先后排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"14","content":"14"},{"id":"6","content":"6"},{"id":"30","content":"30"},{"id":"2","content":"2"},{"id":"11","content":"11"},{"id":"25","content":"25"}],"key":["2","11"]},{"id":"extra","type":"choice","prompt":"`by_key` 比 `full` 多标出的那一行，属于哪种情况？","options":[{"id":"double","content":"与前面某行整行相同，录了两遍"},{"id":"other_wave","content":"同一位受访者另一轮的作答，不是重复"},{"id":"conflict","content":"同一位受访者同一轮的作答，分数不同，是冲突"}],"key":"conflict"}],"explanation":"`full` 只有索引 **2**：它与索引 6 每一列都相同（R2、第 1 轮、5 分）。`by_key` 有索引 **2、11**：11 是 R1 第 1 轮，与索引 14 业务键相同，分数一个 4、一个 2，是**冲突**。\n\n索引 30 是 R1 的第 2 轮，不是重复；索引 25 的分数与 14 相同，但它是另一位受访者，也不是重复。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：问卷作答记录","index":[14,6,30,2,11,25],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R1","R2","R1","R3"],"wave":[1,1,2,1,1,1],"score":[4,5,3,5,2,4]}}]},{"id":"py25.k1.x2","body":"表 temps 的一行代表“一个采样点在某一天的一次水温记录”，约定每个采样点每天只记一次。这张表里 temp 一列碰巧各不相同。\n","slots":[{"id":"key","type":"choice","prompt":"判断两行是不是同一条记录，应该按哪一组列？","options":[{"id":"temp","content":"`temp`"},{"id":"site_temp","content":"`site` 和 `temp`"},{"id":"site_day","content":"`site` 和 `day`"},{"id":"site","content":"`site`"}],"key":"site_day"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行 `temps.duplicated(subset=[\"site\", \"day\"])`，结果里有几个 True？","key":1},{"id":"row","type":"choice","prompt":"那个 True 在哪一行（原行索引）？","options":[{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"9","content":"9"},{"id":"14","content":"14"},{"id":"6","content":"6"},{"id":"11","content":"11"}],"key":"11"}],"explanation":"按 **site 和 day**：一行代表“某采样点某一天”，这两列合起来才说明是哪一次记录。temp 碰巧各不相同，换一批数据就可能有两天水温一样；按 temp 或 site 加 temp 找，会把同一天记了两次、读数又不同的情况漏掉。\n\n按 site 和 day 找，有 **1** 个 True，在索引 **11**：它和索引 3 都是河口第 1 天，水温一个 18、一个 20，是冲突，要交人核对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：河流水温记录（摄氏度）","index":[3,9,14,6,11],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["河口","上游","河口","上游","河口"],"day":[1,1,2,2,1],"temp":[18,16,19,17,20]}}]}]},{"id":"py25.k2","title":"duplicated/drop_duplicates 的 subset、keep 规则","key":["py14"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"keep 规则","aliases":["drop_duplicates","去重","keep=False"],"definition":"duplicated 按 subset 里的列认重复，keep 决定哪一次不算重复：\"first\" 留第一次，\"last\" 留最后一次，False 一次都不留；drop_duplicates 去掉标为 True 的行。","conditions":["drop_duplicates 返回新表，保留原顺序和原索引；不赋值给原来的名字，df 不变。","“第一次”“最后一次”按表里行的先后算；行的先后就是录入先后时，keep=\"last\" 才是“留最后录入的”。","keep=False 把出现不止一次的每一行都标出来，适合把冲突全部找出来交人核对。"],"example":"```python\nresult = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n表 M 里，S_A 第 1 天留下最后录入的索引 4，S_B 第 1 天留下索引 15，加上 S_A 第 2 天的索引 22：结果是 22、4、15 三行，df 仍是 5 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]},"lesson":"`duplicated` 还有一个关键字参数 `keep`，决定一组重复里**哪一次不算重复**。表 M 按业务键 `[\"sample_id\", \"day\"]` 看，S_A 第 1 天出现在 31、4，S_B 第 1 天出现在 7、15：\n\n| 原行索引 | `keep=\"first\"`（缺省） | `keep=\"last\"` | `keep=False` |\n|---:|---|---|---|\n| 31 | False | True | True |\n| 7 | False | True | True |\n| 22 | False | False | False |\n| 4 | True | False | True |\n| 15 | True | False | True |\n\n- `\"first\"`：第一次出现的不算重复，后面的标 True。不写 `keep` 就是这一种。\n- `\"last\"`：最后一次出现的不算重复，前面的标 True。\n- `False`（不加引号）：一次都不留，凡是出现不止一次的全部标 True。想把冲突全部找出来交人核对，用它。\n\n“第一次”“最后一次”按表里行的先后算。只有行的先后就是录入的先后时，`keep=\"last\"` 才等于“留最后录入的那条”。\n\n`drop_duplicates` 接受同样的 `subset` 和 `keep`，去掉会被标为 True 的行，留下其余的行：\n\n```python\nresult = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n\n结果留下 22、4、15 三行。留下的行保持原表里的先后和原索引，不会重新编号；结果是一张新表，要赋给一个名字，`df` 自己不变，仍是 5 行。结果的行数等于原表行数减去被标为 True 的行数。\n","example":{"id":"py25.k2.e0","body":"负责人说：同一个样本同一天出现不止一次时，留最后录入的那一条。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 留下了哪些行？按结果里的先后顺序排出原行索引，没留下的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"},{"id":"22","content":"22"},{"id":"4","content":"4"},{"id":"15","content":"15"}],"key":["22","4","15"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`len(result)` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"cell","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"结果里 S_B 第 1 天那一行的 signal 是多少？","key":11},{"id":"df_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行之后，`len(df)` 是多少？","key":5}],"explanation":"| 原行索引 | sample_id | day | signal |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|\n| 22 | S_A | 2 | 9 |\n| 4 | S_A | 1 | 8 |\n| 15 | S_B | 1 | 11 |\n\nS_A 第 1 天出现在 31、4，留最后的 **4**；S_B 第 1 天出现在 7、15，留最后的 **15**；S_A 第 2 天只有 22，照样留下。结果按原表的先后排成 **22、4、15**，共 **3** 行，索引不重新编号；S_B 第 1 天留下的 signal 是 **11**。\n\n`drop_duplicates` 返回新表，`df` 仍是 **5** 行。注意 keep=\"last\" 只是按事先定好的规则挑了一条：10 和 11 哪个对，规则本身并不知道。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py25.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，分别说出 `a` 和 `b` 留下了哪些行。\n\n```python\na = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"])\nb = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a_rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`a` 留下的行，按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"40","content":"40"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"21","content":"21"},{"id":"5","content":"5"}],"key":["12","3","8","21"]},{"id":"b_rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`b` 留下的行，按先后顺序排出原行索引。","items":[{"id":"12","content":"12"},{"id":"3","content":"3"},{"id":"40","content":"40"},{"id":"8","content":"8"},{"id":"21","content":"21"},{"id":"5","content":"5"}],"key":["8","21"]}],"explanation":"`a` 用缺省的 keep=\"first\"：S_C 第 1 天出现在 12、40，留 12；S_D 第 1 天出现在 3、5，留 3。结果是 **12、3、8、21**。\n\n`b` 用 keep=False：出现不止一次的业务键，每一行都去掉，12、40、3、5 全没了，只剩 **8、21**。S_C 和 S_D 的第 1 天在 `b` 里一条记录都不剩，所以 keep=False 适合用 `duplicated` 把冲突找出来看，直接拿去 `drop_duplicates` 会把这两天的数据整个丢掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一份同样格式的测量记录","index":[12,3,40,8,21,5],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_C","S_D","S_C","S_D"],"day":[1,1,1,2,2,1],"signal":[7,12,7,12,6,13]}}]},{"id":"py25.k2.q2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 每个样本每天只留一条记录：同一个 sample_id 和 day 出现不止一次时，留最后录入的那一条（行的先后就是录入的先后）。保留原顺序和原索引，不改变 `df`。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"result = df.drop_duplicates()\n","solution":"result = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")\n","accepts":["result = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"day\", \"sample_id\"], keep=\"last\")","result = df.drop_duplicates([\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"])","why":"没写 keep，留下的是第一次录入的那条"},{"code":"result = df.drop_duplicates(keep=\"last\")","why":"没写 subset，只去掉了整行相同的行，冲突还在"},{"code":"result = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"], keep=\"last\")","why":"只按 sample_id 去重，同一个样本不同天的记录也被去掉了"},{"code":"result = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=False)","why":"keep=False 把有重复的记录全部去掉了"},{"code":"result = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\", ignore_index=True)","why":"把索引重新编号成 0、1、2"},{"code":"df = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")\nresult = df\n","why":"把 df 换成了去重后的表"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 M","expect":{"result":"df.loc[[22, 4, 15]]","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张有整行重复和冲突的表","hidden":true,"data":["M2"],"expect":{"result":"df.loc[[40, 8, 21, 5]]","df":"df"}},{"name":"换一张没有重复的表","hidden":true,"data":["M3"],"expect":{"result":"df","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = df.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n\n要补两处：`subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"]` 按业务键认同一条记录，不写的话只去掉整行相同的行，S_B 第 1 天的两个值都会留下；`keep=\"last\"` 留最后录入的那条，不写就留第一条。本例结果是索引 22、4、15 三行。判分时还会换两张表运行你的代码，并检查 `df` 没有被改变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]},{"id":"py25.k2.q3","body":"负责人看到表 M 后说：\n\n> S_B 第 1 天录了两个不同的值，我不知道哪个对。凡是同一个样本同一天出现不止一次的记录，全部列出来给我核对，我来决定留哪条。\n\n用 `df.duplicated(subset=…, keep=…)` 标出这些行。\n","slots":[{"id":"subset","type":"choice","prompt":"`subset` 写哪些列？","options":[{"id":"all","content":"不写，比较全部列"},{"id":"key","content":"`[\"sample_id\", \"day\"]`"},{"id":"id","content":"`[\"sample_id\"]`"}],"key":"key"},{"id":"keep","type":"choice","prompt":"`keep` 取哪个值？","options":[{"id":"first","content":"`\"first\"`"},{"id":"last","content":"`\"last\"`"},{"id":"none","content":"`False`"}],"key":"none"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这样会标出几行？","key":4},{"id":"action","type":"choice","prompt":"标出这些行之后，下一步交给负责人的是什么？","options":[{"id":"drop","content":"用 drop_duplicates 把这些行去掉后的表"},{"id":"list","content":"被标出的这些行本身，原样交给负责人"},{"id":"pick","content":"每组里 signal 较大的那一行"}],"key":"list"}],"explanation":"`subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"]`，`keep=False`，标出 **4** 行：31、7、4、15。\n\nkeep=False 才会把第一次出现的那行也标出来，负责人才能看到同一组的全部候选值；\"first\" 或 \"last\" 都会让其中一行显得“没有问题”。标出来之后交给负责人的是这些行本身：去掉它们会让 S_A、S_B 第 1 天的数据整个消失，挑 signal 较大的则是替负责人做了决定。\n\n31 和 4 整行相同，也会被列出来，核对时一眼就能看出它们只是录了两遍。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 M：两天的测量记录","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_A","S_A","S_B"],"day":[1,1,2,1,1],"signal":[8,10,9,8,11]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py25.k2.r1","body":"表 plots 约定每个采样点每年只测一次，行的先后就是录入的先后。要求是：同一个采样点同一年出现不止一次时，留最后录入的那一条。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行代码符合要求？","options":[{"id":"first","content":"```python\nresult = plots.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"site\", \"year\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"whole","content":"```python\nresult = plots.drop_duplicates(keep=\"last\")\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = plots.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"site\", \"year\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n"},{"id":"site","content":"```python\nresult = plots.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"site\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n"}],"key":"right"},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"用符合要求的那行代码，`result` 有几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"`subset=[\"site\", \"year\"], keep=\"last\"` 的那一行符合要求，结果留下 12、3、8、20 共 **4** 行：北坡 2024 年出现在 5、8，留最后录入的 8。\n\n不写 keep 的留下了第一次录入的 5；不写 subset 的只看整行，这张表没有整行相同的行，什么也没去掉；只按 site 去重，把不同年份的测量也去掉了，只剩每个采样点最后一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：采样点每年一次的株高测量（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8,20],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","北坡","南坡"],"year":[2024,2024,2025,2024,2025],"height":[31,28,33,35,28]}}]},{"id":"py25.k2.r2","body":"表 traps 的一行代表“一盏诱虫灯某一晚的一次计数”，约定每盏灯每晚只数一次。阅读代码。\n\n```python\nflags = traps.duplicated(subset=[\"trap\", \"night\"], keep=False)\nkept = traps.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"trap\", \"night\"], keep=False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"flags","type":"table","prompt":"按原行索引填写 `flags` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"index","header":"原行索引"},{"id":"trap","header":"trap"},{"id":"night","header":"night"},{"id":"moths","header":"moths"},{"id":"flag","header":"flags","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r6","cells":{"index":"6","trap":"T1","night":"1","moths":"14","flag":true}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"index":"2","trap":"T2","night":"1","moths":"9","flag":false}},{"id":"r9","cells":{"index":"9","trap":"T1","night":"1","moths":"17","flag":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"index":"4","trap":"T2","night":"2","moths":"9","flag":false}},{"id":"r11","cells":{"index":"11","trap":"T1","night":"2","moths":"12","flag":false}}]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`len(kept)` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"left","type":"choice","prompt":"`kept` 里还有 T1 第 1 晚的记录吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"有，留下了其中一条"},{"id":"no","content":"没有，两条都被去掉了"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"`flags` 依次为 **True、False、True、False、False**：T1 第 1 晚出现在 6、9 两行（14 和 17），keep=False 把两行都标出来。索引 2 和 4 的蛾子数都是 9，但晚上不同，不是重复。\n\n`kept` 去掉了 6、9，剩 **3** 行，T1 第 1 晚**一条记录都没有了**。这就是 keep=False 用在 drop_duplicates 上的代价：冲突的数据被整组丢掉，而不是交人核对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"traps","caption":"表 traps：诱虫灯每晚捕到的蛾子数","index":[6,2,9,4,11],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"trap":["T1","T2","T1","T2","T1"],"night":[1,1,1,2,2],"moths":[14,9,17,9,12]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py25.k2.x1","body":"表 plates 的一行代表“一块培养板上一个孔的一次计数”，约定每个孔只数一次。程序依次显示哪三个数？\n\n```python\nprint(len(plates.drop_duplicates()))\nprint(len(plates.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"])))\nprint(len(plates.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"], keep=False)))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":5},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":4},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行显示","key":2}],"explanation":"依次显示 **5、4、2**。\n\n- 整行比较：只有索引 6 与 3 每一列都相同（P1、A1、120），去掉 6，剩 5 行。\n- 按 plate 和 well：P1 的 A1 出现在 3、6，P2 的 A1 出现在 1、10（110 和 108，冲突），各去掉后一次，剩 4 行。\n- keep=False：这两组的四行全部去掉，只剩 8、4 两行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plates","caption":"表 plates：培养板各孔的菌落计数","index":[3,8,1,6,10,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plate":["P1","P1","P2","P1","P2","P2"],"well":["A1","A2","A1","A1","A1","A2"],"count":[120,95,110,120,108,99]}}]},{"id":"py25.k2.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 标出 plate 和 well 相同、出现不止一次的**每一行**（包括第一次出现的那行），结果是一列 True/False，与 plates 的行一一对应，索引不变。不改变 `plates`。\n\n作答框里的代码不符合需求。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `flags`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"flags = plates.duplicated()\n","solution":"flags = plates.duplicated(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"], keep=False)\n","accepts":["flags = plates.duplicated([\"plate\", \"well\"], keep=False)","flags = plates.duplicated(subset=[\"well\", \"plate\"], keep=False)"],"rejects":[{"code":"flags = plates.duplicated(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"])","why":"缺省 keep=\"first\"，第一次出现的那行没有标出来"},{"code":"flags = plates.duplicated(keep=False)","why":"没写 subset，只标出整行相同的行，漏了冲突"},{"code":"flags = plates.duplicated(subset=[\"plate\"], keep=False)","why":"只按 plate 比较，同一块板的不同孔也被标出来"},{"code":"flags = plates.duplicated(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"], keep=\"last\")","why":"keep=\"last\" 标的是前面的，最后一次出现的没有标出来"},{"code":"flags = plates.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"], keep=False)","why":"得到的是去掉这些行之后的表，不是标记"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 plates","expect":{"flags":"pd.Series([True, False, True, True, True, False], index=[3, 8, 1, 6, 10, 4])","plates":"plates"}},{"name":"换一张只有冲突、没有整行重复的表","hidden":true,"data":["plates2"],"expect":{"flags":"pd.Series([True, True, False, False], index=[7, 2, 5, 9])","plates":"plates"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nflags = plates.duplicated(subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"], keep=False)\n```\n\n`subset=[\"plate\", \"well\"]` 按业务键比较，才能认出 P2 的 A1 这种读数不同的冲突；`keep=False` 让第一次出现的那行也标 True。本例标出 3、1、6、10 四行。判分时还会换一张只有冲突、没有整行重复的表运行你的代码。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plates","caption":"表 plates：培养板各孔的菌落计数","index":[3,8,1,6,10,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plate":["P1","P1","P2","P1","P2","P2"],"well":["A1","A2","A1","A1","A1","A2"],"count":[120,95,110,120,108,99]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py26","title":"汇总前先数清分母","summary":"分清表的行数、一列有值的个数和缺失个数；读懂 sum、mean 默认跳过缺失，以及全缺失时的 0.0 和 NaN；报告汇总值时带上单位、有效样本量和比例的分母。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py19","py07"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 N：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`group` 是实验组，`signal` 是一次测量的值（任意单位）；表里的 NaN 表示这个样本没有测到值，也就是缺失。左边的原行索引是原表的行标签。\n\n这一节只问一件事：算平均、算比例之前，先数清到底有几个数参与了计算。\n","wrapup":"报告一个汇总值时，把三样东西一起写上：值和它的单位、实际参与计算的个数 n、缺了几个。例如：“signal 均值 10.0（任意单位），n = 3，另有 2 个样本缺失。”\n\n向同事或 AI 提要求时，比例要写明分母：“在测到 signal 的样本中，signal 至少为 10 的比例”，而不是只说“达标比例”。拿到代码后，先打印 count，再看求和、平均和比例。\n","kps":[{"id":"py26.k1","title":"行数、count 和非缺失数的区别","key":["py19"],"links":["py19.k1"],"card":{"name":"行数与 count","aliases":["count","非缺失个数","len"],"definition":"len(df) 数表有几行；df[\"列\"].count() 只数这一列有值（非缺失）的格子；两者之差就是这一列缺失的个数。","conditions":["count 按列各数各的：同一张表里，不同列的 count 可能不同。","缺失个数用 isna().sum() 数；行数 = count + 缺失个数。"],"example":"表 N 有 5 行；signal 列 count 为 3，isna().sum() 为 2，3 + 2 = 5。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"算平均、算比例之前，先回答：一共有几个数参与计算？表 N 有 5 行，但 signal 列只有 3 个格子有值，另外 2 个是 NaN（缺失）。三种“数一数”说的是三件不同的事：\n\n| 写法 | 数的是什么 | 表 N 的结果 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| `len(df)` 或 `df.shape[0]` | 表有几行 | 5 |\n| `df[\"signal\"].count()` | signal 这一列有值的格子 | 3 |\n| `df[\"signal\"].isna().sum()` | signal 这一列缺失的格子 | 2 |\n\n`isna()` 逐行给出 True/False（[缺失判断](repa:concept/py19.k1)），对它求 `sum()` 时，True 当作 1、False 当作 0，加起来就是缺失的个数。`notna().sum()` 同理，结果和 `count()` 相同。\n\n`count` 按列各数各的：`df.count()` 会给出每一列有值的个数，同一张表里 sample_id 可能是 5，signal 只有 3。所以“表里有 5 个样本”不等于“5 个样本测到了 signal”。\n","example":{"id":"py26.k1.e0","body":"阅读表 N，写出每个表达式的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"rows","cells":{"expr":"`len(df)`","value":5}},{"id":"count","cells":{"expr":"`df[\"signal\"].count()`","value":3}},{"id":"missing","cells":{"expr":"`df[\"signal\"].isna().sum()`","value":2}},{"id":"ids","cells":{"expr":"`df[\"sample_id\"].count()`","value":5}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **5、3、2、5**。表有 5 行；signal 列有 3 个格子有值、2 个是 NaN，3 + 2 = 5。sample_id 列没有缺失，所以它的 count 是 5：count 只看括号前面那一列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py26.k1.q1","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nprint(len(df))\nprint(df[\"signal\"].count())\nprint(df[\"signal\"].notna().sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":5},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"count 只数有值的格子，signal 有两个 NaN。"}]},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行","key":3}],"explanation":"依次显示 **5、3、3**。`notna()` 在有值的行为 True，求和就是有值的个数，和 `count()` 一样；`len(df)` 数的是行，不管 signal 有没有值。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k1.q2","body":"先筛出 drug 组的 signal，再数一数。逗号后面只写一个列名时，得到的是一列（Series）。\n\n```python\ndrug = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", \"signal\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`len(drug)` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`drug.count()` 是多少？","key":1},{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪句话正确？","options":[{"id":"three","content":"drug 组有 3 个样本测到了 signal","feedback":"3 是 drug 组的行数，其中两行 signal 是 NaN。"},{"id":"one","content":"drug 组有 3 个样本，其中只有 1 个测到了 signal"},{"id":"zero","content":"drug 组没有任何样本测到 signal"}],"key":"one"}],"explanation":"drug 组有 **3** 行（索引 7、22、15），但只有索引 22 测到了值，count 为 **1**。所以正确的说法是“drug 组有 3 个样本，其中只有 1 个测到了 signal”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k1.q3","body":"`df.count()` 对每一列分别数有值的格子。写出这张表每一列的结果。\n","slots":[{"id":"counts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"column","header":"列"},{"id":"count","header":"`df.count()` 里的值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"sample_id","cells":{"column":"sample_id","count":4}},{"id":"group","cells":{"column":"group","count":4}},{"id":"signal","cells":{"column":"signal","count":2}}]}],"explanation":"sample_id 和 group 都没有缺失，各为 **4**；signal 有两个 NaN，为 **2**。同一张表，不同列的 count 不一样，所以说“有几个”时要说清是哪一列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一批同结构的记录","index":[12,5,30,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_F","S_G","S_H","S_I"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[11.0,null,7.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py26.k1.r1","body":"项目负责人想知道：一共有几个采样点，测到深度的有几个，没测到的有几个。\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共有几个采样点？","key":6},{"id":"measured","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"测到深度的有几个？","key":4},{"id":"code","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行代码算出的是“测到深度的采样点个数”？","options":[{"id":"len","content":"```python\nn = len(soil)\n```\n"},{"id":"count","content":"```python\nn = soil[\"depth\"].count()\n```\n"},{"id":"isna","content":"```python\nn = soil[\"depth\"].isna().sum()\n```\n"},{"id":"site","content":"```python\nn = soil[\"site\"].count()\n```\n"}],"key":"count"}],"explanation":"一共 **6** 个采样点，测到深度的 **4** 个，另外 2 个没测到。`soil[\"depth\"].count()` 只数 depth 有值的格子；`len(soil)` 和 `soil[\"site\"].count()` 都是 6，数的是采样点；`isna().sum()` 数的是没测到的 2 个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：六个采样点的土层深度（厘米），没测到的为 NaN","index":[5,12,3,8,21,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶","谷底"],"depth":[30.0,null,25.0,30.0,null,35.0]},"dtypes":{"depth":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k1.r2","body":"判断下面每句话对不对。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"`len(survey)` 是 5","ok":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"`survey[\"age\"].count()` 是 5","ok":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"`survey[\"city\"].count()` 比 `survey[\"age\"].count()` 大","ok":true}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"`survey[\"age\"].count()` 加上 `survey[\"age\"].isna().sum()` 等于 `len(survey)`","ok":true}}]}],"explanation":"第 1、3、4 句对，第 2 句错。表有 5 行；age 有 2 个没填，count 是 3；city 只有 1 个没填，count 是 4，比 age 的 3 大。任何一列的 count 加上它的缺失个数，都等于行数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：一次问卷的部分记录，没填的为 NaN","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5"],"age":[30.0,null,50.0,25.0,null],"city":["北京","上海",null,"广州","上海"]},"dtypes":{"age":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py26.k1.x1","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nprint(farm.shape[0])\nprint(farm[\"yield_kg\"].count())\nprint(farm.shape[0] - farm[\"yield_kg\"].count())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":6},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":4},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行","key":2}],"explanation":"依次显示 **6、4、2**：6 块地，4 块有产量记录，相减得到没有记录的 2 块。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：六块试验地的产量（千克），没收到记录的为 NaN","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5","P6"],"yield_kg":[4.0,null,6.0,5.0,null,5.0]},"dtypes":{"yield_kg":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k1.x2","body":"报告里要写“有高度测量值的幼苗数”。哪个表达式算出的是这个数？\n","slots":[{"id":"expr","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"isna","content":"```python\nplants[\"height\"].isna().sum()\n```\n"},{"id":"len","content":"```python\nlen(plants)\n```\n"},{"id":"count","content":"```python\nplants[\"height\"].count()\n```\n"},{"id":"ncols","content":"```python\nplants.shape[1]\n```\n"}],"key":"count"}],"explanation":"`plants[\"height\"].count()`，结果是 4。`len(plants)` 是 6 株幼苗的总数；`isna().sum()` 是没量到的 2 株；`plants.shape[1]` 是列数 2，和测量值无关。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），没量到的为 NaN","columns":{"plant_id":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5","A6"],"height":[33.0,null,27.0,36.0,null,24.0]},"dtypes":{"height":"float"}}]}]},{"id":"py26.k2","title":"sum/mean 的缺失处理与全缺失风险","key":["py19","py07"],"links":["py19.k3"],"card":{"name":"跳过缺失","aliases":["skipna","均值的分母","全缺失"],"definition":"pandas 的 sum、mean 默认跳过缺失：sum 只加有值的格子，mean 用这个和除以 count，而不是除以行数。","conditions":["一列全是缺失时，sum 得 0.0、mean 得 NaN；0.0 看起来像真的测量结果，先看 count。","用 fillna(0) 把缺失当成 0，会把均值拉低；能不能这样做是业务规则。"],"example":"表 N 的 signal 为 8.0、NaN、13.0、9.0、NaN：sum 为 30.0，mean 为 30.0 / 3 = 10.0，而不是 30.0 / 5 = 6.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"pandas 求和、求平均时，默认跳过缺失：\n\n- `df[\"signal\"].sum()` 只把有值的格子加起来：8.0 + 13.0 + 9.0 = 30.0。\n- `df[\"signal\"].mean()` 用这个和除以 **count**：30.0 / 3 = 10.0。\n\n自己写 `df[\"signal\"].sum() / len(df)` 就错了：分母 5 里包括了两个没测到的样本，得到 6.0。把缺失先填成 0 再平均，`df[\"signal\"].fillna(0).mean()`，也是 6.0：这等于说“没测到就是测到 0”。这样做对不对，要看[业务规则](repa:concept/py19.k3)，不能为了算得出数随手填。\n\n还有一个容易漏看的情况：**一列全是缺失**。这时 `count()` 是 0，`mean()` 是 NaN，而 `sum()` 是 **0.0**。0.0 看起来像一个真的结果，其实是“没有数可加”。所以看到总和为 0 时，先看 count。（pandas 另有 `sum(min_count=1)`，要求至少有 1 个值才求和，否则给 NaN；这里知道有这个开关就够了。）\n","example":{"id":"py26.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，写出三个名字的值。\n\n```python\ntotal = df[\"signal\"].sum()\navg = df[\"signal\"].mean()\nby_rows = total / len(df)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`total`","key":30},{"id":"avg","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`avg`","key":10},{"id":"by_rows","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`by_rows`","key":6},{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一个才是“测到的 signal 的平均值”？","options":[{"id":"avg","content":"`avg`"},{"id":"by_rows","content":"`by_rows`"}],"key":"avg"}],"explanation":"`total` 是 **30.0**，只加了有值的 8.0、13.0、9.0；`avg` 是 **10.0**，等于 30.0 除以 count 3；`by_rows` 是 **6.0**，把两个没测到的样本也算进了分母。测到的 signal 的平均值是 `avg`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py26.k2.q1","body":"这批记录里，drug 组的 signal 全都没测到。屏幕上依次显示什么？没有数字时 Python 显示 `nan`。\n\n```python\ndrug = df.loc[df[\"group\"] == \"drug\", \"signal\"]\nprint(drug.count())\nprint(drug.sum())\nprint(drug.mean())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"0"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"0.0"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"nan","feedback":[{"when":"0.0","message":"没有任何值时，平均数无从算起，mean 给出 nan。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **0、0.0、nan**。drug 组的两个格子都是缺失：count 为 0；sum 把“没有数”加起来得到 0.0；mean 要除以 0 个值，给出 nan。只看 sum 会以为 drug 组测到的总和是 0，先看 count 才知道根本没有数据。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"另一批同结构的记录","index":[12,5,30,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_F","S_G","S_H","S_I"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[11.0,null,7.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k2.q2","body":"同事想算“测到的 signal 的平均值”，写了下面的代码。\n\n```python startLine=1\ntotal = df[\"signal\"].sum()\nn = len(df)\navg = total / n\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"got","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"这段代码算出的 `avg` 是多少？","key":6},{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪一行？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行：sum 把缺失算成了 0"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行：分母数的是行数，包括了没测到的样本"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行：应该用 // 而不是 /"}],"key":"l2"},{"id":"right","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"正确的平均值是多少？","key":10}],"explanation":"这段代码得到 **6.0**。第 1 行没问题：sum 跳过缺失，总和 30.0 只来自三个测到的值。问题在**第 2 行**：`len(df)` 是 5，把两个没测到的样本也放进了分母。正确的平均是 30.0 / 3 = **10.0**，直接写 `df[\"signal\"].mean()`，或者把第 2 行改成 `n = df[\"signal\"].count()`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k2.q3","body":"`fillna(0)` 把缺失的格子填成 0，返回一列新的值。\n\n```python\na = df[\"signal\"].mean()\nb = df[\"signal\"].fillna(0).mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`a`","key":10},{"id":"b","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`b`","key":6},{"id":"meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"`b` 背后的假设是什么？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"没测到的两个样本，测量值就是 0"},{"id":"skip","content":"没测到的样本不参与平均"},{"id":"same","content":"和 a 的假设一样，只是写法不同"}],"key":"zero"}],"explanation":"`a` 是 **10.0**，`b` 是 **6.0**。`b` 先把两个 NaN 填成 0，再按 5 个值平均，等于假设“没测到的样本测量值是 0”。没测到不等于测到 0；要不要这样填，是需要写进要求的业务规则。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py26.k2.r1","body":"要算的是“测到浓度的站点的平均浓度”。下面哪些写法得到这个数？选出所有正确的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"mean","content":"```python\navg = water[\"conc\"].mean()\n```\n"},{"id":"by_len","content":"```python\navg = water[\"conc\"].sum() / len(water)\n```\n"},{"id":"by_count","content":"```python\navg = water[\"conc\"].sum() / water[\"conc\"].count()\n```\n"},{"id":"fill","content":"```python\navg = water[\"conc\"].fillna(0).mean()\n```\n"}],"key":["mean","by_count"]}],"explanation":"`mean()` 和 `sum() / count()` 都得到 **5.0 mg/L**：20.0 除以 4 个测到的值。`sum() / len(water)` 除以 6 个站点，`fillna(0).mean()` 把没测到的当作 0，两者都得到约 3.33，把没测到的站点也算进了分母。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：六个站点的硝酸盐浓度（mg/L），没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"station":["W1","W2","W3","W4","W5","W6"],"conc":[2.0,null,6.0,4.0,null,8.0]},"dtypes":{"conc":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k2.r2","body":"同事运行了下面两行，屏幕上显示 `0.0`，于是在报告里写：“B 站的硝酸盐浓度总和为 0。”\n\n```python\nb = water.loc[water[\"station\"] == \"B\", \"conc\"]\nprint(b.sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`b.count()` 是多少？","key":0},{"id":"verdict","type":"choice","prompt":"这句报告对吗？","options":[{"id":"wrong","content":"不对。B 站没有任何测到的值，0.0 只是“没有数可加”的结果"},{"id":"right","content":"对。B 站测到的浓度都是 0"},{"id":"deleted","content":"不对。B 站的记录被 loc 删掉了"}],"key":"wrong"}],"explanation":"`b.count()` 是 **0**：B 站有两行记录，但两次都没测到。对全是缺失的一列求和，pandas 给出 0.0，这不是测量结果。报告应写“B 站没有测到浓度”，而不是“总和为 0”；`b.mean()` 会给出 NaN，更不容易被误读。记录也没有被删掉，`len(b)` 仍是 2。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：三个站点的多次采样（mg/L），没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"station":["A","A","B","B","C"],"conc":[3.0,5.0,null,null,4.0]},"dtypes":{"conc":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py26.k2.x1","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nh = plants[\"height\"]\nprint(h.sum())\nprint(h.mean())\nprint(h.sum() / len(h))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"120.0"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"30.0"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"20.0","feedback":[{"when":"30.0","message":"`len(h)` 是 6，包括两株没量到的幼苗。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **120.0、30.0、20.0**。sum 只加 4 个量到的高度；mean 除以 count 4；第三行除以 `len(h)`，也就是 6 株幼苗，把没量到的也算进了分母。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），没量到的为 NaN","columns":{"plant_id":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5","A6"],"height":[33.0,null,27.0,36.0,null,24.0]},"dtypes":{"height":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k2.x2","body":"分两批取出测量值，再分别汇总。没有数字时，平均值填 NaN。\n\n```python\na = lab.loc[lab[\"batch\"] == \"甲\", \"value\"]\nb = lab.loc[lab[\"batch\"] == \"乙\", \"value\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"summary","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"count","header":"`count()`","input":"integer"},{"id":"sum","header":"`sum()`","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}},{"id":"mean","header":"`mean()`","input":{"type":"text","format":"number","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"name":"a（甲批）","count":3,"sum":15,"mean":5}},{"id":"b","cells":{"name":"b（乙批）","count":0,"sum":0,"mean":"NaN"}}]}],"explanation":"| 名字 | count() | sum() | mean() |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| a（甲批） | 3 | 15.0 | 5.0 |\n| b（乙批） | 0 | 0.0 | NaN |\n\n乙批两个样品都没测到：count 为 0，sum 是 0.0，mean 是 NaN。只看 sum 会误以为乙批测到的总量是 0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"lab","caption":"表 lab：两批样品的测量值，没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"sample_id":["L1","L2","L3","L4","L5"],"batch":["甲","乙","甲","乙","甲"],"value":[4.0,null,6.0,null,5.0]},"dtypes":{"value":"float"}}]}]},{"id":"py26.k3","title":"结果的单位与有效样本量","key":["py19","py02"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"有效样本量","aliases":["n","分母","单位"],"definition":"报告一个汇总值时，同时说清单位、实际参与计算的值有几个（有效样本量 n），以及有几个缺失。","conditions":["均值和原来那一列同单位；count 的单位是“个样本”，不是测量单位。","比例要写明分母：是全部样本，还是测到值的样本。"],"example":"表 N：“signal 均值 10.0（任意单位），n = 3，另有 2 个样本缺失。”\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"一个汇总值单独摆出来，别人没法核对。报告时把三样东西写在一起：\n\n1. **值和单位**：均值和原来那一列同单位，深度的均值还是厘米；count 的单位是“个样本”。\n2. **有效样本量 n**：实际参与计算的值有几个，也就是 count。\n3. **缺了几个**：行数减去 n。\n\n例如：“signal 均值 10.0（任意单位），n = 3，另有 2 个样本缺失。”\n\n**比例**最容易弄错分母。要算“signal 至少为 10 的样本占多少”，可能写成：\n\n```python\nshare = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10).mean()\n```\n\n比较得到一列 True/False，对它求 `mean()` 就是 True 所占的比例。但缺失的格子比较出来是 **False**，所以这里的分母是全部 5 行：1 / 5 = 0.2。如果要的是“在测到 signal 的样本中”的比例，分母应是 count：\n\n```python\nshare = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10).sum() / df[\"signal\"].count()\n```\n\n得到 1 / 3，约 0.33。两种分母回答的是两个不同的问题，要求里要写明是哪一个。\n","example":{"id":"py26.k3.e0","body":"要在报告里写表 N 的 signal 均值。下面哪句话写得正确、完整？\n","slots":[{"id":"report","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"rows","content":"signal 均值 6.0（任意单位），n = 5"},{"id":"n5","content":"signal 均值 10.0（任意单位），n = 5"},{"id":"full","content":"signal 均值 10.0（任意单位），n = 3，另有 2 个样本缺失"},{"id":"unit","content":"signal 均值 10.0 个样本，n = 3"}],"key":"full"},{"id":"n","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这句报告里的 n 应当是几？","key":3}],"explanation":"“signal 均值 10.0（任意单位），n = 3，另有 2 个样本缺失”正确。均值 10.0 来自 3 个测到的值，n 应是 **3**；写 n = 5 把没测到的也当作参与了计算，6.0 则是除错了分母。“10.0 个样本”把 count 的单位安到了均值上。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py26.k3.q1","body":"要求是：“在测到 signal 的样本中，signal 至少为 10 的占多少？”同事写了：\n\n```python\nshare = (df[\"signal\"] >= 10).mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"got","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`share` 是多少？","key":0.2},{"id":"denominator","type":"choice","prompt":"这段代码的分母是什么？","options":[{"id":"all","content":"全部 5 个样本"},{"id":"measured","content":"测到 signal 的 3 个样本"}],"key":"all"},{"id":"right","type":"text","format":"number","tolerance":0.01,"prompt":"按要求，比例应当是多少？（保留两位小数）","key":0.33}],"explanation":"`share` 是 **0.2**。缺失的两个格子比较出来是 False，`mean()` 按全部 **5 个样本**算：只有索引 22 的 13.0 满足，1 / 5 = 0.2。要求问的是“在测到 signal 的样本中”，分母应是 count 3：1 / 3 ≈ **0.33**，写成 `(df[\"signal\"] >= 10).sum() / df[\"signal\"].count()`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 N","index":[31,7,22,4,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,null,13.0,9.0,null]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k3.q2","body":"表 soil 的 depth 单位是厘米。\n\n```python\navg = soil[\"depth\"].mean()\nn = soil[\"depth\"].count()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"avg_unit","type":"choice","prompt":"`avg` 的单位是什么？","options":[{"id":"cm","content":"厘米"},{"id":"sites","content":"个采样点"},{"id":"none","content":"没有单位"}],"key":"cm"},{"id":"n_unit","type":"choice","prompt":"`n` 的单位是什么？","options":[{"id":"cm","content":"厘米"},{"id":"sites","content":"个采样点"},{"id":"none","content":"没有单位"}],"key":"sites"},{"id":"avg","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`avg` 是多少？","key":30}],"explanation":"`avg` 是 **30.0 厘米**：深度的平均值仍是深度，单位不变。`n` 是 4，单位是**个采样点**：它数的是有几个测到深度的采样点，不是一个长度。报告写成“平均深度 30.0 厘米，n = 4 个采样点，另有 2 个缺失”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：六个采样点的土层深度（厘米），没测到的为 NaN","index":[5,12,3,8,21,14],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶","谷底"],"depth":[30.0,null,25.0,30.0,null,35.0]},"dtypes":{"depth":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py26.k3.r1","body":"有人根据表 survey 写了一句报告：“受访者平均年龄 21.0 岁（n = 5）。”把它改对。\n","slots":[{"id":"mean","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"平均年龄应当是多少岁？","key":35},{"id":"n","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"n 应当是多少？","key":3},{"id":"missing","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"另有几位没填年龄？","key":2}],"explanation":"应改成“受访者平均年龄 **35.0** 岁（n = **3**，另有 **2** 位没填年龄）”。原句的 21.0 是 105 除以 5：把没填年龄的两位也算进了分母，n 也跟着写错了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：一次问卷的部分记录，没填的为 NaN","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5"],"age":[30.0,null,50.0,25.0,null],"city":["北京","上海",null,"广州","上海"]},"dtypes":{"age":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k3.r2","body":"负责人想知道浓度至少 5 mg/L 的站点占多少。\n\n```python\np1 = (water[\"conc\"] >= 5).mean()\np2 = (water[\"conc\"] >= 5).sum() / water[\"conc\"].count()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"p1","type":"text","format":"number","tolerance":0.01,"prompt":"`p1` 是多少？（保留两位小数）","key":0.33},{"id":"p2","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`p2` 是多少？","key":0.5},{"id":"match","type":"choice","prompt":"要求写的是“在测到浓度的站点中”。应当报告哪一个？","options":[{"id":"p1","content":"`p1`"},{"id":"p2","content":"`p2`"}],"key":"p2"}],"explanation":"6.0 和 8.0 两个站点达到 5 mg/L。`p1` 的分母是全部 6 个站点，2 / 6 ≈ **0.33**；`p2` 的分母是测到浓度的 4 个站点，2 / 4 = **0.5**。要求写的是“在测到浓度的站点中”，应当报告 **`p2`**，并写明 n = 4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：六个站点的硝酸盐浓度（mg/L），没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"station":["W1","W2","W3","W4","W5","W6"],"conc":[2.0,null,6.0,4.0,null,8.0]},"dtypes":{"conc":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py26.k3.x1","body":"要在报告里写表 plants 的平均高度。哪一句正确、完整？\n","slots":[{"id":"report","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"full","content":"平均高度 30.0 厘米，n = 4，另有 2 株没量到"},{"id":"rows","content":"平均高度 20.0 厘米，n = 6"},{"id":"unit","content":"平均高度 30.0 株，n = 4"},{"id":"n6","content":"平均高度 30.0 厘米，n = 6"}],"key":"full"}],"explanation":"“平均高度 30.0 厘米，n = 4，另有 2 株没量到”正确：120.0 厘米除以 4 株量到的幼苗。20.0 是除以全部 6 株的结果；30.0 配上 n = 6 说错了参与计算的株数；“30.0 株”把单位写成了个数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），没量到的为 NaN","columns":{"plant_id":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5","A6"],"height":[33.0,null,27.0,36.0,null,24.0]},"dtypes":{"height":"float"}}]},{"id":"py26.k3.x2","body":"要求是：“在量到高度的幼苗中，高度至少 25 厘米的占多少？”哪一段代码符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"mean_all","content":"```python\nshare = (plants[\"height\"] >= 25).mean()\n```\n"},{"id":"by_len","content":"```python\nshare = (plants[\"height\"] >= 25).sum() / len(plants)\n```\n"},{"id":"by_count","content":"```python\nshare = (plants[\"height\"] >= 25).sum() / plants[\"height\"].count()\n```\n"},{"id":"measured","content":"```python\nshare = plants[\"height\"].count() / len(plants)\n```\n"}],"key":"by_count"}],"explanation":"分母用 `plants[\"height\"].count()` 的那一段符合要求：3 株达到 25 厘米，除以量到高度的 4 株，得 0.75。直接对比较结果求 `mean()`，或者除以 `len(plants)`，分母都是全部 6 株，得 0.5；最后一段算的是“量到高度的幼苗占多少”，和 25 厘米无关。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），没量到的为 NaN","columns":{"plant_id":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5","A6"],"height":[33.0,null,27.0,36.0,null,24.0]},"dtypes":{"height":"float"}}]}]}]},{"id":"py27","title":"按组回答一个问题","summary":"读懂 df.groupby(\"分组列\")[\"值列\"].聚合()：先按组分开，组内照常汇总，再合成每组一行的结果；分清每条记录一行、每组一行和整张表一个数。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py26","py16"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 G：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`group` 是实验组标签，`signal` 是一次测量的值（任意单位），NaN 表示没测到。左边的原行索引是原表的行标签。\n\n上一节用掩码一次筛出一个组再汇总；这一节一行代码对每个组都汇总一遍。\n","wrapup":"读到 `groupby` 时，先找三样：按哪一列分组、对哪一列算、算什么；再说出结果的样子：每组一行，行标签是排好序的组名，有几个组就有几行。\n\n向同事或 AI 提要求时，可以说：“按 group 分组，对每组的 signal 求平均（跳过缺失），输出一张表，group 一列、signal 一列，每组一行。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py27.k1","title":"groupby 先分组再聚合","key":["py26","py16"],"links":["py26.k2"],"card":{"name":"分组聚合","aliases":["groupby","按组汇总"],"definition":"df.groupby(\"分组列\")[\"值列\"].聚合() 先按分组列的取值把行分成几组，在每组里对值列做同一种汇总，再把各组的结果合在一起。","conditions":["读代码时依次找三样：按哪一列分组、对哪一列算、算什么。","组内照常跳过缺失：每组的 mean 除以这一组的 count。"],"example":"```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()\n```\n表 G 里 control 组为 10.0、NaN、6.0，平均 8.0；drug 组为 8.0、13.0、12.0，平均 11.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"上一节要算 drug 组的平均，先用掩码筛出 drug 组，再求 `mean()`。组多了，一组一组筛很麻烦。下面这一行对每个组都算一遍：\n\n```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()\n```\n\n从左往右读三段：\n\n1. `groupby(\"group\")`：按 group 列的取值分组。表 G 里只有 drug 和 control 两种，于是分成两组。\n2. `[\"signal\"]`：在每一组里取出 signal 这一列。\n3. `.mean()`：对每一组的 signal 求平均。\n\n手算时也照这三步做：\n\n| 组 | 这一组的 signal | 平均 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| control | 10.0、NaN、6.0 | 8.0 |\n| drug | 8.0、13.0、12.0 | 11.0 |\n\n组内的汇总照[跳过缺失](repa:concept/py26.k2)的规则：control 组有 3 行，只有 2 个值，16.0 / 2 = 8.0。把 `.mean()` 换成 `.sum()`、`.count()`、`.max()`，就是对每组做另一种汇总。\n","example":{"id":"py27.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，写出每个组的结果。\n\n```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"means","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"mean","header":"平均","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"control","cells":{"group":"control","mean":8}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"group":"drug","mean":11}}]},{"id":"used","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"control 组的平均用到了几个值？","key":2}],"explanation":"control 组是索引 7、4、9 三行，signal 为 10.0、NaN、6.0，跳过 NaN 后平均 16.0 / 2 = **8.0**，用到 **2** 个值；drug 组是索引 31、22、15，(8.0 + 13.0 + 12.0) / 3 = **11.0**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py27.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码，填写 `total` 和 `n` 里每个组的值。\n\n```python\ntotal = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].sum()\nn = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].count()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"total","header":"total","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"control","cells":{"group":"control","total":16,"n":2}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"group":"drug","total":33,"n":3}}]}],"explanation":"control 组：10.0 + 6.0 = **16.0**，有值的 **2** 个；drug 组：8.0 + 13.0 + 12.0 = **33.0**，有值的 **3** 个。count 在每组里只数有值的格子，所以 control 组是 2 而不是 3。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py27.k1.q2","body":"阅读代码，说出它在做什么。\n\n```python\ndeepest = soil.groupby(\"plot\")[\"depth\"].max()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"key","type":"choice","prompt":"按哪一列分组？","options":[{"id":"site","content":"site"},{"id":"plot","content":"plot"},{"id":"depth","content":"depth"}],"key":"plot"},{"id":"value","type":"choice","prompt":"对哪一列做汇总？","options":[{"id":"site","content":"site"},{"id":"plot","content":"plot"},{"id":"depth","content":"depth"}],"key":"depth"},{"id":"how","type":"choice","prompt":"做什么汇总？","options":[{"id":"max","content":"取最大值"},{"id":"mean","content":"求平均"},{"id":"count","content":"数有几个"}],"key":"max"},{"id":"plot_c","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"地块 C 的结果是多少？","key":34}],"explanation":"按 **plot** 分组，对 **depth** 取**最大值**：每个地块里最深的那个采样点有多深。地块 C 有北坡 30 和东坡 34 两个采样点，结果是 **34**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个采样点的土层深度（厘米），plot 是所在地块","index":[5,12,3,8,21],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶"],"plot":["C","A","C","B","A"],"depth":[30,25,34,28,21]}}]},{"id":"py27.k1.q3","body":"要求是“每个组 signal 的最大值”。同事写了：\n\n```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"signal\")[\"group\"].max()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"problem","type":"choice","prompt":"问题在哪里？","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"分组列和值列写反了：按 signal 分组，对 group 取最大"},{"id":"agg","content":"应该用 mean 而不是 max"},{"id":"fine","content":"没有问题，结果就是每组的最大值"}],"key":"swapped"},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这段代码的结果有几行？","key":5},{"id":"drug_max","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"改对以后，drug 组的结果是多少？","key":13}],"explanation":"分组列和值列**写反了**。`groupby(\"signal\")` 把每个不同的 signal 值当作一组：5 个有值的 signal 各不相同，于是得到 **5** 行（NaN 那一行不成组），每行是这一组的 group 文字，回答的不是要求的问题。改成 `df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].max()` 后，drug 组的最大值是 **13.0**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py27.k1.r1","body":"把下面四块拼成一行代码，算出每个地块幼苗的平均高度，存进 `result`。每块都要用上。\n","slots":[{"id":"chunks","type":"order","items":[{"id":"mean","code":".mean()"},{"id":"start","code":"result = plants"},{"id":"column","code":"[\"height\"]"},{"id":"group","code":".groupby(\"plot\")"}],"key":["start","group","column","mean"]},{"id":"plot_b","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"地块 B 的平均高度是多少？","key":14}],"explanation":"拼成 `result = plants.groupby(\"plot\")[\"height\"].mean()`：先分组，再取 height 列，最后求平均。地块 B 有 15 和 13 两株，平均 **14.0**。\n\n先取列再分组（`plants[\"height\"].groupby(\"plot\")`）会报错，因为单独取出的 height 列里没有 plot；先求平均再取列，会对 plant_id 这样的文字列也求平均而报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），plot 是所在地块","columns":{"plant_id":["H1","H2","H3","H4","H5","H6"],"plot":["A","B","A","C","B","A"],"height":[12,15,10,9,13,14]}}]},{"id":"py27.k1.r2","body":"阅读代码，填写每个站点的结果。\n\n```python\navg = water.groupby(\"station\")[\"conc\"].mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"avg","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"station","header":"站点"},{"id":"value","header":"平均浓度","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"A","cells":{"station":"A","value":3}},{"id":"B","cells":{"station":"B","value":7}},{"id":"C","cells":{"station":"C","value":6}}]}],"explanation":"A 站：3.0 和 NaN，跳过 NaN 后只剩 3.0，平均 **3.0**；B 站：(6.0 + 8.0) / 2 = **7.0**；C 站：(5.0 + 7.0) / 2 = **6.0**。A 站的平均只来自一次测量，报告时最好附上 n。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：三个站点的多次采样浓度（mg/L），没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"station":["B","A","C","A","B","C"],"conc":[6.0,3.0,5.0,null,8.0,7.0]},"dtypes":{"conc":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py27.k1.x1","body":"屏幕上显示什么？`.loc[\"上海\"]` 按行标签取出上海那一组的值。\n\n```python\nby_city = survey.groupby(\"city\")[\"age\"].mean()\nprint(by_city.loc[\"上海\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","key":"33.0"}],"explanation":"显示 **33.0**。上海组是 R1、R3、R6 三位，年龄 30、36、33，平均 99 / 3 = 33.0。平均值是浮点数，所以显示 33.0 而不是 33。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：六位受访者的城市和年龄","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5","R6"],"city":["上海","北京","上海","广州","北京","上海"],"age":[30,41,36,25,39,33]}}]},{"id":"py27.k1.x2","body":"要求是“每种作物的总产量”。哪一行代码符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nresult = farm.groupby(\"yield_kg\")[\"crop\"].sum()\n```\n"},{"id":"whole","content":"```python\nresult = farm[\"yield_kg\"].sum()\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = farm.groupby(\"crop\")[\"yield_kg\"].sum()\n```\n"},{"id":"mean","content":"```python\nresult = farm.groupby(\"crop\")[\"yield_kg\"].mean()\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`farm.groupby(\"crop\")[\"yield_kg\"].sum()` 符合要求：按作物分组，对产量求和，wheat 为 15、corn 为 12、rice 为 3。`farm[\"yield_kg\"].sum()` 是全部地块的总产量 30，不分作物；把分组列和值列写反，是按产量分组去拼作物名；`.mean()` 算的是平均产量而不是总产量。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：六块试验地的作物和产量（千克）","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5","P6"],"crop":["wheat","corn","wheat","rice","corn","wheat"],"yield_kg":[4,5,6,3,7,5]}}]}]},{"id":"py27.k2","title":"区分每条记录与每组一行的结果","key":["py26","py16"],"links":["py16.k1"],"card":{"name":"每组一行","aliases":["分组结果的形状"],"definition":"分组汇总的结果每组一行：行数等于不同组的个数，行标签是排好序的组名，而不是原表的行索引。","conditions":["结果默认按组名排序，不按组在原表里第一次出现的顺序。","写成 [[\"signal\"]] 得到一张表；再接 reset_index()，组名会变成普通的一列。"],"example":"表 G 有 6 行；`df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()` 只有 2 行，行标签依次是 control、drug。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"同一张表，可以得到三种“粒度”的结果：\n\n| 代码 | 结果是什么 | 表 G 上有几个值 |\n|---|---|---:|\n| `df` | 每条记录一行 | 6 行 |\n| `df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()` | 每组一行 | 2 个 |\n| `df[\"signal\"].mean()` | 整张表一个数 | 1 个 |\n\n分组的结果是一列（Series），行标签是组名，不是原来的 31、7、22……。组名**默认按字母顺序排好**：表 G 里 drug 先出现，结果里却是 control 在前。行数等于有几个不同的组，和原表行数无关，所以不能把它和原表一行一行地对齐。`df` 本身也没有变。\n\n需要一张表时，有两处可以改：\n\n- 值列写成列名列表 `[[\"signal\"]]`，结果是一张表（[单列与多列](repa:concept/py16.k1)的区别照样成立）；\n- 再接 `.reset_index()`，组名从行标签变成普通的一列 group，行标签重新编为 0、1……。写成 `df.groupby(\"group\", as_index=False)[\"signal\"].mean()` 效果相同。\n","example":{"id":"py27.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"labels","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 的行标签是什么？按结果里的顺序排出来，不属于它的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"drug","content":"drug"},{"id":"control","content":"control"},{"id":"31","content":"31"},{"id":"7","content":"7"}],"key":["control","drug"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"df_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行之后，`df` 有几行？","key":6}],"explanation":"`result` 只有 **2** 行，行标签依次是 **control、drug**：组名按字母排序，虽然 drug 在原表里先出现；原行索引 31、7 不会出现在结果里。`df` 没有变，仍是 **6** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py27.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = soil.groupby(\"plot\")[\"depth\"].mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"labels","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"行标签按结果里的顺序排出来。","items":[{"id":"C","content":"C"},{"id":"A","content":"A"},{"id":"B","content":"B"},{"id":"5","content":"5"}],"key":["A","B","C"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"plot_a","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"地块 A 的值是多少？","key":23}],"explanation":"三个地块，结果 **3** 行，行标签按字母排成 **A、B、C**，与它们在原表里出现的先后（C、A、C、B、A）无关。地块 A 是南坡 25 和山顶 21，平均 **23.0**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个采样点的土层深度（厘米），plot 是所在地块","index":[5,12,3,8,21],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶"],"plot":["C","A","C","B","A"],"depth":[30,25,34,28,21]}}]},{"id":"py27.k2.q2","body":"阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"group\")[[\"signal\"]].mean().reset_index()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"group","content":"`group`"}],"key":["group","signal"]},{"id":"index","type":"choice","prompt":"`result` 的行标签是什么？","options":[{"id":"names","content":"control、drug"},{"id":"numbers","content":"0、1"},{"id":"original","content":"7、31"}],"key":"numbers"},{"id":"cell","type":"text","prompt":"行标签为 1 的那一行，group 是什么？","key":"drug"}],"explanation":"`[[\"signal\"]]` 让结果是一张表；`reset_index()` 把组名从行标签变成普通的一列，所以列依次是 **group、signal**，行标签重新编为 **0、1**。组名仍按字母排序，行 1 的 group 是 **drug**，signal 是 11.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py27.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 按 group 分组，对每组的 signal 求平均（跳过缺失）。结果是一张表：第一列 group，第二列 signal，每组一行，组名按字母顺序，行标签从 0 开始。不改变 `df`。\n\n作答框里是 AI 给的代码，它离需求还差两处。请改动它并提交，结果变量仍叫 `result`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"result = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].sum()\n","solution":"result = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().reset_index()\n","accepts":["result = df.groupby(\"group\")[[\"signal\"]].mean().reset_index()","result = df.groupby(\"group\", as_index=False)[\"signal\"].mean()"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()","why":"组名还是行标签，结果是一列而不是带 group 列的表"},{"code":"result = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].sum().reset_index()","why":"仍是求和而不是平均"},{"code":"result = df.groupby(\"group\", sort=False)[\"signal\"].mean().reset_index()","why":"关掉了排序，组按首次出现的顺序排列"},{"code":"result = df.groupby(\"group\").mean().reset_index()","why":"没有选出 signal 列，对文字列 sample_id 求平均会报错"},{"code":"result = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().reset_index(drop=True)","why":"drop=True 把组名直接丢掉了"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 G","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"group\": [\"control\", \"drug\"], \"signal\": [8.0, 11.0]})","df":"df"}},{"name":"三个组、首次出现的顺序不是字母顺序","hidden":true,"data":["G2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"group\": [\"control\", \"drug\", \"placebo\"], \"signal\": [7.0, 9.0, 4.0]})","df":"df"}},{"name":"只有两个组、drug 先出现","hidden":true,"data":["G3"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"group\": [\"control\", \"drug\"], \"signal\": [9.0, 7.0]})","df":"df"}}]}],"explanation":"要改两处：`.sum()` 改成 `.mean()`；再接 `.reset_index()`，让组名成为 group 列。\n\n```python\nresult = df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().reset_index()\n```\n\n写成 `df.groupby(\"group\", as_index=False)[\"signal\"].mean()` 也对。表 G 上结果是两行：control 8.0、drug 11.0。判分时还会换几张组的出现顺序不同、有缺失值的表运行你的代码。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 G","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","drug","control","drug","control"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,13.0,null,12.0,6.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py27.k2.r1","body":"运行 `by_crop = farm.groupby(\"crop\")[\"yield_kg\"].sum()` 之后，判断每句话对不对。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"by_crop 的行数和 farm 一样多","ok":false}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"by_crop 的第一行是 farm 里第一个出现的作物 wheat","ok":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"by_crop 的行标签是作物名","ok":true}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"运行之后 farm 仍有 6 行","ok":true}}]}],"explanation":"第 3、4 句对，第 1、2 句错。farm 有 6 行，但只有 corn、rice、wheat 三种作物，by_crop 是 3 行；组名按字母排序，第一行是 corn 而不是先出现的 wheat；分组汇总不改变 farm。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：六块试验地的作物和产量（千克）","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5","P6"],"crop":["wheat","corn","wheat","rice","corn","wheat"],"yield_kg":[4,5,6,3,7,5]}}]},{"id":"py27.k2.r2","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nby_city = survey.groupby(\"city\")[\"age\"].max()\nprint(len(survey))\nprint(len(by_city))\nprint(by_city.loc[\"北京\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":6},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":3},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行","key":41}],"explanation":"依次显示 **6、3、41**。survey 每位受访者一行，共 6 行；by_city 每个城市一行，上海、北京、广州共 3 行；北京组是 41 岁和 39 岁，最大值 41。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：六位受访者的城市和年龄","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5","R6"],"city":["上海","北京","上海","广州","北京","上海"],"age":[30,41,36,25,39,33]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py27.k2.x1","body":"同事发来分组统计的结果，要的是每个站点测到浓度的次数（没测到的不算）：一张表，第一列 station，第二列 conc 存次数，行标签从 0 开始，站点按字母顺序：\n\n```text\n  station  conc\n0       A     1\n1       B     2\n2       C     2\n```\n\n他说这是用表 water 算出来的，却没写代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"下面哪些代码在表 water 上运行，得到的 `result` 正好是上面这张表？选出所有的。","options":[{"id":"reset","content":"```python\nresult = water.groupby(\"station\")[\"conc\"].count().reset_index()\n```\n"},{"id":"as_index","content":"```python\nresult = water.groupby(\"station\", as_index=False)[\"conc\"].count()\n```\n"},{"id":"series","content":"```python\nresult = water.groupby(\"station\")[\"conc\"].count()\n```\n","feedback":"结果是一列（Series），station 在行标签里，不是一列。"},{"id":"frame_only","content":"```python\nresult = water.groupby(\"station\")[[\"conc\"]].count()\n```\n","feedback":"是一张表，但 station 还在行标签里，行标签不是 0、1、2。"},{"id":"total","content":"```python\nresult = water.groupby(\"station\")[\"conc\"].sum().reset_index()\n```\n","feedback":"sum 是把浓度加起来，A 站得 3.0，不是次数 1。"}],"key":["reset","as_index"]}],"explanation":"要的是一张表：station 是普通的一列，行标签是 0、1、2。\n\n- `.count().reset_index()`：先得到以 station 为行标签的一列，`reset_index()` 把 station 变回普通的一列，行标签重新编为 0、1、2。\n- `groupby(\"station\", as_index=False)`：一开始就不让 station 进行标签，结果相同。\n- 只写 `[\"conc\"].count()` 得到一列，station 在行标签里。\n- `[[\"conc\"]].count()` 得到一张表，但 station 仍在行标签里，要再接 `reset_index()`。\n- `sum()` 是把浓度加起来，不是数次数：A 站得 3.0，不是 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：三个站点的多次采样浓度（mg/L），没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"station":["B","A","C","A","B","C"],"conc":[6.0,3.0,5.0,null,8.0,7.0]},"dtypes":{"conc":"float"}}]},{"id":"py27.k2.x2","body":"写出每个表达式的结果里有几个值。一个单独的数算 1 个。\n","slots":[{"id":"sizes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"size","header":"有几个值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"column","cells":{"expr":"`plants[\"height\"]`","size":6}},{"id":"by_plot","cells":{"expr":"`plants.groupby(\"plot\")[\"height\"].mean()`","size":3}},{"id":"whole","cells":{"expr":"`plants[\"height\"].mean()`","size":1}},{"id":"by_id","cells":{"expr":"`plants.groupby(\"plant_id\")[\"height\"].mean()`","size":6}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **6、3、1、6**。取出的一列每株一个值；按 plot 分组每个地块一个值，A、B、C 共 3 个；整列求平均只有 1 个数。按 plant_id 分组时，每株幼苗编号都不同，各自成一组，于是又回到 6 个：每组一行，组有多少，结果就有多少行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），plot 是所在地块","columns":{"plant_id":["H1","H2","H3","H4","H5","H6"],"plot":["A","B","A","C","B","A"],"height":[12,15,10,9,13,14]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py28","title":"把分组统计口径写明确","summary":"用 .agg(输出列名=(\"源列\", \"操作\")) 把分组汇总的每一列写明白；分组列有缺失时用 dropna 说清要不要留下这些行，并用 size 与 count 核对行数。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py27","py19","py12"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。大多数题用表 B 和表 A：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`group` 是实验组标签，`signal` 是一次测量的值（任意单位）；NaN 表示缺失。表 A 里有一个样本没有标组。\n\n上一节的分组结果只有一列、名字沿用原来的列名。交给别人的汇总表往往要好几列，每一列是什么，要写在代码里，也要写在要求里。\n","wrapup":"读一段 `.agg(...)`，每一行都读成“输出列名 = （从哪一列取值，怎样算）”，然后只相信括号里的内容，列名只是名字。再核对一次行数：各组的 size 加起来等不等于原表行数，不等就是有行因为分组列缺失被丢掉了。\n\n向同事或 AI 提要求时，可以说：“按 group 分组，输出 mean_signal（signal 的平均，跳过缺失）和 n_valid（有 signal 的样本数）两列；没有标组的样本单独列为一组，不要丢掉。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py28.k1","title":"named aggregation 的固定（源列, 操作）配置指明输出","key":["py27"],"links":["py27.k2"],"card":{"name":"命名聚合","aliases":["agg","named aggregation"],"definition":".agg(输出列名=(\"源列\", \"操作\")) 写明结果的每一列：等号前是这一列的名字，括号里第一个位置是从哪一列取值，第二个位置是怎样算。","conditions":["结果的列按写的先后排列；每组一行，行标签是排好序的组名。","输出列名只是名字，算的是什么由括号里的源列和操作决定。"],"example":"```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"),\n    n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n表 B：control 组 mean_signal 10.0、n_valid 3；drug 组 10.5、2。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 B","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,11.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"上一节的 `df.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()` 只得到一列，名字沿用 signal。交给别人的汇总表常常要好几列，而且每列叫什么、怎么算都要说得清。这时写成：\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"),\n    n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n\n括号没有合上之前可以换行，所以这是一行代码分几行写。`.agg(...)` 里每一行都照同一个格式读：\n\n> **输出列名 = (\"从哪一列取值\", \"怎样算\")**\n\n圆括号里有两个位置：第一个位置写源列的名字，第二个位置写操作的名字，常用的有 `\"mean\"`、`\"sum\"`、`\"count\"`、`\"max\"`、`\"min\"`。所以 `n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\")` 的意思是：数一数每组 signal 有值的格子，结果放进叫 n_valid 的一列。\n\n结果每组一行，行标签是排好序的组名（和 [每组一行](repa:concept/py27.k2) 一样），列按写的先后排列。\n\n输出列名可以随便起，pandas 不会检查它和括号里是否相符：写 `mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"max\")` 也能运行，只是名不副实。核对一段 `.agg` 时，要看括号里的源列和操作，而不是只看列名。\n","example":{"id":"py28.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，说出 `summary` 的样子。\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"),\n    n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`summary` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"group","content":"`group`"},{"id":"n_valid","content":"`n_valid`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"mean_signal","content":"`mean_signal`"}],"key":["mean_signal","n_valid"]},{"id":"values","type":"table","prompt":"填写每组的值。","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"mean_signal","header":"mean_signal","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}},{"id":"n_valid","header":"n_valid","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"control","cells":{"group":"control","mean_signal":10,"n_valid":3}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"group":"drug","mean_signal":10.5,"n_valid":2}}]},{"id":"first","type":"choice","prompt":"`(\"signal\", \"count\")` 里的 `\"signal\"` 表示什么？","options":[{"id":"name","content":"输出列的名字"},{"id":"source","content":"从哪一列取值"},{"id":"key","content":"按哪一列分组"}],"key":"source"}],"explanation":"列依次是 **mean_signal、n_valid**，组名 control、drug 是行标签，不是列。control 组 signal 为 10.0、11.0、9.0，平均 **10.0**，有值 **3** 个；drug 组为 8.0、NaN、13.0，平均 **10.5**，有值 **2** 个。\n\n`(\"signal\", \"count\")` 里的 `\"signal\"` 是**从哪一列取值**；输出列的名字写在等号前面，分组列写在 `groupby` 里。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 B","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,11.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py28.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码，说出 `summary` 的样子。\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    total=(\"signal\", \"sum\"),\n    top=(\"signal\", \"max\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`summary` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"top","content":"`top`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"total","content":"`total`"}],"key":["total","top"]},{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"total","header":"total","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}},{"id":"top","header":"top","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}}],"rows":[{"id":"control","cells":{"group":"control","total":30,"top":11}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"group":"drug","total":21,"top":13}}]}],"explanation":"列依次是 **total、top**，和写的先后一致。control 组：10.0 + 11.0 + 9.0 = **30.0**，最大 **11.0**；drug 组跳过 NaN，8.0 + 13.0 = **21.0**，最大 **13.0**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 B","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,11.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py28.k1.q2","body":"要求是：“按 group 分组，mean_signal 是 signal 的平均，n_valid 是有 signal 的样本数。”同事写了：\n\n```python startLine=1\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"),\n    n_valid=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行不符合要求？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行：分组列写错了"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行：平均的源列写错了"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行：数的是 sample_id 有值的个数，不是 signal 有值的个数"}],"key":"l3"},{"id":"got","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这段代码算出的 drug 组 n_valid 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"right","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按要求应当是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"问题在**第 3 行**。`(\"sample_id\", \"count\")` 数的是 sample_id 有值的格子，每个样本都有编号，于是 drug 组得到 **3**，把 signal 缺失的 S_D 也算了进去。要求的是有 signal 的样本数，应写 `n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\")`，drug 组是 **2**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 B","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,11.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py28.k1.q3","body":"要求是：“按 group 分组，输出两列：peak 是每组 signal 的最大值；n 是每组有 signal 的样本数。”\n\n代码写成 `df.groupby(\"group\").agg(peak=(源列, 操作), n=(源列, 操作))`。把两处括号里的源列和操作填上。\n","slots":[{"id":"config","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"output","header":"输出列"},{"id":"source","header":"源列","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"sample_id","label":"sample_id"},{"id":"group","label":"group"},{"id":"signal","label":"signal"}]}},{"id":"op","header":"操作","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"mean","label":"mean"},{"id":"sum","label":"sum"},{"id":"count","label":"count"},{"id":"max","label":"max"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"peak","cells":{"output":"peak","source":"signal","op":"max"}},{"id":"n","cells":{"output":"n","source":"signal","op":"count"}}]}],"explanation":"peak 填 **(\"signal\", \"max\")**；n 填 **(\"signal\", \"count\")**：\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    peak=(\"signal\", \"max\"),\n    n=(\"signal\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n\nn 不能写 `(\"sample_id\", \"count\")`：sample_id 没有缺失，会把 signal 缺失的样本也数进去。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 B","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control","control","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,11.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py28.k1.r1","body":"要求是：“按地块 plot 分组，依次输出两列：deepest 是测到的最大深度；n_sites 是测到深度的采样点个数。”\n\n挑出需要的行，排成一段代码，结果存进 `summary`。不需要的行不要放进来。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"close","code":")"},{"id":"n_site","code":"n_sites=(\"site\", \"count\"),"},{"id":"deepest","code":"deepest=(\"depth\", \"max\"),"},{"id":"open","code":"summary = soil.groupby(\"plot\").agg("},{"id":"n_depth","code":"n_sites=(\"depth\", \"count\"),"},{"id":"deep_mean","code":"deepest=(\"depth\", \"mean\"),"}],"key":["open","deepest","n_depth","close"],"tests":[{"name":"表 soil","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"deepest\": [25.0, 33.0, 30.0], \"n_sites\": [2, 2, 1]}, index=[\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"])"}},{"name":"另一片样地","hidden":true,"data":["soil2"],"expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"deepest\": [18.0, 20.0], \"n_sites\": [1, 2]}, index=[\"A\", \"B\"])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsummary = soil.groupby(\"plot\").agg(\n    deepest=(\"depth\", \"max\"),\n    n_sites=(\"depth\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n\ndeepest 要的是最大值，用 `\"max\"` 而不是 `\"mean\"`；n_sites 要数的是测到深度的采样点，源列应是 depth：地块 C 的东坡没测到深度，`(\"site\", \"count\")` 会把它也数进去，得到 2 而不是 1。两列的先后也要照要求排。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：六个采样点的土层深度（厘米），plot 是所在地块，没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","山顶","谷底"],"plot":["C","A","C","B","A","B"],"depth":[30.0,25.0,null,28.0,21.0,33.0]},"dtypes":{"depth":"float"}}]},{"id":"py28.k1.r2","body":"阅读代码，填写 `summary` 里每个站点的值。\n\n```python\nsummary = water.groupby(\"station\").agg(\n    lowest=(\"ph\", \"min\"),\n    n=(\"ph\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"station","header":"站点"},{"id":"lowest","header":"lowest","input":{"type":"text","format":"number"}},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"S1","cells":{"station":"S1","lowest":7.2,"n":2}},{"id":"S2","cells":{"station":"S2","lowest":6.5,"n":2}},{"id":"S3","cells":{"station":"S3","lowest":8.0,"n":1}}]}],"explanation":"S1 测到 7.2 和 7.4（另一次没测到），最小 **7.2**，n 为 **2**；S2 测到 6.8 和 6.5，最小 **6.5**，n 为 **2**；S3 只有一次 8.0，n 为 **1**。lowest 和 n 都是从 ph 这一列算的。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"water","caption":"表 water：三个站点多次采样的 pH，没测到的为 NaN","columns":{"station":["S1","S2","S1","S3","S2","S1"],"ph":[7.2,6.8,null,8.0,6.5,7.4]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py28.k1.x1","body":"要求是：“按作物 crop 分组，依次输出两列：total_kg 是总产量，n_plots 是种这种作物的地块数。”哪一段代码符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nsummary = farm.groupby(\"crop\").agg(\n    total_kg=(\"yield_kg\", \"count\"),\n    n_plots=(\"yield_kg\", \"sum\"),\n)\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nsummary = farm.groupby(\"crop\").agg(\n    total_kg=(\"yield_kg\", \"sum\"),\n    n_plots=(\"plot\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n"},{"id":"mean","content":"```python\nsummary = farm.groupby(\"crop\").agg(\n    total_kg=(\"yield_kg\", \"mean\"),\n    n_plots=(\"plot\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n"},{"id":"order","content":"```python\nsummary = farm.groupby(\"crop\").agg(\n    n_plots=(\"plot\", \"count\"),\n    total_kg=(\"yield_kg\", \"sum\"),\n)\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"total_kg 用 `(\"yield_kg\", \"sum\")`、n_plots 用 `(\"plot\", \"count\")`、两列按要求的先后写的那一段符合要求：wheat 15 千克、3 块地，corn 13 千克、2 块，rice 3 千克、1 块。把 sum 和 count 交换，列名就名不副实；`\"mean\"` 算的是平均产量；n_plots 写在前面，列的先后与要求不符。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：六块试验地的作物和产量（千克）","columns":{"plot":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5","P6"],"crop":["wheat","corn","wheat","rice","corn","wheat"],"yield_kg":[4,6,6,3,7,5]}}]},{"id":"py28.k1.x2","body":"要求是：“按地块 plot 分组，avg_height 是量到的幼苗的平均高度。”同事写了：\n\n```python\nsummary = plants.groupby(\"plot\").agg(\n    avg_height=(\"height\", \"max\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"got","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"这段代码给地块 A 算出的 avg_height 是多少？","key":14},{"id":"right","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"按要求，地块 A 应当是多少？","key":13},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"应当怎样改？","options":[{"id":"name","content":"把列名 avg_height 改成 max_height"},{"id":"op","content":"把括号里的 \"max\" 改成 \"mean\""},{"id":"source","content":"把括号里的 \"height\" 改成 \"plant_id\""}],"key":"op"}],"explanation":"这段代码给地块 A 算出 **14.0**：括号里写的是 `\"max\"`，列名虽叫 avg_height，算的却是最大值。地块 A 量到 12.0 和 14.0（H3 没量到），平均应是 **13.0**。要满足要求，应把括号里的 **\"max\" 改成 \"mean\"**；只改列名会让名字对上，但算的仍不是平均高度。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：六株幼苗的高度（厘米），没量到的为 NaN","columns":{"plant_id":["H1","H2","H3","H4","H5","H6"],"plot":["A","B","A","B","A","B"],"height":[12.0,15.0,null,12.0,14.0,9.0]},"dtypes":{"height":"float"}}]}]},{"id":"py28.k2","title":"分组键缺失用 dropna 明确是否保留，并核对 count/size","key":["py19","py26"],"links":["py26.k1"],"card":{"name":"分组键缺失","aliases":["dropna","size 与 count"],"definition":"分组列是缺失（NaN）的行，groupby 默认整行丢掉、不进任何一组；写 dropna=False 才会把它们留成单独的一组。","conditions":["核对：各组 size 加起来应等于原表行数；少了，就是有行因分组列缺失被丢掉了。","size 数这一组有几行；count 只数源列里有值的格子。"],"example":"表 A 有 6 行，S_C 没有标组：默认分组只有 control（2 行）和 drug（3 行），共 5 行；dropna=False 多出一组 NaN（1 行）。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 A：S_C 没有标组","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control",null,"drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,12.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"表 A 里 S_C 的 group 是 NaN。分组时，这一行默认**整行丢掉**：它不属于 control，也不属于 drug，也不会单独成组，结果里根本看不到它，也没有任何提示。\n\n要发现这一点，在汇总里同时放两种计数：\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(\n    rows=(\"signal\", \"size\"),\n    n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n\n- `\"size\"` 数这一组**有几行**，源列里是不是缺失都算；\n- `\"count\"` 只数源列里**有值**的格子，和 [行数与 count](repa:concept/py26.k1) 里一样。\n\n表 A 上，control 组 rows 2、n_valid 2；drug 组 rows 3、n_valid 2（S_D 没测到）。rows 加起来是 5，而 `len(df)` 是 6：差的那一行就是没标组的 S_C。\n\n想把没标组的行留下，写 `df.groupby(\"group\", dropna=False)`，结果会多一行，组名显示为 NaN，排在最后。留下还是丢掉，是一条要写进要求的规则：丢掉时要报告丢了几行，留下时要说明这一组代表“没有标组”。\n","example":{"id":"py28.k2.e0","body":"两段代码分别得到 `s1` 和 `s2`。\n\n```python\ns1 = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(rows=(\"signal\", \"size\"))\ns2 = df.groupby(\"group\", dropna=False).agg(rows=(\"signal\", \"size\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"s1_groups","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s1` 有几行（几个组）？","key":2},{"id":"s1_total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s1` 的 rows 加起来是多少？","key":5},{"id":"s2_groups","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s2` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"s2_total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s2` 的 rows 加起来是多少？","key":6},{"id":"dropped","type":"text","prompt":"`s1` 里少了哪个样本？写出它的 sample_id。","key":"S_C"}],"explanation":"`s1` 只有 control、drug **2** 组，rows 加起来 **5**；`s2` 多出组名为 NaN 的一组，共 **3** 行，rows 加起来 **6**，等于 `len(df)`。`s1` 里少的是没有标组的 **S_C**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 A：S_C 没有标组","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control",null,"drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,12.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py28.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码，填写 `summary` 每一行的值。组名为 NaN 的那一行也要填。\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\", dropna=False).agg(\n    rows=(\"signal\", \"size\"),\n    n_valid=(\"signal\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"rows","header":"rows","input":"integer"},{"id":"n_valid","header":"n_valid","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"control","cells":{"group":"control","rows":2,"n_valid":2}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"group":"drug","rows":3,"n_valid":2}},{"id":"missing","cells":{"group":"NaN","rows":1,"n_valid":1}}]}],"explanation":"| 组 | rows | n_valid |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| control | 2 | 2 |\n| drug | 3 | 2 |\n| NaN | 1 | 1 |\n\ndrug 组有 3 行，但 S_D 的 signal 没测到，所以 size 是 3、count 是 2。NaN 组就是没标组的 S_C，它测到了 signal，两种计数都是 1。三组的 rows 加起来是 6，没有行被丢掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 A：S_C 没有标组","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control",null,"drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,12.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py28.k2.q2","body":"同事交来的汇总表是这样算的：\n\n```python\nsummary = df.groupby(\"group\").agg(rows=(\"signal\", \"size\"))\n```\n\n他发现 rows 加起来是 5，可表 A 明明有 6 行。\n","slots":[{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"少的那一行是怎么回事？","options":[{"id":"key_missing","content":"有一行 group 是缺失，默认分组时整行被丢掉了"},{"id":"value_missing","content":"有一行 signal 是缺失，size 没有数它"},{"id":"duplicate","content":"有两行重复，被合并成了一行"}],"key":"key_missing"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"想让这一行作为单独一组留在结果里，应当怎样改？","options":[{"id":"dropna","content":"在 groupby 里加上 dropna=False"},{"id":"count","content":"把 \"size\" 改成 \"count\""},{"id":"column","content":"把源列 signal 改成 sample_id"}],"key":"dropna"}],"explanation":"少的是 group 为缺失的 S_C：默认分组把分组列缺失的行**整行丢掉**。不是 signal 缺失的缘故：size 数行，S_D 的 signal 缺失照样被数进 drug 组。加上 **dropna=False** 后，S_C 会单独成为组名为 NaN 的一组，rows 加起来就是 6。把 size 换成 count 或换源列，都找不回整行被丢掉的 S_C。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"df","caption":"表 A：S_C 没有标组","index":[31,7,22,4,15,9],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E","S_F"],"group":["drug","control",null,"drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8.0,10.0,12.0,null,9.0,13.0]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py28.k2.r1","body":"有一晚的记录忘了写灯号。\n\n```python\ns1 = traps.groupby(\"trap\").agg(nights=(\"insects\", \"size\"))\ns2 = traps.groupby(\"trap\", dropna=False).agg(nights=(\"insects\", \"size\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"s1_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s1` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"s1_total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s1` 的 nights 加起来是多少？","key":5},{"id":"s2_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s2` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"t1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`s1` 里 T1 的 nights 是多少？","key":3}],"explanation":"`s1` 只有 T1、T2 两行，nights 共 **5**，N4 那一晚没写灯号，被整行丢掉了；`s2` 多出组名为 NaN 的一行，共 **3** 行。T1 有 N1、N3、N6 三晚，size 数的是行，N6 虽然没数虫子也算在内，所以是 **3**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"traps","caption":"表 traps：诱虫灯每晚的记录，有一晚忘了写灯号，有几晚没数","columns":{"night":["N1","N2","N3","N4","N5","N6"],"trap":["T1","T2","T1",null,"T2","T1"],"insects":[3.0,null,5.0,2.0,4.0,null]},"dtypes":{"insects":"float"}}]},{"id":"py28.k2.r2","body":"运行下面的代码之后，判断每句话对不对。\n\n```python\nsummary = survey.groupby(\"region\").agg(\n    people=(\"income\", \"size\"),\n    answered=(\"income\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"summary 的 people 加起来等于 len(survey)","ok":false}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"south 组的 people 比 answered 大","ok":true}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"没填地区的两位受访者在 summary 里单独成一组","ok":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"north 组的 people 和 answered 相等","ok":true}}]}],"explanation":"第 2、4 句对，第 1、3 句错。没填地区的 R3、R5 默认被整行丢掉，不会单独成组，所以 people 加起来是 4 而不是 6。south 组有 R2、R6 两人，R2 没填收入，people 为 2、answered 为 1；north 组的 R1、R4 都填了收入，两种计数都是 2。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：问卷记录，地区或收入没填的为 NaN","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5","R6"],"region":["north","south",null,"north",null,"south"],"income":[5.0,null,7.0,6.0,4.0,8.0]},"dtypes":{"income":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py28.k2.x1","body":"要求是：“按诊室 clinic 分组，依次输出两列：visits 是就诊人次（每行一次），timed 是记下了候诊时间的人次。没记诊室的就诊单独作为一组，不要丢掉。”哪一段代码符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"default","content":"```python\nsummary = visits.groupby(\"clinic\").agg(\n    visits=(\"wait_min\", \"size\"),\n    timed=(\"wait_min\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n"},{"id":"both_count","content":"```python\nsummary = visits.groupby(\"clinic\", dropna=False).agg(\n    visits=(\"wait_min\", \"count\"),\n    timed=(\"wait_min\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nsummary = visits.groupby(\"clinic\", dropna=False).agg(\n    visits=(\"wait_min\", \"size\"),\n    timed=(\"wait_min\", \"count\"),\n)\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nsummary = visits.groupby(\"clinic\", dropna=False).agg(\n    visits=(\"wait_min\", \"count\"),\n    timed=(\"wait_min\", \"size\"),\n)\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"带 `dropna=False`、visits 用 `\"size\"`、timed 用 `\"count\"` 的那一段符合要求：K1 3 人次、记了时间 2 人次；K2 2 人次、2 人次；没记诊室的 2 人次、2 人次。不写 dropna=False 会把没记诊室的 V3、V6 整行丢掉；visits 用 count 会漏掉 V2 这样没记时间的就诊；把 size 和 count 交换，两列就名不副实。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"visits","caption":"表 visits：门诊候诊时间（分钟），诊室或时间没记的为 NaN","columns":{"visit":["V1","V2","V3","V4","V5","V6","V7"],"clinic":["K2","K1",null,"K1","K2",null,"K1"],"wait_min":[10.0,null,15.0,20.0,5.0,8.0,12.0]},"dtypes":{"wait_min":"float"}}]},{"id":"py28.k2.x2","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\na = visits.groupby(\"clinic\").agg(n=(\"visit\", \"size\"))\nb = visits.groupby(\"clinic\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"visit\", \"size\"))\nprint(len(visits))\nprint(a[\"n\"].sum())\nprint(b[\"n\"].sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":7},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行","key":5},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行","key":7}],"explanation":"依次显示 **7、5、7**。表里 7 次就诊；默认分组丢掉了没记诊室的 V3、V6，各组加起来只有 5；加上 dropna=False 后，它们单独成组，加起来又是 7。拿各组 size 之和和原表行数对一下，就能发现有没有行被悄悄丢掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"visits","caption":"表 visits：门诊候诊时间（分钟），诊室或时间没记的为 NaN","columns":{"visit":["V1","V2","V3","V4","V5","V6","V7"],"clinic":["K2","K1",null,"K1","K2",null,"K1"],"wait_min":[10.0,null,15.0,20.0,5.0,8.0,12.0]},"dtypes":{"wait_min":"float"}}]}]}]},{"id":"py29","title":"拼两张表之前先检查键","summary":"用 pd.merge 按键把另一张表的列补上：分清 left 与 inner 留下哪些行，看出右表键重复造成的行数增长，用 validate 和 indicator 让关系错误和没配上的行显出来。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py25","py19","py12"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始，前面题目里的 `result` 等变量都已清除。大多数题用两张表：表 samples 是四个样本的测量记录，`sample_id` 是样本编号，`signal` 是测量值（任意单位），左边是原行索引；表 sites 记下每个样本是在哪个采样点（`site`）取的。按 `sample_id` 把采样点补到 samples 上，就是这一节要读的“拼表”。NaN 表示缺失值。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提拼表的需求时，可以这样说：“按 sample_id 把 sites 的 site 补到 samples 上：samples 每一行都保留，配不上的留空；sites 里每个 sample_id 最多一行，重复就报错；配不上的样本单独列出来。结果的行数应当等于 samples 的行数。”\n\n对应的代码是 `how=\"left\"`、`validate=\"many_to_one\"`、`indicator=True`。拿到别人的拼表代码，先看 how 留下谁，再问右表的键是不是唯一，最后比一比结果和左表的行数。\n","kps":[{"id":"py29.k1","title":"left/inner join 怎样保留记录","key":["py25","py19"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"按键拼表","aliases":["merge","left join","inner join","连接"],"definition":"pd.merge(左表, 右表, on=键列, how=...) 按键列的值把右表的列配到左表的行上：how=\"left\" 留下左表每一行，配不上的补 NaN；how=\"inner\" 只留两张表都有的键。","conditions":["只在右表里出现的键，left 和 inner 都不会加进结果。","结果的行顺序跟左表走，行索引重新编号为 0、1、2……，左表原来的行索引不保留。"],"example":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\nsamples 的 S_A、S_B、S_C、S_D 都留下；sites 里没有 S_C、S_D，它们的 site 是 NaN；只在 sites 里的 S_E 不出现。行索引变成 0、1、2、3。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},"lesson":"想知道每个样本是在哪个采样点取的，就要按两张表都有的 `sample_id`，把 sites 的 `site` 配到 samples 的每一行上。这一列叫**键**：两边的值相同，就认为说的是同一个样本。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n\n`pd.merge` 的第一张表叫左表，第二张叫右表；`on` 写键列，`how` 决定留下哪些行：\n\n- `how=\"left\"`：左表每一行都留下。右表里找不到的样本，补上的列是缺失值 NaN。\n- `how=\"inner\"`：只留两张表都有的键，配不上的左表行被丢掉。\n\n上面这行代码的结果：\n\n| 行索引 | sample_id | signal | site |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 0 | S_A | 8 | 南坡 |\n| 1 | S_B | 10 | 北坡 |\n| 2 | S_C | 13 | NaN |\n| 3 | S_D | 10 | NaN |\n\n换成 `how=\"inner\"`，只剩 S_A、S_B 两行。只在 sites 里出现的 S_E，两种写法都不会加进来。\n\n还有两处要留意：行的顺序跟左表走，不跟右表；结果的行索引重新从 0 编号，samples 原来的 31、7、22、4 没有带过来。`samples.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")` 是同一件事的另一种写法。\n","example":{"id":"py29.k1.e0","body":"要给每个样本补上采样点，同事写了下面这行。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 里依次是哪些样本？按结果的先后顺序排出 sample_id，结果里没有的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"SA","content":"S_A"},{"id":"SB","content":"S_B"},{"id":"SC","content":"S_C"},{"id":"SD","content":"S_D"},{"id":"SE","content":"S_E"}],"key":["SA","SB","SC","SD"]},{"id":"site","type":"text","prompt":"结果里 S_C 那一行的 site 是什么？","quick":["NaN"],"key":"NaN"},{"id":"index","type":"choice","prompt":"`result` 的行索引依次是","options":[{"id":"original","content":"31、7、22、4"},{"id":"renumbered","content":"0、1、2、3"},{"id":"sorted","content":"4、7、22、31"}],"key":"renumbered"}],"explanation":"| 行索引 | sample_id | signal | site |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 0 | S_A | 8 | 南坡 |\n| 1 | S_B | 10 | 北坡 |\n| 2 | S_C | 13 | NaN |\n| 3 | S_D | 10 | NaN |\n\n`how=\"left\"` 留下 samples 的**全部四行**，顺序和 samples 一样，不按 sites 的顺序。sites 里没有 S_C，它的 site 是 **NaN**；只在 sites 里的 S_E 不进结果。行索引重新编号为 **0、1、2、3**，原来的 31、7、22、4 没有带过来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py29.k1.q1","body":"这次同事只想要两张表都有记录的样本。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"留下了哪些样本？按结果的先后顺序排出 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"SA","content":"S_A"},{"id":"SB","content":"S_B"},{"id":"SC","content":"S_C"},{"id":"SD","content":"S_D"},{"id":"SE","content":"S_E"}],"key":["SA","SB"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":2},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第二个数（列数）","key":3}],"explanation":"只留 **S_A、S_B** 两行，顺序跟 samples 走（S_A 在前），不跟 sites（sites 里 S_B 在前）。S_C、S_D 在 sites 里找不到，inner 把它们丢掉；S_E 只在 sites 里，也不进结果。列是 sample_id、signal、site 三列，键列只出现一次，shape 为 **(2, 3)**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k1.q2","body":"同一对表，分别用两种写法拼接：\n\n```python\nleft_result = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\ninner_result = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n\nS_C 只在 samples 里，S_E 只在 sites 里。它们各自会不会出现在每种结果里？出现填 True，不出现填 False。\n","slots":[{"id":"presence","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"way","header":"结果"},{"id":"sc","header":"S_C 出现吗","input":"bool"},{"id":"se","header":"S_E 出现吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"left","cells":{"way":"left_result","sc":true,"se":false}},{"id":"inner","cells":{"way":"inner_result","sc":false,"se":false}}]}],"explanation":"| 结果 | S_C | S_E |\n|---|---|---|\n| left_result | True | False |\n| inner_result | False | False |\n\nleft 保留左表每一行，所以 S_C 在（site 为 NaN）；inner 只留两边都有的键，S_C 被丢掉。S_E 只在右表，**两种写法都不会加进来**：left 和 inner 都以左表为准，不会多出左表没有的样本。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k1.q3","body":"需求是：“给每个样本补上采样点；samples 里的样本一个都不能少，查不到采样点的留空。”同事写的是：\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n\n结果只有 2 行。应该把这一行改成哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"swap","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(sites, samples, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","feedback":"交换左右表，inner 仍然只留两边都有的键，S_C、S_D 还是没有。"},{"id":"left","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n"},{"id":"sitesleft","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(sites, samples, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","feedback":"这样 sites 成了左表，留下的是 sites 的每一行：S_E 进来了，S_C、S_D 还是没有。"}],"key":"left"}],"explanation":"改成 `pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")`：samples 是左表，`how=\"left\"` 让它的四行都留下，查不到采样点的 S_C、S_D 的 site 为 NaN。\n\n只交换两张表的位置没有用：inner 不管谁在左边，都只留两边都有的键；把 sites 放在左边再用 left，留下的就成了 sites 的每一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py29.k1.r1","body":"同事用下面某一行代码，从 plants 和 plots 得到了上面第三张表 result。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"是哪一行？","options":[{"id":"plotsfirst","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plots, plants, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","feedback":"plots 在左边时，行按 plots 的顺序排（P4 在 P2 前面），列也是 plot 在 height 前面。"},{"id":"left","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","feedback":"left 会留下 plants 的全部四株，P1、P3 的 plot 为 NaN。"},{"id":"inner","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n"}],"key":"inner"},{"id":"other","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果写成 `pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\")`，result 有几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"是 `pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"inner\")`。result 只有 P2、P4：这两株在两张表里都有，P1、P3 在 plots 里找不到被丢掉，只在 plots 里的 P7 不进结果。行的顺序（P2 在前）和列的顺序（height 在 plot 前）都跟 plants 走，说明 plants 是左表。\n\n换成 left，plants 的 **4** 株都留下，P1、P3 的 plot 为 NaN。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：四株植株的株高（厘米）","index":[12,5,30,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"height":[21,18,25,19]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：植株种在哪个地块","showIndex":false,"columns":{"plant_id":["P4","P7","P2"],"plot":["乙","丙","甲"]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"shown","caption":"同事得到的 result","index":[0,1],"indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["P2","P4"],"height":[18,19],"plot":["甲","乙"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k1.r2","body":"阅读代码，按 `result` 的行顺序，写出每一行的 resp_id 和 region；没有值的写 NaN。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(survey, regions, on=\"resp_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":5},{"id":"rows","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"pos","header":"行索引"},{"id":"resp","header":"resp_id","input":"text"},{"id":"region","header":"region","input":{"type":"text","quick":["NaN"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"pos":"0","resp":"R1","region":"华东"}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"pos":"1","resp":"R2","region":"NaN"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"pos":"2","resp":"R3","region":"华北"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"pos":"3","resp":"R4","region":"西南"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"pos":"4","resp":"R5","region":"NaN"}}]}],"explanation":"| 行索引 | resp_id | score | region |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 0 | R1 | 4 | 华东 |\n| 1 | R2 | 2 | NaN |\n| 2 | R3 | 5 | 华北 |\n| 3 | R4 | 3 | 西南 |\n| 4 | R5 | 4 | NaN |\n\n`how=\"left\"` 留下 survey 的 **5** 行，顺序跟 survey 走；R2、R5 在 regions 里找不到，region 为 NaN；只在 regions 里的 R9 不进结果。行索引重新编号为 0 到 4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：五份问卷的满意度评分（1–5）","index":[3,9,1,6,2],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"resp_id":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5"],"score":[4,2,5,3,4]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"regions","caption":"表 regions：问卷来自哪个地区","showIndex":false,"columns":{"resp_id":["R3","R1","R4","R9"],"region":["华北","华东","西南","华南"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py29.k1.x1","body":"```python\nby_left = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"left\")\nby_inner = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nleft","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`by_left` 有几行？","key":4},{"id":"ninner","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`by_inner` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"dropped","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"哪些水样在 `by_left` 里有、在 `by_inner` 里没有？按它们在 `by_left` 里的先后排出 bottle_id。","items":[{"id":"B1","content":"B1"},{"id":"B2","content":"B2"},{"id":"B3","content":"B3"},{"id":"B4","content":"B4"},{"id":"B8","content":"B8"}],"key":["B1","B3"]}],"explanation":"`by_left` 有 **4** 行：bottles 的每瓶水样都留下，B1、B3 的 lab 为 NaN。`by_inner` 只有 B2、B4 两行，被丢掉的是在 labs 里找不到的 **B1、B3**。B8 只在 labs 里，两种结果都没有它。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"bottles","caption":"表 bottles：四瓶水样的 pH","index":[20,3,11,7],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"bottle_id":["B1","B2","B3","B4"],"ph":[7.1,6.8,7.4,6.9]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"labs","caption":"表 labs：水样送到了哪个实验室","showIndex":false,"columns":{"bottle_id":["B2","B8","B4"],"lab":["甲","丙","乙"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k1.x2","body":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n\n关于 `result`，下面哪些说法正确？选出所有正确的。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"index","content":"`result` 的行索引仍是 20、3、11、7"},{"id":"kept","content":"bottles 的四瓶水样都在 `result` 里"},{"id":"b8","content":"只在 labs 里登记的 B8 也在 `result` 里"},{"id":"b3nan","content":"B3 那一行的 lab 是 NaN"},{"id":"two","content":"`result` 只有 2 行"}],"key":["kept","b3nan"]}],"explanation":"正确的是“bottles 的四瓶水样都在 result 里”和“B3 那一行的 lab 是 NaN”。left 留下左表每一行，B3 在 labs 里找不到，lab 补 NaN。\n\nB8 只在右表，不会加进来；只有 2 行的是 inner 的结果；行索引重新编号为 0、1、2、3，不再是 20、3、11、7。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"bottles","caption":"表 bottles：四瓶水样的 pH","index":[20,3,11,7],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"bottle_id":["B1","B2","B3","B4"],"ph":[7.1,6.8,7.4,6.9]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"labs","caption":"表 labs：水样送到了哪个实验室","showIndex":false,"columns":{"bottle_id":["B2","B8","B4"],"lab":["甲","丙","乙"]}}]}]},{"id":"py29.k2","title":"一对多造成行数增长","key":["py25"],"links":["py25.k2"],"card":{"name":"一对多行数增长","aliases":["一对多","行数膨胀","键重复"],"definition":"右表里同一个键有几行，左表这个键的每一行就配出几行；所以右表的键有重复时，拼出的结果比左表的行多。","conditions":["left 的结果行数 = 左表每行配上的行数之和，一行也配不上的算 1；inner 配不上的不算。","多出的行不报错，之后数样本、算平均会把同一个值重复算；拼之前用 duplicated 查右表的键。"],"example":"sites 里 S_A 有南坡、西坡两行，`pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")` 得到 5 行：S_A 两行（signal 8 出现两次），S_B、S_C、S_D 各一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：S_A 被记了两次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E","S_A"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"]}}]},"lesson":"上一个知识点里，sites 每个样本只有一行。如果 sites 里 S_A 被记了两次，一次南坡、一次西坡，samples 的 S_A 会和这两行**都**配上：\n\n| 行索引 | sample_id | signal | site |\n|---:|---|---:|---|\n| 0 | S_A | 8 | 南坡 |\n| 1 | S_A | 8 | 西坡 |\n| 2 | S_B | 10 | 北坡 |\n| 3 | S_C | 13 | NaN |\n| 4 | S_D | 10 | NaN |\n\n规则是：左表的每一行，右表里有几行同样的键，就配出几行。一行也配不上时，left 仍留它一行（补 NaN），inner 不留。所以 left 结果的行数，是左表每行“配上几行，至少算 1”加起来：这里 2 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 5。\n\n多出来的行不会报错，看起来也很正常。可之后数样本、算平均，S_A 和它的 8 都会被算两次。所以拼之前，先用 [duplicated](repa:concept/py25.k2) 查右表的键有没有重复：\n\n```python\nsites.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\"], keep=False)\n```\n\n有 True 就说明这个键在右表里不止一行。这时先弄清哪一行对、该怎样处理，再拼表。\n","example":{"id":"py29.k2.e0","body":"这次的 sites 里，S_A 被记了两次。阅读代码，回答下面的问题。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":5},{"id":"counts","type":"table","prompt":"每个样本在 `result` 里出现几次？","columns":[{"id":"sid","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"n","header":"出现次数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"sid":"S_A","n":2}},{"id":"b","cells":{"sid":"S_B","n":1}},{"id":"c","cells":{"sid":"S_C","n":1}},{"id":"d","cells":{"sid":"S_D","n":1}}]}],"explanation":"**5** 行。S_A 在 sites 里有南坡、西坡两行，samples 的 S_A 配上了两行，所以出现 **2** 次，signal 8 也跟着出现两次。S_B 配上一行；S_C、S_D 配不上，left 仍各留一行，site 为 NaN。合起来 2 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 5。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：S_A 被记了两次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E","S_A"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py29.k2.q1","body":"这份 sites 里，S_B 被记了三次。\n\n```python\nby_left = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\nby_inner = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nleft","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`by_left` 有几行？","key":6,"feedback":[{"when":4,"message":"S_B 在 sites 里有三行，samples 的 S_B 会配出三行。"}]},{"id":"ninner","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`by_inner` 有几行？","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":6,"message":"inner 不留配不上的行，S_C、S_D 不算。"}]}],"explanation":"逐个样本数配上几行：S_A 1 行，S_B 3 行，S_C、S_D 各 0 行。\n\nleft 里配不上的也留一行：1 + 3 + 1 + 1 = **6**。inner 只算配上的：1 + 3 = **4**。两种写法都因为 S_B 重复而多出了行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"另一份 sites：S_B 被记了三次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_B","S_B"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k2.q2","body":"同事拼完表后，用下面的代码数样本数，屏幕显示 5，可是 samples 里只有 4 个样本。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\nprint(len(result))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"key","type":"text","prompt":"sites 里哪个 sample_id 不止一行？","key":"S_A"},{"id":"reason","type":"choice","prompt":"多出的一行是怎么来的？","options":[{"id":"extra","content":"sites 独有的 S_E 被加进了结果","feedback":"left 以左表为准，只在右表的键不会加进来。"},{"id":"nan","content":"配不上的 S_C、S_D 被各算了两次","feedback":"配不上的样本在 left 里只留一行。"},{"id":"dup","content":"S_A 在 sites 里有两行，samples 的 S_A 配上了两行"}],"key":"dup"}],"explanation":"sites 里 **S_A** 有两行（南坡、西坡），samples 的 S_A 和两行都配上，结果多出一行。S_E 只在右表，不会进 left 的结果；S_C、S_D 配不上，各留一行。\n\n`len(result)` 数的是行数，不是样本数。右表的键有重复时，两者就不再相等。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：S_A 被记了两次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E","S_A"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k2.q3","body":"拼表之前，先查 sites 的键有没有重复：\n\n```python\nflags = sites.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\"], keep=False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"flags","type":"table","prompt":"按 sites 的行顺序填写 `flags` 的值。","columns":[{"id":"sid","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"site","header":"site"},{"id":"flag","header":"flags","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"sid":"S_B","site":"北坡","flag":false}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"sid":"S_A","site":"南坡","flag":true}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"sid":"S_E","site":"东坡","flag":false}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"sid":"S_A","site":"西坡","flag":true}}]},{"id":"extra","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"用这份 sites 和 samples 按 sample_id 做 left 拼接，结果比 samples 多几行？","key":1}],"explanation":"`flags` 依次为 **False、True、False、True**：`keep=False` 把重复键的每一次出现都标成 True，两行 S_A 都是 True。\n\nS_A 在 sites 里有两行，samples 的 S_A 会配出两行，所以结果比 samples 多 **1** 行。看到 True，就该先弄清 S_A 到底在南坡还是西坡，再拼表。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：S_A 被记了两次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E","S_A"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py29.k2.r1","body":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(survey, regions, on=\"resp_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n\n运行之后，下面哪些说法正确？选出所有正确的。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"changed","content":"survey 本身也变成了 7 行"},{"id":"seven","content":"`result` 有 7 行"},{"id":"r4gone","content":"R4 在 regions 里找不到，被丢掉了"},{"id":"r3three","content":"R3 的评分 5 在 `result` 里出现了 3 次"}],"key":["seven","r3three"]}],"explanation":"正确的是“result 有 7 行”和“R3 的评分 5 出现了 3 次”。逐份问卷数配上几行：R1 1 行，R2 1 行，R3 3 行，R4、R5 配不上但 left 各留一行，合计 1 + 1 + 3 + 1 + 1 = 7。R3 的每一行都带着同一个评分 5。\n\nR4 没有被丢掉，它的 region 是 NaN；`pd.merge` 得到的是新表，survey 仍是 5 行。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：五份问卷的满意度评分（1–5）","index":[3,9,1,6,2],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"resp_id":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5"],"score":[4,2,5,3,4]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"regions","caption":"表 regions：有的问卷登记了不止一次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"resp_id":["R1","R3","R2","R3","R3"],"region":["华东","华北","西南","华北","东北"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k2.r2","body":"表 plants 每株植物一行。表 plots 登记每株所在的地块，P2 被登记了两次（甲和丁），负责人说以最后登记的为准。\n\n需求：给 plants 的每株植物补上地块 plot，植株一株都不能少，也不能因为重复登记多出行；没有登记的植株，plot 留空。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一段代码符合需求？","options":[{"id":"dedupe_right","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plant_id\"], keep=\"last\"), on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n"},{"id":"keep_first","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plant_id\"]), on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","feedback":"去重了，但留下的是第一次登记的甲；负责人说以最后登记的为准。"},{"id":"dedupe_left","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plant_id\"], keep=\"last\"), plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","feedback":"重复的是 plots 里的 P2，对 plants 去重没有用，结果还是多出一行。"},{"id":"validate","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\", validate=\"many_to_one\")\n```\n","feedback":"validate 只检查，不修正；plots 的 P2 重复，这一行直接报 MergeError。"}],"key":"dedupe_right"},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按需求，结果应当有几行？","key":4}],"explanation":"重复出在右表 plots：P2 有甲、丁两行，直接合并会让 P2 配出两行。要先把右表整理成每株只有一行，再合并：`plots.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plant_id\"], keep=\"last\")` 按植株编号去重，留下最后登记的那一条（丁）。\n\n只对左表去重没有用，重复的不在左表；`validate=\"many_to_one\"` 是发现问题就报错，不会替你选留哪一条；`keep=\"first\"`（缺省）留下的是甲，不符合“以最后登记的为准”。\n\n这样 `result` 有 **4** 行，每株一行：P2 的 plot 是丁，P4 是乙，没登记的 P1、P3 留空。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：四株植株的株高（厘米）","index":[12,5,30,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"height":[21,18,25,19]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：P2 登记了两个地块","showIndex":false,"columns":{"plant_id":["P2","P4","P2","P7"],"plot":["甲","乙","丁","丙"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py29.k2.x1","body":"```python\nby_left = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"left\")\nby_inner = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"counts","type":"table","prompt":"每瓶水样在两个结果里各出现几次？","columns":[{"id":"bid","header":"bottle_id"},{"id":"left","header":"在 by_left 里","input":"integer"},{"id":"inner","header":"在 by_inner 里","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"b1","cells":{"bid":"B1","left":1,"inner":1}},{"id":"b2","cells":{"bid":"B2","left":2,"inner":2}},{"id":"b3","cells":{"bid":"B3","left":1,"inner":0}},{"id":"b4","cells":{"bid":"B4","left":3,"inner":3}}]}],"explanation":"| bottle_id | labs 里的行数 | 在 by_left 里 | 在 by_inner 里 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| B1 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\n| B2 | 2 | 2 | 2 |\n| B3 | 0 | 1 | 0 |\n| B4 | 3 | 3 | 3 |\n\n配上几行就出现几次；B3 在 labs 里一行都没有，left 留它一行（lab 为 NaN），inner 不留。by_left 共 7 行、by_inner 共 6 行，都比 bottles 的 4 行多。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"bottles","caption":"表 bottles：四瓶水样的 pH","index":[20,3,11,7],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"bottle_id":["B1","B2","B3","B4"],"ph":[7.1,6.8,7.4,6.9]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"labs","caption":"表 labs：有的水样登记了不止一次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"bottle_id":["B2","B1","B4","B2","B4","B4"],"lab":["甲","乙","乙","丙","甲","丙"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k2.x2","body":"这次 bottles 里 B1 测了两次 pH，labs 里每瓶水样只登记一次。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"left\")\nprint(len(bottles))\nprint(len(result))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":5},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":5},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么两个数一样？","options":[{"id":"merged","content":"bottles 里重复的 B1 被合并成了一行"},{"id":"unique","content":"labs 里每个 bottle_id 只有一行，bottles 的每一行都只配上一行"},{"id":"dedup","content":"pd.merge 会自动去掉键重复的行"}],"key":"unique"}],"explanation":"两行都显示 **5**。行数会不会变多，要看**右表**的键：labs 里每瓶水样只有一行，bottles 的每一行（包括两行 B1）都只配上一行，所以结果仍是 5 行，两行 B1 都留着，各自配上同一个实验室。\n\n左表里同一个键出现几次没关系，这正是“左边多、右边一”的正常情况。pd.merge 不会合并或去掉重复的行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"bottles","caption":"表 bottles：B1 测了两次 pH","index":[20,3,11,7,15],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"bottle_id":["B1","B2","B3","B4","B1"],"ph":[7.1,6.8,7.4,6.9,7.2]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"labs","caption":"表 labs：每瓶水样送到了哪个实验室","showIndex":false,"columns":{"bottle_id":["B3","B1","B4","B2"],"lab":["甲","乙","甲","丙"]}}]}]},{"id":"py29.k3","title":"validate 与 indicator 暴露关系错误和未匹配项","key":["py25","py19"],"links":["py17.k1","py19.k1"],"card":{"name":"validate 与 indicator","aliases":["validate","indicator","_merge","MergeError"],"definition":"validate=\"many_to_one\" 要求右表每个键最多一行，不满足就报 MergeError；indicator=True 加一列 _merge，标出每行是 both（配上了）还是 left_only（只在左表）。","conditions":["validate 只查键有没有重复，不查配不配得上；没配上的要看 _merge 去数。","两张表的键列都有缺失时，pandas 会让缺失的键互相配上；拼之前先用 isna 查键列。"],"example":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\",\n                  validate=\"many_to_one\", indicator=True)\n```\nsites 的键不重复，不报错；_merge 依次为 both、both、left_only、left_only，S_C、S_D 没配上。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},"lesson":"行数变多不会报错，配不上的行也只是悄悄补 NaN。`pd.merge` 有两个参数，能把这两件事摆到明面上。\n\n**validate 写下两张表的键是什么关系。** `validate=\"many_to_one\"` 的意思是“左边多、右边一”：左表里同一个键可以有好几行（比如同一个样本测了两次），右表里每个键最多一行。右表的键一旦重复，`pd.merge` 不再悄悄多出行，而是报错 `MergeError`，程序停在这一行。同样的读法，`\"one_to_many\"` 是“左边一、右边多”，`\"one_to_one\"` 要求两边的键都不重复。validate 只检查键有没有重复，不管配不配得上。\n\n**indicator 给每一行标出来历。** 加上 `indicator=True`，结果多出一列 `_merge`：`both` 是两边都有，`left_only` 是只在左表、没配上。（`right_only` 只出现在保留右表独有键的拼法里，left 和 inner 都不会有。）\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\",\n                  validate=\"many_to_one\", indicator=True)\nunmatched = result.loc[result[\"_merge\"] == \"left_only\", [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n\n第二行用[布尔掩码](repa:concept/py17.k1)取出没配上的样本，交给负责人核对。\n\n还有一点要先查：如果两张表的键列都有缺失值，pandas 会让缺失的键互相配上，这和很多人的直觉不同。拼之前，先用 [isna](repa:concept/py19.k1) 看看键列有没有缺失。\n","example":{"id":"py29.k3.e0","body":"阅读代码，说出运行的结果。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\",\n                  validate=\"many_to_one\", indicator=True)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"choice","prompt":"这一行会报错吗？","options":[{"id":"merge-error","content":"报 MergeError"},{"id":"no","content":"不报错，正常得到 result"}],"key":"no"},{"id":"merge","type":"table","prompt":"按结果的行顺序填写 `_merge` 列。","columns":[{"id":"sid","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"merge","header":"_merge","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both","label":"both"},{"id":"leftonly","label":"left_only"},{"id":"rightonly","label":"right_only"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"sid":"S_A","merge":"both"}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"sid":"S_B","merge":"both"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"sid":"S_C","merge":"leftonly"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"sid":"S_D","merge":"leftonly"}}]},{"id":"unmatched","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`_merge` 为 left_only 的有几行？","key":2}],"explanation":"**不报错**：sites 里每个 sample_id 只有一行，符合“左边多、右边一”。\n\n`_merge` 依次为 **both、both、left_only、left_only**：S_A、S_B 在两张表里都有；S_C、S_D 只在 samples 里，没配上。所以 left_only 有 **2** 行。只在 sites 里的 S_E 不进 left 的结果，也就没有 right_only。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py29.k3.q1","body":"这次的 sites 里，S_A 被记了两次。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\", validate=\"many_to_one\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这一行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"five","content":"不报错，result 有 5 行"},{"id":"error","content":"报 MergeError，没有得到 result"},{"id":"four","content":"不报错，result 有 4 行，重复的 S_A 只留一行","feedback":"validate 不会替你挑一行留下，它只检查，不满足就报错。"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"without","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果去掉 `validate=\"many_to_one\"`，这一行不报错，result 有几行？","key":5}],"explanation":"**报 MergeError**。`many_to_one` 要求右表每个 sample_id 最多一行，sites 里 S_A 有两行，不满足，程序停在这一行。\n\n去掉 validate，它就照常拼出 **5** 行，S_A 多出一行，而且不会提醒任何人。validate 的用处就在这里：把“右表每个键只有一行”这个前提写进代码，不满足时立刻停下。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：S_A 被记了两次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E","S_A"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k3.q2","body":"阅读代码，说出 `unmatched` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\", indicator=True)\nunmatched = result.loc[result[\"_merge\"] == \"left_only\", [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`unmatched` 里有哪些样本？按先后顺序排出 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"SA","content":"S_A"},{"id":"SB","content":"S_B"},{"id":"SC","content":"S_C"},{"id":"SD","content":"S_D"},{"id":"SE","content":"S_E"}],"key":["SC","SD"]},{"id":"index","type":"choice","prompt":"`unmatched` 的行索引是","options":[{"id":"original","content":"22、4"},{"id":"zeroone","content":"0、1"},{"id":"twothree","content":"2、3"}],"key":"twothree"}],"explanation":"`unmatched` 里是 **S_C、S_D**：它们在 sites 里找不到，`_merge` 为 left_only。\n\n行索引是 **2、3**。`result` 的行索引已经重新编号为 0 到 3，`.loc` 用掩码选行时保留的是 `result` 的标签，所以是 2、3；samples 原来的 22、4 在拼表时就没有带过来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：四个样本的测量值","index":[31,7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[8,10,13,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本在哪个采样点取的","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_A","S_E"],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k3.q3","body":"负责人的要求是：“给每个样本补上采样点：samples 里的样本一个不能少，也不能因为 sites 记重了而多出行——sites 里同一个样本出现两次就立刻报错；配不上的样本要能单独列出来。”\n\n把它对应到 `pd.merge(samples, sites, on=\"sample_id\", ...)` 的三个参数。\n","slots":[{"id":"how","type":"choice","prompt":"how","options":[{"id":"inner","content":"`how=\"inner\"`"},{"id":"left","content":"`how=\"left\"`"}],"key":"left"},{"id":"validate","type":"choice","prompt":"validate","options":[{"id":"none","content":"不写 validate"},{"id":"onemany","content":"`validate=\"one_to_many\"`"},{"id":"manyone","content":"`validate=\"many_to_one\"`"}],"key":"manyone"},{"id":"indicator","type":"choice","prompt":"indicator","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"`indicator=True`"},{"id":"no","content":"不写 indicator"}],"key":"yes"}],"explanation":"`how=\"left\"`、`validate=\"many_to_one\"`、`indicator=True`。\n\n“一个不能少”要 left，inner 会丢掉配不上的样本；“sites 记重了就报错”是右表每个键最多一行，也就是“左边多、右边一”，`one_to_many` 检查的是左表，方向反了，不写 validate 则只会悄悄多出行；“配不上的单独列出来”可以用 `_merge` 为 left_only 的行取出。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py29.k3.r1","body":"plants 里同一株可以量好几次（P1 就有两行），plots 里每株只能登记一个地块。要让拼表在 plots 的 plant_id 有重复时报错、没有重复时照常运行，应该用哪一行？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"oneone","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\", validate=\"one_to_one\")\n```\n","feedback":"one_to_one 还要求 plants 的键不重复；P1 量了两次，现在就会报错。"},{"id":"none","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","feedback":"不写 validate，plots 记重了也不会报错，只会悄悄多出行。"},{"id":"manyone","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\", validate=\"many_to_one\")\n```\n"},{"id":"onemany","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\", validate=\"one_to_many\")\n```\n","feedback":"one_to_many 要求的是 plants 的键不重复，方向反了；P1 量了两次，现在就会报错。"}],"key":"manyone"}],"explanation":"用 `validate=\"many_to_one\"`：左表 plants 里同一株可以有多行，右表 plots 里每株最多一行。现在的 plots 没有重复，照常运行；plots 一旦记重，就报 MergeError。\n\n`one_to_one` 和 `one_to_many` 都要求 plants 的键不重复，P1 有两行，现在就会报错；不写 validate 则永远不会报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：P1 量了两次株高（厘米）","index":[12,5,30,8,41],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P1"],"height":[21,18,25,19,22]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：植株种在哪个地块","showIndex":false,"columns":{"plant_id":["P4","P7","P2"],"plot":["乙","丙","甲"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k3.r2","body":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(plants, plots, on=\"plant_id\", how=\"left\", indicator=True)\n```\n\n关于 `result`，下面哪些说法正确？选出所有正确的。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"boththree","content":"`_merge` 为 both 的有 3 行"},{"id":"p7right","content":"P7 那一行的 `_merge` 是 right_only"},{"id":"noright","content":"`_merge` 列里没有 right_only"},{"id":"leftnan","content":"`_merge` 为 left_only 的行，plot 都是 NaN"}],"key":["noright","leftnan"]}],"explanation":"正确的是“没有 right_only”和“left_only 的行，plot 都是 NaN”。left 以 plants 为准：P2、P4 配上了，是 both（2 行，不是 3 行）；P1、P3 没配上，是 left_only，plot 补 NaN。P7 只在 plots 里，根本不进结果，所以也没有 right_only 的行。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：四株植株的株高（厘米）","index":[12,5,30,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"height":[21,18,25,19]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：植株种在哪个地块","showIndex":false,"columns":{"plant_id":["P4","P7","P2"],"plot":["乙","丙","甲"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py29.k3.x1","body":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(bottles, labs, on=\"bottle_id\", how=\"left\", validate=\"many_to_one\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这一行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"seven","content":"不报错，result 有 7 行"},{"id":"four","content":"不报错，result 有 4 行"},{"id":"error","content":"报 MergeError"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"culprits","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"labs 里哪些 bottle_id 不止一行？选出所有的。","options":[{"id":"B1","content":"B1"},{"id":"B2","content":"B2"},{"id":"B3","content":"B3"},{"id":"B4","content":"B4"}],"key":["B2","B4"]}],"explanation":"**报 MergeError**。labs 里 **B2** 有两行、**B4** 有三行，不满足右表每个键最多一行。没有 validate 时，这一行会悄悄拼出 7 行；有了它，错误在拼表这一步就暴露出来，要先弄清这两瓶水样到底送到了哪个实验室。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"bottles","caption":"表 bottles：四瓶水样的 pH","index":[20,3,11,7],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"bottle_id":["B1","B2","B3","B4"],"ph":[7.1,6.8,7.4,6.9]},"dtypes":{"ph":"float"}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"labs","caption":"表 labs：有的水样登记了不止一次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"bottle_id":["B2","B1","B4","B2","B4","B4"],"lab":["甲","乙","乙","丙","甲","丙"]}}]},{"id":"py29.k3.x2","body":"需求是：“给每份问卷补上地区：survey 里的问卷一份不能少，也不能因为 regions 登记重复而多出行——regions 里同一份问卷出现两次就报错；还要能数出有几份问卷没查到地区。”哪一种写法符合这条需求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(survey, regions, on=\"resp_id\", how=\"left\",\n                  indicator=True)\n```\n","feedback":"没写 validate，regions 记重了也不会报错，只会悄悄多出行。"},{"id":"onemany","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(survey, regions, on=\"resp_id\", how=\"left\",\n                  validate=\"one_to_many\", indicator=True)\n```\n","feedback":"one_to_many 检查的是 survey 的键，regions 记重了照样通过。"},{"id":"inner","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(survey, regions, on=\"resp_id\", how=\"inner\",\n                  validate=\"many_to_one\", indicator=True)\n```\n","feedback":"inner 会丢掉没查到地区的问卷。"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = pd.merge(survey, regions, on=\"resp_id\", how=\"left\",\n                  validate=\"many_to_one\", indicator=True)\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"符合的是 `how=\"left\"`、`validate=\"many_to_one\"`、`indicator=True` 那一种。left 让 survey 的问卷一份不少；`many_to_one` 要求 regions 每个 resp_id 最多一行，记重了就报错；`_merge` 为 left_only 的行就是没查到地区的问卷，这张表里是 R2、R5 两份。\n\ninner 会丢掉 R2、R5；不写 validate 或写成 `one_to_many`，regions 记重时都不会报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：五份问卷的满意度评分（1–5）","index":[3,9,1,6,2],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"resp_id":["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5"],"score":[4,2,5,3,4]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"regions","caption":"表 regions：问卷来自哪个地区","showIndex":false,"columns":{"resp_id":["R3","R1","R4","R9"],"region":["华北","华东","西南","华南"]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py30","title":"把同结构的多份记录叠起来","summary":"用 pd.concat 把几批同结构的记录上下叠成一张表：行数相加、列按列名对齐；看懂默认保留的重复行索引，用 ignore_index 重新编号，并在叠之前加一列来源。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py14","py19","py06"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。这一节的表大多是同一项测量分几批记下的：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`signal` 是一次测量的值（任意单位）。每张表左边的行索引是这张表自己的行标签，读入时都从 0 开始编号，所以不同的表会有相同的行索引。\n","wrapup":"把几批记录叠成一张表时，可以这样提要求：“把 a、b 两批按这个顺序上下叠起来；列名必须一致，不一致就先停下来告诉我；叠之前给每批加一列 batch 记下来源；结果的行索引从 0 重新编号。”\n\n拿到结果后先核对三件事：行数是不是各批之和，列是不是没有多出来，有没有意外的 NaN。\n","kps":[{"id":"py30.k1","title":"concat 沿行叠加并按列名对齐","key":["py14","py06","py19"],"links":["py06.k1","py19.k1"],"card":{"name":"上下叠加","aliases":["concat","纵向合并","叠表"],"definition":"pd.concat([a, b]) 把列表里的表按顺序上下接起来：行数相加，列按列名配对，不按列的位置。","conditions":["列名只要差一点（大小写、拼写），就会成为两列，各自缺的地方是 NaN。","列表里排在前面的表，它的行在上面；结果的列沿用第一张表的先后。"],"example":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, b])\n```\na 的 2 行在上、b 的 3 行在下，共 5 行；列仍是 sample_id、signal 两列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]},"lesson":"同一项测量分几批记下，每批一张表，列都一样。要把它们放进一张表，写：\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, b])\n```\n\n方括号里是一个列表，`concat` 按[列表的顺序](repa:concept/py06.k1)把这些表上下接起来：a 的行在上，b 的行在下。行数相加，a 有 2 行、b 有 3 行，结果有 5 行。\n\n列是**按列名**配对的，不看列在表里排第几。表 c 的列是 signal 在前、sample_id 在后，叠到 a 下面时，它的编号仍进 sample_id 列，测量值仍进 signal 列；结果的列沿用第一张表的先后。\n\n反过来，列名只要差一点，pandas 就把它们当成两列。表 d 把测量值写成了 `Signal`（大写 S），`pd.concat([a, d])` 会得到 sample_id、signal、Signal 三列：a 的行在 Signal 列是 NaN，d 的行在 signal 列是 NaN。原来的整数也因为混进了 NaN 变成了小数（8.0）。\n\n所以叠完先核对：行数是不是各表之和，列是不是没有多出来，有没有意外的[缺失](repa:concept/py19.k1)。\n","example":{"id":"py30.k1.e0","body":"两批测量要放进一张表。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, b])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"按 `result` 里从上到下的顺序，排出各行的 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"S_C","content":"S_C"},{"id":"S_A","content":"S_A"},{"id":"S_E","content":"S_E"},{"id":"S_B","content":"S_B"},{"id":"S_D","content":"S_D"}],"key":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":5},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.shape` 的第二个数（列数）","key":2}],"explanation":"a 的两行 **S_A、S_B** 在上，b 的三行 **S_C、S_D、S_E** 接在下面，各表内部的先后不变。行数 2 + 3 = **5**；两张表的列名相同，按名字配对后仍是 **2** 列，shape 为 (5, 2)。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py30.k1.q1","body":"这次把 b 写在列表的前面。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([b, a])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"按从上到下的顺序，排出各行的 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"S_A","content":"S_A"},{"id":"S_B","content":"S_B"},{"id":"S_C","content":"S_C"},{"id":"S_D","content":"S_D"},{"id":"S_E","content":"S_E"}],"key":["S_C","S_D","S_E","S_A","S_B"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"行数","key":5}],"explanation":"依次是 **S_C、S_D、S_E、S_A、S_B**，共 **5** 行。列表里谁在前，谁的行就在上面；concat 不会按编号或测量值重新排序。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]},{"id":"py30.k1.q2","body":"表 c 的两列先后与 a 不同。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, c])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","prompt":"`result` 的列从左到右是哪几列？","items":[{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"}],"key":["sample_id","signal"]},{"id":"cell","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 里 sample_id 为 S_F 的那一行，signal 是多少？","key":7},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么 c 的编号没有跑进 signal 列？","options":[{"id":"name","content":"concat 按列名配对，不看列排在第几"},{"id":"sorted","content":"concat 先把每张表的列按字母排好再叠"},{"id":"luck","content":"这只是碰巧，换一张表就会错位"}],"key":"name"}],"explanation":"列仍是 **sample_id、signal**，沿用第一张表 a 的先后。S_F 那一行的 signal 是 **7**：concat 按列名配对，c 里叫 signal 的那一列进 signal 列，叫 sample_id 的进 sample_id 列，与它们在 c 里排第几无关。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"c","caption":"表 c：第三批测量，列的先后与 a 不同","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"signal":[7,12],"sample_id":["S_F","S_G"]}}]},{"id":"py30.k1.q3","body":"表 d 把测量值的列名写成了 `Signal`。屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, d])\nprint(result.shape)\nprint(result[\"signal\"].isna().sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shape","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"(4, 3)","feedback":[{"when":"(4, 2)","message":"signal 和 Signal 名字不同，concat 把它们当成两列。"}]},{"id":"missing","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"2"},{"id":"sign","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个现象最能提醒你列名没有对上？","options":[{"id":"extra","content":"列数比每批表多了一列，而且 signal 列里出现了 NaN"},{"id":"rows","content":"行数等于两批的行数之和"},{"id":"order","content":"d 的行排在 a 的行下面"}],"key":"extra"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **(4, 3)**：行数 2 + 2 = 4 是对的，但列多了一列 `Signal`。第二行显示 **2**：d 的两行在 signal 列没有值。\n\n行数相加、d 的行在下面都是正常现象；**多出一列、signal 列出现了原本没有的 NaN**，才说明列名没对上。修正的办法是先把列名统一，再叠。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"d","caption":"表 d：第四批测量，测量值的列名写成了 Signal","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_H","S_I"],"Signal":[11,6]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py30.k1.r1","body":"春季和秋季的记录要放进一张表。判断下面每句关于 `both` 的话对不对。\n\n```python\nboth = pd.concat([spring, autumn])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"both 有 5 行","ok":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"both 最左边的一列是 depth","ok":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"秋季的 28 和 33 都在 depth 列里","ok":true}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"both 里有缺失值（NaN）","ok":false}}]}],"explanation":"第 1、3 句对，第 2、4 句错。行数 3 + 2 = 5；列沿用第一张表 spring 的先后，最左边是 site；两张表的列名完全相同，只是先后不同，按列名配对后秋季的深度进了 depth 列，也就没有产生缺失值。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"spring","caption":"表 spring：春季三个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"],"depth":[30,25,35]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"autumn","caption":"表 autumn：秋季两个采样点的土层深度（厘米），列的先后与春季不同","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"depth":[28,33],"site":["北坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py30.k1.r2","body":"南站的问卷把年龄一列写成了 `Age`。叠起来以后，每一列各有几个缺失值？\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([north, south])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"missing","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"column","header":"列"},{"id":"n","header":"`result[列].isna().sum()`","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"respondent","cells":{"column":"respondent","n":0}},{"id":"age","cells":{"column":"age","n":2}},{"id":"Age","cells":{"column":"Age","n":3}}]}],"explanation":"respondent 两站都有，没有缺失，为 **0**；age 只有北站有，南站的 2 行在这里是 NaN，为 **2**；Age 只有南站有，北站的 3 行在这里是 NaN，为 **3**。一个人的年龄被拆进了两列，任何一列单独拿去计算都会少掉一部分人。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"north","caption":"表 north：北站的问卷","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3"],"age":[34,51,28]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"south","caption":"表 south：南站的问卷，年龄的列名写成了 Age","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"respondent":["R4","R5"],"Age":[45,39]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py30.k1.x1","body":"要把二月的浊度记录接在一月的下面，得到一张 6 行 2 列的表。哪一行代码做到了？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"side","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([jan, feb], axis=1)\n```\n"},{"id":"reversed","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([feb, jan])\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([jan, feb])\n```\n"},{"id":"no_list","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat(jan, feb)\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`pd.concat([jan, feb])`：一月 3 行在上，二月 3 行在下，6 行 2 列。把 feb 写在前面，二月的行就跑到了上面；`axis=1` 是左右并排，得到 3 行 4 列；不写方括号时 concat 拿不到“一组表”，会报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"jan","caption":"表 jan：一月三个采样点的浊度（NTU）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"point":["W1","W2","W3"],"ntu":[12,8,15]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"feb","caption":"表 feb：二月三个采样点的浊度（NTU）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"point":["W1","W2","W3"],"ntu":[10,9,14]}}]},{"id":"py30.k1.x2","body":"乙地块的表多记了一列备注 `note`。阅读代码，说出 `result` 的样子。没有值的格子填 NaN。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([plot_a, plot_b])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","prompt":"`result` 的列从左到右是哪几列？","items":[{"id":"note","content":"`note`"},{"id":"height","content":"`height`"},{"id":"plant_id","content":"`plant_id`"}],"key":["plant_id","height","note"]},{"id":"first_note","type":"text","prompt":"`result` 第一行（A1）的 note 是什么？","quick":["NaN"],"key":"NaN"},{"id":"missing","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result[\"note\"].isna().sum()` 是多少？","key":3}],"explanation":"列是 **plant_id、height、note**：前两列沿用 plot_a 的先后，plot_b 多出的 note 接在后面。甲地块没有备注，A1 那一行的 note 是 **NaN**；甲地块的 3 行都缺 note，所以缺失个数是 **3**。height 两张表都有，不受影响。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plot_a","caption":"表 plot_a：甲地块的株高（厘米）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["A1","A2","A3"],"height":[12,15,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plot_b","caption":"表 plot_b：乙地块的株高（厘米），多记了一列备注","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"plant_id":["B1","B2"],"height":[14,9],"note":["叶片发黄","正常"]}}]}]},{"id":"py30.k2","title":"ignore_index 与来源列的用途","key":["py16"],"links":["py16.k2"],"card":{"name":"来源列","aliases":["ignore_index","重新编号","batch 列"],"definition":"concat 默认保留各表原来的行索引，可能重复；ignore_index=True 从 0 重新编号，但原索引也丢了。要知道每行来自哪一批，叠之前给每张表加一列来源。","conditions":["行索引重复时，result.loc[0] 会取到不止一行。","重新编号以后，只有来源列还能说明一行来自哪张表。"],"example":"`pd.concat([a, b])` 的行索引是 0、1、0、1、2；加 `ignore_index=True` 后是 0、1、2、3、4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]},"lesson":"concat 默认把每张表原来的行索引一起带过来。a 的行索引是 0、1，b 的是 0、1、2，叠起来就是 **0、1、0、1、2**：同一个标签出现了两次。这时 `result.loc[0]` 按[标签](repa:concept/py16.k2)取行，会取到两行，一行来自 a，一行来自 b。\n\n加上 `ignore_index=True`，结果的行索引从 0 重新编号为 0、1、2、3、4，不再重复：\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, b], ignore_index=True)\n```\n\n但重新编号也把原来的索引丢了。无论编不编号，表里都没有哪一列写着“这一行来自哪一批”。要能追溯来源，叠之前给每张表加一列：\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a.assign(batch=\"A\"), b.assign(batch=\"B\")], ignore_index=True)\n```\n\n`a.assign(batch=\"A\")` 返回一张多了 batch 列的新表，这一列每行都是 \"A\"；a 本身不变。这样叠完以后，行索引不重复，每一行也都带着自己的来源。如果文件里本来就有记录来源的列，就不必再加，但要先确认它确实存在、写得对。\n","example":{"id":"py30.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，按从上到下的顺序填写 `result` 各行的行索引，再回答两个问题。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([a, b])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"labels","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"label","header":"行索引","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"sample_id":"S_A","label":0}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"sample_id":"S_B","label":1}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"sample_id":"S_C","label":0}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"sample_id":"S_D","label":1}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"sample_id":"S_E","label":2}}]},{"id":"loc0","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result.loc[0]` 取到几行？","key":2},{"id":"last","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果改成 `pd.concat([a, b], ignore_index=True)`，最后一行的行索引是多少？","key":4}],"explanation":"行索引依次是 **0、1、0、1、2**：a 和 b 各自的索引原样带了过来。标签 0 出现了两次，`result.loc[0]` 取到 **2** 行（S_A 和 S_C）。加上 `ignore_index=True` 后从 0 重新编号，5 行的最后一行是 **4**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py30.k2.q1","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nr1 = pd.concat([a, b])\nr2 = pd.concat([a, b], ignore_index=True)\nprint(r1.loc[2, \"sample_id\"])\nprint(r2.loc[2, \"sample_id\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","prompt":"第一行","key":"S_E"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","prompt":"第二行","key":"S_C","feedback":[{"when":"S_E","message":"r2 已经重新编号，标签 2 是从上往下数的第 3 行。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行是 **S_E**：r1 保留原索引，标签 2 只在 b 里有，是 b 的第 3 行 S_E。第二行是 **S_C**：r2 从 0 重新编号，标签 2 是整张表的第 3 行，也就是 b 的第 1 行 S_C。同样写 `.loc[2]`，取到哪一行取决于有没有重新编号。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]},{"id":"py30.k2.q2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把 a、b 两批按这个顺序上下叠起来，行索引从 0 重新编号；加一列 batch，a 的行写 \"A\"，b 的行写 \"B\"。不改变 a、b。\n\n作答框里的代码只做了第一步。请改动它并提交，结果仍叫 `result`。`a.assign(batch=\"A\")` 返回一张多了 batch 列的新表，a 不变。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"result = pd.concat([a, b])\n","solution":"result = pd.concat([a.assign(batch=\"A\"), b.assign(batch=\"B\")], ignore_index=True)\n","accepts":["first = a.assign(batch=\"A\")\nsecond = b.assign(batch=\"B\")\nresult = pd.concat([first, second], ignore_index=True)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"result = pd.concat([a.assign(batch=\"A\"), b.assign(batch=\"B\")])","why":"没有重新编号，行索引仍是 0、1、0、1、2"},{"code":"result = pd.concat([a, b], ignore_index=True)","why":"只重新编号，没有来源列"},{"code":"result = pd.concat([a.assign(batch=\"B\"), b.assign(batch=\"A\")], ignore_index=True)","why":"两批的来源写反了"},{"code":"result = pd.concat([b.assign(batch=\"B\"), a.assign(batch=\"A\")], ignore_index=True)","why":"两批的先后颠倒了"},{"code":"result = pd.concat([a, b], ignore_index=True).assign(batch=\"A\")","why":"叠完再加列，所有行都成了 \"A\""},{"code":"a = a.assign(batch=\"A\")\nb = b.assign(batch=\"B\")\nresult = pd.concat([a, b], ignore_index=True)\n","why":"把 a、b 换成了加过列的表"}],"tests":[{"name":"两批测量","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\"], \"signal\": [8, 10, 13, 10, 9], \"batch\": [\"A\", \"A\", \"B\", \"B\", \"B\"]})","a":"a","b":"b"}},{"name":"换两批行数不同的表","hidden":true,"data":["A2","B2"],"expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_K\", \"S_L\", \"S_M\", \"S_N\"], \"signal\": [5, 12, 7, 9], \"batch\": [\"A\", \"A\", \"A\", \"B\"]})","a":"a","b":"b"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([a.assign(batch=\"A\"), b.assign(batch=\"B\")], ignore_index=True)\n```\n\n叠之前给每批加上来源列，叠的时候加 `ignore_index=True` 重新编号。结果 5 行 3 列，行索引 0 到 4，batch 列依次是 A、A、B、B、B。先叠再 `.assign(batch=\"A\")` 会让所有行都写成 A；写成 `a = a.assign(...)` 则改掉了原来的 a。判分时还会换两批行数不同的表来运行你的代码。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"a","caption":"表 a：第一批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"signal":[8,10]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"b","caption":"表 b：第二批测量","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_D","S_E"],"signal":[13,10,9]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py30.k2.r1","body":"同事想看秋季的第 2 个采样点（秋季表里行索引为 1 的那一行），写了：\n\n```python\nboth = pd.concat([spring, autumn])\nx = both.loc[1]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`x` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"tell","type":"choice","prompt":"只看 `x` 本身，能分出哪一行是秋季的吗？","options":[{"id":"label","content":"能，秋季那一行的行索引是 2"},{"id":"cannot","content":"不能，两行的行索引都是 1，表里也没有记录季节的列"},{"id":"position","content":"能，秋季那一行总是排在上面"}],"key":"cannot"}],"explanation":"`x` 有 **2** 行：春季的南坡和秋季的东坡，行索引都是 1。表里没有记录季节的列，只看 `x` 分不出哪一行是秋季的（秋季的行在下面，是因为 autumn 在列表里排在后面，不是一条可以依靠的标记）。叠之前加一列 season，再从 0 重新编号，才能按季节取行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"spring","caption":"表 spring：春季三个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"],"depth":[30,25,35]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"autumn","caption":"表 autumn：秋季两个采样点的土层深度（厘米），列的先后与春季不同","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"depth":[28,33],"site":["北坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py30.k2.r2","body":"把下面的代码行排成一段程序：叠起春秋两季的记录，加一列 season（春季写 \"spring\"，秋季写 \"autumn\"），行索引从 0 重新编号，春季的行在上面。有的行用不上。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"both_plain","code":"both = pd.concat([spring, autumn], ignore_index=True)"},{"id":"t","code":"t = autumn.assign(season=\"autumn\")"},{"id":"both_keep","code":"both = pd.concat([s, t])"},{"id":"s","code":"s = spring.assign(season=\"spring\")"},{"id":"both","code":"both = pd.concat([s, t], ignore_index=True)"}],"key":["s","t","both"],"alternatives":[["t","s","both"]],"tests":[{"name":"叠好的表","expect":{"both":"pd.DataFrame({\"site\": [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\", \"北坡\", \"东坡\"], \"depth\": [30, 25, 35, 28, 33], \"season\": [\"spring\", \"spring\", \"spring\", \"autumn\", \"autumn\"]})","spring":"spring","autumn":"autumn"}}]}],"explanation":"先用 assign 得到带 season 列的 `s` 和 `t`（这两行谁先都可以），再写 `both = pd.concat([s, t], ignore_index=True)`。直接叠 spring 和 autumn 没有季节列；不加 `ignore_index=True` 时行索引会是 0、1、2、0、1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"spring","caption":"表 spring：春季三个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"],"depth":[30,25,35]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"autumn","caption":"表 autumn：秋季两个采样点的土层深度（厘米），列的先后与春季不同","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"depth":[28,33],"site":["北坡","东坡"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py30.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码，回答问题。\n\n```python\nresult = pd.concat([north.assign(station=\"N\"), south.assign(station=\"S\")], ignore_index=True)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":5},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几列？","key":3},{"id":"station","type":"text","prompt":"`result.loc[3, \"station\"]` 是什么？","key":"S"},{"id":"respondent","type":"text","prompt":"`result.loc[3, \"respondent\"]` 是什么？","key":"R4"},{"id":"north_cols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"运行之后，`north` 有几列？","key":2}],"explanation":"5 行、3 列（respondent、age、station）。重新编号后标签 3 是第 4 行，也就是南站的第一位受访者：station 是 **S**，respondent 是 **R4**。assign 返回新表，north 本身仍是 **2** 列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"north","caption":"表 north：北站的问卷","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3"],"age":[34,51,28]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"south","caption":"表 south：南站的问卷","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"respondent":["R4","R5"],"age":[45,39]}}]},{"id":"py30.k2.x2","body":"同事发来一张叠好的表，是把一月的表 jan 和二月的表 feb 上下叠起来的结果，多了一列 month 记录来源，行索引从 0 重新编号：\n\n```text\n  point  ntu month\n0    W1   12   jan\n1    W2    8   jan\n2    W3   15   jan\n3    W1   10   feb\n4    W2    9   feb\n5    W3   14   feb\n```\n\n他没有写代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪一段代码能得到这张表？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([jan.assign(month=\"jan\"), feb.assign(month=\"feb\")], ignore_index=True)\n```\n"},{"id":"no_renumber","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([jan.assign(month=\"jan\"), feb.assign(month=\"feb\")])\n```\n","feedback":"没有重新编号，行索引是 0、1、2、0、1、2。"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([feb.assign(month=\"feb\"), jan.assign(month=\"jan\")], ignore_index=True)\n```\n","feedback":"二月的行排到了上面。"},{"id":"wrong_label","content":"```python\nresult = pd.concat([jan.assign(month=\"jan\"), feb.assign(month=\"jan\")], ignore_index=True)\n```\n","feedback":"二月的行 month 仍写成 jan。"}],"key":"right"},{"id":"last","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果去掉 `ignore_index=True`，叠出来的表最后一行的行索引是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"要同时满足三点：一月在上、二月在下；每张表叠之前各加自己的来源（`jan.assign(month=\"jan\")`、`feb.assign(month=\"feb\")`）；`ignore_index=True` 把行索引重新编号为 0 到 5。\n\n去掉 `ignore_index=True`，各表原来的行索引会一起带过来：jan 的 0、1、2，feb 的 0、1、2，所以最后一行的行索引是 **2**，同一个标签出现了两次。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"jan","caption":"表 jan：一月三个采样点的浊度（NTU）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"point":["W1","W2","W3"],"ntu":[12,8,15]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"feb","caption":"表 feb：二月三个采样点的浊度（NTU）","indexHeader":"行索引","columns":{"point":["W1","W2","W3"],"ntu":[10,9,14]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py31","title":"长表和宽表只是同一批观测的不同排法","summary":"认出标识列、变量列和值列；读懂 melt 把几列测量拆成多行，pivot 把长表变回宽表，并知道键组合重复时怎样处理是一项要写明的决定。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py25","py27"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码，不需要写导入或构造数据的代码。每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始，前面题目里的变量都已清除。\n\n这一节常用两张表。表 W 是**宽表**：`sample_id` 是样本编号，`day1`、`day2` 分别是第 1 天、第 2 天测到的 signal（任意单位）。表 L 是**长表**：同样的测量，每行一个，`day` 写第几天，`signal` 是测到的值。左边的行标签是表的原行索引。\n","wrapup":"拿到一张表，先说出三种列：谁（标识列）、什么条件（变量列，可能藏在列名里）、测到的数（值列）。宽变长、长变宽前后，测量个数应当不变。\n\n向同事或 AI 提变形需求时，可以说：“把宽表排成长表，每行一个样本一天的测量，列依次为 sample_id、day、signal。转回宽表前，先按 sample_id 和 day 检查重复；同一样本同一天有两个不同的数时，列出来给我核对，不要默认取平均。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py31.k1","title":"辨认标识列、变量列和值列","key":["py25"],"links":["py25.k1","py27.k1"],"card":{"name":"长表与宽表","aliases":["标识列","变量列","值列"],"definition":"一个测量值靠标识列（测的是谁）和变量列（在什么条件下测的）来定位；宽表把变量藏在列名里，长表把它单独放成一列，每行一个测量。","conditions":["两种排法的测量个数相同：宽表行数 × 测量列数 = 长表行数。","长表里，标识列加变量列应当唯一，它们就是长表的业务键。"],"example":"表 W（3 个样本 × day1、day2 两列）排成长表是 6 行：sample_id 是标识列，day 是变量列（原来藏在列名里），signal 是值列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"表 W：三个样本两天的测量（宽表）","index":[31,7,22],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C"],"day1":[8,10,13],"day2":[9,12,11]}}]},"lesson":"同一批测量可以有两种排法。表 W 是**宽表**，每个样本一行、每天一列：\n\n| sample_id | day1 | day2 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| S_A | 8 | 9 |\n| S_B | 10 | 12 |\n| S_C | 13 | 11 |\n\n排成**长表**，每个测量一行：\n\n| sample_id | day | signal |\n|---|---|---:|\n| S_A | day1 | 8 |\n| S_B | day1 | 10 |\n| S_C | day1 | 13 |\n| S_A | day2 | 9 |\n| S_B | day2 | 12 |\n| S_C | day2 | 11 |\n\n两张表记的是同样的 6 个测量（3 个样本 × 2 天）。读任何一种排法，都先认出三种列：\n\n- **标识列**：测的是谁。这里是 sample_id。\n- **变量列**：这个数是在什么条件下测的，这里是“第几天”。宽表里它没有单独成列，而是藏在列名 day1、day2 里；长表里它是 day 这一列。\n- **值列**：测到的数。宽表里分散在 day1、day2 两列，长表里集中在 signal 一列。\n\n两条核对办法：测量个数不变，宽表行数 × 测量列数 = 长表行数，3 × 2 = 6；长表里标识列加变量列合起来应当唯一，它们就是长表的[业务键](repa:concept/py25.k1)。同一个样本同一天出现两行，说明有重复测量，要先弄清楚。\n\n哪种排法更好，看下一步做什么：宽表便于人眼对照同一样本的两天；长表便于[按组汇总](repa:concept/py27.k1)，例如 `long.groupby(\"day\")[\"signal\"].mean()` 一行算出每天的平均。\n","example":{"id":"py31.k1.e0","body":"表 W 是宽表。现在要把它排成长表：每行一个测量，列为 sample_id、day、signal。\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"长表有几行？","key":6},{"id":"where","type":"choice","prompt":"在宽表里，“第几天”这个信息写在哪里？","options":[{"id":"names","content":"写在列名 day1、day2 里"},{"id":"sample","content":"写在 sample_id 列里"},{"id":"index","content":"写在原行索引 31、7、22 里"}],"key":"names"},{"id":"key","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"长表里，哪几列合起来应当唯一（每种组合只出现一次）？","options":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"sample_id"},{"id":"day","content":"day"},{"id":"signal","content":"signal"}],"key":["sample_id","day"]},{"id":"lookup","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"长表里 sample_id 为 S_B、day 为 day2 的那一行，signal 是多少？","key":12}],"explanation":"长表有 **6** 行：3 个样本 × 2 天，每个测量一行。“第几天”在宽表里**写在列名 day1、day2 里**，排成长表后成了 day 列的值。长表里 **sample_id 和 day** 合起来认出一个测量，应当唯一；signal 是测到的数，不同测量完全可能相同，不能拿来认记录。S_B 第 2 天的值在宽表 S_B 那一行的 day2 列，是 **12**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"表 W：三个样本两天的测量（宽表）","index":[31,7,22],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C"],"day1":[8,10,13],"day2":[9,12,11]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py31.k1.q1","body":"把表 heights 排成长表：每行一个采样点一年的株高，列为 site、year、height。\n","slots":[{"id":"measurements","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"宽表里一共记了几个株高？","key":12},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"长表有几行？","key":12},{"id":"columns","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"长表有几列？","key":3},{"id":"lookup","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"长表里 site 为东坡、year 为 y2024 的那一行，height 是多少？","key":36}],"explanation":"4 个采样点 × 3 年 = **12** 个株高，长表就有 **12** 行；列只有 site、year、height **3** 列，原来的 y2023、y2024、y2025 三个列名成了 year 列的值。东坡 y2024 那一格是 **36**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"heights","caption":"表 heights：四个采样点三年的平均株高（厘米）","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"y2023":[31,28,35,30],"y2024":[33,29,36,30],"y2025":[34,31,38,32]}}]},{"id":"py31.k1.q2","body":"表 trees 是一张长表。给它的每一列认出角色，再想想排成宽表（每棵树一行）的样子。\n","slots":[{"id":"roles","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"column","header":"列"},{"id":"role","header":"角色","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"id","label":"标识列"},{"id":"variable","label":"变量列"},{"id":"value","label":"值列"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"tree_id","cells":{"column":"tree_id","role":"id"}},{"id":"season","cells":{"column":"season","role":"variable"}},{"id":"girth_cm","cells":{"column":"girth_cm","role":"value"}}]},{"id":"wide_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"排成宽表（每棵树一行、每个季节一列）后有几行？","key":2},{"id":"wide_values","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"宽表里有几列周长？","key":2}],"explanation":"tree_id 说明测的是哪棵树，是**标识列**；season 说明在哪个季节测的，是**变量列**；girth_cm 是测到的周长，是**值列**。排成宽表时每棵树一行，T1、T2 共 **2** 行；每个季节一列，spring、autumn 共 **2** 列周长。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trees","caption":"表 trees：树干周长（厘米）","columns":{"tree_id":["T1","T1","T2","T2"],"season":["spring","autumn","spring","autumn"],"girth_cm":[31,33,28,29]}}]},{"id":"py31.k1.q3","body":"约定每个样本每天只测一次。检查这张长表是否符合约定。\n","slots":[{"id":"ok","type":"choice","prompt":"符合约定吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"符合，每个样本每天只有一行"},{"id":"no","content":"不符合，有样本同一天出现了不止一行"}],"key":"no"},{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一个组合出现了不止一次？","options":[{"id":"S_A-day1","content":"S_A 的 day1"},{"id":"S_B-day1","content":"S_B 的 day1"},{"id":"S_B-day2","content":"S_B 的 day2"},{"id":"S_C-day2","content":"S_C 的 day2"}],"key":"S_B-day1"},{"id":"marked","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`long.duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=False)` 里有几个 True？","key":2}],"explanation":"**不符合**。**S_B 的 day1** 出现了两行，signal 一个是 10、一个是 14：同一样本同一天的两个不同的数，是冲突。按 sample_id 和 day 用 `keep=False` 标重复时，这两行都标 True，共 **2** 个。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"long","caption":"一张长表（行的先后是录入的先后）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_A","S_B","S_C","S_B"],"day":["day1","day1","day1","day2","day2","day2","day1"],"signal":[8,10,13,9,12,11,14]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py31.k1.r1","body":"把表 soil 排成长表：每行是一个采样点在一个季节的一次深度测量，列为 site、season、depth。\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"长表有几行？","key":6},{"id":"pair","type":"choice","prompt":"按“一行是一个采样点在一个季节的一次测量”这个约定，长表的业务键是哪两列？","options":[{"id":"site_depth","content":"site 和 depth"},{"id":"site_season","content":"site 和 season"},{"id":"season_depth","content":"season 和 depth"}],"key":"site_season"}],"explanation":"3 个采样点 × 2 个季节，长表 **6** 行。\n\n业务键由“一行代表什么”决定，不看这一批数据里哪些列碰巧不重复。一行代表“一个采样点在一个季节的一次测量”，所以能认出这一行的是**测的是谁**（site）和**什么条件下测的**（season）；depth 是测到的值，是这一行的内容，不是用来认记录的。\n\n用值来认记录靠不住：不同采样点、不同季节完全可能测到同样的深度。这批数据里就有：东坡春、秋两季都是 30 厘米，site 和 depth 的组合“东坡、30”出现两次；春季北坡、东坡都是 30，season 和 depth 的组合“spring、30”也出现两次。换一批数据，这两个组合碰巧不重复也说明不了什么，业务键仍然是 site 和 season。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：三个采样点两个季节的土层深度（厘米）","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"],"spring":[30,25,30],"autumn":[25,28,30]}}]},{"id":"py31.k1.r2","body":"把表 survey 排成长表：每行是一位受访者一轮的作答，列为 respondent、wave、score。判断每句话对不对。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"长表有 8 行","ok":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"长表的行数和宽表一样多","ok":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"长表里 respondent 列中每个编号只出现一次","ok":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"长表里 wave 列的值是 wave1 和 wave2","ok":true}}]}],"explanation":"第 1、4 句对，第 2、3 句错。4 位受访者 × 2 轮 = 8 行，比宽表的 4 行多；每位受访者有两轮作答，所以每个编号在长表里出现两次；wave1、wave2 原来是列名，排成长表后成了 wave 列的值。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"survey","caption":"表 survey：四位受访者两轮问卷的得分","columns":{"respondent":["R1","R2","R3","R4"],"wave1":[4,5,3,4],"wave2":[5,5,2,4]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py31.k1.x1","body":"表 farm 是长表。把它排成宽表：每块地一行，每年一列，格子里是产量。填写宽表。\n","slots":[{"id":"wide","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"plot","header":"plot"},{"id":"y2024","header":"y2024","input":"integer"},{"id":"y2025","header":"y2025","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"A","cells":{"plot":"A","y2024":4,"y2025":5}},{"id":"B","cells":{"plot":"B","y2024":6,"y2025":7}},{"id":"C","cells":{"plot":"C","y2024":5,"y2025":3}}]}],"explanation":"| plot | y2024 | y2025 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| A | 4 | 5 |\n| B | 6 | 7 |\n| C | 5 | 3 |\n\nplot 是标识列，成了宽表的行；year 是变量列，它的值 y2024、y2025 成了列名；kg 是值列，填进格子。长表 6 行，宽表 3 行 × 2 列，测量个数相同。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：三块地两年的产量（千克），每行一个测量","columns":{"plot":["B","A","C","A","C","B"],"year":["y2025","y2024","y2024","y2025","y2025","y2024"],"kg":[7,4,5,5,3,6]}}]},{"id":"py31.k1.x2","body":"表 birds 是一张长表。给它的每一列认出角色。\n","slots":[{"id":"role_line","type":"choice","prompt":"`line` 列是什么角色？","options":[{"id":"id","content":"标识列（说明测的是谁）"},{"id":"variable","content":"变量列（说明在什么条件下测的）"},{"id":"value","content":"值列（测到的数）"}],"key":"id"},{"id":"role_month","type":"choice","prompt":"`month` 列是什么角色？","options":[{"id":"id","content":"标识列（说明测的是谁）"},{"id":"variable","content":"变量列（说明在什么条件下测的）"},{"id":"value","content":"值列（测到的数）"}],"key":"variable"},{"id":"role_n_birds","type":"choice","prompt":"`n_birds` 列是什么角色？","options":[{"id":"id","content":"标识列（说明测的是谁）"},{"id":"variable","content":"变量列（说明在什么条件下测的）"},{"id":"value","content":"值列（测到的数）"}],"key":"value"},{"id":"wide_values","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"排成宽表（每条样线一行）后，有几列鸟的数量？","key":2}],"explanation":"line 说明数的是哪条样线，是**标识列**；month 说明在哪个月数的，是**变量列**——它是数字，但在这里表示条件，不是测到的量；n_birds 是数到的鸟，是**值列**。排成宽表时，5 月、6 月各成一列，共 **2** 列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"birds","caption":"表 birds：两条样线在 5 月、6 月数到的鸟","columns":{"line":["L1","L2","L1","L2"],"month":[5,5,6,6],"n_birds":[12,7,9,11]}}]}]},{"id":"py31.k2","title":"melt 从多列变多行","key":["py14"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"melt","aliases":["宽变长","多列变多行"],"definition":"melt 把几列测量拆成多行：id_vars 的列原样带着，value_vars 里每一列的每个值各成一行，原来的列名写进 var_name 那一列，值写进 value_name 那一列。","conditions":["行数 = 原行数 × value_vars 的列数；先排完第一个被拆的列，再排下一个。","结果的行标签从 0 重新编号；不写 value_vars 时，id_vars 以外的列全部被拆。"],"example":"```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"], value_vars=[\"day1\", \"day2\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n表 W 的 3 行变成 6 行：先是 day1 的三行，再是 day2 的三行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"表 W：三个样本两天的测量（宽表）","index":[31,7,22],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C"],"day1":[8,10,13],"day2":[9,12,11]}}]},"lesson":"宽表变长表用 `melt`：\n\n```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"], value_vars=[\"day1\", \"day2\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n\n| 参数 | 意思 | 这里 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `id_vars` | 原样带着、不拆的列（标识列） | sample_id |\n| `value_vars` | 要拆成多行的测量列 | day1、day2 |\n| `var_name` | 新的变量列叫什么，里面放原来的列名 | day |\n| `value_name` | 新的值列叫什么，里面放原来格子里的数 | signal |\n\n结果有 3 × 2 = 6 行。行的先后是：先把 day1 这一列从上到下拆完（S_A、S_B、S_C），再拆 day2。day 列里的值就是原来的列名文字 `\"day1\"`、`\"day2\"`。结果的行标签从 0 重新编号，原行索引 31、7、22 不保留。\n\n两个省略要留意：不写 `var_name`、`value_name` 时，新列叫 `variable` 和 `value`；不写 `value_vars` 时，id_vars 以外的列**全部**被拆。表里还有别的列（比如组别）却忘了放进 id_vars，它也会被当成一种“测量”拆进来。\n","example":{"id":"py31.k2.e0","body":"阅读代码，说出 `long` 的样子。\n\n```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"], value_vars=[\"day1\", \"day2\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`long` 有几行？","key":6},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`long` 有哪些列？按顺序排列，不属于它的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"variable","content":"`variable`"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"day","content":"`day`"},{"id":"day1","content":"`day1`"}],"key":["sample_id","day","signal"]},{"id":"sample","type":"text","prompt":"行标签为 3 的那一行，sample_id 是什么？","key":"S_A"},{"id":"day","type":"text","prompt":"这一行的 day 是什么？","key":"day2"},{"id":"signal","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这一行的 signal 是多少？","key":9}],"explanation":"| 行标签 | sample_id | day | signal |\n|---:|---|---|---:|\n| 0 | S_A | day1 | 8 |\n| 1 | S_B | day1 | 10 |\n| 2 | S_C | day1 | 13 |\n| 3 | S_A | day2 | 9 |\n| 4 | S_B | day2 | 12 |\n| 5 | S_C | day2 | 11 |\n\n共 **6** 行，列依次是 **sample_id、day、signal**。先拆完 day1 的三行（标签 0–2），再拆 day2，所以行标签 3 是 **S_A** 的 **day2**，signal 为 **9**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"表 W：三个样本两天的测量（宽表）","index":[31,7,22],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C"],"day1":[8,10,13],"day2":[9,12,11]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py31.k2.q1","body":"这次没有写 var_name 和 value_name。阅读代码，说出 `long` 的样子。\n\n```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`long` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"value","content":"`value`"},{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"day","content":"`day`"},{"id":"variable","content":"`variable`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"}],"key":["sample_id","variable","value"]},{"id":"nrows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`long` 有几行？","key":6},{"id":"cell","type":"text","prompt":"行标签为 4 的那一行，variable 列是什么？","key":"day2"}],"explanation":"列是 **sample_id、variable、value**：没写名字时，pandas 用默认的 variable 和 value。没写 value_vars，id_vars 以外的 day1、day2 全部被拆，仍是 **6** 行。行标签 4 是 day2 那一段的第二行（S_B），variable 是 **day2**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"表 W：三个样本两天的测量（宽表）","index":[31,7,22],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C"],"day1":[8,10,13],"day2":[9,12,11]}}]},{"id":"py31.k2.q2","body":"阅读代码，填写 `long` 每一行的 sample_id 和 signal。\n\n```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"label","header":"行标签"},{"id":"day","header":"day"},{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id","input":"text"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"label":"0","day":"day1","sample_id":"S_D","signal":7}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"label":"1","day":"day1","sample_id":"S_E","signal":15}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"label":"2","day":"day2","sample_id":"S_D","signal":6}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"label":"3","day":"day2","sample_id":"S_E","signal":14}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"label":"4","day":"day3","sample_id":"S_D","signal":9}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"label":"5","day":"day3","sample_id":"S_E","signal":16}}]}],"explanation":"2 个样本 × 3 天 = 6 行。每拆一列，都按原表的行序走一遍：S_D、S_E；所以 sample_id 依次是 S_D、S_E 交替，signal 依次是 **7、15、6、14、9、16**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"另一张宽表：两个样本三天的测量","index":[5,18],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_D","S_E"],"day1":[7,15],"day2":[6,14],"day3":[9,16]}}]},{"id":"py31.k2.q3","body":"要求是：“排成长表，每行一个测量，列为 sample_id、group、day、signal。”同事写了：\n\n```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"got","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"这段代码得到几行？","key":6},{"id":"problem","type":"choice","prompt":"问题出在哪里？","options":[{"id":"group","content":"group 没放进 id_vars，被当成一种测量拆进了 day 和 signal"},{"id":"order","content":"行的顺序不对，应该按 sample_id 排"},{"id":"names","content":"var_name 和 value_name 写反了"}],"key":"group"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一行代码符合要求？","options":[{"id":"both","content":"```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\", \"group\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n"},{"id":"drop","content":"```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"sample_id\"], value_vars=[\"day1\", \"day2\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n"},{"id":"group_only","content":"```python\nlong = wide.melt(id_vars=[\"group\"], var_name=\"day\", value_name=\"signal\")\n```\n"}],"key":"both"}],"explanation":"得到 **6** 行而不是 4 行：**group 没放进 id_vars**，于是 day 列里多出了“group”，signal 列里混进了 control、drug 这样的文字。把 group 也放进 id_vars，`id_vars=[\"sample_id\", \"group\"]`，就得到 4 行、四列。只写 value_vars 而不放 group，结果里就没有 group 列了；只放 group，sample_id 又被拆了进来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"wide","caption":"带组别的宽表","index":[31,7],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B"],"group":["control","drug"],"day1":[8,10],"day2":[9,12]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py31.k2.r1","body":"要从表 rain 得到下面这张长表。哪一行代码符合要求？\n\n| station | month | mm |\n|---|---|---:|\n| N | jun | 120 |\n| S | jun | 95 |\n| E | jun | 140 |\n| N | jul | 80 |\n| S | jul | 110 |\n| E | jul | 60 |\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nlong = rain.melt(id_vars=[\"station\"], var_name=\"mm\", value_name=\"month\")\n```\n"},{"id":"default","content":"```python\nlong = rain.melt(id_vars=[\"station\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nlong = rain.melt(id_vars=[\"station\"], var_name=\"month\", value_name=\"mm\")\n```\n"},{"id":"one","content":"```python\nlong = rain.melt(id_vars=[\"station\"], value_vars=[\"jun\"], var_name=\"month\", value_name=\"mm\")\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`var_name=\"month\", value_name=\"mm\"` 的那一行符合要求：原来的列名 jun、jul 进 month 列，降水量进 mm 列。把两个名字写反，列名就和内容对不上；不写名字得到的是 variable、value；只拆 jun 一列只有 3 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"rain","caption":"表 rain：三个站点两个月的降水量（毫米）","columns":{"station":["N","S","E"],"jun":[120,95,140],"jul":[80,110,60]}}]},{"id":"py31.k2.r2","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nlong = temps.melt(id_vars=[\"station\"], var_name=\"time\", value_name=\"temp\")\nprint(len(long))\nprint(long.loc[1, \"time\"])\nprint(long.loc[2, \"temp\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行","key":4},{"id":"line2","type":"text","prompt":"第二行","key":"am"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行","key":18}],"explanation":"依次显示 **4、am、18**。2 个站点 × 2 个时段 = 4 行；先拆 am 列（标签 0 是 N1、1 是 N2），再拆 pm 列（标签 2 是 N1、3 是 N2）。所以标签 1 的 time 是 am，标签 2 是 N1 下午的 18。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：两个站点上午、下午的水温（摄氏度）","columns":{"station":["N1","N2"],"am":[12,15],"pm":[18,20]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py31.k2.x1","body":"阅读代码，按 `long` 里的先后排出每一行是哪块地、哪一年。\n\n```python\nlong = farm.melt(id_vars=[\"plot\"], var_name=\"year\", value_name=\"kg\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","items":[{"id":"A-y2024","content":"A，y2024"},{"id":"A-y2025","content":"A，y2025"},{"id":"B-y2024","content":"B，y2024"},{"id":"B-y2025","content":"B，y2025"}],"key":["B-y2024","A-y2024","B-y2025","A-y2025"]}],"explanation":"先拆 y2024 这一列，按原表的行序是 B、A；再拆 y2025，还是 B、A。所以依次是 **B y2024、A y2024、B y2025、A y2025**。melt 不会按地块名排序，也不会把同一块地的两年排在一起。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：两块地两年的产量（千克）","columns":{"plot":["B","A"],"y2024":[6,4],"y2025":[7,5]}}]},{"id":"py31.k2.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把宽表排成长表，每行一个采样点一个季节的深度，列依次为 site、season、depth；note 列不要。不改变 `soil`。\n\n作答框里的代码还不符合需求。请改动它并提交，结果变量仍叫 `long`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"])\n","solution":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], value_vars=[\"spring\", \"autumn\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")\n","accepts":["long = soil[[\"site\", \"spring\", \"autumn\"]].melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")","long = soil.melt(id_vars=\"site\", value_vars=[\"spring\", \"autumn\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")"],"rejects":[{"code":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")","why":"没写 value_vars，note 也被拆了进来"},{"code":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], value_vars=[\"spring\", \"autumn\"])","why":"列名还是默认的 variable、value"},{"code":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], value_vars=[\"spring\", \"autumn\"], var_name=\"depth\", value_name=\"season\")","why":"var_name 和 value_name 写反了"},{"code":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\", \"note\"], value_vars=[\"spring\", \"autumn\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")","why":"把 note 当成标识列留了下来"},{"code":"long = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], value_vars=[\"spring\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")","why":"只拆了 spring 一列"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 soil","expect":{"long":"pd.DataFrame({\"site\": [\"N\", \"S\", \"E\", \"N\", \"S\", \"E\"], \"season\": [\"spring\", \"spring\", \"spring\", \"autumn\", \"autumn\", \"autumn\"], \"depth\": [32, 26, 35, 29, 27, 33]})","soil":"soil"}},{"name":"另一份记录","hidden":true,"data":["soil4"],"expect":{"long":"pd.DataFrame({\"site\": [\"W\", \"X\", \"W\", \"X\"], \"season\": [\"spring\", \"spring\", \"autumn\", \"autumn\"], \"depth\": [20, 22, 21, 26]})","soil":"soil"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nlong = soil.melt(id_vars=[\"site\"], value_vars=[\"spring\", \"autumn\"], var_name=\"season\", value_name=\"depth\")\n```\n\nvalue_vars 只写两个季节，note 就不会被拆进来，也不会留在结果里；var_name、value_name 定下新列的名字。先选出 site、spring、autumn 三列再 melt 也对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：三个采样点两季的深度（厘米），note 是记录员的备注","columns":{"site":["N","S","E"],"spring":[32,26,35],"autumn":[29,27,33],"note":["ok","补测","ok"]}}]}]},{"id":"py31.k3","title":"pivot 要求键组合唯一，聚合是另一项决定","key":["py25"],"links":["py25.k2","py27.k1"],"card":{"name":"pivot 与聚合","aliases":["长变宽","pivot_table"],"definition":"pivot 把长表变回宽表：index 的值成为行，columns 的值成为列，values 填进格子；它要求每个（行, 列）组合只出现一次。","conditions":["组合重复时 pivot 报 ValueError；pivot_table 不报错，默认对重复的值取平均。","重复了取平均、取第一条还是先查清，是统计上的决定，要在需求里写明。"],"example":"```python\nwide = long.pivot(index=\"sample_id\", columns=\"day\", values=\"signal\")\n```\n表 L 变回宽表：行是 S_A、S_B、S_C，列是 day1、day2，按标签排好序。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"long","caption":"表 L：同一批测量排成长表（行的先后是录入的先后）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_A","S_B","S_A","S_C","S_B"],"day":["day2","day1","day1","day2","day1","day2"],"signal":[11,8,10,9,13,12]}}]},"lesson":"长表变宽表用 `pivot`：\n\n```python\nwide = long.pivot(index=\"sample_id\", columns=\"day\", values=\"signal\")\n```\n\n`index` 那一列的值成为行标签，`columns` 那一列的值成为列名，`values` 那一列的数填进格子。行和列都**按标签排好序**，与长表里行的先后无关：表 L 里 S_C 先出现，结果里仍是 S_A、S_B、S_C。\n\n每一格只能放一个数，所以 pivot 要求每个（sample_id, day）组合只出现一次。同一样本同一天有两行时，pivot 报 **ValueError**（Index contains duplicate entries, cannot reshape）。这个报错是在提醒你：数据和“每个样本每天一个测量”的约定不符，先用 [duplicated](repa:concept/py25.k2) 找出是哪几行。\n\n`pivot_table` 写法相同，但遇到重复不报错，而是**默认取平均**；写 `aggfunc=\"first\"` 则只留先出现的一条。取平均、取第一条，还是先交人核对，是对数据的一项决定，和[分组聚合](repa:concept/py27.k1)选 mean 还是 max 一样，要在需求里写明，不能让默认值替你决定。\n","example":{"id":"py31.k3.e0","body":"阅读代码，说出 `wide` 的样子。\n\n```python\nwide = long.pivot(index=\"sample_id\", columns=\"day\", values=\"signal\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","prompt":"`wide` 的行标签，按结果里的顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"S_C","content":"S_C"},{"id":"S_A","content":"S_A"},{"id":"S_B","content":"S_B"}],"key":["S_A","S_B","S_C"]},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`wide` 的列，按顺序排列，不属于它的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"day2","content":"`day2`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"day1","content":"`day1`"}],"key":["day1","day2"]},{"id":"cell","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`wide.loc[\"S_C\", \"day2\"]` 是多少？","key":11}],"explanation":"| sample_id | day1 | day2 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| S_A | 8 | 9 |\n| S_B | 10 | 12 |\n| S_C | 13 | 11 |\n\n行标签按顺序是 **S_A、S_B、S_C**，列是 **day1、day2**，都按标签排序，与长表里谁先出现无关；signal 是填进格子的值，不再是列名。S_C 第 2 天是 **11**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"long","caption":"表 L：同一批测量排成长表（行的先后是录入的先后）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_C","S_A","S_B","S_A","S_C","S_B"],"day":["day2","day1","day1","day2","day1","day2"],"signal":[11,8,10,9,13,12]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py31.k3.q1","body":"对这张长表运行下面的代码。\n\n```python\nwide = long.pivot(index=\"sample_id\", columns=\"day\", values=\"signal\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"会发生什么？","options":[{"id":"error","content":"报 ValueError，没有得到 wide"},{"id":"mean","content":"不报错，重复的那一格取平均"},{"id":"first","content":"不报错，重复的那一格留先出现的值"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"是哪个组合重复了？","options":[{"id":"S_A-day1","content":"S_A 的 day1"},{"id":"S_B-day1","content":"S_B 的 day1"},{"id":"S_B-day2","content":"S_B 的 day2"}],"key":"S_B-day1"}],"explanation":"**报 ValueError**：**S_B 的 day1** 有两行（10 和 14），宽表的一格放不下两个数，pivot 不替你选，直接报错。要先弄清这两次测量哪个对，或者定下处理规则。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"long","caption":"一张长表（行的先后是录入的先后）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_A","S_B","S_C","S_B"],"day":["day1","day1","day1","day2","day2","day2","day1"],"signal":[8,10,13,9,12,11,14]}}]},{"id":"py31.k3.q2","body":"同一张长表，改用 pivot_table。\n\n```python\na = long.pivot_table(index=\"sample_id\", columns=\"day\", values=\"signal\")\nb = long.pivot_table(index=\"sample_id\", columns=\"day\", values=\"signal\", aggfunc=\"first\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`a.loc[\"S_B\", \"day1\"]` 是多少？","key":12},{"id":"b","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"`b.loc[\"S_B\", \"day1\"]` 是多少？","key":10},{"id":"used","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`a` 里 S_B、day1 那一格是由几个测量算出来的？","key":2}],"explanation":"`a` 默认取平均：(10 + 14) / 2 = **12.0**；`b` 只留先出现的那一条，是 **10**。这一格由 **2** 个测量得来，而宽表上看不出这一点：12.0 看起来和别的格子一样，像是一次测到的值。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"long","caption":"一张长表（行的先后是录入的先后）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_A","S_B","S_C","S_B"],"day":["day1","day1","day1","day2","day2","day2","day1"],"signal":[8,10,13,9,12,11,14]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py31.k3.r1","body":"判断每句话对不对。说法里的参数都是 `index=\"plot\", columns=\"year\", values=\"kg\"`。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"claim","header":"说法"},{"id":"ok","header":"对吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"claim":"`farm.pivot(...)` 会报错","ok":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"claim":"把 pivot 换成 pivot_table，参数不变，就不报错","ok":true}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"claim":"pivot_table 的结果里，A、y2024 那一格是 4","ok":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"claim":"pivot_table 的结果和 farm 一样有 5 行","ok":false}}]}],"explanation":"第 1、2 句对，第 3、4 句错。A 在 y2024 有两条记录（4 和 6），pivot 报错；pivot_table 不报错，默认取平均，那一格是 5.0 而不是 4；结果每块地一行，只有 A、B 两行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"farm","caption":"表 farm：两块地两年的产量记录（千克）","columns":{"plot":["A","B","A","B","A"],"year":["y2024","y2024","y2025","y2025","y2024"],"kg":[4,6,5,7,6]}}]},{"id":"py31.k3.r2","body":"需求是：“每个站点一行，每个时段一列，格子是水温；同一站点同一时段记了不止一次时，只留表里先出现的那一次。”哪一行代码符合需求？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"pivot","content":"```python\nwide = temps.pivot(index=\"station\", columns=\"time\", values=\"temp\")\n```\n"},{"id":"mean","content":"```python\nwide = temps.pivot_table(index=\"station\", columns=\"time\", values=\"temp\")\n```\n"},{"id":"max","content":"```python\nwide = temps.pivot_table(index=\"station\", columns=\"time\", values=\"temp\", aggfunc=\"max\")\n```\n"},{"id":"first","content":"```python\nwide = temps.pivot_table(index=\"station\", columns=\"time\", values=\"temp\", aggfunc=\"first\")\n```\n"}],"key":"first"}],"explanation":"`aggfunc=\"first\"` 的那一行符合需求：N1 上午记了 12 和 14，留先出现的 12。pivot 遇到重复会报错；不写 aggfunc 默认取平均，得 13.0；`aggfunc=\"max\"` 留的是较大的 14。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：水温记录（摄氏度），行的先后是录入的先后","columns":{"station":["N1","N2","N1","N2","N1"],"time":["am","am","pm","pm","am"],"temp":[12,15,18,20,14]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py31.k3.x1","body":"屏幕上依次显示什么？\n\n```python\nwide = growth.pivot_table(index=\"dish\", columns=\"hour\", values=\"colonies\")\nprint(wide.shape)\nprint(wide.loc[\"D2\", \"h24\"])\nprint(wide.loc[\"D1\", \"h0\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行","key":"(2, 2)"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行","key":"32.0"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行","key":"12.0","feedback":[{"when":"12","message":"pivot_table 默认取平均，结果是浮点数；只有一个值时平均也写成 12.0。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **(2, 2)、32.0、12.0**。两个培养皿、两个时间点，宽表 2 行 2 列。D2 在 24 小时记了两次（30 和 34），pivot_table 默认取平均得 32.0；D1 在 0 小时只有一次 12，取平均后也成了浮点数 12.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"growth","caption":"表 growth：培养皿在 0 小时和 24 小时的菌落数","columns":{"dish":["D2","D1","D2","D1","D2"],"hour":["h0","h0","h24","h24","h24"],"colonies":[10,12,30,26,34]}}]},{"id":"py31.k3.x2","body":"负责人的要求是：“同一样本同一天测出两个不同的数时，先拿给我核对，不要让程序自己挑一个或者取平均。”\n","slots":[{"id":"marked","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按 sample_id 和 day，用 keep=False 标出的重复行有几行？","key":2},{"id":"next","type":"choice","prompt":"转成宽表之前，下一步最合适的是哪一项？","options":[{"id":"mean","content":"直接用 `pivot_table`，按默认取平均"},{"id":"first","content":"用 `pivot_table` 加 `aggfunc=\"first\"`，只留先出现的一条"},{"id":"check","content":"先用 `duplicated(subset=[\"sample_id\", \"day\"], keep=False)` 标出这些行，交给负责人核对，确认后再 pivot"},{"id":"full","content":"先用 `drop_duplicates()` 去掉整行重复，再 pivot"}],"key":"check"}],"explanation":"标出 **2** 行：S_B 的 day1 那两行。负责人要求先核对，所以应当**先标出这些行交给负责人，确认后再 pivot**。取平均、取第一条都是程序替人做了决定；`drop_duplicates()` 不写 subset 只去整行相同的行，这两行 signal 不同，去不掉，之后 pivot 照样报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"long","caption":"一张长表（行的先后是录入的先后）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_A","S_B","S_C","S_B"],"day":["day1","day1","day1","day2","day2","day2","day1"],"signal":[8,10,13,9,12,11,14]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py32","title":"日期是一种有单位的值","summary":"按约定的格式把文字读成日期并数清读不了的值；两个日期相减得到时间差，取出整数天数；按日期区间筛选时写明两端算不算。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py20","py18"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表，你直接读表和代码。\n\n从 CSV 或 Excel 读进来的日期，在 pandas 里往往只是一串文字，例如 `\"2026-03-02\"`。文字不能相减，也不能按先后比较大小。这一节先按约定的格式把它读成日期，再算相隔几天、筛出某段时间的记录。本节的日期都在同一个时区，只精确到“日”。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提日期相关的需求时，可以照这三句说：\n\n- “collected 列按 年-月-日 读成日期，读不了的变成缺失，并告诉我有几个。”\n- “等待天数是检测日期减采样日期的整数天数，采样当天算第 0 天。”\n- “只要 3 月 1 日（含）到 4 月 1 日（不含）之间采的样本。”\n\n拿到代码后，看 format 是否与数据的写法一致，看有没有数读不了的值，看区间两端用的是 `>=`、`>` 还是 `<`、`<=`。\n","kps":[{"id":"py32.k1","title":"按固定格式读懂 to_datetime 与转换失败","key":["py19","py03"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"按格式读日期","aliases":["to_datetime","NaT","format"],"definition":"pd.to_datetime(列, format=\"%Y-%m-%d\") 按给定格式把文字逐个读成日期；格式对不上的值默认让整行报 ValueError，加 errors=\"coerce\" 时变成缺失 NaT。","conditions":["用了 errors=\"coerce\" 不等于都读对了，要用 isna().sum() 数出有几个 NaT，写进结果说明。","03/04/2026 是 3 月 4 日还是 4 月 3 日只能由数据来源说明，format 要照着说明写。","原本就空着的格子不算格式错误，也直接是 NaT。"],"example":"```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.isna().sum()\n```\n\"2026/03/09\" 用了斜杠，\"2026-02-30\" 日历上没有，这两个变成 NaT，n_bad 为 2。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：四个样本登记的采样日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026/03/09","2026-03-15","2026-02-30"]}}]},"lesson":"读进来的日期往往还是文字。`pd.to_datetime` 把一列文字读成日期，`format` 告诉它每个值长什么样：\n\n| 写法 | 意思 |\n|---|---|\n| `%Y` | 四位年份，例如 2026 |\n| `%m` | 月份，例如 03 |\n| `%d` | 几号，例如 09 |\n\n`format=\"%Y-%m-%d\"` 就是“年-月-日，中间用短横线”。连接符号也要一模一样：`\"2026/03/09\"` 用了斜杠，对不上；`\"2026-02-30\"` 写法对，但日历上没有 2 月 30 日，也读不了。\n\n遇到读不了的值，默认整行代码报 **ValueError**，什么结果也不产生。加上 `errors=\"coerce\"`，读不了的值变成 **NaT**（日期的缺失值），其余照常读。这和把文字转成数字时的做法一样：程序不报错了，但坏值还在，要用 `.isna().sum()` 数出有几个，写进结果说明。\n\n格式还决定怎样理解一个值。`\"03/04/2026\"` 按 `\"%d/%m/%Y\"`（日/月/年）是 4 月 3 日，按 `\"%m/%d/%Y\"`（月/日/年）是 3 月 4 日，两种都读得通、都不报错。哪一种对，只能由数据的来源说明，需求里要写明。\n","example":{"id":"py32.k1.e0","body":"登记表约定采样日期写成“年-月-日”。阅读代码，回答下面几问。\n\n```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.isna().sum()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nat","type":"table","label":"哪些值变成了 NaT","columns":[{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"collected","header":"collected"},{"id":"nat","header":"变成 NaT 吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"sample_id":"S_A","collected":"2026-03-02","nat":false}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"sample_id":"S_B","collected":"2026/03/09","nat":true}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"sample_id":"S_C","collected":"2026-03-15","nat":false}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"sample_id":"S_D","collected":"2026-02-30","nat":true}}]},{"id":"n_bad","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`n_bad` 是多少？","key":2},{"id":"strict","type":"choice","prompt":"如果去掉 `errors=\"coerce\"`，第一行运行时会怎样？","options":[{"id":"skip","content":"只把读不了的两个值变成 NaT，其余照常"},{"id":"drop","content":"把读不了的两行从表里删掉"},{"id":"error","content":"报 ValueError，`dates` 没有得到任何值"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"S_B 和 S_D 变成 **NaT**，`n_bad` 是 **2**。S_B 的 `\"2026/03/09\"` 用了斜杠，和格式里的短横线对不上；S_D 的 `\"2026-02-30\"` 写法没错，但日历上没有 2 月 30 日。\n\n去掉 `errors=\"coerce\"` 时，遇到第一个读不了的值就**报 ValueError**，这一行没有完成，`dates` 也就没有被赋值。`errors=\"coerce\"` 也不会删掉任何行：`dates` 仍有 4 个值，只是其中两个是 NaT。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：四个样本登记的采样日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026/03/09","2026-03-15","2026-02-30"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py32.k1.q1","body":"日期约定写成“年-月-日”。阅读代码。\n\n```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"bad","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"哪几个样本的日期读不了，变成了 NaT？选出全部。","options":[{"id":"S_E","content":"S_E（`2026-04-01`）"},{"id":"S_F","content":"S_F（`20260402`）"},{"id":"S_G","content":"S_G（`2026-04-03`）"},{"id":"S_H","content":"S_H（`2026-04-31`）"},{"id":"S_I","content":"S_I（`2026-04-05`）"}],"key":["S_F","S_H"]},{"id":"size","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`dates` 一共有几个值（包括 NaT）？","key":5,"feedback":[{"when":3,"message":"errors=\"coerce\" 不删值，读不了的位置留下 NaT，个数和原来的列一样。"}]}],"explanation":"**S_F 和 S_H** 读不了：`\"20260402\"` 中间没有短横线；4 月只有 30 天，`\"2026-04-31\"` 不存在。`dates` 仍有 **5** 个值，读不了的位置是 NaT，没有被删掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：另一批样本的采样日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_F","S_G","S_H","S_I"],"collected":["2026-04-01","20260402","2026-04-03","2026-04-31","2026-04-05"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k1.q2","body":"下面的程序想数出读不了的日期有几个。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nprint(dates.isna().sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行结果是什么？","options":[{"id":"one","content":"显示 1"},{"id":"error","content":"第 1 行报 ValueError，第 2 行没有运行"},{"id":"zero","content":"显示 0"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"把第 1 行换成哪一行，程序就能显示读不了的个数 1？","options":[{"id":"coerce","content":"```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n"},{"id":"dots","content":"```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y.%m.%d\")\n```\n","feedback":"换成点号以后，另外两个用短横线的值又对不上了，照样报错。"},{"id":"noformat","content":"```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(raw[\"collected\"])\n```\n","feedback":"不写 format 时 pandas 按第一个值猜格式，第三个值仍然对不上，照样报错。"}],"key":"coerce"}],"explanation":"`\"2026.05.08\"` 用的是点号，和 `\"%Y-%m-%d\"` 对不上，所以第 1 行**报 ValueError**，程序停在这里，第 2 行没有机会运行。\n\n加上 `errors=\"coerce\"` 后，这个值变成 NaT，第 2 行显示 1。把格式改成点号，另外两个值又对不上；去掉 format，pandas 按第一个值猜出“年-月-日”，第三个值照样报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：三个样本的采样日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_J","S_K","S_L"],"collected":["2026-05-06","2026-05-07","2026.05.08"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k1.q3","body":"合作实验室发来的表里，日期写成 `03/04/2026`、`25/04/2026` 这样。对方说明：前两位是“日”，中间两位是“月”，最后是年。\n","slots":[{"id":"fmt","type":"choice","prompt":"`pd.to_datetime` 的 format 应该写哪一个？","options":[{"id":"mdy","content":"`\"%m/%d/%Y\"`"},{"id":"ymd","content":"`\"%Y-%m-%d\"`"},{"id":"dmy","content":"`\"%d/%m/%Y\"`"},{"id":"ymd_slash","content":"`\"%Y/%m/%d\"`"}],"key":"dmy"},{"id":"month","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按对方的说明，`03/04/2026` 是几月？","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":3,"message":"前两位 03 是日，中间的 04 才是月。"}]}],"explanation":"写 **`\"%d/%m/%Y\"`**：`%d` 是日，`%m` 是月，`%Y` 是四位年份，中间用斜杠。按这个格式，`03/04/2026` 是 **4** 月 3 日。\n\n如果写成 `\"%m/%d/%Y\"`，`03/04/2026` 也能读，只是读成了 3 月 4 日，程序不会提醒你；`25/04/2026` 才会因为没有 25 月而读不了。所以一列里日和月都不超过 12 时，只能靠来源说明来定格式。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py32.k1.r1","body":"采样日期约定写成“年-月-日”。阅读代码，回答下面两问。\n\n```python\nwhen = pd.to_datetime(soil[\"sampled\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nprint(when.isna().sum())\nok = soil.loc[when.notna(), [\"site\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示哪个整数？","key":2},{"id":"kept","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`ok` 里留下了哪些采样点？按先后顺序排出来，没留下的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"n","content":"北坡"},{"id":"s","content":"南坡"},{"id":"e","content":"东坡"},{"id":"w","content":"西坡"}],"key":["n","w"]}],"explanation":"显示 **2**。南坡的 `\"2026-06-31\"` 不存在（6 月只有 30 天），东坡的 `\"6/12/2026\"` 写法和“年-月-日”对不上，都变成 NaT。`when.notna()` 标出读得了的行，`ok` 按原顺序留下**北坡、西坡**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点登记的采样日期（还是文字）","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"sampled":["2026-06-10","2026-06-31","6/12/2026","2026-06-12"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k1.r2","body":"这台仪器的说明书写着：导出的日期按“月/日/年”记录。阅读代码，填出两次测量各是几月几号。\n\n```python\nd = pd.to_datetime(lab[\"date\"], format=\"%m/%d/%Y\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"parts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"run_id","header":"run_id"},{"id":"date","header":"date"},{"id":"month","header":"月","input":"integer"},{"id":"day","header":"日","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"run_id":"R1","date":"05/06/2026","month":5,"day":6}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"run_id":"R2","date":"12/01/2026","month":12,"day":1}}]}],"explanation":"格式 `\"%m/%d/%Y\"` 的第一段是月、第二段是日：R1 是 **5 月 6 日**，R2 是 **12 月 1 日**。同样的文字如果按“日/月/年”读，就成了 6 月 5 日和 1 月 12 日，而且不会报错，所以格式一定要照来源说明写。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"lab","caption":"表 lab：仪器导出的测量日期（还是文字）","columns":{"run_id":["R1","R2"],"date":["05/06/2026","12/01/2026"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py32.k1.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> sown 列按“年-月-日”读成日期，结果叫 `dates`；读不了的值变成缺失，不要让程序报错。`n_bad` 是读不了的个数。不改变 `plots`。\n\n作答框里的代码一运行就报错，`n_bad` 也写死成了 0。请改动它并提交。判分时还会换一张表运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nn_bad = 0\n","solution":"dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.isna().sum()\n","accepts":["dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], errors=\"coerce\", format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nn_bad = int(dates.isna().sum())\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.isna().sum()\n","why":"没写 format，pandas 按第一个值猜格式，第一个值写法不同时整列都读错"},{"code":"dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = 2\n","why":"照着这张表把个数写死"},{"code":"dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], format=\"%Y/%m/%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.isna().sum()\n","why":"格式写成了斜杠"},{"code":"dates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.notna().sum()\n","why":"数成了读得了的个数"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 plots","expect":{"n_bad":"2","dates.isna().tolist()":"[False, True, False, True]","dates.dropna().dt.day.tolist()":"[3, 17]","plots":"plots"}},{"name":"第一个值写法不同的表","hidden":true,"data":["plots2"],"expect":{"n_bad":"1","dates.isna().tolist()":"[True, False, False]","plots":"plots"}},{"name":"全部读得了的表","hidden":true,"data":["plots3"],"expect":{"n_bad":"0","dates.dt.day.tolist()":"[1, 2, 3]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(plots[\"sown\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\nn_bad = dates.isna().sum()\n```\n\n加上 `errors=\"coerce\"`，`\"2026/04/10\"` 和 `\"unknown\"` 变成 NaT，程序不再报错；`n_bad` 由 `dates` 数出来，是 2。format 要留着：换一张第一个值写成 `\"04/05/2026\"` 的表，不写 format 时 pandas 会照这个值猜成“月/日/年”，后面按“年-月-日”写的值反而全读不了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：四块样地的播种日期（还是文字）","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"sown":["2026-04-03","2026/04/10","2026-04-17","unknown"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k1.x2","body":"同事运行了下面这行，没有报错，于是说：“加了 `errors=\"coerce\"` 以后不报错了，说明 tested 列的日期全都读对了。”\n\n```python\ndates = pd.to_datetime(assay[\"tested\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\", errors=\"coerce\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`dates` 里有几个 NaT？","key":1},{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"同事的说法对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，没报错就说明都读对了"},{"id":"dropped","content":"不对，读不了的那一行已经从 assay 里删掉了"},{"id":"hidden","content":"不对，读不了的值变成了 NaT，要数出个数并在结果里说明"}],"key":"hidden"}],"explanation":"有 **1** 个 NaT：A3 的 `\"2026-07-32\"` 不存在。`errors=\"coerce\"` 的作用是把读不了的值变成 NaT、让程序继续往下走，并不保证都读对了；它也不删行，`assay` 和 `dates` 都还是 5 行。所以要数出 NaT 的个数，写进结果说明。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"assay","caption":"表 assay：五个样本的检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["A1","A2","A3","A4","A5"],"tested":["2026-07-01","2026-07-15","2026-07-32","2026-07-20","2026-07-28"]}}]}]},{"id":"py32.k2","title":"同一时区的简单时间差和天数单位","key":["py02"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"时间差与天数","aliases":["Timedelta","dt.days","间隔天数"],"definition":"两个日期相减得到时间差（显示为“3 days”），它带着单位，不是普通数字；.dt.days 取出整数天数，才能和数字比较。","conditions":["“间隔几天”是后一天减前一天；“包括首尾共几天”要再加 1，需求里要写明是哪一种。","时间差直接和整数比较会报 TypeError；.dt.day 是日期的“几号”，不是天数。"],"example":"```python\nwait = (tested - collected).dt.days\n```\n3 月 2 日采样、3 月 5 日检测，wait 为 3；3 月 31 日到 4 月 2 日跨了月份，wait 为 2。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},"lesson":"把两列文字都读成日期以后，就可以相减：\n\n```python\ncollected = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ntested = pd.to_datetime(log[\"tested\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ngap = tested - collected\n```\n\n`gap` 的每个值是一个**时间差**，显示成 `3 days` 这样，带着单位。它不是普通的整数：写 `gap > 5` 会报 TypeError。取 `.dt.days` 才得到整数天数，之后才能和数字比较、筛选：\n\n```python\nwait = gap.dt.days\n```\n\n相减时 pandas 按日历算，跨月、跨年、2 月有几天都不用自己数。\n\n“相隔几天”和“一共几天”差 1。3 月 2 日采样、3 月 5 日检测，相隔 5 − 2 = 3 天；如果说“从采样那天到检测那天，两头都算，一共几天”，是 4 天，要写成 `gap.dt.days + 1`。需求里要写明是哪一种，例如“采样当天算第 0 天”。\n","example":{"id":"py32.k2.e0","body":"想知道每个样本采样后等了几天才检测。阅读代码，填出 `wait` 的值。\n\n```python\ncollected = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ntested = pd.to_datetime(log[\"tested\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nwait = (tested - collected).dt.days\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"wait","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"sample_id","header":"sample_id"},{"id":"collected","header":"collected"},{"id":"tested","header":"tested"},{"id":"wait","header":"wait","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"sample_id":"S_A","collected":"2026-03-02","tested":"2026-03-05","wait":3}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"sample_id":"S_B","collected":"2026-03-15","tested":"2026-03-15","wait":0}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"sample_id":"S_C","collected":"2026-03-31","tested":"2026-04-02","wait":2}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"sample_id":"S_D","collected":"2026-04-01","tested":"2026-04-08","wait":7}}]},{"id":"span","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"S_A 从采样那天到检测那天，两头都算，一共是几天？","key":4}],"explanation":"`wait` 依次为 **3、0、2、7**。S_B 当天采样当天检测，相隔 0 天；S_C 从 3 月 31 日到 4 月 2 日跨了月份，pandas 按日历算出 2 天。`.dt.days` 把每个时间差变成整数。\n\nS_A 两头都算是 **4** 天（3 月 2、3、4、5 日），比相隔天数多 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py32.k2.q1","body":"要标出等了超过 5 天才检测的样本。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncollected = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ntested = pd.to_datetime(log[\"tested\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ngap = tested - collected\nlate = gap > 5\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行到第 4 行时会怎样？","options":[{"id":"values","content":"`late` 依次为 False、False、False、True"},{"id":"error","content":"报 TypeError：时间差不能直接和整数比较"},{"id":"all_false","content":"`late` 全是 False"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 行改成哪一行才对？","options":[{"id":"day","content":"```python\nlate = gap.dt.day > 5\n```\n","feedback":"时间差没有 .dt.day（那是日期的“几号”），会报 AttributeError。"},{"id":"days","content":"```python\nlate = gap.dt.days > 5\n```\n"},{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nlate = gap.days > 5\n```\n","feedback":"一整列时间差要先写 .dt，才能取 days。"}],"key":"days"}],"explanation":"第 4 行**报 TypeError**：`gap` 里是带单位的时间差，pandas 不知道 5 是 5 天还是 5 秒，所以不让它和整数直接比较。\n\n改成 `late = gap.dt.days > 5`：先取出整数天数（3、0、2、7），再比较，只有 S_D 是 True。`.dt.day` 是日期的“几号”，时间差没有它；不写 `.dt` 也取不到 days。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k2.q2","body":"每次实验从开始那天做到结束那天，两天都做了实验。阅读代码，填出 `gap` 和 `span`。\n\n```python\nstart = pd.to_datetime(trials[\"start\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(trials[\"end\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ngap = (end - start).dt.days\nspan = gap + 1\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"trial","header":"trial"},{"id":"start","header":"start"},{"id":"end","header":"end"},{"id":"gap","header":"gap","input":"integer"},{"id":"span","header":"span","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"trial":"T1","start":"2026-03-30","end":"2026-04-02","gap":3,"span":4}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"trial":"T2","start":"2026-04-10","end":"2026-04-10","gap":0,"span":1}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"trial":"T3","start":"2026-02-27","end":"2026-03-02","gap":3,"span":4}}]},{"id":"which","type":"choice","prompt":"“这次实验一共做了几天”应该用哪一列回答？","options":[{"id":"gap","content":"`gap`"},{"id":"span","content":"`span`"}],"key":"span"}],"explanation":"`gap` 依次为 **3、0、3**，`span` 依次为 **4、1、4**。T2 开始和结束是同一天，相隔 0 天，但实验做了 1 天。T3 从 2 月 27 日到 3 月 2 日，2026 年 2 月只有 28 天，pandas 按日历算出相隔 3 天。\n\n两头都做了实验，问“一共做了几天”要用 **`span`**，也就是相隔天数再加 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trials","caption":"表 trials：三次田间实验的开始和结束日期（两天都做了实验）","columns":{"trial":["T1","T2","T3"],"start":["2026-03-30","2026-04-10","2026-02-27"],"end":["2026-04-02","2026-04-10","2026-03-02"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k2.q3","body":"阅读代码，说出 `slow` 留下了哪些样本。\n\n```python\ncollected = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ntested = pd.to_datetime(log[\"tested\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nwait = (tested - collected).dt.days\nslow = log.loc[wait >= 3, [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按先后顺序排出 `slow` 里的 sample_id，没留下的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"S_E","content":"S_E"},{"id":"S_F","content":"S_F"},{"id":"S_G","content":"S_G"},{"id":"S_H","content":"S_H"},{"id":"S_I","content":"S_I"}],"key":["S_E","S_I"]}],"explanation":"`wait` 依次为 3、0、2、1、5：S_E 从 2 月 27 日到 3 月 2 日跨过了只有 28 天的 2 月，是 3 天；S_H 从 3 月 31 日到 4 月 1 日是 1 天。`>= 3` 包含等号，留下 **S_E、S_I**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"另一张同结构的表","columns":{"sample_id":["S_E","S_F","S_G","S_H","S_I"],"collected":["2026-02-27","2026-03-01","2026-03-10","2026-03-31","2026-04-15"],"tested":["2026-03-02","2026-03-01","2026-03-12","2026-04-01","2026-04-20"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py32.k2.r1","body":"要求是：样品寄出后 **2 天以内**到达实验室算按时，寄出当天算第 0 天，第 2 天到达也算按时。前两行已经写好：\n\n```python\nsent = pd.to_datetime(ship[\"sent\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\narrived = pd.to_datetime(ship[\"arrived\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n```\n\n第三行应写成哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"strict","content":"```python\non_time = (arrived - sent).dt.days < 2\n```\n"},{"id":"raw","content":"```python\non_time = (arrived - sent) <= 2\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\non_time = (arrived - sent).dt.days <= 2\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`on_time = (arrived - sent).dt.days <= 2`。五份样品相隔 1、3、2、0、3 天；“第 2 天到达也算按时”要包含等号，P3 才算按时。写成 `< 2` 会把 P3 判成迟到；不取 `.dt.days` 直接拿时间差和 2 比较，会报 TypeError。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"ship","caption":"表 ship：五份样品的寄出日期和到达实验室的日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"sent":["2026-05-04","2026-05-04","2026-05-06","2026-05-08","2026-05-29"],"arrived":["2026-05-05","2026-05-07","2026-05-08","2026-05-08","2026-06-01"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k2.r2","body":"每次降雨从开始那天下到结束那天，两天都下了雨。同事用下面的代码算每次下了几天雨：\n\n```python\nstart = pd.to_datetime(rain[\"start\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(rain[\"end\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nrain_days = (end - start).dt.days\n```\n\n他看到 E1（6 月 28 日到 7 月 3 日）的 `rain_days` 是 5，就在报告里写：“E1 一共下了 5 天雨。”\n","slots":[{"id":"verdict","type":"choice","prompt":"这句报告对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，相隔几天就是下了几天"},{"id":"add_one","content":"不对：开始和结束两天都下了雨，应当比相隔天数多 1，一共 6 天"},{"id":"minus_one","content":"不对：开始那天不算，应当比相隔天数少 1，一共 4 天"}],"key":"add_one"},{"id":"e2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"E2 开始和结束是同一天（7 月 9 日），代码里它的 `rain_days` 是多少？","key":0},{"id":"e3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"E3 从 7 月 20 日下到 7 月 22 日，按“两天都算”，一共下了几天雨？","key":3}],"explanation":"`(end - start).dt.days` 算的是**相隔**几天：E1 是 5 天（6 月有 30 天，28 日到 3 日隔 5 天）。可是降雨从开始那天下到结束那天，两头都下了雨，6 月 28、29、30 日和 7 月 1、2、3 日，一共 **6** 天，要在相隔天数上加 1。\n\nE2 开始和结束是同一天，相隔 **0** 天，但那天下了雨，一共 1 天。E3 相隔 2 天，从 20 日到 22 日三天都下了雨，一共 **3** 天。“相隔几天”和“一共几天”差 1，需求里要写明是哪一种。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"rain","caption":"表 rain：监测站记录的三次连续降雨，开始和结束那天都下了雨","columns":{"event":["E1","E2","E3"],"start":["2026-06-28","2026-07-09","2026-07-20"],"end":["2026-07-03","2026-07-09","2026-07-22"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py32.k2.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> `days` 是每只小鼠在代谢笼里的天数，**放入和取出那天都算**，是整数。\n\n作答框里前两行已经把日期读好了，第三行算出的还不是需求要的值。请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `days`。判分时还会换一张表运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"start = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_in\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_out\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ndays = end - start\n","solution":"start = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_in\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_out\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ndays = (end - start).dt.days + 1\n","rejects":[{"code":"start = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_in\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_out\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ndays = (end - start).dt.days\n","why":"算的是相隔天数，没有把两头都算上"},{"code":"start = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_in\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_out\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ndays = end.dt.day - start.dt.day + 1\n","why":"只用几号相减，跨月时算错"},{"code":"start = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_in\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nend = pd.to_datetime(cages[\"moved_out\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\ndays = (end - start).dt.days - 1\n","why":"两头都没算"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 cages","expect":{"days.tolist()":"[4, 1, 8]"}},{"name":"跨 2 月和跨年的表","hidden":true,"data":["cages2"],"expect":{"days.tolist()":"[4, 4]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndays = (end - start).dt.days + 1\n```\n\n`end - start` 是时间差，不是整数，先取 `.dt.days` 得到相隔天数 3、0、7，再加 1 把放入和取出那天都算上，得到 4、1、8。只拿“几号”相减在跨月时会出错，例如 8 月 28 日到 9 月 4 日，4 − 28 是负数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"cages","caption":"表 cages：三只小鼠放入和取出代谢笼的日期（还是文字）","columns":{"mouse":["M1","M2","M3"],"moved_in":["2026-08-03","2026-08-10","2026-08-28"],"moved_out":["2026-08-06","2026-08-10","2026-09-04"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k2.x2","body":"阅读代码，回答下面两问。\n\n```python\nfrozen = pd.to_datetime(freezer[\"frozen\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nthawed = pd.to_datetime(freezer[\"thawed\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nstored = (thawed - frozen).dt.days\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"f1","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"F1 的 `stored` 是多少？","key":31},{"id":"f3","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"F3 的 `stored` 是多少？","key":0}],"explanation":"F1 从 1 月 30 日冻存到 3 月 2 日解冻：1 月还剩 1 天到 31 日，2026 年 2 月有 28 天，再到 3 月 2 日 2 天，共 **31** 天。pandas 按日历替你算，不用自己数。F3 冻存和解冻是同一天，`stored` 是 **0**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"freezer","caption":"表 freezer：三份样本冻存和解冻的日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["F1","F2","F3"],"frozen":["2026-01-30","2026-02-10","2026-03-31"],"thawed":["2026-03-02","2026-02-11","2026-03-31"]}}]}]},{"id":"py32.k3","title":"按日期区间筛选，明确左右边界","key":["py18","py08"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"日期区间","aliases":["左闭右开","日期筛选"],"definition":"读成日期后可以和 \"2026-03-01\" 这样的文字比较先后；一段时间用 & 连起两个加了括号的比较，3 月写成 >= 3 月 1 日且 < 4 月 1 日。","conditions":["需求要写明两端那一天算不算；右端写成“小于下个月 1 日”不用记每月几天。","记录带时刻时，<= \"2026-03-31\" 只到 3 月 31 日零点，当天下午的记录会漏掉。"],"example":"```python\nmarch = log.loc[(collected >= \"2026-03-01\") & (collected < \"2026-04-01\"), [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n留下 3 月 2 日、15 日、31 日采的 S_A、S_B、S_C；4 月 1 日采的 S_D 不在 3 月。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},"lesson":"读成日期以后，就能比较先后：`collected >= \"2026-03-01\"` 对每一行判断“是不是在 3 月 1 日或之后”，得到一列 True/False，右边的文字 pandas 会当作日期来比较。\n\n一段时间要两个条件同时成立，用 `&` 连起来，每个比较加括号：\n\n```python\nin_march = (collected >= \"2026-03-01\") & (collected < \"2026-04-01\")\n```\n\n注意两端写法不同：左端 `>=` 包含 3 月 1 日，右端 `<` 不包含 4 月 1 日。这叫**左闭右开**，表示一个月很方便：不用记 3 月有 31 天，换成 2 月也照样写“小于 3 月 1 日”。\n\n还有一个理由：有的记录带时刻，例如 `2026-03-31 14:20`。`\"2026-03-31\"` 当作日期时是 3 月 31 日零点，所以 `<= \"2026-03-31\"` 会漏掉 3 月 31 日下午的记录，而 `< \"2026-04-01\"` 不会。\n\n不管怎样写，需求里都要说清两端那一天算不算，例如“3 月 1 日（含）到 4 月 1 日（不含）”。\n","example":{"id":"py32.k3.e0","body":"只要 3 月采的样本。阅读代码。\n\n```python\ncollected = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nmarch = log.loc[(collected >= \"2026-03-01\") & (collected < \"2026-04-01\"), [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按先后顺序排出 `march` 里的 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"S_A","content":"S_A"},{"id":"S_B","content":"S_B"},{"id":"S_C","content":"S_C"},{"id":"S_D","content":"S_D"}],"key":["S_A","S_B","S_C"]},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"S_D 是 4 月 1 日采的，它为什么不在结果里？","options":[{"id":"strict","content":"右端写的是 `<`，不包含 4 月 1 日"},{"id":"left","content":"左端写的是 `>=`，把它排除了"},{"id":"format","content":"它的日期读不了"}],"key":"strict"}],"explanation":"留下 **S_A、S_B、S_C**（3 月 2 日、15 日、31 日）。S_D 是 4 月 1 日，右端的 `<` 不包含这一天，所以没有留下。3 月 31 日的 S_C 留下了，不用另外写“小于等于 3 月 31 日”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py32.k3.q1","body":"要标出 3 月 15 日到 3 月 31 日（两天都算）之间的采样。阅读代码，填写 `in_window` 的值。\n\n```python\nd = pd.to_datetime(visits[\"day\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nin_window = (d >= \"2026-03-15\") & (d <= \"2026-03-31\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"mask","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"visit","header":"visit"},{"id":"day","header":"day"},{"id":"in_window","header":"in_window","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r0","cells":{"visit":"V1","day":"2026-03-14","in_window":false}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"visit":"V2","day":"2026-03-15","in_window":true}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"visit":"V3","day":"2026-03-20","in_window":true}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"visit":"V4","day":"2026-03-31","in_window":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"visit":"V5","day":"2026-04-01","in_window":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **False、True、True、True、False**。两端都写了等号，3 月 15 日和 3 月 31 日都算；3 月 14 日早于左端，4 月 1 日晚于右端。这张表只有日期、没有时刻，所以 `<= \"2026-03-31\"` 不会漏掉 3 月 31 日。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"visits","caption":"表 visits：五次野外采样的日期（还是文字）","columns":{"visit":["V1","V2","V3","V4","V5"],"day":["2026-03-14","2026-03-15","2026-03-20","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k3.q2","body":"下面的代码想标出 3 月采的样本。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncollected = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nin_march = collected >= \"2026-03-01\" & collected < \"2026-04-01\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行到第 2 行时会怎样？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"得到 True、True、True、False"},{"id":"first","content":"只按第一个条件判断，得到 True、True、True、True"},{"id":"error","content":"报 TypeError"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行改成哪一行才对？","options":[{"id":"and","content":"```python\nin_march = (collected >= \"2026-03-01\") and (collected < \"2026-04-01\")\n```\n","feedback":"and 只能连接两个单独的 True/False；一整列要用 &。"},{"id":"paren","content":"```python\nin_march = (collected >= \"2026-03-01\") & (collected < \"2026-04-01\")\n```\n"},{"id":"or","content":"```python\nin_march = (collected >= \"2026-03-01\") | (collected < \"2026-04-01\")\n```\n","feedback":"| 表示两个条件满足一个就行，每一行都会是 True。"}],"key":"paren"}],"explanation":"第 2 行**报 TypeError**。`&` 比 `>=`、`<` 先算，Python 先去算 `\"2026-03-01\" & collected`，文字和一列日期没法做 `&`。\n\n给每个比较加上括号，写成 `(collected >= \"2026-03-01\") & (collected < \"2026-04-01\")`，得到 True、True、True、False。换成 `and` 会报错，因为它只能连接两个单独的 True/False；换成 `|` 则每一行都满足其中一个条件。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k3.q3","body":"这张表的时间带时刻，格式是“年-月-日 时:分”，所以 format 多了 `%H:%M`（时和分）。两种写法都想留下 3 月的读数。\n\n```python\nt = pd.to_datetime(readings[\"time\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M\")\na = readings.loc[(t >= \"2026-03-01\") & (t <= \"2026-03-31\"), [\"reading_id\"]]\nb = readings.loc[(t >= \"2026-03-01\") & (t < \"2026-04-01\"), [\"reading_id\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`a` 有几行？","key":1},{"id":"b_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`b` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"right","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一种写法留下了全部 3 月的读数？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"`a` 的写法"},{"id":"b","content":"`b` 的写法"}],"key":"b"}],"explanation":"`a` 只有 **1** 行，`b` 有 **3** 行。`\"2026-03-31\"` 当作时刻是 3 月 31 日 0 点，D2（8:00）和 D3（14:20）都晚于它，被 `<= \"2026-03-31\"` 漏掉了。**`b` 的写法**用“小于 4 月 1 日”，3 月 31 日一整天都在里面，D4（4 月 1 日 6:00）不在。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"readings","caption":"表 readings：仪器的四条读数记录，时间带时刻（年-月-日 时:分）","columns":{"reading_id":["D1","D2","D3","D4"],"time":["2026-03-30 09:00","2026-03-31 08:00","2026-03-31 14:20","2026-04-01 06:00"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py32.k3.r1","body":"需求是：只要第二季度的采样，也就是 4 月 1 日到 6 月 30 日，**两天都算**。日期已经读好了：\n\n```python\nd = pd.to_datetime(q[\"day\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n```\n\n标出第二季度的那一行应写成哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"open_left","content":"```python\nkeep = (d > \"2026-04-01\") & (d < \"2026-07-01\")\n```\n"},{"id":"either","content":"```python\nkeep = (d >= \"2026-04-01\") | (d < \"2026-07-01\")\n```\n"},{"id":"short","content":"```python\nkeep = (d >= \"2026-04-01\") & (d < \"2026-06-30\")\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nkeep = (d >= \"2026-04-01\") & (d < \"2026-07-01\")\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`(d >= \"2026-04-01\") & (d < \"2026-07-01\")`：左端包含 4 月 1 日，右端“小于 7 月 1 日”正好把 6 月 30 日包括进来，留下 G2、G3、G4。`d > \"2026-04-01\"` 漏掉 4 月 1 日；`d < \"2026-06-30\"` 漏掉 6 月 30 日；用 `|` 时每一行都满足其中一个条件，什么也没筛掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"q","caption":"表 q：六次采样的日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["G1","G2","G3","G4","G5","G6"],"day":["2026-03-31","2026-04-01","2026-05-15","2026-06-30","2026-07-01","2026-07-02"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k3.r2","body":"要找出**不在** 5 月第一周（5 月 1 日（含）到 5 月 8 日（不含））采样的点。阅读代码。\n\n```python\nd = pd.to_datetime(soil[\"sampled\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\noutside = soil.loc[~((d >= \"2026-05-01\") & (d < \"2026-05-08\")), [\"site\"]]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按先后顺序排出 `outside` 里的采样点，没留下的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"n","content":"北坡"},{"id":"s","content":"南坡"},{"id":"e","content":"东坡"},{"id":"w","content":"西坡"},{"id":"v","content":"谷底"}],"key":["n","w"]}],"explanation":"括号里的条件标出 5 月 1 日到 5 月 7 日的采样：南坡、东坡、谷底。`~` 把它反过来，留下**北坡**（4 月 30 日）和**西坡**（5 月 8 日）。5 月 8 日在右端，`<` 不包含它，所以它不在第一周里。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五个采样点的采样日期（还是文字）","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡","谷底"],"sampled":["2026-04-30","2026-05-01","2026-05-07","2026-05-08","2026-05-03"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py32.k3.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 留下采样日期在 `start`（含）到 `end`（不含）之间的样本，只输出 sample_id 一列，结果仍是一张表，保留原行顺序和原索引。\n\n宿主另外提供了 `start` 和 `end` 两个变量，是“年-月-日”写法的文字，例如 `start = \"2026-03-15\"`、`end = \"2026-04-01\"`；换一次分析可以取别的值。作答框里的代码两端都写反了，请改动它并提交，最终结果变量仍叫 `result`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"d = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nresult = log.loc[(d > start) & (d <= end), [\"sample_id\"]]\n","solution":"d = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nresult = log.loc[(d >= start) & (d < end), [\"sample_id\"]]\n","accepts":["d = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nmask = (d >= start) & (d < end)\nresult = log.loc[mask, [\"sample_id\"]]\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"d = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nresult = log.loc[(d >= start) & (d <= end), [\"sample_id\"]]\n","why":"右端包含了 end 那一天"},{"code":"d = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nresult = log.loc[(d > start) & (d < end), [\"sample_id\"]]\n","why":"左端漏掉了 start 那一天"},{"code":"d = pd.to_datetime(log[\"collected\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nresult = log.loc[(d >= \"2026-03-15\") & (d < \"2026-04-01\"), [\"sample_id\"]]\n","why":"把日期写死了"}],"tests":[{"name":"3 月 15 日到 4 月 1 日","setup":"start = \"2026-03-15\"\nend = \"2026-04-01\"\n","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_B\", \"S_C\"]}, index=[1, 2])","log":"log"}},{"name":"换一段时间","hidden":true,"setup":"start = \"2026-03-02\"\nend = \"2026-03-31\"\n","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_A\", \"S_B\"]}, index=[0, 1])"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"data":["log2"],"setup":"start = \"2026-03-01\"\nend = \"2026-03-31\"\n","expect":{"result":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"S_F\", \"S_G\"]}, index=[1, 2])"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nresult = log.loc[(d >= start) & (d < end), [\"sample_id\"]]\n```\n\n左端“含”写 `>=`，右端“不含”写 `<`。本例 start 是 3 月 15 日、end 是 4 月 1 日，留下 S_B（3 月 15 日，正好在左端）和 S_C（3 月 31 日）；S_D 是 4 月 1 日，正好在右端，不留下。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"log","caption":"表 log：四个样本的采样日期和检测日期（还是文字）","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D"],"collected":["2026-03-02","2026-03-15","2026-03-31","2026-04-01"],"tested":["2026-03-05","2026-03-15","2026-04-02","2026-04-08"]}}]},{"id":"py32.k3.x2","body":"要数出 3 月 9 日（含）到 3 月 16 日（不含）这一周的观测有几次。阅读代码。\n\n```python\nd = pd.to_datetime(obs[\"day\"], format=\"%Y-%m-%d\")\nin_week = (d >= \"2026-03-09\") & (d < \"2026-03-16\")\nprint(in_week.sum())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示哪个整数？","key":3},{"id":"o4","type":"choice","prompt":"O4（3 月 16 日）算不算在这一周里？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"算"},{"id":"no","content":"不算"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"显示 **3**：O2（3 月 9 日）、O3（3 月 12 日）、O5（3 月 15 日）。`in_week.sum()` 数的是 True 的个数。O1 早于左端；O4 的 3 月 16 日正好是右端，`<` **不算**它；O6 更晚。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"obs","caption":"表 obs：六次观测的日期（还是文字）","columns":{"obs_id":["O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6"],"day":["2026-03-08","2026-03-09","2026-03-12","2026-03-16","2026-03-15","2026-03-17"]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py33","title":"从一张表读出图想说明什么","summary":"按要回答的问题选柱状图、折线图或散点图；从两三行画图代码读出横轴、纵轴、单位，以及画之前有没有先按组聚合。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py27","py23"],"intro":"AI 给的分析脚本里，最后常常是一两行画图代码。这一节不看图片本身，而是练习在运行之前，从代码读出图上会有什么：画的是哪份数据，横轴、纵轴各是什么，有几根柱或几个点。\n\n宿主已经准备好 pandas 和题目里的表。每道题都从题面给出的表重新开始。\n","wrapup":"拿到一张图或一段画图代码，先问它想回答什么：比较几个组、看随时间的变化，还是看两个量的关系，再看图的种类是否对得上。\n\n然后读 `.plot` 前面的那份数据：它有几行，图上就有几根柱或几个点；横轴按行的顺序排，纵轴标签上的单位要和数一致。向 AI 提要求时，可以直接说：“按 group 求平均 signal，每组一根柱，从高到低排列，纵轴标签写明单位。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py33.k1","title":"按比较、趋势或关系选 bar/line/scatter","key":["py27"],"links":["py27.k2"],"card":{"name":"图的种类","aliases":["bar","line","scatter","柱状图","折线图","散点图"],"definition":"按要回答的问题选图：比较几个组的一个数用柱状图 bar，看一个量随有序的 x（如时间）变化用折线图 line，看两个数值量有没有关系用散点图 scatter。","conditions":["折线会把相邻的点连起来，暗示它们之间有先后；没有先后的组别不要用折线连。","散点图每一行画一个点，横轴、纵轴各用一列数。"],"example":"问“control 组和 drug 组的平均 signal 谁高”，是在比较两个组：先按组求平均，再画柱状图，每组一根柱，比高低。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trial","caption":"表 trial：一次试验的五个样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug","drug"],"signal":[8,13,10,11,12]}}]},"lesson":"画图之前先问一句：这张图要回答什么问题？常见的问题有三类，各对应一种图：\n\n| 要回答的问题 | 图 | pandas 写法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 几个组的某个数谁高谁低（比较） | 柱状图 bar | `summary.plot.bar()` |\n| 一个量随时间或其他有先后的 x 怎样变化（趋势） | 折线图 line | `daily.plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"count\")` |\n| 两个数值量之间有没有关系（关系） | 散点图 scatter | `field.plot.scatter(x=\"depth\", y=\"moisture\")` |\n\n三点区别：\n\n- **柱状图**每个组一根柱，柱的高度就是那个组的数。比较组别时，通常先按组聚合（[每组一行](repa:concept/py27.k2)），再画。\n- **折线图**把相邻的点用线连起来。线本身在说“从这个点到下一个点发生了变化”，所以横轴要有先后，例如第几天、第几小时。几个采样点、几个处理组之间没有先后，用线连起来会让人读出并不存在的“趋势”。\n- **散点图**表里每一行画一个点：横坐标取 `x=` 那一列，纵坐标取 `y=` 那一列。点的整体走向回答“一个大，另一个是不是也大”。\n","example":{"id":"py33.k1.e0","body":"要回答的问题：control 组和 drug 组的平均 signal 谁高？同事已经按组算好了平均值：\n\n```python\nsummary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"chart","type":"choice","prompt":"用哪种图回答这个问题？","options":[{"id":"line","content":"折线图：把两组的平均值连成一条线"},{"id":"bar","content":"柱状图：每组一根柱，比较高低"},{"id":"scatter","content":"散点图：每个样本一个点，横轴、纵轴各用一列数"}],"key":"bar"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`summary` 里有几个数？","key":2}],"explanation":"这是在**比较两个组**，用**柱状图**：`summary.plot.bar()` 每组一根柱，柱高是组平均，一眼就能比出高低。\n\n`summary` 是按组聚合后的结果，每组一个数，共 **2** 个，所以柱状图上有 2 根柱。折线会把 control 和 drug 连起来，好像两组之间有先后变化；散点图用来看两个数值量的关系，这里只有一个数要比较。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trial","caption":"表 trial：一次试验的五个样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug","drug"],"signal":[8,13,10,11,12]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py33.k1.q1","body":"要回答的问题：北坡、南坡、东坡三个采样点，平均采样深度谁深谁浅？`summary` 已经算好：\n\n```python\nsummary = soil.groupby(\"site\")[\"depth_cm\"].mean()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","prompt":"用哪一行画图？","options":[{"id":"scatter","content":"```python\nsoil.plot.scatter(x=\"depth_cm\", y=\"moisture\")\n```\n","feedback":"散点图看的是深度和湿度两个量的关系，不是三个采样点的比较。"},{"id":"line","content":"```python\nsummary.plot.line()\n```\n","feedback":"三个采样点之间没有先后，用线连起来像是在说深度从一个点“变”到另一个点。"},{"id":"bar","content":"```python\nsummary.plot.bar()\n```\n"}],"key":"bar"}],"explanation":"用 `summary.plot.bar()`：三个采样点各一根柱，柱高是平均深度，比较深浅。\n\n折线把三个采样点连起来，读的人会以为深度沿着某个方向在变化，可采样点之间并没有先后；散点图画的是每份土样的深度和湿度，回答的是另一个问题。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五份土样，depth_cm 是采样深度（厘米），moisture 是湿度（%）","showIndex":false,"columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡","南坡"],"depth_cm":[30,25,34,35,27],"moisture":[21,26,19,17,24]}}]},{"id":"py33.k1.q2","body":"要回答的问题：采样越深，土壤是不是越干？同事画了散点图：\n\n```python\nfield.plot.scatter(x=\"depth\", y=\"moisture\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"points","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"图上有几个点？","key":5},{"id":"sc_x","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"样本 S_C 那个点的横坐标是多少？","key":15},{"id":"sc_y","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"样本 S_C 那个点的纵坐标是多少？","key":28}],"explanation":"表有 5 行，散点图每行画一个点，共 **5** 个点。横坐标取 `x=\"depth\"`，纵坐标取 `y=\"moisture\"`，所以 S_C 的点在横坐标 **15**、纵坐标 **28** 的位置。\n\n把五个点看一遍：深度越大的点，湿度越低，点从左上往右下排。散点图就是用这种整体走向回答“两个量有没有关系”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"field","caption":"表 field：五份土样的采样深度（厘米）和湿度（%）","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"depth":[10,25,15,30,20],"moisture":[32,21,28,18,25]}}]},{"id":"py33.k1.q3","body":"同事画了下面这张图，却在报告里写：“这张图显示株高随时间增长。”\n\n```python\nplants.plot.scatter(x=\"root_mm\", y=\"height_cm\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"question","type":"choice","prompt":"这张图实际回答的是哪个问题？","options":[{"id":"groups","content":"不同处理组的平均株高谁高"},{"id":"relation","content":"根长和株高有没有关系"},{"id":"time","content":"株高怎样随时间变化","feedback":"表里四株植物是同一天测的，没有时间这一列。"}],"key":"relation"},{"id":"points","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"图上有几个点？","key":4}],"explanation":"这是散点图，横轴是根长 root_mm，纵轴是株高 height_cm，每株植物一个点，共 **4** 个点。它回答的是**根长和株高有没有关系**。\n\n表里四株植物是同一天测的，没有时间；要看株高随时间的变化，需要同一株植物在不同日子的记录，画折线图。图里也没有处理组，比不出组间高低。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plants","caption":"表 plants：同一天测的四株植物","showIndex":false,"columns":{"plant":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"root_mm":[42,66,38,70],"height_cm":[18,25,16,27]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py33.k1.r1","body":"要回答的问题：A 号培养箱这 8 天里，温度是怎样变化的？表 incubator 每天一行。\n","slots":[{"id":"chart","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一种图回答这个问题？","options":[{"id":"scatter","content":"散点图：横轴是 temp，纵轴是 humidity"},{"id":"line","content":"折线图：横轴是 day，从第 1 天到第 8 天；纵轴是 temp"},{"id":"bar","content":"柱状图：只有一根柱，高度是 8 天的平均 temp"}],"key":"line"}],"explanation":"“这 8 天里怎样变化”问的是**随时间的趋势**：用折线图，横轴是按先后排好的 day，纵轴是 temp，相邻两天用线连起来，升降一目了然。\n\n温度对湿度的散点图回答的是“温度高时湿度是不是也高”；一根平均值的柱把 8 天压成一个数，看不出变化。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"incubator","caption":"表 incubator：A 号培养箱每天记一次","showIndex":false,"columns":{"day":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"temp":[37,37,36,38,37,39,37,37],"humidity":[60,62,61,58,60,63,59,61]}}]},{"id":"py33.k1.r2","body":"下面哪个问题最适合用散点图回答？\n","slots":[{"id":"question","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"count","content":"三个采样点各收到了多少份样本"},{"id":"od","content":"一份培养液在 12 小时里 OD 读数怎样变化"},{"id":"leaves","content":"植株的叶片数和株高有没有关系"},{"id":"diff","content":"drug 组的平均 signal 比 control 组高多少"}],"key":"leaves"}],"explanation":"“叶片数和株高有没有关系”最适合散点图：每株植物一个点，横轴叶片数、纵轴株高，看点的整体走向。\n\n各采样点的样本数和两组平均 signal 的差，都是在比较几个组，用柱状图；12 小时里 OD 的变化是随时间的趋势，用折线图。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py33.k1.x1","body":"为每个问题选一种图。\n","slots":[{"id":"charts","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"question","header":"要回答的问题"},{"id":"chart","header":"图","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"bar","label":"柱状图 bar"},{"id":"line","label":"折线图 line"},{"id":"scatter","label":"散点图 scatter"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"moisture","cells":{"question":"四个采样点的平均土壤湿度谁高谁低","chart":"bar"}},{"id":"relation","cells":{"question":"每份样本的 signal 和它的采样深度有没有关系","chart":"scatter"}},{"id":"hours","cells":{"question":"同一份培养液在 0、2、4、6 小时的 OD 怎样变化","chart":"line"}}]}],"explanation":"| 要回答的问题 | 图 |\n|---|---|\n| 四个采样点的平均土壤湿度谁高谁低 | 柱状图：比较几个组 |\n| 每份样本的 signal 和它的采样深度有没有关系 | 散点图：两个数值量的关系 |\n| 同一份培养液在 0、2、4、6 小时的 OD 怎样变化 | 折线图：随时间的趋势 |\n\n采样点之间没有先后，不用折线连；0、2、4、6 小时有先后，用折线把相邻时间点连起来。\n"},{"id":"py33.k1.x2","body":"下面哪些问题适合用折线图回答？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"questions","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"groups","content":"control 组和 drug 组各有几只小鼠"},{"id":"week","content":"一周 7 天里每天的最高气温怎样变化"},{"id":"protein","content":"每份样本的蛋白含量和吸光度有没有关系"},{"id":"minutes","content":"一份样本在第 0、10、20、30 分钟的温度怎样变化"}],"key":["week","minutes"]}],"explanation":"适合折线图的是**一周 7 天的最高气温**和**第 0、10、20、30 分钟的温度**：横轴是有先后的时间，问的是怎样变化。\n\n两组各有几只小鼠是比较组别，用柱状图；蛋白含量和吸光度的关系是两个数值量的关系，用散点图。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n"}]},{"id":"py33.k2","title":"从代码核对横轴、纵轴、单位和是否先聚合","key":["py27","py23"],"links":["py27.k2","py23.k1"],"card":{"name":"读画图代码","aliases":["横轴","纵轴","先聚合","ylabel"],"definition":"`.plot` 前面的对象就是被画的数据：它有几行就有几根柱或几个点；横轴是 x 指定的列或 Series 的索引，按行的顺序排列，纵轴是 y 列或 Series 的值。","conditions":["整张表直接画柱状图是每条记录一根柱；要每组一根，先 groupby 聚合。","折线按行的顺序连点，x 没排好要先 sort_values；ylabel 只是文字，不会换算单位。"],"example":"`trial.plot.bar(x=\"group\", y=\"signal\")` 画 5 根柱，每个样本一根；`trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().plot.bar()` 画 2 根柱，每组一根，drug 那根高 12.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trial","caption":"表 trial：一次试验的五个样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug","drug"],"signal":[8,13,10,11,12]}}]},"lesson":"读一行画图代码，按顺序问四件事。\n\n**1. 画的是哪份数据？** 看 `.plot` 前面的那个对象。它有几行，图上就有几根柱或几个点。\n\n```python\ntrial.plot.bar(x=\"group\", y=\"signal\")                 # 整张表：每个样本一根柱\ntrial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().plot.bar()     # 先聚合：每组一根柱\n```\n\n第一行没有聚合，表有 5 行就画 5 根柱，横轴上 control、drug 会重复出现；要比较组平均，必须先像第二行那样按组聚合（[每组一行](repa:concept/py27.k2)）。\n\n**2. 横轴是什么，按什么顺序？** 给了 `x=\"day\"`，横轴就是 day 这一列；直接画一个 Series（例如聚合结果）时，横轴是它的索引。点和柱按数据里**行的顺序**排列，画图不会替你排序。折线把相邻两行的点连起来，day 没排好，线就会来回折，所以要先[排序](repa:concept/py23.k1)：`daily.sort_values(\"day\").plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"count\")`。\n\n**3. 纵轴是什么？** `y=` 指定的列，或者 Series 本身的值。\n\n**4. 单位对不对？** `ylabel=\"平均深度（cm）\"` 只是写在纵轴旁边的文字，不会换算数值。列是厘米、标签写米，图就差了 100 倍；数值除以了 100，标签也要跟着改。\n\n查一个画图参数时，可以像读文档那样找它的名字和含义：`x` 是横轴用的列名，`y` 是纵轴用的列名，`ylabel` 是纵轴旁边的文字。\n","example":{"id":"py33.k2.e0","body":"需求：比较 control 和 drug 两组的平均 signal。同事写了两种画法。\n\n第一种：\n\n```python\ntrial.plot.bar(x=\"group\", y=\"signal\")\n```\n\n第二种：\n\n```python\ntrial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().plot.bar()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"bars_first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一种画出几根柱？","key":5},{"id":"bars_second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二种画出几根柱？","key":2},{"id":"drug","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"第二种里，drug 那根柱有多高？","key":12}],"explanation":"第一种画 **5** 根柱：它直接画整张表，每个样本一根，横轴依次是 control、drug、control、drug、drug，组名重复出现，比不出组平均。\n\n第二种先按 group 求平均，得到每组一个数，画 **2** 根柱。drug 组是 13、11、12，平均 **12.0**；control 组是 8、10，平均 9.0。符合需求的是第二种。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trial","caption":"表 trial：一次试验的五个样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug","drug"],"signal":[8,13,10,11,12]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py33.k2.q1","body":"需求：画出每天收到的样本数怎样变化。同事写了：\n\n```python\ndaily.plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"count\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"path","type":"order","prompt":"折线按什么顺序连过各天？从第一个点开始，依次排出天数。","items":[{"id":"d1","content":"第 1 天"},{"id":"d2","content":"第 2 天"},{"id":"d3","content":"第 3 天"},{"id":"d4","content":"第 4 天"}],"key":["d3","d1","d4","d2"]},{"id":"shape","type":"choice","prompt":"这条线在横轴上是怎样走的？","options":[{"id":"forward","content":"从左到右一路往前"},{"id":"zigzag","content":"在横轴上来回折返"}],"key":"zigzag"}],"explanation":"折线按表里行的顺序连点：第 3 天 → 第 1 天 → 第 4 天 → 第 2 天。横轴上先往左、再往右、又往左，**来回折返**，读的人很难看出变化。\n\n画图不会替你排序。先按 day 排好再画：`daily.sort_values(\"day\").plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"count\")`，线就从第 1 天一路连到第 4 天。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"daily","caption":"表 daily：每天收到的样本数","showIndex":false,"columns":{"day":[3,1,4,2],"count":[5,2,6,4]}}]},{"id":"py33.k2.q2","body":"需求：比较三个采样点的平均采样深度，纵轴用厘米。同事写了：\n\n```python\nsummary = soil.groupby(\"site\")[\"depth_cm\"].mean()\n```\n\n```python\nsummary.plot.bar(ylabel=\"平均深度（m）\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"north","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"北坡那根柱有多高（照 `summary` 里的数填）？","key":32},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"这张图要怎样改？","options":[{"id":"keep","content":"不用改，北坡平均深 32 米"},{"id":"label","content":"把纵轴标签改成“平均深度（cm）”，数不用动"},{"id":"axis","content":"把纵轴换成 site"}],"key":"label"}],"explanation":"北坡两份土样是 30、34 厘米，平均 **32.0**，柱就是这么高。`depth_cm` 是厘米，数没有换算过，纵轴标签却写着米，读图的人会读成 32 米。需求要的就是厘米，所以**把标签改成“平均深度（cm）”**，数不用动。\n\n`ylabel` 只是写在纵轴旁边的文字，它不会替你换算；数和标签的单位要自己核对一致。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五份土样，depth_cm 是采样深度（厘米），moisture 是湿度（%）","showIndex":false,"columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡","南坡"],"depth_cm":[30,25,34,35,27],"moisture":[21,26,19,17,24]}}]},{"id":"py33.k2.q3","body":"需求：\n\n> 比较各组的平均 signal，每组一根柱，柱从高到低排列。\n\n画图那一行已经写好，不用改：\n\n```python\nsummary.plot.bar(ylabel=\"平均 signal\")\n```\n\n作答框里是同事准备数据的那一行，它没有按组求平均。请改它，让 `summary` 是每组一个平均值（索引是组名），并且从高到低排好。不要改动 `trial`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"summary = trial[[\"group\", \"signal\"]]\n","solution":"summary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().sort_values(ascending=False)\n","accepts":["means = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()\nsummary = means.sort_values(ascending=False)\n","summary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].agg(\"mean\").sort_values(ascending=False)"],"rejects":[{"code":"summary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean()","why":"没有排序，柱按组名顺序排列"},{"code":"summary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().sort_values()","why":"从低到高排了"},{"code":"summary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].sum().sort_values(ascending=False)","why":"求的是总和，不是平均"},{"code":"summary = trial.sort_values(\"signal\", ascending=False)","why":"只排了序，没有按组聚合，仍是每个样本一根柱"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 trial","expect":{"summary":"pd.Series({\"drug\": 12.0, \"control\": 9.0}, name=\"signal\")","trial":"trial"}},{"name":"换一张有三个组、各组样本数不同的表","hidden":true,"data":["trial3"],"expect":{"summary":"pd.Series({\"drug\": 13.0, \"placebo\": 10.0, \"control\": 9.0}, name=\"signal\")","trial":"trial"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsummary = trial.groupby(\"group\")[\"signal\"].mean().sort_values(ascending=False)\n```\n\n先按 group 求平均，每组得到一个数，柱状图才是每组一根柱；再用 `sort_values(ascending=False)` 从高到低排，柱就按这个顺序从左到右排列。本例 drug 平均 12.0 在前，control 平均 9.0 在后。\n\n只求平均不排序，柱会按组名的顺序排；求总和会让样本多的组显得更高。判分时还会换一张有三个组、各组样本数不同的表运行你的代码。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"trial","caption":"表 trial：一次试验的五个样本","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_C","S_D","S_E"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug","drug"],"signal":[8,13,10,11,12]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py33.k2.r1","body":"下面三行画图代码分别会画出几根柱或几个点？每根柱或每个点代表什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"read","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"画图代码"},{"id":"count","header":"柱或点的个数","input":"integer"},{"id":"unit","header":"每根柱或每个点代表","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"record","label":"一份土样（表的一行）"},{"id":"site","label":"一个采样点"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"code":"soil.plot.bar(x=\"site\", y=\"depth_cm\")","count":5,"unit":"record"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"code":"soil.groupby(\"site\")[\"depth_cm\"].max().plot.bar()","count":3,"unit":"site"}},{"id":"c","cells":{"code":"soil.plot.scatter(x=\"depth_cm\", y=\"moisture\")","count":5,"unit":"record"}}]}],"explanation":"| 画图代码 | 个数 | 每个代表 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `soil.plot.bar(x=\"site\", y=\"depth_cm\")` | 5 | 一份土样 |\n| `soil.groupby(\"site\")[\"depth_cm\"].max().plot.bar()` | 3 | 一个采样点 |\n| `soil.plot.scatter(x=\"depth_cm\", y=\"moisture\")` | 5 | 一份土样 |\n\n看 `.plot` 前面是什么：直接画 soil，表有 5 行，就是 5 根柱或 5 个点，每个对应一份土样，北坡、南坡各出现两次；先按 site 聚合，每个采样点只剩一行，就是 3 根柱。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：五份土样，depth_cm 是采样深度（厘米），moisture 是湿度（%）","showIndex":false,"columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡","南坡"],"depth_cm":[30,25,34,35,27],"moisture":[21,26,19,17,24]}}]},{"id":"py33.k2.r2","body":"需求：画出温度随天数的变化，折线从第 1 天依次连到第 4 天。哪一行能做到？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"plain","content":"```python\ntemps.plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"temp\")\n```\n"},{"id":"by_temp","content":"```python\ntemps.sort_values(\"temp\").plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"temp\")\n```\n"},{"id":"by_day","content":"```python\ntemps.sort_values(\"day\").plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"temp\")\n```\n"},{"id":"by_index","content":"```python\ntemps.sort_index().plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"temp\")\n```\n"}],"key":"by_day"}],"explanation":"`temps.sort_values(\"day\").plot.line(x=\"day\", y=\"temp\")`：先按 day 排好，折线才会从第 1 天依次连到第 4 天。\n\n不排序时按表里的行顺序连，是第 2、4、1、3 天；按 temp 排序连的是第 3、1、2、4 天；表的原行索引 10、11、12、13 已经是从小到大，按索引排序不会改变顺序，仍是第 2、4、1、3 天。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"temps","caption":"表 temps：四天的温度记录","index":[10,11,12,13],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"day":[2,4,1,3],"temp":[18,21,16,15]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py33.k2.x1","body":"需求：\n\n> 每天测了两次 OD，先按天求平均，再画平均 OD 随天数变化的折线；横轴是天数，从小到大。\n\n画图那一行已经写好，不用改：\n\n```python\nsummary.plot.line(ylabel=\"平均 OD\")\n```\n\n作答框里准备数据的那一行没有求平均（`set_index(\"day\")` 只是把 day 这一列改作行索引，每行仍是一次读数），同一天的两次读数都会画成点。请改它，让 `summary` 是每天一个平均值、索引是天数。不要改动 `growth`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"summary = growth.set_index(\"day\")[\"od\"]\n","solution":"summary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].mean()\n","accepts":["summary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].mean().sort_index()","summary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].agg(\"mean\")"],"rejects":[{"code":"summary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].mean().sort_values()","why":"按平均值排了序，横轴上的天数不再从小到大"},{"code":"summary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].sum()","why":"求的是每天两次读数的总和"},{"code":"summary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].max()","why":"取了每天较大的一次，不是平均"},{"code":"summary = growth.sort_values(\"day\")","why":"只排了序，没有按天聚合"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 growth","expect":{"summary":"pd.Series({1: 0.11, 2: 0.40, 3: 0.30}, name=\"od\")","growth":"growth"}},{"name":"换一批读数","hidden":true,"data":["growth2"],"expect":{"summary":"pd.Series({1: 0.09, 2: 0.23, 3: 0.35, 4: 0.52}, name=\"od\")","growth":"growth"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsummary = growth.groupby(\"day\")[\"od\"].mean()\n```\n\n按 day 分组求平均，每天只剩一个数；groupby 的结果按天数从小到大排好，直接画 Series 时横轴就是这个索引，折线从第 1 天连到第 3 天。本例三天的平均依次是 0.11、0.40、0.30。\n\n再按平均值排序会把第 3 天排到第 2 天前面，折线就乱了；求总和或取最大值都不是需求里的平均。判分时还会换一批读数运行你的代码。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"growth","caption":"表 growth：每天测两次的 OD 读数","showIndex":false,"columns":{"day":[2,1,3,1,2,3],"od":[0.42,0.12,0.31,0.1,0.38,0.29]},"dtypes":{"od":"float"}}]},{"id":"py33.k2.x2","body":"需求：比较两种处理的平均根长，纵轴用厘米。同事写了：\n\n```python\nsummary = roots.groupby(\"treatment\")[\"root_mm\"].mean() / 10\n```\n\n```python\nsummary.plot.bar(ylabel=\"平均根长（mm）\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"bars","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"图上有几根柱？","key":2},{"id":"high","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"high 那根柱有多高（照 `summary` 里的数填）？","key":6.6},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改才符合需求？","options":[{"id":"drop_division","content":"去掉 `/ 10`，标签不动"},{"id":"keep","content":"都不用改"},{"id":"label","content":"把纵轴标签改成“平均根长（cm）”，`/ 10` 保留"}],"key":"label"}],"explanation":"按 treatment 聚合后有 low、high 两组，**2** 根柱。high 组根长 66、70、62 毫米，平均 66.0，除以 10 得到 **6.6**，单位已经是厘米。\n\n数换成了厘米，标签却还写着毫米，读的人会以为根只有 6.6 毫米长。需求要厘米，所以**保留 `/ 10`，把标签改成“平均根长（cm）”**。去掉 `/ 10` 能让数和“mm”对上，但不符合“纵轴用厘米”的需求。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"roots","caption":"表 roots：两种处理下的根长（毫米）","showIndex":false,"columns":{"plant":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"treatment":["low","high","low","high","high"],"root_mm":[42,66,38,70,62]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py34","title":"导出的是结果，也是约定","summary":"读懂 to_csv 写出的文件里有什么：行索引列、列的顺序和编码；导出后把文件读回来，按需求核对行数、键和数值。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py15","py12","py25"],"intro":"宿主已经准备好 pandas 和数据表。题目里写出的文件放在一个临时的文件夹里，写完可以马上读回来看。读回来的一列常用 `.tolist()` 变成列表，一眼就能看清每个值。\n\n导出的 CSV 会交给同事、导入别的软件，或者用 Excel 打开。文件里有哪些列、按什么顺序、第一列是什么，都由导出的那一行代码决定；对方拿到文件时不会看到你的代码，只会看到这些约定的结果。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提导出的需求时，可以这样说：“导出 site_depth.csv：只要 site 和 mean_depth 两列，按这个顺序；不写行索引；编码用 utf-8-sig，方便用 Excel 打开；每个采样点一行，共 4 行，site 不重复。”\n\n导出以后，把文件读回来核对：行数对不对，键有没有重复，挑一两个能手算的值看一看。编号列按文字读回，别让读法吃掉前导零。\n","kps":[{"id":"py34.k1","title":"to_csv 的列顺序、index=False 与编码","key":["py15"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"to_csv 导出","aliases":["导出 CSV","index=False","utf-8-sig"],"definition":"df.to_csv(\"文件名.csv\") 把表写成逗号分隔的文字文件；默认把行索引也写成第一列，index=False 不写；列按表里的顺序写出。","conditions":["要换列的顺序或只要几列，先选列：df[[\"site\", \"depth\"]].to_csv(...)。","含中文、要用 Excel 双击打开的文件，加 encoding=\"utf-8-sig\"，否则常常显示成乱码。"],"example":"```python\nkept.to_csv(\"kept.csv\")\n```\n文件第一行是 `,sample_id,signal`：开头多出一列没有列名的行索引，下面每行以 7、22、4 开头。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"kept","caption":"表 kept：筛选后留下的三行，左边是原行索引","index":[7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[10,13,10]}}]},"lesson":"`kept.to_csv(\"kept.csv\")` 把表 `kept` 写成一个文字文件：第一行是列名，下面每行一条记录，格子之间用逗号隔开。\n\n默认情况下，**行索引也会被写进去**，成为第一列。这一列没有列名，所以第一行以逗号开头：\n\n```\n,sample_id,signal\n7,S_B,10\n22,S_C,13\n4,S_D,10\n```\n\n同事用 Excel 打开，会看到最左边多了一列没有标题的 7、22、4。行索引对对方没有意义时，写 `index=False`，文件就只有表里的列。\n\n列按表里现在的顺序写出。需求要求别的顺序，或者只要其中几列，先选列再导出：`kept[[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]].to_csv(\"out.csv\", index=False)`。\n\n还有编码。文件里有中文、对方要用 Excel 双击打开时，写 `encoding=\"utf-8-sig\"`。它会在文件最开头写一个看不见的标记，Excel 靠它认出这是 UTF-8 文字；不写的话，中文常常显示成乱码。pandas 读回时，有没有这个标记都能读对。\n","example":{"id":"py34.k1.e0","body":"阅读代码，说出写出的文件 `kept.csv` 里有什么。\n\n```python\nkept.to_csv(\"kept.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"header","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"文件的第一行原样是什么？","key":",sample_id,signal"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"文件的第二行原样是什么？","key":"7,S_B,10"},{"id":"ncols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"用 Excel 打开，一共有几列？","key":3}],"explanation":"第一行是 **`,sample_id,signal`**，第二行是 **`7,S_B,10`**，用 Excel 打开有 **3** 列。没写 `index=False`，行索引 7、22、4 也被写成了第一列；这一列在表里没有列名，所以第一行以一个逗号开头。\n\n要是写成 `kept.to_csv(\"kept.csv\", index=False)`，第一行就是 `sample_id,signal`，只有两列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"kept","caption":"表 kept：筛选后留下的三行，左边是原行索引","index":[7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[10,13,10]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py34.k1.q1","body":"阅读代码，说出写出的文件 `kept_q1.csv` 里有什么。\n\n```python\nkept.to_csv(\"kept_q1.csv\", index=False)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"header","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"文件的第一行原样是什么？","key":"sample_id,signal","feedback":[{"when":",sample_id,signal","message":"写了 index=False，行索引不会写进文件，第一行不再以逗号开头。"}]},{"id":"nlines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"文件一共有几行（列名那一行也算）？","key":4},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"文件的第二行原样是什么？","key":"S_B,10"}],"explanation":"第一行是 **`sample_id,signal`**，一共 **4** 行（1 行列名加 3 行记录），第二行是 **`S_B,10`**。`index=False` 让行索引 7、22、4 不进文件。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"kept","caption":"表 kept：筛选后留下的三行，左边是原行索引","index":[7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[10,13,10]}}]},{"id":"py34.k1.q2","body":"需求是：导出 `out.csv`，**signal 在前、sample_id 在后**，不要行索引，行的顺序不变。哪一行代码符合需求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nkept.to_csv(\"out.csv\", index=False)\n```\n","feedback":"列按表里原来的顺序写出，sample_id 仍在前。"},{"id":"index","content":"```python\nkept[[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]].to_csv(\"out.csv\")\n```\n","feedback":"列的顺序对了，但没写 index=False，行索引成了第一列。"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nkept[[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]].to_csv(\"out.csv\", index=False)\n```\n"},{"id":"sorted","content":"```python\nkept.sort_values(\"signal\").to_csv(\"out.csv\", index=False)\n```\n","feedback":"sort_values 调换的是行的顺序，不是列的顺序。"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`kept[[\"signal\", \"sample_id\"]].to_csv(\"out.csv\", index=False)`：先按需求的顺序选出两列，再不带行索引写出。直接导出 `kept` 时列的顺序没变；忘了 `index=False` 会多出行索引那一列；排序改的是行的先后，列的顺序不变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"kept","caption":"表 kept：筛选后留下的三行，左边是原行索引","index":[7,22,4],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"sample_id":["S_B","S_C","S_D"],"signal":[10,13,10]}}]},{"id":"py34.k1.q3","body":"表 sites 要导出成 `sites.csv`，发给一位用 Windows 的同事，他会双击用 Excel 打开。他只要 site 和 depth 两列（site 在前），不要行索引。哪一行代码符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"no_bom","content":"```python\nsites[[\"site\", \"depth\"]].to_csv(\"sites.csv\", index=False)\n```\n","feedback":"没写 encoding=\"utf-8-sig\"，Excel 双击打开时“北坡”这些中文常常显示成乱码。"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nsites[[\"site\", \"depth\"]].to_csv(\"sites.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")\n```\n"},{"id":"with_index","content":"```python\nsites[[\"site\", \"depth\"]].to_csv(\"sites.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")\n```\n","feedback":"没写 index=False，行索引 5、12、3 成了第一列。"},{"id":"order","content":"```python\nsites.to_csv(\"sites.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")\n```\n","feedback":"表里 depth 在前，直接导出时列的顺序不符合要求。"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`sites[[\"site\", \"depth\"]].to_csv(\"sites.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")` 三处都符合：先选列定下 site 在前，`index=False` 不写行索引，`encoding=\"utf-8-sig\"` 在文件开头写入标记，让 Excel 认出中文。其他几行各少了一处。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：三个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"depth":[30,25,35],"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py34.k1.r1","body":"需求是：把 summary 导出成 `summary_r1.csv`，只要 group 和 mean_signal 两列（group 在前），不要行索引，编码用 utf-8-sig。从下面的代码块里选出需要的，排成程序；用不到的不要放进来。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"write_index","code":"out.to_csv(\"summary_r1.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")"},{"id":"pick_wrong","code":"out = summary[[\"mean_signal\", \"group\"]]"},{"id":"write","code":"out.to_csv(\"summary_r1.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")"},{"id":"pick","code":"out = summary[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]]"},{"id":"write_all","code":"summary.to_csv(\"summary_r1.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")"}],"key":["pick","write"],"tests":[{"name":"文件内容符合需求","setup":"import os\nif os.path.exists(\"summary_r1.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"summary_r1.csv\")\n","expect":{"open(\"summary_r1.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\").read()":"\"﻿group,mean_signal\\ncontrol,9.5\\ndrug,11.5\\n\"","summary":"summary"}}]}],"explanation":"先 `out = summary[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]]` 选出两列并定下顺序，再 `out.to_csv(\"summary_r1.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")` 写出。文件内容是一行列名 `group,mean_signal` 加两行记录，开头有 utf-8-sig 的标记。直接导出 `summary` 会多出 n 列；少了 `index=False` 会多出行索引列。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"summary","caption":"表 summary：每组一行的汇总结果","columns":{"group":["control","drug"],"n":[2,2],"mean_signal":[9.5,11.5]},"dtypes":{"mean_signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py34.k1.r2","body":"下面三行各写出一个文件。分别写出每个文件的第一行。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsoil.to_csv(\"a.csv\")\nsoil[[\"depth\", \"site\"]].to_csv(\"b.csv\", index=False)\nsoil[[\"site\"]].to_csv(\"c.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"headers","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码"},{"id":"file","header":"文件"},{"id":"header","header":"文件的第一行","input":{"type":"text","match":"text"}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","file":"a.csv","header":",site,depth"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","file":"b.csv","header":"depth,site"}},{"id":"c","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","file":"c.csv","header":",site"}}]}],"explanation":"- `a.csv`：**`,site,depth`**。没写 `index=False`，行索引成了没有列名的第一列。\n- `b.csv`：**`depth,site`**。先选列定下了 depth 在前，`index=False` 不写行索引。\n- `c.csv`：**`,site`**。只选了 site 一列，但仍带着行索引。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"soil","caption":"表 soil：四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）","index":[5,12,3,8],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","西坡"],"depth":[30,25,35,30]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py34.k1.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把 report 导出成 `report.csv`，只要 group 和 mean_signal 两列（group 在前），不要行索引；同事会用 Excel 打开，组名是中文，编码用 utf-8-sig。\n\n作答框里的代码不符合需求，请改动它并提交。判分时会读出文件的全部内容核对，还会换一张表运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"report.to_csv(\"report.csv\")\n","solution":"report[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]].to_csv(\"report.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")\n","accepts":["out = report[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]]\nout.to_csv(\"report.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8-sig\", index=False)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"report[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]].to_csv(\"report.csv\", index=False)","why":"没写 utf-8-sig，Excel 打开中文可能乱码"},{"code":"report[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]].to_csv(\"report.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")","why":"行索引写进了文件"},{"code":"report.to_csv(\"report.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")","why":"多导出了 n 列"},{"code":"report[[\"mean_signal\", \"group\"]].to_csv(\"report.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")","why":"列的顺序反了"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 report","setup":"import os\nif os.path.exists(\"report.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"report.csv\")\n","expect":{"open(\"report.csv\", \"rb\").read(3)":"b\"\\xef\\xbb\\xbf\"","open(\"report.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8-sig\").read()":"\"group,mean_signal\\n对照,8.5\\n处理,12.5\\n\"","report":"report"}},{"name":"换一张索引不按顺序的表","hidden":true,"data":["report2"],"setup":"import os\nif os.path.exists(\"report.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"report.csv\")\n","expect":{"open(\"report.csv\", \"rb\").read(3)":"b\"\\xef\\xbb\\xbf\"","open(\"report.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8-sig\").read()":"\"group,mean_signal\\n高剂量,13.5\\n对照,8.0\\n低剂量,10.5\\n\""}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nreport[[\"group\", \"mean_signal\"]].to_csv(\"report.csv\", index=False, encoding=\"utf-8-sig\")\n```\n\n三处要改：先选出 group、mean_signal 两列并定下顺序；`index=False` 去掉行索引列；`encoding=\"utf-8-sig\"` 让 Excel 认出中文。文件内容是 `group,mean_signal`、`对照,8.5`、`处理,12.5` 三行，开头带一个看不见的标记。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"report","caption":"表 report：每组一行的汇总结果","columns":{"group":["对照","处理"],"n":[4,5],"mean_signal":[8.5,12.5]},"dtypes":{"mean_signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py34.k1.x2","body":"阅读代码，说出写出的文件 `counts.csv` 里有什么。\n\n```python\ncounts.to_csv(\"counts.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"nlines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"文件一共有几行（列名那一行也算）？","key":6},{"id":"nfields","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"每一行有几个用逗号隔开的格子？","key":3},{"id":"last","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"文件的最后一行原样是什么？","key":"50,O5,5"}],"explanation":"一共 **6** 行：1 行列名加 5 行记录。没写 `index=False`，行索引也写进去了，所以每行有 **3** 个格子：行索引、obs_id、count。最后一行是 **`50,O5,5`**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"counts","caption":"表 counts：五次观测的计数，左边是原行索引","index":[10,20,30,40,50],"indexHeader":"原行索引","columns":{"obs_id":["O1","O2","O3","O4","O5"],"count":[3,0,7,2,5]}}]}]},{"id":"py34.k2","title":"输出后按需求核对行数、键和数值","key":["py15","py25"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"导出后核对","aliases":["读回核对","前导零","is_unique"],"definition":"导出后把文件读回来，按需求核对：行数是否等于应有的条数，业务键有没有重复，挑一两个能手算的值看对不对。","conditions":["编号列读回时写 dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}，否则 \"001\" 会被读成数字 1，看起来像文件错了。","行数对了不代表没问题：可能一条重复、另一条缺了，键也要查。"],"example":"```python\nback = pd.read_csv(\"per_sample.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n读回 3 行，sample_id 没有重复，第一个编号仍是 001；不写 dtype 时会读成 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"per_sample","caption":"表 per_sample：每个样本一行","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","010"],"signal":[8,10,13]}}]},"lesson":"代码运行完、文件写出来了，还不等于交付完成。把文件读回来，照着需求核对三样：\n\n1. **行数**：需求说“每个样本一行，共 3 个样本”，`len(back)` 就应该是 3。\n2. **键**：样本编号这样的业务键不能重复。`back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique` 在这一列没有重复值时是 True，有重复时是 False。\n3. **数值**：挑一两个能手算的值看一看，例如某个样本的 signal。取一列的第一个值，可以写 `back[\"sample_id\"].iloc[0]`。\n\n行数对了也别急着放心：一个样本重复、另一个样本缺了，行数照样对得上，所以键要单独查。\n\n读回时要按需求的口径读。编号 `001` 在文件里写得好好的，但 `pd.read_csv` 默认把这一列读成数字 1，前导零就没了，看起来像是文件出了错。读回时写 `dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}`，编号才按文字读进来，和需求里的写法一致。\n","example":{"id":"py34.k2.e0","body":"需求是“每个样本一行，共 3 个样本，编号保留前导零”。阅读导出和核对的代码。\n\n```python\nper_sample.to_csv(\"per_sample.csv\", index=False)\nback = pd.read_csv(\"per_sample.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = len(back)\nunique = back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique\nfirst = back[\"sample_id\"].iloc[0]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"n_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`n_rows` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"unique","type":"choice","prompt":"`unique` 是什么？","options":[{"id":"True","content":"True"},{"id":"False","content":"False"}],"key":"True"},{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"`first` 是什么？","key":"001"},{"id":"plain","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"如果第二行不写 `dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"}`，`first` 用 print 显示出来是什么？","key":"1"}],"explanation":"`n_rows` 是 **3**，`unique` 是 **True**，`first` 是 **001**：按文字读回，前导零还在。\n\n不写 dtype 时，pandas 看这一列都是数字，就读成整数，`first` 显示为 **1**。文件里写的仍是 `001`，变的是读法。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"per_sample","caption":"表 per_sample：每个样本一行","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","010"],"signal":[8,10,13]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py34.k2.q1","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python\nplots.to_csv(\"plots_q1.csv\", index=False)\nback = pd.read_csv(\"plots_q1.csv\")\nprint(back[\"plot_id\"].tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[7, 12, 100]","feedback":[{"when":"['007', '012', '100']","message":"读回时没有写 dtype，pandas 把这一列读成了整数。"}]},{"id":"file","type":"choice","prompt":"文件 plots_q1.csv 里，第一块样地的编号写的是什么？","options":[{"id":"zeros","content":"`007`"},{"id":"seven","content":"`7`"}],"key":"zeros"}],"explanation":"显示 **`[7, 12, 100]`**。文件里写的是 **`007`**，前导零是在读回时丢的：不写 `dtype`，pandas 把全是数字的一列读成整数。要保留编号的原样，读回时写 `dtype={\"plot_id\": \"str\"}`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：三块样地的编号和深度","columns":{"plot_id":["007","012","100"],"depth":[30,25,35]}}]},{"id":"py34.k2.q2","body":"需求是“每个样本一行，共 3 个样本（S_A、S_B、S_C）”。拼表以后导出，再读回来核对。\n\n```python\nmerged.to_csv(\"merged.csv\", index=False)\nback = pd.read_csv(\"merged.csv\")\nn_rows = len(back)\nunique = back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"n_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`n_rows` 是多少？","key":4},{"id":"unique","type":"choice","prompt":"`unique` 是什么？","options":[{"id":"False","content":"False"},{"id":"True","content":"True"}],"key":"False"},{"id":"dup","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"哪个 sample_id 出现了不止一次？","key":"S_B"},{"id":"ok","type":"choice","prompt":"这个文件符合需求吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"符合，文件能读回来就行"},{"id":"no","content":"不符合，行数和键都不对"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"`n_rows` 是 **4**，`unique` 是 **False**：**S_B** 出现了两次，两行的 signal 还不一样（10 和 11）。需求是每个样本一行、共 3 行，所以**不符合**，要回头查拼表那一步为什么多出一行，而不是随手删掉一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"merged","caption":"表 merged：两张表拼起来以后的结果","columns":{"sample_id":["S_A","S_B","S_B","S_C"],"site":["北坡","南坡","南坡","东坡"],"signal":[8,10,11,13]}}]},{"id":"py34.k2.q3","body":"文件 `export.csv` 已经导出好了，内容就是上面这张表。核对的代码只写了第一行，请补全另外两行：\n\n- `n_rows`：读回来的行数；\n- `ids_unique`：sample_id 这一列没有重复值时为 True，有重复时为 False。\n\n判分时还会换几份文件运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"back = pd.read_csv(\"export.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = ...\nids_unique = ...\n","solution":"back = pd.read_csv(\"export.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = len(back)\nids_unique = back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique\n","accepts":["back = pd.read_csv(\"export.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = back.shape[0]\nids_unique = not back[\"sample_id\"].duplicated().any()\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"back = pd.read_csv(\"export.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = len(back)\nids_unique = True\n","why":"没有真正检查，直接写 True"},{"code":"back = pd.read_csv(\"export.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = 3\nids_unique = back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique\n","why":"照着这份文件把行数写死"},{"code":"back = pd.read_csv(\"export.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nn_rows = len(back.columns)\nids_unique = back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique\n","why":"数成了列数"}],"tests":[{"name":"文件 export.csv","setup":"export.to_csv(\"export.csv\", index=False)","expect":{"n_rows":"3","ids_unique":"True"}},{"name":"有重复编号的文件","hidden":true,"data":["checked2"],"setup":"export.to_csv(\"export.csv\", index=False)","expect":{"n_rows":"4","ids_unique":"False"}},{"name":"只有两行的文件","hidden":true,"data":["checked3"],"setup":"export.to_csv(\"export.csv\", index=False)","expect":{"n_rows":"2","ids_unique":"True","back[\"sample_id\"].tolist()":"[\"010\", \"100\"]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nn_rows = len(back)\nids_unique = back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique\n```\n\n`len(back)` 是读回来的行数；`.is_unique` 直接回答“这一列有没有重复”。两个值都从读回来的表算出，换一份文件照样能用；照着这份文件写死 3 或 True，换一份有重复的文件就查不出问题了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"export","caption":"已经导出的文件 export.csv 的内容","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003"],"signal":[8,10,13]}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py34.k2.r1","body":"需求是：“导出 site_means.csv，列为 site、mean_depth；每个采样点一行，共 4 个采样点（北坡、南坡、东坡、西坡），site 不重复。”导出以后读回来：\n\n```python\nsite_means.to_csv(\"site_means.csv\", index=False)\nback = pd.read_csv(\"site_means.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"failed","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"下面几项核对，哪几项**没有通过**？选出全部。","options":[{"id":"columns","content":"列名依次是 site、mean_depth"},{"id":"rows","content":"行数等于 4"},{"id":"key","content":"site 没有重复"},{"id":"covered","content":"四个采样点都出现了"}],"key":["rows","key"]}],"explanation":"**行数**和**键**没有通过：读回来有 5 行，南坡出现了两次。列名依次是 site、mean_depth，四个采样点也都出现了，这两项通过。这份结果还不能交出去，要先弄清南坡为什么有两行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"site_means","caption":"表 site_means：要导出的结果","columns":{"site":["北坡","南坡","东坡","南坡","西坡"],"mean_depth":[30,25,35,26,30]}}]},{"id":"py34.k2.r2","body":"同事导出后读回来，发现编号变成了 7、8、12，于是说：“导出把编号前面的 0 弄丢了，文件坏了。”\n\n```python\ntubes.to_csv(\"tubes.csv\", index=False)\nback = pd.read_csv(\"tubes.csv\")\nprint(back[\"tube_id\"].tolist())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"text","match":"text","prompt":"文件 tubes.csv 的第二行原样是什么？","key":"007,5"},{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"编号变成 7、8、12 的原因是什么？","options":[{"id":"export","content":"to_csv 写文件时去掉了前导零"},{"id":"read","content":"文件里还是 007，读回时没写 dtype，pandas 把这一列读成了整数"},{"id":"excel","content":"文件要用 utf-8-sig 编码才能保留前导零"}],"key":"read"}],"explanation":"文件第二行是 **`007,5`**，导出没有问题。编号变成 7、8、12，是因为**读回时没写 dtype**，pandas 把全是数字的一列读成了整数。核对时写 `pd.read_csv(\"tubes.csv\", dtype={\"tube_id\": \"str\"})`，读回来就是 007、008、012。编码管的是文字怎样存，和前导零无关。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"tubes","caption":"表 tubes：三支样品管的编号和体积（毫升）","columns":{"tube_id":["007","008","012"],"volume":[5,2,3]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py34.k2.x1","body":"需求是“每个样本一行，共 4 个样本（S01、S02、S03、S04），列为 sample_id、signal”。导出后读回来：\n\n```python\nfinal.to_csv(\"final.csv\", index=False)\nback = pd.read_csv(\"final.csv\")\n```\n\n在这两行后面再加一行 `print(...)` 做核对，条件成立显示 True，不成立显示 False。下面哪几行在这份文件上会显示 False，也就是能发现它不符合需求？选出所有能发现的。\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"rows","content":"```python\nprint(len(back) == 4)\n```\n","feedback":"文件正好有 4 行，这一行显示 True，发现不了问题。"},{"id":"unique","content":"```python\nprint(back[\"sample_id\"].is_unique)\n```\n"},{"id":"columns","content":"```python\nprint(list(back.columns) == [\"sample_id\", \"signal\"])\n```\n","feedback":"列名没有问题，这一行显示 True，发现不了问题。"},{"id":"ids","content":"```python\nprint(list(back[\"sample_id\"]) == [\"S01\", \"S02\", \"S03\", \"S04\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"width","content":"```python\nprint(len(back.columns) == 2)\n```\n","feedback":"正好两列，这一行显示 True，发现不了问题。"}],"key":["unique","ids"]}],"explanation":"这份文件 4 行、两列、列名也对，但 S03 出现了两次、S04 没有，一多一少，行数恰好抵消。\n\n- 查行数、查列名、查列数，三项都显示 True，看不出问题。\n- `is_unique` 显示 False：S03 重复了。\n- 把读回来的编号和应有的四个编号比较，读回来的是 S01、S02、S03、S03，对不上，也显示 False。\n\n行数对了不代表没问题。键（编号）要单独查：有没有重复，该有的是不是都在。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"final","caption":"表 final：要交出去的结果","columns":{"sample_id":["S01","S02","S03","S03"],"signal":[9,10,12,12]}}]},{"id":"py34.k2.x2","body":"文件 `batch.csv` 已经导出好了，内容就是上面这张表。需求是：编号保留前导零，signal 照常是整数。\n\n作答框里的核对代码读回时丢了前导零，请改动它并提交，变量名不变。判分时还会换一份文件运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"back = pd.read_csv(\"batch.csv\")\nids = back[\"sample_id\"].tolist()\nn_rows = len(back)\n","solution":"back = pd.read_csv(\"batch.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nids = back[\"sample_id\"].tolist()\nn_rows = len(back)\n","rejects":[{"code":"back = pd.read_csv(\"batch.csv\")\nids = back[\"sample_id\"].astype(str).tolist()\nn_rows = len(back)\n","why":"读成整数以后再转回文字，前导零已经没了"},{"code":"back = pd.read_csv(\"batch.csv\", dtype=str)\nids = back[\"sample_id\"].tolist()\nn_rows = len(back)\n","why":"把所有列都读成文字，signal 也成了文字"}],"tests":[{"name":"文件 batch.csv","setup":"batch.to_csv(\"batch.csv\", index=False)","expect":{"ids":"[\"007\", \"012\", \"100\"]","back[\"signal\"].tolist()":"[8, 10, 13]","n_rows":"3"}},{"name":"换一份文件","hidden":true,"data":["batch2"],"setup":"batch.to_csv(\"batch.csv\", index=False)","expect":{"ids":"[\"0001\", \"0420\"]","back[\"signal\"].tolist()":"[4, 9]","n_rows":"2"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nback = pd.read_csv(\"batch.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n\n只给 sample_id 这一列指定按文字读，编号就保留 `007` 的原样，signal 仍按整数读。先读成整数再 `astype(str)` 已经晚了，得到的是 `\"7\"`；`dtype=str` 把所有列都读成文字，signal 也成了 `\"8\"`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"batch","caption":"已经导出的文件 batch.csv 的内容","showIndex":false,"columns":{"sample_id":["007","012","100"],"signal":[8,10,13]}}]}]}]},{"id":"py35","title":"循环：同一句指令轮流处理谁","summary":"读懂 for 循环：列表有几个元素，循环体就按顺序执行几遍；分清循环里和循环后的名字，读出累计的结果。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py06","py01","py02"],"intro":"前面读的代码，每一行只执行一次。这一节读 `for` 循环：几行代码对列表里的每个元素各执行一遍。\n\n程序仍当作一段从上往下运行的短脚本，`print` 显示那一刻的值。读循环时最有用的，还是前面用过的那张状态表，只是这次按“第几轮”来记。\n","wrapup":"读一个 for 循环，先回答三个问题：它轮流处理的是哪个列表；每一轮循环体做什么；哪些行缩进在循环里，哪些行在循环之后。\n\n看到累计的写法，再查两处：起点是不是写在循环前，结果是不是在循环后才显示。请 AI 写这类代码时，也可以直接这样说：“先把 total 设为 0，对列表里每个值加一次，循环结束后只显示一次总和。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py35.k1","title":"for 逐个取得列表元素","key":["py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"for 循环","aliases":["循环","循环体","循环变量"],"definition":"`for v in values:` 按列表顺序让 v 依次指向每个元素；每指向一个，就把下面缩进的循环体从上到下执行一遍。","conditions":["列表有几个元素，循环体就执行几遍，顺序就是列表里的顺序；空列表一遍也不执行。","循环体是 for 那一行（末尾有冒号）下面缩进的几行；一轮把这几行全部执行完，才轮到下一个元素。"],"example":"```python\ncounts = [3, 5, 2]\nfor n in counts:\n    print(n + 1)\n```\nn 依次指向 3、5、2，循环体执行 3 遍，依次显示 4、6、3。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"同一件事要对列表里的每个元素都做一遍，就写一个 `for` 循环：\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\nfor v in signals:\n    print(v * 2)\n```\n\n这样读：`for v in signals:` 先让名字 `v` 指向列表的第一个元素 8，执行一遍下面缩进的那一行；再让 `v` 指向 10，又执行一遍；最后指向 13，再执行一遍。列表里没有下一个元素了，循环结束，程序接着往下走。\n\n| 第几轮 | v | 显示 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 1 | 8 | 16 |\n| 2 | 10 | 20 |\n| 3 | 13 | 26 |\n\n读的时候看清三件事：\n\n- **哪几行在循环里。** `for` 那一行末尾有冒号，下面**缩进**（通常是 4 个空格）的几行叫循环体。每一轮把循环体从上到下全部执行完，才轮到下一个元素。没有缩进的行不属于循环。\n- **执行几遍、什么顺序。** 列表有几个元素，循环体就执行几遍；顺序就是列表里的顺序，不会自动排序。列表是空的，就一遍也不执行。\n- **`v` 只是一个名字。** 每一轮开始时，它被赋值为当前这个元素，就像写了一句 `v = 8`。写成 `x`、`s` 效果完全一样。\n","example":{"id":"py35.k1.e0","body":"`counts` 是三批样本各自的份数。阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python\ncounts = [3, 5, 2]\nfor n in counts:\n    print(n + 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"times","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"循环体 `print(n + 1)` 一共执行几遍？","key":3},{"id":"lines","type":"table","prompt":"按先后顺序写出显示的每一行。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"输出"},{"id":"value","header":"显示","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","value":4}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","value":6}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":3}}]}],"explanation":"循环体执行 **3** 遍，依次显示 **4、6、3**。\n\n| 第几轮 | n | 显示 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 1 | 3 | 4 |\n| 2 | 5 | 6 |\n| 3 | 2 | 3 |\n\n`n` 按列表顺序依次指向 3、5、2，每指向一个就执行一遍 `print(n + 1)`。输出的顺序跟着列表走，所以最后一行是 3，不会自动从小到大排好。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py35.k1.q1","body":"四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）放在列表里，每个都要减去 5 厘米的表层。阅读程序，按先后顺序写出全部输出。\n\n```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 30]\nfor d in depths:\n    print(d - 5)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"输出"},{"id":"value","header":"显示","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","value":25}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","value":20}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":30}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","value":25}}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **25、20、30、25**。`d` 按列表顺序指向 30、25、35、30，每一轮显示 `d - 5`。列表里有两个 30，它们是两个元素，各处理一遍，所以 25 出现两次。\n"},{"id":"py35.k1.q2","body":"```python\nlabels = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\"]\nfor label in labels:\n    print(label)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"third","type":"text","prompt":"第 3 轮循环开始时，`label` 指向什么？","key":"S_C"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序一共显示几行？","key":5}],"explanation":"第 3 轮时 `label` 指向列表的第三个元素 **S_C**；列表有 5 个元素，循环体执行 5 遍，一共显示 **5** 行。\n"},{"id":"py35.k1.q3","body":"哪一段程序会依次显示 9、12、15 三行？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"reversed","content":"```python\nfor v in [5, 4, 3]:\n    print(v * 3)\n```\n","feedback":"循环按列表顺序处理，这一段先显示 15。"},{"id":"flat","content":"```python\nfor v in [3, 4, 5]:\nprint(v * 3)\n```\n","feedback":"for 下面的循环体必须缩进；这里没有缩进，程序会报错。"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nfor v in [3, 4, 5]:\n    print(v * 3)\n```\n"},{"id":"twice","content":"```python\nfor v in [9, 12, 15]:\n    print(v * 3)\n```\n","feedback":"列表里已经是 9、12、15，再乘 3 就成了 27、36、45。"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"列表是 `[3, 4, 5]`、`print(v * 3)` 缩进在循环里的那一段：三轮分别显示 9、12、15。列表倒过来写的那段先显示 15；`print` 没有缩进的那段，for 下面缺了循环体，会报错；列表本身写成 9、12、15 的那段又乘了一次 3。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py35.k1.r1","body":"循环体有两行。阅读程序，把显示的四行按出现的先后排好。\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 10]\nfor v in signals:\n    print(v)\n    print(v * 10)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","items":[{"id":"s10","content":"`10`"},{"id":"s80","content":"`80`"},{"id":"s100","content":"`100`"},{"id":"s8","content":"`8`"}],"key":["s8","s80","s10","s100"]}],"explanation":"依次是 **8、80、10、100**。第 1 轮 `v` 指向 8，把循环体的两行都执行完（显示 8 和 80），才进入第 2 轮；第 2 轮再显示 10 和 100。排成 8、10、80、100 是把两行 `print` 当成了各自先跑完整个列表。\n"},{"id":"py35.k1.r2","body":"下面四段程序里，哪一段显示的行数最多？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"four","content":"```python\nfor s in [\"甲\", \"乙\", \"丙\", \"丁\"]:\n    print(s)\n```\n"},{"id":"empty","content":"```python\nfor s in []:\n    print(s)\n    print(s)\n    print(s)\n```\n"},{"id":"two_lines","content":"```python\nfor s in [\"甲\", \"乙\", \"丙\"]:\n    print(s)\n    print(\"--\")\n```\n"},{"id":"after","content":"```python\nfor s in [\"甲\", \"乙\"]:\n    print(s)\nprint(\"完\")\n```\n"}],"key":"two_lines"}],"explanation":"三个元素、循环体两行的那一段最多：3 轮 × 2 行 = **6** 行。四个元素、循环体一行的那段显示 4 行；空列表那段循环体一遍也不执行，显示 0 行；最后那段循环体执行 2 遍，再加上循环后的一行，共 3 行。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py35.k1.x1","body":"```python\nsites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\"]\nfor site in sites:\n    print(site)\n    print(\"--\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共显示几行？","key":6},{"id":"third","type":"text","prompt":"第 3 行显示什么？","key":"南坡"},{"id":"last","type":"text","prompt":"最后一行显示什么？","key":"--"}],"explanation":"一共 **6** 行：北坡、--、南坡、--、东坡、--。每一轮把两行 `print` 都执行完才换下一个采样点，所以第 3 行是第 2 轮的 **南坡**，最后一行是第 3 轮的 **--**。\n"},{"id":"py35.k1.x2","body":"下面两段程序各自的循环体执行几遍？\n\n程序甲：\n\n```python\nvalues = [7, 7, 7]\nfor v in values:\n    print(v)\n```\n\n程序乙：\n\n```python\nvalues = []\nfor v in values:\n    print(v)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序甲的循环体执行几遍？","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":1,"message":"三个元素的值相同，也是三个元素，各执行一遍。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序乙的循环体执行几遍？","key":0}],"explanation":"程序甲执行 **3** 遍：列表里有三个元素，值都是 7 也要各处理一遍。程序乙执行 **0** 遍：空列表里没有元素，循环体一次也不执行，程序什么也不显示。\n"}]},{"id":"py35.k2","title":"循环内外的变量状态","key":["py01","py02"],"links":["py01.k2"],"card":{"name":"循环后的名字","aliases":["循环内外","循环结束后"],"definition":"循环结束后，循环变量和循环体里赋值的名字都还在，指向最后一轮留下的值；缩进在循环体里的行每轮执行一次，退回到 for 那一层的行在循环结束后只执行一次。","conditions":["判断一行在不在循环里只看缩进：和循环体对齐的在循环里，和 for 对齐的在循环后。","列表是空的时，循环体里的赋值一次也没有发生，名字保持循环前的样子。"],"example":"```python\ncounts = [3, 5, 2]\nfor n in counts:\n    scaled = n * 10\nprint(scaled)\n```\nprint 没有缩进，循环结束后只执行一次，显示最后一轮的 20。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"循环结束以后，循环里用过的名字并不会消失。\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\nfor v in signals:\n    doubled = v * 2\nprint(v)\nprint(doubled)\n```\n\n`for` 下面只有 `doubled = v * 2` 一行缩进，它是循环体，执行 3 遍；后面两行 `print` 没有缩进，在循环结束后各执行一次。那时 `v` 还指向最后一个元素 13，`doubled` 是最后一轮算出的 26，所以显示 13 和 26。前两轮的 16、20 被后来的赋值替换掉了，和[重新赋值](repa:concept/py01.k2)一样。\n\n同样一行 `print(doubled)`，缩进与否结果完全不同：\n\n| 写法 | 执行几次 | 显示 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 缩进在循环体里 | 每轮一次，共 3 次 | 16、20、26 |\n| 不缩进，写在循环后 | 循环结束后 1 次 | 26 |\n\n所以读循环时，先找出循环体到哪一行为止：缩进退回到和 `for` 对齐的第一行，就是循环之后的代码。\n","example":{"id":"py35.k2.e0","body":"两段程序只差最后一行的缩进。\n\n程序甲：\n\n```python\ncounts = [3, 5, 2]\nfor n in counts:\n    scaled = n * 10\n    print(scaled)\n```\n\n程序乙：\n\n```python\ncounts = [3, 5, 2]\nfor n in counts:\n    scaled = n * 10\nprint(scaled)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序甲显示几行？","key":3},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序乙显示几行？","key":1},{"id":"shown","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序乙显示的那个数是多少？","key":20}],"explanation":"程序甲的 `print` 缩进在循环体里，每轮显示一次，共 **3** 行：30、50、20。程序乙的 `print` 和 `for` 对齐，在循环结束后只执行 **1** 次；那时 `scaled` 是最后一轮算出的 **20**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py35.k2.q1","body":"三批样本的重量（千克），在循环里换算成克。\n\n```python\nweights = [12, 7, 20]\nfor w in weights:\n    grams = w * 1000\nprint(w)\nprint(grams)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":20,"feedback":[{"when":12,"message":"循环结束时，w 已经依次指向过三个元素，停在最后一个。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":20000}],"explanation":"显示 **20** 和 **20000**。两行 `print` 都在循环后，各执行一次。循环结束时 `w` 停在最后一个元素 20，`grams` 是最后一轮算出的 20000；前两轮的 12000、7000 已经被替换掉。\n"},{"id":"py35.k2.q2","body":"下面的程序想在处理完全部样本之后，**只显示一次**最后处理的样本编号。它却显示了三行。\n\n```python startLine=1\nlabels = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nfor label in labels:\n    last = label\n    print(last)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改才符合要求？","options":[{"id":"drop3","content":"删掉第 3 行","feedback":"删掉以后 last 从来没有被赋值，第 4 行用它会报错。"},{"id":"dedent3","content":"第 3 行去掉缩进，和 for 对齐","feedback":"这样 for 下面第一行就没有缩进，循环体断开了，程序会报错。"},{"id":"dedent4","content":"第 4 行去掉缩进，和 for 对齐"}],"key":"dedent4"}],"explanation":"把第 4 行去掉缩进。`print(last)` 退到循环后，只在循环结束时执行一次；那时 `last` 是最后一轮的 S_C。删掉第 3 行，`last` 就没有值；把第 3 行退出来，for 下面紧跟的一行没有缩进，程序会报错。\n"},{"id":"py35.k2.q3","body":"两段文字用 `+` 连起来，就是把它们拼成一段。\n\n```python\nnote = \"未开始\"\nfor s in [\"S_A\", \"S_B\"]:\n    note = \"处理到\" + s\nprint(note)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"处理到S_B"},{"id":"empty","type":"text","prompt":"如果把第 2 行的列表换成空列表 `[]`，程序显示什么？","key":"未开始"}],"explanation":"显示 **处理到S_B**：循环里给 `note` 赋值了两次，循环后读到的是最后一次的结果。换成空列表时，循环体一次也不执行，`note` 还是循环前的 **未开始**。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py35.k2.r1","body":"下面的程序运行结束后，哪一句说法正确？\n\n```python\nreadings = [4, 9, 6]\nfor r in readings:\n    diff = r - 1\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"gone","content":"`r` 和 `diff` 只在循环里有效，循环结束后就不存在了"},{"id":"first","content":"`r` 回到了列表开头，指向 4"},{"id":"last","content":"`r` 指向 6，`diff` 是 5"},{"id":"all","content":"`diff` 保存了每一轮的结果 3、8、5"}],"key":"last"}],"explanation":"“`r` 指向 6，`diff` 是 5”正确。循环结束后两个名字都还在：`r` 停在最后一个元素 6，`diff` 是最后一轮算出的 5。每一轮的 `diff = r - 1` 都让 `diff` 改指向新值，前两轮的 3、8 没有另外保存。\n"},{"id":"py35.k2.r2","body":"```python\nfor d in [30, 25]:\n    print(d)\n    print(\"测完一个\")\nprint(\"全部测完\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共显示几行？","key":5},{"id":"each","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"“测完一个”显示几次？","key":2},{"id":"done","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"“全部测完”显示几次？","key":1}],"explanation":"一共 **5** 行：30、测完一个、25、测完一个、全部测完。“测完一个”缩进在循环体里，两轮各显示一次，共 **2** 次；“全部测完”和 `for` 对齐，在循环结束后只显示 **1** 次。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py35.k2.x1","body":"列表里的样本编号没有按顺序排列。\n\n```python\nlabels = [\"S_C\", \"S_A\", \"S_B\"]\nfor label in labels:\n    current = label\nprint(current)\nprint(label)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"S_B","feedback":[{"when":"S_C","message":"循环按列表的顺序走，最后一轮是列表的最后一个元素，不是编号最大的那个。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"S_B"}],"explanation":"两行都显示 **S_B**。循环按列表顺序依次处理 S_C、S_A、S_B，最后一轮 `label` 指向 S_B，`current` 也在这一轮被赋值为 S_B。循环不会按编号大小排序。\n"},{"id":"py35.k2.x2","body":"下面的程序想把每个深度从厘米换算成毫米，**每个都显示出来**。它却只显示了一行。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndepths = [30, 25, 35]\nfor d in depths:\n    mm = d * 10\nprint(mm)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"现在显示的那一行是什么？","key":350},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改才能三个都显示？","options":[{"id":"indent4","content":"第 4 行加上缩进，和第 3 行对齐"},{"id":"dedent3","content":"第 3 行去掉缩进"},{"id":"list","content":"第 1 行改成 `depths = [[30, 25, 35]]`"}],"key":"indent4"}],"explanation":"现在显示 **350**：`print(mm)` 在循环后，只执行一次，那时 `mm` 是最后一轮的 350。把第 4 行缩进到循环体里，每轮都显示一次，依次是 300、250、350。去掉第 3 行的缩进会让 for 下面缺了循环体而报错；把列表再套一层，循环只有一轮，算出的也不是三个深度。\n"}]},{"id":"py35.k3","title":"初始化与累计值的位置","key":["py01"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"累计值","aliases":["累加","计数","初始化"],"definition":"在循环前给累计的名字一个起点（如 total = 0），循环体每轮用 total = total + v 把当前元素加进去；循环结束后，它才是全部元素的累计结果。","conditions":["起点写进循环体，每轮都会被设回起点，最后只剩最后一轮的值。","加法从 0 起，乘法从 1 起；只要最终结果时，print 写在循环后。"],"example":"```python\ncounts = [4, 6, 5]\ntotal = 0\nfor c in counts:\n    total = total + c\nprint(total)\n```\ntotal 依次是 0、4、10、15，循环后显示 15。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"想把一个列表里的数加起来，常见的写法是：\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\ntotal = 0\nfor v in signals:\n    total = total + v\nprint(total)\n```\n\n`total = 0` 在循环**前**执行一次，给累计一个起点；循环体每一轮用 `total` 现在的值加上当前的 `v`，再让 `total` 指向新结果；循环结束后 `print` 执行一次。按轮次记状态表：\n\n| 执行到 | v | total |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 循环前 | 尚未定义 | 0 |\n| 第 1 轮后 | 8 | 8 |\n| 第 2 轮后 | 10 | 18 |\n| 第 3 轮后 | 13 | 31 |\n\n显示 31。每一轮的 `total + v` 用的都是上一轮留下的 `total`，这就是“累计”。数个数也是同一个写法：先 `count = 0`，每轮 `count = count + 1`。\n\n最常见的两处错位：\n\n- 把 `total = 0` 缩进到循环体里：每一轮先被设回 0，再加上当前的 `v`，最后只剩最后一个元素 13。\n- 把 `print(total)` 缩进到循环体里：每一轮都显示一次中间值 8、18、31，而不是只显示最终结果。\n\n起点也要想一想：加法从 0 开始；乘法从 1 开始，从 0 开始乘多少次都是 0。\n","example":{"id":"py35.k3.e0","body":"`counts` 是三批样本各自的份数，程序算出一共多少份。按执行顺序填写状态表，再写出显示的结果。\n\n```python\ncounts = [4, 6, 5]\ntotal = 0\nfor c in counts:\n    total = total + c\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","label":"状态表","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"执行到"},{"id":"c","header":"c","input":"integer"},{"id":"total","header":"total","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"before","cells":{"step":"循环前","c":{"value":"尚未定义"},"total":0}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"step":"第 1 轮后","c":4,"total":4}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"step":"第 2 轮后","c":6,"total":10}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"step":"第 3 轮后","c":5,"total":15}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":15}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | c | total |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 循环前 | 尚未定义 | 0 |\n| 第 1 轮后 | 4 | 4 |\n| 第 2 轮后 | 6 | 10 |\n| 第 3 轮后 | 5 | 15 |\n\n最后显示 **15**。`total = 0` 只在循环前执行一次；每一轮都用上一轮留下的 `total` 加上当前的 `c`。`print` 在循环后，只显示最终结果。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py35.k3.q1","body":"下面的程序想算出三批样本的总重量（克）。\n\n```python startLine=1\nweights = [12, 7, 20]\nfor w in weights:\n    total = 0\n    total = total + w\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":20,"feedback":[{"when":39,"message":"39 是想要的结果；再看第 3 行在不在循环体里。"}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改才能显示总重量？","options":[{"id":"indent5","content":"第 5 行加上缩进，放进循环体"},{"id":"move3","content":"第 3 行移到 for 之前，并去掉缩进"},{"id":"assign","content":"第 4 行改成 `total = w`"}],"key":"move3"}],"explanation":"现在显示 **20**：`total = 0` 在循环体里，每一轮先被设回 0，再加上当前的 `w`，最后只剩最后一批的 20。把第 3 行移到 for 之前、去掉缩进，起点只设一次，结果才是 39。把 `print` 放进循环会显示 12、7、20 三行；改成 `total = w` 仍然只记住最后一批。\n"},{"id":"py35.k3.q2","body":"同一个循环里同时数个数、算总和。\n\n```python\nsignals = [9, 12, 10]\ncount = 0\ntotal = 0\nfor v in signals:\n    count = count + 1\n    total = total + v\nprint(count)\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"middle","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 2 轮结束时，`total` 是多少？","key":21},{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":3},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":31}],"explanation":"第 2 轮结束时 `total` 是 9 + 12 = **21**。循环结束后显示 **3** 和 **31**：`count` 每轮加 1，数的是元素个数；`total` 每轮加上当前的 `v`，是总和。\n"},{"id":"py35.k3.q3","body":"宿主已经准备好列表 `weights`，是每批样本的重量（克）。把下面的代码块排成一段程序：算出总重量，**最后只显示一次**总和。用不到的块不要放进来，每一块的缩进也要排对。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":2,"items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(total)"},{"id":"assign","code":"total = w"},{"id":"add","code":"total = total + w"},{"id":"loop","code":"for w in weights:"},{"id":"start","code":"total = 0"}],"key":["start","loop","add","show"],"indents":{"start":0,"loop":0,"add":1,"show":0},"tests":[{"name":"三批样本","setup":"weights = [12, 7, 20]","stdout":"39"},{"name":"只有一批","hidden":true,"setup":"weights = [5]","stdout":"5"},{"name":"一批都没有","hidden":true,"setup":"weights = []","stdout":"0"}]}],"explanation":"```python\ntotal = 0\nfor w in weights:\n    total = total + w\nprint(total)\n```\n\n`total = 0` 在循环前、不缩进；`total = total + w` 缩进一层，是循环体；`print(total)` 退回不缩进，循环结束后只显示一次。`total = w` 只会记住最后一批，用不上。一批都没有时，循环体不执行，显示起点 0。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py35.k3.r1","body":"一份溶液连续稀释了三次，`factors` 是每次的稀释倍数。程序算出总的稀释倍数。按执行顺序填写状态表。\n\n```python\nfactors = [2, 5, 10]\ndilution = 1\nfor f in factors:\n    dilution = dilution * f\nprint(dilution)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"执行到"},{"id":"f","header":"f","input":"integer"},{"id":"dilution","header":"dilution","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"before","cells":{"step":"循环前","f":{"value":"尚未定义"},"dilution":1}},{"id":"r1","cells":{"step":"第 1 轮后","f":2,"dilution":2}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"step":"第 2 轮后","f":5,"dilution":10}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"step":"第 3 轮后","f":10,"dilution":100}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":100}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | f | dilution |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 循环前 | 尚未定义 | 1 |\n| 第 1 轮后 | 2 | 2 |\n| 第 2 轮后 | 5 | 10 |\n| 第 3 轮后 | 10 | 100 |\n\n最后显示 **100**。乘起来的累计从 1 开始；如果起点写成 0，乘多少次都是 0。\n"},{"id":"py35.k3.r2","body":"下面的程序想显示三批样本一共多少份。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncounts = [3, 4, 5]\nn = 0\nfor c in counts:\n    n = n + c\n    print(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共显示几行？","key":3},{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":3},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要只显示一次总数，应该怎样改？","options":[{"id":"move2","content":"把第 2 行移进循环体"},{"id":"dedent5","content":"第 5 行去掉缩进，和 for 对齐"},{"id":"start","content":"第 2 行改成 `n = 3`"}],"key":"dedent5"}],"explanation":"显示 **3** 行：3、7、12，每一轮都显示一次中间结果，第一行是 **3**。把第 5 行退到和 for 对齐，`print` 就只在循环结束后执行一次，显示 12。把起点移进循环体会每轮清零，起点改成 3 会多加 3；这两种改法都没动 `print`，仍然每轮显示一次。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py35.k3.x1","body":"哪一段程序会显示 `samples` 里一共有几个样本（只显示一行）？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"reset","content":"```python\nfor s in samples:\n    n = 0\n    n = n + 1\nprint(n)\n```\n"},{"id":"inside","content":"```python\nn = 0\nfor s in samples:\n    n = n + 1\n    print(n)\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nn = 0\nfor s in samples:\n    n = n + 1\nprint(n)\n```\n"},{"id":"text","content":"```python\nn = 0\nfor s in samples:\n    n = n + s\nprint(n)\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`n = 0` 在循环前、`print(n)` 在循环后的那一段显示 **4**。把 `n = 0` 写进循环的那段每轮清零，只显示 1；`print` 缩进在循环里的那段显示 1、2、3、4 四行；`n = n + s` 是把数字和文字相加，会报错，而且数个数本来就该每轮加 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"samples = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]","display":"宿主已经准备好列表：\n\n```python\nsamples = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py35.k3.x2","body":"AI 写了一段程序，说是算出三个读数的总和。\n\n```python\nsignals = [9, 12, 10]\ntotal = signals[0]\nfor v in signals:\n    total = total + v\nprint(total)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":40,"feedback":[{"when":31,"message":"31 是三个读数的和；再看 total 的起点是多少，循环又从哪个元素开始加。"}]},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"结果和三个读数的和差在哪里？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"没有差别，结果就是总和"},{"id":"missing","content":"少加了最后一个读数"},{"id":"double","content":"第一个读数被算了两次"}],"key":"double"}],"explanation":"显示 **40**，比真正的总和 31 多出 9。起点已经是第一个读数 9，循环又从第一个元素开始，把 9 再加了一次，所以第一个读数被算了两次。起点写成 0 就对了。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py36","title":"把“逐个检查并收集”读成循环","summary":"读懂“逐个检查，满足条件的收进新列表”：for、if、append 的执行顺序和缩进；分清两个名字指向同一个列表和各自独立的副本。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py35","py10","py06"],"intro":"上一节的循环对每个元素做同样的事。这一节在循环里加一个 `if`：逐个检查，满足条件的收进一个新列表。AI 写的数据处理代码里，这是最常见的样子之一。\n\n后半节看一个和“收集”紧挨着的坑：两个名字可能指向同一个列表，改一个，另一个也跟着变。\n","wrapup":"读“逐个检查并收集”的循环，按顺序找四处：空列表在哪里建（应在循环前）；每轮检查什么条件；`append` 是否缩进在 `if` 下面；结果在哪里显示。结果总是按原列表的顺序排列。\n\n看到 `backup = data` 这类写法，先问一句：这是同一个列表的另一个名字，还是一份独立的副本？要副本就写 `data.copy()`。\n","kps":[{"id":"py36.k1","title":"for+if+append 的处理顺序","key":["py35","py10"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"筛选收集","aliases":["append","逐个检查"],"definition":"先在循环前建空列表 kept = []，循环里逐个检查，满足条件的用 kept.append(v) 加到末尾；结果只含满足条件的元素，按原列表的顺序排列。","conditions":["kept = [] 写进循环体，每轮都会被清空，最后最多剩下一个元素。","append 要比 if 多缩进一层才只收满足条件的；和 if 对齐的行不归 if 管，每轮都执行。"],"example":"```python\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v)\nprint(kept)\n```\n逐个检查，12、10、15 满足条件，显示 [12, 10, 15]，顺序与原列表相同。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"“把 signal 至少为 10 的读数挑出来”，写成循环通常是这样：\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v)\nprint(kept)\n```\n\n逐行读：\n\n1. `kept = []` 建一个空列表，用来装结果。它在循环**前**，只执行一次。\n2. `for v in signals:` 让 `v` 依次指向每个读数，每轮执行一遍缩进的循环体。\n3. 循环体里是一个 `if`：条件成立时，才执行比 `if` 再多缩进一层的那一行。\n4. `kept.append(v)` 在 `kept` 这个列表的末尾加上当前的 `v`。它直接改动 `kept` 这个列表，不需要再写 `kept = ...`。\n5. 循环结束后，`print(kept)` 显示一次结果。\n\n按轮次记下来：\n\n| 第几轮 | v | `v >= 10` | 这一轮后的 kept |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | 8 | False | `[]` |\n| 2 | 12 | True | `[12]` |\n| 3 | 10 | True | `[12, 10]` |\n| 4 | 7 | False | `[12, 10]` |\n| 5 | 15 | True | `[12, 10, 15]` |\n\n结果 `[12, 10, 15]` 按原列表的顺序排列，不会自动排序。这里有两层缩进：循环体缩进一层，`if` 下面的那一行再缩进一层。只有比 `if` 多缩进一层的行才归 `if` 管；和 `if` 对齐的行不论条件成不成立，每轮都执行，`append` 写在那里就会把每个读数都收进来。`kept = []` 如果写进循环体，每一轮都会被清空。\n","example":{"id":"py36.k1.e0","body":"按轮次填写：这一轮的条件是否成立，以及这一轮结束后 `kept` 的样子。再写出最后显示的内容。\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v)\nprint(kept)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","label":"状态表","columns":[{"id":"round","header":"第几轮"},{"id":"v","header":"v"},{"id":"cond","header":"v >= 10","input":"bool"},{"id":"kept","header":"这一轮后的 kept","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"round":"1","v":"8","cond":false,"kept":"[]"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"round":"2","v":"12","cond":true,"kept":"[12]"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"round":"3","v":"10","cond":true,"kept":"[12, 10]"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"round":"4","v":"7","cond":false,"kept":"[12, 10]"}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"round":"5","v":"15","cond":true,"kept":"[12, 10, 15]"}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":"[12, 10, 15]"}],"explanation":"| 第几轮 | v | `v >= 10` | 这一轮后的 kept |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | 8 | False | `[]` |\n| 2 | 12 | True | `[12]` |\n| 3 | 10 | True | `[12, 10]` |\n| 4 | 7 | False | `[12, 10]` |\n| 5 | 15 | True | `[12, 10, 15]` |\n\n最后显示 **[12, 10, 15]**。条件不成立的轮次，`append` 不执行，`kept` 保持上一轮的样子。10 恰好等于阈值，`>=` 包含它。结果按原列表的顺序，不是从小到大。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py36.k1.q1","body":"要挑出深度小于 30 厘米的采样点读数。\n\n```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 30, 20]\nshallow = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d < 30:\n        shallow.append(d)\nprint(shallow)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rounds","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"循环体一共执行几遍？","key":5},{"id":"appends","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`shallow.append(d)` 一共执行几次？","key":2},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":"[25, 20]","feedback":[{"when":"[20, 25]","message":"收集的结果按原列表的顺序排列，不会自动排序。"},{"when":"[30, 25, 30, 20]","message":"`<` 不包含等号，恰好是 30 的不算。"}]}],"explanation":"循环体执行 **5** 遍，每个深度都检查一次；只有 25 和 20 小于 30，`append` 执行 **2** 次。最后显示 **[25, 20]**，按原列表的顺序。“检查几次”和“收进几个”是两回事。\n"},{"id":"py36.k1.q2","body":"下面的程序想收集至少为 10 的读数，结果不对。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\nfor v in signals:\n    kept = []\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v)\nprint(kept)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[15]"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改才对？","options":[{"id":"indent6","content":"第 6 行缩进进循环体"},{"id":"assign","content":"第 5 行改成 `kept = [v]`"},{"id":"move3","content":"第 3 行移到 for 之前，并去掉缩进"}],"key":"move3"}],"explanation":"显示 **[15]**。`kept = []` 在循环体里，每一轮开头都把 `kept` 换成一个新的空列表，前面收进去的 12、10 都丢了；最后一轮的 15 满足条件，所以只剩 `[15]`。把第 3 行移到循环前，空列表只建一次，结果才是 `[12, 10, 15]`。把 `print` 放进循环只会把每轮的残缺结果都显示出来；改成 `kept = [v]` 也只记住最后一个。\n"},{"id":"py36.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 从 `depths` 里收集**至少达到** `limit` 的深度，放进列表 `deep`，保持原来的顺序，不改动 `depths`。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，有两处错误。请改对并提交，结果仍放在 `deep` 里。判分时还会换别的 `depths` 和 `limit` 运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":8,"starter":"for d in depths:\n    deep = []\n    if d > limit:\n        deep.append(d)\n","solution":"deep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d >= limit:\n        deep.append(d)\n","accepts":["deep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if not d < limit:\n        deep.append(d)\n","deep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d >= limit:\n        deep = deep + [d]\n","deep = [d for d in depths if d >= limit]"],"rejects":[{"code":"deep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d > limit:\n        deep.append(d)\n","why":"只挪了空列表，仍漏掉恰好等于阈值的深度"},{"code":"for d in depths:\n    deep = []\n    if d >= limit:\n        deep.append(d)\n","why":"只改了比较符，空列表仍在循环里每轮清空"},{"code":"deep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d >= limit:\n        pass\n    deep.append(d)\n","why":"append 没有缩进在 if 下面，每个深度都收了"},{"code":"deep = [30, 35, 30]","why":"照着这一组数据写死了结果"},{"code":"deep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d >= limit:\n        deep.append(d)\ndeep.sort()\n","why":"把结果重新排了序"}],"tests":[{"name":"题面里的数据（含恰好等于阈值的深度）","expect":{"deep":"[30, 35, 30]","depths":"depths"}},{"name":"换一组深度和阈值","hidden":true,"setup":"depths = [40, 12, 40, 18, 55]\nlimit = 18\n","expect":{"deep":"[40, 40, 18, 55]","depths":"depths"}},{"name":"没有达到阈值的深度","hidden":true,"setup":"depths = [10, 20]\nlimit = 25\n","expect":{"deep":"[]"}},{"name":"列表是空的","hidden":true,"setup":"depths = []\nlimit = 10\n","expect":{"deep":"[]"}}]}],"explanation":"两处错误：`deep = []` 在循环体里，每轮清空；`>` 不包含恰好等于 `limit` 的深度。改成：\n\n```python\ndeep = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d >= limit:\n        deep.append(d)\n```\n\n题面数据的结果是 `[30, 35, 30]`，两个恰好等于 30 的深度都留下，顺序与原列表相同。判分时还会换数据：没有深度达标时 `deep` 是空列表 `[]`；`depths` 本身是空列表时，循环体不执行，`deep` 也要是 `[]`，所以空列表必须在循环前建好。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"depths = [30, 25, 35, 30]\nlimit = 30\n","display":"宿主已经准备好：\n\n```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 30]\nlimit = 30\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py36.k1.r1","body":"宿主已经准备好 `readings`，是一组温度读数（摄氏度），其中 `-999` 表示仪器没有读到，其他负数是正常的低温读数。把下面的代码块排成程序：把所有不是 `-999` 的读数按原顺序收进 `clean`，最后显示一次 `clean`。用不到的块不要放进来，缩进也要排对。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":2,"items":[{"id":"add","code":"clean.append(t)"},{"id":"positive","code":"if t > 0:"},{"id":"show","code":"print(clean)"},{"id":"loop","code":"for t in readings:"},{"id":"check","code":"if t != -999:"},{"id":"start","code":"clean = []"}],"key":["start","loop","check","add","show"],"indents":{"start":0,"loop":0,"check":1,"add":2,"show":0},"tests":[{"name":"有坏值也有正常的负数","setup":"readings = [12, -999, -3, 8]","stdout":"[12, -3, 8]"},{"name":"全是坏值","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [-999, -999]","stdout":"[]"},{"name":"没有读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = []","stdout":"[]"},{"name":"只有一个读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [5]","stdout":"[5]"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nclean = []\nfor t in readings:\n    if t != -999:\n        clean.append(t)\nprint(clean)\n```\n\n空列表在循环前；`if` 缩进一层，是循环体；`append` 再缩进一层，归 `if` 管；`print` 不缩进，循环后显示一次。`if t > 0:` 会把 -3 这样正常的低温读数也去掉，不符合要求。\n"},{"id":"py36.k1.r2","body":"一次循环同时分成两组。\n\n```python\nhigh = []\nlow = []\nfor v in [9, 14, 10, 3]:\n    if v >= 10:\n        high.append(v)\n    else:\n        low.append(v)\nprint(high)\nprint(low)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[14, 10]"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[9, 3]"}],"explanation":"显示 **[14, 10]** 和 **[9, 3]**。每个读数只走 `if` 和 `else` 中的一条路：至少为 10 的进 `high`，其余的进 `low`。两个列表里的顺序都跟着原列表走。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py36.k1.x1","body":"下面的程序想数出至少为 10 的读数有几个，并把它们收进 `kept`。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7]\nkept = []\nn = 0\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        n = n + 1\n    kept.append(v)\nprint(n)\nprint(kept)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":2},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[8, 12, 10, 7]"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要让 `kept` 只收至少为 10 的读数、`n` 的结果不变，应该怎样改？","options":[{"id":"strict","content":"第 5 行改成 `if v > 10:`"},{"id":"indent7","content":"第 7 行再缩进一层，和第 6 行对齐"},{"id":"move2","content":"第 2 行移进循环体，放在第 5 行之前"}],"key":"indent7"}],"explanation":"显示 **2** 和 **[8, 12, 10, 7]**。第 6 行比 `if` 多缩进一层，只在条件成立时执行，所以 `n` 是 2；第 7 行和 `if` 对齐，不归 `if` 管，每个读数都被收进 `kept`。把第 7 行再缩进一层，`kept` 才是 `[12, 10]`。改成 `>` 会漏掉恰好为 10 的读数；把空列表移进循环会每轮清空。\n"},{"id":"py36.k1.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把 `wells` 里不是空白对照孔（`\"blank\"`）的孔位标记，按原顺序收进 `sample_wells`，不改动 `wells`。\n\n作答框里已经写好了空列表和循环，把 `...` 那一行换成检查和收集的代码。判分时还会换别的 `wells` 运行你的代码。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":8,"starter":"sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    ...\n","solution":"sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if w != \"blank\":\n        sample_wells.append(w)\n","accepts":["sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if not w == \"blank\":\n        sample_wells.append(w)\n","sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if w == \"blank\":\n        pass\n    else:\n        sample_wells.append(w)\n","sample_wells = [w for w in wells if w != \"blank\"]"],"rejects":[{"code":"sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if w == \"blank\":\n        sample_wells.append(w)\n","why":"条件写反了，收的是空白对照孔"},{"code":"sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if w != \"blank\":\n        pass\n    sample_wells.append(w)\n","why":"append 没有缩进在 if 下面，每个孔都收了"},{"code":"sample_wells = [\"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\"]","why":"照着这一组数据写死了结果"},{"code":"sample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if w != \"blank\":\n        sample_wells.append(w)\nsample_wells.sort()\n","why":"把结果重新排了序"}],"tests":[{"name":"题面里的孔位","expect":{"sample_wells":"[\"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\"]","wells":"wells"}},{"name":"全是空白对照","hidden":true,"setup":"wells = [\"blank\", \"blank\"]","expect":{"sample_wells":"[]"}},{"name":"没有空白对照，编号也不按顺序","hidden":true,"setup":"wells = [\"S9\", \"S1\", \"S4\"]","expect":{"sample_wells":"[\"S9\", \"S1\", \"S4\"]","wells":"wells"}},{"name":"一个孔都没有","hidden":true,"setup":"wells = []","expect":{"sample_wells":"[]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsample_wells = []\nfor w in wells:\n    if w != \"blank\":\n        sample_wells.append(w)\n```\n\n`if` 缩进一层，在循环体里逐个检查；`append` 再缩进一层，只在不是 `\"blank\"` 时执行。题面数据的结果是 `[\"S1\", \"S2\", \"S3\"]`。判分时还会换数据：全是空白对照时结果是空列表；编号不按顺序时，结果保持原来的顺序，不排序。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"wells = [\"S1\", \"blank\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"blank\"]\n","display":"宿主已经准备好一块板上各孔的标记，`\"blank\"` 是空白对照孔：\n\n```python\nwells = [\"S1\", \"blank\", \"S2\", \"S3\", \"blank\"]\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py36.k2","title":"列表原位修改及别名与独立副本","key":["py06","py01"],"links":["py01.k2"],"card":{"name":"列表别名","aliases":["别名","副本","copy"],"definition":"b = a 不复制列表，只让 b 也指向 a 指向的那个列表；之后用任何一个名字 append，两个名字看到的都变了。要独立的一份，写 a.copy() 或 list(a)。","conditions":["a = a + [5] 先造出新列表再让 a 改指向它，别名 b 仍指向旧列表；append 是在原列表上改。","整数没有原地修改，n = n + 1 总是让名字改指向新值，所以另一个名字不受影响。"],"example":"```python\na = [8, 10]\nb = a\nc = a.copy()\nb.append(13)\n```\na 和 b 指向同一个列表，都成了 [8, 10, 13]；c 是独立副本，仍是 [8, 10]。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"讲[重新赋值](repa:concept/py01.k2)时说过：`saved = count` 之后再改 `count`，`saved` 不变。换成列表，再用上 `append`，情况就不一样了：\n\n```python\na = [8, 10]\nb = a\nb.append(13)\nprint(a)\n```\n\n显示 `[8, 10, 13]`。`b = a` 并没有复制出第二个列表，只是让 `b` 也指向 `a` 指向的那**同一个**列表，就像同一个文件夹有两个快捷方式。`b.append(13)` 直接改动这个列表，从 `a` 看过去当然也变了。两个名字指向同一个列表，`b` 就是 `a` 的**别名**。\n\n要一份独立的副本，写 `a.copy()` 或 `list(a)`：它们造出一个内容相同的新列表，之后改一个，另一个不受影响。\n\n| 第二行写成 | 造了新列表吗 | 之后 `b.append(13)`，a 变不变 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `b = a` | 没有，b 是别名 | 变 |\n| `b = a.copy()` | 造了 | 不变 |\n| `b = list(a)` | 造了 | 不变 |\n\n还有一处容易混：`a = a + [5]` 照“先算右边”来读，用 `a` 现在的内容和 `[5]` 拼出一个**新**列表，再让 `a` 改指向它；原来的列表没有被改，别名 `b` 仍指向原来那个。`a.append(5)` 则是在原列表上改，`b` 也会看到。\n\n为什么要在意：AI 写的代码有时先 `backup = data`，想“留一份原始数据”，再往 `data` 里加东西或做清理。这样留下的不是备份，原始数据也跟着变了。\n","example":{"id":"py36.k2.e0","body":"按执行顺序填写第 3 行和第 4 行执行完后，三个名字各指向什么样的列表；再判断第 4 行之后哪两个名字指向同一个列表。\n\n```python startLine=1\na = [8, 10]\nb = a\nc = a.copy()\nb.append(13)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","label":"状态表","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"执行到"},{"id":"a","header":"a","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}},{"id":"b","header":"b","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}},{"id":"c","header":"c","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"step":"第 3 行","a":"[8, 10]","b":"[8, 10]","c":"[8, 10]"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"step":"第 4 行","a":"[8, 10, 13]","b":"[8, 10, 13]","c":"[8, 10]"}}]},{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 行之后，哪两个名字指向同一个列表？","options":[{"id":"ac","content":"a 和 c"},{"id":"ab","content":"a 和 b"},{"id":"bc","content":"b 和 c"}],"key":"ab"}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | a | b | c |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 第 3 行 | [8, 10] | [8, 10] | [8, 10] |\n| 第 4 行 | [8, 10, 13] | [8, 10, 13] | [8, 10] |\n\n第 3 行时三个名字显示的内容一样，但只有 **a 和 b** 是同一个列表：`b = a` 没有复制，`c = a.copy()` 造了一个新列表。所以第 4 行通过 `b` 加上 13 以后，`a` 也变了，`c` 不变。内容相同不等于是同一个列表。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py36.k2.q1","body":"有人想先留一份原始读数，再往 `raw` 里补一个新读数。\n\n```python\nraw = [5, 7, 9]\nbackup = raw\nraw.append(-1)\nprint(backup)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[5, 7, 9, -1]","feedback":[{"when":"[5, 7, 9]","message":"第 2 行没有复制列表，backup 和 raw 是同一个列表的两个名字。"}]},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句解释了这个结果？","options":[{"id":"same","content":"`backup` 和 `raw` 指向同一个列表，通过 `raw` 改动，从 `backup` 也看得到"},{"id":"all","content":"`append` 会给程序里所有的列表都加上 -1"},{"id":"copy","content":"`backup = raw` 复制了一份，但 print 显示的其实是 `raw`"}],"key":"same"}],"explanation":"显示 **[5, 7, 9, -1]**。`backup = raw` 只让 `backup` 也指向同一个列表，`raw.append(-1)` 改的就是这个列表，所以从 `backup` 看也多了 -1。这样留下的不是备份；要备份应写 `backup = raw.copy()`。\n"},{"id":"py36.k2.q2","body":"```python\na = [1, 2]\nb = a\na = a + [3]\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[1, 2, 3]"},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[1, 2]","feedback":[{"when":"[1, 2, 3]","message":"`a + [3]` 拼出的是一个新列表，第 3 行只让 a 改指向它，原来的列表没有被改。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **[1, 2, 3]** 和 **[1, 2]**。第 3 行先算右边，拼出一个新列表 `[1, 2, 3]`，再让 `a` 改指向它；`b` 仍指向原来的 `[1, 2]`。如果第 3 行写成 `a.append(3)`，改的是原来那个列表，两行就都是 `[1, 2, 3]`。\n"},{"id":"py36.k2.q3","body":"第 2 行想留一份**不受后面修改影响**的原始读数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nraw = [5, 7, 9]\n# 第 2 行写在这里\nraw.append(-1)\n```\n\n下面哪些写法能做到？选出所有能做到的。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"alias","content":"```python\nbackup = raw\n```\n"},{"id":"copy","content":"```python\nbackup = raw.copy()\n```\n"},{"id":"nested","content":"```python\nbackup = [raw]\n```\n"},{"id":"list","content":"```python\nbackup = list(raw)\n```\n"}],"key":["copy","list"]}],"explanation":"`backup = raw.copy()` 和 `backup = list(raw)` 能做到：它们各造出一个内容相同的新列表，第 3 行改 `raw` 不影响它。`backup = raw` 只是别名，会跟着变成 `[5, 7, 9, -1]`；`backup = [raw]` 造的是“装着 raw 这个列表的列表”，里面那个仍是同一个列表，也会跟着变。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py36.k2.r1","body":"```python\nkept = []\nalias = kept\nfor v in [4, 11, 12]:\n    if v > 10:\n        alias.append(v)\nprint(kept)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[11, 12]","feedback":[{"when":"[]","message":"循环里是通过 alias 加的，但 alias 和 kept 是同一个列表。"}]},{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"`kept` 和 `alias` 是什么关系？","options":[{"id":"two","content":"两个各自独立的空列表"},{"id":"one","content":"同一个列表的两个名字"}],"key":"one"}],"explanation":"显示 **[11, 12]**。第 2 行让 `alias` 也指向 `kept` 那个空列表；循环里通过 `alias.append(v)` 加进去的 11、12，改的就是这一个列表，从 `kept` 看也一样。\n"},{"id":"py36.k2.r2","body":"运行下面三行之后，哪一句说法正确？\n\n```python\na = [3, 6]\nb = list(a)\nb.append(0)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both","content":"a 和 b 都是 [3, 6, 0]"},{"id":"only_b","content":"a 还是 [3, 6]，b 是 [3, 6, 0]"},{"id":"swapped","content":"a 是 [3, 6, 0]，b 还是 [3, 6]"},{"id":"zero","content":"b 只剩 [0]"}],"key":"only_b"}],"explanation":"“a 还是 [3, 6]，b 是 [3, 6, 0]”正确。`list(a)` 造了一个内容相同的新列表，`b.append(0)` 只改这个新列表，`a` 不受影响。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py36.k2.x1","body":"```python\nx = [1]\ny = x\nz = x.copy()\nx.append(2)\ny = y + [3]\nprint(x)\nprint(y)\nprint(z)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"[1, 2]","feedback":[{"when":"[1, 2, 3]","message":"第 5 行的 y + [3] 拼出了新列表，再让 y 改指向它，x 那个列表没有被改。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"[1, 2, 3]"},{"id":"third","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"[1]"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **[1, 2]**、**[1, 2, 3]**、**[1]**。\n\n- 第 2 行让 `y` 成为 `x` 的别名；第 3 行给 `z` 造了一份副本 `[1]`。\n- 第 4 行在原列表上加 2，`x` 和 `y` 都看到 `[1, 2]`，`z` 不变。\n- 第 5 行先算右边，拼出新列表 `[1, 2, 3]`，再让 `y` 改指向它；从这以后 `y` 和 `x` 不再是同一个列表，`x` 仍是 `[1, 2]`。\n"},{"id":"py36.k2.x2","body":"`day1` 是第一天的两个读数。想得到 `day2`：在第一天的读数后面加上第二天的新读数 14；同时 `day1` 保持只有第一天的两个读数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nday1 = [12, 9]\nday2 = day1\nday2.append(14)\nprint(day1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"现在程序显示什么？","key":"[12, 9, 14]"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行应该改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"nested","content":"```python\nday2 = [day1]\n```\n"},{"id":"empty","content":"```python\nday2 = []\n```\n"},{"id":"copy","content":"```python\nday2 = day1.copy()\n```\n"}],"key":"copy"}],"explanation":"现在显示 **[12, 9, 14]**：`day2` 是 `day1` 的别名，第 3 行改的是同一个列表。第 2 行改成 `day2 = day1.copy()`，`day2` 是独立副本，加上 14 以后是 `[12, 9, 14]`，`day1` 仍是 `[12, 9]`。写成 `[day1]` 得到的是“装着 day1 的列表”，再加 14 成了 `[[12, 9], 14]`；写成空列表就丢了第一天的读数。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py37","title":"用字典描述一条记录","summary":"用字典把“列名 → 值”写成一条记录：按键取值而不是按位置，缺键时用 get 给默认值，用 in 查键是否存在。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py06","py03"],"intro":"表里的一行，比如样本 S_A 的 signal 是 8、group 是 control，可以写成 Python 的**字典**：每一项是“名字 → 值”，名字叫**键**。AI 写的代码里，配置、一条记录、按编号查值，常常都是字典。\n\n这一节的程序都当作短脚本，从上往下运行。每道题都从题面给出的代码重新开始。\n","wrapup":"读到字典时，记住三件事：方括号里写的是键，不是位置；没把握有没有这个键时，`get` 给出默认值而不会报错，默认值要按需求选；`in` 只查键，不查值。\n\n看到 `record[\"signal\"]`，可以读成“这条记录的 signal”；看到 `record.get(\"depth\", 0)`，要问一句：缺了 depth 时当成 0，符合需求吗？\n","kps":[{"id":"py37.k1","title":"键和值与位置索引的区别","key":["py06"],"links":["py06.k2"],"card":{"name":"字典","aliases":["dict","键","值"],"definition":"字典把键对应到值，`d[键]` 按键取出对应的值；它不按位置编号，同一个键只对应一个值。","conditions":["`d[0]` 找的是键 0，不是“第一项”；没有这个键就报 KeyError。","给已有的键赋值是覆盖旧值，给新键赋值是添一项；len 数的是键的个数。"],"example":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"}\nprint(record[\"group\"])\n```\n按键 group 取值，显示 control；`len(record)` 是 3，因为有三个键。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"表里的一行可以写成字典：\n\n```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"}\n```\n\n花括号里每一项写成 `键: 值`，项与项之间用逗号隔开。这里的键是 `\"sample_id\"`、`\"signal\"`、`\"group\"`，就像表的列名；值是这一行在各列的内容。\n\n取值时在方括号里写**键**：`record[\"signal\"]` 得到 8。这和列表不一样：列表用 0、1、-1 这样的[位置](repa:concept/py06.k2)取元素，字典不按位置编号。`record[0]` 的意思是“找键 0”，这条记录里没有键 0，程序就在这一行报 KeyError 停下。\n\n同一个键在字典里只有一个值：\n\n- `record[\"signal\"] = 12` 给已有的键赋值，旧值 8 被换成 12，键的个数不变；\n- `record[\"depth\"] = 30` 给新键赋值，字典多出一项；\n- `len(record)` 数的是键的个数。\n","example":{"id":"py37.k1.e0","body":"样本 S_A 的一条记录写成了字典。阅读程序。\n\n```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"}\nprint(record[\"group\"])\nprint(record[\"signal\"] + 2)\nprint(len(record))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"control"},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":10},{"id":"third","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行显示","key":3}],"explanation":"依次显示 **control**、**10**、**3**。\n\n`record[\"group\"]` 按键 group 取出值 control；`record[\"signal\"]` 取出 8，再加 2 得到 10；`len(record)` 数的是键的个数，这条记录有 sample_id、signal、group 三个键。print 显示文字时不带引号。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py37.k1.q1","body":"```python\nrecord = {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": 25, \"slope\": 8}\nprint(record[\"depth\"])\nprint(record[\"site\"])\nprint(record[\"depth\"] - record[\"slope\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":25},{"id":"second","type":"text","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"南坡"},{"id":"third","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行显示","key":17}],"explanation":"依次显示 **25**、**南坡**、**17**。每次都按方括号里的键找到对应的值；第三行取出 25 和 8 再相减。字典写下各项的先后与取值无关，取值只看键。\n"},{"id":"py37.k1.q2","body":"同事想显示这条记录的第一项，写了下面的程序，以为第 2 行会像列表那样取出第一个值。\n\n```python startLine=1\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"}\nprint(record[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"what","type":"choice","prompt":"运行第 2 行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"first_value","content":"显示 S_A","feedback":"字典不按位置取值，方括号里的 0 被当成键。"},{"id":"keyerror","content":"报 KeyError 停下：字典里没有 0 这个键"},{"id":"first_key","content":"显示 sample_id"}],"key":"keyerror"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行改成哪一行，才会显示 S_A？","options":[{"id":"one","content":"```python\nprint(record[1])\n```\n"},{"id":"value","content":"```python\nprint(record[\"S_A\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"key","content":"```python\nprint(record[\"sample_id\"])\n```\n"}],"key":"key"}],"explanation":"第 2 行**报 KeyError**。字典的方括号里写的是键，`record[0]` 是在找键 0；这条记录的键是 sample_id、signal、group，没有 0，所以报错停下。\n\n要取 S_A，写它的键：`print(record[\"sample_id\"])`。`record[1]` 同样是在找键 1；`record[\"S_A\"]` 把值当成了键，也会报 KeyError。\n"},{"id":"py37.k1.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_B\", \"signal\": 10}\nrecord[\"signal\"] = 12\nrecord[\"group\"] = \"drug\"\nprint(len(record))\nprint(record[\"signal\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"second_line","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行做了什么？","options":[{"id":"added","content":"又加了一个叫 signal 的键，字典里现在有两个 signal","feedback":"同一个键在字典里只有一个值，给已有的键赋值是覆盖。"},{"id":"replaced","content":"把键 signal 的值从 10 换成 12，键的个数不变"}],"key":"replaced"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 4 行显示","key":3},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 5 行显示","key":12}],"explanation":"第 2 行给已有的键 signal 赋值，旧值 10 被**换成 12**，字典仍是两项；第 3 行给新键 group 赋值，字典多出一项。所以 `len(record)` 显示 **3**，`record[\"signal\"]` 显示 **12**。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py37.k1.r1","body":"一个采样点的信息写成了字典：\n\n```python\nsite = {\"site\": \"北坡\", \"depth\": 30, \"slope\": 12}\n```\n\n表里每一行代码都单独接在上面这行后面运行。填写 print 显示的内容；会报错的填 ERROR。\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"接着运行"},{"id":"out","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"code":"print(site[\"depth\"])","out":"30"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"code":"print(site[0])","out":"ERROR"}},{"id":"c","cells":{"code":"print(len(site))","out":"3"}},{"id":"d","cells":{"code":"print(site[\"site\"])","out":"北坡"}},{"id":"e","cells":{"code":"print(site[-1])","out":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"| 接着运行 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `print(site[\"depth\"])` | 30 |\n| `print(site[0])` | ERROR |\n| `print(len(site))` | 3 |\n| `print(site[\"site\"])` | 北坡 |\n| `print(site[-1])` | ERROR |\n\n按键取值才行：`site[\"depth\"]` 是 30，`site[\"site\"]` 是 北坡。`site[0]` 和 `site[-1]` 是在找键 0 和键 -1，字典里没有这两个键，都报 KeyError；列表的“第一个”“最后一个”在字典里不成立。`len` 数的是三个键。\n"},{"id":"py37.k1.r2","body":"这次字典的键是样本编号，值是每个样本的读数。\n\n```python\nreading = {\"S_A\": 8, \"S_B\": 10}\nreading[\"S_A\"] = 9\nreading[\"S_C\"] = 7\nreading[\"S_A\"] = reading[\"S_A\"] + 1\nprint(reading)\nprint(len(reading))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"whole","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行 print 显示的字典（照 Python 的写法填）","key":"{'S_A': 10, 'S_B': 10, 'S_C': 7}"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":3}],"explanation":"显示 **{'S_A': 10, 'S_B': 10, 'S_C': 7}** 和 **3**。\n\nS_A 先被覆盖成 9，最后一行赋值又用当时的 9 加 1 得到 10，自始至终只有一个键 S_A；S_C 是新键，添在后面。三个键，所以长度是 3。字典显示时按各键第一次加入的先后排列。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py37.k1.x1","body":"前一行是：\n\n```python\nrecord = {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": 25}\n```\n\n哪一行会显示 25？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"position","content":"```python\nprint(record[1])\n```\n"},{"id":"last","content":"```python\nprint(record[-1])\n```\n"},{"id":"key","content":"```python\nprint(record[\"depth\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"bare","content":"```python\nprint(record[depth])\n```\n"}],"key":"key"}],"explanation":"`print(record[\"depth\"])` 显示 25：方括号里写键 `\"depth\"`。\n\n`record[1]` 和 `record[-1]` 把字典当成了列表，找的是键 1 和键 -1，都报 KeyError；`record[depth]` 少了引号，Python 把 depth 当成一个名字去找，这个名字没有赋过值，报 NameError。\n"},{"id":"py37.k1.x2","body":"按运行顺序填写每行执行后 `len(row)` 和 `row` 里 signal 的值。还没有 signal 这个键时填“没有这个键”。\n\n```python startLine=1\nrow = {\"sample_id\": \"S_D\"}\nrow[\"signal\"] = 10\nrow[\"signal\"] = 13\nrow[\"group\"] = \"control\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"size","header":"len(row)","input":"integer"},{"id":"signal","header":"signal 的值","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["没有这个键"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","size":1,"signal":"没有这个键"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","size":2,"signal":10}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","size":2,"signal":13}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","size":3,"signal":13}}]}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | len(row) | signal 的值 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 第 1 行 | 1 | 没有这个键 |\n| 第 2 行 | 2 | 10 |\n| 第 3 行 | 2 | 13 |\n| 第 4 行 | 3 | 13 |\n\n第 2 行给新键 signal 赋值，多出一项；第 3 行给已有的 signal 赋值，只是把 10 换成 13，长度不变；第 4 行又添了新键 group。\n"}]},{"id":"py37.k2","title":"索引取值与 get 默认值","key":["py03"],"links":["py03.k3"],"card":{"name":"get 默认值","aliases":["get","KeyError","默认值"],"definition":"`d.get(键, 默认值)` 有这个键时取出它的值，没有时得到默认值（不写默认值就是 None），不报错，也不往字典里加键。","conditions":["`d[键]` 遇到没有的键会报 KeyError 停下；get 不会。","默认值只在键不存在时才用；默认值要按需求选，缺失的测量写成 0 会被当成真的测到 0。"],"example":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8}\nprint(record.get(\"depth\"))\nprint(record.get(\"depth\", 0))\n```\n没有 depth 这个键：第一行显示 None，第二行显示 0；record 仍只有两个键。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"用方括号取一个不存在的键，程序会报 **KeyError**，停在这一行，后面的代码都不再运行：\n\n```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8}\nprint(record[\"depth\"])   # KeyError，程序停下\n```\n\n有的记录可能缺某一项时，用字典自带的 `get`：\n\n- `record.get(\"depth\")`：有 depth 就取出它的值；没有就得到 [None](repa:concept/py03.k3)，不报错。\n- `record.get(\"depth\", 0)`：没有 depth 时得到你给的默认值 0。\n\n两点要留意：\n\n1. 默认值只在**键不存在**时才用。键存在、值恰好是 None 时，get 照样取出 None。\n2. get 只是查，不会把键加进字典，`len(record)` 不变。\n\n默认值不是随手填的。缺了 depth 表示没测，写成 `get(\"depth\", 0)` 就把“没测”当成了“测到 0”；需求里要说清缺失时怎样处理。\n","example":{"id":"py37.k2.e0","body":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8}\nprint(record.get(\"signal\"))\nprint(record.get(\"depth\"))\nprint(record.get(\"depth\", 0))\nprint(len(record))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"8"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"None"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"0"},{"id":"line4","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第四行显示","key":"2"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **8**、**None**、**0**、**2**。\n\nsignal 这个键存在，get 取出 8；depth 不存在，不写默认值时得到 None，写了默认值 0 就得到 0。两次 get 都没有往字典里加 depth，所以长度仍是 2。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py37.k2.q1","body":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_C\", \"group\": \"drug\"}\nprint(record.get(\"group\", \"unknown\"))\nprint(record.get(\"signal\", \"unknown\"))\nprint(record.get(\"site\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"drug","feedback":[{"when":"unknown","message":"group 这个键存在，get 取出它的值；默认值只在键不存在时才用。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"unknown"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"None"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **drug**、**unknown**、**None**。group 存在，取出 drug，写了默认值也不用；signal 不存在，得到默认值 unknown；site 不存在、也没写默认值，得到 None。\n"},{"id":"py37.k2.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8}\nprint(record[\"depth\"])\nprint(\"done\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"what","type":"choice","prompt":"运行后屏幕上会出现什么？","options":[{"id":"none_done","content":"先显示 None，再显示 done","feedback":"方括号取不存在的键不会得到 None，而是报错。"},{"id":"error","content":"第 2 行报 KeyError，done 不会显示"},{"id":"done_only","content":"跳过第 2 行，只显示 done"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行改成哪一行，程序就能显示 None 和 done？","options":[{"id":"get","content":"```python\nprint(record.get(\"depth\"))\n```\n"},{"id":"get_zero","content":"```python\nprint(record.get(\"depth\", 0))\n```\n"},{"id":"brackets","content":"```python\nprint(record.get[\"depth\"])\n```\n"}],"key":"get"}],"explanation":"第 2 行按方括号取不存在的键 depth，**报 KeyError**，程序停在这里，第 3 行的 done 不会显示。\n\n改成 `print(record.get(\"depth\"))`，没有 depth 时得到 None，不报错，程序接着显示 done。写成 `get(\"depth\", 0)` 会显示 0 而不是 None；`record.get[\"depth\"]` 用了方括号，get 要用圆括号调用，这样写会报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py37.k2.q3","body":"有的样本记录里有 depth，有的没有。需求是：\n\n> 取出 depth；没有测 depth 的样本，结果是 None（表示没有值），不能当成 0，程序也不能报错停下。\n\n`record` 是其中一条记录。哪一行符合需求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"```python\ndepth = record.get(\"depth\", 0)\n```\n","feedback":"没测的样本会得到 0，像是测到了 0。"},{"id":"index","content":"```python\ndepth = record[\"depth\"]\n```\n","feedback":"遇到没有 depth 的记录会报 KeyError 停下。"},{"id":"get","content":"```python\ndepth = record.get(\"depth\")\n```\n"}],"key":"get"}],"explanation":"`depth = record.get(\"depth\")` 符合需求：有 depth 时取出它的值，没有时得到 None，不报错。\n\n`record[\"depth\"]` 遇到缺 depth 的记录会报 KeyError；`record.get(\"depth\", 0)` 不报错，却把“没测”变成了 0，后面算平均值时会把它当成一次真实的测量。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py37.k2.r1","body":"`counts` 记录每组已经收到几份样本：\n\n```python\ncounts = {\"control\": 2, \"drug\": 3}\n```\n\n表里每一行代码都单独接在上面这行后面运行。填写 print 显示的内容；会报错的填 ERROR。\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"接着运行"},{"id":"out","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["ERROR","None"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"code":"print(counts.get(\"drug\", 0))","out":"3"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"code":"print(counts.get(\"placebo\", 0))","out":"0"}},{"id":"c","cells":{"code":"print(counts.get(\"placebo\"))","out":"None"}},{"id":"d","cells":{"code":"print(counts[\"placebo\"])","out":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"| 接着运行 | 显示 |\n|---|---|\n| `print(counts.get(\"drug\", 0))` | 3 |\n| `print(counts.get(\"placebo\", 0))` | 0 |\n| `print(counts.get(\"placebo\"))` | None |\n| `print(counts[\"placebo\"])` | ERROR |\n\ndrug 这个键存在，get 取出 3，不用默认值；placebo 不存在，写了默认值得到 0，没写得到 None；方括号取不存在的键报 KeyError。这里“还没收到 placebo 组的样本”当成 0 份是合理的，因为它是计数，不是测量。\n"},{"id":"py37.k2.r2","body":"```python\ninfo = {\"site\": \"东坡\"}\ndepth = info.get(\"depth\", 35)\nprint(depth)\nprint(len(info))\nprint(info.get(\"depth\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"35"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"1","feedback":[{"when":"2","message":"get 只是查，没有把 depth 加进 info。"}]},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"None","feedback":[{"when":"35","message":"35 只是上一次 get 给出的默认值，赋给了 depth 这个名字，没有存进 info。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **35**、**1**、**None**。\n\ninfo 里没有 depth，第 2 行的 get 得到默认值 35，赋给名字 `depth`；这一步没有往 info 里加任何键，所以 info 仍只有 site 一项，再 get 一次 depth（没写默认值）得到 None。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py37.k2.x1","body":"前一行是：\n\n```python\nsample = {\"sample_id\": \"S_E\", \"signal\": 11}\n```\n\n哪一行会显示 no_group，而且不报错？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"index","content":"```python\nprint(sample[\"group\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nprint(sample.get(\"no_group\", \"group\"))\n```\n"},{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nprint(sample.get(\"group\"))\n```\n"},{"id":"default","content":"```python\nprint(sample.get(\"group\", \"no_group\"))\n```\n"}],"key":"default"}],"explanation":"`print(sample.get(\"group\", \"no_group\"))`：第一个位置是要找的键 group，第二个位置是找不到时的默认值 no_group。sample 里没有 group，所以显示 no_group。\n\n`sample[\"group\"]` 报 KeyError；`sample.get(\"group\")` 没写默认值，显示 None；把两个位置写反的那一行是在找键 no_group，找不到时显示默认值 group。\n"},{"id":"py37.k2.x2","body":"`latest` 记录每个样本最近一次的读数；S_B 这次没读到，记成了 None。\n\n```python\nlatest = {\"S_A\": 8, \"S_B\": None}\nprint(latest.get(\"S_B\", 0))\nprint(latest.get(\"S_C\", 0))\nprint(len(latest))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"None","feedback":[{"when":"0","message":"S_B 这个键存在，只是值为 None；默认值只在键不存在时才用。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"0"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"2"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **None**、**0**、**2**。\n\nS_B 这个键存在，值是 None，get 照样取出 None，默认值 0 用不上；S_C 这个键不存在，才得到默认值 0。get 不添键，latest 仍是两项。\n"}]},{"id":"py37.k3","title":"in 检查键是否存在","key":["py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"in 查键","aliases":["in","键是否存在"],"definition":"`键 in d` 得到 True 或 False，表示字典 d 里有没有这个键；它只看键，不看值。","conditions":["值里有 8 时，`8 in d` 仍可能是 False；要查值，写 `8 in d.values()`。","键要完全一样才算有：大小写、拼写不同就是 False。"],"example":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_B\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"}\nprint(\"signal\" in record)\nprint(10 in record)\n```\n第一行显示 True；10 只是 signal 的值，不是键，第二行显示 False。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"想知道一条记录里有没有某一项，写 `键 in 字典`，结果是 True 或 False：\n\n```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_B\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"}\nprint(\"signal\" in record)   # True\nprint(\"depth\" in record)    # False\n```\n\n`in` 对字典**只查键**。10 和 \"drug\" 都是这条记录里的值，但 `10 in record`、`\"drug\" in record` 都是 False，因为没有叫 10 或 drug 的键。真要查值，写 `10 in record.values()`。\n\n对比一下：对列表，`in` 查的是元素，`8 in [8, 10]` 是 True；对字典，`in` 查的是键。\n\n`in` 只是查，不取值，也不会报错。键要一字不差：`\"Signal\" in record` 是 False。\n","example":{"id":"py37.k3.e0","body":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_B\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"}\n```\n\n表里每个表达式都在这行之后求值。填写结果是 True 还是 False。\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"结果","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"expr":"\"signal\" in record","value":true}},{"id":"b","cells":{"expr":"\"depth\" in record","value":false}},{"id":"c","cells":{"expr":"10 in record","value":false}},{"id":"d","cells":{"expr":"\"drug\" in record","value":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **True、False、False、False**。\n\nsignal 是键，所以 True；depth 不是键，False。10 和 drug 虽然都出现在这条记录里，但它们是值，不是键，`in` 对字典只查键，所以也是 False。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py37.k3.q1","body":"`done` 记录每个样本已经测了几次：\n\n```python\ndone = {\"S_A\": 1, \"S_B\": 0}\n```\n\n表里每个表达式都在这行之后求值。填写结果是 True 还是 False。\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"结果","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"expr":"\"S_B\" in done","value":true}},{"id":"b","cells":{"expr":"\"S_C\" in done","value":false}},{"id":"c","cells":{"expr":"0 in done","value":false}},{"id":"d","cells":{"expr":"\"s_a\" in done","value":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次为 **True、False、False、False**。\n\nS_B 是键，它的值是 0 也不影响，`in` 只问有没有这个键；S_C 不是键；0 是值，不是键；s_a 与键 S_A 大小写不同，不算同一个键。\n"},{"id":"py37.k3.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_A\", \"signal\": 8}\nprint(8 in record)\nprint(8 in record.values())\n```\n\n有人看到第 2 行显示 False，就说：“这条记录里没有 8。”\n","slots":[{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 2 行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 3 行显示","key":"True"},{"id":"claim","type":"choice","prompt":"这个说法对吗？","options":[{"id":"right","content":"对，False 说明记录里没有 8"},{"id":"keys_only","content":"不对，`in` 对字典只查键；8 是 signal 的值，不是键"}],"key":"keys_only"}],"explanation":"第 2 行显示 **False**，第 3 行显示 **True**。\n\n`8 in record` 问的是“有没有叫 8 的键”，没有，所以 False；8 其实是 signal 的值，`8 in record.values()` 查的是值，得到 True。所以“记录里没有 8”这个说法不对。\n"},{"id":"py37.k3.q3","body":"```python\nseen = {}\nprint(\"S_A\" in seen)\nseen[\"S_A\"] = 1\nprint(\"S_A\" in seen)\nprint(1 in seen)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"False"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"True"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"False"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **False**、**True**、**False**。\n\n`{}` 是一个空字典，一开始没有任何键；给 S_A 赋值以后，S_A 成了键；1 是 S_A 的值，不是键，所以最后一行仍是 False。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py37.k3.r1","body":"要显示 `record` 里有没有 depth 这一项：有就显示 True，没有就显示 False，不管 depth 的值是多少。哪一行符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"values","content":"```python\nprint(\"depth\" in record.values())\n```\n"},{"id":"key","content":"```python\nprint(\"depth\" in record)\n```\n"},{"id":"bare","content":"```python\nprint(depth in record)\n```\n"},{"id":"lookup","content":"```python\nprint(record[\"depth\"] in record)\n```\n"}],"key":"key"}],"explanation":"`print(\"depth\" in record)`：`in` 对字典查键，有 depth 这个键就是 True。\n\n`\"depth\" in record.values()` 查的是值，问的是“有没有哪一项的值是文字 depth”；`depth in record` 少了引号，depth 被当成没赋过值的名字，报 NameError；`record[\"depth\"] in record` 先取出 depth 的值再拿它去查键，没有 depth 时还会报 KeyError。\n"},{"id":"py37.k3.r2","body":"`ids` 是一个列表，`signals` 是一个字典：\n\n```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\"]\nsignals = {\"S_A\": 8, \"S_B\": 10}\nprint(8 in ids)\nprint(\"S_A\" in ids)\nprint(8 in signals)\nprint(\"S_B\" in signals)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"第几行输出"},{"id":"value","header":"显示","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","value":false}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","value":true}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","value":false}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","value":true}}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **False、True、False、True**。\n\n对列表，`in` 查元素：ids 的元素是 S_A、S_B，没有 8。对字典，`in` 查键：signals 的键是 S_A、S_B，8 只是值，所以 `8 in signals` 是 False，`\"S_B\" in signals` 是 True。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py37.k3.x1","body":"一份导出设置写成了字典：\n\n```python\nsettings = {\"sep\": \",\", \"encoding\": \"utf-8\", \"index\": False}\n```\n\n下面哪些表达式在这行之后求值的结果是 True？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"exprs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"false_value","content":"```python\nFalse in settings\n```\n"},{"id":"index_key","content":"```python\n\"index\" in settings\n```\n"},{"id":"utf8_value","content":"```python\n\"utf-8\" in settings\n```\n"},{"id":"sep_key","content":"```python\n\"sep\" in settings\n```\n"},{"id":"utf8_values","content":"```python\n\"utf-8\" in settings.values()\n```\n"}],"key":["index_key","sep_key","utf8_values"]}],"explanation":"结果为 True 的是 `\"index\" in settings`、`\"sep\" in settings` 和 `\"utf-8\" in settings.values()`。\n\nindex 和 sep 是键；index 的值是 False 也不影响“有没有这个键”。False 和 utf-8 都是值，不是键，所以 `False in settings`、`\"utf-8\" in settings` 是 False；要查值得写 `.values()`，`\"utf-8\" in settings.values()` 才是 True。\n\n每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n"},{"id":"py37.k3.x2","body":"```python\nrecord = {\"sample_id\": \"S_C\", \"depth\": None}\nprint(\"depth\" in record)\nprint(record.get(\"depth\", 0))\nprint(\"signal\" in record)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示","key":"True","feedback":[{"when":"False","message":"depth 这个键存在，它的值是 None 不影响 in 的结果。"}]},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示","key":"None"},{"id":"line3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行显示","key":"False"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **True**、**None**、**False**。\n\ndepth 是键，值为 None，`in` 只问键在不在，所以是 True；键存在，get 就取出它的值 None，默认值 0 用不上；记录里没有 signal 这个键，False。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py38","title":"同时读到编号和值","summary":"读懂元组和解包的数量对应，用 enumerate 同时拿到位置和元素，用 zip 把两个列表按位置配对，并留意长度不同时的截断。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py35","py06"],"intro":"一个样本常常同时带着几样信息：编号、测量值、组别。前面学过用 `for` 从列表里逐个取出元素，这一节看三件相关的事：\n\n- 怎样把几个值装在一起，再一次拆给几个名字（元组和解包）；\n- 循环时怎样同时知道“这是第几个”和“它的值”（`enumerate`）；\n- 编号和测量值分放在两个列表里时，怎样按位置把它们配成对（`zip`），以及两个列表不一样长时会发生什么。\n\n下面的程序都当作短脚本，从第一行往下运行。\n","wrapup":"读到 `a, b = ...`，先数左右两边的个数是否对得上；读到 `enumerate`，先看编号从 0 还是从 1 开始；读到 `zip`，先确认两个列表的顺序一一对应、长度相同。\n\n请 AI 写这类代码时，可以直接要求：“编号和测量值按位置一一对应，长度不同时报错，不要悄悄丢掉多出来的记录。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py38.k1","title":"元组及解包的数量对应","key":["py06","py01"],"links":["py01.k2"],"card":{"name":"元组解包","aliases":["元组","tuple","解包"],"definition":"用逗号把几个值写在一起就是元组；`a, b = 元组` 按位置把元素依次交给左边的名字，名字的个数必须和元素的个数相同。","conditions":["左边的名字比元素多或少，都会报 ValueError，不会自动补上空值，也不会丢掉多余的元素。","`a, b = b, a` 先算出右边的整个元组，再依次赋值，所以一行就能交换两个值。"],"example":"```python\nrecord = (\"S_B\", 10)\nsid, value = record\n```\n第 2 行让 sid 指向 \"S_B\"、value 指向 10，等同于 `sid = record[0]` 和 `value = record[1]` 两行。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"一个样本的编号和测量值可以写在一起：\n\n```python\nrecord = (\"S_A\", 8)\n```\n\n圆括号里用逗号隔开的几个值叫**元组**（tuple）。它和列表一样按位置取值，`record[0]` 是 `\"S_A\"`，`record[1]` 是 8，`len(record)` 是 2。区别是元组建好以后不能改动里面的元素，这一节只读它，不改它。\n\n想把元组里的值分别交给几个名字，可以一行写完，这叫**解包**：\n\n```python\nsid, value = record\n```\n\n左边第一个名字拿第 0 个元素，第二个名字拿第 1 个元素，效果和 `sid = record[0]`、`value = record[1]` 两行相同。\n\n解包要求**个数对得上**：元组有 3 个元素，左边就要写 3 个名字。写少了或写多了，Python 都会报 `ValueError`，不会自己补一个空值，也不会悄悄丢掉多出来的元素。只写一个名字 `whole = record` 不算解包，`whole` 拿到的是整个元组。\n\n还记得用 `a = b`、`b = a` 交换两个值会失败吗？（见[重新赋值](repa:concept/py01.k2)）写成 `a, b = b, a` 就能交换：Python 先算出右边的元组（b 现在的值, a 现在的值），再依次交给 `a` 和 `b`，赋值时用的都是交换前的值。\n","example":{"id":"py38.k1.e0","body":"阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nrecord = (\"S_B\", 10)\nsid, value = record\nprint(sid)\nprint(value + 1)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"S_B"},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示哪个整数？","key":11},{"id":"same","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行的效果和哪两行赋值相同？","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\nsid = record[1]\nvalue = record[0]\n```\n"},{"id":"whole","content":"```python\nsid = record\nvalue = record\n```\n"},{"id":"by_position","content":"```python\nsid = record[0]\nvalue = record[1]\n```\n"}],"key":"by_position"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **S_B**，第二行显示 **11**。第 2 行按位置解包：`sid` 拿第 0 个元素 `\"S_B\"`，`value` 拿第 1 个元素 10，所以它和 `sid = record[0]`、`value = record[1]` 两行效果相同。第 4 行先算 10 + 1，再显示 11。\n\n把位置反过来，`sid` 会拿到 10；让两个名字都等于 `record`，它们拿到的都是整个元组，不是其中一个值。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py38.k1.q1","body":"一行记录有三样信息：编号、测量值和组别。\n\n```python startLine=1\nrow = (\"S_C\", 13, \"drug\")\nsid, signal, group = row\nprint(group)\nprint(signal - 3)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"drug","feedback":[{"when":"S_C","message":"第 3 行显示的是 group。三个名字按位置依次拿到 \"S_C\"、13、\"drug\"，group 是第三个。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示哪个整数？","key":10,"feedback":[{"when":13,"message":"第 4 行显示的是 signal - 3，不是 signal 本身。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **drug**，第二行显示 **10**。三个名字按位置拿值：`sid` 是 `\"S_C\"`，`signal` 是 13，`group` 是 `\"drug\"`；第 4 行算 13 - 3 得到 10。\n"},{"id":"py38.k1.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\nrow = (\"S_D\", 10, \"control\")\nsid, signal = row\nprint(sid)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"drops_extra","content":"显示 S_D，多出来的 \"control\" 被丢掉","feedback":"解包不会悄悄丢掉多出来的元素，个数对不上就报错。"},{"id":"shows_pair","content":"显示 ('S_D', 10)"},{"id":"value_error","content":"第 2 行报 ValueError，什么也不显示"},{"id":"name_error","content":"第 3 行报 NameError，因为 sid 没有值"}],"key":"value_error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行改成哪一行，程序就能显示 S_D，并让 signal 指向 10？","options":[{"id":"first_only","content":"```python\nsid, signal = row[0]\n```\n"},{"id":"three_names","content":"```python\nsid, signal, group = row\n```\n"},{"id":"skip_middle","content":"```python\nsid, signal = row[0], row[2]\n```\n"}],"key":"three_names"}],"explanation":"元组有 3 个元素，左边只写了 2 个名字，个数对不上，**第 2 行报 ValueError**，程序在这里停下，后面的 `print` 不会运行。\n\n改成 `sid, signal, group = row`，三个名字对三个元素就行了。`row[0]` 是一段文字 `\"S_D\"`，拆给两个名字也对不上，同样报错；`row[0], row[2]` 能运行，但 `signal` 拿到的是 `\"control\"`，不是 10。\n"},{"id":"py38.k1.q3","body":"按运行顺序填写前三行各自执行后 `low` 和 `high` 的值，再写出第 4 行显示的内容。还没有赋值的名字填“尚未定义”。\n\n```python startLine=1\nlow = 13\nhigh = 8\nlow, high = high, low\nprint(low, high)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"执行到"},{"id":"low","header":"low","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"high","header":"high","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","low":13,"high":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","low":13,"high":8}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","low":8,"high":13}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 4 行显示什么？（两个数之间隔一个空格）","key":"8 13"}],"explanation":"| 执行到 | low | high |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 第 1 行 | 13 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | 13 | 8 |\n| 第 3 行 | 8 | 13 |\n\n第 3 行先算出右边的元组 (8, 13)，用的是交换前的值，再依次交给 `low` 和 `high`，所以两个值互换了，第 4 行显示 **8 13**。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py38.k1.r1","body":"开始时 `first` 是 3，`second` 是 5。下面哪几段程序运行后，`first` 变成 5、`second` 变成 3？选出所有符合的。\n","slots":[{"id":"ways","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"one_line","content":"```python\nfirst, second = second, first\n```\n"},{"id":"two_lines","content":"```python\nfirst = second\nsecond = first\n```\n"},{"id":"same_order","content":"```python\nfirst, second = first, second\n```\n"},{"id":"helper","content":"```python\ntemp = first\nfirst = second\nsecond = temp\n```\n"}],"key":["one_line","helper"]}],"explanation":"一行写成 `first, second = second, first` 的能交换：右边先算出 (5, 3)，再依次交给两个名字。借助 `temp` 先存下旧的 `first`，再分三行赋值，也能交换。\n\n分两行写 `first = second`、`second = first` 不行：第一行之后 `first` 已经是 5，第二行读到的也是 5，两个名字都成了 5。`first, second = first, second` 右边的顺序没变，两个值原样不动。\n"},{"id":"py38.k1.r2","body":"表里每一行都单独从上面这一行准备代码开始运行，互不影响。填写每一行运行后的结果。\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"代码"},{"id":"result","header":"结果","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ok","label":"正常运行"},{"id":"error","label":"报 ValueError"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"three","cells":{"code":"a, b, c = reading","result":"ok"}},{"id":"two","cells":{"code":"a, b = reading","result":"error"}},{"id":"one","cells":{"code":"a = reading","result":"ok"}},{"id":"four","cells":{"code":"a, b, c, d = reading","result":"error"}}]},{"id":"whole","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第三行 `a = reading` 运行后，`print(a)` 会显示什么？","key":"('S_A', 8, 'control')","feedback":[{"when":"'S_A'","message":"左边只有一个名字时不是解包，a 拿到的是整个元组。"}]}],"explanation":"元组有 3 个元素：写 3 个名字的正常运行；写 2 个或 4 个名字的个数对不上，报 **ValueError**。只写一个名字 `a = reading` 不是解包，`a` 拿到整个元组，显示 **('S_A', 8, 'control')**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"reading = (\"S_A\", 8, \"control\")\n","display":"准备代码：\n\n```python\nreading = (\"S_A\", 8, \"control\")\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py38.k1.x1","body":"一次野外采样记下了日期、采样点和深度（厘米）。\n\n```python startLine=1\nvisit = (\"2026-03-05\", \"南坡\", 25)\nday, site, depth = visit\ndepth = depth + 5\nprint(site)\nprint(depth)\nprint(visit[2])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"南坡"},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示哪个整数？","key":30},{"id":"third","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第三行显示哪个整数？","key":25,"feedback":[{"when":30,"message":"第 3 行只让名字 depth 指向新的值 30；元组 visit 里的第 2 个元素还是 25。"}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **南坡**、**30**、**25**。第 2 行把三个元素分别交给 `day`、`site`、`depth`；第 3 行让 `depth` 改指向 25 + 5 算出的 30。元组 `visit` 没有被改动，`visit[2]` 仍是 25。\n"},{"id":"py38.k1.x2","body":"```python startLine=1\na = 1\nb = 2\nc = 3\na, b, c = c, a, b\n```\n\n把第 4 行换成三行 `a = c`、`b = a`、`c = b`，结果又是什么？分别填写两种写法运行完以后三个名字的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"finals","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"way","header":"第 4 行的写法"},{"id":"a","header":"a","input":"integer"},{"id":"b","header":"b","input":"integer"},{"id":"c","header":"c","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"one_line","cells":{"way":"一行：a, b, c = c, a, b","a":3,"b":1,"c":2}},{"id":"three_lines","cells":{"way":"拆成三行","a":3,"b":3,"c":3}}]}],"explanation":"一行的写法先算出右边的元组：此刻 c、a、b 是 3、1、2，再依次交给 a、b、c，所以 **a = 3，b = 1，c = 2**。\n\n拆成三行时，每一行都读到上一行改过的值：`a = c` 之后 a 是 3，`b = a` 读到的也是 3，`c = b` 读到的还是 3，三个名字**都是 3**。\n"}]},{"id":"py38.k2","title":"enumerate 给元素配位置","key":["py35","py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"enumerate","aliases":["编号","序号"],"definition":"`for i, v in enumerate(列表):` 每轮同时拿到位置 i 和元素 v；i 默认从 0 开始，写 `start=1` 才从 1 开始。","conditions":["start 只改变编号从几开始，不会跳过元素，也不改变取元素的顺序。","报告里的“第 1 个”通常从 1 数；把默认从 0 起的编号直接写进报告，会差 1。"],"example":"```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n依次显示 0 S_A、1 S_B、2 S_C；写成 `enumerate(ids, start=1)` 才显示 1 S_A、2 S_B、3 S_C。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"`for sid in ids:` 每轮只拿到一个元素。想同时知道它是第几个，用 `enumerate`：\n\n```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n\n`print` 里用逗号隔开几个值时，会依次显示它们，中间隔一个空格。这段程序显示：\n\n| 第几轮 | i | sid | 显示 |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | 0 | S_A | `0 S_A` |\n| 2 | 1 | S_B | `1 S_B` |\n| 3 | 2 | S_C | `2 S_C` |\n\n`enumerate` 每轮给出一个（位置, 元素）元组，`i, sid` 就是上一个知识点的解包。位置默认**从 0 开始**，和列表的索引一致，所以 `ids[i]` 就是这一轮的 `sid`。\n\n要写给人看的“第 1 个、第 2 个”，就写 `enumerate(ids, start=1)`，编号从 1 开始。`start` 只改编号，不会跳过 S_A：仍然是三轮，依次显示 `1 S_A`、`2 S_B`、`3 S_C`。\n\n常见的差 1 错误有两种：把从 0 起的编号当成“第几个”写进报告；或者编号改成从 1 起之后，又拿它当索引去取 `ids[i]`，取到的是下一个元素。\n","example":{"id":"py38.k2.e0","body":"```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","prompt":"按显示的先后，填写每一行里的两个值。","columns":[{"id":"row","header":"显示的第几行"},{"id":"i","header":"i","input":"integer"},{"id":"sid","header":"sid","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"o1","cells":{"row":"第 1 行","i":0,"sid":"S_A"}},{"id":"o2","cells":{"row":"第 2 行","i":1,"sid":"S_B"}},{"id":"o3","cells":{"row":"第 3 行","i":2,"sid":"S_C"}}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"想让它依次显示 1 S_A、2 S_B、3 S_C，循环的第一行应改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"slice","content":"```python\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids[1:]):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n"},{"id":"start_one","content":"```python\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids, start=1):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n"},{"id":"start_zero","content":"```python\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids, start=0):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n"}],"key":"start_one"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **0 S_A、1 S_B、2 S_C**：编号默认从 0 开始，和索引一致。\n\n加上 `start=1` 后显示 1 S_A、2 S_B、3 S_C，三个样本都还在。`ids[1:]` 先去掉了 S_A，再从 0 编号，显示的是 0 S_B、1 S_C；`start=0` 就是默认写法，结果不变。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py38.k2.q1","body":"```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35]\nfor n, d in enumerate(depths, start=1):\n    print(n, d)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","prompt":"按显示的先后，填写每一行里的两个数。","columns":[{"id":"row","header":"显示的第几行"},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":"integer"},{"id":"d","header":"d","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"o1","cells":{"row":"第 1 行","n":1,"d":30}},{"id":"o2","cells":{"row":"第 2 行","n":2,"d":25}},{"id":"o3","cells":{"row":"第 3 行","n":3,"d":35}}]},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共显示几行？","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":2,"message":"start=1 只让编号从 1 开始，不会跳过第一个元素 30。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **1 30、2 25、3 35**，一共 **3** 行。`start=1` 让编号从 1 开始，元素仍从第一个 30 取起，一个也不少。\n"},{"id":"py38.k2.q2","body":"有人想逐个显示 `signals` 里的值，写了下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsignals = [8, 10, 13, 10]\nfor i, v in enumerate(signals, start=1):\n    print(signals[i])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示哪个整数？","key":10,"feedback":[{"when":8,"message":"第一轮 i 是 1（start=1），signals[1] 取的是位置 1 上的 10，不是 8。"}]},{"id":"last_round","type":"choice","prompt":"第 4 轮会怎样？","options":[{"id":"wraps","content":"显示 8，又从头取起"},{"id":"index_error","content":"报错：位置 4 超出了列表的范围（IndexError）"},{"id":"shows_ten","content":"显示 10，正常结束"}],"key":"index_error"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **10**。编号从 1 开始，第一轮 `i` 是 1，`signals[1]` 取到的是位置 1 上的 10。之后依次显示 13、10；第 4 轮 `i` 是 4，可列表只有位置 0 到 3，**报 IndexError**。\n\n编号从 1 开始只适合写给人看，不能再拿来当索引。这里直接 `print(v)` 就对了：`v` 本来就是这一轮的元素。\n"},{"id":"py38.k2.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 40]\nfor i, d in enumerate(depths):\n    print(d)\nprint(i)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"last","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后一行（第 4 行的 print）显示哪个整数？","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":4,"message":"编号从 0 开始，四个元素的编号是 0、1、2、3，最后一轮 i 是 3。"},{"when":40,"message":"第 4 行显示的是 i，不是 d。"}]},{"id":"relation","type":"choice","prompt":"循环结束时，`i` 和 `len(depths)` 是什么关系？","options":[{"id":"equal","content":"i 等于 len(depths)"},{"id":"minus_one","content":"i 等于 len(depths) - 1"},{"id":"unrelated","content":"两者没有固定关系"}],"key":"minus_one"}],"explanation":"最后显示 **3**。循环结束后，`i` 停在最后一轮的值上；编号从 0 开始，四个元素的编号是 0、1、2、3，所以 `i` 是 3，正好比 `len(depths)` 少 1。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py38.k2.r1","body":"把需要的代码块排成一段程序，让它依次显示：\n\n```text\n1 北坡\n2 南坡\n3 东坡\n```\n\n有的块用不上；排好后还要给块设好缩进。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":1,"items":[{"id":"loop_zero","code":"for n, site in enumerate(sites):"},{"id":"show","code":"print(n, site)"},{"id":"sites","code":"sites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\"]"},{"id":"show_swapped","code":"print(site, n)"},{"id":"loop_one","code":"for n, site in enumerate(sites, start=1):"}],"key":["sites","loop_one","show"],"indents":{"sites":0,"loop_zero":0,"loop_one":0,"show":1,"show_swapped":1},"tests":[{"name":"依次显示编号和采样点","stdout":"1 北坡\n2 南坡\n3 东坡\n"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\"]\nfor n, site in enumerate(sites, start=1):\n    print(n, site)\n```\n\n先建列表，再写循环；编号要从 1 开始，所以用带 `start=1` 的那一行；`print(n, site)` 缩进一层，编号在前、采样点在后。不带 `start` 的循环会显示 0 北坡。\n"},{"id":"py38.k2.r2","body":"```python\ncodes = [\"A1\", \"B2\", \"C3\", \"D4\"]\nfor i, c in enumerate(codes, start=10):\n    print(i, c)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共显示几行？","key":4},{"id":"last_number","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后一行显示的数是多少？","key":13,"feedback":[{"when":3,"message":"start=10 让编号从 10 开始，依次是 10、11、12、13。"},{"when":14,"message":"第一个编号就是 10，四个元素的编号是 10 到 13。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **4** 行：10 A1、11 B2、12 C3、13 D4，最后一行的数是 **13**。`start` 写几，编号就从几开始；元素一个不少，仍是四轮。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py38.k2.x1","body":"```python\nsites = [\"东坡\", \"西坡\", \"北坡\"]\n```\n\n接着运行下面哪一段，显示的**第一行**是 `1 西坡`？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"plain","content":"```python\nfor i, s in enumerate(sites):\n    print(i, s)\n```\n"},{"id":"start_one","content":"```python\nfor i, s in enumerate(sites, start=1):\n    print(i, s)\n```\n"},{"id":"plus_one","content":"```python\nfor i, s in enumerate(sites):\n    print(i + 1, s)\n```\n"},{"id":"slice_start_one","content":"```python\nfor i, s in enumerate(sites[1:], start=1):\n    print(i, s)\n```\n"}],"key":"slice_start_one"}],"explanation":"`sites[1:]` 先去掉东坡，从西坡开始取；`start=1` 让编号从 1 开始，所以第一行是 **1 西坡**。\n\n另外三段的第一行分别是 0 东坡、1 东坡、1 东坡：编号从几开始，和从哪个元素开始取，是两件事。\n"},{"id":"py38.k2.x2","body":"```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\", \"S_E\"]\nfor i, sid in enumerate(ids):\n    print(i, sid)\n```\n\n同事看着这段程序的输出说：“编号是 3 的那一行，就是第 3 个样本。”\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","prompt":"输出里编号为 3 的那一行，显示的样本编号是什么？","key":"S_D"},{"id":"third","type":"text","prompt":"按日常说法从 1 数起，第 3 个样本实际是哪个？","key":"S_C"}],"explanation":"编号默认从 0 开始，编号 3 的那一行显示 **S_D**，它是第 4 个样本；从 1 数起的第 3 个样本是 **S_C**。同事把从 0 起的编号当成了“第几个”，差了 1。要给人看的报告，写 `enumerate(ids, start=1)`。\n"}]},{"id":"py38.k3","title":"zip 配对并留意长度不同时的截断","key":["py35","py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"zip 配对","aliases":["zip","配对"],"definition":"`zip(甲, 乙)` 按位置把两个列表的元素配成一对对元组：第 0 个配第 0 个，第 1 个配第 1 个，依此类推。","conditions":["两个列表长度不同时，配到短的那个用完就停，多出的元素被悄悄丢掉，不报错。","zip 只看位置，不看内容；两份列表的顺序对不上，配出来的就是错的。加 `strict=True` 时长度不同会报 ValueError。"],"example":"```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\npairs = list(zip(ids, signals))\n```\npairs 是 [('S_A', 8), ('S_B', 10), ('S_C', 13)]，S_D 没有配上，被丢掉了，程序也没有报错。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"样本编号和测量值常常分放在两个列表里，位置一一对应。`zip` 把它们按位置配成对：\n\n```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\nfor sid, v in zip(ids, signals):\n    print(sid, v)\n```\n\n显示 `S_A 8`、`S_B 10`、`S_C 13`。每一轮 `zip` 给出一个元组（ids 的第 i 个, signals 的第 i 个），`sid, v` 再把它解包。想一次看到全部配对，可以写 `list(zip(ids, signals))`，得到 `[('S_A', 8), ('S_B', 10), ('S_C', 13)]`。\n\n读 `zip` 的代码时要留意两件事：\n\n1. **只按位置配，不看内容。** 如果 `signals` 是按测量先后记的，顺序和 `ids` 不一样，`zip` 照样一对一配上，配出来的就是错的。\n2. **长度不同时悄悄截断。** 两个列表一长一短时，配到短的那个用完就停，长的那个多出来的元素直接丢掉，程序不报错。4 个编号配 3 个值，只得到 3 对，第 4 个样本从结果里消失了。\n\n两份数据本该一样长时，可以写 `zip(ids, signals, strict=True)`：长度不同就报 `ValueError`，不让记录悄悄丢失。写在 `for` 里时，前面能配上的几对会先照常处理，走到短的一边用完时才报错。\n","example":{"id":"py38.k3.e0","body":"```python startLine=1\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\npairs = list(zip(ids, signals))\nprint(pairs)\nprint(len(pairs))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"pairs","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"[('S_A', 8), ('S_B', 10), ('S_C', 13)]"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示哪个整数？","key":3},{"id":"fate","type":"choice","prompt":"S_D 怎样了？","options":[{"id":"with_none","content":"和 None 配成了一对"},{"id":"error","content":"第 3 行因为长度不同报错"},{"id":"dropped","content":"没有配上，被悄悄丢掉，程序不报错"}],"key":"dropped"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **[('S_A', 8), ('S_B', 10), ('S_C', 13)]**，第二行显示 **3**。`signals` 只有 3 个值，配到第 3 对就停了；S_D 没有出现在结果里，也**没有报错**。`zip` 不会用 None 补齐短的一边。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py38.k3.q1","body":"```python\nsites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\"]\ndepths = [30, 25, 35]\nfor site, d in zip(sites, depths):\n    print(site, d)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","prompt":"按显示的先后，填写每一行里的采样点和深度。","columns":[{"id":"row","header":"显示的第几行"},{"id":"site","header":"site","input":"text"},{"id":"d","header":"d","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"o1","cells":{"row":"第 1 行","site":"北坡","d":30}},{"id":"o2","cells":{"row":"第 2 行","site":"南坡","d":25}},{"id":"o3","cells":{"row":"第 3 行","site":"东坡","d":35}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **北坡 30、南坡 25、东坡 35**。`zip` 每轮取两个列表同一位置上的元素配成一对，`site, d` 再把它们分开。\n"},{"id":"py38.k3.q2","body":"```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nsignals = [8, 10, 13, 10, 9]\nfor sid, v in zip(ids, signals):\n    print(sid, v)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"一共显示几行？","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"ids 只有 3 个编号，配到第 3 对就停了，signals 多出的 10 和 9 被丢掉。"}]},{"id":"last","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"最后一行显示什么？（两个值之间隔一个空格）","key":"S_C 13"}],"explanation":"显示 **3** 行，最后一行是 **S_C 13**。这次长的是 `signals`：`ids` 用完时 `zip` 就停了，`signals` 末尾的 10 和 9 没有出现在输出里，程序也没有报错。哪一边短，就按哪一边停。\n"},{"id":"py38.k3.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\npairs = list(zip(ids, signals, strict=True))\nprint(len(pairs))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"shows_three","content":"显示 3"},{"id":"value_error","content":"第 3 行报 ValueError"},{"id":"shows_four","content":"显示 4"},{"id":"warns","content":"显示 3，并提示少了一个值"}],"key":"value_error"},{"id":"plain","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果把第 3 行的 `, strict=True` 删掉，会显示哪个整数？","key":3}],"explanation":"加了 `strict=True`，长度不同时 `zip` 不再悄悄截断，而是**报 ValueError**，第 4 行不会运行。删掉 `strict=True` 就回到默认做法：配到第 3 对停下，显示 **3**，S_D 被丢掉。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py38.k3.r1","body":"`ids` 按编号排好了，`signals` 却是按测量先后记下的：实际先测了 S_C，得到 13；再测 S_A，得到 8；最后测 S_B，得到 10。\n\n```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\"]\nsignals = [13, 8, 10]\npairs = list(zip(ids, signals))\nprint(pairs[0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"('S_A', 13)"},{"id":"actual","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"S_A 实际测得的值是多少？","key":8}],"explanation":"程序显示 **('S_A', 13)**，可 S_A 实际测得的是 **8**。`zip` 只按位置配对，不看编号：位置 0 的 S_A 配上了位置 0 的 13，那其实是 S_C 的值。两份列表的顺序对不上时，要先按同一种顺序排好，或者把编号和值一起记在同一条记录里，`zip` 本身查不出这种错。\n"},{"id":"py38.k3.r2","body":"```python\ngroups = [\"control\", \"drug\"]\nsites = [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"东坡\"]\nprint(list(zip(groups, sites)))\nprint(len(list(zip(sites, groups))))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"[('control', '北坡'), ('drug', '南坡')]"},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示哪个整数？","key":2,"feedback":[{"when":3,"message":"换了顺序，短的仍是 groups；配到它用完就停，只有 2 对。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **[('control', '北坡'), ('drug', '南坡')]**：`groups` 只有 2 个，东坡没有配上。第二行显示 **2**：把两个列表的顺序换过来，每对里的先后变了，但能配上的对数仍由短的那个决定。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py38.k3.x1","body":"```python\nids = [\"S_A\", \"S_B\", \"S_C\", \"S_D\"]\nsignals = [8, 10, 13, 10]\ngroups = [\"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\"]\n```\n\n接着分别运行下面的循环。\n","slots":[{"id":"four_lines","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一段会正常运行完，并显示 4 行？","options":[{"id":"ids_groups","content":"```python\nfor a, b in zip(ids, groups):\n    print(a, b)\n```\n"},{"id":"groups_ids","content":"```python\nfor a, b in zip(groups, ids):\n    print(a, b)\n```\n"},{"id":"ids_signals","content":"```python\nfor a, b in zip(ids, signals):\n    print(a, b)\n```\n"},{"id":"strict","content":"```python\nfor a, b in zip(ids, groups, strict=True):\n    print(a, b)\n```\n"}],"key":"ids_signals"},{"id":"strict_lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"加了 `strict=True` 的那一段，报错之前显示了几行？","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":0,"message":"写在 for 里时，能配上的几对会先照常处理，走到 groups 用完时才报错。"}]}],"explanation":"只有 `zip(ids, signals)` 两边都是 4 个，正常显示 **4** 行。`groups` 只有 3 个，和它配对时不管写在前面还是后面，都只有 3 对。\n\n加了 `strict=True` 的那一段先显示 S_A control、S_B drug、S_C drug 这 **3** 行，轮到第 4 对时发现 `groups` 已经用完，报 ValueError。\n"},{"id":"py38.k3.x2","body":"`ids` 是样本编号，`signals` 是对应的测量值，两份列表本该一样长。你希望程序在两份长度不同时停下来报错，而不是悄悄少处理几个样本。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"应该用哪一行？","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\npairs = list(zip(signals, ids))\n```\n"},{"id":"strict","content":"```python\npairs = list(zip(ids, signals, strict=True))\n```\n"},{"id":"plain","content":"```python\npairs = list(zip(ids, signals))\n```\n"}],"key":"strict"},{"id":"lost","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果 `ids` 有 5 个、`signals` 有 4 个，用不加 strict 的那一行，`pairs` 里有几对？","key":4}],"explanation":"用 `zip(ids, signals, strict=True)`：长度相同时照常配对，长度不同时报 ValueError。另外两行在长度不同时都悄悄截断，只是每对里的先后不同。\n\n不加 strict 时，5 个编号配 4 个值只得到 **4** 对，第 5 个样本不见了，也没有任何提示。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py39","title":"把一行推导式展开来看","summary":"读懂列表推导式里的取元素、条件和结果三部分，并能在推导式和 for、if、append 的循环之间来回改写。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py36"],"intro":"前面读过“逐个检查并收集”的循环：先建一个空列表，逐个取出元素，满足条件的用 `append` 放进去。AI 写代码时，常把这四行压成一行，叫**列表推导式**。\n\n这一节把一行推导式拆开来读：从哪个列表取、条件是什么、放进结果的是什么；再练习在推导式和循环之间来回改写。程序仍当作从上往下运行的短脚本。\n","wrapup":"读到 `[… for … in … if …]`，先看中间的 for 从哪个列表取，再看末尾的 if 留下谁，最后回到最前面，看放进结果的是什么。拿不准时，就把它展开成空列表、for、if、append 四行，逐轮追踪。\n\n请 AI 解释一段推导式时，也可以要它“展开成普通的 for 循环再写一遍”，两种写法的结果应当完全一样。\n","kps":[{"id":"py39.k1","title":"列表推导式中的取元素、条件和结果","key":["py36"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"列表推导式","aliases":["推导式","list comprehension"],"definition":"`[表达式 for v in 列表 if 条件]` 从列表里逐个取出 v，条件为 True 的才算出表达式，按原顺序放进一个新列表。","conditions":["按“中间、末尾、开头”的顺序读：先看 for 从哪个列表取，再看 if 留下谁，最后看最前面放进结果的是什么。","没有 if 时每个元素都进结果；一个都不满足时得到空列表 []。"],"example":"```python\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\ndoubled = [v * 2 for v in signals if v >= 10]\n```\n从 signals 逐个取 v，留下 v >= 10 的 12、10、15，各乘 2，doubled 是 [24, 20, 30]。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"“逐个检查并收集”的循环这样收集 signal 至少为 10 的读数：\n\n```python\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v)\n```\n\n同样的事可以写成一行**列表推导式**：\n\n```python\nkept = [v for v in signals if v >= 10]\n```\n\n两种写法得到同一个 `kept`：`[12, 10, 15]`。方括号里有三部分，按“中间、末尾、开头”的顺序读最顺：\n\n| 部分 | 写法 | 意思 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 取元素 | `for v in signals` | 从 signals 里逐个取出元素，每次叫 v |\n| 条件 | `if v >= 10` | 只有条件为 True 的元素才往下走 |\n| 结果 | 最前面的 `v` | 放进新列表的东西 |\n\n最前面的部分不一定是 `v` 本身，也可以是用 v 算出来的值。仍用这个 `signals`：\n\n- `[v * 2 for v in signals if v >= 10]` 得到 `[24, 20, 30]`：先筛，再把留下的各乘 2；\n- `[v * 2 for v in signals]` 没有 if，每个都进结果，得到 `[16, 24, 20, 14, 30]`；\n- `[v for v in signals if v > 20]` 一个都不满足，得到空列表 `[]`。\n\n结果里的元素保持原列表中的先后顺序，长度可能比原列表短，但不会更长。\n","example":{"id":"py39.k1.e0","body":"```python\nsignals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]\ndoubled = [v * 2 for v in signals if v >= 10]\nprint(doubled)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"source","type":"choice","prompt":"从哪个列表逐个取元素？","options":[{"id":"doubled","content":"```python\ndoubled\n```\n"},{"id":"signals","content":"```python\nsignals\n```\n"},{"id":"v","content":"```python\nv\n```\n"}],"key":"signals"},{"id":"condition","type":"choice","prompt":"条件是哪一部分？","options":[{"id":"expr","content":"```python\nv * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"loop","content":"```python\nfor v in signals\n```\n"},{"id":"test","content":"```python\nv >= 10\n```\n"}],"key":"test"},{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"放进结果的是哪一部分？","options":[{"id":"value","content":"```python\nv\n```\n"},{"id":"doubled_value","content":"```python\nv * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"test","content":"```python\nv >= 10\n```\n"}],"key":"doubled_value"},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[24, 20, 30]"}],"explanation":"从 **signals** 里逐个取 v；条件是 **v >= 10**；放进结果的是 **v * 2**。\n\n逐个看：8 和 7 不满足条件，跳过；12、10、15 满足，各乘 2 得到 24、20、30。显示 **[24, 20, 30]**，顺序和原列表一致。`doubled` 是最后接住新列表的名字，不是取元素的来源。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py39.k1.q1","body":"`depths` 是四个采样点的土层深度（厘米）。\n\n```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 30]\nadjusted = [d - 5 for d in depths if d > 28]\nprint(adjusted)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[25, 30, 25]","feedback":[{"when":"[30, 35, 30]","message":"留下的是对的，但放进结果的是 d - 5，每个还要减 5。"},{"when":"[25, 20, 30, 25]","message":"25 不满足 d > 28，不会进入结果。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **[25, 30, 25]**。从 depths 逐个取 d：30、35、30 满足 d > 28，25 不满足；留下的三个各减 5，得到 25、30、25，顺序不变。\n"},{"id":"py39.k1.q2","body":"```python\nsignals = [8, 10, 13, 10]\nhigh = [v for v in signals if v > 20]\nprint(high)\nprint(len(signals))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"[]","feedback":[{"when":"None","message":"没有元素满足条件时，推导式仍然得到一个列表，只是里面什么也没有。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示哪个整数？","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":0,"message":"推导式建的是一个新列表，signals 本身没有被改动，仍有 4 个元素。"}]}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **[]**：四个值都不大于 20，一个也没留下，得到空列表。第二行显示 **4**：推导式只是从 signals 里读，另外建了一个新列表，signals 不变。\n"},{"id":"py39.k1.q3","body":"```python\ncodes = [3, 8, 5, 8]\npicked = [c * 10 for c in codes if c != 8]\nprint(picked)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","prompt":"按取出的先后，填写每个元素是否满足条件，以及它放进结果的值；不放入的填“不放入”。","columns":[{"id":"c","header":"c"},{"id":"test","header":"c != 8","input":"bool"},{"id":"added","header":"放进结果的值","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["不放入"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"e1","cells":{"c":"3","test":true,"added":30}},{"id":"e2","cells":{"c":"8","test":false,"added":"不放入"}},{"id":"e3","cells":{"c":"5","test":true,"added":50}},{"id":"e4","cells":{"c":"8","test":false,"added":"不放入"}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":"[30, 50]"}],"explanation":"| c | c != 8 | 放进结果的值 |\n|---:|---|---|\n| 3 | True | 30 |\n| 8 | False | 不放入 |\n| 5 | True | 50 |\n| 8 | False | 不放入 |\n\n只有条件为 True 的元素才会算 `c * 10` 并放进结果，所以显示 **[30, 50]**。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py39.k1.r1","body":"```python\ndepths = [30, 25, 35, 40]\n```\n\n接着运行下面哪一行，`result` 会是 `[70, 80]`？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ge","content":"```python\nresult = [d * 2 for d in depths if d >= 30]\n```\n"},{"id":"no_double","content":"```python\nresult = [d for d in depths if d > 30]\n```\n"},{"id":"no_condition","content":"```python\nresult = [d * 2 for d in depths]\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nresult = [d * 2 for d in depths if d > 30]\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`[d * 2 for d in depths if d > 30]`：留下大于 30 的 35、40，各乘 2 得到 [70, 80]。\n\n用 `>= 30` 还会留下 30，得到 [60, 70, 80]；最前面只写 `d`，得到的是 [35, 40]；没有 if 时四个都进结果，得到 [60, 50, 70, 80]。\n"},{"id":"py39.k1.r2","body":"每一行都单独接在上面的准备代码之后，用 `print(...)` 显示这个表达式的值。写出会显示什么。\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"code","header":"表达式"},{"id":"value","header":"print 显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"positive","cells":{"code":"[c for c in counts if c > 0]","value":"[4, 7, 2]"}},{"id":"plus","cells":{"code":"[c + 1 for c in counts]","value":"[5, 1, 8, 3]"}},{"id":"none","cells":{"code":"[c for c in counts if c > 10]","value":"[]"}},{"id":"length","cells":{"code":"len([c for c in counts if c != 0])","value":"3"}}]}],"explanation":"- 留下大于 0 的：**[4, 7, 2]**，0 被去掉，顺序不变。\n- 没有 if，每个加 1：**[5, 1, 8, 3]**，长度和原列表相同。\n- 没有大于 10 的：**[]**。\n- 不等于 0 的有 4、7、2 三个，`len` 得到 **3**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"counts = [4, 0, 7, 2]\n","display":"准备代码：\n\n```python\ncounts = [4, 0, 7, 2]\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py39.k1.x1","body":"`lengths` 是几段样品的长度，单位是厘米；下面把至少 25 厘米的换成毫米。\n\n```python\nlengths = [12, 30, 7, 25]\nlong_mm = [n * 10 for n in lengths if n >= 25]\nprint(long_mm)\nprint(lengths)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"[300, 250]","feedback":[{"when":"[30, 25]","message":"放进结果的是 n * 10，留下的值还要乘 10。"},{"when":"[300]","message":"n >= 25 包含恰好等于 25 的那一段。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？","key":"[12, 30, 7, 25]"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **[300, 250]**：30 和 25 满足 n >= 25（包括恰好等于 25），各乘 10。第二行显示 **[12, 30, 7, 25]**：推导式另建了一个新列表，`lengths` 没有变。\n"},{"id":"py39.k1.x2","body":"```python\nratios = [r / 10 for r in readings if r >= 50]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"source","type":"choice","prompt":"从哪个列表逐个取元素？","options":[{"id":"ratios","content":"```python\nratios\n```\n"},{"id":"r","content":"```python\nr\n```\n"},{"id":"readings","content":"```python\nreadings\n```\n"}],"key":"readings"},{"id":"condition","type":"choice","prompt":"决定留不留下的条件是哪一部分？","options":[{"id":"test","content":"```python\nr >= 50\n```\n"},{"id":"expr","content":"```python\nr / 10\n```\n"},{"id":"loop","content":"```python\nfor r in readings\n```\n"}],"key":"test"},{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"放进结果的是哪一部分？","options":[{"id":"test","content":"```python\nr >= 50\n```\n"},{"id":"value","content":"```python\nr\n```\n"},{"id":"divided","content":"```python\nr / 10\n```\n"}],"key":"divided"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果 `readings` 是 `[40, 55, 60]`，`ratios` 里有几个元素？","key":2}],"explanation":"从 **readings** 逐个取 r；条件是 **r >= 50**；放进结果的是 **r / 10**。`ratios` 只是接住新列表的名字。\n\n`readings` 是 [40, 55, 60] 时，只有 55 和 60 满足条件，`ratios` 里有 **2** 个元素：5.5 和 6.0。\n"}]},{"id":"py39.k2","title":"与显式 for/if 的等价关系","key":["py36"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"推导式展开","aliases":["改写成循环"],"definition":"`new = [表达式 for v in 列表 if 条件]` 等价于先写 `new = []`，再在 `for v in 列表:` 里、`if 条件:` 成立时 `new.append(表达式)`。","conditions":["展开时三部分各就各位：for 行照抄 for 部分，if 行照抄条件，append 的括号里写最前面的表达式。","推导式总是建一个新列表，原列表不变；`a if 条件 else b` 写在 for 前面时是给每个元素二选一，不是筛选。"],"example":"`kept = [v * 2 for v in signals if v >= 10]` 展开成：\n```python\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v * 2)\n```\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"推导式和“逐个检查并收集”的循环可以一一对上：\n\n```python\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v * 2)\n```\n\n```python\nkept = [v * 2 for v in signals if v >= 10]\n```\n\n| 循环里的 | 推导式里的 |\n|---|---|\n| `kept = []`，先建空列表 | 外面的一对方括号 |\n| `for v in signals:` | 中间的 `for v in signals` |\n| `if v >= 10:` | 末尾的 `if v >= 10` |\n| `kept.append(v * 2)` 括号里的 `v * 2` | 最前面的 `v * 2` |\n\n**把推导式展开成循环**：先写 `名字 = []`；再把 for 部分照抄成一行，末尾加冒号；if 部分照抄成下一行，缩进一层、加冒号；最后一行再缩进一层，写 `名字.append(最前面的表达式)`。没有 if 的推导式，就少掉 if 那一行，append 只缩进一层。\n\n**把循环改写成推导式**：反过来，从 append 的括号里取出表达式放在最前面，后面接 for 部分和 if 部分。只有“空列表、for、可选的 if、append”这种形状的循环能这样改。\n\n两种写法的结果完全一样：都按原顺序收集、都建一个新列表，原来的 `signals` 不变。\n\n另外，AI 写的代码里有时会出现 `[a if 条件 else b for v in 列表]`，if 写在 for **前面**、还带 else。那是给每个元素二选一，结果和原列表一样长，不会去掉元素，和本节的筛选不是一回事，这里不展开。\n","example":{"id":"py39.k2.e0","body":"把下面这行推导式展开成循环：把需要的代码块排好，并设好缩进。有的块用不上。宿主已经准备好列表 `signals`。\n\n```python\nkept = [v * 2 for v in signals if v >= 10]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":2,"items":[{"id":"append_plain","code":"kept.append(v)"},{"id":"loop","code":"for v in signals:"},{"id":"test_gt","code":"if v > 10:"},{"id":"start","code":"kept = []"},{"id":"append_double","code":"kept.append(v * 2)"},{"id":"test","code":"if v >= 10:"}],"key":["start","loop","test","append_double"],"indents":{"start":0,"loop":0,"test":1,"test_gt":1,"append_double":2,"append_plain":2},"tests":[{"name":"表里有恰好等于 10 的值","setup":"signals = [8, 12, 10, 7, 15]","expect":{"kept":"[24, 20, 30]","signals":"[8, 12, 10, 7, 15]"}},{"name":"换一组值","hidden":true,"setup":"signals = [12, 9, 10, 30]","expect":{"kept":"[24, 20, 60]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nkept = []\nfor v in signals:\n    if v >= 10:\n        kept.append(v * 2)\n```\n\n先建空列表；for 部分照抄成第二行；条件照抄成 `if v >= 10:`，缩进一层；最前面的表达式 `v * 2` 写进 append 的括号，再缩进一层。`if v > 10:` 改了等号的含义，`kept.append(v)` 漏了乘 2，都用不上。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py39.k2.q1","body":"```python\nbig = [d * 2 for d in depths if d > 28]\n```\n\n哪一段循环和这一行的结果总是相同？\n","slots":[{"id":"loop","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"reset_inside","content":"```python\nfor d in depths:\n    big = []\n    if d > 28:\n        big.append(d * 2)\n```\n","feedback":"big = [] 写进了循环，每一轮都重新清空，最后只剩最后一轮的结果。"},{"id":"no_double","content":"```python\nbig = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d > 28:\n        big.append(d)\n```\n"},{"id":"same","content":"```python\nbig = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d > 28:\n        big.append(d * 2)\n```\n"},{"id":"ge","content":"```python\nbig = []\nfor d in depths:\n    if d >= 28:\n        big.append(d * 2)\n```\n"}],"key":"same"}],"explanation":"空列表写在循环前、条件照抄 `d > 28`、append 里写 `d * 2` 的那一段和推导式相同。\n\n把 `big = []` 写进循环，每一轮都清空，只留下最后一轮的结果；append 里只写 `d`，漏了乘 2；`d >= 28` 会多留下恰好是 28 的值。\n"},{"id":"py39.k2.q2","body":"下面的循环从 `readings` 里挑出高于本底 5 的读数，减去 5 后收集起来：\n\n```python\nnet = []\nfor r in readings:\n    if r > 5:\n        net.append(r - 5)\n```\n\n把它改写成一行推导式，结果仍叫 `net`。作答框里的 `___` 是要你填的地方。宿主已经准备好 `readings`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"net = [___ for r in readings if ___]\n","solution":"net = [r - 5 for r in readings if r > 5]\n","rejects":[{"code":"net = [r for r in readings if r > 5]","why":"放进结果的是 r，忘了减去本底"},{"code":"net = [r - 5 for r in readings if r >= 5]","why":"把“高于 5”写成了大于或等于，多留下恰好是 5 的读数"},{"code":"net = [r - 5 for r in readings]","why":"漏了条件，每个读数都减 5 放进结果"}],"tests":[{"name":"有恰好等于本底的读数","setup":"readings = [12, 4, 9, 5]","expect":{"net":"[7, 4]","readings":"[12, 4, 9, 5]"}},{"name":"换一组读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [6, 5, 20]","expect":{"net":"[1, 15]"}},{"name":"没有高于本底的读数","hidden":true,"setup":"readings = [1, 2]","expect":{"net":"[]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nnet = [r - 5 for r in readings if r > 5]\n```\n\nappend 括号里的 `r - 5` 放到最前面，for 部分和 if 部分照抄。`readings` 是 [12, 4, 9, 5] 时得到 [7, 4]：恰好等于 5 的读数不高于本底，不留下。判分时还会换几组读数运行。\n"},{"id":"py39.k2.q3","body":"```python\nsignals = [8, 10, 13]\nplus_one = [v + 1 for v in signals]\nprint(signals)\nprint(plus_one)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"[8, 10, 13]","feedback":[{"when":"[9, 11, 14]","message":"推导式建的是新列表，交给 plus_one；signals 本身没有改。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？","key":"[9, 11, 14]"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **[8, 10, 13]**，第二行显示 **[9, 11, 14]**。推导式和“空列表加 append”的循环一样，是另建一个新列表往里放，原来的 `signals` 不变。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py39.k2.r1","body":"下面每组有一行推导式（甲）和一段循环（乙），`nums` 是一个整数列表，可能有正数、0 和负数。\n\n第 1 组：\n\n```python\nout = [x + 1 for x in nums if x > 0]\n```\n\n```python\nout = []\nfor x in nums:\n    if x > 0:\n        out.append(x + 1)\n```\n\n第 2 组：\n\n```python\nout = [x for x in nums if x > 0]\n```\n\n```python\nout = []\nfor x in nums:\n    if x > 0:\n        out.append(x + 1)\n```\n\n第 3 组：\n\n```python\nout = [x * 2 for x in nums]\n```\n\n```python\nout = []\nfor x in nums:\n    out.append(x * 2)\n```\n\n第 4 组：\n\n```python\nout = [x for x in nums if x != 0]\n```\n\n```python\nout = []\nfor x in nums:\n    if x > 0:\n        out.append(x)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"same","type":"table","prompt":"对任何 `nums`，甲和乙得到的 `out` 是否总是相同？","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"same","header":"总是相同","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"g1","cells":{"group":"第 1 组","same":true}},{"id":"g2","cells":{"group":"第 2 组","same":false}},{"id":"g3","cells":{"group":"第 3 组","same":true}},{"id":"g4","cells":{"group":"第 4 组","same":false}}]}],"explanation":"- 第 1 组**相同**：条件和表达式都对得上。\n- 第 2 组**不同**：推导式放进结果的是 `x`，循环放的是 `x + 1`。\n- 第 3 组**相同**：没有 if 的推导式，对应没有 if 的循环。\n- 第 4 组**不同**：`x != 0` 会留下负数，`x > 0` 不会；`nums` 里有负数时结果就不一样。\n"},{"id":"py39.k2.r2","body":"把下面这行推导式改写成 for 循环，结果仍叫 `selected`。作答框里的 `___` 是要你补写的地方，可以写成几行。宿主已经准备好 `groups`。\n\n```python\nselected = [g for g in groups if g != \"control\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"selected = []\nfor g in groups:\n    ___\n","solution":"selected = []\nfor g in groups:\n    if g != \"control\":\n        selected.append(g)\n","accepts":["selected = [g for g in groups if g != \"control\"]\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"selected = []\nfor g in groups:\n    selected.append(g)\n","why":"漏了条件，control 也被收集进来"},{"code":"for g in groups:\n    selected = []\n    if g != \"control\":\n        selected.append(g)\n","why":"空列表写进了循环，每一轮都被清空"},{"code":"selected = []\nfor g in groups:\n    if g == \"control\":\n        selected.append(g)\n","why":"条件写反了，收集的是 control"}],"tests":[{"name":"三种组别","setup":"groups = [\"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\", \"control\", \"placebo\"]","expect":{"selected":"[\"drug\", \"drug\", \"placebo\"]","groups":"[\"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\", \"control\", \"placebo\"]"}},{"name":"只有对照组","hidden":true,"setup":"groups = [\"control\", \"control\"]","expect":{"selected":"[]"}},{"name":"最后一个不是对照组","hidden":true,"setup":"groups = [\"drug\", \"control\", \"drug\"]","expect":{"selected":"[\"drug\", \"drug\"]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nselected = []\nfor g in groups:\n    if g != \"control\":\n        selected.append(g)\n```\n\n条件 `g != \"control\"` 照抄成 if 行，缩进一层；最前面的 `g` 写进 append 的括号，再缩进一层。空列表必须写在循环前面，否则每一轮都被清空。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py39.k2.x1","body":"把下面这行推导式展开成循环：把需要的代码块排好，并设好缩进。有的块用不上。宿主已经准备好 `temps`。\n\n```python\nwarm = [t - 20 for t in temps if t > 20]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":2,"items":[{"id":"test","code":"if t > 20:"},{"id":"append_plain","code":"warm.append(t)"},{"id":"start","code":"warm = []"},{"id":"append_diff","code":"warm.append(t - 20)"},{"id":"loop","code":"for t in temps:"},{"id":"test_diff","code":"if t - 20 > 20:"}],"key":["start","loop","test","append_diff"],"indents":{"start":0,"loop":0,"test":1,"test_diff":1,"append_diff":2,"append_plain":2},"tests":[{"name":"几天的温度","setup":"temps = [18, 25, 20, 31]","expect":{"warm":"[5, 11]","temps":"[18, 25, 20, 31]"}},{"name":"换一组温度","hidden":true,"setup":"temps = [45, 21, 12]","expect":{"warm":"[25, 1]"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nwarm = []\nfor t in temps:\n    if t > 20:\n        warm.append(t - 20)\n```\n\n条件照抄 `t > 20`，不要把最前面的表达式也算进条件；放进结果的是 `t - 20`，写进 append 的括号。\n"},{"id":"py39.k2.x2","body":"```python\nvalues = [5, 12, 9, 15]\nkept = [v - 2 for v in values if v > 8]\n```\n\n把第二行展开成“空列表、for、if、append”的循环，逐轮执行。填写每一轮结束时 `kept` 的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"rounds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"round","header":"第几轮"},{"id":"v","header":"v"},{"id":"kept","header":"这一轮结束时的 kept","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"round":"1","v":"5","kept":"[]"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"round":"2","v":"12","kept":"[10]"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"round":"3","v":"9","kept":"[10, 7]"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"round":"4","v":"15","kept":"[10, 7, 13]"}}]}],"explanation":"| 第几轮 | v | v > 8 | kept |\n|---:|---:|---|---|\n| 1 | 5 | False | [] |\n| 2 | 12 | True | [10] |\n| 3 | 9 | True | [10, 7] |\n| 4 | 15 | True | [10, 7, 13] |\n\n第 1 轮条件不成立，`kept` 仍是空列表；之后每轮把 `v - 2` 加到末尾。最后的 `kept` 是 [10, 7, 13]，和推导式直接算出的一样。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py40","title":"读懂自己定义的函数","summary":"分清 def 定义与调用两次动作；读出形参接收了哪个实参、return 交回什么；顺着中间量追到函数的结果。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py04","py10"],"intro":"前面你调用过别人写好的函数，例如 `int(\"12\")`、`round(2.567, 1)`：给它输入，拿回一个结果。AI 写的分析代码里，常常还会自己定义函数，把几步计算包成一个名字。\n\n这一节练三件事：分清“定义”和“调用”；读出每个输入交给了哪个名字、最后交回了什么；顺着函数里的中间量，找到结果是怎样算出来的。\n","wrapup":"读一个自己定义的函数，可以按这个顺序：先找到调用它的那一行，确定每个形参接收了哪个值；再像读普通程序一样逐行追踪函数体；最后看 return 后面写的是谁，那才是调用处拿到的结果。\n\n向 AI 提问时也可以这样说：“这个函数的输入是什么、交回的是哪个值？中间哪一步减了本底？”\n","kps":[{"id":"py40.k1","title":"def 定义与调用是两次不同动作","key":["py04"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"定义与调用","aliases":["def","函数定义","调用函数"],"definition":"`def` 只记下函数名和它的做法，缩进的几行这时不运行；写 `名字()` 调用时才运行一遍，调用几次就运行几次。","conditions":["函数要先定义、后调用；调用写在 def 之前会报 NameError。","函数体里的 print 在调用时才显示，和外面的 print 按实际运行顺序交错。"],"example":"```python\ndef show_start():\n    print(\"开始测量\")\n\nprint(\"准备样本\")\nshow_start()\nshow_start()\n```\ndef 那两行不显示任何东西；先显示“准备样本”，两次调用各显示一次“开始测量”。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"除了调用别人写好的函数，也可以自己定义一个：\n\n```python\ndef show_start():\n    print(\"开始测量\")\n```\n\n`def 名字():` 这一行，加上下面缩进的几行（叫**函数体**），合起来是一次**定义**。Python 只记下“`show_start` 这个名字代表这几行做法”，这时缩进的几行**一行也不运行**，屏幕上什么也不显示。\n\n要让做法真正运行，得**调用**它：写 `show_start()`，带上括号。每调用一次，函数体就从头运行一遍；调用两次，就运行两遍。\n\n读一段含 `def` 的程序，仍然从上往下按顺序走：\n\n1. 走到 `def`，只记下名字，跳过缩进的部分；\n2. 走到调用的那一行，转进函数里，把函数体运行完，再回到调用处，接着往下走。\n\n函数要先定义、后调用。调用写在 `def` 前面时，Python 走到那一行还不认识这个名字，会报 NameError（意思是“不认识这个名字”），和使用还没赋值的名字一样。\n","example":{"id":"py40.k1.e0","body":"阅读下面的程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef show_start():\n    print(\"开始测量\")\n\nprint(\"准备样本\")\nshow_start()\nshow_start()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"before","type":"choice","prompt":"刚运行完第 1–2 行（def 那两行）时，屏幕上显示了什么？","options":[{"id":"nothing","content":"什么也没有显示"},{"id":"start","content":"显示了一次“开始测量”"}],"key":"nothing"},{"id":"lines","type":"table","label":"输出","prompt":"按先后顺序选出整个程序显示的每一行。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"输出的第几行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"prep","label":"准备样本"},{"id":"start","label":"开始测量"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","shown":"prep"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":"start"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"start"}}]},{"id":"runs","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"函数体 `print(\"开始测量\")` 一共运行了几次？","key":2}],"explanation":"第 1–2 行只是定义，**什么也不显示**。第 4 行显示“准备样本”；第 5 行调用一次，转进函数显示“开始测量”；第 6 行再调用一次，又显示一次。\n\n所以输出依次是 **准备样本、开始测量、开始测量**，函数体运行了 **2** 次：调用几次，就运行几次。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py40.k1.q1","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef warn():\n    print(\"信号偏低，请复测\")\n\nprint(\"检查结束\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"屏幕上一共显示几行？","key":1,"feedback":[{"when":2,"message":"第 1–2 行只定义了 warn，程序里没有一行写 `warn()`。"}]},{"id":"runs","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"warn 的函数体运行了几次？","key":0}],"explanation":"只显示 **1** 行“检查结束”。程序定义了 warn，却没有任何一行调用它，所以函数体运行了 **0** 次，“信号偏低，请复测”一次也不显示。\n"},{"id":"py40.k1.q2","body":"同事想先显示“开始”，再显示“报告已生成”。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(\"开始\")\nreport()\n\ndef report():\n    print(\"报告已生成\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"ok","content":"先显示“开始”，再显示“报告已生成”"},{"id":"reversed","content":"先显示“报告已生成”，再显示“开始”"},{"id":"error","content":"显示“开始”之后，在第 2 行报 NameError"},{"id":"silent","content":"什么也不显示，直接报错"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改，才能先显示“开始”、再显示“报告已生成”？","options":[{"id":"noparen","content":"把第 2 行的 `report()` 改成 `report`，去掉括号","feedback":"去掉括号也要先认识 report 这个名字，第 2 行照样报 NameError；而且不带括号就不是调用。"},{"id":"delete","content":"删掉第 2 行","feedback":"删掉以后程序里没有调用 report，“报告已生成”一次也不显示。"},{"id":"move","content":"把第 4–5 行的定义移到第 1 行之前"}],"key":"move"}],"explanation":"第 1 行先显示“开始”；第 2 行要调用 report，可这时第 4 行的 def 还没运行，Python 不认识这个名字，于是**在第 2 行报 NameError**，程序停下。\n\n把定义移到最前面：先定义、再调用，就会依次显示“开始”和“报告已生成”。删掉第 2 行就没有调用了；只去掉括号，第 2 行仍然要用到这个还不认识的名字。\n"},{"id":"py40.k1.q3","body":"一个函数里也可以调用另一个函数。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef weigh():\n    print(\"称重\")\n\ndef record():\n    print(\"记录\")\n    weigh()\n\nrecord()\nprint(\"换下一份\")\nweigh()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"table","prompt":"按先后顺序选出程序显示的每一行。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"输出的第几行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"weigh","label":"称重"},{"id":"record","label":"记录"},{"id":"next","label":"换下一份"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","shown":"record"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":"weigh"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"next"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":"weigh"}}]},{"id":"runs","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"weigh 的函数体一共运行了几次？","key":2}],"explanation":"输出依次是 **记录、称重、换下一份、称重**。\n\n第 8 行调用 record：先显示“记录”，接着 record 的第二行调用 weigh，显示“称重”，然后回到第 8 行之后。第 9 行显示“换下一份”，第 10 行再调用一次 weigh。weigh 一共被调用 **2** 次：一次在 record 里面，一次在第 10 行。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py40.k1.r1","body":"把下面的代码块排成一段程序：先显示“开始”，再把 measure 的做法运行两遍，每遍显示一次“测量”。每一块都要用上，并排好缩进。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","indent":1,"items":[{"id":"call1","code":"measure()"},{"id":"start","code":"print(\"开始\")"},{"id":"body","code":"print(\"测量\")"},{"id":"call2","code":"measure()"},{"id":"def","code":"def measure():"}],"key":["def","body","start","call1","call2"],"alternatives":[["start","def","body","call1","call2"]],"indents":{"def":0,"body":1,"start":0,"call1":0,"call2":0},"tests":[{"name":"依次显示开始、测量、测量","stdout":"开始\n测量\n测量\n"}]}],"explanation":"`print(\"测量\")` 要缩进在 `def measure():` 下面，作为函数体；两次 `measure()` 不缩进，要放在定义之后。`print(\"开始\")` 放在两次调用之前，放在定义的前面或后面都可以，因为定义本身不显示任何东西。\n\n```python\ndef measure():\n    print(\"测量\")\n\nprint(\"开始\")\nmeasure()\nmeasure()\n```\n"},{"id":"py40.k1.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef done():\n    print(\"记录完成\")\n\ntotal = 3\ndone()\ntotal = total + 1\ndone()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"early","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 4 行运行完时，屏幕上已经显示了几次“记录完成”？","key":0,"feedback":[{"when":1,"message":"第 1–2 行只是定义，“记录完成”要等第 5 行调用时才第一次显示。"}]},{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"整个程序一共显示几次“记录完成”？","key":2}],"explanation":"第 4 行运行完时显示了 **0** 次：前两行只是定义 done，第 4 行只给 total 赋值。第 5 行和第 7 行各调用一次，所以一共显示 **2** 次。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py40.k1.x1","body":"哪一段程序会依次显示“开始”“测量”“结束”三行？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"never","content":"```python\nprint(\"开始\")\ndef measure():\n    print(\"测量\")\nprint(\"结束\")\n```\n"},{"id":"early","content":"```python\nprint(\"开始\")\nmeasure()\ndef measure():\n    print(\"测量\")\nprint(\"结束\")\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\ndef measure():\n    print(\"测量\")\nprint(\"开始\")\nmeasure()\nprint(\"结束\")\n```\n"},{"id":"first","content":"```python\ndef measure():\n    print(\"测量\")\nmeasure()\nprint(\"开始\")\nprint(\"结束\")\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"先定义 measure、再显示“开始”、然后调用、最后显示“结束”的那一段是对的。\n\n只定义不调用的那一段，“测量”一次也不显示；在 def 之前调用的那一段，第 2 行报 NameError；先调用再显示“开始”的那一段，顺序成了测量、开始、结束。\n"},{"id":"py40.k1.x2","body":"填写运行到每一处时，屏幕上**一共**已经显示了几行。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef check():\n    print(\"检查\")\n    print(\"通过\")\n\nprint(\"开始\")\ncheck()\ncheck()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"at","header":"运行完"},{"id":"count","header":"已显示的行数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"d","cells":{"at":"第 1–3 行（定义）","count":0}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"at":"第 5 行","count":1}},{"id":"l6","cells":{"at":"第 6 行","count":3}},{"id":"l7","cells":{"at":"第 7 行","count":5}}]}],"explanation":"定义不显示任何东西，所以第 1–3 行运行完是 **0** 行。第 5 行显示“开始”，共 **1** 行；第 6 行调用 check，函数体的两行 print 各显示一行，共 **3** 行；第 7 行再调用一次，共 **5** 行。\n"}]},{"id":"py40.k2","title":"形参接收实参，return 把值交回","key":["py04","py10"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"参数与返回值","aliases":["形参","实参","return","返回值"],"definition":"调用时，形参按位置或按名字接收实参；return 把一个值交回调用处，并结束这次调用。","conditions":["按位置给实参只看顺序：net_signal(3, 12) 里 raw 是 3，blank 是 12。","只 print 不 return 时，调用处拿到的是 None，不能接着计算。"],"example":"```python\ndef net_signal(raw, blank):\n    return raw - blank\n\na = net_signal(12, 3)\nb = net_signal(blank=2, raw=7)\n```\n第一次调用 raw 为 12、blank 为 3，交回 9；第二次按名字给，raw 为 7、blank 为 2，交回 5。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"函数常常需要输入。写在 `def` 后面括号里的名字叫**形参**，调用时写在括号里的值叫**实参**：\n\n```python\ndef net_signal(raw, blank):\n    return raw - blank\n```\n\n调用 `net_signal(12, 3)` 时，形参先按位置接收实参：`raw` 指向 12，`blank` 指向 3，就像函数一开始先做了 `raw = 12`、`blank = 3`。也可以按名字给，`net_signal(blank=3, raw=12)` 的结果一样。按位置给时只看顺序：`net_signal(3, 12)` 会让 `raw` 指向 3。\n\n`return 值` 把这个值**交回**调用的地方，整个调用就被这个值取代。`x = net_signal(12, 3) + 1` 先算出 `net_signal(12, 3)` 是 9，再算 9 + 1。\n\n`return` 同时结束这次调用，它后面的行不再运行。函数里有 if/elif/else 时，走到哪条路径上的 `return`，就交回哪个值：\n\n```python\ndef label(signal, limit):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    else:\n        return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n只 `print` 不 `return` 的函数，会把结果显示在屏幕上，但调用处拿到的是 None（表示没有值），不能接着算。要把结果交给下一步，就要 `return`。\n","example":{"id":"py40.k2.e0","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef net_signal(raw, blank):\n    return raw - blank\n\na = net_signal(12, 3)\nb = net_signal(blank=2, raw=7)\nprint(a + b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"params","type":"table","label":"每次调用时形参的值","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"raw","header":"raw","input":"integer"},{"id":"blank","header":"blank","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"第 4 行","raw":12,"blank":3}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"第 5 行","raw":7,"blank":2}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":14}],"explanation":"| 调用 | raw | blank | 交回 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 第 4 行 | 12 | 3 | 9 |\n| 第 5 行 | 7 | 2 | 5 |\n\n第 4 行按位置给：第一个实参 12 给 raw，第二个 3 给 blank。第 5 行按名字给，写的顺序不影响：raw 是 7，blank 是 2。两次调用分别被交回的 9 和 5 取代，最后显示 **14**。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py40.k2.q1","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef double(n):\n    return n * 2\n    print(\"算完了\")\n\nresult = double(5)\nprint(result)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"choice","prompt":"屏幕上显示什么？","options":[{"id":"both","content":"先显示“算完了”，再显示 10"},{"id":"after","content":"先显示 10，再显示“算完了”"},{"id":"only","content":"只显示 10"},{"id":"none","content":"只显示“算完了”"}],"key":"only"}],"explanation":"**只显示 10**。第 2 行的 return 把 10 交回，同时结束这次调用，第 3 行的 print 永远不会运行。第 6 行显示 result，也就是 10。\n"},{"id":"py40.k2.q2","body":"```python\ndef label(signal, limit):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    else:\n        return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n这里的“达标”只是题目约定的规则。填写每次调用交回的结果。\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"result","header":"交回","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"pass","label":"达标"},{"id":"fail","label":"未达标"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"label(12, 10)","result":"pass"}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"label(10, 10)","result":"pass"}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"call":"label(10, 12)","result":"fail"}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"call":"label(limit=8, signal=7)","result":"fail"}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **达标、达标、未达标、未达标**。\n\n- `label(12, 10)`：signal 为 12，limit 为 10，12 >= 10，走第一条路径。\n- `label(10, 10)`：恰好等于阈值，`>=` 包含等号，也是达标。\n- `label(10, 12)`：按位置给，signal 是 10、limit 是 12，10 >= 12 不成立，走 else。\n- `label(limit=8, signal=7)`：按名字给，signal 是 7、limit 是 8，未达标。\n"},{"id":"py40.k2.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef ratio(part, total):\n    print(part / total)\n\nr = ratio(3, 4)\nprint(r)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第一行显示什么？","key":"0.75"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第二行显示什么？","key":"None","feedback":[{"when":"0.75","message":"ratio 只把结果显示出来，没有 return，r 拿到的是 None。"}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要让 `r` 拿到 0.75，第 2 行应改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"assign","content":"```python\n    r = part / total\n```\n","feedback":"函数里的 r 和外面的 r 不是同一个名字；不 return，调用处仍然拿到 None。"},{"id":"return","content":"```python\n    return part / total\n```\n"},{"id":"print_return","content":"```python\n    print(return part / total)\n```\n"}],"key":"return"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **0.75**：那是函数里的 print 显示的。第二行显示 **None**：ratio 没有 return，调用处拿到的是 None，r 就指向 None。\n\n把第 2 行改成 `return part / total`，结果才会交回给 r。在函数里另写 `r = ...` 不会改变外面的 r；把 return 写进 print 的括号里不是合法的写法。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py40.k2.r1","body":"需求：`classify(depth)` 在深度小于 20 时交回 `\"浅\"`，否则交回 `\"深\"`。把代码块排成这个函数，并排好缩进。有一块用不上。\n","slots":[{"id":"function","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":2,"items":[{"id":"ret_deep","code":"return \"深\""},{"id":"if","code":"if depth < 20:"},{"id":"show","code":"print(\"浅\")"},{"id":"def","code":"def classify(depth):"},{"id":"else","code":"else:"},{"id":"ret_shallow","code":"return \"浅\""}],"key":["def","if","ret_shallow","else","ret_deep"],"indents":{"def":0,"if":1,"ret_shallow":2,"else":1,"ret_deep":2,"show":2},"tests":[{"name":"浅、深和边界","doctest":">>> classify(5)\n'浅'\n>>> classify(20)\n'深'\n>>> classify(19)\n'浅'\n"},{"name":"交回的值能接着用","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> classify(3) + \"层\"\n'浅层'\n>>> classify(40) + \"层\"\n'深层'\n"}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndef classify(depth):\n    if depth < 20:\n        return \"浅\"\n    else:\n        return \"深\"\n```\n\n`if` 和 `else` 缩进一层，属于函数体；两个 return 再缩进一层，分别属于各自的路径。`print(\"浅\")` 用不上：它只显示，不交回，调用处拿到的是 None，`classify(3) + \"层\"` 就会出错。\n"},{"id":"py40.k2.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef grade(depth):\n    if depth < 20:\n        return \"浅\"\n    elif depth < 40:\n        return \"中\"\n    print(\"进入最后一段\")\n    return \"深\"\n```\n\n对每次调用，填写交回的结果，以及调用时会不会显示“进入最后一段”。\n","slots":[{"id":"calls","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"result","header":"交回","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"shallow","label":"浅"},{"id":"middle","label":"中"},{"id":"deep","label":"深"}]}},{"id":"shows","header":"显示“进入最后一段”","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c5","cells":{"call":"grade(5)","result":"shallow","shows":false}},{"id":"c20","cells":{"call":"grade(20)","result":"middle","shows":false}},{"id":"c40","cells":{"call":"grade(40)","result":"deep","shows":true}}]}],"explanation":"- `grade(5)`：5 < 20，第 3 行 return，交回 **浅**，调用到此结束，不显示。\n- `grade(20)`：20 < 20 不成立；20 < 40 成立，第 5 行交回 **中**，也不显示。\n- `grade(40)`：两个条件都不成立，才走到第 6 行，**显示**“进入最后一段”，再交回 **深**。\n\nreturn 一旦运行，这次调用就结束了，后面的行都不会运行。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py40.k2.x1","body":"`change(before, after)` 算一个采样点前后两次测得的深度变化。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef change(before, after):\n    return after - before\n\nprint(change(30, 25))\nprint(change(after=30, before=25))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"before","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 4 行的调用里，before 是多少？","key":30},{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":-5,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"按位置给时，30 给第一个形参 before，25 给 after，算的是 25 - 30。"}]},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":5}],"explanation":"第 4 行按位置给：before 是 **30**，after 是 25，交回 25 - 30 = **-5**。第 5 行按名字给：after 是 30，before 是 25，交回 **5**。写在括号里的先后顺序不决定谁给谁，位置调用看位置，名字调用看名字。\n"},{"id":"py40.k2.x2","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef total(a, b):\n    print(a + b)\n\ns = total(2, 3) * 2\nprint(s)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"ten","content":"只显示 10"},{"id":"both","content":"先显示 5，再显示 10"},{"id":"error","content":"显示 5 之后，第 4 行报 TypeError"},{"id":"silent","content":"什么也不显示，直接报错"}],"key":"error"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行改成哪一行，程序就只显示 10？","options":[{"id":"bare","content":"`a + b`"},{"id":"assign","content":"`s = a + b`"},{"id":"return","content":"`return a + b`"}],"key":"return"}],"explanation":"第 4 行先调用 `total(2, 3)`：函数里的 print 显示 **5**，但没有 return，调用处拿到 None。接着算 `None * 2`，None 不能做乘法，**报 TypeError**，第 5 行不再运行。\n\n把第 2 行改成 `return a + b`，调用处拿到 5，s 是 10，程序只显示 10。只写 `a + b` 算完就丢掉了；`s = a + b` 改的是函数里的名字，外面仍拿到 None。\n"}]},{"id":"py40.k3","title":"局部中间量如何流向结果","key":["py01","py04"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"函数里的中间量","aliases":["局部变量","中间结果"],"definition":"函数体里算出的中间量只在这一次调用里存在；只有 return 后面的那个值被交回，其余的调用结束就丢掉。","conditions":["从 return 倒着追：交回的名字在哪一行算出、用了哪些名字，一直追到形参。","中间量算对了却没有被交回，调用处仍然拿不到它。"],"example":"```python\ndef corrected(raw, blank, factor):\n    net = raw - blank\n    scaled = net * factor\n    return scaled\n```\ncorrected(14, 2, 3)：net 是 12，scaled 是 36，交回 36。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"函数里常常不是一步算完，而是先算出几个**中间量**：\n\n```python\ndef corrected(raw, blank, factor):\n    net = raw - blank\n    scaled = net * factor\n    return scaled\n```\n\n读一次调用，比如 `corrected(14, 2, 3)`，就像读一段普通程序：先写下形参接收的值，再逐行记状态表。\n\n| 运行到 | raw | blank | factor | net | scaled |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 刚进入函数 | 14 | 2 | 3 | 尚未定义 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 2 行 | 14 | 2 | 3 | 12 | 尚未定义 |\n| 第 3 行 | 14 | 2 | 3 | 12 | 36 |\n\n第 4 行交回 scaled，也就是 36。\n\n结果是哪一个，只看 return 后面写的是谁。中间量只活在这一次调用里：调用结束，`net`、`scaled` 就不在了，调用处只拿到交回的那个值。\n\n读 AI 写的函数时，可以从 return 倒着查：交回的名字在哪一行算出 → 那一行用了哪些名字 → 那些名字又从哪里来……一直追到形参。漏掉的一步（例如没减本底）、用错的名字（例如用了 `raw` 而不是 `net`），都会在这条链上露出来。\n","example":{"id":"py40.k3.e0","body":"填写调用 `corrected(14, 2, 3)` 时，函数体第 2、3 行运行完后 `net` 和 `scaled` 的值，还没有赋值的填“尚未定义”。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef corrected(raw, blank, factor):\n    net = raw - blank\n    scaled = net * factor\n    return scaled\n\nresult = corrected(14, 2, 3)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"运行到"},{"id":"net","header":"net","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}},{"id":"scaled","header":"scaled","input":{"type":"text","format":"integer","quick":["尚未定义"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","net":12,"scaled":"尚未定义"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","net":12,"scaled":36}}]},{"id":"result","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 6 行运行完，result 是多少？","key":36}],"explanation":"进入函数时 raw 是 14、blank 是 2、factor 是 3。第 2 行算出 net = 14 - 2 = **12**；第 3 行用 net 算出 scaled = 12 × 3 = **36**；第 4 行交回 scaled，所以 result 是 **36**。\n\n倒着看也一样：result 来自 scaled，scaled 来自 net 和 factor，net 来自 raw 和 blank。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py40.k3.q1","body":"需求：`mean_of_two(a, b)` 交回两次读数的平均值。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef mean_of_two(a, b):\n    total = a + b\n    mean = total / 2\n    return total\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`mean_of_two(6, 10)` 交回多少？","key":16,"feedback":[{"when":8,"message":"平均值 8 确实算出来了，存在 mean 里；但第 4 行交回的是 total。"}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样改，才符合需求？","options":[{"id":"line3","content":"第 3 行改成 `mean = total * 2`"},{"id":"line2","content":"第 2 行改成 `total = a - b`"},{"id":"line4","content":"第 4 行改成 `return mean`"}],"key":"line4"}],"explanation":"交回 **16**。平均值 8 在第 3 行已经算出来、存在 mean 里了，可第 4 行交回的是 total，mean 在调用结束时被丢掉。\n\n把第 4 行改成 `return mean` 就对了。另外两种改法改的是中间量的算法，交回的仍不是平均值。\n"},{"id":"py40.k3.q2","body":"配 50 毫升稀释液，原液占总体积的五分之一：`split_volume` 算出要取多少原液，以及要加多少水。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef split_volume(volume, ratio):\n    sample = volume / ratio\n    water = volume - sample\n    return sample\n\nresult = split_volume(50, 5)\nprint(result)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"第 7 行显示什么？","key":"10.0"},{"id":"water","type":"choice","prompt":"调用里算出的 water 后来怎样了？","options":[{"id":"returned","content":"和 sample 一起交回给 result"},{"id":"shown","content":"调用时自动显示在屏幕上"},{"id":"dropped","content":"调用里算出了 40.0，但调用结束就丢掉了，调用处拿不到"}],"key":"dropped"},{"id":"outside","type":"choice","prompt":"如果在程序末尾再加一行 `print(water)`，会怎样？","options":[{"id":"forty","content":"显示 40.0"},{"id":"error","content":"报 NameError"},{"id":"none","content":"显示 None"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"显示 **10.0**：sample = 50 / 5，除法 `/` 的结果是小数。water 在调用里算出 40.0，但 return 只交回 sample，调用结束后 water 就不在了，调用处拿不到它；在外面 `print(water)` 会报 **NameError**，因为外面从来没有这个名字。\n\n如果需要加水量，就要另外把它交回，而不是指望它“留在外面”。\n"},{"id":"py40.k3.q3","body":"需求：`net_ratio(raw, blank, ref)` 先从读数 raw 减去本底 blank，再除以参照值 ref，交回这个比值。\n\n同事写的函数在作答框里，下面的例子是需求给出的期望结果，现在没有全部通过。请改动函数并提交。\n\n```python\n>>> net_ratio(12, 2, 5)\n2.0\n>>> net_ratio(9, 1, 4)\n2.0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":8,"starter":"def net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    net = raw - blank\n    ratio = raw / ref\n    return ratio\n","solution":"def net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    net = raw - blank\n    ratio = net / ref\n    return ratio\n","accepts":["def net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    return (raw - blank) / ref\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"def net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    net = raw - blank\n    ratio = net / ref\n    return net\n","why":"比值算对了，却交回了中间量 net"},{"code":"def net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    ratio = raw - blank / ref\n    return ratio\n","why":"少了括号，先算了 blank / ref"},{"code":"def net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    net = raw - blank\n    ratio = net / ref\n    print(ratio)\n","why":"只显示不交回"}],"tests":[{"name":"需求给出的例子","doctest":">>> net_ratio(12, 2, 5)\n2.0\n>>> net_ratio(9, 1, 4)\n2.0\n"},{"name":"读数等于本底","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> net_ratio(7, 7, 2)\n0.0\n"},{"name":"交回的值能接着算","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> net_ratio(20, 4, 8) * 10\n20.0\n"}]}],"explanation":"第 3 行用的是 raw，没有用减过本底的 net，本底那一步白算了。改成：\n\n```python\ndef net_ratio(raw, blank, ref):\n    net = raw - blank\n    ratio = net / ref\n    return ratio\n```\n\n也可以直接写 `return (raw - blank) / ref`，括号不能省：没有括号时会先算 `blank / ref`。判分时还会用读数等于本底、把结果接着乘 10 等例子检查。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py40.k3.r1","body":"需求：`change_pct(before, after)` 先算差值 after - before，再除以 before、乘 100，交回变化的百分比。把代码块排成这个函数，并排好缩进。有一块用不上。\n","slots":[{"id":"function","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":1,"items":[{"id":"ret_pct","code":"return pct"},{"id":"pct","code":"pct = diff / before * 100"},{"id":"def","code":"def change_pct(before, after):"},{"id":"ret_diff","code":"return diff"},{"id":"diff","code":"diff = after - before"}],"key":["def","diff","pct","ret_pct"],"indents":{"def":0,"diff":1,"pct":1,"ret_pct":1,"ret_diff":1},"tests":[{"name":"增加与减少","doctest":">>> change_pct(20, 25)\n25.0\n>>> change_pct(50, 40)\n-20.0\n"},{"name":"没有变化","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> change_pct(8, 8)\n0.0\n"}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndef change_pct(before, after):\n    diff = after - before\n    pct = diff / before * 100\n    return pct\n```\n\npct 要用到 diff，所以先算 diff；最后交回 pct。`return diff` 交回的是差值，不是百分比；而且放在 `return pct` 前面的话，后面那行就不会运行。\n"},{"id":"py40.k3.r2","body":"`tag` 给采样点生成一个标签。填写调用 `tag(\"北坡\", 30)` 时函数里各中间量的值（文字直接写，不用加引号），再写出 result。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef tag(site, depth):\n    unit = \"cm\"\n    text = site + \"-\" + str(depth)\n    full = text + unit\n    return text\n\nresult = tag(\"北坡\", 30)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"中间量"},{"id":"value","header":"调用中的值","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"unit","cells":{"name":"unit","value":"cm"}},{"id":"text","cells":{"name":"text","value":"北坡-30"}},{"id":"full","cells":{"name":"full","value":"北坡-30cm"}}]},{"id":"result","type":"text","prompt":"result 是什么？","key":"北坡-30","feedback":[{"when":"北坡-30cm","message":"带单位的 full 确实算出来了，但第 5 行交回的是 text。"}]}],"explanation":"unit 是 **cm**；text 是 site、“-”和 `str(30)` 连起来的 **北坡-30**；full 在 text 后面接上单位，是 **北坡-30cm**。\n\n第 5 行交回的是 text，所以 result 是 **北坡-30**，不带单位。full 算出来了，但没有被交回，调用结束就丢掉了。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py40.k3.x1","body":"需求：先把读数 count 乘以稀释倍数 dilution，再减去背景值 background，交回结果。哪一个函数符合需求？\n","slots":[{"id":"function","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"count_used","content":"```python\ndef adjust(count, dilution, background):\n    diluted = count * dilution\n    result = count - background\n    return result\n```\n"},{"id":"swapped","content":"```python\ndef adjust(count, dilution, background):\n    result = count - background\n    diluted = result * dilution\n    return diluted\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\ndef adjust(count, dilution, background):\n    diluted = count * dilution\n    result = diluted - background\n    return result\n```\n"},{"id":"wrong_return","content":"```python\ndef adjust(count, dilution, background):\n    diluted = count * dilution\n    result = diluted - background\n    return diluted\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"先算 `diluted = count * dilution`、再算 `result = diluted - background`、交回 result 的那一个符合需求。\n\n从 return 倒着追就能看出另外几个的问题：有一个算了 diluted 却用 count 去减，稀释倍数白算了；有一个先减后乘，背景值也被放大了；还有一个减完了却交回 diluted。\n"},{"id":"py40.k3.x2","body":"`boxes_needed` 想算出：一共有 samples 份样本，每盒装 per_box 份，需要几个盒子。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef boxes_needed(samples, per_box):\n    full = samples // per_box\n    left = samples % per_box\n    boxes = full + 1\n    return boxes\n\nn = boxes_needed(20, 5)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","prompt":"填写调用 `boxes_needed(20, 5)` 时各中间量的值。","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"中间量"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"full","cells":{"name":"full","value":4}},{"id":"left","cells":{"name":"left","value":0}},{"id":"boxes","cells":{"name":"boxes","value":5}}]},{"id":"actual","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"20 份样本、每盒 5 份，实际需要几个盒子？","key":4},{"id":"correct","type":"choice","prompt":"这次调用交回的 n 对吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"对，交回的就是需要的盒数"},{"id":"no","content":"不对，left 是 0 时不需要多加一个盒子"}],"key":"no"}],"explanation":"full = 20 // 5 = **4**，left = 20 % 5 = **0**，boxes = 4 + 1 = **5**，n 是 5。\n\n可 20 份正好装满 **4** 个盒子，交回的 5 **不对**。left 这个中间量算出来了，却没有被用到：只有 left 大于 0 时才需要多加一个盒子。追踪中间量时，留意哪个算出来的值根本没有流向结果。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py41","title":"函数的默认值和作用范围","summary":"读懂默认参数在省略时怎样补上；分清函数里的局部名字和外面的同名名字；记住没有 return 的函数交回 None。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py40","py03"],"intro":"上一节读了自己定义的函数。这一节看三处容易读错的地方：调用时少写了一个实参，函数用的是哪个值；函数里和外面有同名的名字，改的是谁；函数最后一行算出了值，却没有 return，调用处拿到什么。\n","wrapup":"读一次调用时，可以连着问三句：没写的实参用了哪个默认值？函数里赋值的名字是不是只在函数里？每条路径最后有没有 return？\n\n这三句也适合拿来问 AI：“这个参数省略时默认是多少？这个函数会不会改到外面的变量？哪条路径会交回 None？”\n","kps":[{"id":"py41.k1","title":"默认参数用于省略输入","key":["py40","py04"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"默认参数","aliases":["默认值","省略参数"],"definition":"定义时写成“形参=值”，调用时省略这个实参就用默认值；给了实参（按位置或按名字），就用给的值。","conditions":["位置实参从左往右依次给形参：label(15) 里的 15 给的是 signal，不是 limit。","带默认值的形参写在不带默认值的后面；不带默认值的形参调用时必须给。"],"example":"```python\ndef label(signal, limit=10):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n```\nlabel(10) 省略 limit，用默认值 10，交回“达标”；label(10, 12) 里 limit 是 12，交回“未达标”。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"`label(signal, limit)` 每次都要写两个实参。如果大多数分析都用同一个阈值 10，可以在定义时给 limit 一个**默认值**：\n\n```python\ndef label(signal, limit=10):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n调用时：\n\n- `label(12)`：只给了一个实参，它按位置交给 signal；limit 没有给，就用默认值 10。\n- `label(12, 15)`：第二个实参按位置交给 limit，默认值不用。\n- `label(12, limit=15)`：按名字给 limit，同样不用默认值。\n\n默认值只在省略时才用。没有默认值的形参必须给：`label()` 没给 signal，会报 TypeError。定义时，带默认值的形参要写在不带默认值的后面。\n\n读别人的调用时，先数实参：位置实参从左往右依次给形参，按名字给的对号入座，剩下没给的形参才用默认值。最容易读错的是只写一个数的调用：`label(15)` 里的 15 给的是 signal，阈值仍是默认的 10。\n","example":{"id":"py41.k1.e0","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef label(signal, limit=10):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n\nprint(label(10))\nprint(label(10, 12))\nprint(label(signal=13, limit=12))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"calls","type":"table","prompt":"填写每次调用时 limit 的值，以及显示的结果。","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"limit","header":"limit","input":"integer"},{"id":"result","header":"显示","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"pass","label":"达标"},{"id":"fail","label":"未达标"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c6","cells":{"call":"第 6 行","limit":10,"result":"pass"}},{"id":"c7","cells":{"call":"第 7 行","limit":12,"result":"fail"}},{"id":"c8","cells":{"call":"第 8 行","limit":12,"result":"pass"}}]}],"explanation":"| 调用 | signal | limit | 显示 |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| 第 6 行 | 10 | 10（默认值） | 达标 |\n| 第 7 行 | 10 | 12 | 未达标 |\n| 第 8 行 | 13 | 12 | 达标 |\n\n第 6 行只给了一个实参，limit 用默认值 10，10 >= 10 成立。第 7 行按位置给了 limit，默认值不用。第 8 行按名字给了两个形参，13 >= 12 成立。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py41.k1.q1","body":"`to_mm` 把长度换算成毫米，unit 省略时按厘米算。\n\n```python\ndef to_mm(value, unit=\"cm\"):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        return value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        return value * 1000\n    return value\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","prompt":"填写每次调用交回的数。","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"result","header":"交回","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"to_mm(3)","result":30}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"to_mm(3, \"m\")","result":3000}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"call":"to_mm(unit=\"mm\", value=3)","result":3}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"call":"to_mm(2, unit=\"cm\")","result":20}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **30、3000、3、20**。`to_mm(3)` 省略 unit，按默认的 \"cm\" 乘 10；`to_mm(3, \"m\")` 按位置给了 \"m\"；`to_mm(unit=\"mm\", value=3)` 两个都按名字给，\"mm\" 不是 \"cm\" 也不是 \"m\"，走到最后原样交回 3；`to_mm(2, unit=\"cm\")` 明写了默认值，结果和省略一样。\n"},{"id":"py41.k1.q2","body":"```python\ndef label(signal, limit=10):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n同事想用阈值 15 判断 signal 为 12 的样本，写成了 `label(15)`。\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"choice","prompt":"`label(15)` 交回什么？","options":[{"id":"pass","content":"达标"},{"id":"fail","content":"未达标"}],"key":"pass"},{"id":"calls","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"下面哪些写法才是“用阈值 15 判断 signal 为 12”？选出所有正确的。","options":[{"id":"positional","content":"`label(12, 15)`"},{"id":"swapped","content":"`label(15, 12)`"},{"id":"limit_only","content":"`label(limit=15)`"},{"id":"keyword","content":"`label(12, limit=15)`"}],"key":["positional","keyword"]}],"explanation":"`label(15)` 交回 **达标**：15 按位置给了 signal，limit 仍用默认值 10，15 >= 10。\n\n正确的写法是 **`label(12, 15)`** 和 **`label(12, limit=15)`**。`label(15, 12)` 把两个数给反了；`label(limit=15)` 没给 signal，会报 TypeError。\n"},{"id":"py41.k1.q3","body":"需求：大多数样本的本底是 0。希望调用 `net_signal` 时可以省略 blank，省略就按 0 算；给了 blank 就照常减去。\n\n作答框里是现在的函数，省略 blank 会报 TypeError。请改动它并提交。\n\n```python\n>>> net_signal(12, 3)\n9\n>>> net_signal(12)\n12\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"def net_signal(raw, blank):\n    return raw - blank\n","solution":"def net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    return raw - blank\n","rejects":[{"code":"def net_signal(raw, blank=3):\n    return raw - blank\n","why":"默认值写成了 3，不是 0"},{"code":"def net_signal(blank=0, raw=0):\n    return raw - blank\n","why":"把形参的顺序换了，位置实参给错了形参"},{"code":"def net_signal(raw=0, blank):\n    return raw - blank\n","why":"带默认值的形参写在了不带默认值的前面，语法错误"}],"tests":[{"name":"需求给出的例子","doctest":">>> net_signal(12, 3)\n9\n>>> net_signal(12)\n12\n"},{"name":"按名字给","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> net_signal(raw=8)\n8\n>>> net_signal(5, blank=2)\n3\n"}]}],"explanation":"只要给 blank 加上默认值 0：\n\n```python\ndef net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    return raw - blank\n```\n\n形参的顺序不能变：调用 `net_signal(12, 3)` 时，12 仍要给 raw、3 给 blank。带默认值的形参要写在后面，写成 `def net_signal(raw=0, blank):` 是语法错误。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py41.k1.r1","body":"`per_hour` 把一段时间里的计数换算成每小时的次数，minutes 省略时按 60 分钟算。\n\n```python\ndef per_hour(count, minutes=60):\n    return count * 60 // minutes\n```\n\n下面哪些调用交回的结果和 `per_hour(30)` **一定相同**？选出所有的。\n","slots":[{"id":"same","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"explicit","content":"`per_hour(30, 60)`"},{"id":"swapped","content":"`per_hour(60, 30)`"},{"id":"keyword","content":"`per_hour(minutes=60, count=30)`"},{"id":"half","content":"`per_hour(30, minutes=30)`"},{"id":"count_only","content":"`per_hour(count=30)`"}],"key":["explicit","keyword","count_only"]}],"explanation":"`per_hour(30)` 里 count 是 30，minutes 用默认值 60。和它相同的是：**`per_hour(30, 60)`**（明写默认值）、**`per_hour(minutes=60, count=30)`**（按名字给，顺序无关）、**`per_hour(count=30)`**（同样省略 minutes）。\n\n`per_hour(60, 30)` 让 count 是 60、minutes 是 30，交回 120；`per_hour(30, minutes=30)` 改了 minutes，交回 60。它们交给函数的输入和 `per_hour(30)` 不同，结果也就不同。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n"},{"id":"py41.k1.r2","body":"```python\ndef mark(value, low=5, high=10):\n    if value < low:\n        return \"偏低\"\n    elif value > high:\n        return \"偏高\"\n    return \"正常\"\n```\n\n填写每次调用时 low、high 的值和交回的结果。\n","slots":[{"id":"calls","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"low","header":"low","input":"integer"},{"id":"high","header":"high","input":"integer"},{"id":"result","header":"交回","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"low","label":"偏低"},{"id":"high","label":"偏高"},{"id":"ok","label":"正常"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"mark(7)","low":5,"high":10,"result":"ok"}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"mark(7, 8)","low":8,"high":10,"result":"low"}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"call":"mark(7, high=6)","low":5,"high":6,"result":"high"}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"call":"mark(4, low=3)","low":3,"high":10,"result":"ok"}}]}],"explanation":"- `mark(7)`：low、high 都用默认值 5 和 10，7 在中间，**正常**。\n- `mark(7, 8)`：第二个位置实参给 low，low 是 8，high 仍是 10；7 < 8，**偏低**。\n- `mark(7, high=6)`：low 用默认值 5，high 是 6；7 > 6，**偏高**。\n- `mark(4, low=3)`：low 是 3，high 用默认值 10；4 不低于 3 也不高于 10，**正常**。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py41.k1.x1","body":"`deep` 判断一个采样点算不算深层：strict 为 True 时要求严格超过 limit，否则达到 limit 就算。\n\n```python\ndef deep(depth, limit=30, strict=False):\n    if strict:\n        return depth > limit\n    return depth >= limit\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"calls","type":"table","prompt":"填写每次调用时 limit 的值和交回的结果。","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"limit","header":"limit","input":"integer"},{"id":"result","header":"交回","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"deep(30)","limit":30,"result":true}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"deep(30, strict=True)","limit":30,"result":false}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"call":"deep(30, 35)","limit":35,"result":false}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"call":"deep(limit=25, depth=30)","limit":25,"result":true}}]}],"explanation":"- `deep(30)`：limit 30、strict False，30 >= 30，**True**。\n- `deep(30, strict=True)`：limit 仍是默认的 30，但要求严格超过，30 > 30 不成立，**False**。\n- `deep(30, 35)`：第二个位置实参给 limit，30 >= 35 不成立，**False**。\n- `deep(limit=25, depth=30)`：按名字给，30 >= 25，**True**。\n"},{"id":"py41.k1.x2","body":"函数体是 `return count / minutes`，要让下面三次调用都按注释工作：\n\n```python\nper_minute(120)                   # minutes 省略时按 60 算，交回 2.0\nper_minute(30, 10)                # 交回 3.0\nper_minute(minutes=5, count=20)   # 交回 4.0\n```\n\n函数的第一行应写成哪一种？\n","slots":[{"id":"header","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"swapped","content":"`def per_minute(minutes, count=60):`"},{"id":"no_default","content":"`def per_minute(count, minutes):`"},{"id":"right","content":"`def per_minute(count, minutes=60):`"},{"id":"default_first","content":"`def per_minute(minutes=60, count):`"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"**`def per_minute(count, minutes=60):`**。第一个位置实参要给 count，minutes 省略时才用 60。\n\n把 minutes 写在前面时，`per_minute(120)` 会让 minutes 成为 120；不给 minutes 默认值，`per_minute(120)` 报 TypeError；带默认值的形参写在不带默认值的前面，是语法错误。\n"}]},{"id":"py41.k2","title":"局部名称与外部名称的区别","key":["py40","py01"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"局部名字","aliases":["局部变量","作用范围"],"definition":"函数里赋值的名字（包括形参）只属于这一次调用，和外面同名的名字互不影响；函数里没赋值的名字才到外面去找。","conditions":["调用结束后局部名字就不在了，在外面用它会报 NameError。","函数里只要给某个名字赋值，它在整个函数里都是局部的；先读后赋值会报 UnboundLocalError。"],"example":"```python\nlimit = 10\n\ndef label(signal):\n    limit = 12\n    ...\n```\n函数里的 limit = 12 只属于这次调用，用 12 判断；调用之后外面的 limit 仍是 10。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"函数里赋值的名字是**局部**的：它在这次调用里新建，调用结束就消失，和函数外面同名的名字互不相干。\n\n```python\nlimit = 10\n\ndef label(signal):\n    limit = 12\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n函数里的 `limit = 12` 新建了一个只属于这次调用的 limit，判断时用 12；外面的 limit 仍是 10。形参也是局部名字：调用时接收实参，调用结束就消失。\n\n函数里**没有赋值**的名字，会到外面去找：\n\n```python\nblank = 2\n\ndef net(raw):\n    return raw - blank\n```\n\n这里的 blank 读的是外面的 blank，而且是**调用那一刻**的值。外面后来改了 blank，下次调用就用新值。这样写容易出错，结果取决于调用之前外面发生过什么；更清楚的写法是把 blank 也写成形参，调用时传进来。\n\n两种常见的报错：\n\n- 在函数外面用函数里的局部名字：报 NameError，外面从来没有这个名字。\n- 函数里先读一个名字、后面又给它赋值，例如 `count = count + 1`：Python 认定它是局部名字，读的时候它还没有值，报 UnboundLocalError。想更新外面的值，就把值传进去，再用 return 交回来：`count = add_one(count)`。\n","example":{"id":"py41.k2.e0","body":"```python startLine=1\nlimit = 10\n\ndef label(signal):\n    limit = 12\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n\nresult = label(11)\nprint(result)\nprint(limit)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"inside","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"调用 `label(11)` 时，第 5 行比较用的 limit 是多少？","key":12},{"id":"line1","type":"choice","prompt":"第 10 行显示什么？","options":[{"id":"pass","content":"达标"},{"id":"fail","content":"未达标"}],"key":"fail"},{"id":"line2","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 11 行显示什么？","key":10,"feedback":[{"when":12,"message":"第 4 行的 limit 只属于那一次调用，外面的 limit 没有被改。"}]}],"explanation":"调用时，第 4 行新建了函数自己的 limit，比较用的是 **12**；11 >= 12 不成立，交回 **未达标**。\n\n调用结束，函数里的 limit 消失了。第 11 行显示的是外面的 limit，第 1 行赋的 **10**，从来没有被改过。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py41.k2.q1","body":"```python startLine=1\nblank = 2\n\ndef net(raw):\n    return raw - blank\n\na = net(9)\nblank = 5\nb = net(9)\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":7},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":7,"message":"net 每次调用时才去外面读 blank；第 8 行调用时 blank 已经是 5。"}]},{"id":"when","type":"choice","prompt":"net 里的 blank 读的是什么时候的值？","options":[{"id":"define","content":"定义函数（第 3 行）那一刻外面的 blank"},{"id":"call","content":"每次调用那一刻外面的 blank"}],"key":"call"}],"explanation":"显示 **7** 和 **4**。net 里没有给 blank 赋值，所以去外面找，而且是在**每次调用那一刻**去读：第 6 行调用时 blank 是 2，第 8 行调用时已经是 5。\n\n同样的 `net(9)` 两次结果不同，原因藏在函数外面。把 blank 写成形参、调用时明着传进去，就不会这样。\n"},{"id":"py41.k2.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef net(raw, blank):\n    result = raw - blank\n    return result\n\nvalue = net(10, 4)\nprint(value)\nprint(result)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"outcome","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"twice","content":"显示两次 6"},{"id":"none","content":"先显示 6，再显示 None"},{"id":"error","content":"显示 6 之后，第 7 行报 NameError"},{"id":"early","content":"第 6 行就报错，什么也不显示"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"第 6 行显示 **6**。result 是函数里的局部名字，调用结束就不在了，外面从来没有 result 这个名字，所以**第 7 行报 NameError**。结果已经通过 return 交给了 value，在外面用 value 就行。\n"},{"id":"py41.k2.q3","body":"同事想每处理一份样本，就让外面的 count 加 1。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncount = 0\n\ndef add_sample():\n    count = count + 1\n    return count\n\nadd_sample()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"choice","prompt":"运行这段程序会怎样？","options":[{"id":"works","content":"不报错，外面的 count 变成 1"},{"id":"unbound","content":"第 4 行报 UnboundLocalError"},{"id":"type","content":"第 4 行报 TypeError"}],"key":"unbound"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一种改法运行后外面的 count 是 1？","options":[{"id":"no_return","content":"```python\ncount = 0\n\ndef add_sample(count):\n    count = count + 1\n\nadd_sample(count)\n```\n"},{"id":"pass_back","content":"```python\ncount = 0\n\ndef add_sample(count):\n    return count + 1\n\ncount = add_sample(count)\n```\n"},{"id":"new_name","content":"```python\ncount = 0\n\ndef add_sample():\n    new = count + 1\n\nadd_sample()\n```\n"}],"key":"pass_back"}],"explanation":"第 4 行给 count 赋值，所以整个函数里 count 都是局部名字；可是右边要先读 count，这时局部的 count 还没有值，于是**报 UnboundLocalError**。\n\n把 count 作为形参传进去、用 return 交回、再在外面赋值：`count = add_sample(count)`，外面的 count 才变成 1。只在函数里改形参不 return，外面不变；另起一个名字 new 也只是局部的。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py41.k2.r1","body":"```python startLine=1\nx = 5\n\ndef change(x):\n    x = x * 2\n    return x\n\ny = change(x)\nz = change(y)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"values","type":"table","prompt":"程序运行完后，外面的 x、y、z 各是多少？","columns":[{"id":"name","header":"名字"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"x","cells":{"name":"x","value":5}},{"id":"y","cells":{"name":"y","value":10}},{"id":"z","cells":{"name":"z","value":20}}]}],"explanation":"x 仍是 **5**。形参 x 和函数里的 `x = x * 2` 都是局部的：第 7 行调用时，局部的 x 接收 5、变成 10 后交回，外面的 x 没被碰过。y 是 **10**；第 8 行把 10 传进去，交回 20，z 是 **20**。\n"},{"id":"py41.k2.r2","body":"```python startLine=1\ntotal = 100\n\ndef share(n):\n    part = total // n\n    return part\n\na = share(4)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"a","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序运行完，a 是多少？","key":25},{"id":"source","type":"choice","prompt":"share 里的 total 是从哪里来的？","options":[{"id":"outside","content":"函数里没有给 total 赋值，读的是外面的 total"},{"id":"param","content":"total 是 share 的形参"},{"id":"local","content":"total 是 share 自己新建的局部名字"}],"key":"outside"},{"id":"after","type":"choice","prompt":"在程序末尾加一行 `print(part)`，会怎样？","options":[{"id":"shows","content":"显示 25"},{"id":"none","content":"显示 None"},{"id":"error","content":"报 NameError"}],"key":"error"}],"explanation":"a 是 **25**。share 里没有给 total 赋值，也没有叫 total 的形参，所以**读的是外面的 total**（100），100 // 4 = 25。part 是函数里赋值的局部名字，调用结束就不在了，在外面 `print(part)` **报 NameError**。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py41.k2.x1","body":"```python startLine=1\nn = 1\n\ndef bump(n):\n    n = n + 10\n    return n\n\nprint(bump(n))\nprint(n)\nprint(bump(5) + n)\nm = bump(n)\nprint(m)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"table","prompt":"按顺序填写显示的四行。","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"输出的第几行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","shown":11}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":1}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":16}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":11}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **11、1、16、11**。bump 里的 n 是形参，是局部名字：每次调用它接收实参、加 10 后交回，外面的 n 始终是 1。所以第 8 行显示 1，第 9 行是 15 + 1 = 16，第 10 行又把 1 传进去，m 是 11。\n"},{"id":"py41.k2.x2","body":"有人以为调用 `reset()` 能把外面的 level 清零。\n\n```python startLine=1\nlevel = 7\n\ndef reset():\n    level = 0\n\nreset()\nprint(level)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"显示什么？","key":7},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一种写法运行后外面的 level 是 0？","options":[{"id":"param","content":"```python\nlevel = 7\n\ndef reset(level):\n    level = 0\n\nreset(level)\n```\n"},{"id":"call_only","content":"```python\nlevel = 7\n\ndef reset():\n    level = 0\n    return level\n\nreset()\n```\n"},{"id":"assign_back","content":"```python\nlevel = 7\n\ndef reset():\n    return 0\n\nlevel = reset()\n```\n"}],"key":"assign_back"}],"explanation":"显示 **7**。第 4 行的 `level = 0` 新建的是 reset 自己的局部名字，调用结束就消失了，外面的 level 没被改。\n\n要改外面的 level，就让函数交回 0，再在外面赋值：`level = reset()`。把 level 当形参传进去再改，改的仍是局部名字；函数交回了 0，但调用处没有接住它，外面也不变。\n"}]},{"id":"py41.k3","title":"Python 不自动返回最后一个表达式","key":["py40","py03"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"没有 return 得到 None","aliases":["None","缺少 return"],"definition":"Python 函数只交回 return 后面的值；运行到函数体末尾都没遇到 return，就交回 None，最后一行算出的值不会自动交回。","conditions":["错误常在后面才露面：拿 None 去计算会报 TypeError。","有分支时逐条路径检查，每条路径都要有 return。"],"example":"```python\ndef net(raw, blank):\n    raw - blank\n\nvalue = net(10, 3)\n```\nraw - blank 算出了 7，但没有 return，value 是 None。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"有些工具会把函数最后一行算出的值当作结果交回；Python 不会。Python 的函数只交回 `return` 后面的值；运行到函数体末尾都没有遇到 `return`，就交回 **None**。\n\n```python\ndef net(raw, blank):\n    raw - blank\n```\n\n`raw - blank` 算出来了，可是没有交给任何人，算完就丢掉。`value = net(10, 3)` 让 value 指向 None。\n\n这类错误常常不在函数里露面，而是在后面：`value + 1` 报 TypeError，因为 None 不能做加法。看到报错信息里提到 NoneType，就回头找给这个名字赋值的那次调用，看函数有没有 return。\n\n函数里有分支时，要逐条路径检查：if/elif/else 里只要有一条路径没有 return，走到那条路径时就交回 None。只写 `print(...)` 也一样，显示出来不等于交回。\n","example":{"id":"py41.k3.e0","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef net(raw, blank):\n    raw - blank\n\nvalue = net(10, 3)\nprint(value)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"显示什么？","key":"None","feedback":[{"when":"7","message":"第 2 行算出了 7，但没有 return，这个值没有交回。"}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行改成哪一行，程序才显示 7？","options":[{"id":"print","content":"`print(raw - blank)`"},{"id":"assign","content":"`value = raw - blank`"},{"id":"return","content":"`return raw - blank`"}],"key":"return"}],"explanation":"显示 **None**。第 2 行算出 7 后就丢掉了：函数体运行到末尾没有遇到 return，交回 None。\n\n改成 `return raw - blank` 才把 7 交回。改成 print 只会在函数里显示 7，第 5 行仍显示 None；在函数里写 `value = ...` 赋的是局部名字，外面的 value 仍是 None。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py41.k3.q1","body":"```python\ndef label(signal, limit):\n    if signal >= limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    elif signal >= limit - 2:\n        \"接近\"\n    else:\n        return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n填写每次调用交回的值。\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"result","header":"交回","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"pass","label":"达标"},{"id":"near","label":"接近"},{"id":"fail","label":"未达标"},{"id":"none","label":"None"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"c1","cells":{"call":"label(12, 10)","result":"pass"}},{"id":"c2","cells":{"call":"label(9, 10)","result":"none"}},{"id":"c3","cells":{"call":"label(5, 10)","result":"fail"}},{"id":"c4","cells":{"call":"label(8, 10)","result":"none"}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **达标、None、未达标、None**。9 和 8 都落在 elif 那条路径上，那里只写了 `\"接近\"`，没有 return，函数走到末尾，交回 None。另外两条路径都有 return。\n"},{"id":"py41.k3.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\ndef double(x):\n    x * 2\n\na = double(4)\nb = a + 1\nprint(b)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"程序在第几行报错？","options":[{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l5","content":"第 5 行"},{"id":"l6","content":"第 6 行"}],"key":"l5"},{"id":"type","type":"choice","prompt":"报的是哪种错误？","options":[{"id":"name","content":"NameError"},{"id":"type","content":"TypeError"},{"id":"syntax","content":"SyntaxError"}],"key":"type"},{"id":"a","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"报错时 a 是什么？","key":"None"}],"explanation":"第 4 行不报错：double(4) 正常运行完，只是没有 return，a 指向 **None**。到**第 5 行**算 `None + 1` 才出问题，报 **TypeError**。\n\n错误露面的地方（第 5 行）和真正的原因（第 2 行缺 return）不在一处。\n"},{"id":"py41.k3.q3","body":"`to_mm` 想把长度换算成毫米，可现在每次都交回 None。请改动作答框里的函数，让每条路径都交回换算结果。\n\n```python\n>>> to_mm(3, \"cm\")\n30\n>>> to_mm(2, \"m\")\n2000\n>>> to_mm(7, \"mm\")\n7\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":10,"starter":"def to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        value * 1000\n    else:\n        value\n","solution":"def to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        return value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        return value * 1000\n    else:\n        return value\n","rejects":[{"code":"def to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        return value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        value * 1000\n    else:\n        value\n","why":"只给第一条路径加了 return"},{"code":"def to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        print(value * 10)\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        print(value * 1000)\n    else:\n        print(value)\n","why":"只显示不交回"},{"code":"def to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        return value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        return value * 1000\n","why":"去掉了 else，单位是 mm 时交回 None"}],"tests":[{"name":"三种单位","doctest":">>> to_mm(3, \"cm\")\n30\n>>> to_mm(2, \"m\")\n2000\n>>> to_mm(7, \"mm\")\n7\n"},{"name":"交回的值能接着算","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> to_mm(3, \"cm\") + 1\n31\n>>> to_mm(1, \"m\") + to_mm(5, \"mm\")\n1005\n"}]}],"explanation":"三条路径各加一个 return：\n\n```python\ndef to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        return value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        return value * 1000\n    else:\n        return value\n```\n\n只改成 print 不行：屏幕上看着有数，调用处拿到的仍是 None，`to_mm(3, \"cm\") + 1` 会报 TypeError。判分时会把交回的值接着计算。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py41.k3.r1","body":"下面哪些函数的调用 `f(3)` 会交回 6？选出所有的。\n","slots":[{"id":"returns","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"bare","content":"```python\ndef f(x):\n    x * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"direct","content":"```python\ndef f(x):\n    return x * 2\n```\n"},{"id":"printed","content":"```python\ndef f(x):\n    print(x * 2)\n```\n"},{"id":"via_name","content":"```python\ndef f(x):\n    y = x * 2\n    return y\n```\n"},{"id":"last_name","content":"```python\ndef f(x):\n    y = x * 2\n    y\n```\n"}],"key":["direct","via_name"]}],"explanation":"只有写了 `return` 的两个：`return x * 2`，以及先算 y 再 `return y`。\n\n只写表达式 `x * 2` 或最后一行只写 `y`，值算出来就丢掉了；`print(x * 2)` 会显示 6，但交回的是 None。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n"},{"id":"py41.k3.r2","body":"```python\ndef depth_class(depth):\n    if depth < 20:\n        return \"浅\"\n    if depth < 40:\n        \"中\"\n    if depth >= 40:\n        return \"深\"\n```\n\n下面哪些调用会交回 None？选出所有的。\n","slots":[{"id":"none","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"d10","content":"`depth_class(10)`"},{"id":"d20","content":"`depth_class(20)`"},{"id":"d39","content":"`depth_class(39)`"},{"id":"d40","content":"`depth_class(40)`"}],"key":["d20","d39"]}],"explanation":"**`depth_class(20)`** 和 **`depth_class(39)`**。这两个深度不小于 20、又小于 40，走到第二个 if 下面，那里只写了 `\"中\"`，没有 return；第三个 if 也不成立，函数走到末尾，交回 None。10 和 40 各自遇到了 return。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py41.k3.x1","body":"```python\ndef a(n):\n    return n + 1\n\ndef b(n):\n    n + 1\n\ndef c(n):\n    print(n + 1)\n```\n\n对每个函数，填写调用时传入 2 会不会在屏幕上显示东西，以及交回的值（写成 Python 显示的样子，例如 3 或 None）。\n","slots":[{"id":"calls","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"shows","header":"调用时显示东西","input":"bool"},{"id":"value","header":"交回的值","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["None"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"a","cells":{"call":"a(2)","shows":false,"value":"3"}},{"id":"b","cells":{"call":"b(2)","shows":false,"value":"None"}},{"id":"c","cells":{"call":"c(2)","shows":true,"value":"None"}}]}],"explanation":"- `a(2)`：不显示，交回 **3**。\n- `b(2)`：`n + 1` 算出 3 就丢掉了，不显示，交回 **None**。\n- `c(2)`：**显示** 3，但交回的是 **None**。\n\n屏幕上看到一个数，不代表函数交回了它；反过来，交回了值也不会自动显示。\n"},{"id":"py41.k3.x2","body":"需求：`net_signal(raw, blank=0)` 交回减去本底后的值，不在屏幕上显示任何东西。\n\n作答框里的函数只把结果显示出来，调用处拿不到。请改动它并提交。\n\n```python\n>>> net_signal(12, 2) * 2\n20\n>>> net_signal(5)\n5\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"def net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    net = raw - blank\n    print(net)\n","solution":"def net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    net = raw - blank\n    return net\n","accepts":["def net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    return raw - blank\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"def net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    net = raw - blank\n    print(net)\n    return net\n","why":"交回了，但仍在屏幕上显示"},{"code":"def net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    net = raw - blank\n    return print(net)\n","why":"交回的是 print 的结果 None"},{"code":"def net_signal(raw, blank):\n    net = raw - blank\n    return net\n","why":"去掉了 blank 的默认值"}],"tests":[{"name":"需求给出的例子","doctest":">>> net_signal(12, 2) * 2\n20\n>>> net_signal(5)\n5\n"},{"name":"交回的值接着算","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> net_signal(9, 4) + net_signal(3)\n8\n"}]}],"explanation":"把 print 换成 return：\n\n```python\ndef net_signal(raw, blank=0):\n    net = raw - blank\n    return net\n```\n\n既 print 又 return 会多显示一行，不符合“不在屏幕上显示”；`return print(net)` 交回的是 print 的结果 None。blank 的默认值 0 要保留，`net_signal(5)` 才能省略本底。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py42","title":"用小例子检查一个函数","summary":"把一条要求写成正常、边界、空输入三类“调用 → 期望”的测试，再用 assert 逐条核对，从第一条失败的断言定位差异。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py40","py12","py11"],"intro":"前面读懂了函数怎样接收输入、交回结果。这一节反过来：拿到一个函数，不管是自己写的、同事写的还是 AI 写的，怎样用几个小例子检查它符不符合要求。\n\n在“把‘处理一下’变成可核对的要求”那一节，你用正常、边界和没有结果的例子检查过一条筛选规则。这里把同样的例子写成可以反复运行的测试。\n","wrapup":"检查一个函数，先从要求里推出几条“调用 → 期望”：正常值各一个、恰好等于阈值的边界、没有数据的空输入。再把它们写成 assert，一运行就知道哪一条没通过。\n\n拿 AI 写的函数时，也可以直接要求：“请附上覆盖正常、边界和空输入的 assert 测试，期望结果按我的要求写，不要照着函数的输出抄。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py42.k1","title":"正常、边界和空输入转成测试","key":["py12","py40"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"三类测试","aliases":["测试例子","正常、边界、空输入"],"definition":"把要求写成“调用 → 期望结果”的测试：正常值各一个、恰好等于阈值的边界值、没有数据的空输入；期望从要求推出，不从函数的输出抄。","conditions":["一组测试要让常见的错误写法至少失败一条；只有普通值时，查不出 >= 写成 > 的错误。","要求没写空输入怎样处理时，先问清楚，不要按函数现在的行为补上期望。"],"example":"要求“signal 大于或等于 limit 记为达标”：label(12, 10) 期望“达标”、label(8, 10) 期望“未达标”是正常；label(10, 10) 期望“达标”是边界。mean_signal(0, 0) 期望 None 是空输入。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"一条**测试**就是一次调用，加上**按要求算出的**期望结果。要求是“signal 大于或等于 limit 记为达标，否则未达标”时：\n\n| 测试 | 调用 | 期望 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 正常（应达标） | `label(12, 10)` | \"达标\" |\n| 正常（不达标） | `label(8, 10)` | \"未达标\" |\n| 边界 | `label(10, 10)` | \"达标\" |\n\n期望要从要求里推出来，而不是先运行函数、再把它交回的东西抄成期望：那样函数错了，测试也跟着错。\n\n挑例子和检查筛选规则时一样：\n\n1. **正常**：明显该达标、明显不达标的普通值，各一个；\n2. **边界**：恰好等于阈值的值。把 `>=` 写成 `>`，只有这一条测试会失败；\n3. **空输入**：没有数据时的情况。例如 `mean_signal(total, n)` 算 n 份样本的平均信号，要求写明“没有样本（n 为 0）时交回 None”，就要有一条 `mean_signal(0, 0)` 期望 None 的测试。要求里没写空输入怎样处理时，先去问清楚，再写这条测试。\n\n一组测试好不好，看它能不能分出常见的错误写法：拿错误写法去跑，至少要有一条失败。只有 `label(12, 10)` 和 `label(8, 10)` 两条时，`>=` 和 `>` 都能全部通过，这组测试就查不出等号的问题。\n","example":{"id":"py42.k1.e0","body":"两条要求：\n\n- `label(signal, limit)`：signal 大于或等于 limit 时交回 \"达标\"，否则交回 \"未达标\"。\n- `mean_signal(total, n)`：交回 n 份样本的平均信号 total / n；没有样本（n 为 0）时交回 None。\n\n为下面四条测试填上期望结果，并说出每条属于哪一类。\n","slots":[{"id":"tests","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"expect","header":"期望","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"pass","label":"达标"},{"id":"fail","label":"未达标"},{"id":"none","label":"None"}]}},{"id":"kind","header":"类别","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"normal","label":"正常"},{"id":"boundary","label":"边界"},{"id":"empty","label":"空输入"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"t1","cells":{"call":"label(12, 10)","expect":"pass","kind":"normal"}},{"id":"t2","cells":{"call":"label(8, 10)","expect":"fail","kind":"normal"}},{"id":"t3","cells":{"call":"label(10, 10)","expect":"pass","kind":"boundary"}},{"id":"t4","cells":{"call":"mean_signal(0, 0)","expect":"none","kind":"empty"}}]}],"explanation":"| 调用 | 期望 | 类别 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `label(12, 10)` | 达标 | 正常 |\n| `label(8, 10)` | 未达标 | 正常 |\n| `label(10, 10)` | 达标 | 边界：恰好等于阈值，“大于或等于”包含它 |\n| `mean_signal(0, 0)` | None | 空输入：要求明写没有样本时交回 None |\n\n这四条期望都是从要求读出来的，题目里根本没有给函数的代码，也不需要。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py42.k1.q1","body":"要求：signal 大于或等于 limit 时交回 \"达标\"，否则交回 \"未达标\"。有人写成了：\n\n```python\ndef label(signal, limit):\n    if signal > limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n```\n\n用下面四条测试去检查它，哪些测试会失败？选出所有会失败的。\n","slots":[{"id":"failing","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"t1","content":"`label(12, 10)` 期望 \"达标\""},{"id":"t2","content":"`label(10, 10)` 期望 \"达标\""},{"id":"t3","content":"`label(9, 10)` 期望 \"未达标\""},{"id":"t4","content":"`label(20, 20)` 期望 \"达标\""}],"key":["t2","t4"]}],"explanation":"**`label(10, 10)`** 和 **`label(20, 20)`** 会失败：它们恰好等于阈值，要求说算达标，`>` 却把它们判成未达标。另外两条是普通值，`>` 和 `>=` 给出的结果一样，查不出这个错误。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n"},{"id":"py42.k1.q2","body":"同事给你的要求只有一句：“`mean_signal(total, n)` 交回 n 份样本的平均信号 total / n。”你在写测试。\n","slots":[{"id":"normal","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"按这句要求，`mean_signal(30, 4)` 的期望是多少？","key":7.5},{"id":"empty","type":"choice","prompt":"空输入 `mean_signal(0, 0)` 的期望该怎样写？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"写期望 0，没有样本就当平均值是 0","feedback":"平均值 0 和“没有样本”是两回事，要求没有授权你这样定。"},{"id":"current","content":"先运行函数，它报什么错就把什么当期望","feedback":"这是在照着函数现在的行为写测试，函数错了测试也跟着错。"},{"id":"ask","content":"先问清楚：没有样本时交回什么（例如 None），确认后再写这条测试"},{"id":"skip","content":"不写这条测试，反正很少遇到"}],"key":"ask"}],"explanation":"`mean_signal(30, 4)` 期望 **7.5**。\n\n空输入的期望要求里没写，应当**先问清楚**再写。自己定成 0，等于替对方补了一条规则；照函数现在报的错写，测试就失去了检查的意义；不写这条，最容易出问题的地方就没人看。\n"},{"id":"py42.k1.q3","body":"`label(signal, limit)` 的要求不变：signal 大于或等于 limit 时交回 \"达标\"。现在阈值 limit 取 15。\n\n请构造一条测试，让正确的写法（`>=`）通过、错误的写法（`>`）失败：填 signal 的值和这条测试的期望。\n","slots":[{"id":"signal","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"signal 取多少？","key":15},{"id":"expect","type":"choice","prompt":"这条测试的期望","options":[{"id":"pass","content":"达标"},{"id":"fail","content":"未达标"}],"key":"pass"}],"explanation":"signal 取 **15**，期望 **达标**。只有恰好等于阈值时，`>=` 和 `>` 结果不同：正确写法交回达标，错误写法交回未达标，测试就会失败。取 16、14 这样的值，两种写法结果一样，查不出问题。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py42.k1.r1","body":"要求：`is_deep(depth)` 在深度**超过** 30 厘米时交回 True，恰好 30 不算，交回 False。\n\n担心有人把它写成了 `return depth >= 30`。哪一组测试能查出这个错误？\n","slots":[{"id":"tests","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"far","content":"`is_deep(35)` 期望 True；`is_deep(10)` 期望 False"},{"id":"above","content":"`is_deep(40)` 期望 True；`is_deep(31)` 期望 True"},{"id":"boundary","content":"`is_deep(30)` 期望 False；`is_deep(35)` 期望 True"},{"id":"below","content":"`is_deep(29)` 期望 False；`is_deep(20)` 期望 False"}],"key":"boundary"}],"explanation":"含有 **`is_deep(30)` 期望 False** 的那一组。错误写法 `depth >= 30` 会把 30 判成 True，这条测试失败。其余几组都只有离 30 远的值或 31、29 这样的普通值，`>=` 和 `>` 结果一样，全部通过，查不出问题。\n"},{"id":"py42.k1.r2","body":"要求：`rate(count, minutes)` 交回每分钟的次数 count / minutes；没有观察时间（minutes 为 0）时交回 None。\n\n按要求填写下面每条测试的期望（写成 Python 显示的样子，例如 2.0 或 None），并说出类别。\n","slots":[{"id":"tests","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"call","header":"调用"},{"id":"expect","header":"期望","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["None"]}},{"id":"kind","header":"类别","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"normal","label":"正常"},{"id":"empty","label":"空输入"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"t1","cells":{"call":"rate(30, 10)","expect":"3.0","kind":"normal"}},{"id":"t2","cells":{"call":"rate(0, 5)","expect":"0.0","kind":"normal"}},{"id":"t3","cells":{"call":"rate(5, 0)","expect":"None","kind":"empty"}}]}],"explanation":"- `rate(30, 10)`：30 / 10 = **3.0**，正常。\n- `rate(0, 5)`：观察了 5 分钟，一次也没有，每分钟 **0.0** 次。这是正常的结果，不是空输入。\n- `rate(5, 0)`：没有观察时间，要求说交回 **None**，这是空输入。\n\n“计数为 0”和“没有观察时间”要分开：前者有确定的答案 0.0，后者要按要求交回 None。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py42.k1.x1","body":"要求：`in_range(value, low, high)` 在 value 介于 low 和 high 之间时交回 True，**两端都算**；否则交回 False。\n\n同事先写了函数：\n\n```python\ndef in_range(value, low, high):\n    return value > low and value < high\n```\n\n然后运行函数，把运行出来的结果抄成了期望，得到四条测试：\n\n| 测试 | 调用 | 同事写的期望 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `in_range(7, 5, 10)` | True |\n| 2 | `in_range(5, 5, 10)` | False |\n| 3 | `in_range(10, 5, 10)` | False |\n| 4 | `in_range(11, 5, 10)` | False |\n","slots":[{"id":"passes","type":"choice","prompt":"这个函数能通过这四条测试吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"能，四条的期望都和函数交回的一样"},{"id":"no","content":"不能，有测试会失败"}],"key":"yes"},{"id":"tests","type":"table","prompt":"按要求（两端都算），每条测试的期望对吗？","columns":[{"id":"test","header":"测试"},{"id":"ok","header":"期望符合要求","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"t1","cells":{"test":"测试 1：in_range(7, 5, 10) 期望 True","ok":true}},{"id":"t2","cells":{"test":"测试 2：in_range(5, 5, 10) 期望 False","ok":false}},{"id":"t3","cells":{"test":"测试 3：in_range(10, 5, 10) 期望 False","ok":false}},{"id":"t4","cells":{"test":"测试 4：in_range(11, 5, 10) 期望 False","ok":true}}]},{"id":"verdict","type":"choice","prompt":"四条测试都通过，能说明这个函数符合要求吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"能，测试都通过了"},{"id":"copied","content":"不能：期望是照着函数的输出抄的，函数错了，测试也跟着错"}],"key":"copied"}],"explanation":"函数写成了 `value > low and value < high`，两端都不算。同事把它的输出抄成期望，所以四条测试都能通过。\n\n可是要求是**两端都算**：5 和 10 恰好落在两端，应当交回 True。测试 2、3 的期望写成 False，正是照着函数的输出抄的，与要求矛盾。7 在中间、11 在外面，两种写法答案一样，所以测试 1、4 没有问题。\n\n期望要从要求推出来，不能照着函数的输出抄：测试通过只说明函数和测试一致，不说明函数符合要求。\n"},{"id":"py42.k1.x2","body":"要求：`mean_signal(total, n)` 交回 n 份样本的平均信号 total / n；没有样本（n 为 0）时交回 None。两个人分别写了：\n\n```python\ndef mean_a(total, n):\n    return total / n\n\ndef mean_b(total, n):\n    if total == 0:\n        return None\n    return total / n\n```\n\n对每条测试，填写两个实现能不能通过（交回的值等于期望才算通过，报错算不通过）。\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"test","header":"测试"},{"id":"a","header":"甲（mean_a）通过","input":"bool"},{"id":"b","header":"乙（mean_b）通过","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"t1","cells":{"test":"调用 (30, 3)，期望 10.0","a":true,"b":true}},{"id":"t2","cells":{"test":"调用 (0, 4)，期望 0.0","a":true,"b":false}},{"id":"t3","cells":{"test":"调用 (0, 0)，期望 None","a":false,"b":true}}]}],"explanation":"- (30, 3)：两个都交回 10.0，都通过。\n- (0, 4)：四份样本的总信号是 0，平均就是 0.0。甲交回 0.0，通过；乙看到 total 为 0 就交回 None，**不通过**。\n- (0, 0)：甲算 0 / 0 报 ZeroDivisionError，**不通过**；乙交回 None，通过。\n\n甲漏了空输入，乙把“总信号为 0”错当成了“没有样本”。只用正常测试，两个都看不出问题；正常值 0.0 和空输入各有一条测试，才把两种错误都查出来。\n"}]},{"id":"py42.k2","title":"assert 表达期望并在失败时定位差异","key":["py40","py11"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"assert 断言","aliases":["AssertionError","断言"],"definition":"`assert 条件` 在条件为 True 时什么也不做；为 False 时报 AssertionError 并停在这一行，逗号后的说明一起显示。","conditions":["第一条失败的 assert 就让程序停下，它前面的都通过了，后面的不再运行。","assert 用于练习和自查；python -O 会跳过它，不拿它检查正式输入的数据。"],"example":"```python\nassert label(12, 10) == \"达标\"\nassert label(8, 10) == \"未达标\"\nassert label(10, 10) == \"达标\", \"等于阈值也算达标\"\n```\n函数把 >= 写成了 >，前两条通过，第三条报 AssertionError，并显示“等于阈值也算达标”。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"测试表写好了，可以让 Python 替你逐条核对。`assert 条件` 的意思是“我断定这个条件成立”：\n\n```python\nassert label(12, 10) == \"达标\"\n```\n\n- 条件为 True：什么也不发生，不显示任何东西，程序接着往下走；\n- 条件为 False：报 **AssertionError**，程序停在这一行，后面的行都不运行。\n\n一条测试写成一行 `assert 调用 == 期望`。期望是 None 时写 `assert mean_signal(0, 0) is None`：判断一个值是不是 None，习惯用 `is None`。\n\n逗号后面可以加一句说明，失败时随错误一起显示，告诉读的人这一条在查什么：\n\n```python\nassert label(10, 10) == \"达标\", \"等于阈值也算达标\"\n```\n\n失败时这样定位：\n\n1. 看报错指向哪一行，就知道哪一条测试没通过；它前面的 assert 都通过了。\n2. 单独运行那一行里的调用，例如 `print(label(10, 10))`，看函数实际交回了什么，和期望对比。\n3. 回到函数里，追是哪条路径、哪个中间量出了问题。也可能是测试的期望写错了：拿要求再核对一遍，不要改测试去迁就函数。\n\nassert 适合练习和自查。用 `python -O` 运行时，Python 会跳过所有 assert；所以不要拿它检查正式输入的数据是否合格，那要用一直会运行的检查。\n","example":{"id":"py42.k2.e0","body":"要求：signal 大于或等于 limit 时交回 \"达标\"，否则交回 \"未达标\"。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef label(signal, limit):\n    if signal > limit:\n        return \"达标\"\n    return \"未达标\"\n\nassert label(12, 10) == \"达标\"\nassert label(8, 10) == \"未达标\"\nassert label(10, 10) == \"达标\", \"等于阈值也算达标\"\nprint(\"全部通过\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序停在第几行？","key":8},{"id":"shown","type":"choice","prompt":"会显示“全部通过”吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"会"},{"id":"no","content":"不会"}],"key":"no"},{"id":"actual","type":"choice","prompt":"`label(10, 10)` 实际交回什么？","options":[{"id":"pass","content":"达标"},{"id":"fail","content":"未达标"}],"key":"fail"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"按要求，应该改哪里？","options":[{"id":"expect","content":"把第 8 行的期望改成 \"未达标\"","feedback":"这是改测试去迁就函数；要求明说等于阈值算达标。"},{"id":"condition","content":"把第 2 行改成 `if signal >= limit:`"},{"id":"always","content":"把第 4 行改成 `return \"达标\"`","feedback":"那样什么都算达标，第 7 行的测试就会失败。"}],"key":"condition"}],"explanation":"第 6、7 行的 assert 条件成立，什么也不显示。第 **8** 行失败：`label(10, 10)` 实际交回 **未达标**，不等于期望的“达标”，于是报 AssertionError，并显示说明“等于阈值也算达标”。程序停在这里，“全部通过”**不会**显示。\n\n对照要求，错的是函数：第 2 行的 `>` 不包含等号，应改成 `>=`。改测试的期望是迁就函数；让第 4 行也交回“达标”会让不达标的样本也算达标。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py42.k2.q1","body":"`net(raw, blank)` 应当交回 raw 减去 blank，有人把减号写成了加号。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef net(raw, blank):\n    return raw + blank\n\nassert net(5, 0) == 5\nassert net(9, 4) == 5\nassert net(3, 3) == 0\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"stop","type":"choice","prompt":"程序停在哪一行？","options":[{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l5","content":"第 5 行"},{"id":"l6","content":"第 6 行"},{"id":"none","content":"不会停，全部通过"}],"key":"l5"},{"id":"ran6","type":"choice","prompt":"第 6 行的 assert 运行了吗？","options":[{"id":"yes","content":"运行了"},{"id":"no","content":"没有运行"}],"key":"no"},{"id":"blind","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一条测试无论写加号还是减号都会通过，查不出这个错误？","options":[{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"},{"id":"l5","content":"第 5 行"},{"id":"l6","content":"第 6 行"}],"key":"l4"}],"explanation":"第 4 行 `net(5, 0)`：blank 是 0，5 + 0 和 5 - 0 都是 5，通过，所以这条**查不出**加减写反。第 **5** 行 `net(9, 4)` 实际交回 13，不等于 5，报 AssertionError，程序停下，第 6 行**没有运行**。\n\n本底为 0 的例子看着正常，却分不出加减；挑测试时要选能让错误写法露馅的值。\n"},{"id":"py42.k2.q2","body":"要求：signal 大于或等于 limit 时交回 \"达标\"。现有的测试只有：\n\n```python\nassert label(12, 10) == \"达标\"\nassert label(5, 10) == \"未达标\"\n```\n\n有人把条件写成了 `signal > limit`，这两条都通过了。再加哪一条 assert，就能查出这个错误？\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"high","content":"`assert label(15, 10) == \"达标\"`","feedback":"15 离阈值很远，`>` 和 `>=` 都交回达标。"},{"id":"wrong_expect","content":"`assert label(10, 10) == \"未达标\"`","feedback":"按要求，10 等于阈值应当达标，这条测试的期望写错了。"},{"id":"boundary","content":"`assert label(10, 10) == \"达标\"`"},{"id":"low","content":"`assert label(9, 10) == \"未达标\"`"}],"key":"boundary"}],"explanation":"加 **`assert label(10, 10) == \"达标\"`**。恰好等于阈值的这一条，正确写法通过、`>` 的写法失败。15 和 9 都不在边界上，两种写法结果一样；期望写成“未达标”的那条违背了要求，反而会让正确的函数失败。\n"},{"id":"py42.k2.q3","body":"要求：`mean_signal(total, n)` 交回 n 份样本的平均信号 total / n；没有样本（n 为 0）时交回 None。\n\n作答框里是现在的函数和三条测试。运行时第三条测试没有通过：调用 `mean_signal(0, 0)` 时就报了 ZeroDivisionError，还没走到比较。请改函数，让三条测试全部通过；测试本身不要改。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":12,"starter":"def mean_signal(total, n):\n    return total / n\n\nassert mean_signal(30, 3) == 10\nassert mean_signal(7, 2) == 3.5\nassert mean_signal(0, 0) is None, \"没有样本时交回 None\"\n","solution":"def mean_signal(total, n):\n    if n == 0:\n        return None\n    return total / n\n\nassert mean_signal(30, 3) == 10\nassert mean_signal(7, 2) == 3.5\nassert mean_signal(0, 0) is None, \"没有样本时交回 None\"\n","rejects":[{"code":"def mean_signal(total, n):\n    if total == 0:\n        return None\n    return total / n\n\nassert mean_signal(30, 3) == 10\nassert mean_signal(7, 2) == 3.5\nassert mean_signal(0, 0) is None, \"没有样本时交回 None\"\n","why":"把“总信号为 0”当成了“没有样本”"},{"code":"def mean_signal(total, n):\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    return total / n\n\nassert mean_signal(30, 3) == 10\nassert mean_signal(7, 2) == 3.5\nassert mean_signal(0, 0) == 0\n","why":"改了测试去迁就函数，没有样本时交回 0"},{"code":"def mean_signal(total, n):\n    return total / n\n\nassert mean_signal(30, 3) == 10\nassert mean_signal(7, 2) == 3.5\n","why":"删掉了失败的测试，函数没改"}],"tests":[{"name":"作答里的三条断言全部通过","expect":{"mean_signal(30, 3)":"10.0"}},{"name":"没有样本","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> mean_signal(5, 0) is None\nTrue\n"},{"name":"总信号为 0 但有样本","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> mean_signal(0, 5)\n0.0\n>>> mean_signal(9, 4)\n2.25\n"}]}],"explanation":"在除法之前先处理空输入：\n\n```python\ndef mean_signal(total, n):\n    if n == 0:\n        return None\n    return total / n\n```\n\n判断的是 n（有没有样本），不是 total：四份样本总信号为 0 时，平均值是 0.0，不是 None。删掉失败的测试、或把期望改成 0，都只是让报错消失，函数仍不符合要求。判分时还会单独调用 `mean_signal(5, 0)` 和 `mean_signal(0, 5)`。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py42.k2.r1","body":"要求：深度**超过** 30 厘米才算深，恰好 30 不算。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef is_deep(depth):\n    return depth >= 30\n\nprint(\"开始检查\")\nassert is_deep(35) == True\nassert is_deep(30) == False, \"恰好 30 不算深\"\nprint(\"检查完毕\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"屏幕上显示了几行 print 的内容？","key":1},{"id":"line","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"哪一行报了 AssertionError？","key":6},{"id":"who","type":"choice","prompt":"按要求，是谁错了？","options":[{"id":"test","content":"测试错了：第 6 行的期望应当是 True"},{"id":"function","content":"函数错了：第 2 行应当用 `>`"}],"key":"function"}],"explanation":"第 4 行显示“开始检查”；第 5 行通过；第 **6** 行 `is_deep(30)` 实际交回 True，不等于期望的 False，报 AssertionError，并显示“恰好 30 不算深”。程序停下，“检查完毕”不显示，所以只显示了 **1** 行。\n\n要求说恰好 30 不算深，第 6 行的期望是对的，**错在函数**：`>=` 应改成 `>`。\n"},{"id":"py42.k2.r2","body":"关于 `assert`，下面哪些说法正确？选出所有正确的。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"quiet","content":"条件成立时，assert 什么也不显示"},{"id":"continues","content":"一条 assert 失败后，后面的行照样运行"},{"id":"value_error","content":"条件不成立时，报的是 ValueError"},{"id":"message","content":"逗号后面的说明文字，会在失败时随错误一起显示"},{"id":"skipped","content":"用 python -O 运行时，assert 会被跳过"}],"key":["quiet","message","skipped"]}],"explanation":"正确的是：条件成立时**什么也不显示**；逗号后的**说明文字**在失败时随错误显示；用 **python -O** 运行时 assert 会被跳过。\n\n一条 assert 失败，程序就停在那一行，后面的行不再运行；报的是 AssertionError，不是 ValueError。正因为 -O 会跳过它，assert 只用来练习和自查，不拿来检查正式输入的数据。每个选项的勾选状态分别计分。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py42.k2.x1","body":"要求：`to_mm(value, unit)` 把长度换算成毫米：unit 为 \"cm\" 时乘 10，为 \"m\" 时乘 1000，其他单位原样交回。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef to_mm(value, unit):\n    if unit == \"cm\":\n        return value * 10\n    elif unit == \"m\":\n        return value * 100\n    return value\n\nassert to_mm(3, \"cm\") == 30\nassert to_mm(2, \"mm\") == 2\nassert to_mm(2, \"m\") == 2000\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"哪一行报了 AssertionError？","key":10},{"id":"actual","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"那一行里的调用实际交回多少？","key":200},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"按要求，应当怎样改？","options":[{"id":"expect","content":"把第 10 行改成 `assert to_mm(2, \"m\") == 200`"},{"id":"line5","content":"把第 5 行改成 `return value * 1000`"},{"id":"line3","content":"把第 3 行改成 `return value * 100`"}],"key":"line5"}],"explanation":"第 8、9 行通过，第 **10** 行失败：`to_mm(2, \"m\")` 走第 5 行，实际交回 2 × 100 = **200**，期望是 2000。\n\n按要求，“m”要乘 1000，错在第 5 行，改成 `return value * 1000`。把测试的期望改成 200 是迁就函数；改第 3 行会弄坏本来正确的厘米换算。\n"},{"id":"py42.k2.x2","body":"要求：深度小于 10 厘米是“表层”；10 厘米及以上、小于 30 厘米是“中层”；30 厘米及以上是“深层”。\n\n作答框里的函数没有通过下面的断言。请改函数，让断言全部通过；断言本身不要改。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":12,"starter":"def layer(depth):\n    if depth <= 10:\n        return \"表层\"\n    elif depth <= 30:\n        return \"中层\"\n    return \"深层\"\n\nassert layer(5) == \"表层\"\nassert layer(10) == \"中层\", \"10 厘米算中层\"\nassert layer(30) == \"深层\", \"30 厘米算深层\"\n","solution":"def layer(depth):\n    if depth < 10:\n        return \"表层\"\n    elif depth < 30:\n        return \"中层\"\n    return \"深层\"\n\nassert layer(5) == \"表层\"\nassert layer(10) == \"中层\", \"10 厘米算中层\"\nassert layer(30) == \"深层\", \"30 厘米算深层\"\n","rejects":[{"code":"def layer(depth):\n    if depth < 10:\n        return \"表层\"\n    elif depth <= 30:\n        return \"中层\"\n    return \"深层\"\n\nassert layer(5) == \"表层\"\nassert layer(10) == \"中层\", \"10 厘米算中层\"\nassert layer(30) == \"深层\", \"30 厘米算深层\"\n","why":"只改了第一个边界"},{"code":"def layer(depth):\n    if depth <= 10:\n        return \"表层\"\n    elif depth <= 30:\n        return \"中层\"\n    return \"深层\"\n\nassert layer(5) == \"表层\"\nassert layer(10) == \"表层\"\nassert layer(30) == \"中层\"\n","why":"改了断言去迁就函数"},{"code":"def layer(depth):\n    if depth < 10:\n        return \"表层\"\n    elif depth < 29:\n        return \"中层\"\n    return \"深层\"\n\nassert layer(5) == \"表层\"\nassert layer(10) == \"中层\", \"10 厘米算中层\"\nassert layer(30) == \"深层\", \"30 厘米算深层\"\n","why":"把第二个阈值改成了 29，30 是对了，29 却成了深层"}],"tests":[{"name":"两个边界","doctest":">>> layer(10)\n'中层'\n>>> layer(30)\n'深层'\n"},{"name":"边界两侧","hidden":true,"doctest":">>> layer(9)\n'表层'\n>>> layer(29)\n'中层'\n>>> layer(31)\n'深层'\n>>> layer(0)\n'表层'\n"}]}],"explanation":"两个阈值都要“及以上”归到下一层，所以比较要用不含等号的 `<`：\n\n```python\ndef layer(depth):\n    if depth < 10:\n        return \"表层\"\n    elif depth < 30:\n        return \"中层\"\n    return \"深层\"\n```\n\n第 9 行的断言先失败，提示 10 厘米被判成了表层；只改第一个比较，第 10 行又会失败，提示 30 厘米被判成了中层。按失败的断言一条条定位，直到全部通过。判分时还会检查 9、29、31 这些紧挨着边界的值。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py43","title":"读写文件时，先确认对象和范围","summary":"读写文件前先确认三件事：相对路径从哪里算起，用什么编码读，打开方式会不会清空原有内容。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py13","py05","py11"],"intro":"这一节的代码会真的读写文件。读文件出错，最常见的不是代码写错了，而是：找的不是你以为的那个文件，读的编码和保存时不一样，或者一打开就把原来的内容清掉了。\n\n课程的运行环境里，路径用 `/` 分隔；每道题开始前，题目用到的文件都会按题面重新准备好。你在 Windows 上看到的路径用反斜杠 `\\`，道理完全相同。\n","wrapup":"读写文件之前，先回答三个问题：这个相对路径是从哪个文件夹算起的？文件是用什么编码保存的？这次打开会不会清空原来的内容？\n\n向同事或 AI 提要求时，可以直接写：“从工作目录下的 data/plate1.csv 读，编码 UTF-8；结果写到 results 文件夹里的新文件，不要以写入方式打开 data 里的任何文件。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py43.k1","title":"Path 与相对路径的基准","key":["py13"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"相对路径","aliases":["工作目录","Path"],"definition":"不以盘符或根目录开头的路径是相对路径；Python 从当前工作目录出发找它，而不是从脚本或 notebook 文件所在的位置。","conditions":["notebook 的工作目录通常是它所在的文件夹；在命令行运行脚本时，是你输入命令时所在的文件夹。","Path(\"data\") / \"plate1.csv\" 只是拼出一个路径；文件在不在，要用 .exists() 去查。"],"example":"```python\np = Path(\"data\") / \"plate1.csv\"\n```\np.name 是 plate1.csv，p.suffix 是 .csv；工作目录下的 data 文件夹里有这个文件时，p.exists() 为 True。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"data\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"data\").mkdir()\nPath(\"data/plate1.csv\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\nS_B,10\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nPath(\"data/plate2.csv\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_C,13\\nS_D,10\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"当前工作目录里有一个 `data` 文件夹，里面只有 `plate1.csv` 和 `plate2.csv` 两个文件。\n"}]},"lesson":"电脑上每个文件都有一条**路径**。从盘符写起的叫绝对路径，例如 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\data\\plate1.csv`；像 `data/plate1.csv` 这样不从盘符写起的叫**相对路径**。\n\n相对路径要接在某个文件夹后面才完整。Python 接的是**当前工作目录**，而不是你的脚本或 notebook 文件放在哪里：\n\n- 在 notebook 里，工作目录通常就是这个 notebook 所在的文件夹；\n- 在命令行里运行脚本时，工作目录是你输入命令时所在的文件夹。脚本放在 `scripts` 子文件夹里，不会让路径从 `scripts` 算起。\n\n所以同一行 `open(\"data/plate1.csv\")`，换一个工作目录运行，找的就是另一个文件，可能报 FileNotFoundError，也可能悄悄打开了另一份同名的旧文件。\n\n标准库 pathlib 里的 `Path` 用来拼路径和查看路径的各个部分：\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"data\") / \"plate1.csv\"\n```\n\n`/` 在这里不是除法，而是把两段接成一条路径。`p.name` 是最后一段 `plate1.csv`，`p.suffix` 是扩展名 `.csv`，`p.parent` 是上一层 `data`。拼路径不会去检查文件在不在；要查，用 `p.exists()`，它从工作目录出发去找，得到 True 或 False。\n\n在 Windows 上 `print(p)` 显示的是 `data\\plate1.csv`，课程的运行环境里显示 `data/plate1.csv`，意思一样。写代码时用 `/` 拼接就好，Windows 上也认。\n","example":{"id":"py43.k1.e0","body":"阅读程序，写出第 3–6 行各显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"data\") / \"plate1.csv\"\nprint(p.name)\nprint(p.suffix)\nprint(p.exists())\nprint((Path(\"data\") / \"plate3.csv\").exists())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"table","label":"各行显示","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"plate1.csv"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":".csv"}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","shown":"True"}},{"id":"l6","cells":{"line":"第 6 行","shown":"False"}}]},{"id":"where","type":"choice","prompt":"`p.exists()` 去哪里找 `data` 文件夹？","options":[{"id":"cwd","content":"当前工作目录"},{"id":"install","content":"Python 程序安装的位置"},{"id":"anywhere","content":"整台电脑上所有叫 data 的文件夹"}],"key":"cwd"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **plate1.csv**、**.csv**、**True**、**False**。\n\n`p.name` 是路径的最后一段，`p.suffix` 是扩展名。`p.exists()` 从当前工作目录出发，去找 `data` 文件夹里的 `plate1.csv`，找到了，所以是 True；`plate3.csv` 不存在，第 6 行显示 False。第 2 行只是拼出路径，不会因为文件不存在而报错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"data\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"data\").mkdir()\nPath(\"data/plate1.csv\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\nS_B,10\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nPath(\"data/plate2.csv\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_C,13\\nS_D,10\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"当前工作目录里有一个 `data` 文件夹，里面只有 `plate1.csv` 和 `plate2.csv` 两个文件。\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py43.k1.q1","body":"林老师在 Windows 上打开 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\analysis.ipynb`，这个 notebook 的工作目录是 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project`。下面这行代码指向哪个文件？\n\n```python\np = Path(\"data\") / \"plate1.csv\"\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"file","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"home","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\data\\plate1.csv`"},{"id":"flat","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\plate1.csv`","feedback":"中间还有一层 data 文件夹。"},{"id":"project","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\data\\plate1.csv`"},{"id":"drive","content":"`C:\\data\\plate1.csv`","feedback":"相对路径接在工作目录后面，不是从盘符开始。"}],"key":"project"}],"explanation":"指向 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\data\\plate1.csv`：把相对路径 `data\\plate1.csv` 接在工作目录 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project` 后面。\n"},{"id":"py43.k1.q2","body":"林老师把 notebook 挪进了 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\notebooks\\` 文件夹，工作目录也随之变成这个文件夹。数据没有动，仍在 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\data\\plate1.csv`。原来能运行的代码现在出了问题：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"data\") / \"plate1.csv\"\nprint(p.exists())\nf = open(p)\n```\n\n`open(p)` 打开这个文件，下一个知识点再细讲。\n","slots":[{"id":"looked","type":"choice","prompt":"Python 现在去找的是哪个文件？","options":[{"id":"notebooks","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\notebooks\\data\\plate1.csv`"},{"id":"project","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\data\\plate1.csv`","feedback":"这是文件真正的位置，但工作目录已经变成 notebooks 文件夹了。"},{"id":"home","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\data\\plate1.csv`"}],"key":"notebooks"},{"id":"exists","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行显示什么？","options":[{"id":"True","content":"True"},{"id":"False","content":"False"}],"key":"False"},{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"第 4 行报的是哪种异常？写出异常类型的名字。","key":"FileNotFoundError"}],"explanation":"相对路径 `data\\plate1.csv` 现在接在 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\notebooks` 后面，Python 去找 `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\notebooks\\data\\plate1.csv`。那里没有这个文件，所以第 3 行显示 **False**，第 4 行报 **FileNotFoundError**。\n\n文件没有丢，变的是工作目录。可以把 notebook 放回原处，或者问清数据该放在哪里，再改路径。\n"},{"id":"py43.k1.q3","body":"要指向 `results` 文件夹里 `week2` 子文件夹中的 `depth.csv`。下面哪几行写对了？选出所有写对的。\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"slash","content":"```python\np = Path(\"results\") / \"week2\" / \"depth.csv\"\n```\n"},{"id":"strdiv","content":"```python\np = Path(\"results\" / \"week2\" / \"depth.csv\")\n```\n","feedback":"括号里先算 \"results\" / \"week2\"，两段文字不能相除。"},{"id":"whole","content":"```python\np = Path(\"results/week2/depth.csv\")\n```\n"},{"id":"plus","content":"```python\np = Path(\"results\") + \"week2\" + \"depth.csv\"\n```\n","feedback":"路径用 / 拼接，不能用 + 。"}],"key":["slash","whole"]}],"explanation":"`Path(\"results\") / \"week2\" / \"depth.csv\"` 和 `Path(\"results/week2/depth.csv\")` 都对，得到同一条路径。\n\n`Path(\"results\" / \"week2\" / \"depth.csv\")` 先在括号里拿两段文字相除，报 TypeError；`/` 要放在 Path 的后面才表示拼路径。`Path(...) + \"week2\"` 也报 TypeError，路径不能用 `+` 接。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"from pathlib import Path\n","display":"已经运行过 `from pathlib import Path`。\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py43.k1.r1","body":"野外数据整理脚本放在 `D:\\fieldwork\\scripts\\depth.py`，里面有这样一行：\n\n```python\np = Path(\"raw\") / \"north.csv\"\n```\n\n同事用两种方式运行它。每种方式下，`p` 指向哪个文件？\n","slots":[{"id":"files","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"how","header":"运行方式"},{"id":"file","header":"p 指向","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"fieldwork","label":"D:\\fieldwork\\raw\\north.csv"},{"id":"scripts","label":"D:\\fieldwork\\scripts\\raw\\north.csv"},{"id":"drive","label":"D:\\raw\\north.csv"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"from_root","cells":{"how":"在 D:\\fieldwork 输入 python scripts\\depth.py","file":"fieldwork"}},{"id":"from_scripts","cells":{"how":"在 D:\\fieldwork\\scripts 输入 python depth.py","file":"scripts"}}]}],"explanation":"在 `D:\\fieldwork` 运行时，工作目录是 `D:\\fieldwork`，`p` 指向 `D:\\fieldwork\\raw\\north.csv`；先进入 `scripts` 再运行时，工作目录是 `D:\\fieldwork\\scripts`，`p` 指向 `D:\\fieldwork\\scripts\\raw\\north.csv`。\n\n同一个脚本、同一行代码，只因为输入命令的位置不同，就找不同的文件。相对路径看的是工作目录，不看脚本放在哪里。\n"},{"id":"py43.k1.r2","body":"阅读程序，写出第 2–4 行各显示 True 还是 False。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfrom pathlib import Path\nprint(Path(\"raw/north.csv\").exists())\nprint((Path(\"raw\") / \"east.csv\").exists())\nprint(Path(\"north.csv\").exists())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":true}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":false}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":false}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **True、False、False**。`raw/north.csv` 存在；`raw` 里没有 `east.csv`；第 4 行只写了文件名，Python 在工作目录本身找 `north.csv`，而它在 `raw` 文件夹里，所以找不到。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"raw\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"north.csv\").unlink(missing_ok=True)\nPath(\"raw\").mkdir()\nPath(\"raw/north.csv\").write_text(\"site,depth\\n北坡,30\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nPath(\"raw/south.csv\").write_text(\"site,depth\\n南坡,25\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"当前工作目录里有一个 `raw` 文件夹，里面只有 `north.csv` 和 `south.csv`；工作目录本身没有其他 csv 文件。\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py43.k1.x1","body":"阅读程序，写出四行显示的内容。\n\n```python startLine=1\np = Path(\"results\") / \"week1\" / \"summary.txt\"\nprint(p.name)\nprint(p.suffix)\nprint(p.parent.name)\nprint(p.parent.parent.name)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":"summary.txt"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":".txt"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":"week1"}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","shown":"results"}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **summary.txt**、**.txt**、**week1**、**results**。`p.parent` 是去掉最后一段的路径 `results/week1`，它的 `.name` 是 `week1`；再往上一层是 `results`。点号从左往右一步步取。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"from pathlib import Path\n","display":"已经运行过 `from pathlib import Path`。\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k1.x2","body":"林老师电脑上有两份同名文件：\n\n- `C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\data\\plate1.csv`（新数据）\n- `C:\\Users\\lin\\backup\\data\\plate1.csv`（上个月的旧备份）\n\n`C:\\Users\\lin\\project` 里另有一个 `notebooks` 文件夹，里面没有 data 文件夹。代码是：\n\n```python\nf = open(\"data/plate1.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cwd","type":"choice","multiple":true,"prompt":"工作目录是哪些文件夹时，这行代码能打开一个文件而不报错？选出所有。","options":[{"id":"project","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\project`"},{"id":"notebooks","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\project\\notebooks`"},{"id":"home","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin`"},{"id":"backup","content":"`C:\\Users\\lin\\backup`"}],"key":["project","backup"]},{"id":"opened","type":"choice","prompt":"工作目录是 `C:\\Users\\lin\\backup` 时，打开的是哪份数据？","options":[{"id":"new","content":"新数据"},{"id":"old","content":"旧备份"},{"id":"none","content":"哪份也打不开，会报错"}],"key":"old"}],"explanation":"工作目录是 **project** 或 **backup** 时都能打开文件：两处下面都有 `data\\plate1.csv`。在 notebooks 和 `C:\\Users\\lin` 下，接出来的路径没有文件，报 FileNotFoundError。\n\n在 backup 下运行时打开的是**旧备份**，而且不会报任何错。相对路径没有说清从哪里算起时，最危险的不是报错，而是悄悄读了另一份同名文件。\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k2","title":"with 管理文本文件及编码","key":["py05","py11"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"with 打开文件","aliases":["open","encoding","编码"],"definition":"用 with open(路径, encoding=\"utf-8\") as f 打开文件，在下面缩进的几行里读写，离开缩进时文件自动关闭；encoding 说明文件里的字节按哪种编码变成文字。","conditions":["读要写在 with 的缩进里；离开后再用 f 读会报 ValueError，但已经读出来的文字变量照样能用。","编码要和文件保存时一致：按 UTF-8 读 GBK 文件会报 UnicodeDecodeError，用错的编码也可能不报错、只读出乱码。"],"example":"```python\nwith open(\"notes/plate1.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nprint(text.strip())\n```\n在缩进里读出整段文字，离开 with 后文件已关闭，text 仍可以用。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"notes\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"notes\").mkdir()\nPath(\"notes/plate1.txt\").write_text(\"批次 P1，共 4 个样本\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `notes/plate1.txt`（UTF-8 编码）的内容只有一行：\n\n```text\n批次 P1，共 4 个样本\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"读一个文本文件，常见的写法是：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"notes/plate1.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nprint(text)\n```\n\n- `open(...)` 打开文件，`as f` 给打开的文件起名叫 `f`。\n- `with` 那一行以冒号结尾，下面**缩进**的几行属于它。在这几行里，文件是打开的；离开缩进，文件就自动关上了。\n- `f.read()` 把整个文件读成一段文字（字符串）。读出来的 `text` 是普通的字符串，文件关了它也还在。\n\n离开缩进以后再写 `f.read()`，文件已经关了，会报 **ValueError**。\n\n**编码**说明文件里存的字节怎样变成文字。现在大多数文件用 UTF-8；但中文 Windows 上的旧版记事本、一些仪器软件或用 Excel 另存的 CSV，常常用 GBK。编码对不上时：\n\n- 按 UTF-8 读 GBK 文件，通常报 **UnicodeDecodeError**；\n- 按某些编码读，不报错，却读出一堆乱码，更难发现。\n\n不写 `encoding` 时，Python 用这台电脑的默认编码。在中文 Windows 上它常常不是 UTF-8，于是同一段代码换一台电脑可能读出不同的结果。所以读写文字文件时把 `encoding` 写清楚；遇到 UnicodeDecodeError，先问清文件是用什么编码保存的，再改成对应的 `encoding=\"gbk\"` 之类。\n","example":{"id":"py43.k2.e0","body":"阅读程序，写出它显示的内容。\n\n```python\nwith open(\"notes/plate1.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nprint(text.strip())\n```\n\n如果把最后一行改成在缩进外面直接读文件：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"notes/plate1.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nprint(f.read())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","prompt":"第一段程序显示什么？","key":"批次 P1，共 4 个样本"},{"id":"after","type":"choice","prompt":"第二段程序的最后一行会怎样？","options":[{"id":"same","content":"再显示一次同样的文字"},{"id":"blank","content":"显示一个空行"},{"id":"ValueError","content":"报 ValueError，文件已经关了"}],"key":"ValueError"}],"explanation":"第一段显示 **批次 P1，共 4 个样本**。`f.read()` 在缩进里读出整行文字，`strip()` 去掉末尾的换行。\n\n第二段的最后一行在缩进外面，这时文件已经自动关上，`f.read()` 报 **ValueError**。要用文件内容，就在缩进里先读进一个名字（这里是 `text`），出来以后用这个名字。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"notes\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"notes\").mkdir()\nPath(\"notes/plate1.txt\").write_text(\"批次 P1，共 4 个样本\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `notes/plate1.txt`（UTF-8 编码）的内容只有一行：\n\n```text\n批次 P1，共 4 个样本\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py43.k2.q1","body":"阅读程序，写出它显示的内容。\n\n```python\nwith open(\"logs/run2.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nprint(text.strip().lower())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","prompt":"显示什么？","key":"signal ok","feedback":[{"when":"Signal OK","message":"后面还有一步 lower()，大写字母都变成了小写。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **signal ok**。`f.read()` 读出整行，包括两边的空格和末尾的换行；`strip()` 去掉两边的空白，`lower()` 再把字母变成小写。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"logs\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"logs\").mkdir()\nPath(\"logs/run2.txt\").write_text(\"  Signal OK  \\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `logs/run2.txt`（UTF-8 编码）只有一行，开头和结尾各有两个空格：\n\n```text\n  Signal OK\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k2.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\nwith open(\"logs/run2.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    first = f.read()\nsecond = f.read()\nprint(first.strip())\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"程序在第几行停下来报错？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"},{"id":"l4","content":"第 4 行"}],"key":"l3"},{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"报的是哪种异常？写出异常类型的名字。","key":"ValueError"}],"explanation":"停在**第 3 行**，报 **ValueError**。第 2 行在缩进里，文件开着，读得出来；第 3 行已经离开 with，文件关了，不能再读。程序停在第 3 行，第 4 行没有机会运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"logs\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"logs\").mkdir()\nPath(\"logs/run2.txt\").write_text(\"  Signal OK  \\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `logs/run2.txt`（UTF-8 编码）只有一行，开头和结尾各有两个空格：\n\n```text\n  Signal OK\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k2.q3","body":"```python\nwith open(\"export/plate2.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"运行这段代码，报的是哪种异常？写出异常类型的名字。","key":"UnicodeDecodeError"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"把 `encoding=\"utf-8\"` 换成哪一个，`text` 才能得到记事本里看到的原文？","options":[{"id":"ascii","content":"`encoding=\"ascii\"`"},{"id":"gbk","content":"`encoding=\"gbk\"`"},{"id":"utf-8","content":"`encoding=\"utf-8\"`，再运行一次"}],"key":"gbk"}],"explanation":"报 **UnicodeDecodeError**：文件按 GBK 保存，却按 UTF-8 去解读，中文字节对不上。改成 **`encoding=\"gbk\"`**，和保存时的编码一致，才能读出原文。ascii 只认英文字母和数字，同样读不了中文；再运行一次 UTF-8 结果不会变。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"export\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"export\").mkdir()\nPLATE2_TEXT = \"样本,信号\\nS_A,8\\n\"\nPath(\"export/plate2.csv\").write_bytes(PLATE2_TEXT.encode(\"gbk\"))\n","display":"`export/plate2.csv` 是用旧版 Windows 软件导出的，按 GBK 编码保存，用记事本打开看到的是：\n\n```text\n样本,信号\nS_A,8\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py43.k2.r1","body":"把下面三行排成一段程序：读出 `logs/run5.txt` 的内容，去掉两边空白、换成大写后显示。每一行都要用上，并设好缩进。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","indent":1,"items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(text.strip().upper())"},{"id":"read","code":"text = f.read()"},{"id":"open","code":"with open(\"logs/run5.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:"}],"key":["open","read","show"],"indents":{"open":0,"read":1,"show":0},"tests":[{"name":"显示整理后的内容","stdout":"RUN 5 OK"},{"name":"换一份记录","hidden":true,"data":["log_run5b"],"stdout":"RUN 5 FAILED"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nwith open(\"logs/run5.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nprint(text.strip().upper())\n```\n\n`text = f.read()` 要缩进在 with 下面，趁文件开着读出来；`print` 放在缩进外面或里面都可以，因为它用的是已经读出的 `text`。如果把读的那一行放到缩进外面，会报 ValueError。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"logs\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"logs\").mkdir()\nPath(\"logs/run5.txt\").write_text(\"run 5 ok\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `logs/run5.txt`（UTF-8 编码）的内容是一行 `run 5 ok`。\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k2.r2","body":"分别用三种编码读这个文件，只改下面代码里 `encoding` 的值：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"field/site_notes.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"result","type":"table","prompt":"每种编码的结果是什么？","columns":[{"id":"encoding","header":"encoding"},{"id":"outcome","header":"结果","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"same","label":"读出原文"},{"id":"garbled","label":"读出乱码，不报错"},{"id":"error","label":"报错"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"utf8","cells":{"encoding":"\"utf-8\"","outcome":"error"}},{"id":"gbk","cells":{"encoding":"\"gbk\"","outcome":"same"}},{"id":"latin1","cells":{"encoding":"\"latin-1\"","outcome":"garbled"}}]}],"explanation":"**utf-8 报错**（UnicodeDecodeError），**gbk 读出原文**，**latin-1 读出乱码但不报错**。\n\nlatin-1 把每个字节都当成一个西文字符，所以永远不会报错，读出来却是 `±±ÆÂ 30 ÀåÃ×` 这样的乱码。不报错不等于读对了；读完看一眼内容，才知道编码对不对。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"field\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"field\").mkdir()\nNOTE_TEXT = \"北坡 30 厘米\\n\"\nPath(\"field/site_notes.txt\").write_bytes(NOTE_TEXT.encode(\"gbk\"))\n","display":"野外记录 `field/site_notes.txt` 是旧版记事本按 GBK 编码保存的，原文是一行：\n\n```text\n北坡 30 厘米\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py43.k2.x1","body":"`text.splitlines()` 把一段文字按行切开，得到一个列表。\n\n```python startLine=1\nwith open(\"logs/run7.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\nrows = text.splitlines()\nprint(len(rows))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"safe","type":"choice","prompt":"第 3 行已经在 with 的缩进外面了，它会怎样？","options":[{"id":"error","content":"报 ValueError，文件已经关了"},{"id":"fine","content":"正常运行，它用的是已经读出来的文字"}],"key":"fine"},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":3}],"explanation":"第 3 行**正常运行**，程序显示 **3**。文件确实已经关了，但第 3 行没有再读文件，它切的是第 2 行读出来的字符串 `text`。会出错的是在缩进外面再用 `f` 读文件。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"logs\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"logs\").mkdir()\nPath(\"logs/run7.txt\").write_text(\"S_A 8\\nS_B 10\\nS_C 13\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `logs/run7.txt`（UTF-8 编码）的内容：\n\n```text\nS_A 8\nS_B 10\nS_C 13\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k2.x2","body":"作答框里的代码一运行就报 UnicodeDecodeError。请改动它，让 `text` 得到文件里的原文。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"with open(\"survey/answers.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n","solution":"with open(\"survey/answers.txt\", encoding=\"gbk\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n","accepts":["with open(\"survey/answers.txt\", encoding=\"GBK\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n","with open(\"survey/answers.txt\", encoding=\"gb18030\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"with open(\"survey/answers.txt\", encoding=\"latin-1\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n","why":"换成一个不报错的编码，读出来的是乱码"},{"code":"text = open(\"survey/answers.txt\").read()\n","why":"不写编码，按这台电脑的默认编码读"}],"tests":[{"name":"读出原文","expect":{"text":"ANSWERS"}},{"name":"换一份问卷记录","hidden":true,"data":["survey_b"],"expect":{"text":"ANSWERS"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nwith open(\"survey/answers.txt\", encoding=\"gbk\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n```\n\n文件按 GBK 保存，就按 GBK 读。换成 latin-1 之类的编码虽然不报错，读出的是乱码，测试会比较读出的文字是否与原文一致。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"survey\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"survey\").mkdir()\nANSWERS = \"问卷 12 份，有效 11 份\\n\"\nPath(\"survey/answers.txt\").write_bytes(ANSWERS.encode(\"gbk\"))\n","display":"`survey/answers.txt` 是旧版 Windows 软件导出的，按 GBK 编码保存，原文是一行 `问卷 12 份，有效 11 份`。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py43.k3","title":"r/w/a 的行为和覆盖风险","key":[],"links":[],"card":{"name":"打开方式 r/w/a","aliases":["文件模式","覆盖","追加"],"definition":"open 的第二个参数决定怎样用文件：\"r\" 只读，文件必须已经存在；\"w\" 写入，打开那一刻就清空原有内容；\"a\" 追加，新内容接在末尾。","conditions":["\"w\" 一打开就清空，即使后面一个字也没写成；不要用 \"w\" 打开原始数据文件。","write 不会自动换行，每行末尾要自己写 \\n；\"a\" 的代码多运行一次，内容就多一份。"],"example":"records/log.txt 原有 P1。用 \"a\" 写入 P2 后有 P1、P2 两行；接着用 \"w\" 写入 P3，只剩 P3。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"records\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"records\").mkdir()\nPath(\"records/log.txt\").write_text(\"P1\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"开始时 `records/log.txt` 里只有一行 `P1`。\n"}]},"lesson":"`open` 的第二个参数是**打开方式**，不写时是 `\"r\"`：\n\n| 打开方式 | 意思 | 文件不存在时 | 文件已存在时 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `\"r\"` | 只读 | 报 FileNotFoundError | 从头读 |\n| `\"w\"` | 写入 | 新建 | **打开那一刻就清空** |\n| `\"a\"` | 追加 | 新建 | 新内容接在末尾 |\n\n写文字用 `f.write(...)`：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P2 done\\n\")\n```\n\n`write` 不会自动换行，`\\n` 表示换行，每行末尾要自己写上。\n\n最大的风险在 `\"w\"`：它在打开时就清空文件，哪怕紧接着的那行写入出了错、一个字也没写成，原来的内容也已经没了。所以：\n\n- 原始数据只用 `\"r\"` 读，结果写到另一个文件夹里的新文件；\n- 追加记录用 `\"a\"`，但要记得同一段代码运行两次，记录就多一份，在 notebook 里重复运行单元格时尤其容易发生。\n","example":{"id":"py43.k3.e0","body":"阅读程序。\n\n```python startLine=1\nwith open(\"records/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P2\\n\")\nwith open(\"records/log.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P3\\n\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"after_first","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"第 1–2 行运行完时，文件里有哪几行？按先后顺序排出，没有的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"P1","content":"P1"},{"id":"P2","content":"P2"},{"id":"P3","content":"P3"}],"key":["P1","P2"]},{"id":"after_all","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"四行全部运行完时，文件里有哪几行？","items":[{"id":"P1","content":"P1"},{"id":"P2","content":"P2"},{"id":"P3","content":"P3"}],"key":["P3"]}],"explanation":"第 1–2 行用 `\"a\"`，P2 接在原有的 P1 后面，文件里是 **P1、P2**。第 3 行用 `\"w\"` 打开，文件立刻被清空，再写入 P3，最后只剩 **P3**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"records\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"records\").mkdir()\nPath(\"records/log.txt\").write_text(\"P1\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"开始时 `records/log.txt` 里只有一行 `P1`。\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py43.k3.q1","body":"有人想给原始数据加一行表头说明，写了下面的代码，但忘了先定义 `header`。\n\n```python\nwith open(\"raw/plate1.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(header)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"运行时报的是哪种异常？写出异常类型的名字。","key":"NameError"},{"id":"lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"报错之后，`raw/plate1.csv` 里还剩几行？","key":0,"feedback":[{"when":3,"message":"程序在写入时才报错，但 \"w\" 在打开那一刻已经清空了文件。"}]}],"explanation":"报 **NameError**，而 `raw/plate1.csv` 里只剩 **0** 行。第 1 行用 `\"w\"` 打开时文件就被清空了；第 2 行写入时才因为 `header` 没定义而报错，什么也没写成。原始数据就这样丢了，所以不要用 `\"w\"` 打开原始数据文件。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"raw\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"raw\").mkdir()\nRAW = \"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\nS_B,10\\n\"\nPath(\"raw/plate1.csv\").write_text(RAW, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"原始数据 `raw/plate1.csv` 有三行：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\nS_A,8\nS_B,10\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k3.q2","body":"下面四段代码按顺序运行。每段运行完时，`results/log.txt` 里有几行？\n\n第 1 段：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A 8\\n\")\n```\n\n第 2 段：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_B 10\\n\")\n```\n\n第 3 段：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/log.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_C 13\\n\")\n```\n\n第 4 段：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_D 10\\n\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"运行完"},{"id":"lines","header":"文件行数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"step":"第 1 段","lines":1}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"step":"第 2 段","lines":2}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"step":"第 3 段","lines":1}},{"id":"s4","cells":{"step":"第 4 段","lines":2}}]}],"explanation":"行数依次是 **1、2、1、2**。第 1 段时文件还不存在，`\"a\"` 新建它并写入一行；第 2 段接在末尾；第 3 段 `\"w\"` 清空后只写入 S_C 一行；第 4 段再接一行，最后是 S_C、S_D 两行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"results\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"results\").mkdir()\n","display":"`results` 文件夹是空的。\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k3.q3","body":"要求是：把 `summary` 保存成 `results/summary.txt`，不能改动 `raw/plate1.csv`。哪一段代码符合要求？\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"append_raw","content":"```python\nwith open(\"raw/plate1.csv\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(summary)\n```\n","feedback":"原始数据没被清空，但末尾多了一行汇总，也算改动了。"},{"id":"read_mode","content":"```python\nwith open(\"results/summary.txt\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(summary)\n```\n","feedback":"\"r\" 只能读，而且 results/summary.txt 还不存在，会报 FileNotFoundError。"},{"id":"new_file","content":"```python\nwith open(\"results/summary.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(summary)\n```\n"},{"id":"overwrite_raw","content":"```python\nwith open(\"raw/plate1.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(summary)\n```\n"}],"key":"new_file"}],"explanation":"用 `\"w\"` 打开 `results/summary.txt` 的那一段符合要求：这个文件原本不存在，`\"w\"` 新建它并写入汇总，原始数据没有被碰。\n\n用 `\"w\"` 打开 `raw/plate1.csv` 会把原始数据清空；用 `\"a\"` 打开它虽然没清空，却在原始数据末尾多出一行；用 `\"r\"` 打开一个还不存在的文件会报错，而且 `\"r\"` 本来也不能写。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"raw\", ignore_errors=True)\nshutil.rmtree(\"results\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"raw\").mkdir()\nPath(\"results\").mkdir()\nRAW = \"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\nS_B,10\\n\"\nPath(\"raw/plate1.csv\").write_text(RAW, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nsummary = \"样本数 2，平均 9.0\\n\"\n","display":"原始数据在 `raw/plate1.csv`；`results` 文件夹是空的。变量 `summary` 已经算好，是一行文字 `样本数 2，平均 9.0`。\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py43.k3.r1","body":"`logs/runlog.txt` 里已经有三行记录。下面三种需求，各自该用哪种打开方式，也就是 `open(\"logs/runlog.txt\", 打开方式, encoding=\"utf-8\")` 里的第二个参数？\n","slots":[{"id":"modes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"need","header":"需求"},{"id":"mode","header":"打开方式","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"r","label":"r（只读）"},{"id":"w","label":"w（写入）"},{"id":"a","label":"a（追加）"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"see","cells":{"need":"只想读出里面写了什么，文件一个字也不能变","mode":"r"}},{"id":"add","cells":{"need":"把一行 run 4 接在末尾，原来的三行都要保留","mode":"a"}},{"id":"replace","cells":{"need":"整个换成只有 run 4 一行的新内容，旧内容不要了","mode":"w"}}]}],"explanation":"| 需求 | 打开方式 | 为什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 只读不改 | `\"r\"` | 只读，文件原样不动；用 `\"w\"` 或 `\"a\"` 打开就不能读了，而且 `\"w\"` 一打开就清空 |\n| 接在末尾 | `\"a\"` | 新内容接在原有内容后面；`\"w\"` 会先清空，只剩 run 4；`\"r\"` 不能写，会报错 |\n| 整个换掉 | `\"w\"` | 打开那一刻就清空，再写入新内容；`\"a\"` 会把 run 4 接在旧内容后面 |\n\n选的时候先问：旧内容要不要留。要留，就是读用 `\"r\"`、加东西用 `\"a\"`；不要了，才用 `\"w\"`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"logs\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"logs\").mkdir()\nRUNLOG = \"run 1\\nrun 2\\nrun 3\\n\"\nPath(\"logs/runlog.txt\").write_text(RUNLOG, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"`logs/runlog.txt` 里已经有三行：\n\n```text\nrun 1\nrun 2\nrun 3\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k3.r2","body":"```python\nwith open(\"results/ids.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A\")\n    f.write(\"S_B\\n\")\n    f.write(\"S_C\\n\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"运行之后，`results/ids.txt` 里有哪几行？按先后顺序排出，用不到的不要放进来。","items":[{"id":"S_A","content":"S_A"},{"id":"S_B","content":"S_B"},{"id":"S_C","content":"S_C"},{"id":"S_AS_B","content":"S_AS_B"}],"key":["S_AS_B","S_C"]}],"explanation":"只有两行：**S_AS_B**、**S_C**。`write` 不会自己换行，第一次写的 `S_A` 后面没有 `\\n`，紧接着写的 `S_B` 就连在同一行上。三次写入都在同一个 with 里，`\"w\"` 只在打开时清空一次。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"results\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"results\").mkdir()\n","display":"`results` 文件夹是空的。\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py43.k3.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 在处理记录 `results/log.txt` 的末尾接上一行 `P3 done`，原有的记录都要保留；不能改动 `raw` 里的任何文件。\n\n作答框里的代码会把已有记录清掉。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"with open(\"results/log.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P3 done\\n\")\n","solution":"with open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P3 done\\n\")\n","rejects":[{"code":"with open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P3 done\")\n","why":"漏了换行符，下一次追加会连在同一行"},{"code":"with open(\"raw/plate3.csv\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P3 done\\n\")\n","why":"写进了原始数据文件"}],"tests":[{"name":"记录接在末尾，原始数据不变","expect":{"open(\"results/log.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\").read()":"LOG + \"P3 done\\n\"","open(\"raw/plate3.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\").read()":"RAW3"}},{"name":"换一份已有记录","hidden":true,"data":["log_x1b"],"expect":{"open(\"results/log.txt\", encoding=\"utf-8\").read()":"LOG + \"P3 done\\n\"","open(\"raw/plate3.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\").read()":"RAW3"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nwith open(\"results/log.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"P3 done\\n\")\n```\n\n把 `\"w\"` 改成 `\"a\"`，新的一行接在末尾，原有记录保留。末尾的 `\\n` 不能省，否则下一条记录会接在同一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"raw\", ignore_errors=True)\nshutil.rmtree(\"results\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"raw\").mkdir()\nPath(\"results\").mkdir()\nRAW3 = \"sample_id,signal\\nS_E,12\\n\"\nLOG = \"P1 done\\nP2 done\\n\"\nPath(\"raw/plate3.csv\").write_text(RAW3, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nPath(\"results/log.txt\").write_text(LOG, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"原始数据在 `raw/plate3.csv`。处理记录 `results/log.txt` 里已经有两行：\n\n```text\nP1 done\nP2 done\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py43.k3.x2","body":"notebook 里有一个单元格，内容如下。你不小心把它**运行了两次**。\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/batch.txt\", \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"S_A,8\\n\")\n```\n\n如果单元格写的是下面这样，同样运行两次：\n\n```python\nwith open(\"results/batch.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\nS_A,8\\n\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"append_twice","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一种写法运行两次后，`results/batch.txt` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"write_twice","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二种写法运行两次后，有几行？","key":2}],"explanation":"第一种是 **3** 行：表头加上两行 `S_A,8`，同一条记录重复了。`\"a\"` 每运行一次就接一份。\n\n第二种是 **2** 行：每次 `\"w\"` 都先清空，再写入表头和一行数据，运行几次结果都一样。用 `\"a\"` 记录时，要想到代码可能被重复运行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"results\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"results\").mkdir()\nPath(\"results/batch.txt\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"开始时 `results/batch.txt` 里只有一行表头 `sample_id,signal`。\n"}]}]}]},{"id":"py44","title":"从文件里的结构找到一条记录","summary":"认出 CSV 的行列和 JSON 每一层是字典、列表还是值，按键和位置一层层走到目标值，并分清缺键、空值和类型不对。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py43","py37","py15"],"intro":"数据不只放在表格里。仪器导出、网页接口和配置文件常用 JSON，它像一层套一层的盒子：外面是一个字典，里面某个键对应一个列表，列表里每一项又是一个字典。\n\n这一节练三件事：看出每一层是什么，一层层走到想要的那个值，以及遇到缺了、空了、类型不对的值时，先查出来、再说清怎么处理。题目里已经导入了 pandas（叫 `pd`），每道题用到的文件都会按题面重新准备好。\n","wrapup":"读一个结构化文件，先画出它的层次：最外层是字典还是列表？要的值在第几层、靠哪个键或哪个位置拿到？\n\n拿不准的记录，不要让代码悄悄补成 0 或跳过。向同事或 AI 说清：“signal 缺这一项或为 null 的记为缺失，不当作 0；signal 是文字的，列出这些样本编号，先不要计算。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py44.k1","title":"CSV 的行列与 JSON 的列表/字典层次","key":["py43","py37","py15"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"文件里的层次","aliases":["JSON","CSV","嵌套"],"definition":"CSV 是一张表：第一行通常是列名，之后每行一条记录，字段用分隔符隔开；JSON 读进来后，花括号变成字典、方括号变成列表，可以一层套一层。","conditions":["read_csv 默认把第一行当列名；文件没有列名行时，第一条记录会被当成列名。","字典的 len 是键的个数，不是里面列表的长度；要数记录，先走到放记录的那个列表。"],"example":"plates/p1.json 读进来，data 是字典；data[\"samples\"] 是列表；data[\"samples\"][0] 是字典；data[\"samples\"][0][\"signal\"] 是整数 8。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json`（UTF-8 编码）的内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"**CSV** 就是一张用文字写成的表：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal,group\n001,8,control\n002,10,drug\n```\n\n第一行通常是**列名**，后面每一行是一条记录，同一行里的字段用逗号隔开。`pd.read_csv` 默认把第一行当列名，所以上面三行文字读成 2 行 3 列的表。文件没有列名行、或者用的不是逗号时，就要另外告诉 read_csv。\n\n**JSON** 能表达一层套一层的结构。用 `json` 模块读进来以后：\n\n| JSON 里写的 | 读进 Python 变成 |\n|---|---|\n| `{ ... }` 花括号 | 字典（dict） |\n| `[ ... ]` 方括号 | 列表（list） |\n| `\"S01\"` 带引号 | 字符串（str） |\n| `8`、`9.5` | 整数（int）、小数（float） |\n| `true` / `false` | `True` / `False` |\n| `null` | `None` |\n\n```python\nimport json\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n```\n\n`json.load(f)` 读一个打开的文件；`json.loads(文字)` 读一段已经在手里的文字。\n\n读一个 JSON，先一层层认清：最外层是字典还是列表？某个键对应的是一个值、一个列表，还是又一个字典？注意 `len` 对字典数的是**键的个数**：`data` 有 plate、operator、samples 三个键，`len(data)` 是 3，跟有几条样本无关；样本数是 `len(data[\"samples\"])`。\n","example":{"id":"py44.k1.e0","body":"读入文件：\n\n```python\nimport json\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n```\n\n按文件内容，写出下面每个表达式得到的是哪种东西。\n","slots":[{"id":"types","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"kind","header":"类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"dict","label":"字典 dict"},{"id":"list","label":"列表 list"},{"id":"str","label":"字符串 str"},{"id":"int","label":"整数 int"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"top","cells":{"expr":"data","kind":"dict"}},{"id":"plate","cells":{"expr":"data[\"plate\"]","kind":"str"}},{"id":"samples","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"]","kind":"list"}},{"id":"first","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][0]","kind":"dict"}},{"id":"signal","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][0][\"signal\"]","kind":"int"}}]}],"explanation":"最外层是花括号，`data` 是**字典**；`data[\"plate\"]` 是带引号的 \"P1\"，是**字符串**；`data[\"samples\"]` 是方括号，是**列表**；列表里每一项是花括号，`data[\"samples\"][0]` 是**字典**；它的 `\"signal\"` 是不带引号的 8，是**整数**。\n\n一层层看下来：字典 → 列表 → 字典 → 值。每走一步，先想清楚手里拿着的是哪一种。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json`（UTF-8 编码）的内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py44.k1.q1","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"plates/p2.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"文件 `plates/p2.csv` 一共有几行文字？","key":5},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`df.shape` 的第一个数（行数）","key":4,"feedback":[{"when":5,"message":"第一行是列名，不算一条记录。"}]},{"id":"cols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`df.shape` 的第二个数（列数）","key":3},{"id":"header","type":"choice","prompt":"文件的第一行在 `df` 里变成了什么？","options":[{"id":"record","content":"第一条记录"},{"id":"columns","content":"列名"},{"id":"dropped","content":"被丢掉了，哪里都没有"}],"key":"columns"}],"explanation":"文件有 **5** 行文字：1 行列名加 4 行记录。read_csv 把第一行当**列名**，所以 `df` 是 **4** 行 **3** 列。数记录时不要把列名那一行算进去。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p2.csv\").write_text(\n    \"sample_id,signal,group\\n001,8,control\\n002,10,drug\\n003,13,drug\\n004,10,control\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"文件 `plates/p2.csv` 的全部内容：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal,group\n001,8,control\n002,10,drug\n003,13,drug\n004,10,control\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k1.q2","body":"阅读程序，写出第 3–5 行各显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport json\nrec = json.loads('{\"ok\": true, \"note\": null, \"ids\": [\"001\", \"002\"]}')\nprint(rec[\"ok\"])\nprint(rec[\"note\"])\nprint(rec[\"ids\"][0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"True"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":"None"}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","shown":"001"}}]}],"explanation":"依次显示 **True**、**None**、**001**。JSON 的 `true` 读成 Python 的 True，`null` 读成 None；`\"001\"` 带引号，是字符串，前导零保留。\n"},{"id":"py44.k1.q3","body":"```python startLine=1\nprint(len(data))\nprint(len(data[\"samples\"]))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 1 行显示","key":3},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第 2 行显示","key":4},{"id":"count","type":"choice","prompt":"要数这块板上有几条样本记录，用哪个表达式？","options":[{"id":"samples","content":"`len(data[\"samples\"])`"},{"id":"top","content":"`len(data)`"}],"key":"samples"}],"explanation":"第 1 行显示 **3**：`data` 是字典，`len` 数的是它的键 plate、operator、samples。第 2 行显示 **4**：`data[\"samples\"]` 是放样本记录的列表，里面有 4 项。数记录要用 `len(data[\"samples\"])`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json` 已经用 `json.load` 读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py44.k1.r1","body":"根据原文，说出 `sites` 的结构。\n","slots":[{"id":"outer","type":"choice","prompt":"`sites` 最外层是什么？","options":[{"id":"dict_by_site","content":"一个字典，键是采样点的名字"},{"id":"list_of_dicts","content":"一个列表，每一项是一个采样点的字典"},{"id":"text","content":"一段还没读开的文字"}],"key":"list_of_dicts"},{"id":"count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`len(sites)` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"depth","type":"choice","prompt":"`sites[0][\"depth\"]` 是什么？","options":[{"id":"number","content":"一个整数"},{"id":"numbers","content":"一个列表，里面是两次测量的整数"},{"id":"words","content":"一个字符串"}],"key":"numbers"}],"explanation":"最外层是方括号，`sites` 是一个**列表**，每一项是一个采样点的**字典**；列表里有 3 项，`len(sites)` 是 **3**。每个采样点的 `\"depth\"` 又是方括号，是**两个整数组成的列表**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nsites = json.loads(\"\"\"[\n  {\"site\": \"北坡\", \"depth\": [30, 32]},\n  {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": [25, 27]},\n  {\"site\": \"东坡\", \"depth\": [35, 33]}\n]\"\"\")\n","display":"野外记录已经用 json 读进来，结果叫 `sites`。原文：\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"site\": \"北坡\", \"depth\": [30, 32]},\n  {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": [25, 27]},\n  {\"site\": \"东坡\", \"depth\": [35, 33]}\n]\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k1.r2","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"plates/p5.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`df` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"header","type":"choice","prompt":"`df` 的列名是什么？","options":[{"id":"numbers","content":"0、1、2"},{"id":"named","content":"sample_id、signal、group"},{"id":"first_record","content":"S11、8、control"}],"key":"first_record"}],"explanation":"`df` 只有 **2** 行，列名是 **S11、8、control**。read_csv 默认把第一行当列名，可这个文件没有列名行，于是第一条记录被拿去当了列名，记录也少了一条。读之前先看一眼文件的第一行是不是列名。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p5.csv\").write_text(\"S11,8,control\\nS12,10,drug\\nS13,13,drug\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"仪器导出的 `plates/p5.csv` 没有列名行，全部内容是：\n\n```text\nS11,8,control\nS12,10,drug\nS13,13,drug\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py44.k1.x1","body":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"plates/p6.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"cols","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`df` 有几列？","key":1},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"要读成 sample_id、signal、group 三列，应该改成哪一行？","options":[{"id":"encoding","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"plates/p6.csv\", encoding=\"gbk\")\n```\n"},{"id":"dtype","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"plates/p6.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n"},{"id":"sep","content":"```python\ndf = pd.read_csv(\"plates/p6.csv\", sep=\";\")\n```\n"}],"key":"sep"}],"explanation":"只有 **1** 列：read_csv 默认按逗号分字段，这个文件里没有逗号，整行都挤进了一列，列名是 `sample_id;signal;group`。加上 **`sep=\";\"`** 告诉它用分号分隔，才是 3 列。改编码或改编号列的类型都解决不了分隔符的问题。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p6.csv\").write_text(\n    \"sample_id;signal;group\\nS21;9;control\\nS22;11;drug\\nS23;7;drug\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"另一台仪器导出的 `plates/p6.csv` 用分号分隔，全部内容是：\n\n```text\nsample_id;signal;group\nS21;9;control\nS22;11;drug\nS23;7;drug\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k1.x2","body":"写出下面每个表达式得到的是哪种东西。\n","slots":[{"id":"types","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"kind","header":"类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"dict","label":"字典 dict"},{"id":"list","label":"列表 list"},{"id":"str","label":"字符串 str"},{"id":"bool","label":"布尔值 bool"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"plates","cells":{"expr":"config[\"plates\"]","kind":"list"}},{"id":"second","cells":{"expr":"config[\"plates\"][1]","kind":"dict"}},{"id":"wells","cells":{"expr":"config[\"plates\"][1][\"wells\"]","kind":"list"}},{"id":"well","cells":{"expr":"config[\"plates\"][1][\"wells\"][0]","kind":"str"}},{"id":"calibrated","cells":{"expr":"config[\"calibrated\"]","kind":"bool"}}]}],"explanation":"`config[\"plates\"]` 是**列表**；它的第二项是 P2 那块板的**字典**；这块板的 `\"wells\"` 虽然只有一个孔位，仍是方括号，是**列表**；列表里的 \"C3\" 是**字符串**；`\"calibrated\"` 的 `true` 读成 True，是**布尔值**。只有一项的列表还是列表，不会自动变成那一项。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nconfig = json.loads(\"\"\"{\n  \"instrument\": \"reader-2\",\n  \"plates\": [\n    {\"plate\": \"P1\", \"wells\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"B1\"]},\n    {\"plate\": \"P2\", \"wells\": [\"C3\"]}\n  ],\n  \"calibrated\": true\n}\"\"\")\n","display":"仪器设置已经用 json 读进来，结果叫 `config`。原文：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"instrument\": \"reader-2\",\n  \"plates\": [\n    {\"plate\": \"P1\", \"wells\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"B1\"]},\n    {\"plate\": \"P2\", \"wells\": [\"C3\"]}\n  ],\n  \"calibrated\": true\n}\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py44.k2","title":"按键和位置走到目标值","key":["py37","py06"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"逐层取值","aliases":["嵌套取值","路径"],"definition":"从最外层开始，遇到字典用键、遇到列表用从 0 开始的位置，一层一层写方括号，直到拿到要的值。","conditions":["每一步先想手里是字典还是列表：对列表用文字键报 TypeError，键写错报 KeyError，位置超出报 IndexError。","对字典用数字位置，例如 data[0]，Python 会把 0 当成一个键去找，报 KeyError。"],"example":"data[\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]：先取 samples 这个列表，再取第 2 项（位置 1）这个字典，最后取它的 signal，得到 10。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json` 已经用 `json.load` 读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"要的值藏在几层里面时，从最外层开始，一层一层往里走：\n\n```python\ndata[\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]\n```\n\n读法是从左往右：\n\n1. `data` 是字典，用键 `\"samples\"` 取出样本列表；\n2. 列表按位置取，`[1]` 是第 2 项（位置从 0 开始），得到 S02 那条记录的字典；\n3. 这个字典再用键 `\"signal\"`，得到 10。\n\n走错一层时，报错的类型能告诉你错在哪：\n\n| 写法 | 报错 | 原因 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `data[\"sample\"]` | KeyError | 字典里没有这个键（少了一个 s） |\n| `data[\"samples\"][\"S02\"]` | TypeError | 列表只能按位置取，不能用文字 |\n| `data[\"samples\"][4]` | IndexError | 列表只有 4 项，位置最大是 3 |\n| `data[0]` | KeyError | 字典没有位置，0 被当成一个键去找 |\n\n还有一个常见的偷懒：照着眼前的文件把值抄成 `signal = 10`。换一份文件，它就错了。写出取值的路径，代码才能用在下一份文件上。\n","example":{"id":"py44.k2.e0","body":"按顺序看 `data[\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]` 每走一步拿到了什么。\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"走到"},{"id":"kind","header":"拿到的是","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"dict","label":"字典 dict"},{"id":"list","label":"列表 list"},{"id":"int","label":"整数 int"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"]","kind":"list"}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][1]","kind":"dict"}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]","kind":"int"}}]},{"id":"sample","type":"text","prompt":"第二步拿到的是哪个样本的记录？写出它的 sample_id。","key":"S02"},{"id":"value","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后得到的值是多少？","key":10}],"explanation":"第一步用键取出**列表**；第二步按位置 1 取出第 2 项，是 **S02** 那条记录的**字典**；第三步用键 \"signal\" 取出**整数 10**。位置从 0 开始，`[1]` 是第二项，不是 S01。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json` 已经用 `json.load` 读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py44.k2.q1","body":"要取出 S03 的 group。用下面的块拼出这个表达式，从左往右排；用不到的块不要放进来。\n","slots":[{"id":"path","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"group","content":"`[\"group\"]`"},{"id":"i3","content":"`[3]`"},{"id":"data","content":"`data`"},{"id":"S03","content":"`[\"S03\"]`"},{"id":"i2","content":"`[2]`"},{"id":"samples","content":"`[\"samples\"]`"}],"key":["data","samples","i2","group"]}],"explanation":"`data[\"samples\"][2][\"group\"]`，得到 \"drug\"。S03 是列表里的第 3 项，位置是 2。`[\"S03\"]` 不能用：列表只能按位置取，\"S03\" 只是记录里 sample_id 的值，不是键；`[3]` 是第 4 项 S04。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json` 已经用 `json.load` 读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k2.q2","body":"写出每个表达式的结果：能取到值的写出值，报错的写出异常类型的名字。\n","slots":[{"id":"results","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"表达式"},{"id":"result","header":"结果","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"expr":"data[\"sample\"]","result":"KeyError"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][\"S02\"]","result":"TypeError"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][4]","result":"IndexError"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"expr":"data[\"samples\"][-1][\"sample_id\"]","result":"S04"}}]}],"explanation":"- `data[\"sample\"]`：键少了一个 s，字典里没有，**KeyError**。\n- `data[\"samples\"][\"S02\"]`：样本列表只能按位置取，用文字报 **TypeError**。\n- `data[\"samples\"][4]`：列表有 4 项，位置是 0–3，**IndexError**。\n- `data[\"samples\"][-1][\"sample_id\"]`：-1 是最后一项，得到 **S04**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json` 已经用 `json.load` 读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k2.q3","body":"需求是：取出**第二块板**上**第一个样本**的 signal，存进 `signal`。换一份同样结构的文件，代码也要取对。\n\n作答框里的代码取错了。请改动它并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"signal = data[\"plates\"][0][\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]\n","solution":"signal = data[\"plates\"][1][\"samples\"][0][\"signal\"]\n","accepts":["plate = data[\"plates\"][1]\nsignal = plate[\"samples\"][0][\"signal\"]\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"signal = 12","why":"照着眼前的文件把值抄成了 12"},{"code":"signal = data[\"plates\"][2][\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]","why":"把“第二”“第一”写成了位置 2 和 1"},{"code":"signal = data[\"plates\"][1][\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"]","why":"样本位置还是 1，取成了第二个样本"}],"tests":[{"name":"本文件","expect":{"signal":"12"}},{"name":"换一份三块板的文件","hidden":true,"data":["runs_b"],"expect":{"signal":"7"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nsignal = data[\"plates\"][1][\"samples\"][0][\"signal\"]\n```\n\n第二块板是位置 1，第一个样本是位置 0。原来的代码把两个位置弄反了，取到的是第一块板的第二个样本 S02。本文件得到 12；判分时还会换一份三块板的文件检查。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"runs\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"runs\").mkdir()\nPath(\"runs/r3.json\").write_text(\"\"\"{\n  \"run\": 3,\n  \"plates\": [\n    {\"plate\": \"P1\", \"samples\": [{\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8}, {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10}]},\n    {\"plate\": \"P2\", \"samples\": [{\"sample_id\": \"S05\", \"signal\": 12}, {\"sample_id\": \"S06\", \"signal\": 9}]}\n  ]\n}\"\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"runs/r3.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `runs/r3.json` 已经读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"run\": 3,\n  \"plates\": [\n    {\"plate\": \"P1\", \"samples\": [{\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8}, {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10}]},\n    {\"plate\": \"P2\", \"samples\": [{\"sample_id\": \"S05\", \"signal\": 12}, {\"sample_id\": \"S06\", \"signal\": 9}]}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py44.k2.r1","body":"阅读程序，写出三行各显示什么。\n\n```python startLine=1\nprint(sites[1][\"site\"])\nprint(sites[0][\"depth\"][1])\nprint(sites[-1][\"depth\"][0])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","shown":"南坡"}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":"32"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"35"}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **南坡**、**32**、**35**。`sites[1]` 是第二个采样点南坡；`sites[0][\"depth\"][1]` 是北坡的第二次测量；`sites[-1]` 是最后一个采样点东坡，它的第一次测量是 35。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nsites = json.loads(\"\"\"[\n  {\"site\": \"北坡\", \"depth\": [30, 32]},\n  {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": [25, 27]},\n  {\"site\": \"东坡\", \"depth\": [35, 33]}\n]\"\"\")\n","display":"野外记录已经用 json 读进来，结果叫 `sites`。原文：\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"site\": \"北坡\", \"depth\": [30, 32]},\n  {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": [25, 27]},\n  {\"site\": \"东坡\", \"depth\": [35, 33]}\n]\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k2.r2","body":"想显示 S02 的 signal，写成了 `print(data[\"samples\"][\"signal\"])`，报了 TypeError。改成哪一行才对？\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"by_id","content":"```python\nprint(data[\"samples\"][\"S02\"][\"signal\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"no_list","content":"```python\nprint(data[\"signal\"][1])\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nprint(data[\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"off_by_one","content":"```python\nprint(data[\"samples\"][2][\"signal\"])\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"`print(data[\"samples\"][1][\"signal\"])`：样本列表要先按位置取出 S02（位置 1），再用键取 signal。\n\n用 \"S02\" 去取列表同样报 TypeError；`data` 最外层没有 \"signal\" 这个键，报 KeyError；位置 2 是第三项 S03，会显示 13 而不是 S02 的 10。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nP1_TEXT = \"\"\"{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n\"\"\"\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/p1.json\").write_text(P1_TEXT, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"plates/p1.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n","display":"文件 `plates/p1.json` 已经用 `json.load` 读进来，结果叫 `data`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plate\": \"P1\",\n  \"operator\": \"lin\",\n  \"samples\": [\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 8, \"group\": \"control\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"signal\": 13, \"group\": \"drug\"},\n    {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": 10, \"group\": \"control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py44.k2.x1","body":"需求是：取出列表里**第二位**受访者对问题 q2 的回答，存进 `value`。换一份同样结构的文件，代码也要取对，别的文件里的受访者人数不一定是 3。\n\n下面哪几段代码能做到？选出所有能做到的。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"direct","content":"```python\nvalue = responses[1][\"answers\"][\"q2\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"stepwise","content":"```python\nsecond = responses[1]\nvalue = second[\"answers\"][\"q2\"]\n```\n"},{"id":"with_get","content":"```python\nvalue = responses[1][\"answers\"].get(\"q2\")\n```\n"},{"id":"from_end","content":"```python\nvalue = responses[-2][\"answers\"][\"q2\"]\n```\n","feedback":"倒数第二位只有在恰好 3 个人时才是第二位；换成 2 个人的文件，它取到的是第一位。"},{"id":"by_id","content":"```python\nvalue = responses[\"R2\"][\"answers\"][\"q2\"]\n```\n","feedback":"最外层是列表，只能按位置取，用文字 \"R2\" 会报 TypeError。"},{"id":"third","content":"```python\nvalue = responses[2][\"answers\"][\"q2\"]\n```\n","feedback":"位置从 0 数起，位置 2 是第三位。"}],"key":["direct","stepwise","with_get"]}],"explanation":"最外层是列表，第二位的位置是 1；取出的字典里，回答放在 `\"answers\"` 这个字典里，再取 `\"q2\"`。\n\n- `responses[1][\"answers\"][\"q2\"]`、先存成 `second` 再取，两种写法一回事，都对。\n- `.get(\"q2\")` 在键存在时取到同一个值，也对。\n- `responses[-2]` 是倒数第二位：本文件正好 3 人，碰巧也是第二位；换成 2 个人的文件，它就成了第一位。要“第二位”，就写位置 1。\n- `responses[\"R2\"]` 用文字去取列表，报 TypeError；`responses[2]` 是第三位。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nimport shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nshutil.rmtree(\"survey\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"survey\").mkdir()\nPath(\"survey/responses.json\").write_text(\"\"\"[\n  {\"id\": \"R1\", \"answers\": {\"q1\": 3, \"q2\": 5}},\n  {\"id\": \"R2\", \"answers\": {\"q1\": 4, \"q2\": 2}},\n  {\"id\": \"R3\", \"answers\": {\"q1\": 5, \"q2\": 4}}\n]\"\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nwith open(\"survey/responses.json\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    responses = json.load(f)\n","display":"问卷结果 `survey/responses.json` 已经读进来，结果叫 `responses`。文件内容：\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"id\": \"R1\", \"answers\": {\"q1\": 3, \"q2\": 5}},\n  {\"id\": \"R2\", \"answers\": {\"q1\": 4, \"q2\": 2}},\n  {\"id\": \"R3\", \"answers\": {\"q1\": 5, \"q2\": 4}}\n]\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k2.x2","body":"想显示第一块板（P1）的孔位列表，写成了下面这行，一运行就报错。\n\n```python\nprint(config[0][\"wells\"])\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"error","type":"choice","prompt":"报的是哪种异常？","options":[{"id":"IndexError","content":"IndexError"},{"id":"TypeError","content":"TypeError"},{"id":"KeyError","content":"KeyError"}],"key":"KeyError"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"改成哪一行，才会显示 P1 的孔位列表？","options":[{"id":"by_name","content":"```python\nprint(config[\"plates\"][\"P1\"][\"wells\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"second","content":"```python\nprint(config[\"plates\"][1][\"wells\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"no_plates","content":"```python\nprint(config[\"wells\"][0])\n```\n"},{"id":"right","content":"```python\nprint(config[\"plates\"][0][\"wells\"])\n```\n"}],"key":"right"}],"explanation":"报 **KeyError**，不是 IndexError：`config` 是字典，没有“第 0 项”，Python 把 0 当成一个键去找，找不到。板的列表放在 `\"plates\"` 这个键下面，要先取出它，再按位置取第一块：`print(config[\"plates\"][0][\"wells\"])`。\n\n用 \"P1\" 去取列表报 TypeError；位置 1 是第二块板 P2；`config` 最外层没有 \"wells\" 这个键。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nconfig = json.loads(\"\"\"{\n  \"instrument\": \"reader-2\",\n  \"plates\": [\n    {\"plate\": \"P1\", \"wells\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"B1\"]},\n    {\"plate\": \"P2\", \"wells\": [\"C3\"]}\n  ],\n  \"calibrated\": true\n}\"\"\")\n","display":"仪器设置已经用 json 读进来，结果叫 `config`。原文：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"instrument\": \"reader-2\",\n  \"plates\": [\n    {\"plate\": \"P1\", \"wells\": [\"A1\", \"A2\", \"B1\"]},\n    {\"plate\": \"P2\", \"wells\": [\"C3\"]}\n  ],\n  \"calibrated\": true\n}\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py44.k3","title":"缺键、缺失和字段类型的验证","key":["py37","py03","py15"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"缺失与类型","aliases":["缺键","null","字段类型"],"definition":"一条记录的某个值可能缺这一项、写着 null（读成 None）、或者类型不对（例如文字 \"12\"）；先用 in、get 和 type() 查出是哪一种，再按写明的规则处理。","conditions":["get 只在缺这一项时用默认值；键在而值是 null 时，get 照样得到 None。","read_csv 把空格子读成 NaN，整列跟着变成小数；一列里只要有一格是文字，整列都成了文字。"],"example":"S03 没有 signal 这一项：\"signal\" in rec 是 False，rec.get(\"signal\") 得到 None；S04 写着 null：in 是 True，get 同样得到 None。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nrecs = json.loads(\"\"\"[\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 12},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": \"12\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S03\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": null}\n]\"\"\")\n","display":"四条记录已经用 json 读进来，结果叫 `recs`。原文：\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 12},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": \"12\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S03\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": null}\n]\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"从文件里取值时，同一个字段在不同记录里可能是三种不同的“不对劲”：\n\n| 情况 | JSON 里的样子 | `\"signal\" in rec` | `rec.get(\"signal\")` | `rec[\"signal\"]` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 正常 | `\"signal\": 12` | True | 12 | 12 |\n| 缺这一项 | 没有 `\"signal\"` | False | None | 报 KeyError |\n| 值为空 | `\"signal\": null` | True | None | None |\n| 类型不对 | `\"signal\": \"12\"` | True | `'12'`（文字） | `'12'` |\n\n- `rec[\"signal\"]` 遇到缺键会报错；`rec.get(\"signal\")` 不报错，缺键时得到 None，也可以写 `rec.get(\"signal\", 默认值)`。默认值只在**缺这一项**时才用，值写着 null 时仍是 None。\n- `type(值)` 告诉你类型：`type(12)` 是 int，`type(\"12\")` 是 str。文字 \"12\" 看着像数，却不能直接拿来算。\n\nCSV 读成表时也有对应的情况：空着的格子读成 **NaN**，整数列会因此变成小数列（float64）；一列里只要有一格写着“未测”这样的文字，整列都成了文字列（str）。`df[\"列\"].dtype` 可以查看一列的类型。\n\n查出来之后，怎样处理是业务规则，要写清楚，而不是让代码悄悄决定。尤其不要把缺失补成 0：0 是一个真实的测量结果，缺测不是。\n","example":{"id":"py44.k3.e0","body":"对每条记录 `rec`，分别求出：`\"signal\" in rec`、`rec.get(\"signal\")` 显示什么，以及 `type(rec.get(\"signal\"))` 是哪种类型。\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"record","header":"记录"},{"id":"has","header":"\"signal\" in rec","input":"bool"},{"id":"got","header":"rec.get(\"signal\")","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}},{"id":"kind","header":"类型","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int","label":"int"},{"id":"str","label":"str"},{"id":"NoneType","label":"NoneType（None 的类型）"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"S01","cells":{"record":"S01","has":true,"got":"12","kind":"int"}},{"id":"S02","cells":{"record":"S02","has":true,"got":"'12'","kind":"str"}},{"id":"S03","cells":{"record":"S03","has":false,"got":"None","kind":"NoneType"}},{"id":"S04","cells":{"record":"S04","has":true,"got":"None","kind":"NoneType"}}]}],"explanation":"| 记录 | in | get | 类型 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| S01 | True | 12 | int |\n| S02 | True | '12' | str |\n| S03 | False | None | NoneType |\n| S04 | True | None | NoneType |\n\nS02 的值带引号，读进来是文字 '12'。S03 和 S04 用 get 都得到 None，但原因不同：S03 根本没有这一项，S04 有这一项、值写着 null。要分清这两种，就看 `in`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nrecs = json.loads(\"\"\"[\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 12},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": \"12\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S03\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": null}\n]\"\"\")\n","display":"四条记录已经用 json 读进来，结果叫 `recs`。原文：\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S01\", \"signal\": 12},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S02\", \"signal\": \"12\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S03\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S04\", \"signal\": null}\n]\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py44.k3.q1","body":"在交互解释器里依次输入下面几行。每一行显示什么？什么都不显示的写 NOTHING，报错的写 ERROR。\n\n```python startLine=1\nrec = {\"sample_id\": \"S03\", \"group\": \"drug\"}\nrec.get(\"signal\")\nrec.get(\"signal\", \"缺失\")\n\"signal\" in rec\nrec[\"signal\"]\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"'缺失'"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":"False"}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","shown":"ERROR"}}]}],"explanation":"- 第 2 行：缺这一项，get 得到 None；交互解释器遇到 None **什么都不显示**（NOTHING）。\n- 第 3 行：给了默认值，得到 **'缺失'**。\n- 第 4 行：**False**，记录里没有 signal 这个键。\n- 第 5 行：用方括号取一个不存在的键，报 KeyError（**ERROR**）。\n"},{"id":"py44.k3.q2","body":"```python startLine=1\na = pd.read_csv(\"plates/a.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nb = pd.read_csv(\"plates/b.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nprint(a[\"signal\"].dtype)\nprint(b[\"signal\"].dtype)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"dtypes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"代码行"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"int64","label":"int64"},{"id":"float64","label":"float64"},{"id":"str","label":"str"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","shown":"float64"}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","shown":"str"}}]},{"id":"blank","type":"choice","prompt":"`a` 里 002 那一格读成了什么？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"0"},{"id":"empty","content":"空的文字 \"\""},{"id":"nan","content":"NaN（缺失）"}],"key":"nan"}],"explanation":"第 3 行显示 **float64**：空格子读成 **NaN**，而 NaN 只能放在小数列里，整列的 8、12 也跟着成了 8.0、12.0。第 4 行显示 **str**：只要有一格是“未测”这样的文字，整列都成了文字，8 和 12 也成了文字 '8'、'12'。\n\n两种情况都不会报错，读完看一眼每列的 dtype，才能发现。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nshutil.rmtree(\"plates\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"plates\").mkdir()\nPath(\"plates/a.csv\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,8\\n002,\\n003,12\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nPath(\"plates/b.csv\").write_text(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,8\\n002,未测\\n003,12\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"两个文件只差 002 那一格：`plates/a.csv` 里是空的，`plates/b.csv` 里写着“未测”。\n\n```text\nplates/a.csv          plates/b.csv\nsample_id,signal      sample_id,signal\n001,8                 001,8\n002,                  002,未测\n003,12                003,12\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k3.q3","body":"把每条记录的 signal 归到一类。\n","slots":[{"id":"classes","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"record","header":"记录"},{"id":"category","header":"signal 的情况","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ok","label":"正常的数"},{"id":"missing","label":"缺这一项"},{"id":"null","label":"值为 null"},{"id":"text","label":"是文字"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"S05","cells":{"record":"S05","category":"ok"}},{"id":"S06","cells":{"record":"S06","category":"null"}},{"id":"S07","cells":{"record":"S07","category":"text"}},{"id":"S08","cells":{"record":"S08","category":"missing"}}]}],"explanation":"S05 是**正常的数**；S06 有 signal 这一项，**值为 null**；S07 的 \"9.5\" 带引号，**是文字**；S08 只有 sample_id 和 group，**缺这一项**。\n\n查的办法：先用 `\"signal\" in rec` 看有没有这一项，有的话再用 `type(rec[\"signal\"])` 看是 int、float、str 还是 NoneType。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import json\nrecs = json.loads(\"\"\"[\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S05\", \"signal\": 9},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S06\", \"signal\": null},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S07\", \"signal\": \"9.5\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S08\", \"group\": \"drug\"}\n]\"\"\")\n","display":"第二块板的四条记录已经读进来，结果叫 `recs`。原文：\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S05\", \"signal\": 9},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S06\", \"signal\": null},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S07\", \"signal\": \"9.5\"},\n  {\"sample_id\": \"S08\", \"group\": \"drug\"}\n]\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py44.k3.r1","body":"每个采样点的记录 `rec` 是一个字典，可能没有 `\"depth\"` 这一项。需求是：\n\n> 取出 depth 存进 `depth`；没有这一项时，`depth` 得到 None，不报错，也不补成 0。\n\n作答框里的代码遇到缺 depth 的记录会报 KeyError。请改动它并提交。宿主会准备好不同的 `rec` 来检查。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":3,"starter":"depth = rec[\"depth\"]\n","solution":"depth = rec.get(\"depth\")\n","accepts":["depth = rec.get(\"depth\", None)"],"rejects":[{"code":"depth = rec.get(\"depth\", 0)","why":"缺的时候补成了 0"},{"code":"depth = \"depth\" in rec","why":"得到的是有没有这一项，不是深度"}],"tests":[{"name":"有 depth","setup":"rec = {\"site\": \"北坡\", \"depth\": 30}","expect":{"depth":"30"}},{"name":"缺 depth","setup":"rec = {\"site\": \"东坡\"}","expect":{"depth":"None"}},{"name":"depth 为 None","hidden":true,"setup":"rec = {\"site\": \"西坡\", \"depth\": None}","expect":{"depth":"None"}},{"name":"depth 恰好是 0","hidden":true,"setup":"rec = {\"site\": \"南坡\", \"depth\": 0}","expect":{"depth":"0"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndepth = rec.get(\"depth\")\n```\n\nget 在缺这一项时得到 None，不报错。写成 `rec.get(\"depth\", 0)` 会把缺测补成 0，和真的测出 0 分不开，不符合需求。\n"},{"id":"py44.k3.r2","body":"两条记录：\n\n```python\nrec_a = {\"sample_id\": \"S07\", \"signal\": None}\nrec_b = {\"sample_id\": \"S08\"}\n```\n\n`rec_a` 来自 JSON 里的 `\"signal\": null`。下面哪一句说法正确？\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"both_no_key","content":"两条记录都没有 signal 这一项"},{"id":"zero","content":"rec_a 的 signal 是 0"},{"id":"get_error","content":"对 rec_b 写 rec_b.get(\"signal\") 会报 KeyError"},{"id":"same_get","content":"两条记录用 get 取 signal 都得到 None，但只有 rec_a 有 signal 这一项"}],"key":"same_get"}],"explanation":"“两条记录用 get 都得到 None，但只有 rec_a 有 signal 这一项”正确。rec_a 的 null 读成 None，键还在；rec_b 根本没有这个键，get 不报错，也得到 None。要分清它们，用 `\"signal\" in rec`。null 不是 0。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py44.k3.x1","body":"用 `df = pd.read_csv(\"field/day4.csv\")` 读进文件。读完发现 depth 一列不能直接求平均。\n","slots":[{"id":"dtype","type":"choice","prompt":"`df[\"depth\"]` 读成了什么类型？","options":[{"id":"int64","content":"int64（整数）"},{"id":"float64","content":"float64（小数）"},{"id":"str","content":"str（文字）"}],"key":"str"},{"id":"culprit","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个采样点的那一格，让整列都成了这个类型？","options":[{"id":"north","content":"北坡"},{"id":"south","content":"南坡"},{"id":"east","content":"东坡"},{"id":"west","content":"西坡"},{"id":"peak","content":"山顶"},{"id":"valley","content":"谷底"}],"key":"peak"},{"id":"fixed","type":"choice","prompt":"如果把那一格改成 21（其余不变）再读，depth 是什么类型？","options":[{"id":"int64","content":"int64（整数）"},{"id":"float64","content":"float64（小数）"},{"id":"str","content":"str（文字）"}],"key":"int64"}],"explanation":"一列只有一种类型。只要有一格不是数，`约 21` 这样的写法，整列都会读成文字：谷底的 33、北坡的 30 在 `df` 里也是文字，不能直接算平均。\n\n是哪一格出的问题，可以逐个看：只有山顶那格带着汉字。把它改成 21，六格都是整数，depth 就读成 int64。\n\n读完先看 `df.dtypes`：该是数的列显示 str，就回头在文件里找夹着文字的那一格。至于“约 21”该改成 21、记为缺失，还是去问记录的人，要按需求定，不能让程序悄悄决定。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import shutil\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\nshutil.rmtree(\"field\", ignore_errors=True)\nPath(\"field\").mkdir()\nPath(\"field/day4.csv\").write_text(\"site,depth\\n北坡,30\\n南坡,25\\n东坡,35\\n西坡,28\\n山顶,约 21\\n谷底,33\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n","display":"第四天的野外记录 `field/day4.csv`，内容是：\n\n```text\nsite,depth\n北坡,30\n南坡,25\n东坡,35\n西坡,28\n山顶,约 21\n谷底,33\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py44.k3.x2","body":"需求写着：“signal 缺失的样本记为缺失，不当作 0。”AI 给的代码对每条记录 `rec` 这样取值：\n\n```python\nvalue = rec.get(\"signal\", 0)\n```\n\n下面哪些说法正确？选出所有。\n","slots":[{"id":"claims","type":"choice","multiple":true,"options":[{"id":"missing_zero","content":"缺 signal 这一项的记录，value 得到 0"},{"id":"null_zero","content":"signal 为 null 的记录，value 也得到 0"},{"id":"missing_error","content":"缺 signal 这一项的记录会报 KeyError"},{"id":"mixed","content":"按这段代码，缺测的样本和真的测出 0 的样本分不出来"}],"key":["missing_zero","mixed"]}],"explanation":"正确的是“缺这一项得到 0”和“缺测与真测出 0 分不出来”。get 的默认值只在缺这一项时使用，所以缺 signal 的记录得到 0，不会报错；signal 为 null 的记录键还在，得到的是 None，不是 0。\n\n这段代码把缺测补成了 0，和需求不符：它应当得到 None（或单独记为缺失），而不是 0。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py45","title":"为什么同一本 notebook 重跑会变","summary":"notebook 里变量的值取决于单元格实际运行的先后和次数；重启内核再从上到下全部运行，才能查出依赖隐藏状态的结果。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py01","py13"],"intro":"notebook（例如 Jupyter）把代码分成一个个单元格，可以单独运行、重复运行、改了再运行。背后有一个**内核**，记着运行过的所有名字和它们的值。\n\n这很方便，也带来一个问题：屏幕上看到的代码和结果，不一定是内核里真正发生过的事。这一节的题目里，每个单元格写成一个代码块，前面标出它在屏幕上的位置和左边的执行编号，例如 `[3]`。\n","wrapup":"notebook 里一个值对不对，要看单元格实际怎样运行过，而不是屏幕上怎样排列。交付或依赖一个结果之前，先“重启内核并全部运行”：从上到下跑通、结果和之前一样，才算可以重现。\n\n请 AI 或同事给你 notebook 时，可以直接要求：“请先重启内核、从上到下全部运行一遍，确认不报错、结果和你说的一致，再发给我。”\n","kps":[{"id":"py45.k1","title":"执行顺序与屏幕排列可能不同","key":["py01"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"执行顺序","aliases":["单元格","内核","执行编号"],"definition":"notebook 里变量的值取决于单元格实际运行的先后和次数，而不是它们在屏幕上的排列；单元格左边的 [编号] 是它最近一次运行的顺序。","conditions":["同一个单元格运行两次，里面的 n = n + 5 就做了两次；屏幕上只留下最后一次的输出。","删掉或改动单元格，不会改变内核里已经有的变量，要重新运行才算数。"],"example":"A: n = 10，B: n = n + 5，C: print(n)。依次运行 A、B、C、B：C 显示 15，但内核里的 n 已经是 20；编号是 A [1]、B [4]、C [3]。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"在 notebook 里运行一个单元格，就是把这一格的代码交给内核执行。内核记着**所有运行过的**赋值，不管它们来自哪一格、那一格现在还在不在屏幕上。\n\n所以读一本 notebook 时要分清两件事：\n\n- **屏幕排列**：单元格从上到下怎么摆；\n- **执行顺序**：它们实际按什么先后、运行了几次。\n\n单元格左边的 `[编号]` 记的是这一格**最近一次**运行时排第几。编号不按从上到下递增，就说明运行顺序和屏幕排列不同；同一格运行了好几次，只留下最后一次的编号和输出。\n\n几种常见情况：\n\n- 同一格运行两次，里面的 `n = n + 5` 就加了两次，正像一段程序里把这一行写了两遍；\n- 删掉一个运行过的单元格，它定义的名字仍留在内核里，后面的单元格照样能用；\n- 改了某一格的代码却没有重新运行，屏幕上是新代码，内核里还是旧代码算出的值。\n\n读的时候，按实际运行顺序把单元格接成一段程序，再像追踪普通程序那样逐行记下每个名字的值。\n\n另外，notebook 会自动显示单元格最后一行表达式的值；这一节的题目都用 print 显示，避免混淆。\n","example":{"id":"py45.k1.e0","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格：\n\n单元格 A：\n\n```python\nn = 10\n```\n\n单元格 B：\n\n```python\nn = n + 5\n```\n\n单元格 C：\n\n```python\nprint(n)\n```\n\n打开 notebook 后，依次运行了 A、B、C、B。\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"屏幕上单元格 C 下面显示的是什么？","key":15},{"id":"kernel","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"现在内核里的 `n` 是多少？","key":20},{"id":"counts","type":"table","prompt":"每个单元格左边的执行编号是多少？","columns":[{"id":"cell","header":"单元格"},{"id":"count","header":"编号","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"A","cells":{"cell":"A","count":1}},{"id":"B","cells":{"cell":"B","count":4}},{"id":"C","cells":{"cell":"C","count":3}}]}],"explanation":"按运行顺序接起来就是：`n = 10`、`n = n + 5`、`print(n)`、`n = n + 5`。C 运行时 n 是 15，所以 C 下面显示 **15**；之后 B 又运行了一次，内核里的 n 变成 **20**，但 C 没有再运行，屏幕上仍是 15。\n\n编号记最近一次运行：A 是 **[1]**，C 是 **[3]**，B 最后一次是第 4 次运行，显示 **[4]**。屏幕上 B 的编号比下面的 C 还大，就提示运行顺序和屏幕排列不同。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py45.k1.q1","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格，每个都只运行过一次：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\nx = x * 2\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\nx = 3\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[3]`：\n\n```python\nprint(x)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"order","type":"order","prompt":"按实际运行的先后排出三个单元格。","items":[{"id":"A","content":"单元格 A"},{"id":"B","content":"单元格 B"},{"id":"C","content":"单元格 C"}],"key":["B","A","C"]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"C 下面显示什么？","key":6}],"explanation":"编号从小到大就是运行顺序：B（`x = 3`）、A（`x = x * 2`）、C。所以 C 显示 **6**。如果照屏幕从上往下读，会以为 A 先运行，那时 x 还没有定义。\n"},{"id":"py45.k1.q2","body":"屏幕上现在有两个单元格：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\ntotal = 40\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[3]`，下面显示 45：\n\n```python\nprint(total + bonus)\n```\n\n原来 A 和 C 之间还有一个单元格，内容如下。它运行过（编号 `[2]`），后来被删掉了：\n\n```python\nbonus = 5\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"again","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"现在不重启，直接再运行一次 C，显示什么？","key":45},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么还能这样显示？","options":[{"id":"zero","content":"找不到 bonus 时，Python 把它当作 0"},{"id":"kept","content":"删掉单元格不会删掉它定义的变量，bonus 还在内核里"},{"id":"screen","content":"屏幕上显示的是上一次的结果，C 其实没有运行"}],"key":"kept"}],"explanation":"再运行 C 仍显示 **45**。删掉的单元格运行过，`bonus = 5` 已经存进内核；删掉的只是屏幕上的代码，变量还在。\n\n这正是隐藏状态：只看屏幕，找不到 bonus 是从哪里来的。下一个知识点会看到，重启之后它就消失了。\n"},{"id":"py45.k1.q3","body":"屏幕上有两个单元格：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\nlimit = 12\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\nprint(limit * 2)\n```\n\nA 运行的时候写的是下面这一行；运行完以后才改成现在的 `limit = 12`，改完没有再运行：\n\n```python\nlimit = 10\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"屏幕上 B 下面显示什么？","key":20},{"id":"rerun_b","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"现在只再运行一次 B，显示什么？","key":20},{"id":"rerun_both","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果先运行 A、再运行 B，B 显示什么？","key":24}],"explanation":"B 显示 **20**，只再运行 B 还是 **20**：内核里的 limit 是 A 改动之前算的 10，屏幕上的 `limit = 12` 还没有运行过。先运行 A、再运行 B，limit 才变成 12，B 显示 **24**。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py45.k1.r1","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格：\n\n单元格 P：\n\n```python\ncount = 0\n```\n\n单元格 Q：\n\n```python\ncount = count + 1\n```\n\n单元格 R：\n\n```python\nprint(count)\n```\n\n依次运行了 P、Q、Q、R、Q。\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","prompt":"每次运行之后，内核里的 count 是多少？","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"第几次运行"},{"id":"cell","header":"运行的单元格"},{"id":"count","header":"count","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"step":"1","cell":"P","count":0}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"step":"2","cell":"Q","count":1}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"step":"3","cell":"Q","count":2}},{"id":"s4","cells":{"step":"4","cell":"R","count":2}},{"id":"s5","cells":{"step":"5","cell":"Q","count":3}}]},{"id":"shown","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"屏幕上 R 下面显示什么？","key":2}],"explanation":"count 依次是 0、1、2、2、3。R 是第 4 次运行的，那时 count 是 2，所以屏幕上 R 显示 **2**；之后 Q 又运行一次，内核里已经是 3，屏幕上的 2 并没有更新。\n"},{"id":"py45.k1.r2","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格，C 下面显示 8：\n\n单元格 A：\n\n```python\ny = 2\n```\n\n单元格 B：\n\n```python\ny = y * 4\n```\n\n单元格 C：\n\n```python\nprint(y)\n```\n\n下面哪一种运行顺序会让 C 显示 8？\n","slots":[{"id":"history","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ac","content":"A、C"},{"id":"abbc","content":"A、B、B、C"},{"id":"acb","content":"A、C、B"},{"id":"abc","content":"A、B、C"}],"key":"abc"}],"explanation":"**A、B、C**：y 先是 2，B 把它乘成 8，C 显示 8。\n\nA、C 显示 2；A、B、B、C 中 B 运行了两次，y 成了 32；A、C、B 里 C 在 B 之前运行，显示的是 2，之后 B 再运行也不会改变 C 下面已经显示的内容。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py45.k1.x1","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\nlabel = \"plate\"\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[3]`：\n\n```python\nlabel = label + \"_v2\"\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[4]`：\n\n```python\nprint(label)\n```\n\nB 第一次运行后，你以为没运行成功，又运行了一次 B，然后运行 C。\n","slots":[{"id":"output","type":"text","prompt":"C 下面显示什么？","key":"plate_v2_v2","feedback":[{"when":"plate_v2","message":"B 运行了两次，\"_v2\" 也接了两次。"}]}],"explanation":"显示 **plate_v2_v2**。B 第一次运行把 label 变成 plate_v2（编号 [2]），第二次在这个基础上又接了一次（编号 [3]）。在原值上改动的单元格，运行几次就改几次。\n"},{"id":"py45.k1.x2","body":"屏幕上从上到下有四个单元格，每个都只运行过一次，编号如下：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[3]`：\n\n```python\ntotal = total + 7\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\ntotal = 0\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[4]`：\n\n```python\nprint(total)\n```\n\n单元格 D，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\ntotal = total + 5\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"trace","type":"table","prompt":"每个单元格运行完的那一刻，total 是多少？","columns":[{"id":"cell","header":"单元格（屏幕顺序）"},{"id":"total","header":"运行完时的 total","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"A","cells":{"cell":"A","total":12}},{"id":"B","cells":{"cell":"B","total":0}},{"id":"C","cells":{"cell":"C","total":12}},{"id":"D","cells":{"cell":"D","total":5}}]}],"explanation":"按编号排出实际顺序：B（0）、D（5）、A（12）、C（显示 12）。所以 B 运行完时 total 是 **0**，D 是 **5**，A 是 **12**，C 运行时没有改 total，仍是 **12**。屏幕上 A 排在最前面，但它是第三个运行的。\n"}]},{"id":"py45.k2","title":"重启后从头运行才能核对隐藏状态","key":["py01","py13"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"重启并全部运行","aliases":["Restart & Run All","重启内核","可重现"],"definition":"重启内核会清掉所有变量和导入；再按屏幕顺序从上到下运行全部单元格，不报错、结果和之前一致，才说明 notebook 不依赖隐藏状态。","conditions":["全部运行遇到第一个报错就停下，后面的单元格不再运行。","交付或依赖一个结果之前做这一步；只重新运行其中某一格查不出隐藏状态。"],"example":"屏幕上 A: print(total)、B: total = base + 5、C: base = 10，编号是 [3]、[2]、[1]。重启并全部运行时 A 先运行，报 NameError；把顺序调成 C、B、A 才能跑通。\n","datasets":[]},"lesson":"**重启内核**（Restart）会把内核里的一切清掉：所有变量，包括 import 进来的名字。接着**全部运行**（Run All）会按屏幕顺序，从第一个单元格运行到最后一个。两步合起来，就是把 notebook 当成一段从上往下的普通程序重新跑一遍。\n\n这一步能暴露上一个知识点里的各种隐藏状态：\n\n- 某个名字是在下面的单元格、或者已经删掉的单元格里定义的：从上往下运行时，用到它的那一格报 **NameError**；\n- 某一格在会话里运行过好几次，或者改了没重跑：结果和屏幕上原来显示的不一样。\n\n全部运行遇到第一个报错就停下，后面的单元格不会运行；屏幕上如果还留着它们上一次的输出，那也不是这次运行的结果。\n\n修好的标准是：重启并全部运行，中途不报错，关键结果和你要交付的一致。改的办法是把单元格挪到正确的位置、补回缺的那一步，或者删掉不该重复的操作，然后**再重启、再全部运行一次**确认。只重新运行出问题的那一格不算数，因为内核里可能还留着别的隐藏状态。\n","example":{"id":"py45.k2.e0","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格，编号和输出如下：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[3]`，下面显示 15：\n\n```python\nprint(total)\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\ntotal = base + 5\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\nbase = 10\n```\n\n现在重启内核并全部运行。\n","slots":[{"id":"stopped","type":"choice","prompt":"在哪个单元格停下来报错？","options":[{"id":"A","content":"单元格 A"},{"id":"B","content":"单元格 B"},{"id":"C","content":"单元格 C"},{"id":"none","content":"不报错，A 仍显示 15"}],"key":"A"},{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"报的是哪种异常？写出异常类型的名字。","key":"NameError"},{"id":"fixed","type":"order","prompt":"把三个单元格在屏幕上重新排列，让重启并全部运行能跑通、最后显示 15。从上到下排出它们。","items":[{"id":"A","content":"单元格 A"},{"id":"B","content":"单元格 B"},{"id":"C","content":"单元格 C"}],"key":["C","B","A"]}],"explanation":"全部运行从屏幕第一格开始，A 要显示 total，可内核刚清空，total 还不存在，在 **A** 就报 **NameError**，B、C 都没有运行。原来能显示 15，是因为会话里先运行了 C、再运行 B（编号 [1]、[2]）。\n\n按依赖关系排成 **C、B、A**：先有 base，再算 total，最后显示。改完再重启、全部运行一次，确认 A 显示 15。\n"},"practice":[{"id":"py45.k2.q1","body":"屏幕上现在有两个单元格：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\ntotal = 49\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[3]`，下面显示 7.0（`math.sqrt` 求平方根）：\n\n```python\nprint(math.sqrt(total))\n```\n\nA 和 C 之间原来有一个单元格，运行过（编号 `[2]`）之后被删掉了，它的内容是：\n\n```python\nimport math\n```\n\n现在重启内核并全部运行。\n","slots":[{"id":"stopped","type":"choice","prompt":"结果怎样？","options":[{"id":"fine","content":"跑通，C 仍显示 7.0"},{"id":"c_error","content":"C 报错"},{"id":"a_error","content":"A 报错"}],"key":"c_error"},{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"如果报错，是哪种异常？写出异常类型的名字；不报错写“无”。","key":"NameError"},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"怎样修好才算数？","options":[{"id":"rerun_c","content":"不重启，再运行一次 C 看看"},{"id":"add_back","content":"在 C 前面补回 import math，再重启并全部运行确认"},{"id":"move_c","content":"把 C 挪到 A 前面"}],"key":"add_back"}],"explanation":"**C 报 NameError**：重启清掉了所有名字，也清掉了 import 进来的 math；屏幕上已经没有 `import math`，从上往下运行时 math 不存在。\n\n修法是**在 C 前面补回 `import math`，再重启并全部运行**确认。不重启只再运行 C 什么也查不出；把 C 挪到 A 前面，连 total 也没有了。\n"},{"id":"py45.k2.q2","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格：\n\n单元格 A：\n\n```python\ncount = 0\n```\n\n单元格 B：\n\n```python\ncount = count + 1\n```\n\n单元格 C：\n\n```python\nprint(count)\n```\n\n会话里依次运行了 A、B、B、B、C。\n","slots":[{"id":"session","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"会话里 C 下面显示什么？","key":3},{"id":"restart","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"重启内核并全部运行后，C 下面显示什么？","key":1}],"explanation":"会话里 B 运行了三次，C 显示 **3**；重启并全部运行时每格只运行一次，C 显示 **1**。两个结果不同，说明原来的 3 依赖“B 多运行了两次”这个屏幕上看不出来的历史。哪个才是想要的，要回到需求去问，而不是看哪个顺眼。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py45.k2.r1","body":"一本 notebook 的四个单元格各只有一行，屏幕顺序乱了，重启并全部运行会报错。把它们在屏幕上重新排好，让重启并全部运行能跑通、最后显示平均值。从上到下排出四个单元格。\n","slots":[{"id":"cells","type":"order","items":[{"id":"show","code":"print(mean)"},{"id":"mean","code":"mean = total / n"},{"id":"n","code":"n = 4"},{"id":"total","code":"total = 36"}],"key":["total","n","mean","show"],"alternatives":[["n","total","mean","show"]],"tests":[{"name":"从上到下运行显示平均值","stdout":"9.0"}]}],"explanation":"`total = 36` 和 `n = 4` 放在最前面（两者谁先都可以），然后算 `mean`，最后显示。一个单元格要用到的名字，必须由它上面的单元格先定义好。\n"},{"id":"py45.k2.r2","body":"屏幕上从上到下有四个单元格。现在重启内核并全部运行。\n\n单元格 A：\n\n```python\nunit = \"cm\"\n```\n\n单元格 B：\n\n```python\nprint(depth, unit)\n```\n\n单元格 C：\n\n```python\ndepth = 30\n```\n\n单元格 D：\n\n```python\nprint(depth + 5)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"status","type":"table","prompt":"每个单元格的结果是什么？","columns":[{"id":"cell","header":"单元格"},{"id":"outcome","header":"结果","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"ok","label":"正常运行"},{"id":"error","label":"报错"},{"id":"skipped","label":"没有运行"}]}}],"rows":[{"id":"A","cells":{"cell":"A","outcome":"ok"}},{"id":"B","cells":{"cell":"B","outcome":"error"}},{"id":"C","cells":{"cell":"C","outcome":"skipped"}},{"id":"D","cells":{"cell":"D","outcome":"skipped"}}]}],"explanation":"A **正常运行**；B 要用 depth，可它定义在下面的 C 里，B **报错**（NameError）；全部运行遇到第一个报错就停下，C、D **没有运行**。把 C 挪到 B 前面再重启、全部运行，才能跑通。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py45.k2.x1","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格：\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[4]`：\n\n```python\nrate = 2\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\namount = 10 * rate\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[3]`，下面显示 30：\n\n```python\nprint(amount)\n```\n\n会话里的经过是：A 原来写的是下面这一行，依次运行了 A、B、C；之后把 A 改成现在的 `rate = 2` 并重新运行了 A，B 和 C 没有再运行。\n\n```python\nrate = 3\n```\n\n下面哪一句说法正确？\n","slots":[{"id":"claim","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"still_30","content":"重启并全部运行后，C 仍显示 30"},{"id":"matches","content":"屏幕上 C 显示的 30，就是现在 A、B 的代码算出来的结果"},{"id":"becomes_20","content":"重启并全部运行后，C 显示 20"},{"id":"name_error","content":"重启并全部运行会在 B 报 NameError"}],"key":"becomes_20"}],"explanation":"“重启并全部运行后，C 显示 20”正确。屏幕上的 30 是 A 改动之前（rate 为 3）算出来的，和现在的代码对不上；重启后按现在的代码从上往下运行，rate 是 2，amount 是 20。A 在 B 上面，B 不会报 NameError。\n"},{"id":"py45.k2.x2","body":"屏幕上从上到下有三个单元格，之前都运行过：\n\n单元格 A：\n\n```python\nbase = 10\n```\n\n单元格 B：\n\n```python\ntotal = base + 5\n```\n\n单元格 C：\n\n```python\nprint(total)\n```\n\n现在**只重启内核**，不全部运行，然后一格一格手动运行：先运行 C，再运行 A，再运行 C，再运行 B，最后运行 C。\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","prompt":"每一步显示什么？没有显示写 NOTHING，报错写 ERROR。","columns":[{"id":"step","header":"第几步"},{"id":"cell","header":"运行的单元格"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output","quick":["NOTHING","ERROR"]}}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"step":"1","cell":"C","shown":"ERROR"}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"step":"2","cell":"A","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"step":"3","cell":"C","shown":"ERROR"}},{"id":"s4","cells":{"step":"4","cell":"B","shown":"NOTHING"}},{"id":"s5","cells":{"step":"5","cell":"C","shown":"15"}}]}],"explanation":"重启后内核是空的。第 1 步 C 用 total，报错；第 2 步 A 定义 base，不显示；第 3 步 C 仍报错，因为 total 要靠 B 来算，B 还没运行；第 4 步 B 算出 total，不显示；第 5 步 C 显示 **15**。\n\n重启之前运行过什么都不算数，一个名字只有在重启后被重新运行出来才存在。\n"}]}]},{"id":"py46","title":"把数据处理拆成可核对的步骤","summary":"把一段数据处理读成读入、校验、变换、汇总、输出几步，说清每一步拿到什么、交出什么；结果不对时逐步比对中间结果，找到第一个偏离需求的步骤。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py34","py28","py42"],"intro":"这一节把前面学过的读表、校验、去重、去掉缺失、筛选、分组汇总和导出连成一条流程。你不用从空白写分析，要练的是两件事：说出每一步拿到什么、交出什么；结果不对时，找出是哪一步偏离了需求。\n\n每道题都从题面给出的文件或表重新开始，宿主已经准备好 pandas（`pd`）。题目里的阈值和“达标”都是题目约定，不是科研结论。\n","wrapup":"向同事或 AI 提需求时，可以按步骤说：从哪个文件读入；读入后先检查什么；怎样去重、去掉什么；按哪一列分组、算什么；结果写到哪个文件。\n\n拿到代码后，按同样的步骤逐个看中间结果：几行、留下了哪些编号。在小表上按需求手算一遍，第一个对不上的地方就是要改的那一步；只改那一步，再从头核对。\n","kps":[{"id":"py46.k1","title":"读入→校验→变换→汇总→输出的接口","key":["py34","py28","py42"],"links":["py42.k2"],"card":{"name":"步骤的接口","aliases":["处理流程","中间结果","检查点"],"definition":"把一段数据处理分成读入、校验、变换、汇总、输出几步，每一步说清拿到哪张表、交出哪张表（哪些列、几行）；下一步只用上一步交出的结果。","conditions":["中间结果各起一个名字，才能逐步查看和核对。","步骤之间的 assert 检查交接的结果是否符合约定；条件不成立时程序在这一行停下，报 AssertionError。","把一步写成函数时，只用参数拿输入，用 return 交出结果，这一步才能换一批数据照样用。"],"example":"```python\nfirst = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmeasured = first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n```\n变换这一步拿到读入的 6 行：每个编号留第一次，剩 5 行；再去掉 signal 缺失的，剩 4 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nimport pandas as pd\nwith open(\"plate.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,group,signal\\n001,control,8\\n002,drug,12\\n002,drug,13\\n003,drug,\\n004,control,10\\n005,drug,9\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 plate.csv 的内容（002 测了两次；003 的 signal 是空的，读入后是缺失值 NaN）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,group,signal\n001,control,8\n002,drug,12\n002,drug,13\n003,drug,\n004,control,10\n005,drug,9\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"一段数据处理代码读起来常常是一长串。把它拆成几步，每一步只回答一个问题：\n\n| 步骤 | 做什么 | 交出什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 读入 | 从文件得到一张表 | 原始表，行数等于文件里的数据行数 |\n| 校验 | 检查表是否符合约定，不改表 | 不交出新表；不符合就停下 |\n| 变换 | 去重、去掉缺失、筛选 | 一张更干净或更小的表 |\n| 汇总 | 按组计数、求平均 | 每组一行的汇总表 |\n| 输出 | 把结果写进文件 | 一个文件 |\n\n读每一步时，问三件事：它拿到的是哪张表，交出的是哪张表，交出的表有哪些列、几行。下一步只应该用上一步交出的结果。中间结果各有名字，例如 `first`、`measured`，你随时可以看它有几行、留下了哪些编号。\n\n步骤之间可以放检查点。[assert](repa:concept/py42.k2) 后面写一个应当成立的条件：成立时什么也不发生；不成立时程序在这一行停下，报 AssertionError。数据处理里常用的检查点：\n\n```python\nassert raw[\"sample_id\"].count() == len(raw)\nassert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(measured)\n```\n\n第一行说“sample_id 的非缺失个数等于行数”，也就是编号没有缺失；第二行说“各组的 n 加起来等于参加统计的行数”，如果有行在分组时被漏掉，程序会在这里停下。\n\n把一步写成函数，接口就更清楚：参数是这一步拿到的表，`return` 交出的是这一步的结果。函数里只用参数，不去拿外面的 `raw`，这一步才能换一批数据照样用。\n\n汇总表每组一行，组名在索引里。导出汇总表时要保留索引，组名才会写进文件；导出逐行的表时才常写 `index=False`。\n","example":{"id":"py46.k1.e0","body":"需求是：每个样本只留第一次测量；signal 缺失的样本不参加统计；按组数出样本数 n，并求平均 signal；结果写进 summary.csv。\n\n```python startLine=1\nraw = pd.read_csv(\"plate.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nassert raw[\"sample_id\"].count() == len(raw)\nfirst = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmeasured = first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\nsummary = measured.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\nassert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(measured)\nsummary.to_csv(\"summary.csv\")\n```\n\n填写每一行属于哪一步。会交出一张表的行，再写出这张表有几行。\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"行"},{"id":"step","header":"属于哪一步","input":{"type":"choice","options":[{"id":"read","label":"读入"},{"id":"check","label":"校验"},{"id":"transform","label":"变换"},{"id":"summarize","label":"汇总"},{"id":"output","label":"输出"}]}},{"id":"rows","header":"交出的表有几行","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"第 1 行","step":"read","rows":6}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"第 2 行","step":"check","rows":{"value":"—"}}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"第 3 行","step":"transform","rows":5}},{"id":"l4","cells":{"line":"第 4 行","step":"transform","rows":4}},{"id":"l5","cells":{"line":"第 5 行","step":"summarize","rows":2}},{"id":"l6","cells":{"line":"第 6 行","step":"check","rows":{"value":"—"}}},{"id":"l7","cells":{"line":"第 7 行","step":"output","rows":{"value":"—"}}}]}],"explanation":"| 行 | 步骤 | 交出 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第 1 行 | 读入 | `raw`，6 行，和文件的 6 行数据一样 |\n| 第 2 行 | 校验 | 编号没有缺失，什么也不发生 |\n| 第 3 行 | 变换 | `first`，5 行：002 只留第一次 |\n| 第 4 行 | 变换 | `measured`，4 行：003 的 signal 缺失，去掉 |\n| 第 5 行 | 汇总 | `summary`，2 行：control 和 drug 各一行 |\n| 第 6 行 | 校验 | n 是 2 和 2，加起来 4，等于 `measured` 的行数 |\n| 第 7 行 | 输出 | 写出 summary.csv，组名在索引里，所以保留索引 |\n\n每一步都只用上一步交出的表：第 4 行用的是 `first`，不是 `raw`。中间结果都有名字，核对时可以逐个看它们的行数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nimport pandas as pd\nwith open(\"plate.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,group,signal\\n001,control,8\\n002,drug,12\\n002,drug,13\\n003,drug,\\n004,control,10\\n005,drug,9\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 plate.csv 的内容（002 测了两次；003 的 signal 是空的，读入后是缺失值 NaN）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,group,signal\n001,control,8\n002,drug,12\n002,drug,13\n003,drug,\n004,control,10\n005,drug,9\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py46.k1.q1","body":"同事把变换这一步写成了函数：\n\n```python\ndef clean(table):\n    first = table.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n    return first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n\nmeasured = clean(raw)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"input","type":"choice","prompt":"`clean` 这一步拿到的是什么？","options":[{"id":"global","content":"外面的变量 `first`","feedback":"`first` 是函数里面算出的中间结果，不是输入。"},{"id":"param","content":"参数 `table`；这次调用时它就是 `raw`"},{"id":"file","content":"直接从 plate.csv 读进来的内容"}],"key":"param"},{"id":"output","type":"choice","prompt":"`clean` 交出什么？","options":[{"id":"printed","content":"什么也不交出，只是把结果显示在屏幕上"},{"id":"modified","content":"什么也不交出，只是把 `raw` 改成了去重后的表"},{"id":"table","content":"一张去重并去掉 signal 缺失之后的新表"}],"key":"table"},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`measured` 有几行？","key":4},{"id":"raw_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"调用之后，`raw` 有几行？","key":6,"feedback":[{"when":4,"message":"`clean` 交出的是一张新表，`raw` 本身没有变。"}]}],"explanation":"`clean` 的输入是参数 `table`，调用 `clean(raw)` 时它就是 `raw`；`return` 交出一张新表：002 只留第一次（5 行），再去掉 signal 缺失的 003，剩 **4** 行。`raw` 没有被改，仍是 **6** 行。\n\n换一批数据时写 `clean(另一张表)` 就行，这一步不依赖外面的名字。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：读入后的样本表（002 测了两次，003 的 signal 缺失）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"group":["control","drug","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8,12,13,null,10,9]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py46.k1.q2","body":"读入的表里有一行没有编号。阅读代码。\n\n```python startLine=1\nassert raw[\"sample_id\"].count() == len(raw)\nfirst = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nprint(len(first))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"stops","type":"choice","prompt":"程序运行到哪里？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"在第 1 行停下"},{"id":"l2","content":"在第 2 行停下"},{"id":"l3","content":"在第 3 行停下"},{"id":"none","content":"不会停下，显示 4"}],"key":"l1"},{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"报的是什么异常？写出异常类型。","key":"AssertionError"}],"explanation":"在**第 1 行**停下，报 **AssertionError**。`raw[\"sample_id\"].count()` 只数非缺失的编号，是 3；`len(raw)` 是 4。两边不相等，检查点不成立，后面的去重和显示都不会运行。\n\n这正是检查点的用处：编号缺失的表不该悄悄进入去重和汇总，在读入后马上停下，比最后对着汇总表猜原因省事。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：另一批读入的记录","columns":{"sample_id":["001",null,"003","004"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control"],"signal":[8,11,10,12]}}]},{"id":"py46.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把变换这一步写成函数 `clean(table)`：输入一张样本表 `table`，每个 sample_id 只留第一次测量；第一次测量的 signal 缺失的样本，不参加统计。返回新表，不改输入的表。\n\n作答框里的函数在表 raw 上结果是对的，可换一张表调用就不对了。找出原因，改好并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"def clean(table):\n    first = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n    return first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n","solution":"def clean(table):\n    first = table.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n    return first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n","accepts":["def clean(table):\n    return table.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"]).dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"def clean(table):\n    first = table.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n    return first.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n","why":"先去缺失再去重，第一次测量缺失时会改用第二次测量"},{"code":"def clean(table):\n    first = table.drop_duplicates()\n    return first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n","why":"去重没写 subset，同一编号的两次测量值不同时都会留下"},{"code":"def clean(table):\n    return table.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n","why":"漏了去重"},{"code":"def clean(table):\n    first = table.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n    print(first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"]))\n","why":"只显示结果，没有交出"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 raw","expect":{"clean(raw)":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"004\", \"005\"], \"group\": [\"control\", \"drug\", \"control\", \"drug\"], \"signal\": [8.0, 12.0, 10.0, 9.0]}, index=[0, 1, 4, 5])","raw":"raw"}},{"name":"换一张表，第一次测量缺失","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nother = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"sample_id\": [\"101\", \"102\", \"102\", \"103\", \"103\"],\n    \"group\": [\"drug\", \"control\", \"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\"],\n    \"signal\": [7.0, None, 11.0, 15.0, 16.0],\n})\n","expect":{"clean(other)":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"101\", \"103\"], \"group\": [\"drug\", \"drug\"], \"signal\": [7.0, 15.0]}, index=[0, 3])","other":"pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"101\", \"102\", \"102\", \"103\", \"103\"], \"group\": [\"drug\", \"control\", \"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\"], \"signal\": [7.0, None, 11.0, 15.0, 16.0]})"}}]}],"explanation":"把函数里的 `raw` 换成参数 `table`：\n\n```python\ndef clean(table):\n    first = table.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\n    return first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\n```\n\n原来的写法不管调用时传进来什么，都去处理外面的 `raw`，所以在 raw 上碰巧对，换一张表就错。判分时还会换一张表：102 的第一次测量缺失，按需求它不参加统计；先去缺失再去重的写法会改用第二次的 11，也判错。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：读入后的样本表（002 测了两次，003 的 signal 缺失）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"group":["control","drug","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8,12,13,null,10,9]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py46.k1.r1","body":"需求是：读入 plots.csv；检查 plot_id 没有缺失；去掉 depth 缺失的样点；按 site 数出样点个数 n、求平均深度 mean_depth；把汇总表写进 depth_summary.csv。\n\n下面五行代码的顺序被打乱了。把它们排成能按需求运行的流程，每一行都要用上。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","items":[{"id":"save","code":"summary.to_csv(\"depth_summary.csv\")"},{"id":"clean","code":"measured = plots.dropna(subset=[\"depth\"])"},{"id":"check","code":"assert plots[\"plot_id\"].count() == len(plots)"},{"id":"summarize","code":"summary = measured.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"), mean_depth=(\"depth\", \"mean\"))"},{"id":"read","code":"plots = pd.read_csv(\"plots.csv\", dtype={\"plot_id\": \"str\"})"}],"key":["read","check","clean","summarize","save"],"tests":[{"name":"汇总表与写出的文件","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 1, 2], \"mean_depth\": [30.0, 32.0, 31.5]}, index=[\"东坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\"])","open(\"depth_summary.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\").read()":"\"site,n,mean_depth\\n东坡,1,30.0\\n北坡,1,32.0\\n南坡,2,31.5\\n\"","len(measured)":"4"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nplots = pd.read_csv(\"plots.csv\", dtype={\"plot_id\": \"str\"})\nassert plots[\"plot_id\"].count() == len(plots)\nmeasured = plots.dropna(subset=[\"depth\"])\nsummary = measured.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"), mean_depth=(\"depth\", \"mean\"))\nsummary.to_csv(\"depth_summary.csv\")\n```\n\n每一行都要用到上一行交出的名字：去掉缺失要用读入的 `plots`，分组要用 `measured`，写文件要用 `summary`。校验不改表，放在读入之后、汇总之前的哪个位置都能运行，按需求放在读入后最先检查。P3 的 depth 缺失被去掉，汇总表 3 行，南坡有 2 个样点。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nimport pandas as pd\nwith open(\"plots.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"plot_id,site,depth\\nP1,北坡,32\\nP2,南坡,28\\nP3,北坡,\\nP4,南坡,35\\nP5,东坡,30\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"depth_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"depth_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 plots.csv 的内容（P3 的 depth 是空的）：\n\n```text\nplot_id,site,depth\nP1,北坡,32\nP2,南坡,28\nP3,北坡,\nP4,南坡,35\nP5,东坡,30\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py46.k1.r2","body":"阅读代码。\n\n```python startLine=1\nmeasured = plots.dropna(subset=[\"depth\"])\nsummary = measured.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"), mean_depth=(\"depth\", \"mean\"))\n```\n\n运行之后，有人想在步骤之间加下面几个检查点。逐个判断：在这张表上，条件成立吗？\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"check","header":"检查点"},{"id":"holds","header":"成立吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"a1","cells":{"check":"assert plots[\"plot_id\"].count() == len(plots)","holds":true}},{"id":"a2","cells":{"check":"assert len(measured) == len(plots)","holds":false}},{"id":"a3","cells":{"check":"assert measured[\"depth\"].count() == len(measured)","holds":true}},{"id":"a4","cells":{"check":"assert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(measured)","holds":false}}]},{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`summary[\"n\"].sum()` 是多少？","key":3}],"explanation":"| 检查点 | 成立吗 | 原因 |\n|---|---|---|\n| plot_id 没有缺失 | True | 5 个编号都在 |\n| measured 和 plots 一样多行 | False | P4 的 depth 缺失被去掉，measured 只有 4 行 |\n| measured 里 depth 没有缺失 | True | 去掉缺失之后，4 个 depth 都有值 |\n| 各组 n 加起来等于 measured 的行数 | False | P3 的 site 缺失，groupby 默认不把它放进任何组 |\n\n`summary[\"n\"].sum()` 是 **3**（东坡、北坡、南坡各 1），比 `measured` 的 4 行少 1。第四个检查点正好能拦下“分组时漏掉了行”这种问题；第二个不成立是去掉缺失的正常结果，要不要这样检查，看需求是否允许去掉行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：五个样点（P3 的 site 缺失，P4 的 depth 缺失）","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡",null,"南坡","东坡"],"depth":[32,28,31,null,30]},"dtypes":{"depth":"float"}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py46.k1.x1","body":"这段代码把流程写成了三个函数，最后一行把它们接起来。\n\n```python startLine=1\ndef load(path):\n    return pd.read_csv(path, dtype={\"dish_id\": \"str\"})\n\ndef clean(table):\n    return table.dropna(subset=[\"cells\"])\n\ndef summarize(table):\n    return table.groupby(\"treatment\").agg(dishes=(\"dish_id\", \"count\"), mean_cells=(\"cells\", \"mean\"))\n\nresult = summarize(clean(load(\"dishes.csv\")))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"source","type":"choice","prompt":"`clean` 拿到的表是谁交出的？","options":[{"id":"summarize","content":"`summarize`"},{"id":"file","content":"文件 dishes.csv，不经过任何函数"},{"id":"load","content":"`load`"}],"key":"load"},{"id":"rows_in","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`clean` 拿到的表有几行？","key":5},{"id":"rows_out","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`clean` 交出的表有几行？","key":4},{"id":"result_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`result` 有几行？","key":2},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`result` 有哪些列？按顺序排列，组名所在的索引不算列。","items":[{"id":"dish_id","content":"`dish_id`"},{"id":"treatment","content":"`treatment`"},{"id":"cells","content":"`cells`"},{"id":"dishes","content":"`dishes`"},{"id":"mean_cells","content":"`mean_cells`"}],"key":["dishes","mean_cells"]}],"explanation":"最后一行从里往外读：先 `load(\"dishes.csv\")` 读入 **5** 行，交给 `clean`；`clean` 去掉 cells 缺失的 03，交出 **4** 行，再交给 `summarize`；`summarize` 按 treatment 分组，交出 **2** 行（control、drug），列是 **dishes、mean_cells**，组名在索引里。\n\n每个函数的输入都是参数，输出都是 `return` 的结果，所以三步能这样一个接一个地套起来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import pandas as pd\nwith open(\"dishes.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"dish_id,treatment,cells\\n01,control,52\\n02,drug,40\\n03,drug,\\n04,control,48\\n05,drug,45\\n\")\n","display":"文件 dishes.csv 的内容（每行是一个培养皿的细胞计数；03 的 cells 是空的）：\n\n```text\ndish_id,treatment,cells\n01,control,52\n02,drug,40\n03,drug,\n04,control,48\n05,drug,45\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py46.k1.x2","body":"需求是：\n\n> 把汇总这一步写成函数 `summarize(table)`：输入一张样本表，按 group 分组，n 为每组 sample_id 的个数，mean_signal 为每组 signal 的平均。把汇总表交给下一步（输出那一步要用它写文件）。\n\n输出那一步写的是 `summary = summarize(measured)`，接着 `summary.to_csv(\"summary.csv\")`，运行时却报错：`summary` 是 None。作答框里是汇总这一步的函数，改好并提交。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"def summarize(table):\n    summary = table.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n    print(summary)\n","solution":"def summarize(table):\n    summary = table.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n    return summary\n","accepts":["def summarize(table):\n    return table.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"def summarize(table):\n    summary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n    return summary\n","why":"用了外面的 raw，没有只用参数"},{"code":"def summarize(table):\n    summary = table.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n    return print(summary)\n","why":"交出的是 print 的结果 None"},{"code":"def summarize(table):\n    return table.groupby(\"group\").agg(count=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","why":"列名不是需求里的 n 和 mean_signal"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 raw","expect":{"summarize(raw)":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [2, 3], \"mean_signal\": [10.0, 12.0]}, index=[\"control\", \"drug\"])","raw":"raw"}},{"name":"换一张表","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nother = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"sample_id\": [\"201\", \"202\", \"203\"],\n    \"group\": [\"drug\", \"drug\", \"control\"],\n    \"signal\": [6, 9, 15],\n})\n","expect":{"summarize(other)":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 2], \"mean_signal\": [15.0, 7.5]}, index=[\"control\", \"drug\"])"}}]}],"explanation":"最后一行改成 `return summary`：\n\n```python\ndef summarize(table):\n    summary = table.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n    return summary\n```\n\n`print` 只是显示，函数交出的仍是 None，下一步写文件时拿不到表。表 raw 上的结果是 control 2 个、平均 10.0，drug 3 个、平均 12.0。判分时还会换一张表调用，检查函数只用了参数。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：五个样本，每个只测了一次","columns":{"sample_id":["051","052","053","054","055"],"group":["control","drug","control","drug","drug"],"signal":[9,14,11,10,12]}}]}]},{"id":"py46.k2","title":"从一个中间结果定位需求与代码的分歧","key":["py28","py25","py19"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"定位分歧","aliases":["逐步核对","第一个对不上的步骤"],"definition":"结果不符合需求时，按需求在小表上手算每一步应有的中间结果，与代码每一步实际的结果比对；第一个对不上的步骤就是要改的地方。","conditions":["第一个对不上的步骤之后，后面的结果都会跟着错；只改那一步，再从头核对。","小表要能暴露分歧：有重复测量、有缺失、有恰好等于阈值的值。"],"example":"需求要每个编号只留第一次，代码写 `raw.drop_duplicates()` 没写 subset：按需求去重后应剩 5 行，代码实际仍是 6 行，分歧从去重这一步开始。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：读入后的样本表（002 测了两次，003 的 signal 缺失）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"group":["control","drug","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8,12,13,null,10,9]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"lesson":"最后的汇总表看着不对时，先别整段重写。拿需求在小表上手算每一步应当交出什么，再看代码每一步实际交出了什么，逐步比对。比如一段四步的代码，比对下来是这样：\n\n| 步骤 | 按需求应当 | 代码实际 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 读入后 | 6 行 | 6 行 |\n| 去掉缺失后 | 5 行 | 5 行 |\n| 筛选后 | 3 行 | 2 行 |\n| 汇总后 drug 组的 n | 2 | 1 |\n\n第一个对不上的是筛选，分歧就在那一步。它后面的步骤即使代码没错，也会因为拿到了错的输入而跟着错；所以要找“第一个”，而不是“最显眼的那个”。\n\n前面学过的几种常见分歧：\n\n- 去重：需求说“同一个编号只留第一次”，代码写 `drop_duplicates()` 没写 subset，只去掉整行完全相同的行；\n- 去掉缺失：需求只说 signal 缺失的不要，代码写 `dropna()` 没写 subset，别的列缺失的行也被去掉；\n- 阈值：需求说“至少 10”，代码写 `> 10`，恰好为 10 的行被丢掉；\n- 分组：groupby 默认不把分组列缺失的行放进任何组，这些行在汇总时悄悄消失；\n- 计数：`(\"signal\", \"count\")` 只数有值的 signal，需求要的若是“每组有几个样本”，缺失的也要算。\n\n找到分歧后只改那一步，再从头跑一遍，逐步核对。\n","example":{"id":"py46.k2.e0","body":"需求是：每个 sample_id 只留第一次测量；去掉 signal 缺失的样本；按 group 数出样本数 n。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = raw.drop_duplicates()\nmeasured = first.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\nsummary = measured.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n\n先按需求在表上手算每一步应有的结果，再写出代码实际的结果。\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"中间结果"},{"id":"need","header":"按需求应当","input":"integer"},{"id":"actual","header":"代码实际","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"first","cells":{"what":"first 的行数","need":5,"actual":6}},{"id":"measured","cells":{"what":"measured 的行数","need":4,"actual":5}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"what":"drug 组的 n","need":2,"actual":3}}]},{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"分歧从哪一行开始？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"}],"key":"l1"}],"explanation":"| 中间结果 | 按需求应当 | 代码实际 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| first 的行数 | 5 | 6 |\n| measured 的行数 | 4 | 5 |\n| drug 组的 n | 2 | 3 |\n\n分歧从**第 1 行**开始。002 测了两次，signal 分别是 12 和 13，两行不完全相同；`drop_duplicates()` 没写 subset，只去掉整行完全相同的行，所以两行都留下了。第 2、3 行本身没错，只是拿到了多一行的表，结果跟着多一。\n\n只改第 1 行：`first = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：读入后的样本表（002 测了两次，003 的 signal 缺失）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"group":["control","drug","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[8,12,13,null,10,9]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py46.k2.q1","body":"需求是：去掉 signal 缺失的样本；signal 至少为 10 的样本算达标；按 group 数出达标样本数 n。\n\n```python startLine=1\nmeasured = raw.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"])\npassed = measured.loc[measured[\"signal\"] > 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"need","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"按需求，哪些样本应当达标？按原表顺序排出 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"011","content":"011"},{"id":"012","content":"012"},{"id":"013","content":"013"},{"id":"014","content":"014"},{"id":"015","content":"015"}],"key":["011","012","013","015"]},{"id":"actual","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"代码的 `passed` 实际留下了哪些？按顺序排出 sample_id。","items":[{"id":"011","content":"011"},{"id":"012","content":"012"},{"id":"013","content":"013"},{"id":"014","content":"014"},{"id":"015","content":"015"}],"key":["012","015"]},{"id":"summary_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"代码的 `summary` 有几行？","key":1},{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"分歧从哪一行开始？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"}],"key":"l2"}],"explanation":"第 1 行去掉 signal 缺失的 014，按需求和按代码都一样，剩 4 行。按需求应当达标的是 **011、012、013、015**；代码第 2 行用了 `> 10`，恰好为 10 的 011 和 013 被丢掉，只留下 **012、015**。分歧从**第 2 行**开始。\n\n第 3 行没写错，但它拿到的表里只剩 drug 组的两行，所以 `summary` 只有 **1** 行，control 组整个不见了。看到汇总表少了一组，要往前找原因，而不是去改分组那一行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：五个样本，014 的 signal 缺失","columns":{"sample_id":["011","012","013","014","015"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[10,14,10,null,11]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]},{"id":"py46.k2.q2","body":"需求是：按 group 数出每组的样本数 n；组别缺失的样本单独算一组，不能丢掉。\n\n```python startLine=1\nsummary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\nprint(summary[\"n\"].sum())\nprint(len(raw))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"first","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":3},{"id":"second","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":4},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 1 行改成哪一种，结果才符合需求？","options":[{"id":"drop","content":"```python\nsummary = raw.dropna(subset=[\"group\"]).groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","feedback":"这是明确地把组别缺失的样本去掉，和需求正好相反。"},{"id":"signal","content":"```python\nsummary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"signal\", \"count\"))\n```\n","feedback":"换一列计数不影响分组；组别缺失的行仍不在任何组里。"},{"id":"keep","content":"```python\nsummary = raw.groupby(\"group\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n"}],"key":"keep"}],"explanation":"先显示 **3**，再显示 **4**。各组的 n 加起来比表的行数少 1：022 的组别缺失，groupby 默认不把它放进任何组。这一个中间结果就说明分歧出在分组这一步。\n\n改成 `raw.groupby(\"group\", dropna=False)`，组别缺失的样本会单独成一组（组名显示为 NaN），n 加起来就是 4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：022 的组别没有记下来","columns":{"sample_id":["021","022","023","024"],"group":["control",null,"drug","drug"],"signal":[9,12,11,8]}}]},{"id":"py46.k2.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 按 group 汇总：n 为每组的样本数，signal 缺失的样本也算在内；mean_signal 为每组有值的 signal 的平均。\n\n核对中间结果时发现：表里 drug 组有 3 个样本，汇总表里 drug 的 n 却是 2。作答框里是同事的代码，只改出错的地方并提交，结果仍叫 `summary`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"summary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"signal\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","solution":"summary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","accepts":["summary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"signal\", \"size\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))","summary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"size\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))"],"rejects":[{"code":"summary = raw.dropna(subset=[\"signal\"]).groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))","why":"先去掉了缺失的样本，n 仍然少数"},{"code":"summary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))","why":"把平均也改成了计数"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 raw","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [2, 3], \"mean_signal\": [10.0, 11.0]}, index=[\"control\", \"drug\"])"}},{"name":"换一张表，缺失在 control 组","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nraw = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"sample_id\": [\"301\", \"302\", \"303\", \"304\"],\n    \"group\": [\"control\", \"control\", \"drug\", \"drug\"],\n    \"signal\": [None, 8.0, 12.0, 14.0],\n})\n","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [2, 2], \"mean_signal\": [8.0, 13.0]}, index=[\"control\", \"drug\"])"}}]}],"explanation":"只改 n 的来源：\n\n```python\nsummary = raw.groupby(\"group\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n```\n\n`(\"signal\", \"count\")` 只数有值的 signal，032 的 signal 缺失，所以 drug 的 n 少了 1。sample_id 没有缺失，数它就是每组的样本数；写成 `(\"signal\", \"size\")` 也对，size 数的是行数，不管有没有值。mean_signal 本来就只用有值的 signal，不用改：drug 是 (12 + 10) ÷ 2 = 11.0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：032 的 signal 缺失","columns":{"sample_id":["031","032","033","034","035"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[9,null,12,11,10]},"dtypes":{"signal":"float"}}]}],"review":[{"id":"py46.k2.r1","body":"需求是：去掉 depth 缺失的样点；depth 至少为 30 的算深层；按 site 数出深层样点的个数。\n\n```python startLine=1\nmeasured = plots.dropna()\ndeep = measured.loc[measured[\"depth\"] >= 30]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"中间结果"},{"id":"need","header":"按需求应当","input":"integer"},{"id":"actual","header":"代码实际","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"measured","cells":{"what":"measured 的行数","need":4,"actual":2}},{"id":"deep","cells":{"what":"deep 的行数","need":3,"actual":1}},{"id":"summary","cells":{"what":"summary 的行数","need":3,"actual":1}}]},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"只改一行，改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"threshold","content":"```python\ndeep = measured.loc[measured[\"depth\"] > 30]\n```\n"},{"id":"subset","content":"```python\nmeasured = plots.dropna(subset=[\"depth\"])\n```\n"},{"id":"group","content":"```python\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n"}],"key":"subset"}],"explanation":"| 中间结果 | 按需求应当 | 代码实际 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| measured 的行数 | 4 | 2 |\n| deep 的行数 | 3 | 1 |\n| summary 的行数 | 3 | 1 |\n\n第一个对不上的是 `measured`。`dropna()` 没写 subset，只要一行里有任何缺失就去掉：P1、P4 只是没有备注，也被去掉了，只剩 P2、P5。改成 `plots.dropna(subset=[\"depth\"])`，只按 depth 去掉 P3；之后 P1、P4、P5 达到 30，三个坡各一个。改阈值或分组那一行都碰不到真正的原因。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：五个样点，note 是备注，没有备注的是缺失值","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","南坡","东坡"],"depth":[32,28,null,35,30],"note":[null,"重测",null,null,"积水"]},"dtypes":{"depth":"float"}}]},{"id":"py46.k2.r2","body":"需求是：同一个 sample_id 测了两次时，用最后一次（复测）的结果；按 group 求平均 signal。\n\n```python startLine=1\nlatest = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nsummary = latest.groupby(\"group\").agg(mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"need","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"按需求，drug 组的平均 signal 应当是多少？","key":12.5},{"id":"actual","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"代码算出的 drug 组平均是多少？","key":10.5},{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"第 1 行改成哪一种，结果才符合需求？","options":[{"id":"whole","content":"```python\nlatest = raw.drop_duplicates(keep=\"last\")\n```\n"},{"id":"none","content":"```python\nlatest = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"], keep=False)\n```\n"},{"id":"last","content":"```python\nlatest = raw.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n"}],"key":"last"}],"explanation":"按需求，042 用复测的 12，drug 组是 042 和 044：(12 + 13) ÷ 2 = **12.5**。代码的 `drop_duplicates` 默认留第一次，用的是 8：(8 + 13) ÷ 2 = **10.5**。control 组两者都是 10.0，只看 control 发现不了。\n\n改成 `keep=\"last\"` 并保留 `subset=[\"sample_id\"]`。只写 `keep=\"last\"` 不写 subset，两行 042 不完全相同，都会留下；`keep=False` 会把 042 两次都去掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"raw","caption":"表 raw：042 测了两次，第二次是复测","columns":{"sample_id":["041","042","042","043","044"],"group":["control","drug","drug","control","drug"],"signal":[9,8,12,11,13]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py46.k2.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> depth 至少为 30 的样点算深层；按 site 数出深层样点的个数 n。\n\n核对中间结果时，打印 `deep` 发现只有 P1、P4 两行。作答框里是同事的代码，只改出错的那一步并提交，结果仍叫 `summary`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"deep = plots.loc[plots[\"depth\"] > 30]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","solution":"deep = plots.loc[plots[\"depth\"] >= 30]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","rejects":[{"code":"deep = plots.loc[plots[\"depth\"] > 30]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","why":"改了分组那一行，没碰到真正的原因"},{"code":"deep = plots\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","why":"去掉了筛选，浅的样点也算进去了"},{"code":"deep = plots.loc[plots[\"depth\"] > 29]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","why":"改成“大于 29”，只在整数深度上碰巧等于“至少 30”"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 plots","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 1, 2]}, index=[\"东坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\"])","plots":"plots"}},{"name":"换一张表，深度带小数","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nplots = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"plot_id\": [\"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\", \"Q4\"],\n    \"site\": [\"北坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"南坡\"],\n    \"depth\": [29.5, 30.0, 33.5, 28.0],\n})\n","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 1]}, index=[\"北坡\", \"南坡\"])"}}]}],"explanation":"分歧在第 1 行：`> 30` 不包含恰好为 30 的 P2、P5。只改比较符：\n\n```python\ndeep = plots.loc[plots[\"depth\"] >= 30]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n\n改后 deep 有 P1、P2、P4、P5 四行，南坡 2 个，东坡、北坡各 1 个。第 2 行不用动：南坡原来不在汇总表里，是因为它的两个样点都在第 1 行被丢掉了。判分时还会换一张深度带小数的表，“大于 29”这样碰巧对整数成立的写法会被查出来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：五个样点的土层深度（厘米）","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4","P5"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡","南坡"],"depth":[34,30,27,31,30]}}]},{"id":"py46.k2.x2","body":"需求是：去掉 cells 缺失的计数；每个 dish_id 只留第一次计数；按 treatment 数出培养皿的个数 n。\n\n```python startLine=1\ncounted = dishes.dropna(subset=[\"cells\"])\nfirst = counted.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"treatment\"])\nsummary = first.groupby(\"treatment\").agg(n=(\"dish_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"steps","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"what","header":"中间结果"},{"id":"need","header":"按需求应当","input":"integer"},{"id":"actual","header":"代码实际","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"counted","cells":{"what":"counted 的行数","need":4,"actual":4}},{"id":"first","cells":{"what":"first 的行数","need":3,"actual":2}},{"id":"control","cells":{"what":"control 的 n","need":2,"actual":1}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"what":"drug 的 n","need":1,"actual":1}}]},{"id":"line","type":"choice","prompt":"分歧从哪一行开始？","options":[{"id":"l1","content":"第 1 行"},{"id":"l2","content":"第 2 行"},{"id":"l3","content":"第 3 行"}],"key":"l2"}],"explanation":"| 中间结果 | 按需求应当 | 代码实际 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| counted 的行数 | 4 | 4 |\n| first 的行数 | 3 | 2 |\n| control 的 n | 2 | 1 |\n| drug 的 n | 1 | 1 |\n\n第 1 行去掉计数缺失的 03，两边一样。分歧从**第 2 行**开始：去重用错了列。`subset=[\"treatment\"]` 让每种处理只留第一行，只剩 01 和 02；需求要的是按 `dish_id` 去重，只去掉 02 的第二次计数，留下 01、02、04 三行。\n\ndrug 的 n 碰巧两边都是 1，只看这一个数会以为没问题；逐步比对行数，才看得出第 2 行就已经错了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"dishes","caption":"表 dishes：02 号培养皿计了两次，03 号的计数缺失","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","02","03","04"],"treatment":["control","drug","drug","drug","control"],"cells":[52,40,41,null,48]},"dtypes":{"cells":"float"}}]}]}]},{"id":"py47","title":"兴趣支线：小说里的名字出现了几次","summary":"用 count、in、split 和短循环按字面数名字，再把“提到这个人”写成别名、排除词和计数单位都清楚的规则。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py05","py36","py37"],"intro":"这一节是兴趣支线：数一数一段小说里某个人物被提到了几次。按字面数的工具很简单，难处在于“提到这个人”到底指什么。\n\n题目里的小说片段都是本课自己编的。变量 `text` 里放的就是题面展示的那段文字，每道题都从题面给出的文字重新开始。\n","wrapup":"让 AI 帮你数人物时，可以这样说：“数沈青被提到的次数：‘沈青’‘青儿’都算；‘沈青山’是另一个人，不算；一句里出现两次算两次。”\n\n拿到结果后，先在原文里找一处名字藏在更长的词里的地方、一处别名，核对它们有没有按规则处理。\n","kps":[{"id":"py47.k1","title":"用 split/count 或短循环追踪明确的字面匹配","key":["py35","py10"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"字面匹配","aliases":["count","in","split"],"definition":"`count` 数一段文字里某几个字连着出现了几处，`in` 只回答有没有；两者都只认字面，不管前后挨着什么字。","conditions":["`split(\"。\")` 在每个句号处切开得到列表；文字以句号结尾时，最后多一个空字符串。","循环里每句加 1 数的是句子数；要数出现次数，就把每句的 count 加起来。"],"example":"```python\ntotal = text.count(\"沈青\")\n```\n在“……叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手”这段里，count 把“沈青山”里的“沈青”也数了进去，得到 4；按句子数，提到“沈青”的句子只有 3 句。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"数名字，最直接的工具是字符串的 `count`：`text.count(\"沈青\")` 从头到尾找“沈青”这两个字连在一起出现的地方，数一共几处，得到一个整数。它只认字面：前后挨着什么字都不管，所以“沈青山”里的“沈青”也会被数进去；一处都对不上就是 0。\n\n`\"沈青\" in s` 只回答“有没有”，结果是 True 或 False，不告诉你有几处。\n\n要按句子看，可以先用 `split` 把文字切开：`text.split(\"。\")` 在每个句号处切一刀，得到一个列表，句号本身不留下。文字以句号结尾时，最后一刀后面什么也没有，所以列表最后多出一个空字符串 `\"\"`。英文常用不带参数的 `split()`，按空格切成单词，标点会粘在单词上，例如 `\"Anna.\"`。\n\n切成句子后，用一个短循环逐句检查：\n\n```python\nn = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    if \"沈青\" in s:\n        n = n + 1\n```\n\n这样数出来的是“提到沈青的句子有几句”：一句里出现两次，也只加 1。想数出现次数，就把每句的次数加起来：`n = n + s.count(\"沈青\")`，结果和直接写 `text.count(\"沈青\")` 一样。两个数都有用，但回答的不是同一个问题，提需求时要说清要哪一个。\n","example":{"id":"py47.k1.e0","body":"我们想知道沈青在这段文字里被提到了几次。先看程序按字面能数出什么。\n\n```python\ntotal = text.count(\"沈青\")\nn = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    if \"沈青\" in s:\n        n = n + 1\nprint(total)\nprint(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第一行显示","key":4},{"id":"n","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二行显示","key":3},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"两个数为什么不一样？","options":[{"id":"empty","content":"最后切出来的空字符串也被算了一句"},{"id":"twice","content":"最后一句里“沈青”出现了两次，按句子数只加 1"},{"id":"alias","content":"`count` 把“青儿”也算成了“沈青”"}],"key":"twice"}],"explanation":"第一行显示 **4**，第二行显示 **3**。\n\n`count` 只认字面：两处“沈青”，再加上“沈青山”出现的两次里各带一个“沈青”，一共 4 处。循环按句子数：`text.split(\"。\")` 切出 5 段（最后一段是空字符串），提到“沈青”的是第 1、3、4 段，所以 n 是 3。第 4 段“桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手”里出现了两次，按句子只加 1，这就是两个数的差别。空字符串里没有“沈青”，不会被算进去；“青儿”和“沈青”不是同样的字，count 不会把它算进去。\n\n还要注意：这两个数里都包含了“沈青山”，他是另一个人。下一个知识点专门处理这件事。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py47.k1.q1","body":"下面每一行单独输入交互解释器，写出它显示的内容。\n\n```python\ntext.count(\"青\")\ntext.count(\"沈青山\")\n\"青儿\" in text\ntext.count(\"林\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"shown","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"expr","header":"输入"},{"id":"shown","header":"显示","input":{"type":"text","match":"output"}}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"expr":"`text.count(\"青\")`","shown":"6"}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"expr":"`text.count(\"沈青山\")`","shown":"2"}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"expr":"`\"青儿\" in text`","shown":"True"}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"expr":"`text.count(\"林\")`","shown":"0"}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **6、2、True、0**。\n\n“青”这个字出现在两处“沈青”、“青儿”、“青石桥”和两处“沈青山”里，一共 6 处：count 不管它是名字的一部分还是桥名。“沈青山”出现 2 次。`in` 只回答有没有，所以是 True，而不是 1。文中没有“林”字，count 得到 0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k1.q2","body":"`text.split(\"。\")` 切出 5 段。按循环的顺序，填写每一轮 `\"沈青\" in s` 的结果，以及这一轮结束后 `n` 的值，再写出最后显示什么。\n\n```python\nn = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    if \"沈青\" in s:\n        n = n + 1\nprint(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rounds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"s","header":"这一轮的 s"},{"id":"hit","header":"\"沈青\" in s","input":"bool"},{"id":"n","header":"这一轮结束后的 n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"s":"沈青推开院门","hit":true,"n":1}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"s":"娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞","hit":false,"n":1}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"s":"沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去","hit":true,"n":2}},{"id":"s4","cells":{"s":"桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手","hit":true,"n":3}},{"id":"s5","cells":{"s":"\"\"（空字符串）","hit":false,"n":3}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":3,"feedback":[{"when":4,"message":"第 4 段里“沈青”出现了两次，但这个循环每句最多加 1。"},{"when":2,"message":"第 4 段的“沈青山”里也有“沈青”两个字，`in` 只认字面，这一段是 True。"}]}],"explanation":"`n` 依次是 **1、1、2、3、3**，最后显示 **3**。\n\n第 2 段只有“青儿”，没有“沈青”两个字连在一起，所以是 False。第 4 段的“沈青山”里有“沈青”，`in` 只认字面，是 True；它出现了两次，但这个循环每句最多加 1。最后一段是句号后面切出来的空字符串，什么都不包含。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k1.q3","body":"需求是：\n\n> 数出名字 `name` 在 `text` 里一共出现了几次，同一句里出现两次算两次，结果放在 `n` 里。\n\n同事写的代码在作答框里，它数成了句子数。请改动它并提交。宿主提供了 `text` 和 `name`；这次 `name` 是 `\"沈青\"`，换一次分析可以是别的名字。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"n = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    if name in s:\n        n = n + 1\n","solution":"n = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    n = n + s.count(name)\n","accepts":["n = text.count(name)","n = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    if name in s:\n        n = n + s.count(name)\n"],"rejects":[{"code":"n = text.count(\"沈青\")","why":"把名字写死成“沈青”"},{"code":"n = len(text.split(\"。\"))","why":"数的是切出来的段数"},{"code":"n = len(text.split(name))","why":"按名字切开后的段数比出现次数多 1"}],"tests":[{"name":"沈青","setup":"name = \"沈青\"","expect":{"n":"4"}},{"name":"换一个名字","hidden":true,"setup":"name = \"青儿\"","expect":{"n":"1"}},{"name":"换一段文字，同一句里出现两次","hidden":true,"data":["story_lin"],"setup":"name = \"舟儿\"","expect":{"n":"2"}}]}],"explanation":"把“这句有没有”换成“这句有几处”，再累加：\n\n```python\nn = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    n = n + s.count(name)\n```\n\n直接写 `n = text.count(name)` 也对，结果相同。本例 n 是 4；判分时还会换名字、换一段一句里出现两次的文字运行你的代码。名字要用 `name`，不要写死成“沈青”。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py47.k1.r1","body":"英文常按空格把一句话切成单词。下面每一行依次输入交互解释器，写出第 1、3、4 行显示的内容。\n\n```python\nnote.count(\"Ann\")\nwords = note.split()\nwords.count(\"Ann\")\nwords.count(\"Anna\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"c1","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`note.count(\"Ann\")` 显示","key":"3"},{"id":"c3","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`words.count(\"Ann\")` 显示","key":"2"},{"id":"c4","type":"text","match":"output","prompt":"`words.count(\"Anna\")` 显示","key":"0"},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"最后一行为什么是这个结果？","options":[{"id":"case","content":"`count` 不区分大小写，“Anna”被算成了“Ann”"},{"id":"period","content":"`split()` 只按空格切，列表里的是 `\"Anna.\"`，带着句点，和 `\"Anna\"` 不是同一个字符串"},{"id":"twice","content":"“Anna”已经在第 1 行被数过，不会再数一次"}],"key":"period"}],"explanation":"依次显示 **3、2、0**。\n\n字符串的 `count` 按字面找“Ann”：两个 Ann 各一处，“Anna”的前三个字母也是一处，共 3。`note.split()` 得到 `['Ann', 'met', 'Anna.', 'Ann', 'smiled.']`，列表的 `count` 要整个元素完全相同才算：两个 `'Ann'` 算，`'Anna.'` 不算，所以是 2。同理，列表里没有恰好等于 `'Anna'` 的元素——那个元素带着句点，是 `'Anna.'`——所以是 0。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"note = \"Ann met Anna. Ann smiled.\"\n","display":"变量 `note` 里是一句英文：\n\n```text\nAnn met Anna. Ann smiled.\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k1.r2","body":"日记 `lines` 是一个列表，每个元素是一行字。把下面的代码块排成程序：数出有几行提到了 `name`（同一行提到两次也只算 1 行），最后显示这个数。拖动时也要排好缩进。不是每一块都要用。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"indent":2,"items":[{"id":"count","code":"n = n + line.count(name)"},{"id":"show","code":"print(n)"},{"id":"loop","code":"for line in lines:"},{"id":"add","code":"n = n + 1"},{"id":"init","code":"n = 0"},{"id":"check","code":"if name in line:"},{"id":"length","code":"n = len(lines)"}],"key":["init","loop","check","add","show"],"indents":{"init":0,"loop":0,"check":1,"add":2,"show":0,"count":2,"length":0},"tests":[{"name":"一行里提到两次","setup":"lines = [\"今天见到阿木\", \"阿木说阿木的狗丢了\", \"晚上下雨\"]\nname = \"阿木\"\n","stdout":"2"},{"name":"没有一行提到","hidden":true,"setup":"lines = [\"下雨\", \"又下雨\"]\nname = \"阿木\"\n","stdout":"0"},{"name":"换一个名字","hidden":true,"setup":"lines = [\"小满来了\", \"小满和小满的妹妹\", \"阿木\", \"小满\"]\nname = \"小满\"\n","stdout":"3"}]}],"explanation":"```python\nn = 0\nfor line in lines:\n    if name in line:\n        n = n + 1\nprint(n)\n```\n\n`n = 0` 放在循环前面，只做一次；`if` 缩进在循环里，加 1 再缩进一层，只在这一行提到名字时执行；`print` 不缩进，循环结束后显示一次。“n = n + line.count(name)”数的是出现次数，第二行提到两次会加 2；“n = len(lines)”数的是总行数。\n"}],"quiz":[{"id":"py47.k1.x1","body":"要数出“舟儿”在 `text` 里一共出现几次，同一句里出现两次算两次。哪一段代码把正确的次数放进了 `n`？\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"per_sentence","content":"```python\nn = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    if \"舟儿\" in s:\n        n = n + 1\n```\n"},{"id":"split_len","content":"```python\nn = len(text.split(\"舟儿\"))\n```\n"},{"id":"summed","content":"```python\nn = 0\nfor s in text.split(\"。\"):\n    n = n + s.count(\"舟儿\")\n```\n"},{"id":"one_char","content":"```python\nn = text.count(\"舟\")\n```\n"}],"key":"summed"}],"explanation":"把每句的 `count` 加起来的那一段正确，n 是 2。“娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！”是同一句，里面有两处“舟儿”：按句子加 1 的那段只得到 1；按“舟儿”切开会切成 3 段，比出现次数多 1；只数“舟”这一个字，连“林舟”“小舟”“林舟渡”都算进去，得到 7。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"林舟把小舟系在渡口。娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！林舟听见了，划着小舟往回走。林舟渡的老人都笑了。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说：\n\n```text\n林舟把小舟系在渡口。娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！林舟听见了，划着小舟往回走。林舟渡的老人都笑了。\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k1.x2","body":"按循环的顺序，填写每一轮 `line.count(\"山\")` 的值和这一轮结束后 `n` 的值，再回答两个问题。\n\n```python\nlines = [\"山前有座庙\", \"庙后山连山\", \"下山的路\"]\nn = 0\nfor line in lines:\n    n = n + line.count(\"山\")\nprint(n)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rounds","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"line","header":"这一轮的 line"},{"id":"found","header":"`line.count(\"山\")`","input":"integer"},{"id":"n","header":"这一轮结束后的 n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"l1","cells":{"line":"山前有座庙","found":1,"n":1}},{"id":"l2","cells":{"line":"庙后山连山","found":2,"n":3}},{"id":"l3","cells":{"line":"下山的路","found":1,"n":4}}]},{"id":"output","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"最后显示什么？","key":4},{"id":"lines_with","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"三行里有几行提到了“山”？","key":3}],"explanation":"每一轮的次数是 **1、2、1**，n 依次是 **1、3、4**，最后显示 **4**。第二行“庙后山连山”里有两个“山”，这一轮加 2。\n\n提到“山”的行有 **3** 行。4 是出现次数，3 是行数：这个循环把每行的次数加起来，所以数的是前者。\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k2","title":"区分字符串出现与人物身份，规定别名和误匹配范围","key":["py05","py37"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"别名与误匹配","aliases":["人物计数规则","排除词"],"definition":"数人物不等于数字符串：先写明哪些叫法算这个人、哪些包含这些字的更长的词不算、按次数还是按句子数，程序再照规则数。","conditions":["名字可能藏在别的词里：“沈青山”里也有“沈青”，count 照样数它。","同一个词可能有别的意思（“木头”是外号还是木料），程序分不出时，规则里要写明怎样处理。"],"example":"规则“沈青、青儿算；沈青山不算”：\n```python\nperson = text.count(\"沈青\") - text.count(\"沈青山\") + text.count(\"青儿\")\n```\n4 - 2 + 1 = 3：先数字面，减去藏在“沈青山”里的，再加上别名。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"程序数的是字，你关心的是人。两者至少有三处对不上：\n\n- **一个人有几种叫法**：沈青，娘叫她“青儿”。只数“沈青”会漏掉。\n- **名字藏在别的词里**：“沈青山”是她叔叔，`count(\"沈青\")` 照样把他数进去；只数一个“青”字，连“青石桥”也算上。\n- **数的单位**：数出现几次，还是数提到她的句子有几句。\n\n所以写代码之前，先把规则写清楚：哪些叫法算这个人；哪些包含这些字的更长的词不算；按次数还是按句子数。规则定了，程序才有确定的做法。例如“沈青、青儿算；沈青山不算；按次数”可以写成：\n\n```python\nperson = text.count(\"沈青\") - text.count(\"沈青山\") + text.count(\"青儿\")\n```\n\n先数字面，减去不该算的，再加上别名。也可以先用 `replace` 把“沈青山”换成别的字，再在换过的文字里数：`text.replace(\"沈青山\", \"某人\").count(\"沈青\")`。这时要记得后面的 `count` 是对换过的文字做的。\n\n有些情况规则也说不清：“木头”可能是人的外号，也可能就是一根木头。程序分不出这种意思，规则里要写明怎样处理，例如“只在作称呼时算，逐处人工核对”。\n","example":{"id":"py47.k2.e0","body":"规则：沈青的叫法有“沈青”“青儿”两种；“沈青山”是她叔叔，不算沈青；一句里出现两次算两次。先把三个字面次数并排放进字典里看，再按规则算。\n\n```python\ncounts = {\"沈青\": text.count(\"沈青\"), \"青儿\": text.count(\"青儿\"), \"沈青山\": text.count(\"沈青山\")}\nperson = counts[\"沈青\"] - counts[\"沈青山\"] + counts[\"青儿\"]\nprint(person)\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"counts","type":"table","label":"counts 里的值","columns":[{"id":"key","header":"键"},{"id":"value","header":"值","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"shen","cells":{"key":"沈青","value":4}},{"id":"er","cells":{"key":"青儿","value":1}},{"id":"shan","cells":{"key":"沈青山","value":2}}]},{"id":"person","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"程序显示什么？","key":3},{"id":"why","type":"choice","prompt":"为什么要减去 `counts[\"沈青山\"]`？","options":[{"id":"alias","content":"“沈青山”是沈青的另一种叫法"},{"id":"duplicate","content":"“沈青山”在文中出现了两次，要去掉重复的一次"},{"id":"inside","content":"“沈青山”里含有“沈青”两个字，`count(\"沈青\")` 把它也数了进去"}],"key":"inside"}],"explanation":"counts 里是 **沈青 4、青儿 1、沈青山 2**，程序显示 **3**。\n\n“沈青”的 4 处里，有 2 处其实是“沈青山”的前两个字，按规则不算，所以减去 2；娘喊的“青儿”是沈青，加上 1。4 - 2 + 1 = 3，对应原文里“沈青推开院门”“喊青儿”“沈青应了一声”这三处。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py47.k2.q1","body":"同一段文字，按下面四种规则分别数，各得几次？都按出现次数数。\n","slots":[{"id":"rules","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"rule","header":"规则"},{"id":"count","header":"次数","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"literal","cells":{"rule":"只数“沈青”两个字连着出现的地方","count":4}},{"id":"excluded","cells":{"rule":"数“沈青”，但“沈青山”里的不算","count":2}},{"id":"person","cells":{"rule":"数“沈青”和“青儿”，“沈青山”里的不算","count":3}},{"id":"char","cells":{"rule":"只数“青”这一个字","count":6}}]}],"explanation":"依次是 **4、2、3、6**。\n\n同一段文字，规则不同，数出来的就不同。只有第三条符合“数沈青这个人”：它排除了叔叔“沈青山”，又加上了娘喊的“青儿”。只数一个“青”字时，连“青石桥”都算进去了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k2.q2","body":"规则：沈青的叫法是“沈青”“青儿”；“沈青山”是她叔叔，不算；按出现次数数。\n\n同事的代码先把“沈青山”替换掉了，可结果还是不对。请改正它，结果仍放在 `total` 里。这条规则只针对这几个名字，名字可以直接写在代码里；但换一段文字，代码也要照这条规则数对。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"cleaned = text.replace(\"沈青山\", \"某人\")\ntotal = text.count(\"沈青\") + text.count(\"青儿\")\n","solution":"cleaned = text.replace(\"沈青山\", \"某人\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"沈青\") + cleaned.count(\"青儿\")\n","accepts":["total = text.count(\"沈青\") - text.count(\"沈青山\") + text.count(\"青儿\")"],"rejects":[{"code":"cleaned = text.replace(\"沈青山\", \"某人\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"沈青\")\n","why":"漏了别名“青儿”"},{"code":"total = 3","why":"照这段文字写死了结果"},{"code":"total = text.count(\"青\")","why":"只数一个“青”字，把桥名和叔叔都算进去"},{"code":"cleaned = text.replace(\"沈青\", \"某人\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"沈青\") + cleaned.count(\"青儿\")\n","why":"把沈青本人也替换掉了"}],"tests":[{"name":"题面这段文字","expect":{"total":"3"}},{"name":"换一段文字","hidden":true,"data":["story2"],"expect":{"total":"5"}}]}],"explanation":"替换之后要在**换过的文字** `cleaned` 里数，原来的 `text` 并没有被改动（字符串不能原地改写，`replace` 交回的是一份新的文字）：\n\n```python\ncleaned = text.replace(\"沈青山\", \"某人\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"沈青\") + cleaned.count(\"青儿\")\n```\n\n写成 `total = text.count(\"沈青\") - text.count(\"沈青山\") + text.count(\"青儿\")` 也对。本例 total 是 3；判分时还会换一段“沈青山”出现次数不同的文字。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说（一整段，中间没有换行）：\n\n```text\n沈青推开院门。娘在灶台边喊青儿带上伞。沈青应了一声，往青石桥走去。桥头站着叔叔沈青山，沈青山冲她招手。\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py47.k2.r1","body":"规则：林舟的叫法是“林舟”“舟儿”；“林舟渡”是村名，不算；“小舟”是船，不算；按出现次数数。\n","slots":[{"id":"literal","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`text.count(\"林舟\")` 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"person","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按规则，林舟一共被提到几次？","key":4},{"id":"wrong","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","prompt":"如果只数“舟”这一个字，会把下面哪些也数进去、而按规则不该算？选出所有。","options":[{"id":"boat","content":"“小舟”"},{"id":"alias","content":"“舟儿”"},{"id":"village","content":"“林舟渡”"},{"id":"name","content":"“林舟”（指人的那几处）"}],"key":["boat","village"]}],"explanation":"`text.count(\"林舟\")` 是 **3**：“林舟把”“林舟听见”，还有“林舟渡”里的一处。按规则要去掉村名那一处，再加上两处“舟儿”：3 - 1 + 2 = **4**。\n\n只数“舟”时，“小舟”和“林舟渡”都会被数进去，它们按规则不算；“舟儿”和指人的“林舟”本来就该算，不是误算。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"林舟把小舟系在渡口。娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！林舟听见了，划着小舟往回走。林舟渡的老人都笑了。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说：\n\n```text\n林舟把小舟系在渡口。娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！林舟听见了，划着小舟往回走。林舟渡的老人都笑了。\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k2.r2","body":"规则：林舟的叫法是“林舟”“舟儿”；“林舟渡”是村名，不算；按出现次数数。把代码块排成程序，显示林舟被提到的次数。不是每一块都要用。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"raw","code":"total = text.count(\"林舟\") + text.count(\"舟儿\")"},{"id":"show","code":"print(total)"},{"id":"replace","code":"cleaned = text.replace(\"林舟渡\", \"某村\")"},{"id":"wrong_replace","code":"cleaned = text.replace(\"林舟\", \"某人\")"},{"id":"total","code":"total = cleaned.count(\"林舟\") + cleaned.count(\"舟儿\")"}],"key":["replace","total","show"],"tests":[{"name":"题面这段文字","stdout":"4"},{"name":"换一段村名出现两次的文字","hidden":true,"setup":"text = \"林舟渡口有棵树。舟儿爬了上去。林舟渡的人都来看。\"","stdout":"1"}]}],"explanation":"```python\ncleaned = text.replace(\"林舟渡\", \"某村\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"林舟\") + cleaned.count(\"舟儿\")\nprint(total)\n```\n\n先把村名换掉，再在换过的文字里数两种叫法。直接在 `text` 里数会把“林舟渡”也算进去，得到 5；把“林舟”换成“某人”则连林舟本人也换掉了。本例显示 4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"林舟把小舟系在渡口。娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！林舟听见了，划着小舟往回走。林舟渡的老人都笑了。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说：\n\n```text\n林舟把小舟系在渡口。娘喊舟儿快回来，舟儿！林舟听见了，划着小舟往回走。林舟渡的老人都笑了。\n```\n"}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py47.k2.x1","body":"规则：周明的叫法是“周明”“明哥”；“周明德”是他父亲，不算；按出现次数数。\n","slots":[{"id":"sentences","type":"table","prompt":"逐句判断：按规则，这一句提到周明了吗？","columns":[{"id":"sentence","header":"句子"},{"id":"hit","header":"提到周明","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"s1","cells":{"sentence":"周明德一早出门了","hit":false}},{"id":"s2","cells":{"sentence":"明哥，明天还去河边吗","hit":true}},{"id":"s3","cells":{"sentence":"周明点点头","hit":true}},{"id":"s4","cells":{"sentence":"周明把网收好，等周明德回来","hit":true}}]},{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按规则，周明一共被提到几次？","key":3},{"id":"one_char","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"如果只数“明”这一个字，得几次？","key":6}],"explanation":"逐句是 **否、是、是、是**，一共 **3** 次：“明哥”“周明点点头”“周明把网收好”。第一句只有父亲“周明德”；最后一句里的“周明德”不算，但同一句的“周明把网收好”算。\n\n只数“明”会得到 **6**：两处“周明德”、“明哥”、“明天”和两处“周明”各有一个。“明天”和人没有关系，也被数了进去。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"周明德一早出门了。明哥，明天还去河边吗？周明点点头。周明把网收好，等周明德回来。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说：\n\n```text\n周明德一早出门了。明哥，明天还去河边吗？周明点点头。周明把网收好，等周明德回来。\n```\n"}]},{"id":"py47.k2.x2","body":"规则：周明的叫法是“周明”“明哥”；“周明德”是他父亲，不算；按出现次数数。哪一段代码按这条规则把次数放进了 `total`？换一段文字也要数对。\n","slots":[{"id":"program","type":"choice","options":[{"id":"no_exclude","content":"```python\ntotal = text.count(\"周明\") + text.count(\"明哥\")\n```\n"},{"id":"one_char","content":"```python\ntotal = text.count(\"明\")\n```\n"},{"id":"wrong_replace","content":"```python\ncleaned = text.replace(\"周明\", \"某人\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"周明德\") + cleaned.count(\"明哥\")\n```\n"},{"id":"rule","content":"```python\ncleaned = text.replace(\"周明德\", \"某人\")\ntotal = cleaned.count(\"周明\") + cleaned.count(\"明哥\")\n```\n"}],"key":"rule"}],"explanation":"先把“周明德”换掉、再在换过的文字里数“周明”和“明哥”的那一段正确，本段得到 3。\n\n没有排除的那段把父亲也算进去，得到 5；只数“明”连“明天”都算上，得到 6；把“周明”换掉的那段，连周明本人和“周明德”一起换成了“某人”，只剩“明哥”，得到 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"text = \"周明德一早出门了。明哥，明天还去河边吗？周明点点头。周明把网收好，等周明德回来。\"\n","display":"变量 `text` 里是下面这段小说：\n\n```text\n周明德一早出门了。明哥，明天还去河边吗？周明点点头。周明把网收好，等周明德回来。\n```\n"}]}]}]},{"id":"py48","title":"读懂一份 AI 给的分析脚本，并说清怎样改","summary":"把 AI 写的短脚本逐行对到需求里的规则和输入输出；用恰好等于阈值、键重复、键找不到、notebook 重跑这类小反例检查偏差；提出只改一处的修改，并写下能直接核对的验收条件。","minutes":20,"prereq":["py46","py29","py45"],"intro":"这一节是课程的收尾。你会读几份 AI 写的短分析脚本，做三件事：说出每一行对应需求里的哪条规则、拿到什么交出什么；用专门造的小反例检查它在边界上是不是还对；找到偏差后，只改一处，并写下改好以后怎样核对。\n\n脚本都不长，表也都很小。每道题从题面给出的文件或表重新开始。阈值和“达标”都是题目约定，不是科研结论。\n","wrapup":"拿到 AI 给的脚本，可以按这一节的顺序回它一段话：\n\n- 哪一行对应哪条规则，哪条规则找不到对应的行；\n- 在哪张小反例上它与需求不符：输入是什么，它给出什么，需求要什么；\n- 只改哪一处；\n- 改完用哪几条能直接检查的条件验收，例如“合并后行数等于样本表的行数”“在这张反例表上，北坡的 n 是 2”。\n\n这样的回复，AI 和同事都能照着改，你也能自己核对改得对不对。\n","kps":[{"id":"py48.k1","title":"把每段代码对应到输入输出与业务规则","key":["py46","py29"],"links":["py29.k1"],"card":{"name":"规则对到代码","aliases":["读脚本","代码与需求对照"],"definition":"读一份脚本时，把需求拆成一条条规则，逐条找出实现它的那一行，并说出这一行拿到哪张表、交出哪张表；找不到对应行、或只做了一部分的规则，就是要问清楚的地方。","conditions":["一行代码可能只做了规则的一部分，例如“用最后一次测量”写成了默认的 drop_duplicates，留的是第一次。","读 merge 这一行要说全：两张输入表、按哪一列配对、how 保留谁的行、交出哪些列。"],"example":"```python\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n第一行对应“每个样本只用第一次测量”，6 行变 5 行；第二行对应“补上采样点”，拿到 first 和 sites，交出 5 行、多了 site 列的表。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,12\\n002,9\\n002,11\\n003,10\\n004,15\\n005,8\\n\")\nwith open(\"sites.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,site\\n001,北坡\\n002,南坡\\n003,北坡\\n004,南坡\\n005,东坡\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"site_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"site_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv（每行是一次测量，002 测了两次）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,12\n002,9\n002,11\n003,10\n004,15\n005,8\n```\n\n文件 sites.csv（每个样本的采样点）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,site\n001,北坡\n002,南坡\n003,北坡\n004,南坡\n005,东坡\n```\n"}]},"lesson":"AI 给的脚本往往一口气写完。读它的时候，先把你的需求拆成几条规则，再逐条去脚本里找实现它的那一行，像对答案一样。找的时候可以看这一行用了什么：\n\n| 需求里的说法 | 去找什么样的代码 | 核对什么 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 只用第一次 / 最后一次 | `drop_duplicates` | subset 是不是编号列，keep 是不是对 |\n| 补上另一张表的信息 | `merge` | on 是哪一列，how 保留谁的行 |\n| 至少 / 超过多少算达标 | `loc` 里的比较 | 比较符有没有等号 |\n| 按组数个数、求平均 | `groupby(...).agg(...)` | 分组列、计数列、缺失的组 |\n| 写进文件 | `to_csv` | 文件名、要不要索引 |\n\n每找到一行，再说出它拿到哪张表、交出哪张表、交出的表大概几行。对完以后看两种情况：\n\n- 需求里的某条规则找不到对应的行，或者那一行只做了一部分：脚本没做到它；\n- 脚本里有一行对应不到任何规则：问清它为什么在那里，它可能悄悄改了结果。\n\nmerge 这一行最容易说漏。[合并](repa:concept/py29.k1)要说全四样：两张输入表各是什么；按哪一列配对；`how=\"left\"` 保留左表的每一行（右表里找不到的，补上的列是缺失），`how=\"inner\"` 只留两边都有的编号；交出的表有哪些列。\n","example":{"id":"py48.k1.e0","body":"你向 AI 提的需求是：\n\n> ① 每个样本只用第一次测量；② 按 sites.csv 给每个样本补上采样点 site；③ signal 至少为 10 的算达标；④ 按 site 数出达标样本数 n，并求平均 signal；⑤ 结果写进 site_summary.csv。\n\nAI 给的脚本：\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport pandas as pd\n\nsamples = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nsites = pd.read_csv(\"sites.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\nsummary.to_csv(\"site_summary.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rules","type":"table","prompt":"每条规则由第几行实现？","columns":[{"id":"rule","header":"规则"},{"id":"line","header":"第几行","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"rule":"① 只用第一次测量","line":6}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"rule":"② 补上采样点","line":7}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"rule":"③ 至少 10 算达标","line":8}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"rule":"④ 按 site 计数、求平均","line":9}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"rule":"⑤ 写进文件","line":10}}]},{"id":"merged_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`merged` 有几行？","key":5},{"id":"passed_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`passed` 有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"| 规则 | 行 | 拿到 → 交出 |\n|---|---:|---|\n| ① 只用第一次测量 | 6 | samples 6 行 → first 5 行（002 留第一次的 9） |\n| ② 补上采样点 | 7 | first 和 sites → merged 5 行，多了 site 列 |\n| ③ 至少 10 算达标 | 8 | merged → passed 3 行（001、003、004） |\n| ④ 按 site 计数、求平均 | 9 | passed → summary，北坡、南坡各一行 |\n| ⑤ 写进文件 | 10 | summary → site_summary.csv |\n\n第 3、4 行是读入，需求里没单独写，但它们决定了 sample_id 按文字读（保留前导零）。`how=\"left\"` 保留 first 的每一行，sites 里每个样本只登记了一次，所以 merged 仍是 **5** 行。003 的 signal 恰好是 10，`>=` 把它留下，passed 是 **3** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,12\\n002,9\\n002,11\\n003,10\\n004,15\\n005,8\\n\")\nwith open(\"sites.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,site\\n001,北坡\\n002,南坡\\n003,北坡\\n004,南坡\\n005,东坡\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"site_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"site_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv（每行是一次测量，002 测了两次）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,12\n002,9\n002,11\n003,10\n004,15\n005,8\n```\n\n文件 sites.csv（每个样本的采样点）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,site\n001,北坡\n002,南坡\n003,北坡\n004,南坡\n005,东坡\n```\n"}]},"practice":[{"id":"py48.k1.q1","body":"只看脚本里去重和合并这两行：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"inputs","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","prompt":"第 2 行拿到哪几张表？选出全部。","options":[{"id":"samples","content":"`samples`"},{"id":"first","content":"`first`"},{"id":"sites","content":"`sites`"},{"id":"merged","content":"`merged`"}],"key":["first","sites"]},{"id":"keeps","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行保留谁的行？","options":[{"id":"inner","content":"只留 first 和 sites 里都有的编号","feedback":"那是 how=\"inner\"。"},{"id":"right","content":"sites 的每一行都留下"},{"id":"left","content":"first 的每一行都留下；在 sites 里找不到的，site 为缺失"}],"key":"left"},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`merged` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"sample_id","content":"`sample_id`"},{"id":"signal","content":"`signal`"},{"id":"site","content":"`site`"},{"id":"merge_flag","content":"`_merge`"}],"key":["sample_id","signal","site"]},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`merged` 有几行？","key":5}],"explanation":"第 2 行拿到 **first** 和 **sites** 两张表（不是原来的 samples），按 sample_id 配对。`how=\"left\"` 保留 first 的每一行，找不到采样点的样本 site 为缺失。交出的表列是 **sample_id、signal、site**：左表的列在前，补上的列在后；没写 `indicator=True`，所以没有 `_merge` 列。first 有 5 行，每个编号在 sites 里只有一行，merged 也是 **5** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本信息","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","004","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k1.q2","body":"这次的需求是：\n\n> ① 同一个样本测了两次时，用最后一次（复测）的结果；② 按 sites 给每个样本补上 site，样本一个不少；③ signal 至少为 10 的算达标；④ 按 site 数出达标样本数 n。\n\nAI 给的脚本：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rules","type":"table","prompt":"第 n 行对应规则 n。这一行完全做到了这条规则吗？","columns":[{"id":"rule","header":"规则"},{"id":"done","header":"做到了吗","input":"bool"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"rule":"① 用最后一次测量（第 1 行）","done":false}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"rule":"② 补上 site，样本一个不少（第 2 行）","done":true}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"rule":"③ 至少 10 算达标（第 3 行）","done":true}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"rule":"④ 按 site 计数（第 4 行）","done":true}}]},{"id":"south","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"脚本算出的南坡 n 是多少？","key":1},{"id":"south_need","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按需求，南坡的 n 应当是多少？","key":2}],"explanation":"第 1 行只做了一半：`drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])` 默认 `keep=\"first\"`，002 留下的是第一次的 9，而需求要复测的 11。其余三行都按各自的规则做了。\n\n这一处让结果不同：脚本里 002 的 9 不达标，南坡只有 004，n 为 **1**；按需求 002 用 11，达标，南坡 n 应为 **2**。第 1 行要加上 `keep=\"last\"`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本信息","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","004","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k1.q3","body":"还是例题里那份脚本。运行之后，打开它写出的 site_summary.csv。\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport pandas as pd\n\nsamples = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\nsites = pd.read_csv(\"sites.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\nsummary.to_csv(\"site_summary.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"header","type":"choice","prompt":"文件的第一行（表头）是哪一种？","options":[{"id":"no_index","content":"`n,mean_signal`"},{"id":"full","content":"`site,n,mean_signal`"},{"id":"blank","content":"`,n,mean_signal`"}],"key":"full"},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"表头下面有几行数据？","key":2},{"id":"east","type":"choice","prompt":"东坡在文件里吗？","options":[{"id":"one","content":"在，n 为 1"},{"id":"zero","content":"在，n 为 0"},{"id":"absent","content":"不在"}],"key":"absent"},{"id":"north_mean","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"北坡的 mean_signal 是多少？","key":11}],"explanation":"表头是 **site,n,mean_signal**：组名在汇总表的索引里，`to_csv` 默认把索引写成第一列，索引名 site 就是第一列的表头。下面 **2** 行数据，北坡和南坡。\n\n东坡**不在**文件里：东坡只有 005，signal 是 8，没有达标；groupby 只为 passed 里出现的组生成一行，不会给东坡写一行 n 为 0。北坡是 001 的 12 和 003 的 10，平均 **11.0**。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,12\\n002,9\\n002,11\\n003,10\\n004,15\\n005,8\\n\")\nwith open(\"sites.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,site\\n001,北坡\\n002,南坡\\n003,北坡\\n004,南坡\\n005,东坡\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"site_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"site_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv（每行是一次测量，002 测了两次）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,12\n002,9\n002,11\n003,10\n004,15\n005,8\n```\n\n文件 sites.csv（每个样本的采样点）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,site\n001,北坡\n002,南坡\n003,北坡\n004,南坡\n005,东坡\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py48.k1.r1","body":"AI 写的土层深度分析：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = readings.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plot_id\"], keep=\"last\")\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"left\")\ndeep = merged.loc[merged[\"depth\"] >= 30]\nsummary = deep.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"line1","type":"choice","prompt":"第 1 行对应需求里的哪一句？","options":[{"id":"first","content":"每个样点测了多次时，只用第一次"},{"id":"whole","content":"只去掉完全相同的重复行"},{"id":"last","content":"每个样点测了多次时，只用最后一次"}],"key":"last"},{"id":"line2","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行对应需求里的哪一句？","options":[{"id":"only_known","content":"只留 plots 表里登记过的样点"},{"id":"keep_all","content":"给每个样点补上 site，样点一个不少"}],"key":"keep_all"},{"id":"merged_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`merged` 有几行？","key":4},{"id":"summary_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`summary` 有几行？","key":2}],"explanation":"第 1 行按 plot_id 去重并 `keep=\"last\"`，对应“只用最后一次”：P2 留下 30，不是 28。第 2 行 `how=\"left\"`，对应“样点一个不少地补上 site”：merged 仍是 **4** 行。\n\n达到 30 的是 P1（32，北坡）、P2（30，南坡）、P3（35，北坡），P4 只有 26。summary 有北坡、南坡 **2** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"readings","caption":"表 readings：土层深度测量（厘米，P2 测了两次）","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P2","P3","P4"],"depth":[32,28,30,35,26]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：每个样点在哪个坡","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3","P4"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k1.r2","body":"需求是：\n\n> ① 每个培养皿只用第一次计数；② 按 dishes 表补上 treatment，培养皿一个不少；③ cells 至少为 45 的算长得好；④ 按 treatment 数出长得好的培养皿个数 n。\n\n从下面的代码行里挑出需要的，按规则的顺序排好，组成一段脚本；用不到的行不要放进来。\n","slots":[{"id":"lines","type":"order","partial":true,"items":[{"id":"strict","code":"good = merged.loc[merged[\"cells\"] > 45]"},{"id":"summary","code":"summary = good.groupby(\"treatment\").agg(n=(\"dish_id\", \"count\"))"},{"id":"inner","code":"merged = first.merge(dishes, on=\"dish_id\", how=\"inner\")"},{"id":"first","code":"first = counts.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"dish_id\"])"},{"id":"good","code":"good = merged.loc[merged[\"cells\"] >= 45]"},{"id":"merged","code":"merged = first.merge(dishes, on=\"dish_id\", how=\"left\")"}],"key":["first","merged","good","summary"],"tests":[{"name":"表 counts 和 dishes","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [2, 1]}, index=[\"control\", \"drug\"])","len(merged)":"4"}},{"name":"有一个培养皿没登记","hidden":true,"setup":"dishes = dishes.loc[dishes[\"dish_id\"] != \"04\"]","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 1]}, index=[\"control\", \"drug\"])","len(merged)":"4"}}]}],"explanation":"```python\nfirst = counts.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"dish_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(dishes, on=\"dish_id\", how=\"left\")\ngood = merged.loc[merged[\"cells\"] >= 45]\nsummary = good.groupby(\"treatment\").agg(n=(\"dish_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n\n四条规则各对一行。“一个不少”要用 `how=\"left\"`：没登记的培养皿也留在 merged 里；`how=\"inner\"` 会把它去掉，判分时会换一张少登记了一个培养皿的 dishes 表检查行数。“至少 45”要用 `>=`：03 第一次计数恰好是 45。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"counts","caption":"表 counts：细胞计数（03 号计了两次）","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03","03","04"],"cells":[52,40,45,47,48]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"dishes","caption":"表 dishes：每个培养皿的处理","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03","04"],"treatment":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py48.k1.x1","body":"AI 写的成绩分析里有这样两行：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = scores.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"pid\"])\nmatched = first.merge(people, on=\"pid\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`matched` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"kept","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`matched` 里有哪些受试者？按先后顺序排出 pid。","items":[{"id":"A1","content":"A1"},{"id":"A2","content":"A2"},{"id":"A3","content":"A3"},{"id":"A4","content":"A4"}],"key":["A1","A2","A3"]},{"id":"columns","type":"order","partial":true,"prompt":"`matched` 有哪些列？按顺序排列。","items":[{"id":"cohort","content":"`cohort`"},{"id":"pid","content":"`pid`"},{"id":"merge_flag","content":"`_merge`"},{"id":"score","content":"`score`"}],"key":["pid","score","cohort"]},{"id":"rule","type":"choice","prompt":"第 2 行对应下面哪一句需求？","options":[{"id":"all","content":"每个受试者都要出现在结果里，没登记批次的 cohort 记为缺失"},{"id":"only","content":"只统计 people 表里登记过的受试者"},{"id":"people_all","content":"people 表里的每个人都要出现在结果里"}],"key":"only"}],"explanation":"第 1 行去重后有 A1、A2、A3、A4 四人（A2 留第一次的 65）。第 2 行 `how=\"inner\"` 只留两张表都有的 pid，A4 没在 people 里登记，被去掉：matched 是 **A1、A2、A3** 共 **3** 行，列是 **pid、score、cohort**。所以这一行对应的是“**只统计 people 表里登记过的受试者**”；如果需求是“每个受试者都要出现”，应当用 `how=\"left\"`。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"scores","caption":"表 scores：受试者的测试成绩（A2 测了两次）","columns":{"pid":["A1","A2","A2","A3","A4"],"score":[78,65,70,88,57]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"people","caption":"表 people：A4 没有登记","columns":{"pid":["A1","A2","A3"],"cohort":["第一批","第二批","第一批"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k1.x2","body":"你的需求（按你想到的先后写的）：\n\n> ① 按 treatment 数出长得好的培养皿个数 n；② 每个培养皿只用第一次计数；③ 按 dishes.csv 补上 treatment；④ cells 至少为 45 的算长得好；⑤ 结果写进 treatment_summary.csv。\n\nAI 给的脚本：\n\n```python startLine=1\nimport pandas as pd\n\ncounts = pd.read_csv(\"counts.csv\", dtype={\"dish_id\": \"str\"})\ndishes = pd.read_csv(\"dishes.csv\", dtype={\"dish_id\": \"str\"})\nmerged = counts.merge(dishes, on=\"dish_id\", how=\"left\")\nfirst = merged.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"dish_id\"])\ngood = first.loc[first[\"cells\"] >= 45]\nsummary = good.groupby(\"treatment\").agg(n=(\"dish_id\", \"count\"))\nsummary.to_csv(\"treatment_summary.csv\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"rules","type":"table","prompt":"每条规则由第几行实现？","columns":[{"id":"rule","header":"规则"},{"id":"line","header":"第几行","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"r1","cells":{"rule":"① 按 treatment 计数","line":8}},{"id":"r2","cells":{"rule":"② 只用第一次计数","line":6}},{"id":"r3","cells":{"rule":"③ 补上 treatment","line":5}},{"id":"r4","cells":{"rule":"④ 至少 45 算长得好","line":7}},{"id":"r5","cells":{"rule":"⑤ 写进文件","line":9}}]},{"id":"merged_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`merged` 有几行？","key":5},{"id":"good_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`good` 有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"| 规则 | 行 |\n|---|---:|\n| ① 按 treatment 计数 | 8 |\n| ② 只用第一次计数 | 6 |\n| ③ 补上 treatment | 5 |\n| ④ 至少 45 算长得好 | 7 |\n| ⑤ 写进文件 | 9 |\n\n脚本的顺序和你写需求的顺序不同：它先合并再去重。这里两种顺序结果一样，因为 dishes 里每个培养皿只有一行。merged 有 **5** 行（counts 的 5 次计数都配上了 treatment）；去重后 03 留第一次的 45，达到 45 的是 01、03、04，good 有 **3** 行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nwith open(\"counts.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"dish_id,cells\\n01,52\\n02,40\\n03,45\\n03,47\\n04,48\\n\")\nwith open(\"dishes.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"dish_id,treatment\\n01,control\\n02,drug\\n03,drug\\n04,control\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"treatment_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"treatment_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 counts.csv（每行是一次细胞计数，03 号培养皿计了两次）：\n\n```text\ndish_id,cells\n01,52\n02,40\n03,45\n03,47\n04,48\n```\n\n文件 dishes.csv（每个培养皿的处理）：\n\n```text\ndish_id,treatment\n01,control\n02,drug\n03,drug\n04,control\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py48.k2","title":"用边界和反例检查偏差","key":["py29","py45","py42"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"反例","aliases":["小反例","边界例子"],"definition":"专门造的一张小表，让脚本可能出错的地方真的出现；先按需求手算应有的结果，再预测脚本的结果，两者不同就找到了一处偏差。","conditions":["常用的反例：恰好等于阈值的值、右表编号重复、左表编号在右表里找不到、分组列缺失、notebook 重启后从头运行。","反例上两者一致，只说明这一处没问题，不说明脚本处处都对。"],"example":"sites 里 003 登记了两次：left merge 后 003 变成两行，merged 从 5 行变成 6 行，达标样本只有 3 个，汇总表的 n 却加起来是 4。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：003 登记了两次，采样点还不一样","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","003","004","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","南坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},"lesson":"AI 的脚本在你手上那张表上跑出了看着合理的结果，不等于它照需求做了。在一张“正常”的表上，好几种写法常常碰巧给出一样的结果。要检查偏差，就造一张小表，让可能出错的地方真的出现：\n\n| 可能的偏差 | 反例里放什么 | 脚本出错时的样子 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 比较符多了或少了等号 | 恰好等于阈值的值 | 该留的没留，或不该留的留下了 |\n| 右表编号重复 | 同一个编号在右表登记两次 | merge 之后行数变多，同一个样本被算了两次 |\n| 左表编号在右表找不到 | 一个没登记的样本 | left merge 后补上的列是缺失，groupby 默认不把它放进任何组；inner merge 直接把它去掉 |\n| notebook 依赖了隐藏的状态 | 重启内核，从头运行全部单元格 | 报 NameError，或结果和屏幕上的代码对不上 |\n\n在反例上先按需求手算应有的结果，再预测脚本会给出什么。两者不同，就把三样一起写下来：输入是什么，脚本给出什么，需求要什么。这就是一份别人能照着复现的问题报告。\n","example":{"id":"py48.k2.e0","body":"需求是：每个样本只用第一次测量；补上采样点 site；signal 至少为 10 的算达标；按 site 数出达标样本数。每个样本只能算一次。\n\n这张 sites 表是一个反例：003 被登记了两次。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"merged_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`merged` 有几行？","key":6},{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"汇总表里各组的 n 加起来是多少？","key":4},{"id":"need","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"实际达标的样本有几个？","key":3},{"id":"cause","type":"choice","prompt":"多出来的那一个是怎么来的？","options":[{"id":"dedupe","content":"第 1 行没有去掉 003 的重复测量"},{"id":"dup","content":"003 在 sites 里有两行，第 2 行把它配成了两行"},{"id":"threshold","content":"第 3 行的 `>=` 多算了恰好为 10 的样本"}],"key":"dup"}],"explanation":"first 有 5 行，每个样本一行。merge 时 003 在 sites 里能配上两行（北坡、南坡），于是 merged 里 003 也成了两行，共 **6** 行。达标的样本是 001、003、004，只有 **3** 个，但 003 的两行都达标，汇总表里北坡、南坡各算了它一次，n 加起来是 **4**。\n\n第 1 行没问题，003 在 samples 里只测了一次；`>=` 与“至少为 10”一致。问题出在右表编号重复。这时该做的不是在脚本里随便删一行 sites，而是把反例交回去：003 到底在哪个坡，要由登记数据的人确定。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：003 登记了两次，采样点还不一样","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","003","004","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","南坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py48.k2.q1","body":"需求是：signal **超过** 10 的样本算达标，恰好为 10 的不算。AI 的脚本里筛选这一行是：\n\n```python\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\n```\n\n你想造一张三行的小表，看它会不会多留。\n","slots":[{"id":"table","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一张小表能暴露这处偏差？","options":[{"id":"a","content":"signal 依次为 8、12、15"},{"id":"b","content":"signal 依次为 9、10、11"},{"id":"c","content":"signal 依次为 11、13、20"}],"key":"b"},{"id":"script_count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"在你选的那张表上，脚本留下几行？","key":2},{"id":"need_count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按需求应当留下几行？","key":1}],"explanation":"选 **9、10、11** 这一张：只有恰好等于 10 的值，在 `>= 10` 和“超过 10”下结果不同。脚本留下 10 和 11 两行（**2** 行），需求只要 11（**1** 行）。另外两张表里没有 10，两种写法结果一样，查不出问题。\n"},{"id":"py48.k2.q2","body":"需求是：每个样本只用第一次测量；补上采样点 site；signal 至少为 10 的算达标；按 site 数出达标样本数。没有采样点信息的样本单独算一组，不能丢。\n\n这张 sites 表是一个反例：004 没有登记。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"site_004","type":"choice","prompt":"在 `merged` 里，004 这一行的 site 是什么？","options":[{"id":"south","content":"南坡，沿用上一行的值"},{"id":"absent","content":"004 不在 merged 里"},{"id":"missing","content":"缺失值 NaN"}],"key":"missing"},{"id":"passed_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`passed` 有几行？","key":3},{"id":"total","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"汇总表里各组的 n 加起来是多少？","key":2},{"id":"lost","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个样本达标了，却没有出现在汇总表里？","options":[{"id":"001","content":"001"},{"id":"003","content":"003"},{"id":"004","content":"004"}],"key":"004"}],"explanation":"`how=\"left\"` 保留 004 这一行，但 sites 里找不到它，site 是**缺失值**。004 的 signal 是 15，达标，passed 有 001、003、004 共 **3** 行。groupby 默认不把分组列缺失的行放进任何组，所以汇总表只有北坡一行，n 加起来是 **2**：**004** 悄悄消失了。按需求它应当单独成一组。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：004 没有登记","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k2.q3","body":"AI 发来一份 notebook，说“运行过，结果没问题”。屏幕上从上到下是下面四个单元格，标出了编号。它之前运行过一个 `limit = 10` 的单元格（编号 `[3]`），后来把那个单元格删掉了。\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\nsamples = pd.read_csv(\"samples.csv\", dtype={\"sample_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[4]`：\n\n```python\npassed = samples.loc[samples[\"signal\"] >= limit]\n```\n\n单元格 D，编号 `[5]`：\n\n```python\nprint(len(passed))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"now","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"不重启，单元格 D 现在显示的数是多少？","key":4},{"id":"stops","type":"choice","prompt":"重启内核、从上到下运行全部单元格，在哪个单元格停下？","options":[{"id":"c1","content":"单元格 A"},{"id":"c2","content":"单元格 B"},{"id":"c3","content":"单元格 C"},{"id":"c4","content":"单元格 D"},{"id":"none","content":"不会停下"}],"key":"c3"},{"id":"error","type":"text","prompt":"报什么异常？写出异常类型。","key":"NameError"}],"explanation":"按编号的顺序，内核里先有了 pandas 和 samples，再运行了已删掉的 `limit = 10`，然后才是单元格 C、D。samples 没有去重，signal 至少为 10 的是 12、11、10、15，单元格 D 显示 **4**。\n\n重启后内核里什么都没有，从上到下运行：单元格 C 用到 `limit`，可是定义它的单元格已经不在了，在**单元格 C** 停下，报 **NameError**。“运行过”只说明在那一刻的内核里能跑，不说明这份 notebook 本身是完整的。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nwith open(\"samples.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,signal\\n001,12\\n002,9\\n002,11\\n003,10\\n004,15\\n005,8\\n\")\nwith open(\"sites.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"sample_id,site\\n001,北坡\\n002,南坡\\n003,北坡\\n004,南坡\\n005,东坡\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"site_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"site_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 samples.csv（每行是一次测量，002 测了两次）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,signal\n001,12\n002,9\n002,11\n003,10\n004,15\n005,8\n```\n\n文件 sites.csv（每个样本的采样点）：\n\n```text\nsample_id,site\n001,北坡\n002,南坡\n003,北坡\n004,南坡\n005,东坡\n```\n"}]}],"review":[{"id":"py48.k2.r1","body":"需求是：每个样点只用第一次测量；按 plots 补上 site，样点一个不少，没登记的 site 记为缺失。\n\n这张 plots 表是一个反例：P4 没有登记。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = readings.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plot_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"need_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"按需求，`merged` 应当有几行？","key":4},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"脚本的 `merged` 实际有几行？","key":3},{"id":"lost","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个样点不见了？","options":[{"id":"P1","content":"P1"},{"id":"P2","content":"P2"},{"id":"P3","content":"P3"},{"id":"P4","content":"P4"}],"key":"P4"}],"explanation":"去重后有 P1、P2、P3、P4 四个样点。按需求，合并后应当仍是 **4** 行，P4 的 site 为缺失；脚本用了 `how=\"inner\"`，只留两张表都有的编号，**P4** 被去掉，只剩 **3** 行。在登记齐全的表上，inner 和 left 结果一样，只有这种“有人没登记”的反例才看得出来。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"readings","caption":"表 readings：土层深度测量（厘米，P2 测了两次）","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P2","P3","P4"],"depth":[32,28,30,35,26]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：P4 没有登记","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k2.r2","body":"需求是：按 dishes 表给每个培养皿补上 treatment，合并后每个培养皿仍只有一行。AI 的脚本：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = counts.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"dish_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(dishes, on=\"dish_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n\n你想检查：dishes 表里如果有人把同一个培养皿登记了两次，脚本会不会把它算成两行。\n","slots":[{"id":"table","type":"choice","prompt":"用下面哪一张 dishes 表做反例最合适？","options":[{"id":"missing","content":"| dish_id | treatment |\n|---|---|\n| 01 | control |\n| 02 | drug |\n| 03 | drug |\n"},{"id":"twice","content":"| dish_id | treatment |\n|---|---|\n| 01 | control |\n| 02 | drug |\n| 03 | drug |\n| 03 | control |\n| 04 | control |\n"},{"id":"clean","content":"| dish_id | treatment |\n|---|---|\n| 01 | control |\n| 02 | drug |\n| 03 | drug |\n| 04 | control |\n"}],"key":"twice"},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"在你选的那张表上，`merged` 有几行？","key":5}],"explanation":"选 **03 登记了两次**的那一张。first 有 01–04 四行；03 在这张 dishes 表里能配上两行，merged 变成 **5** 行，同一个培养皿被算了两次。另外两张表上 merged 都是 4 行：少登记了 04 的表，left merge 仍保留 04（treatment 为缺失）；登记齐全的表本来就没有问题。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"counts","caption":"表 counts：细胞计数（03 号计了两次）","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03","03","04"],"cells":[52,40,45,47,48]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py48.k2.x1","body":"需求是：每个受试者只用第一次成绩；按 people 补上 cohort；按 cohort 数人数 n、求平均成绩。每个受试者只能算一次。\n\n这张 people 表是一个反例：A3 登记了两次。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = scores.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"pid\"])\nmerged = first.merge(people, on=\"pid\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"cohort\").agg(n=(\"pid\", \"count\"), mean_score=(\"score\", \"mean\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"merged_rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"`merged` 有几行？","key":5},{"id":"second_n","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"第二批的 n 是多少？","key":3},{"id":"second_mean","type":"text","format":"number","prompt":"第二批的 mean_score 是多少？","key":70},{"id":"people_count","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"实际有几个受试者？","key":4}],"explanation":"first 是 A1 78、A2 65、A3 88、A4 57 四个人。A3 在 people 里配上两行，merged 有 **5** 行。第二批里是 A2、A3、A4，n 为 **3**，平均 (65 + 88 + 57) ÷ 3 = **70.0**；第一批是 A1、A3。两批的 n 加起来是 5，可受试者只有 **4** 个：A3 两批各算了一次。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"scores","caption":"表 scores：受试者的测试成绩（A2 测了两次）","columns":{"pid":["A1","A2","A2","A3","A4"],"score":[78,65,70,88,57]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"people","caption":"表 people：A3 登记了两次，批次还不一样","columns":{"pid":["A1","A2","A3","A3","A4"],"cohort":["第一批","第二批","第一批","第二批","第二批"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k2.x2","body":"同事的 notebook 屏幕上从上到下是五个单元格，标出了编号。单元格 C 原来写的是 `limit = 45`，运行过（编号 `[3]`）；后来同事把它改成了 `limit = 50` 又运行了一次（编号 `[6]`），接着只重新运行了单元格 E。\n\n单元格 A，编号 `[1]`：\n\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n```\n\n单元格 B，编号 `[2]`：\n\n```python\ncounts = pd.read_csv(\"counts.csv\", dtype={\"dish_id\": \"str\"})\n```\n\n单元格 C，编号 `[6]`：\n\n```python\nlimit = 50\n```\n\n单元格 D，编号 `[4]`：\n\n```python\ngood = counts.loc[counts[\"cells\"] >= limit]\n```\n\n单元格 E，编号 `[7]`：\n\n```python\nprint(len(good))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"now","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"单元格 E 现在显示的数是多少？","key":4},{"id":"restart","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"重启内核、从上到下运行全部单元格，单元格 E 显示多少？","key":1},{"id":"rerun","type":"choice","prompt":"不重启的话，至少要重新运行哪个单元格，`good` 才和屏幕上的代码一致？","options":[{"id":"c3","content":"单元格 C"},{"id":"c4","content":"单元格 D"},{"id":"c5","content":"单元格 E"},{"id":"none","content":"都不用，已经一致"}],"key":"c4"}],"explanation":"单元格 D 的编号是 [4]，比单元格 C 的 [6] 小：它是在 limit 还是 45 的时候运行的。counts 没有去重，至少 45 的计数是 52、45、47、48，所以单元格 E 现在显示 **4**。\n\n屏幕上写的是 `limit = 50`，从上到下重跑后只有 52 达到，显示 **1**。不重启的话，要重新运行**单元格 D**，good 才按 50 重新筛选；只重跑单元格 E 只是把旧的 good 再显示一遍。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"python","code":"import os\nwith open(\"counts.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"dish_id,cells\\n01,52\\n02,40\\n03,45\\n03,47\\n04,48\\n\")\nwith open(\"dishes.csv\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(\"dish_id,treatment\\n01,control\\n02,drug\\n03,drug\\n04,control\\n\")\nif os.path.exists(\"treatment_summary.csv\"):\n    os.remove(\"treatment_summary.csv\")\n","display":"文件 counts.csv（每行是一次细胞计数，03 号培养皿计了两次）：\n\n```text\ndish_id,cells\n01,52\n02,40\n03,45\n03,47\n04,48\n```\n\n文件 dishes.csv（每个培养皿的处理）：\n\n```text\ndish_id,treatment\n01,control\n02,drug\n03,drug\n04,control\n```\n"}]}]},{"id":"py48.k3","title":"提出最小修改及可复验的验收条件","key":["py29","py42","py28"],"links":[],"card":{"name":"最小修改与验收","aliases":["验收条件","只改一处"],"definition":"找到偏差后，只改造成偏差的那一处；同时写下能直接核对的验收条件，例如“合并后行数等于样本表行数”或“在这张反例表上北坡的 n 是 2”，改完后逐条核对。","conditions":["“看起来合理”“写得更规范”不是验收条件；验收条件要能写成 assert，或者是一个明确的数。","好的验收条件在原来的脚本上不成立、在改好的脚本上成立；两边都成立的条件查不出这处偏差。"],"example":"004 没登记采样点，汇总时丢了：只把分组那一行改成 `groupby(\"site\", dropna=False)`；验收条件 `assert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(passed)` 在原脚本上不成立，改好后成立。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：004 没有登记","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡"]}}]},"lesson":"找到偏差以后，回复 AI 或同事时说清两件事：改哪里，怎样算改好了。\n\n**只改一处。** 偏差出在哪一步就改哪一步，其余代码不动。让 AI 整段重写，会带进新的变化，原来对的地方也得重新核对一遍。\n\n**验收条件要能直接检查。** 常见的几类：\n\n| 想确认的事 | 写法 |\n|---|---|\n| 合并没有让行数变多或变少 | `assert len(merged) == len(first)` |\n| 右表每个编号最多一行 | merge 里加 `validate=\"many_to_one\"`，不满足时报 MergeError |\n| 每个样本都配上了信息 | `assert merged[\"site\"].count() == len(merged)`，或加 `indicator=True` 看有没有 left_only |\n| 分组没有漏掉行 | `assert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(passed)` |\n| 在一张小表上的具体结果 | “在反例表上，北坡的 n 是 2，缺失的组 n 是 1” |\n\n“结果看起来合理”“代码更规范”“AI 说检查过了”都不是验收条件：别人没法照着核对。\n\n挑验收条件时，拿原来的脚本和改好的脚本各试一次。好的验收条件在原来的脚本上不成立（运行到它会停下），在改好的脚本上成立；两边都成立的条件，查不出这处偏差。\n","example":{"id":"py48.k3.e0","body":"需求是：每个样本只用第一次测量；补上采样点 site；signal 至少为 10 的算达标；按 site 数出达标样本数 n。没有采样点信息的样本单独算一组，不能丢。\n\n在 004 没登记的反例上，脚本把 004 丢了。\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n","slots":[{"id":"fix","type":"choice","prompt":"只改一行，改成哪一种？","options":[{"id":"inner","content":"```python\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n```\n"},{"id":"keep","content":"```python\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n"},{"id":"strict","content":"```python\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] > 10]\n```\n"}],"key":"keep"},{"id":"checks","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","prompt":"在这张反例表上，哪些验收条件在原脚本上不成立、改好后成立？选出全部。","options":[{"id":"sum","content":"```python\nassert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(passed)\n```\n"},{"id":"rows","content":"```python\nassert len(merged) == len(first)\n```\n"},{"id":"north","content":"```python\nassert summary.loc[\"北坡\", \"n\"] == 2\n```\n"},{"id":"groups","content":"```python\nassert len(summary) == 2\n```\n"}],"key":["sum","groups"]}],"explanation":"改分组那一行：`groupby(\"site\", dropna=False)`，site 缺失的 004 单独成一组。改成 inner 会在合并时就把 004 去掉，和需求正好相反；改比较符碰不到原因。\n\n四个验收条件在原脚本和改好的脚本上分别是：\n\n| 验收条件 | 原脚本 | 改好后 |\n|---|---|---|\n| n 加起来等于 passed 的行数 | 2 ≠ 3，不成立 | 3 = 3，成立 |\n| merged 行数等于 first | 成立 | 成立 |\n| 北坡的 n 是 2 | 成立 | 成立 |\n| 汇总表有 2 行 | 只有北坡 1 行，不成立 | 北坡和缺失组 2 行，成立 |\n\n中间两条两边都成立，查不出这处偏差；它们可以留着防别的问题，但不能用来验收这次修改。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：004 没有登记","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","东坡"]}}]},"practice":[{"id":"py48.k3.q1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 每个样本只用第一次测量；按 sites 补上采样点 site；signal 至少为 10 的算达标；按 site 数出达标样本数 n，并求平均 signal mean_signal。\n\nAI 的脚本在作答框里。核对时发现：signal 恰好为 10 的 003 没有算进去。只改出错的那一处并提交，结果仍叫 `summary`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":6,"starter":"first = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] > 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","solution":"first = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","rejects":[{"code":"first = samples.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"sample_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] > 9]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","why":"改成“大于 9”，只在整数上碰巧等于“至少 10”"},{"code":"merged = samples.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\nsummary = passed.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"sample_id\", \"count\"), mean_signal=(\"signal\", \"mean\"))\n","why":"顺手删掉了去重，002 的复测也被算了进去"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 samples 和 sites","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [2, 1], \"mean_signal\": [11.0, 15.0]}, index=[\"北坡\", \"南坡\"])","samples":"samples"}},{"name":"换一组带小数的测量","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nsamples = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"101\", \"102\", \"103\"], \"signal\": [9.5, 10.0, 12.0]})\nsites = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"101\", \"102\", \"103\"], \"site\": [\"北坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\"]})\n","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 1], \"mean_signal\": [10.0, 12.0]}, index=[\"北坡\", \"南坡\"])"}}]}],"explanation":"只改第 3 行的比较符：\n\n```python\npassed = merged.loc[merged[\"signal\"] >= 10]\n```\n\n其余三行不动。改后北坡是 001 和 003，n 为 2、平均 11.0；南坡是 004，n 为 1、平均 15.0。判分时还会换一组带小数的测量：“大于 9”会把 9.5 也算进去。删掉去重那一行虽然也“改了一处”，却把 002 的复测 11 带了进来，结果跟着变了。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"samples","caption":"表 samples：测量记录（002 测了两次）","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","002","003","004","005"],"signal":[12,9,11,10,15,8]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"sites","caption":"表 sites：样本信息","columns":{"sample_id":["001","002","003","004","005"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡","南坡","东坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k3.q2","body":"合并之后，同事想加一个验收条件。AI 建议的是“合并后的表不是空的”，可这查不出右表编号重复让行数变多。\n\n把作答框里的函数改成：合并后的行数与合并前相同时返回 True，否则返回 False。以后这样用：`assert rows_kept(first, merged)`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":4,"starter":"def rows_kept(before, after):\n    return len(after) > 0\n","solution":"def rows_kept(before, after):\n    return len(after) == len(before)\n","rejects":[{"code":"def rows_kept(before, after):\n    return len(after) >= len(before)\n","why":"行数变多时也返回 True"},{"code":"def rows_kept(before, after):\n    return len(after) <= len(before)\n","why":"合并后少了行也返回 True"}],"tests":[{"name":"行数不变与右表编号重复","setup":"import pandas as pd\nfirst = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\", \"004\"], \"signal\": [12, 9, 10, 15]})\nsites = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\", \"004\"], \"site\": [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\"]})\nsites_dup = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\", \"003\", \"004\"], \"site\": [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"南坡\"]})\nmerged_ok = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\nmerged_dup = first.merge(sites_dup, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"left\")\n","doctest":">>> rows_kept(first, merged_ok)\nTrue\n>>> rows_kept(first, merged_dup)\nFalse\n"},{"name":"合并后少了行","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nfirst = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\", \"004\"], \"signal\": [12, 9, 10, 15]})\nsites = pd.DataFrame({\"sample_id\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\"], \"site\": [\"北坡\", \"南坡\", \"北坡\"]})\nmerged_lost = first.merge(sites, on=\"sample_id\", how=\"inner\")\n","doctest":">>> rows_kept(first, merged_lost)\nFalse\n"}]}],"explanation":"```python\ndef rows_kept(before, after):\n    return len(after) == len(before)\n```\n\n“不是空的”在行数变多时照样成立，查不出编号重复。要比的是合并前后的行数：变多（右表编号重复）、变少（how=\"inner\" 去掉了没登记的样本）都返回 False。写成 `>=` 或 `<=` 只能拦下其中一种。\n"},{"id":"py48.k3.q3","body":"你改好了脚本的合并那一行，准备回复 AI：“这样算改好了”。下面哪些能当验收条件？选出全部。\n","slots":[{"id":"conditions","type":"choice","multiple":true,"minSelected":0,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"looks","content":"汇总结果看起来合理"},{"id":"rows","content":"合并后 merged 的行数等于 first 的行数"},{"id":"style","content":"代码写得更规范、更简洁"},{"id":"number","content":"在 004 没登记的那张反例表上，汇总表里有一行组名为缺失、n 为 1"},{"id":"ai","content":"AI 说它已经检查过了"}],"key":["rows","number"]}],"explanation":"“merged 的行数等于 first 的行数”和“在那张反例表上有一行组名为缺失、n 为 1”能当验收条件：前者能写成 `assert len(merged) == len(first)`，后者是一个明确的数，谁拿同一张表运行都能核对。\n\n“看起来合理”“写得更规范”没有标准，没法核对；“AI 说检查过了”是别人的结论，不是你能复验的条件。\n"}],"review":[{"id":"py48.k3.r1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 每个样点只用第一次测量；按 plots 补上 site，样点一个不少，没登记的单独算一组；按 site 数出样点个数 n。\n\n在 P4 没登记的反例上，汇总表里没有缺失的那一组。作答框里是 AI 的脚本，只改出错的那一处并提交，结果仍叫 `summary`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"first = readings.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plot_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"inner\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"site\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","solution":"first = readings.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plot_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"site\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","rejects":[{"code":"first = readings.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plot_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"right\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"site\", dropna=False).agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","why":"right 保留的是 plots 的行，没登记的样点仍然不在"},{"code":"first = readings.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"plot_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"site\").agg(n=(\"plot_id\", \"count\"))\n","why":"改了合并，却把分组的 dropna=False 删了，缺失的组又丢了"}],"tests":[{"name":"P4 没登记","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [2, 1, 1]}, index=[\"北坡\", \"南坡\", np.nan])","len(merged)":"4"}},{"name":"换一个没登记的样点","hidden":true,"data":["RD","PL"],"setup":"plots = plots.loc[plots[\"plot_id\"] != \"P1\"]","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"n\": [1, 1, 1, 1]}, index=[\"东坡\", \"北坡\", \"南坡\", np.nan])","len(merged)":"4"}}]}],"explanation":"只改合并那一行，`how=\"inner\"` 改成 `how=\"left\"`：\n\n```python\nmerged = first.merge(plots, on=\"plot_id\", how=\"left\")\n```\n\n分组那一行已经写了 `dropna=False`，它没错，只是 inner 在它之前就把 P4 去掉了，缺失的组无从出现。改后 merged 是 4 行，汇总表是北坡 2、南坡 1、缺失 1。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"readings","caption":"表 readings：土层深度测量（厘米，P2 测了两次）","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P2","P3","P4"],"depth":[32,28,30,35,26]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"plots","caption":"表 plots：P4 没有登记","columns":{"plot_id":["P1","P2","P3"],"site":["北坡","南坡","北坡"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k3.r2","body":"需求是：每个培养皿只用第一次计数；按 dishes 补上 treatment；cells **至少为 45** 的算长得好；按 treatment 数出个数 n。AI 的脚本：\n\n```python startLine=1\nfirst = counts.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"dish_id\"])\nmerged = first.merge(dishes, on=\"dish_id\", how=\"left\")\ngood = merged.loc[merged[\"cells\"] > 45]\nsummary = good.groupby(\"treatment\").agg(n=(\"dish_id\", \"count\"))\n```\n\n第 3 行要改成 `>= 45`。改之前先挑验收条件：在这张表上，哪些检查在原来的脚本上不成立（运行到它会停下，不论报什么错），在改好的脚本上成立？\n","slots":[{"id":"checks","type":"choice","multiple":true,"scoring":"options","options":[{"id":"rows","content":"```python\nassert len(merged) == len(first)\n```\n"},{"id":"good3","content":"```python\nassert len(good) == 3\n```\n"},{"id":"sum","content":"```python\nassert summary[\"n\"].sum() == len(good)\n```\n"},{"id":"drug","content":"```python\nassert summary.loc[\"drug\", \"n\"] == 1\n```\n"}],"key":["good3","drug"]}],"explanation":"first 是 01（52）、02（40）、03（45）、04（48）。原脚本用 `> 45`，03 恰好是 45 被丢掉，good 只有 01、04 两行，汇总表里只有 control。\n\n| 验收条件 | 原脚本 | 改好后 |\n|---|---|---|\n| merged 行数等于 first | 成立 | 成立 |\n| good 有 3 行 | 2 行，不成立 | 成立 |\n| n 加起来等于 good 的行数 | 成立 | 成立 |\n| drug 的 n 是 1 | 汇总表里没有 drug，停下 | 成立 |\n\n**good 有 3 行**和 **drug 的 n 是 1** 查得到这处偏差。另外两条两边都成立：它们检查的是合并和分组，和比较符无关。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"counts","caption":"表 counts：细胞计数（03 号计了两次）","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03","03","04"],"cells":[52,40,45,47,48]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"dishes","caption":"表 dishes：每个培养皿的处理","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03","04"],"treatment":["control","drug","drug","control"]}}]}],"quiz":[{"id":"py48.k3.x1","body":"需求是：\n\n> 同一个受试者测了两次时，用最后一次的成绩；按 people 补上 cohort；按 cohort 求平均成绩 mean_score。\n\n核对时发现：A2 用的是第一次的 65，不是复测的 70。作答框里是 AI 的脚本，只改出错的那一处并提交，结果仍叫 `summary`。\n","slots":[{"id":"code","type":"code","language":"python","maxLines":5,"starter":"latest = scores.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"pid\"])\nmerged = latest.merge(people, on=\"pid\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"cohort\").agg(mean_score=(\"score\", \"mean\"))\n","solution":"latest = scores.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"pid\"], keep=\"last\")\nmerged = latest.merge(people, on=\"pid\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"cohort\").agg(mean_score=(\"score\", \"mean\"))\n","rejects":[{"code":"latest = scores.drop_duplicates(keep=\"last\")\nmerged = latest.merge(people, on=\"pid\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"cohort\").agg(mean_score=(\"score\", \"mean\"))\n","why":"没写 subset，A2 的两次成绩不同，两行都留下了"},{"code":"latest = scores.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"pid\"], keep=False)\nmerged = latest.merge(people, on=\"pid\", how=\"left\")\nsummary = merged.groupby(\"cohort\").agg(mean_score=(\"score\", \"mean\"))\n","why":"keep=False 把测了两次的 A2 整个去掉了"}],"tests":[{"name":"表 scores 和 people","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"mean_score\": [83.0, 63.5]}, index=[\"第一批\", \"第二批\"])","scores":"scores"}},{"name":"换一组受试者","hidden":true,"setup":"import pandas as pd\nscores = pd.DataFrame({\"pid\": [\"B1\", \"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\", \"B3\"], \"score\": [60, 80, 75, 90, 70]})\npeople = pd.DataFrame({\"pid\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"], \"cohort\": [\"第一批\", \"第二批\", \"第二批\"]})\n","expect":{"summary":"pd.DataFrame({\"mean_score\": [80.0, 72.5]}, index=[\"第一批\", \"第二批\"])"}}]}],"explanation":"只改第 1 行，加上 `keep=\"last\"`：\n\n```python\nlatest = scores.drop_duplicates(subset=[\"pid\"], keep=\"last\")\n```\n\n变量名叫 latest，代码却留的是第一次，名字不能代替核对。改后第二批是 A2 的 70 和 A4 的 57，平均 63.5；第一批是 83.0。只写 `keep=\"last\"` 不写 subset，A2 两行不完全相同，都会留下；`keep=False` 会把 A2 整个去掉。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"scores","caption":"表 scores：受试者的测试成绩（A2 测了两次）","columns":{"pid":["A1","A2","A2","A3","A4"],"score":[78,65,70,88,57]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"people","caption":"表 people：受试者属于哪一批","columns":{"pid":["A1","A2","A3","A4"],"cohort":["第一批","第二批","第一批","第二批"]}}]},{"id":"py48.k3.x2","body":"需求是：每个培养皿只用第一次计数；按 dishes 补上 treatment，没登记的单独算一组（组名为缺失）；cells 至少为 45 的算长得好；按 treatment 数出长得好的培养皿个数 n。\n\n把这张反例表交给 AI 之前，先写好验收数字：按需求，改好的脚本在这张表上应当给出什么？\n","slots":[{"id":"groups","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"group","header":"组"},{"id":"n","header":"n","input":"integer"}],"rows":[{"id":"control","cells":{"group":"control","n":1}},{"id":"drug","cells":{"group":"drug","n":1}},{"id":"missing","cells":{"group":"缺失","n":1}}]},{"id":"rows","type":"text","format":"integer","prompt":"汇总表共有几行？","key":3}],"explanation":"first 是 01（52）、02（40）、03（45，第一次计数）、04（48）。04 没登记，treatment 为缺失。至少 45 的是 01（control）、03（drug）、04（缺失），三组各 **1** 个，汇总表 **3** 行。\n\n这几个数就是验收条件：AI 改完以后，在这张表上运行，汇总表应当正好是这三行。\n","datasets":[{"kind":"dataframe","name":"counts","caption":"表 counts：细胞计数（03 号计了两次）","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03","03","04"],"cells":[52,40,45,47,48]}},{"kind":"dataframe","name":"dishes","caption":"表 dishes：04 号没有登记","columns":{"dish_id":["01","02","03"],"treatment":["control","drug","drug"]}}]}]}]}]};
